values
  ('927131434502832235', 'Chachi 420', 1997, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'S. Thirunavukkarasu, M. S. Prabhu, Kamal Haasan', 'Kamal Haasan', 'Kamal Haasan, Tabu, Amrish Puri, Om Puri, Johnny Walker, Paresh Rawal, Fatima Sana Shaikh, Nassar', null, 'In order to see his little girl more often, a divorcee disguises himself as an old lady and gets a job as his own daughter''s caretaker. A Hindi remake of the 1996 Tamil film "Avvai Shanmugi," which is itself a remake of the Hollywood film "Mrs. Doubtfire."', 'In order to see his little girl more often, a divorcee disguises himself as an old lady and gets a job as his own daughter''s caretaker. A Hindi remake of the 1996 Tamil film "Avvai Shanmugi," which is itself a remake of the Hollywood film "Mrs. Doubtfire."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/45i934IvoLvuCvhus13n8MxGBV4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134446'),
  ('1013733615606573638', 'Chaco', 2020, 'War, Drama', 'Federico Lastra, Diego Mondaca', 'Diego Mondaca, César Díaz, Pilar Palomero', 'Raimundo Ramos, Fabián Arenillas, Mauricio Toledo, Fausto Castellón, Omar Calisaya', null, 'In 1934, Bolivia is at war with Paraguay. Liborio and Ticona and other Bolivian indigenous soldiers are lost in the hell of the Chaco, under the commandment of German Captain Kundt. They''re looking for the Paraguayan enemy that they haven''t seen for months, and that they will never find. They leave together in a search that will make them realize, progressively, the destiny they have been pushed into and the inevitable condition of a defeated troop. They''re walking like shadows, wandering forever in the middle of dust and silence.', 'In 1934, Bolivia is at war with Paraguay. Liborio and Ticona and other Bolivian indigenous soldiers are lost in the hell of the Chaco, under the commandment of German Captain Kundt. They''re looking for the Paraguayan enemy that they haven''t seen for months, and that they will never find. They leave together in a search that will make them realize, progressively, the destiny they have been pushed into and the inevitable condition of a defeated troop. They''re walking like shadows, wandering forever in the middle of dust and silence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kceKve71vFsd0ALpNGV0CKXkWTT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:662334'),
  ('435865521538394208', 'Chacrinha: O Velho Guerreiro', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Rebeca Diniz, Andrucha Waddington, Fernando Young', 'Carla Faour, Júlia Spadaccini, Cláudio Paiva', 'Stepan Nercessian, Eduardo Sterblitch, Gianne Albertoni, Carla Ribas, Antônio Grassi, Rodrigo Pandolfo, Pablo Sanábio, Thelmo Fernandes', null, 'The story of José Abelardo Barbosa, narrated from the time of his youth, when he was at medical school, and dropped everything to become a radio announcer. After that, we follow the transformation of his life and the creation of his alter ego, Chacrinha.', 'The story of José Abelardo Barbosa, narrated from the time of his youth, when he was at medical school, and dropped everything to become a radio announcer. After that, we follow the transformation of his life and the creation of his alter ego, Chacrinha.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ho8t3hb7K5PUFRKzgsB9hPPueuW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:510662'),
  ('130812627035816078', 'Chacun pour tous', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Emma Skowronek, Vianney Lebasque, Martin De Chabaneix', 'Frank Bellocq, Vianney Lebasque', 'Ahmed Sylla, Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Camélia Jordana, Thomas De Pourquery, Olivier Barthélémy, Estéban, Joachim Tivoukou, Walid Ben Mabrouk', null, 'In order to participate with medal options in the Sydney 2000 Paralympic Games, the national coach of France decides to form a basketball team composed mostly of fake mentally disability. Once in Australia, the fraudsters must fake their disability by living with the other athletes in the Olympic village or by attending the media in the post-match press conference.', 'In order to participate with medal options in the Sydney 2000 Paralympic Games, the national coach of France decides to form a basketball team composed mostly of fake mentally disability. Once in Australia, the fraudsters must fake their disability by living with the other athletes in the Olympic village or by attending the media in the post-match press conference.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jR1JIDQe01q1ajSgjjRXvUDcs0y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:510456'),
