  ('774056570918757013', 'Chai Lai Angels: Dangerous Flowers', 2006, 'Action, Comedy', 'Poj Arnon, Panya Nimchareonpong, Payak Ramvadin', 'Poj Arnon', 'Jintara Poonlarp, Bongkoj Khongmalai, Supakson Ruengsomboon, Kessarin Ektawatkul, Bunyawan Pongsuwan, Kris Srepoomseth, Petchtai Wongkamlao, Salani Chachacha', null, 'Five undercover agents, each with her own specialty, must combat international terrorists who have come to Thailand. They must use every resources available and known to them as this mission will be one that is unlike any they have known.', 'Five undercover agents, each with her own specialty, must combat international terrorists who have come to Thailand. They must use every resources available and known to them as this mission will be one that is unlike any they have known.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wdMqk7joEZs76C72VHR14oC2nC2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34137'),
  ('388755086799719348', 'Chain Kulii Ki Main Kulii', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama, Family, Fantasy', 'Karanjeet Saluja, Pranav Choudhary', 'Nupur Asthana', 'Zain Khan, Rahul Bose, Bobby Bedii, Raj Bhansali, Deiptimaan Chowdhury, Rajesh Khera, Kapil Dev, Lalit Parashar', null, 'An orphan boy with dreams of finding a family and fame as a cricketer, finds a bat with magical powers and lands a spot in the Indian cricket team.', 'An orphan boy with dreams of finding a family and fame as a cricketer, finds a bat with magical powers and lands a spot in the Indian cricket team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j3DbqOVoxnkMGOwMZWfTxTc1tO8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:463315'),
  ('804361043504505473', 'Chain Letter', 2010, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Deon Taylor, Samson Kellman, Philip Lee', 'Diana Erwin, Michael J. Pagan', 'Nikki Reed, Keith David, Michael Bailey Smith, Brad Dourif, Betsy Russell, Cherilyn Wilson, Matt Cohen, Noah Segan', 'R', 'Six friends receive a mysterious chain letter via text messaging and in their email accounts from a maniac who''s hunting down teenagers who fail to forward his online chain letter. Who knew they should take the threats in the chain letter seriously? Or that chain letters using the teens'' favorite technologies to track them can kill? This maniacal game pits friend against friend as they race to beat rules that seem impossible to escape. Break the chain, lose a life. Do you pass it on? Does friendship mean anything?', 'Six friends receive a mysterious chain letter via text messaging and in their email accounts from a maniac who''s hunting down teenagers who fail to forward his online chain letter. Who knew they should take the threats in the chain letter seriously? Or that chain letters using the teens'' favorite technologies to track them can kill? This maniacal game pits friend against friend as they race to beat rules that seem impossible to escape. Break the chain, lose a life. Do you pass it on? Does friendship mean anything?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Qkz89qeK3gJh49x3T85KiecTZi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38033'),
  ('445190246541200604', 'Chain Letters', 1985, 'Drama', 'Mark Rappaport, Martin Schäfer', 'Mark Rappaport', 'Mark Arnott, Reed Birney, David Brisbin, Randy Danson, Daniel Davis, Marilyn Jones, Ellen McElduff, Joan MacIntosh', null, 'Nine Manhattanites receive a chain letter. Depending on their decision to either pass the letter on or to break the chain, the various characters can encounter romance, fulfillment -- and sudden death.', 'Nine Manhattanites receive a chain letter. Depending on their decision to either pass the letter on or to break the chain, the various characters can encounter romance, fulfillment -- and sudden death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bwFpKv7cW3PB4feRLGWPBt2335L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132779'),
  ('71400274418231091', 'Chain Lightning', 1950, 'Drama, Action, War', 'Don Alvarado, Ernest Haller, Stuart Heisler', 'Liam O''Brien, Vincent B. Evans', 'Humphrey Bogart, Eleanor Parker, Raymond Massey, Richard Whorf, James Brown, Roy Roberts, Morris Ankrum, Fay Baker', 'NR', 'Former World War II flying ace Matt Brennan takes a position as a test pilot for a commercial aircraft corporation and bumps into his old girlfriend, Jo Holloway, who now works as a receptionist for the company.', 'Former World War II flying ace Matt Brennan takes a position as a test pilot for a commercial aircraft corporation and bumps into his old girlfriend, Jo Holloway, who now works as a receptionist for the company.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cHDc6XE2CZmZ0b1KAP22NPF7Qeh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87621'),
  ('167068676116951863', 'Chain of Command', 1994, 'Action', 'David Worth, Avi Koren', 'Ben Jonson Handy, Christopher Applegate', 'Michael Dudikoff, Todd Curtis, Keren Tishman, R. Lee Ermey, Steve Greenstein, Eli Danker, Gadi Rabinowitz, Eli Yatzpan', null, 'When Merrill Ross (Michael Dudikoff) is thought to be a C.I.A. agent gone bad and teaming with some other alphabet named agency to take over the oil rich country of Qumir, he finds he''s in the middle of a very explosive situation. Not knowing who he can trust, he''s forced to use a process of elimination thru the chain of operatives he encounters.', 'When Merrill Ross (Michael Dudikoff) is thought to be a C.I.A. agent gone bad and teaming with some other alphabet named agency to take over the oil rich country of Qumir, he finds he''s in the middle of a very explosive situation. Not knowing who he can trust, he''s forced to use a process of elimination thru the chain of operatives he encounters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9quC0dvbzTgSJps67M7U7DE7oyF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52314'),
  ('144415041689838293', 'Chain of Command', 2015, 'Thriller, Adventure, Action', 'Kevin Carraway, Curtis Petersen, Chris Hilsabeck', 'Kevin Carraway, Lawrence Sara', 'Michael Jai White, Max Ryan, Steve Austin, Ian Short, Allen Yates, Ashley Barnett, Carter Bratton, Shyra Thomas', 'R', 'After finding his brother murdered after returning from duty, Webster searches for the perpetrators, but discovers a conspiracy that cuts deep inside the U.S. government.', 'After finding his brother murdered after returning from duty, Webster searches for the perpetrators, but discovers a conspiracy that cuts deep inside the U.S. government.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xUHN0DIWS7fs3bMjg6RktQksK9v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:352978'),
