  ('405429330210854945', 'Chain of Events', 1958, 'Drama', 'Gerald Thomas, Peter Hennessy', 'Leo McKern, Patrick Brawn', 'Dermot Walsh, Susan Shaw, Lisa Gastoni, Jack Watling, Freddie Mills, Joan Hickson, Alan Gifford, Harold Lang', null, 'When a clerk tries to dodge paying a bus fare, it sparks a series of unforseen consequences', 'When a clerk tries to dodge paying a bus fare, it sparks a series of unforseen consequences', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sTnUNmlkgx2EH5MzIUoI0PNkH06.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:279403'),
  ('835971543236282970', 'Chain of Evidence', 1957, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Paul Landres', 'Elwood Ullman', 'Bill Elliott, Jimmy Lydon, Claudia Barrett, Tina Carver, Ross Elliott, Don Haggerty, Dabbs Greer, Timothy Carey', 'NR', 'A police lieutenant fights to prove a boy''s innocence after he''s accused of murder. The fourth of five Ben Schwab productions that starred Bill Elliott as a detective lieutenant in the L.A. Sheriff''s department.', 'A police lieutenant fights to prove a boy''s innocence after he''s accused of murder. The fourth of five Ben Schwab productions that starred Bill Elliott as a detective lieutenant in the L.A. Sheriff''s department.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1j1cLf9bqAP6xcJBaPEPA11SWvV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38748'),
  ('310885727084319034', 'Chain of Fools', 2001, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Pontus Löwenhielm, Patrick von Krusenstjerna, Frederick Elmes', 'Bix Skahill', 'Steve Zahn, Salma Hayek Pinault, Elijah Wood, Jeff Goldblum, David Cross, Tom Wilkinson, Orlando Jones, Kevin Corrigan', 'R', 'An avid detective is assigned to investigate the heist of a batch of precious coins that end up in the hands of a suicidal barber.', 'An avid detective is assigned to investigate the heist of a batch of precious coins that end up in the hands of a suicidal barber.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rUwl3cfSf60aP1uvfb4QIEVMHuq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20682'),
  ('1143209328237210800', 'Chain Reaction', 1996, 'Thriller, Action, Science Fiction', 'Andrew Davis, Frank Tidy, Ann Harris', 'J.F. Lawton, Michael Bortman', 'Keanu Reeves, Morgan Freeman, Rachel Weisz, Fred Ward, Kevin Dunn, Brian Cox, Joanna Cassidy, Chelcie Ross', 'PG-13', 'At the University of Chicago, a research team that includes brilliant student machinist Eddie Kasalivich experiences a breakthrough: a stable form of fusion that may lead to a waste-free energy source. However, a private company wants to exploit the technology, so Kasalivich and physicist Dr. Lily Sinclair are framed for murder, and the fusion device is stolen. On the run from the FBI, they must recover the technology and exonerate themselves.', 'At the University of Chicago, a research team that includes brilliant student machinist Eddie Kasalivich experiences a breakthrough: a stable form of fusion that may lead to a waste-free energy source. However, a private company wants to exploit the technology, so Kasalivich and physicist Dr. Lily Sinclair are framed for murder, and the fusion device is stolen. On the run from the FBI, they must recover the technology and exonerate themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ahjVHwXXsq5zK57ds8FwWY73MS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12123'),
  ('170180685785160534', 'Chain Reaction', 2006, 'Horror', 'Olaf Ittenbach, Holger Fleig', 'Olaf Ittenbach', 'Christopher Kriesa, Martina Ittenbach, Simon Newby, Luca Maric, Mehmet Yilmaz, Jaymes Butler, Dan van Husen, Jürgen Prochnow', null, 'A prison bus with over a dozen criminals on board has an accident and rams another car, in which Dr. Douglas Madsen was on his way home. Most of the prisoners die. Four of them survive, one of them severely injured. After having killed all the guards, they head for the woods. They take Dr. Douglas Madsen hostage. Suddenly a huge house appears in the middle of the woods. The leader of the group, Arthur, emphasizes that he will kill Douglas and every single member of the "family" if his wounded brother would die. Meanwhile some members of the family show strange behavior, and very soon mayhem breaks loose.', 'A prison bus with over a dozen criminals on board has an accident and rams another car, in which Dr. Douglas Madsen was on his way home. Most of the prisoners die. Four of them survive, one of them severely injured. After having killed all the guards, they head for the woods. They take Dr. Douglas Madsen hostage. Suddenly a huge house appears in the middle of the woods. The leader of the group, Arthur, emphasizes that he will kill Douglas and every single member of the "family" if his wounded brother would die. Meanwhile some members of the family show strange behavior, and very soon mayhem breaks loose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ptLp7yy68dDcBF8k5WrTCU55tL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40465'),
  ('1009251377513857829', 'Chain Reaction', 2021, 'Action', 'Márcio Garcia, Rodrigo Graciosa', 'Thiago Dottori, Márcio Garcia', 'Monique Alfradique, Bruno Gissoni, André Bankoff, Adriano Garib, Silvio Matos, Juliana Knust, Victor Lamoglia, Chico Melo', null, 'A peaceful accountant, after find again a love of youth, discovers a big embezzlement in the company where he works. Thanks to the fact, he ends up involving in a corruption network that supplies the Brazilian politician system .', 'A peaceful accountant, after find again a love of youth, discovers a big embezzlement in the company where he works. Thanks to the fact, he ends up involving in a corruption network that supplies the Brazilian politician system .', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qfnYaV20yk9wm2Z0mJBq856zzSY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:872150'),
  ('636416890275615814', 'Chained', 1934, 'Romance, Drama', 'Clarence Brown, George J. Folsey, Douglas Shearer', 'John Lee Mahin', 'Joan Crawford, Clark Gable, Otto Kruger, Stuart Erwin, Una O''Connor, Marjorie Gateson, Akim Tamiroff, Ernie Alexander', 'NR', 'Richard, a millionaire in love with his secretary, Diane, is dispirited when his wife refuses to divorce him. Concerned that Diane will now lose interest, Richard offers her an all-expense-paid cruise to Argentina so that she can think it over. While traveling, however, Diane falls in love with fellow traveler Mike. She resolves to come clean to Richard, but upon return she becomes conflicted when she finds out he was able to get divorced after all.', 'Richard, a millionaire in love with his secretary, Diane, is dispirited when his wife refuses to divorce him. Concerned that Diane will now lose interest, Richard offers her an all-expense-paid cruise to Argentina so that she can think it over. While traveling, however, Diane falls in love with fellow traveler Mike. She resolves to come clean to Richard, but upon return she becomes conflicted when she finds out he was able to get divorced after all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lGvFPJGXfvQDLGlrh9lhef8Z2hR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50079'),
  ('744927596556311337', 'Chained', 2012, 'Horror, Thriller, Drama', 'Jennifer Lynch, Shane Daly, Trevor Cunningham', 'Jennifer Lynch', 'Vincent D''Onofrio, Eamon Farren, Evan Bird, Julia Ormond, Conor Leslie, Gina Philips, Jake Weber, Daniel Maslany', 'R', 'A serial killer kidnaps a young boy after murdering his mother, then raises him to be his accomplice. After years in captivity, the boy must choose between escaping or following in his captor''s bloody footprints.', 'A serial killer kidnaps a young boy after murdering his mother, then raises him to be his accomplice. After years in captivity, the boy must choose between escaping or following in his captor''s bloody footprints.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4A7t5QmUN0joSZMOSUtbFOrbsTU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116979'),
  ('1130142798278019833', 'Chained - The Seduction of Two Women', 2017, 'Drama, Romance', 'Park Sun-Uk', 'Chae Seol-ah', 'Hong Sae-hee, Jeong Hyang, Min Do-yoon, Jeon Eun-jin, Heo Yoon-joo-I, Joo Mi-ran', null, 'This is a love story between Jin-kyeong who obsessively indulges in Min-ah’s body and Min-ah who feels love and friendship at the same time. Jin-kyeong mentally and physically comforts Min-ah who is going through a hard time after her boyfriend disappears. Min-ah is relieved Jin-kyeong is there. One day Min-ah meets Yoon-jae, a student and is mesmerized by the fact that he looks and smells like her ex-boyfriend. Yoon-jae seduces Min-ah and harasses her.', 'This is a love story between Jin-kyeong who obsessively indulges in Min-ah’s body and Min-ah who feels love and friendship at the same time. Jin-kyeong mentally and physically comforts Min-ah who is going through a hard time after her boyfriend disappears. Min-ah is relieved Jin-kyeong is there. One day Min-ah meets Yoon-jae, a student and is mesmerized by the fact that he looks and smells like her ex-boyfriend. Yoon-jae seduces Min-ah and harasses her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2vLoVkIpr8qEyC02p8HVxJAIy50.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:450636'),
