  ('67608493672167266', 'Chairman of the Board', 1998, 'Comedy', 'Alex Zamm, David Lewis', 'Alex Zamm, Alfredo Septién, Turi Meyer', 'Carrot Top, Courtney Thorne-Smith, Larry Miller, Raquel Welch, Mystro Clark, Jack Plotnick, Jack Warden, Estelle Harris', 'PG-13', 'Surfer Edison isn''t able to make ends meet with his inventions or his lifestyle. But then he meets billionaire Armand McMillian, who takes a shine to the young bum — so much so that he leaves his invention company to him upon his death. Unfortunately, Armand''s nephew, Bradford, only gets a surfboard. While Edison manages to run the company successfully, with the help of pretty Natalie, Bradford conspires to take him down.', 'Surfer Edison isn''t able to make ends meet with his inventions or his lifestyle. But then he meets billionaire Armand McMillian, who takes a shine to the young bum — so much so that he leaves his invention company to him upon his death. Unfortunately, Armand''s nephew, Bradford, only gets a surfboard. While Edison manages to run the company successfully, with the help of pretty Natalie, Bradford conspires to take him down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1eGB1EjaUjGbiuPBAqndlO3khyn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31535'),
  ('740337621068017603', 'Chak De! India', 2007, 'Drama', 'Shimit Amin, Karan Kashyap, Stephen Jensen', 'Jaideep Sahni', 'Shah Rukh Khan, Vidya Malvade, Sagarika Ghatge, Shilpa Shukla, Chitrashi Rawat, Tanya Abrol, Arya Menon, Seema Azmi', null, 'A team of rag-tag girls with their own agenda form Team India competing for international fame in field hockey. Their coach, the ex-men''s Indian National team captain, returns from a life of shame after being unjustly accused of match fixing in his last match. Can he give the girls the motivation required to win, while dealing with the shadows of his own past?', 'A team of rag-tag girls with their own agenda form Team India competing for international fame in field hockey. Their coach, the ex-men''s Indian National team captain, returns from a life of shame after being unjustly accused of match fixing in his last match. Can he give the girls the motivation required to win, while dealing with the shadows of his own past?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mmFMgEsTRCAGAtwffGpuo3mJsxN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14163'),
