  ('850274752566758416', 'Chalo Dilli', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Shashant Shah', 'Arshad Sayed', 'Lara Dutta, Vinay Pathak, Akshay Kumar, Mahika Sharma, Pankaj Jha, Brijendra Kala', null, 'Mihika, an investment banker, misses her flight to Delhi and meets Manu Gupta, a very talkative man. In order to reach Delhi on time, she must tag along with him on a road trip and put up with his antics.', 'Mihika, an investment banker, misses her flight to Delhi and meets Manu Gupta, a very talkative man. In order to reach Delhi on time, she must tag along with him on a road trip and put up with his antics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9IAHOSZpWxyHbK40WmUFJq2Bwuh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63468'),
  ('424723270319503953', 'Chalo Ishq Ladaaye', 2002, null, 'Aziz Sajaawal, Himesh Reshammiya', null, 'Govinda, Rani Mukerji, Sanjay Suri, Gulshan Grover, Mink Brar, Johny Lever, Kader Khan, Asrani', null, 'Popular but lonely Bollywood actress, Rani, lives a fairly isolated life, through publicly she is thronged by fans, and has taken to drinking alcohol in a big way. Thus intoxicated she runs her vehicle into a young man named Pappu, who suffers minor injuries. He recognizes her, and tells her that he is her number one fan, and will do anything for her. She wants him to kill her double-timing boyfriend, Rahul. He agrees to do so, provided she kills his overbearing, aged grandmother, to which she agrees. After Pappu completes his gruesome task, he meets with Rani, only to be told that she does not recognize him, but when presented with proof, she relents and agrees to fulfill her part of this trade.', 'Popular but lonely Bollywood actress, Rani, lives a fairly isolated life, through publicly she is thronged by fans, and has taken to drinking alcohol in a big way. Thus intoxicated she runs her vehicle into a young man named Pappu, who suffers minor injuries. He recognizes her, and tells her that he is her number one fan, and will do anything for her. She wants him to kill her double-timing boyfriend, Rahul. He agrees to do so, provided she kills his overbearing, aged grandmother, to which she agrees. After Pappu completes his gruesome task, he meets with Rani, only to be told that she does not recognize him, but when presented with proof, she relents and agrees to fulfill her part of this trade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gOjdeBCBIAVK9JQyF1LlVwTfiwJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:158807'),
