  ('479374101261300332', 'Chaman Bahaar', 2020, 'Drama', 'Apurva Dhar Badgaiyann', 'Apurva Dhar Badgaiyann', 'Jitendra Kumar, Ritika Badiani, Alam Khan', null, 'An ambitious young man, in a small town in Central India, sets up a paan shop to a floundering start. His fortunes start to change dramatically when a family shifts in the house across the road. Hordes of boys start following the teenage girl from the family and set up an "adda" at Billu''s shop. His business flourishes tremendously but Billu is now more unhappy than ever, as he has fallen for the girl himself!', 'An ambitious young man, in a small town in Central India, sets up a paan shop to a floundering start. His fortunes start to change dramatically when a family shifts in the house across the road. Hordes of boys start following the teenage girl from the family and set up an "adda" at Billu''s shop. His business flourishes tremendously but Billu is now more unhappy than ever, as he has fallen for the girl himself!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jfVAx36bnczMArJB8eFZuoDdKC4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:709681'),
