  ('33187577452270359', 'Chance at Romance', 2013, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'James W. Wrenn, Bradford May', 'Neal H. Dobrofsky, Tippi Dobrofsky', 'Erin Krakow, Ryan McPartlin, Ian Andrew, Albert Malafronte, Nadege August, Abraham Benrubi, Gina Gallego, Patricia Richardson', null, 'Samantha Hart is delighted when her online "Chance at Romance" to photographer Heath Madsen eventually results in Heath sending her a first class ticket to visit. Upon arriving for what she expects to be a romantic weekend, however, she learns her online relationship with the widowed photographer was actually manufactured a matchmaking twelve year-old. Sam is anxious to end her trip as quickly as possible, but a nasty bout of weather extends her stay through the end of the week.', 'Samantha Hart is delighted when her online "Chance at Romance" to photographer Heath Madsen eventually results in Heath sending her a first class ticket to visit. Upon arriving for what she expects to be a romantic weekend, however, she learns her online relationship with the widowed photographer was actually manufactured a matchmaking twelve year-old. Sam is anxious to end her trip as quickly as possible, but a nasty bout of weather extends her stay through the end of the week.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/stXiBneBvS5mLoALZHJO1X1Vi3C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256277'),
  ('1140952629884167296', 'Chance or Coincidence', 1998, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Claude Lelouch, Pierre-William Glenn', 'Claude Lelouch', 'Alessandra Martines, Pierre Arditi, Marc Hollogne, Véronique Moreau, Patrick Labbé, Laurent Hilaire, Geoffrey Holder, Luigi Bonino', null, 'Once a successful dancer, Miriam has abandoned her career to bring up her son, Serge, after her boyfriend walked out of her.', 'Once a successful dancer, Miriam has abandoned her career to bring up her son, Serge, after her boyfriend walked out of her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3g3y0DuCqPhWsMjExdyZBebOOU7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76394'),
  ('759649820453039574', 'Chance Pe Dance', 2010, 'Music, Romance, Drama', 'Ken Ghosh, Hari Vendantam', null, 'Shahid Kapoor, Genelia D''Souza, Satish Shah, Mohnish Behl, Vikas Bhalla, Bikramjeet Kanwarpal, Kurush Deboo, Jimmy Sharma', null, 'Sameer is the archetypal struggler who leaves his dad in Delhi and comes to Mumbai, chasing dreams of becoming a star in Bollywood. Does he manage to survive the bleak and grueling rounds of endless auditions, broken promises and missed chances?', 'Sameer is the archetypal struggler who leaves his dad in Delhi and comes to Mumbai, chasing dreams of becoming a star in Bollywood. Does he manage to survive the bleak and grueling rounds of endless auditions, broken promises and missed chances?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ypnLRUuBiu6VxQAiYeBvmLrR4fL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30695'),
  ('628710244217040661', 'Chances Are', 1989, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Romance', 'William A. Fraker, Emile Ardolino', 'Randy Howze, Perry Howze', 'Cybill Shepherd, Robert Downey Jr., Ryan O''Neal, Mary Stuart Masterson, Christopher McDonald, Josef Sommer, Joe Grifasi, Henderson Forsythe', 'PG', 'Louie Jeffries is happily married to Corinne. On their first anniversary, Louie is killed crossing the road. Louie is reincarnated as Alex Finch, and twenty years later, fate brings Alex and Louie''s daughter, Miranda, together. It''s not until Alex is invited to Louie''s home that he begins to remember his former life, wife and best friend. Of course, there''s also the problem that he''s attracted to Louie''s/his own daughter.', 'Louie Jeffries is happily married to Corinne. On their first anniversary, Louie is killed crossing the road. Louie is reincarnated as Alex Finch, and twenty years later, fate brings Alex and Louie''s daughter, Miranda, together. It''s not until Alex is invited to Louie''s home that he begins to remember his former life, wife and best friend. Of course, there''s also the problem that he''s attracted to Louie''s/his own daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uMOt6bECe3JE5N7M9jYi63fmJDj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3064'),
