  ('861454254949850866', 'Chandu Champion', 2024, 'Drama', 'Kabir Khan, Sudeep Chatterjee', 'Sudipto Sarkar, Sumit Arora, Kabir Khan', 'Kartik Aaryan, Vijay Raaz, Bhuvan Arora, Rajpal Yadav, Yashpal Sharma, Aniruddh Dave, Nitin Bhajan, Hemangi Kavi', null, '9 bullet wounds (one still in the body), three different sports and an unshakable determination to fulfill the dream of an Olympic Gold later, Muralikant Petkar, India''s first Paralympian to finish at the top of the podium, got the recognition by his own country 45 years after he achieved what no athlete from his country could.', '9 bullet wounds (one still in the body), three different sports and an unshakable determination to fulfill the dream of an Olympic Gold later, Muralikant Petkar, India''s first Paralympian to finish at the top of the podium, got the recognition by his own country 45 years after he achieved what no athlete from his country could.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AprEYzaWgMuSQtJXMxz1P5Z3e3P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1020951'),
  ('430438690510784173', 'Chandu the Magician', 1932, 'Adventure, Science Fiction, Action', 'Marcel Varnel, William Cameron Menzies, Walter Mayo', 'Barry Conners, Philip Klein', 'Edmund Lowe, Irene Ware, Bela Lugosi, Weldon Heyburn, Herbert Mundin, Henry B. Walthall, Virginia Hammond, June Lang', 'NR', 'When delusional madman Roxor kidnaps a scientist in hopes of using his death ray to achieve world dominance, he is opposed by Chandu, a powerful hypnotist and yogi.', 'When delusional madman Roxor kidnaps a scientist in hopes of using his death ray to achieve world dominance, he is opposed by Chandu, a powerful hypnotist and yogi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3pYOJPXdRLVjEh60OzhuBJqMutb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89573'),
  ('796361831695888447', 'Chang Can Dunk', 2023, 'Family, Comedy, Drama', 'Jingyi Shao, Ross Riege', 'Jingyi Shao', 'Bloom Li, Ben Wang, Zoë Renee, Mardy Ma, Dexter Darden, Chase Liefeld, Jon Shaver, Christopher Ferguson', 'PG', 'Chang, a 16-year-old, Asian American, bets the high school basketball star that he can dunk by Homecoming. The bet leads 5'' 8" Chang on a quest to learn to dunk—not only to impress his crush, Kristy, but to gain the respect of his high school peers too. But before he can rise up and truly throw one down, he''ll have to reexamine everything he knows about himself, his friendships and his family.', 'Chang, a 16-year-old, Asian American, bets the high school basketball star that he can dunk by Homecoming. The bet leads 5'' 8" Chang on a quest to learn to dunk—not only to impress his crush, Kristy, but to gain the respect of his high school peers too. But before he can rise up and truly throw one down, he''ll have to reexamine everything he knows about himself, his friendships and his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ohaIkrTd47z43IuLlwwNg7bi96c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:776098'),
  ('477029359017570192', 'Chang: A Drama of the Wilderness', 1927, 'Documentary, Adventure, Drama', 'Merian C. Cooper, Ernest B. Schoedsack, Ernest B. Schoedsack', 'Ernest B. Schoedsack, Merian C. Cooper, Achmed Abdullah', 'Natives of the Wild, Wild Beasts, The Jungle, Kru, Chantui, Nah, Ladah, Bimbo the Monkey', 'NR', 'Elephants disrupt the lives of a family deep in the jungles of Northern Siam, and an entire village.', 'Elephants disrupt the lives of a family deep in the jungles of Northern Siam, and an entire village.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cHp0S8HojQh1Rmo8ILJ9OOznRdv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44657'),
  ('653442733979817696', 'Chang''an', 2023, 'Animation, History', 'Xie Junwei, Zou Jing', 'Gary Wang', 'Yang Tianxiang, Ling Zhenhe, Junquan Wu, Xuan Xiaoming, Lu Lifeng, Sun Lulu, Liu Xiaoyu, Lu Xiran', null, 'A few years after the Anshi Rebellion, Tang dynasty military commander Gao Shi suffers a defeat in a battle threatening Chang''an. Trapped in the besieged city, he recalls his lifelong friendship with the acclaimed poet Li Bai.', 'A few years after the Anshi Rebellion, Tang dynasty military commander Gao Shi suffers a defeat in a battle threatening Chang''an. Trapped in the besieged city, he recalls his lifelong friendship with the acclaimed poet Li Bai.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ltWuj0bEhITpiNYaTmpc2lUKy90.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1089654'),
  ('652703894042301327', 'Change Nothing', 2009, 'Documentary, Music', 'Pedro Costa', null, 'Jeanne Balibar, Rodolphe Burger, Hervé Loos, Arnaud Dieterlen, Joël Theux, François Loriquet, Fred Cacheux', null, 'One of the most important figures in contemporary cinema, Pedro Costa''s celebrated music documentary is a mesmerizing portrait of French actress-turned-singer Jeanne Balibar, a transfixing, cigarette-smoking chanteuse with an intense devotion to her craft. Photographed in shimmering black-and-white and featuring a soundtrack of jazz-inflected pop songs, the film is a luminous exploration of the creative process.', 'One of the most important figures in contemporary cinema, Pedro Costa''s celebrated music documentary is a mesmerizing portrait of French actress-turned-singer Jeanne Balibar, a transfixing, cigarette-smoking chanteuse with an intense devotion to her craft. Photographed in shimmering black-and-white and featuring a soundtrack of jazz-inflected pop songs, the film is a luminous exploration of the creative process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gojlZDvjc33UREC7hbQQ1P4OjAm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85474'),
  ('1014973954544358075', 'Change of Address', 2006, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Emmanuel Mouret', 'Emmanuel Mouret', 'Fanny Valette, Frédérique Bel, Dany Brillant, Emmanuel Mouret, Ariane Ascaride, Frédéric Niedermayer, Hans Joachim Kruse, Claire Breniaux', null, 'In Paris, the emotional and professional tribulations of a musician and his roommate. Freshly installed in Paris, David, a shy and clumsy musician, falls madly in love with his student, Julia. He tries everything to seduce her. His roommate, Anne, encourages, advises, and consoles... passionately!', 'In Paris, the emotional and professional tribulations of a musician and his roommate. Freshly installed in Paris, David, a shy and clumsy musician, falls madly in love with his student, Julia. He tries everything to seduce her. His roommate, Anne, encourages, advises, and consoles... passionately!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/our6U7TsUTXbVWdSNHfupV6Lzlg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51851'),
  ('599927172902825885', 'Change of Habit', 1969, 'Crime, Drama, Music, Romance', 'William A. Graham, Russell Metty, Phil Bowles', 'James Lee, S.S. Schweitzer, Eric Bercovici', 'Elvis Presley, Mary Tyler Moore, Barbara McNair, Jane Elliot, Leora Dana, Ed Asner, Robert Emhardt, Regis Toomey', 'G', 'Dr. John Carpenter takes the job of running a health center in a low-income district. He enlists three women to help out who — unbeknownst to him — are actually nuns in street clothes. The church wants to improve the neighborhood but fears that nuns in full habit would not be well received. Unaware of her unavailability, John falls for Sister Michelle, serenading her with his guitar — which, luckily for him, effectively wears away at her religious resolve.', 'Dr. John Carpenter takes the job of running a health center in a low-income district. He enlists three women to help out who — unbeknownst to him — are actually nuns in street clothes. The church wants to improve the neighborhood but fears that nuns in full habit would not be well received. Unaware of her unavailability, John falls for Sister Michelle, serenading her with his guitar — which, luckily for him, effectively wears away at her religious resolve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bZx6oDV3LnhaDImYJj2tkgEtqI0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18694'),
  ('772489825996297687', 'Change of Life', 1967, 'Drama', 'Paulo Rocha, Elso Roque, António Campos', 'António Reis, Paulo Rocha', 'Geraldo del Rey, Isabel Ruth, Maria Barroso, João Guedes, Constança Navarro, Mário Santos, Nunes Vidal, Antônio Coelho', null, 'After completing his military service in the Angolan War of Independence, Adelino goes back to the Portuguese fishing village he calls home, only to find that the woman he loves has married his brother. Overcome by bitterness, he sets off to find work in the countryside where he meets Albertina, a free-spirited young woman who challenges him to change his life.', 'After completing his military service in the Angolan War of Independence, Adelino goes back to the Portuguese fishing village he calls home, only to find that the woman he loves has married his brother. Overcome by bitterness, he sets off to find work in the countryside where he meets Albertina, a free-spirited young woman who challenges him to change his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ttRmKrVf0V8GlmXHVsvt86tqMLA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:242296'),
  ('78617402464156485', 'Change of Plans', 2009, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Danièle Thompson, Jean-Marc Fabre', 'Danièle Thompson, Christopher Thompson', 'Karin Viard, Dany Boon, Marina Foïs, Patrick Bruel, Emmanuelle Seigner, Christopher Thompson, Marina Hands, Patrick Chesnais', null, 'So called friends at a dinner party end up acting like a dysfunctional family.', 'So called friends at a dinner party end up acting like a dysfunctional family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nQ2azQZlWFKFl9mwkBqMslAYi07.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14688'),
  ('296193066907745774', 'Change of Sex', 1977, 'Drama', 'Vicente Aranda, Néstor Almendros', 'Vicente Aranda, Joaquín Jordá', 'Victoria Abril, Lou Castel, Fernando Sancho, Bibiana Fernández, Rafaela Aparicio, Montserrat Carulla, Daniel Martín, María Elías', null, 'Young José María goes through a painful journey until he discovers that he is a transsexual.', 'Young José María goes through a painful journey until he discovers that he is a transsexual.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dhxL6lNZOqSyIvNyyP2brei6yGx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115677'),
  ('179015475957787150', 'Changeland', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Seth Green', 'Seth Green', 'Seth Green, Breckin Meyer, Clare Grant, Rose Williams, Kedar Williams-Stirling, Brenda Song, Randy Orton, Macaulay Culkin', 'R', 'Follow two estranged best friends on an epic, life-changing adventure in Thailand, as they''re reminded that there''s no problem that friendship and a few rounds in a Muay Thai boxing ring can''t fix.', 'Follow two estranged best friends on an epic, life-changing adventure in Thailand, as they''re reminded that there''s no problem that friendship and a few rounds in a Muay Thai boxing ring can''t fix.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vaf93xaAmPXcGWDNuQNXe9OYhnl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575381'),
  ('538959940094687715', 'Changeling', 2008, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Clint Eastwood, Tom Stern, Pam Cartmel', 'J. Michael Straczynski', 'Angelina Jolie, John Malkovich, Jeffrey Donovan, Michael Kelly, Colm Feore, Jason Butler Harner, Amy Ryan, Geoff Pierson', 'R', 'Los Angeles, 1928. When single mother Christine Collins leaves for work, her son vanishes without a trace. Five months later, the police reunite mother and son. But when Christine suspects that the boy returned to her isn''t her child, her quest for truth exposes a world of corruption.', 'Los Angeles, 1928. When single mother Christine Collins leaves for work, her son vanishes without a trace. Five months later, the police reunite mother and son. But when Christine suspects that the boy returned to her isn''t her child, her quest for truth exposes a world of corruption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/829VqESzooUXRVgrfM7PtNBGySf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3580'),
  ('571774554647220453', 'Changes', 1991, 'TV Movie, Drama, Romance', 'Charles Jarrott, Chuck Arnold', 'Susan Nanus', 'Cheryl Ladd, Michael Nouri, Chris Gartin, Randee Heller, Cynthia Bain, Charles Frank, James Sloyan, Luis Ávalos', null, 'Melanie is a top TV news reporter, living in New York with her twin teenage daughters. Peter is a handsome and divorced heart surgeon working at an L.A. hospital with three children of his own. A chance meeting leads to instant romance and eventual marriage, bringing about drastic changes in their lives...not all of them good.', 'Melanie is a top TV news reporter, living in New York with her twin teenage daughters. Peter is a handsome and divorced heart surgeon working at an L.A. hospital with three children of his own. A chance meeting leads to instant romance and eventual marriage, bringing about drastic changes in their lives...not all of them good.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lkFBnAMyseRkWpKIPgVJeaw9ggU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21391'),
  ('179769545782326894', 'Changing Landscapes', 1964, 'Documentary, TV Movie, History', 'Éric Rohmer, Pierre Lhomme', null, 'Antoine Vitez', null, 'A sophisticated and beautifully constructed account of landscape change in and around Paris in the early 1960s. The film raises complex issues about the meaning and experience of modern landscapes and the enigmatic characteristics of features such as canals, pylons and deserted factories. Rohmer also explores the role of landscape within different traditions of modern art and design and refers to specific architects, artists and engineers.', 'A sophisticated and beautifully constructed account of landscape change in and around Paris in the early 1960s. The film raises complex issues about the meaning and experience of modern landscapes and the enigmatic characteristics of features such as canals, pylons and deserted factories. Rohmer also explores the role of landscape within different traditions of modern art and design and refers to specific architects, artists and engineers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nC8gKU7JdpQlvkGNtoMb9XGhD4Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123570'),
  ('493390204736823933', 'Changing Lanes', 2002, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Roger Michell, Salvatore Totino, Michael E. Steele', 'Chap Taylor, Michael Tolkin', 'Ben Affleck, Samuel L. Jackson, Toni Collette, Sydney Pollack, William Hurt, Amanda Peet, Richard Jenkins, Dylan Baker', 'R', 'A rush-hour fender-bender on New York City''s crowded FDR Drive, under most circumstances, wouldn''t set off a chain reaction that could decimate two people''s lives. But on this day, at this time, a minor collision will turn two complete strangers into vicious adversaries. Their means of destroying each other might be different, but their goals, ultimately, will be the same: Each will systematically try to dismantle the other''s life in a reckless effort to reclaim something he has lost.', 'A rush-hour fender-bender on New York City''s crowded FDR Drive, under most circumstances, wouldn''t set off a chain reaction that could decimate two people''s lives. But on this day, at this time, a minor collision will turn two complete strangers into vicious adversaries. Their means of destroying each other might be different, but their goals, ultimately, will be the same: Each will systematically try to dismantle the other''s life in a reckless effort to reclaim something he has lost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8wh9WzTKo5pJw3EgHYWA60W7Kbl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1537'),
  ('232690881015724382', 'Changing Sides', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Pascale Pouzadoux, Pierre Gill', 'Grégoire Vigneron, Pascale Pouzadoux', 'Dany Boon, Sophie Marceau, Antoine Duléry, Roland Giraud, Anny Duperey, Juliette Arnaud, Ninon Mauger, Clémot Couture', null, 'Ariane and Hugo decide to exchange the lives they lead to escape from their routine, which after ten years of marriage, gives them the feeling of being hamsters in a wheel. She suddenly finds herself at the head of a construction equipment rental company and he tries to take the role of a house calling jewelry salesman...But is life really better when you live it on the other side of the bed?', 'Ariane and Hugo decide to exchange the lives they lead to escape from their routine, which after ten years of marriage, gives them the feeling of being hamsters in a wheel. She suddenly finds herself at the head of a construction equipment rental company and he tries to take the role of a house calling jewelry salesman...But is life really better when you live it on the other side of the bed?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yFWMa7JatOBYwbuDcokjVbTuYWK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15709'),
  ('4916732988005183', 'Changing Skins', 1997, 'Comedy', 'Andreas Dresen', null, 'Susanne Bormann, Fabian Busch, Otto Mellies, Manfred Möck, Franziska Troegner, Thomas Neumann, Annett Kruschke, Christel Peters', null, 'Inspired by West German terrorists, two pupils kidnap a teacher in East Germany.', 'Inspired by West German terrorists, two pupils kidnap a teacher in East Germany.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aeZY1mF5Yshio50FLrtB3idrMEH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258780'),
  ('14323482967948601', 'Changing Times', 2004, 'Drama, Romance', 'André Téchiné, Julien Hirsch', 'Laurent Guyot, Pascal Bonitzer, André Téchiné', 'Catherine Deneuve, Gérard Depardieu, Gilbert Melki, Malik Zidi, Lubna Azabal, Tanya Lopert, Nabila Baraka, Idir Elomri', null, 'In Tangiers where he traveled for his work, a man finds the woman he loved, and attempts to revive their romance though it ended some 30 years earlier.', 'In Tangiers where he traveled for his work, a man finds the woman he loved, and attempts to revive their romance though it ended some 30 years earlier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cUF2Dbtsayn0q2KebksAzvbLlwN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38021'),
  ('390831810289806505', 'Chantal in Fairyland', 2024, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Laura Mihartescu, Raimond Schultheis, Jan Gregor', 'Bora Dağtekin', 'Jella Haase, Gizem Emre, Mido Kotaini, Max von der Groeben, Nora Tschirner, Maria Ehrich, Cooper Dillon, Alexandra Maria Lara', null, 'Chantal is at the beginning of her career as an influencer when she steps through a mirror and finds herself in a fairy tale. She identifies as Sleeping Beauty. Her best friend Zeynep follows her through the mirror. Chantal’s goal, naturally, is to find a man, definitely a prince. Perhaps she will marry Prince Bosco. She already has a wedding gown, but he seems more interested in men. Her friend, Aladdin (Mido Kotaini), has a magic lamp; he rubs it, and people appear. She works to finish making a flying carpet. There is a wicked witch, Sansara, who sometimes looks old but often young. Her friend Zeynep ends up in a grave but reappears. An elderly rather fat fairy pops up occasionally. Chantal must fight a dragon.', 'Chantal is at the beginning of her career as an influencer when she steps through a mirror and finds herself in a fairy tale. She identifies as Sleeping Beauty. Her best friend Zeynep follows her through the mirror. Chantal’s goal, naturally, is to find a man, definitely a prince. Perhaps she will marry Prince Bosco. She already has a wedding gown, but he seems more interested in men. Her friend, Aladdin (Mido Kotaini), has a magic lamp; he rubs it, and people appear. She works to finish making a flying carpet. There is a wicked witch, Sansara, who sometimes looks old but often young. Her friend Zeynep ends up in a grave but reappears. An elderly rather fat fairy pops up occasionally. Chantal must fight a dragon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z9KCiGL6HdwWztnlywUOIjiaz6n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1119774'),
  ('499443468772738900', 'Chaos', 2000, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Hideo Nakata, Tokushō Kikumura', 'Hisashi Saito', 'Masato Hagiwara, Miki Nakatani, Ken Mitsuishi, Jun Kunimura, Yūna Natsuo, Tarō Suwa, Manabu Hamada, Michi Yamamura', null, 'A kidnapping for ransom seemingly goes off without a hitch, but as one thread left unsolved suddenly reveals many more mysteries, the whole operation threatens to descend into chaos.', 'A kidnapping for ransom seemingly goes off without a hitch, but as one thread left unsolved suddenly reveals many more mysteries, the whole operation threatens to descend into chaos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n7uqF0Tx8izurvWGnyW7uu7UXPZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39983'),
  ('946140224355403221', 'Chaos', 2001, 'Drama', 'Coline Serreau, Jean-François Robin', 'Coline Serreau', 'Vincent Lindon, Catherine Frot, Rachida Brakni, Line Renaud, Aurélien Wiik, Chloé Lambert, Eric Poulain, Hajar Nouma', null, 'A bourgeois couple, modern yet conventional. One night by accident, a young prostitute barges into their lives. Hounded down, beaten up, threatened, she will continue to struggle, with the help of a well off lady, first for her survival-her resurrection-then for her dignity and freedom. Stormy encounters for everyone involved.', 'A bourgeois couple, modern yet conventional. One night by accident, a young prostitute barges into their lives. Hounded down, beaten up, threatened, she will continue to struggle, with the help of a well off lady, first for her survival-her resurrection-then for her dignity and freedom. Stormy encounters for everyone involved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7iRACW1bYueLZJ7CpyWMJgB1Ta4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44164'),
  ('1101935071640552489', 'Chaos', 2005, 'Drama, Action, Crime', 'Tony Giglio, Richard Greatrex, Brian Pearson', 'Tony Giglio', 'Jason Statham, Ryan Phillippe, Wesley Snipes, Henry Czerny, Justine Waddell, Nicholas Lea, Jessica Steen, Rob LaBelle', 'R', 'In Seattle, detective Quentin Conners is unfairly suspended and his partner Jason York leaves the police force after a tragic shooting on Pearl Street Bridge, when the hostage and the criminal die. During a bank heist with a hostage situation, Conners is assigned in charge of the operation with the rookie Shane Dekker as his partner. The thieves, lead by Lorenz, apparently do not steal a penny from the bank. While chasing the gangsters, the police team disclose that they planted a virus in the system, stealing one billion dollars from the different accounts, using the principle of the Chaos Theory. Further, they find that Lorenz is killing his accomplices.', 'In Seattle, detective Quentin Conners is unfairly suspended and his partner Jason York leaves the police force after a tragic shooting on Pearl Street Bridge, when the hostage and the criminal die. During a bank heist with a hostage situation, Conners is assigned in charge of the operation with the rookie Shane Dekker as his partner. The thieves, lead by Lorenz, apparently do not steal a penny from the bank. While chasing the gangsters, the police team disclose that they planted a virus in the system, stealing one billion dollars from the different accounts, using the principle of the Chaos Theory. Further, they find that Lorenz is killing his accomplices.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fsqOoouBsNo69vbh2WG6PtpzGBa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5289'),
  ('1017101816126078035', 'Chaos and Desire', 2002, 'Drama, Mystery, Romance', 'Manon Briand, David Franco', 'Manon Briand', 'Pascale Bussières, Julie Gayet, Jean-Nicolas Verreault, Geneviève Bujold, Norman Helms, Vincent Bilodeau, Gabriel Arcand, Jean-Pierre Ronfard', null, 'Suspecting that the cecassion of the tides may indicate an impending earthquake, Seismologist Alice arrives in her hometown of Baie-Comeau, Quebec to commence her investigation. Soon confronted by numerous figures from her past, the unusual weather and inexplicable behavior of the citizens lead Alice to believe that something beyond her comprehension is occurring to her old hometown...', 'Suspecting that the cecassion of the tides may indicate an impending earthquake, Seismologist Alice arrives in her hometown of Baie-Comeau, Quebec to commence her investigation. Soon confronted by numerous figures from her past, the unusual weather and inexplicable behavior of the citizens lead Alice to believe that something beyond her comprehension is occurring to her old hometown...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ipsbc2Gvt1ihdmFjYG7tFGdpFp2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75040'),
  ('327251857249718414', 'Chaos on the Bridge', 2014, 'TV Movie, Documentary, Science Fiction', 'William Shatner, Decebal Dascau', 'William Shatner', 'Denise Crosby, John de Lancie, Jonathan Frakes, Gates McFadden, Diana Muldaur, William Shatner, Patrick Stewart, Jeffrey Katzenberg', null, 'Canadian acting legend William Shatner takes viewers inside the creation of Star Trek: The Next Generation, the bold attempt in 1986 to recreate the success of the original television series, in which Shatner played Captain James T. Kirk.', 'Canadian acting legend William Shatner takes viewers inside the creation of Star Trek: The Next Generation, the bold attempt in 1986 to recreate the success of the original television series, in which Shatner played Captain James T. Kirk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r8yenzDNnHmIfP0es7n2xzOJTSQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347497'),
  ('362739011457972571', 'Chaos Theory', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Marcos Siega, Ramsey Nickell', 'Daniel Taplitz', 'Ryan Reynolds, Emily Mortimer, Stuart Townsend, Matreya Fedor, Sarah Chalke, Mike Erwin, Constance Zimmer, Elisabeth Harnois', 'PG-13', 'Frank Allen, a professional speaker who lectures on time management has a perfectly ordered and scheduled life, down to the minute. When his wife sets his clock forward 10 minutes as a joke, his day is thrown off. Deciding that his strictly ordered life has done him little good, he begins to make multiple choice index cards, choosing one at random and doing what is written on the card.', 'Frank Allen, a professional speaker who lectures on time management has a perfectly ordered and scheduled life, down to the minute. When his wife sets his clock forward 10 minutes as a joke, his day is thrown off. Deciding that his strictly ordered life has done him little good, he begins to make multiple choice index cards, choosing one at random and doing what is written on the card.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iP4DJqTeMMQJ3J0eyt2RjRH6NZH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12912'),
  ('69703387861627706', 'Chaos Walking', 2021, 'Fantasy, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Nicolas Lepage, Tosin Akinwoye, Fede Álvarez', 'Patrick Ness, Christopher Ford', 'Tom Holland, Daisy Ridley, Mads Mikkelsen, Demián Bichir, David Oyelowo, Kurt Sutter, Cynthia Erivo, Bethany Anne Lind', 'PG-13', 'Two unlikely companions embark on a perilous adventure through the badlands of an unexplored planet as they try to escape a dangerous and disorienting reality, where all inner thoughts are seen and heard by everyone.', 'Two unlikely companions embark on a perilous adventure through the badlands of an unexplored planet as they try to escape a dangerous and disorienting reality, where all inner thoughts are seen and heard by everyone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xAYGdGBGptNkisXRpmhZSry6SPF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:412656'),
  ('902749048356973619', 'Chaos, This Is?', 2007, 'Drama, Crime, Romance', 'Youssef Chahine, Sabri Al Sammak, Manal Al Saifi', 'Nasser Abdulrahman', 'Khaled Saleh, Menna Shalabi, Youssef El Sherif, Hala Sedki, Dorra Zarrouk, Hala Fakher, Amr Abdel Gelil, Ahmad Yahya', null, 'Hatem is a corrupt police officer, who loves his neighbor Nour, who in turn loves the prosecutor, Sherif. Hatem tries to win Nour’s attention even if by force.', 'Hatem is a corrupt police officer, who loves his neighbor Nour, who in turn loves the prosecutor, Sherif. Hatem tries to win Nour’s attention even if by force.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bUo2rjMHGp4qDICzKLAaJ1tdQ8E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163660'),
  ('292414033006635465', 'Chaos: The Manson Murders', 2025, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Errol Morris, Igor Martinović, Robert Chappell', 'Tom O''Neill', 'Charles Manson, Stephen Kay, Tom O''Neill, Gregg Jakobson, Bobby Beausoleil, Louis "Jolly" West, Bernard Crowe, Susan Atkins', 'R', 'In August 1969, Charles Manson''s followers killed seven people on his orders. Why? Explore a conspiracy of mind control, CIA experiments, and murder.', 'In August 1969, Charles Manson''s followers killed seven people on his orders. Why? Explore a conspiracy of mind control, CIA experiments, and murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lcWOKxTVZybE8aRUhzkKokU2s0s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1426486'),
  ('544377746788275433', 'Chaotic Ana', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Julio Medem, Mario Montero', 'Julio Medem', 'Manuela Vellés, Charlotte Rampling, Bebe, Asier Newman, Nicolas Cazalé, Matthias Habich, Gerrit Graham, Giacomo Gonnella', null, 'Ana, a teenager artist, is raised in Ibiza by her German father Klaus in a naturalist lifestyle. She meets Justine, who invites her to move to Madrid and get an artistic education and financial support. Ana befriends Linda, meets the problematic Said, a Saharawi youngster, and later she is hypnotized by Anglo, who opens a door to her memories and past lives.', 'Ana, a teenager artist, is raised in Ibiza by her German father Klaus in a naturalist lifestyle. She meets Justine, who invites her to move to Madrid and get an artistic education and financial support. Ana befriends Linda, meets the problematic Said, a Saharawi youngster, and later she is hypnotized by Anglo, who opens a door to her memories and past lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/49HVU5cpbP5aVIDPfudwYCrLcFo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2588'),
  ('928882742004467856', 'Chapayev', 1934, 'Drama, History, War', 'Alexandr Sigaev, Aleksandr Ksenofontov, Sergey Vasilev', 'Georgi Vasilyev, Sergey Vasilev', 'Boris Babochkin, Leonid Kmit, Varvara Myasnikova, Boris Blinov, Illarion Pevtsov, Nikolai Simonov, Boris Chirkov, Stepan Shkurat', null, 'An account of the peasant turned mythical military hero Vasily Chapayev, charting his campaign in the Red Army during the Russian Civil War.', 'An account of the peasant turned mythical military hero Vasily Chapayev, charting his campaign in the Red Army during the Russian Civil War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/va7mzdH8qu1qa5KYmWAczrTz5FA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46774'),
  ('642818142831636774', 'Chaplin', 1992, 'Drama', 'Richard Attenborough, Sven Nykvist, Norman Dorme', 'William Boyd, Bryan Forbes, William Goldman', 'Robert Downey Jr., Geraldine Chaplin, Paul Rhys, Marisa Tomei, Milla Jovovich, John Thaw, Moira Kelly, Anthony Hopkins', 'PG-13', 'An aged Charlie Chaplin narrates his life to his autobiography''s editor, including his rise to wealth and comedic fame from poverty, his turbulent personal life and his run-ins with the FBI.', 'An aged Charlie Chaplin narrates his life to his autobiography''s editor, including his rise to wealth and comedic fame from poverty, his turbulent personal life and his run-ins with the FBI.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/53auOJUsPP2YE97HTYgBQ0WO2gO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10435'),
  ('279838243232214389', 'Chapo: El Escape Del Siglo', 2016, 'Thriller, Action, Adventure, Crime', 'Axel Uriegas', null, 'Irineo Alvarez, José Sefami, Pascacio López, Kristoff Raczynski, Horacio Castelo, Edgardo González, José Carlos Rodríguez, Armando Hernández', null, 'A famous drug kingpin escapes from prison. The mexican president wants him back in jail whereas the U.S. government wants him dead.', 'A famous drug kingpin escapes from prison. The mexican president wants him back in jail whereas the U.S. government wants him dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/khAED7ox0Dfk4Ef5LAf6jPEe4oy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:377670'),
  ('526197059746852745', 'Chappaqua', 1966, 'Drama', 'Conrad Rooks, Robert Frank', 'Conrad Rooks', 'Jean-Louis Barrault, Conrad Rooks, William S. Burroughs, Allen Ginsberg, Paula Pritchett, Ravi Shankar, Ornette Coleman, Swami Satchidananda', 'NR', 'Semi-autobiographical story of Conrad Rooks, who travels to France to undergo a drug-withdrawal cure. Flashbacks to the beginings of psychedelia in San Fran. Though initially confusing, as Rooks blends drug-illusion with reality, and cuts color with black-and-white and monochrome tinted shots, "Chappaqua" is conventionally constructed with a beginning, middle, and end.', 'Semi-autobiographical story of Conrad Rooks, who travels to France to undergo a drug-withdrawal cure. Flashbacks to the beginings of psychedelia in San Fran. Though initially confusing, as Rooks blends drug-illusion with reality, and cuts color with black-and-white and monochrome tinted shots, "Chappaqua" is conventionally constructed with a beginning, middle, and end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6FVbQs0cG8Cp76Yoar173bhKFs2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33382'),
  ('243031596913271485', 'Chappaquiddick', 2018, 'History, Drama, Thriller', 'John Curran, Maryse Alberti, Chloe Arbiture', 'Taylor Allen, Andrew Logan', 'Jason Clarke, Kate Mara, Ed Helms, Bruce Dern, Jim Gaffigan, Olivia Thirlby, Clancy Brown, Taylor Nichols', 'PG-13', 'Ted Kennedy''s life and political career become derailed in the aftermath of a fatal car accident in 1969 that claims the life of a young campaign strategist, Mary Jo Kopechne.', 'Ted Kennedy''s life and political career become derailed in the aftermath of a fatal car accident in 1969 that claims the life of a young campaign strategist, Mary Jo Kopechne.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kkTD7ufZd7AqAnZP5IMnrQXKRpM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:432301'),
  ('213482572434061054', 'Chappelle''s Home Team - Earthquake: Legendary', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Stan Lathan', 'Earthquake', 'Earthquake', 'R', 'Earthquake shakes up the stage with his takes on "health is wealth," prostate exams and one particularly lengthy celebrity funeral.', 'Earthquake shakes up the stage with his takes on "health is wealth," prostate exams and one particularly lengthy celebrity funeral.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/otOmPzWg0ZWWtFqNl32Q6IgRQZQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:943022'),
  ('261933014742583504', 'Chappie', 2015, 'Crime, Action, Science Fiction', 'Neill Blomkamp, Trent Opaloch, James Bitonti', 'Neill Blomkamp, Terri Tatchell', 'Sharlto Copley, Dev Patel, Hugh Jackman, Ninja, Yo-Landi Visser, Sigourney Weaver, Chris Shields, Anderson Cooper', 'R', 'Every child comes into the world full of promise, and none more so than Chappie: he is gifted, special, a prodigy. Like any child, Chappie will come under the influence of his surroundings—some good, some bad—and he will rely on his heart and soul to find his way in the world and become his own man. But there''s one thing that makes Chappie different from any one else: he is a robot.', 'Every child comes into the world full of promise, and none more so than Chappie: he is gifted, special, a prodigy. Like any child, Chappie will come under the influence of his surroundings—some good, some bad—and he will rely on his heart and soul to find his way in the world and become his own man. But there''s one thing that makes Chappie different from any one else: he is a robot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uuDUpzlMFomdSfNWlpEPS9nVZWV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198184'),
  ('957953811834478826', 'Chapter 27', 2007, 'Drama, Crime', 'Tom Richmond, Thomas Fatone, Jeffrey Lazar', 'Jarrett Schaefer', 'Jared Leto, Lindsay Lohan, Judah Friedlander, Ursula Abbott, Mark Lindsay Chapman, Mariko Takai, Michael Sirow, Kate Higgins', null, 'A film about Mark David Chapman in the days leading up to the infamous murder of Beatle John Lennon.', 'A film about Mark David Chapman in the days leading up to the infamous murder of Beatle John Lennon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mvjreS7Mgz13IkyhmWNCiEbmhlh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8319'),
  ('1060079386966189058', 'Chapter Two', 1979, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Robert Moore, David M. Walsh', 'Neil Simon', 'James Caan, Marsha Mason, Joseph Bologna, Valerie Harper, Alan Fudge, Judy Farrell, Debra Mooney, Isabel Cooley', 'PG', 'George Schneider is an author whose wife had just died. His brother Leo gives him the number of Jennie Malone, and somehow they hit it off. And just when things are moving along, the memory of his first wife comes between them.', 'George Schneider is an author whose wife had just died. His brother Leo gives him the number of Jennie Malone, and somehow they hit it off. And just when things are moving along, the memory of his first wife comes between them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xikReu6tBkPWrTHXUR9ldGWFHQq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42168'),
  ('408977319011593018', 'Character', 1997, 'History, Drama', 'Mike van Diem, Rogier Stoffers', 'Mike van Diem', 'Jan Decleir, Fedja van Huêt, Betty Schuurman, Tamar van den Dop, Victor Löw, Hans Kesting, Lou Landré, Bernard Droog', null, 'In pre-WWII Holland, the penniless, illegitimate son of a powerful bailiff sets out to become a lawyer as he spends a lifetime struggling to prove his worth to his relentlessly spiteful father.', 'In pre-WWII Holland, the penniless, illegitimate son of a powerful bailiff sets out to become a lawyer as he spends a lifetime struggling to prove his worth to his relentlessly spiteful father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v7TWGTZ6fNkY72IyoiVIcnlwniU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17139'),
  ('141518334939399104', 'Character', 2021, 'Thriller, Mystery, Crime', 'Akira Nagai, Yoshimasa Fujie, Masunobu Motokawa', 'Takashi Nagasaki, Anna Kawahara, Akira Nagai', 'Masaki Suda, Fukase, Mitsuki Takahata, Shido Nakamura, Shun Oguri, Akiyoshi Nakao, Yoji Matsuda, Tomu Miyazaki', null, 'A kind man aspires to become a manga writer, but villains and evil deeds do not come easily to him, for he has little experience or natural inclination for them. Things take a surprise turn when he comes across a family who were described as idealized that are no more. He uses the real-life situation for his work.', 'A kind man aspires to become a manga writer, but villains and evil deeds do not come easily to him, for he has little experience or natural inclination for them. Things take a surprise turn when he comes across a family who were described as idealized that are no more. He uses the real-life situation for his work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uwIe2Jiwajp1RFVB4LVSNXDblh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:808667'),
  ('184891443239362544', 'Character Studies', 1927, 'Comedy', 'Roscoe Arbuckle', null, 'Carter DeHaven, Buster Keaton, Harold Lloyd, Roscoe Arbuckle, Rudolph Valentino, Douglas Fairbanks, Jackie Coogan', 'NR', 'Carter DeHaven announces that he will perform a series of "impressions." For each we see him applying makeup and changing the combing of his hair or putting on a wig. When he tilts his head down during each supposed makeover, up pops the actual celebrity (Keaton, Lloyd, Arbuckle, Valentino, Fairbanks, Coogan) he appears to have been making himself up as.', 'Carter DeHaven announces that he will perform a series of "impressions." For each we see him applying makeup and changing the combing of his hair or putting on a wig. When he tilts his head down during each supposed makeover, up pops the actual celebrity (Keaton, Lloyd, Arbuckle, Valentino, Fairbanks, Coogan) he appears to have been making himself up as.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oFcDymalveFDXm6cP93B1k4CfSk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163110'),
  ('258290312257824653', 'Charade', 1984, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Jon Minnis', 'Jon Minnis', 'Jon Minnis', null, 'A talented, but doomed, gentleman tries to participate in a properly British game of charades.', 'A talented, but doomed, gentleman tries to participate in a properly British game of charades.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2FFME6juIEVx7Oi4Mh3qknnZpJX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48276'),
  ('315210795098138508', 'Charak: Fair of Faith', 2026, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Shieladitya Moulik, Amarnath Jha', 'Farauq Malik, Sanjay Halder', 'Anjali Patil, Sahidur Rahaman, Subrat Dutta', null, 'An age-old ritual demands extreme physical commitment from its followers. Several individuals navigate the ceremony, driven by hope, tradition, and the search for purpose.', 'An age-old ritual demands extreme physical commitment from its followers. Several individuals navigate the ceremony, driven by hope, tradition, and the search for purpose.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FzavEC8ywCrM3mgvYzttHdkOzOgs.jpg', 'plex:movie:charak-2026'),
  ('708969431977510102', 'Charcoal', 2022, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Carolina Markowicz, Pepe Mendes', 'Carolina Markowicz', 'Maeve Jinkings, Jean Almeida da Costa, Benedito Alves, Aline Marta Maia, Rômulo Braga, Camila Márdila, Pedro Wagner, Dinho Lima Flor', null, 'In the Brazilian countryside, a family straining to care for their bedridden patriarch have their lives changed when a shady nurse offers a diabolical deal: put their elder to rest and host an Argentinian drug kingpin who urgently needs a place to hide.', 'In the Brazilian countryside, a family straining to care for their bedridden patriarch have their lives changed when a shady nurse offers a diabolical deal: put their elder to rest and host an Argentinian drug kingpin who urgently needs a place to hide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sJY4pANqMX34ybyg4CtoRReThJu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:872989'),
  ('1041635231885788441', 'Charge!', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Robert Guédiguian, Bernard Cavalié, Carole Guenot', 'Robert Guédiguian, Jean-Louis Milesi', 'Ariane Ascaride, Pierre Banderet, Frédérique Bonnal, Patrick Bonnel, Gérard Meylan, Jacques Boudet, Alain Lenglet, Jacques Pieiller', null, 'Two scriptwriter friends with opposing personalities fuss and fight as they cobble together a script for a modern political film. Their arguments seem endless, they constantly stray from the plot, but the story slowly takes shape around garage mechanics at Moliterno & co. who fight a multinational in order to save their business.', 'Two scriptwriter friends with opposing personalities fuss and fight as they cobble together a script for a modern political film. Their arguments seem endless, they constantly stray from the plot, but the story slowly takes shape around garage mechanics at Moliterno & co. who fight a multinational in order to save their business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7FWlEyOqBUedtBdexnAsa2MZPAP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134270'),
  ('768463397702963364', 'Chariot', 2013, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Brad Osborne', null, 'Anthony Montgomery, Ian Sinclair, Michelle Sherrill, Frederic Doss, Brina Palencia, Leslie Hippensteel, Leeanne Locken Emberlin, David DeLao', null, 'Seven strangers find themselves unwitting participants in a U.S. government evacuation program gone horribly wrong.', 'Seven strangers find themselves unwitting participants in a U.S. government evacuation program gone horribly wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uAk0sfohVqO0PCWFr9qBj3xxZOz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:252990'),
  ('1061942947864469269', 'Chariot', 2022, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Mystery', 'Adam Sigal, Senda Bonnet', 'Adam Sigal', 'Thomas Mann, Rosa Salazar, Scout Taylor-Compton, Shane West, John Malkovich, Vernon Davis, Chris Mullinax', null, 'Odd, eccentric specialist Dr. Karn guides unknowing patients through the reincarnation transition. When Harrison experiences mysterious recurring dreams, he turns to Dr. Karn for help and reveals his encounter with a woman he loved in a previous life. Noticing a glitch in the system, the doctor must fix the issue before permanently derailing his patient''s future.', 'Odd, eccentric specialist Dr. Karn guides unknowing patients through the reincarnation transition. When Harrison experiences mysterious recurring dreams, he turns to Dr. Karn for help and reveals his encounter with a woman he loved in a previous life. Noticing a glitch in the system, the doctor must fix the issue before permanently derailing his patient''s future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gKqA1Vz9CtDbiwR4z2peJjqwPXA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:816494'),
  ('620119441080585806', 'Chariots of Fire', 1981, 'Drama, History', 'Hugh Hudson, David Watkin, Jonathan Benson', 'Colin Welland', 'Ben Cross, Ian Charleson, Cheryl Campbell, Alice Krige, Nigel Havers, Ian Holm, Nicholas Farrell, Daniel Gerroll', 'PG', 'In the class-obsessed and religiously divided UK of the early 1920s, two determined young runners train for the 1924 Paris Olympics. Eric Liddell, a devout Christian born to Scottish missionaries in China, sees running as part of his worship of God''s glory and refuses to train or compete on the Sabbath. Harold Abrahams overcomes anti-Semitism and class bias, but neglects his beloved sweetheart in his single-minded quest.', 'In the class-obsessed and religiously divided UK of the early 1920s, two determined young runners train for the 1924 Paris Olympics. Eric Liddell, a devout Christian born to Scottish missionaries in China, sees running as part of his worship of God''s glory and refuses to train or compete on the Sabbath. Harold Abrahams overcomes anti-Semitism and class bias, but neglects his beloved sweetheart in his single-minded quest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qnRaum8k0HqGRml2i7OawFqUtEb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9443'),
  ('424853695630009417', 'Chariots of Fur', 1994, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', null, null, null, 'In his ongoing quest to eat a decent meal just once, Coyote is still hunting down the roadrunner, despite a warning from the surgeon general that it can damage your health. Undeterred, Coyote employs bird seed, giant mouse traps (or traps for giant mice?) and springs in an attempt to catch the tricky bird.', 'In his ongoing quest to eat a decent meal just once, Coyote is still hunting down the roadrunner, despite a warning from the surgeon general that it can damage your health. Undeterred, Coyote employs bird seed, giant mouse traps (or traps for giant mice?) and springs in an attempt to catch the tricky bird.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AaakTeCBYe3SEfT2jPQjYp3iyPY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197740'),
  ('670381245035575773', 'Chariots of the Gods', 1970, 'Documentary, Mystery', 'Harald Reinl, Ernst Wild, Charles M. Wakefield', 'Utz Utermann', 'Heinz-Detlev Bock, Klaus Kindler, Christian Marschall, Erich von Däniken, Aleksandr Kazantsev, Wiatscheslav Saitsew, Bruce Johansen, Lee Pajan', null, 'Documentary based on the book by Erich von Däniken concerning the ancient mysteries of the world, such as the pyramids of Egypt and Mexico, ancient cave drawings, the monuments of Easter Island, etc., and the fact that these things and modern civilisation could have been influenced by extraterrestrial visitations hundreds (or perhaps thousands) of years ago.', 'Documentary based on the book by Erich von Däniken concerning the ancient mysteries of the world, such as the pyramids of Egypt and Mexico, ancient cave drawings, the monuments of Easter Island, etc., and the fact that these things and modern civilisation could have been influenced by extraterrestrial visitations hundreds (or perhaps thousands) of years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gBkZEvKLizGwuddvoQe99PdRrN5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42587'),
  ('107093134213067885', 'Charisma', 1999, 'Mystery, Drama, Thriller', 'Kiyoshi Kurosawa, Junichiro Hayashi', 'Kiyoshi Kurosawa', 'Koji Yakusho, Hiroyuki Ikeuchi, Ren Osugi, Yoriko Doguchi, Yutaka Matsushige, Akira Otaka, Sachiko Meguro, Masahiro Toda', null, 'A seasoned detective is called in to rescue a politician held hostage by a lunatic. In a brief moment of uncertainty, he misses the chance for action. Leaving his job and family without explanation, he makes his way to a mountain forest, encountering a peculiar tree called Charisma.', 'A seasoned detective is called in to rescue a politician held hostage by a lunatic. In a brief moment of uncertainty, he misses the chance for action. Leaving his job and family without explanation, he makes his way to a mountain forest, encountering a peculiar tree called Charisma.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vILXJXcTjBUZFsXViw2vmpxO0uv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72490'),
  ('320638374981524800', 'Charlatan', 2020, 'Drama', 'Martin Štrba, Agnieszka Holland, Pavel Svatoň', 'Marek Epstein', 'Josef Trojan, Ivan Trojan, Juraj Loj, Jaroslava Pokorná, Jana Kvantiková, Jiří Černý, Martin Sitta, Miroslav Hanuš', null, 'Born in the early 20th century, herbalist Jan Mikolasek became rich and famous after curing countless diseases with unorthodox means. A true emblem of Czechoslovakia before World War II, the healer became even more appreciated during the Nazi occupation and the communist regime. Each regime appreciates his skill and protects him. But how much will it cost him to maintain his status in a new political change?', 'Born in the early 20th century, herbalist Jan Mikolasek became rich and famous after curing countless diseases with unorthodox means. A true emblem of Czechoslovakia before World War II, the healer became even more appreciated during the Nazi occupation and the communist regime. Each regime appreciates his skill and protects him. But how much will it cost him to maintain his status in a new political change?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xl2isNXDEqQCuhH8KqQzoDQG0GY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:501738'),
  ('323785699913089940', 'Charles Bronson: The Spirit of Masculinity', 2020, 'Documentary, History', 'Jean Lauritano', 'Jean Lauritano', 'Michel Zlotowski, Charles Bronson', null, 'With his grizzled moustache and chiselled features, Charles Bronson is the embodiment of a slightly archaic, brooding and almost reactionary virility. But who is he really? Often hired to play marginalised Native American or Mexican characters before he was typecast as the image of a lone killer, Bronson was a major figure in the popular cinema of the 1960s and 70s and his stony-faced, physical acting and career are worthy of a second look.', 'With his grizzled moustache and chiselled features, Charles Bronson is the embodiment of a slightly archaic, brooding and almost reactionary virility. But who is he really? Often hired to play marginalised Native American or Mexican characters before he was typecast as the image of a lone killer, Bronson was a major figure in the popular cinema of the 1960s and 70s and his stony-faced, physical acting and career are worthy of a second look.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jKps5CH9LZaHOrrm3r9QRP98BUa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:769938'),
  ('114620110367847351', 'Charles Darwin and the Tree of Life', 2009, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Petra Graf, Ian Salvage', 'David Attenborough', 'David Attenborough', null, 'Darwin''s great insight – that life has evolved over millions of years by natural selection – has been the cornerstone of all David Attenborough’s natural history series. In this documentary, he takes us on a deeply personal journey which reflects his own life and the way he came to understand Darwin’s theory.', 'Darwin''s great insight – that life has evolved over millions of years by natural selection – has been the cornerstone of all David Attenborough’s natural history series. In this documentary, he takes us on a deeply personal journey which reflects his own life and the way he came to understand Darwin’s theory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/plmI9ryqGc8zn3l8c4cVXdgycgR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20784'),
  ('375735257712493020', 'Charles Manson Superstar', 1989, 'Crime, Documentary', 'Nikolas Schreck', null, 'Charles Manson, Nikolas Schreck, Zeena Schreck, James N. Mason', 'R', 'For forty years, Charles Manson has survived most of his life in what he calls ''the hallways of the all ways,'' the reform schools, jails and prisons that have been his home and tomb. His thought was born in the hole of solitary confinement, apart from time and beyond the grasp of society. In his cell, he created his own world and speaks his own language: he has concluded that there is only the mind. From convincing his followers to move into the desert to train for the apocalypse, to leading a murderous crew through a string of devilish murders, you will see and hear from Manson himself of how he created a preconceived terror based on his philosophy of life. Manson claims that the so-called ''straight'' world outside of prison is but an inverted reflection of the underworld in which he has lived. To him, the reality that presidents and law-abiding citizens accept begins in the hermetic alternate universe of criminals, cons and outlaws.', 'For forty years, Charles Manson has survived most of his life in what he calls ''the hallways of the all ways,'' the reform schools, jails and prisons that have been his home and tomb. His thought was born in the hole of solitary confinement, apart from time and beyond the grasp of society. In his cell, he created his own world and speaks his own language: he has concluded that there is only the mind. From convincing his followers to move into the desert to train for the apocalypse, to leading a murderous crew through a string of devilish murders, you will see and hear from Manson himself of how he created a preconceived terror based on his philosophy of life. Manson claims that the so-called ''straight'' world outside of prison is but an inverted reflection of the underworld in which he has lived. To him, the reality that presidents and law-abiding citizens accept begins in the hermetic alternate universe of criminals, cons and outlaws.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xE6sn108Y6Fjf1DQT7GqgooKONM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60078'),
  ('954588403520107184', 'Charles, Dead or Alive', 1970, 'Drama', 'Alain Tanner, Éric Noguet, Florian Rochat', 'Alain Tanner', 'François Simon, Marie-Claire Dufour, Marcel Robert, Maya Simon, André Schmidt, Jo Excoffier, Walter Schochli, Jean-Pierre Moriaud', null, 'On the 100th anniversary of the founding of a watchmaking company in Geneva, Charles Dé the founder''s 50-year-old grandson has had it: he speaks eccentrically to a reporter, recognizing his grandfather as a craftsman and his son as a businessman, but is evasive about himself. He gives his family the slip and moves in with a young couple he meets by chance, doing the cooking, reading, drinking, and engaging in philosophical discussions with them. The young couple comes to love Charles. In secret, he stays in touch with a daughter, and the rest of the family hires a private investigator to find him, setting in motion a business take-over that threatens his Bohemian happiness.', 'On the 100th anniversary of the founding of a watchmaking company in Geneva, Charles Dé the founder''s 50-year-old grandson has had it: he speaks eccentrically to a reporter, recognizing his grandfather as a craftsman and his son as a businessman, but is evasive about himself. He gives his family the slip and moves in with a young couple he meets by chance, doing the cooking, reading, drinking, and engaging in philosophical discussions with them. The young couple comes to love Charles. In secret, he stays in touch with a daughter, and the rest of the family hires a private investigator to find him, setting in motion a business take-over that threatens his Bohemian happiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j72ljYYQtlnJMd407MNL03StZCC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108543'),
  ('890794656082310657', 'Charleston', 1974, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Enzo Barboni, Marcello Masciocchi, Giorgio Ubaldi', 'Enzo Barboni', 'Giuliano Gemma, Ricky Bruch, Laura Becherelli, Dominic Barto, Pupo De Luca, Paolo Zilli, Edoardo Faieta, Riccardo Pizzuti', null, 'Sonny, a New York wise guy, dreams of becoming a feared gangster. He runs errands for the mob and is rewarded by being given the control over Mulberry Street, which is a street that faces a boxing gym.', 'Sonny, a New York wise guy, dreams of becoming a feared gangster. He runs errands for the mob and is rewarded by being given the control over Mulberry Street, which is a street that faces a boxing gym.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/efpg9C0xc7kF45AGOp6tU8HwYH6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41897'),
  ('59042837688315984', 'Charleston', 1977, 'Comedy', 'Marcello Fondato, Nancy Fondato, Mike Higgins', 'Francesco Scardamaglia, Marcello Fondato', 'Bud Spencer, Herbert Lom, Jack La Cayenne, Dino Emanuelli, Geoffrey Bayldon, Ronald Lacey, James Coco, Renzo Marignano', null, 'Charleston is a 1977 Italian comedy film written and directed by Marcello Fondato. It reprises the style of the film The Sting.', 'Charleston is a 1977 Italian comedy film written and directed by Marcello Fondato. It reprises the style of the film The Sting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5S8Uygm5hRbMQuQ9w5DE9CF11BU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46448'),
  ('7680050346093165', 'Charleston Parade', 1927, 'Science Fiction', 'Jean Renoir, Jean Bachelet', 'Pierre Lestringuez', 'Catherine Hessling, Johnny Hudgins, André Cerf, Pierre Lestringuez, Jean Renoir, Pierre Braunberger', null, 'Shot in three days, this surreal, erotic silent short shows a native white girl teaching a futuristic African airman the Charleston dance.', 'Shot in three days, this surreal, erotic silent short shows a native white girl teaching a futuristic African airman the Charleston dance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hC6Lt4KLFYIsjFR8khwMkTw7wiU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126377'),
  ('89618331591862287', 'Charley & Mimmo', 2004, 'Family, Animation', 'Jean-Luc François', 'Michel Fessler, Didier Lejeune, Marie Locatelli', 'Gwénaël Sommier, Clovis Mahouden, Héloïse Jadoul', null, 'Accompanied by his extraordinary confidant Doudou, T''choupi discovers with wonder the small village of the seaside where he will live. The beautiful days of summer, the beach, freedom - Very quickly, the holidays are rich in encounters and adventures. He shares with Doudou all the events of his life, where joy and jealousy mingle; the family is growing, T''choupi now has a little sister, Fanny. But a mysterious shadow disturbs the happiness of the village children by stealing their favorite toys. With Pilou and Lalou, his new friends, T''choupi will conduct a thrilling investigation to unmask the culprit.', 'Accompanied by his extraordinary confidant Doudou, T''choupi discovers with wonder the small village of the seaside where he will live. The beautiful days of summer, the beach, freedom - Very quickly, the holidays are rich in encounters and adventures. He shares with Doudou all the events of his life, where joy and jealousy mingle; the family is growing, T''choupi now has a little sister, Fanny. But a mysterious shadow disturbs the happiness of the village children by stealing their favorite toys. With Pilou and Lalou, his new friends, T''choupi will conduct a thrilling investigation to unmask the culprit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p5dPk9rWDIMGTVtunyziWFPz3lq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26998'),
  ('805378707544529924', 'Charley and the Angel', 1973, 'Family, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Vincent McEveety, Charles F. Wheeler', 'Roswell Rogers', 'Fred MacMurray, Cloris Leachman, Harry Morgan, Kurt Russell, Kathleen Cody, Vincent Van Patten, Scott C. Kolden, George Lindsey', null, 'Charley is a workaholic family man that finds out from an angel that his "number''s up" and he will be dying soon so he tries to change his ways and be a better husband and father with the time he has left.', 'Charley is a workaholic family man that finds out from an angel that his "number''s up" and he will be dying soon so he tries to change his ways and be a better husband and father with the time he has left.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lrRCt8z8RhnNcHDiPaTMwOJk61h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103711'),
  ('1000232065194731225', 'Charley One-Eye', 1973, 'Western', 'Don Chaffey, Kenneth Talbot, Nicholas Granby', 'Keith Leonard', 'Richard Roundtree, Roy Thinnes, Nigel Davenport, Aldo Sambrell, Jill Pearson, Luis Aller, Rafael Albaicín, Johnny Sekka', 'R', 'A black Union Army deserter and his crippled American Indian hostage form a strained partnership in the interests of surviving the advancing threats of a racist bounty hunter and neighboring bandits.', 'A black Union Army deserter and his crippled American Indian hostage form a strained partnership in the interests of surviving the advancing threats of a racist bounty hunter and neighboring bandits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kDUO9T617irVywezc0rVhwcbath.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83831'),
  ('1026210433333165557', 'Charley Varrick', 1973, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama, Action', 'Michael C. Butler, Don Siegel, Joseph C. Cavalier', 'Dean Riesner, Howard Rodman', 'Walter Matthau, Joe Don Baker, Felicia Farr, Andrew Robinson, Sheree North, Norman Fell, Benson Fong, Woodrow Parfrey', 'PG', 'Charley Varrick robs a bank in a small town with his friends, but instead of obtaining a small amount of money, they discover they stole a very large amount of money belonging to the mob. Charley must now come up with a plan to not only evade the police but the mob as well.', 'Charley Varrick robs a bank in a small town with his friends, but instead of obtaining a small amount of money, they discover they stole a very large amount of money belonging to the mob. Charley must now come up with a plan to not only evade the police but the mob as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qPG2VPNA72he1Kczm2yFmslPNZN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27331'),
  ('656257512821638687', 'Charley''s Aunt', 1956, 'Comedy', 'Kurt Schulz, Hans Quest', 'Gustav Kampendonk', 'Heinz Rühmann, Hertha Feiler, Claus Biederstaedt, Walter Giller, Ruth Stephan, Bum Krüger, Hans Olden, Ina Peters', null, 'Otto Dernburg is forced by circumstances to dress up as a middle-aged woman.', 'Otto Dernburg is forced by circumstances to dress up as a middle-aged woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kNQ9bOsA2K5sjdrmMULwYWJWuT3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5999'),
  ('236454416405761721', 'Charley''s Aunt', 1959, 'Comedy, Family', 'Poul Bang, Ole Lytken', 'Arvid Müller', 'Dirch Passer, Ove Sprogøe, Ebbe Langberg, Ghita Nørby, Annie Birgit Garde, Birgitte Federspiel, Susse Wold, Hans W. Petersen', null, 'Charles and Peter have passed their law degree and are looking forward to wooing a few girls in the country. For that, they need a chaperone and persuade their fellow student Ditlev to play Charles''s aunt from Brazil. Ditlev has a talent for acting and takes the role very seriously, but when Charles''s real aunt turns up, things get complicated.', 'Charles and Peter have passed their law degree and are looking forward to wooing a few girls in the country. For that, they need a chaperone and persuade their fellow student Ditlev to play Charles''s aunt from Brazil. Ditlev has a talent for acting and takes the role very seriously, but when Charles''s real aunt turns up, things get complicated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A2TQnT1ZYnG5nrOEzA6ZX2iFgFh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6001'),
  ('678949079944465522', 'Charley''s Aunt', 1963, 'Comedy', 'Géza von Cziffra, Willy Winterstein', 'Gustav Kampendonk', 'Peter Alexander, Maria Sebaldt, Peter Vogel, Marlene Rahn, Alfred Böhm, Helli Servi, Rudolf Carl, Fritz Eckhardt', null, 'An Austrian version of the famous farce Charley''s Aunt. A man impersonates his own aunt.', 'An Austrian version of the famous farce Charley''s Aunt. A man impersonates his own aunt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aftcyMeaLdDEE78vIApXygi66I3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6005'),
  ('701880885970980253', 'Charlie', 2015, 'Drama, Romance', 'Martin Prakkat, Jomon T. John, Roby Varghese Raj', 'Unni R., Martin Prakkat', 'Parvathy Thiruvothu, Dulquer Salmaan, Aparna Gopinath, Chemban Vinod Jose, Nedumudi Venu, Kalpana, Soubin Shahir, Tovino Thomas', null, 'A young, nonconforming woman named Tessa gets entangled in a cat-and-mouse chase in the by-lanes of Kerala, hunting for a mysterious artist who previously lived in her apartment.', 'A young, nonconforming woman named Tessa gets entangled in a cat-and-mouse chase in the by-lanes of Kerala, hunting for a mysterious artist who previously lived in her apartment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kQo30LL8punEsJu5kMZzJydQYJo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:372297'),
  ('817931831423463904', 'Charlie & Boots', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Roger Lanser, Tim Smart, Paul Walton', 'Stewart Faichney, Dean Murphy', 'Paul Hogan, Shane Jacobson, Roy Billing, Morgan Griffin, Anthony Hammer, Bec Asha, Alan Powell, Deborah Kennedy', null, 'After a family tragedy, Charlie and his estranged son, Boots, try to put their differences aside and head off on the road trip of a lifetime - from regional Victoria to the Cape York Peninsula - they overcome many challenges to reach their dream - to fish off the northernmost tip of Australia.', 'After a family tragedy, Charlie and his estranged son, Boots, try to put their differences aside and head off on the road trip of a lifetime - from regional Victoria to the Cape York Peninsula - they overcome many challenges to reach their dream - to fish off the northernmost tip of Australia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sskyVJp4LfMFqbXQadCnM2unlNB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27595'),
  ('12205278218964145', 'Charlie & Louise - Das doppelte Lottchen', 1994, 'Family, Comedy', 'Joseph Vilsmaier, Joseph Vilsmaier, Wilhelm Engelhardt', 'Stefan Cantz, Reinhard Klooss', 'Fritzi Eichhorn, Floriane Eichhorn, Heiner Lauterbach, Corinna Harfouch, Hanns Zischler, Hans-Werner Meyer, April Hailer, Albert Kitzl', null, 'The two twelve-year-old girls Charlotte Palfy and Louise Kröger meet on a language trip to Scotland and discover that they are twins who were separated shortly after birth. Charlotte, the daughter of a music hall composer, is cool, self-confident and cheeky, dresses accordingly and listens to techno music. Louise, who grew up with her mother, an advertising executive, wears more "old-fashioned" clothes, is shy and reserved, but conscientious and orderly. Determined to play fate, the two swap roles - at the end of the journey, Louise travels as Charlie to her father, who works as a composer in Berlin-Kreuzberg, while Charlie travels as Louise to her mother in Hamburg, where she works in an advertising agency. The girls realize that getting their parents back together is not as easy as they thought.', 'The two twelve-year-old girls Charlotte Palfy and Louise Kröger meet on a language trip to Scotland and discover that they are twins who were separated shortly after birth. Charlotte, the daughter of a music hall composer, is cool, self-confident and cheeky, dresses accordingly and listens to techno music. Louise, who grew up with her mother, an advertising executive, wears more "old-fashioned" clothes, is shy and reserved, but conscientious and orderly. Determined to play fate, the two swap roles - at the end of the journey, Louise travels as Charlie to her father, who works as a composer in Berlin-Kreuzberg, while Charlie travels as Louise to her mother in Hamburg, where she works in an advertising agency. The girls realize that getting their parents back together is not as easy as they thought.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/73Qsm9lYqr21n5tMkMWZ0hxAG7l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10864'),
  ('236025297121044877', 'Charlie And A Half', 1974, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Boaz Davidson', 'Eli Tavor', 'Yehuda Barkan, Ze''ev Revach, Tuvia Tzafir, Arieh Elias', null, 'Charlie gets by through fleecing suckers with a three-card Monte. He passes himself off as a rich businessman. Miko is a street kid who spends his time with Charlie instead of going to school. The plot follows Charlie''s attempt to conquer the heart of Gila, a rich girl whose parents try to matchmake her to an American millionaire somewhat against her will.', 'Charlie gets by through fleecing suckers with a three-card Monte. He passes himself off as a rich businessman. Miko is a street kid who spends his time with Charlie instead of going to school. The plot follows Charlie''s attempt to conquer the heart of Gila, a rich girl whose parents try to matchmake her to an American millionaire somewhat against her will.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kS6IRhY66IzNP6zYBlWQos1vebk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13521'),
  ('1047955818994918571', 'Charlie and His Two Chicks', 1973, 'Comedy', 'Joël Séria, Marcel Combes', 'Joël Séria', 'Serge Sauvion, Jeanne Goupil, Nathalie Drivet, Jean-Pierre Marielle, André Lacombe, Jean Legall, Jean Mauvais, Annie Savarin', null, 'Charlie, a forty-something looking for a job, meets two twenty-something girls, Ghislaine and Josiane, who are similarly unemployed. All three decide to take to the road selling oilcloth to pay their way. The harmony reigns within the group until the arrival of Tony, a seller of miniature cathedrals.', 'Charlie, a forty-something looking for a job, meets two twenty-something girls, Ghislaine and Josiane, who are similarly unemployed. All three decide to take to the road selling oilcloth to pay their way. The harmony reigns within the group until the arrival of Tony, a seller of miniature cathedrals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rUOTVtc9N4f0rXUlxonlaLtYeeU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64904'),
  ('95638076481769062', 'Charlie and the Chocolate Factory', 2005, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Tim Burton, Philippe Rousselot, Anthony Caron-Delion', 'John August', 'Johnny Depp, Freddie Highmore, David Kelly, Helena Bonham Carter, Noah Taylor, Missi Pyle, James Fox, Deep Roy', 'PG', 'A young boy wins a tour through the most magnificent chocolate factory in the world, led by the world''s most unusual candy maker.', 'A young boy wins a tour through the most magnificent chocolate factory in the world, led by the world''s most unusual candy maker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iKP6wg3c6COUe8gYutoGG7qcPnO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118'),
  ('1060908423231459683', 'Charlie Bartlett', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Paul Sarossy, Jon Poll, Tim Singh', 'Gustin Nash', 'Anton Yelchin, Robert Downey Jr., Hope Davis, Kat Dennings, Tyler Hilton, Mark Rendall, Dylan Taylor, Megan Park', 'R', 'Awkward teenager Charlie Bartlett has trouble fitting in at a new high school. Charlie needs some friends fast, and decides that the best way to find them is to appoint himself the resident psychiatrist. He becomes one of the most popular guys in school by doling out advice and, occasionally, medication, to the student body.', 'Awkward teenager Charlie Bartlett has trouble fitting in at a new high school. Charlie needs some friends fast, and decides that the best way to find them is to appoint himself the resident psychiatrist. He becomes one of the most popular guys in school by doling out advice and, occasionally, medication, to the student body.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l0jr9jSIW2TYFuunPtDQ1exyjtI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8669'),
  ('916077497138912576', 'Charlie Brown''s All-Stars!', 1966, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, TV Movie', 'Nick Vasu, Bill Melendez', 'Charles M. Schulz', 'Peter Robbins, Sally Dryer, Christopher Shea, Cathy Steinberg, Bill Melendez, Ann Altieri, Glenn Mendelson, Lynn Vanderlip', null, 'After their humiliating 999th defeat, Charlie Brown''s whole baseball team quits on him. All seems lost...until Charlie Brown learns that his team can join the Little League and become an official team with real uniforms! But as the team''s enthusiasm sparks, Charlie Brown learns that neither girls nor Snoopy would be allowed to play. Charlie Brown faces the difficult decision of breaking this horrible news to his excited team.', 'After their humiliating 999th defeat, Charlie Brown''s whole baseball team quits on him. All seems lost...until Charlie Brown learns that his team can join the Little League and become an official team with real uniforms! But as the team''s enthusiasm sparks, Charlie Brown learns that neither girls nor Snoopy would be allowed to play. Charlie Brown faces the difficult decision of breaking this horrible news to his excited team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/43yzLBevC6lprNslYejaLrQyydZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52952'),
  ('1020786570730545443', 'Charlie Brown''s Christmas Tales', 2002, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, TV Movie', 'Larry Leichliter, Andy Kim', 'Charles M. Schulz', 'Wesley Singerman, Serena Berman, Corey Padnos, Megan Taylor Harvey, Christopher Johnson, Timmy Deters, Lauren Schaffel, Bill Melendez', 'NR', 'Tis the season for the cheer and charm of the Peanuts kids - and this delight special offers five segments full of unforgettable moments. Snoopy works as a bell-ringer to raise money and tries making peace with the ferocious cat next door. Linus strives to strike the right tone in his letter to Santa - and his friendship with an indecisive girl at school. Sally''s idea about gift giving and the identity of Santa may be unusual - but her strange notion about how to obtain a Christmas tree surprisingly does the job. Lucy tries awfully hard to be nice...and still coax everyone around her to buy her presents. Charlie Brown and Sally wait up for Santa (a surprisingly short man), who spreads Christmas gift cheer further than they had thought. Make merry!', 'Tis the season for the cheer and charm of the Peanuts kids - and this delight special offers five segments full of unforgettable moments. Snoopy works as a bell-ringer to raise money and tries making peace with the ferocious cat next door. Linus strives to strike the right tone in his letter to Santa - and his friendship with an indecisive girl at school. Sally''s idea about gift giving and the identity of Santa may be unusual - but her strange notion about how to obtain a Christmas tree surprisingly does the job. Lucy tries awfully hard to be nice...and still coax everyone around her to buy her presents. Charlie Brown and Sally wait up for Santa (a surprisingly short man), who spreads Christmas gift cheer further than they had thought. Make merry!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eFmnl8xmvbJOOSNsLJc45QLxw39.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37556'),
  ('737343462476822027', 'Charlie Bubbles', 1968, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Albert Finney, Peter Suschitzky, Terence A. Clegg', 'Shelagh Delaney', 'Albert Finney, Colin Blakely, Billie Whitelaw, Liza Minnelli, Timothy Garland, Richard Pearson, Nicholas Phipps, Peter Sallis', null, 'Charlie Bubbles, a writer, up from the working class of Manchester, England, who, in the course of becoming prematurely rich and famous, has mislaid a writer''s basic tool – the capacity to feel and to respond. Now he must visit his estranged wife and son, whom he has set up on a farm outside his native city. His journey accidentally becomes an attempt to reestablish his connections with life, people, and his own history.', 'Charlie Bubbles, a writer, up from the working class of Manchester, England, who, in the course of becoming prematurely rich and famous, has mislaid a writer''s basic tool – the capacity to feel and to respond. Now he must visit his estranged wife and son, whom he has set up on a farm outside his native city. His journey accidentally becomes an attempt to reestablish his connections with life, people, and his own history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rLxVaQIeCemYEoXhCzIBAdgbPVU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75947'),
  ('218785687820670447', 'Charlie Butts In', 1920, 'Comedy', 'Charlie Chaplin', 'Charlie Chaplin', 'Charlie Chaplin, Ben Turpin', null, 'A tramp heads home drunk on a Saturday night, finding it hard to make it to his room. When he finally does, he cannot make it to his bed.', 'A tramp heads home drunk on a Saturday night, finding it hard to make it to his room. When he finally does, he cannot make it to his bed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dFfTeLsz8pVo5BhxfTC9dJzHoOV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:380288'),
  ('51492709657333718', 'Charlie Chan and the Curse of the Dragon Queen', 1981, 'Comedy, Mystery, Thriller', 'Clive Donner, Paul Baxley, Edmond L. Koons', 'David Axlerod, Stan Burns', 'Peter Ustinov, Lee Grant, Angie Dickinson, Michelle Pfeiffer, Brian Keith, Roddy McDowall, Rachel Roberts, Paul Ryan', 'PG', 'Famous detective Charlie Chan is called out of retirement to help a San Francisco detective solve a mysterious series of murders. With his bumbling grandson as his sidekick, Chan also encounters an old nemesis known as the Dragon Queen who is the prime suspect.', 'Famous detective Charlie Chan is called out of retirement to help a San Francisco detective solve a mysterious series of murders. With his bumbling grandson as his sidekick, Chan also encounters an old nemesis known as the Dragon Queen who is the prime suspect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8gyBGOJpIZrUm8y0Q83L2yuwAPs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66592'),
  ('514905325227614339', 'Charlie Chan at Monte Carlo', 1937, 'Mystery, Comedy', 'Eugene Forde, Daniel B. Clark, Saul Wurtzel', 'Charles S. Belden', 'Warner Oland, Keye Luke, Virginia Field, Sidney Blackmer, Harold Huber, Kay Linaker, Robert Kent, Edward Raquello', null, 'Although Charlie and Lee are in Monaco for an art exhibit, they become caught up in a feud between rival financiers which involves the Chan''s in a web of blackmail and murder.', 'Although Charlie and Lee are in Monaco for an art exhibit, they become caught up in a feud between rival financiers which involves the Chan''s in a web of blackmail and murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5tFNym9qNzVfUI77t6JdYVgnDdL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38455'),
  ('462444422815704850', 'Charlie Chan at the Circus', 1936, 'Crime, Mystery, Comedy, Thriller', 'Harry Lachman, Daniel B. Clark, William Eckhardt', 'Robert Ellis', 'Warner Oland, Keye Luke, John McGuire, Shirley Deane, Francis Ford, J. Carrol Naish, Paul Stanton, Boothe Howard', null, 'While visiting the circus with his family, Charlie is recruited by the big top''s co-owner to investigate threatening letters that he''s received.', 'While visiting the circus with his family, Charlie is recruited by the big top''s co-owner to investigate threatening letters that he''s received.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n7CLgnusrof8kIfPmagu0h659vb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33386'),
  ('801075647712746101', 'Charlie Chan at the Olympics', 1937, 'Mystery, Crime, Thriller', 'Samuel Kaylin, Daniel B. Clark, H. Bruce Humberstone', 'Helen Logan, Robert Ellis', 'Warner Oland, Katherine DeMille, Pauline Moore, Allan Lane, Keye Luke, C. Henry Gordon, John Eldredge, Layne Tom Jr.', 'NR', 'Get ready for a Gold Medal murder mystery! This "tense, thrilling mystery" (''California Congress of Parents and Teachers'') pits Charlie Chan against international spies who are using the Berlin Olympic games as the perfect cover...for cold-blooded murder!', 'Get ready for a Gold Medal murder mystery! This "tense, thrilling mystery" (''California Congress of Parents and Teachers'') pits Charlie Chan against international spies who are using the Berlin Olympic games as the perfect cover...for cold-blooded murder!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4a0iIxRy17FqwLeFh1bZ78ooy6J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25148'),
  ('681653142264439685', 'Charlie Chan at the Opera', 1936, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'H. Bruce Humberstone, Lucien N. Andriot', 'Charles S. Belden', 'Warner Oland, Boris Karloff, Keye Luke, William Demarest, Guy Usher, Margaret Irving, Gregory Gaye, Nedda Harrigan', 'NR', 'A dangerous amnesiac escapes from an asylum, hides in the opera house, and is suspected of getting revenge on those who tried to murder him 13 years ago.', 'A dangerous amnesiac escapes from an asylum, hides in the opera house, and is suspected of getting revenge on those who tried to murder him 13 years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xM3HEdNLnJofx6rmj5i4Ha5dquP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28044'),
  ('853469820669670029', 'Charlie Chan at the Race Track', 1936, 'Mystery, Comedy, Thriller, Crime', 'H. Bruce Humberstone', 'Robert Ellis, Helen Logan, Edward T. Lowe Jr.', 'Warner Oland, Keye Luke, Helen Wood, Thomas Beck, Alan Dinehart, Gavin Muir, Gloria Roy, Jonathan Hale', 'NR', 'When a friend of Charlie''s is found kicked to death by his own race horse on board a Honolulu-bound liner, the detective discovers foul play and uncovers an international gambling ring.', 'When a friend of Charlie''s is found kicked to death by his own race horse on board a Honolulu-bound liner, the detective discovers foul play and uncovers an international gambling ring.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n02zNAllSZq7KpEKTRTUtKV1955.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33387'),
  ('591019568656284040', 'Charlie Chan at the Wax Museum', 1940, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Lynn Shores', 'John Larkin', 'Sidney Toler, Victor Sen Yung, C. Henry Gordon, Marc Lawrence, Eddie Marr, Charles Wagenheim, Joan Valerie, Marguerite Chapman', 'NR', 'A wax museum run by a demented doctor contains statues of such crime figures as Jack the Ripper and Bluebeard. In addition to making wax statues the doctor performs plastic surgery. It is here that an arch fiend takes refuge.', 'A wax museum run by a demented doctor contains statues of such crime figures as Jack the Ripper and Bluebeard. In addition to making wax statues the doctor performs plastic surgery. It is here that an arch fiend takes refuge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1OObtLSkrFgkadhrkqROCjH0o6F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38457'),
  ('540023645177038484', 'Charlie Chan at Treasure Island', 1939, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Norman Foster', 'John Larkin', 'Sidney Toler, Victor Sen Yung, Cesar Romero, Douglas Fowley, Pauline Moore, Donald MacBride, Douglass Dumbrille, Trevor Bardette', 'NR', 'Charlie Chan''s investigation of a blackmail-induced suicide as a case of murder leads him into a world of magick and mysticism peopled with a stage magician, a phoney spiritualist, and a for-real mind reader.', 'Charlie Chan''s investigation of a blackmail-induced suicide as a case of murder leads him into a world of magick and mysticism peopled with a stage magician, a phoney spiritualist, and a for-real mind reader.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zZbHQUsS2WRoYZQMfeXbtr37YM4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33388'),
  ('130927554328419171', 'Charlie Chan in Egypt', 1935, 'Mystery', 'Louis King', 'Robert Ellis, Helen Logan', 'Warner Oland, Pat Paterson, Thomas Beck, Rita Hayworth, Stepin Fetchit, Jameson Thomas, Frank Conroy, Nigel De Brulier', 'NR', 'While investigating the theft of antiquities from an ancient tomb excavation , Charlie discovers that the body of the expedition''s leader concealed inside the mummy''s wrappings.', 'While investigating the theft of antiquities from an ancient tomb excavation , Charlie discovers that the body of the expedition''s leader concealed inside the mummy''s wrappings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1skaeqBp4h3jjXrYV6Qt2759Epb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33390'),
  ('1149373435163795206', 'Charlie Chan in Honolulu', 1938, 'Mystery, Crime, Comedy, Thriller', 'H. Bruce Humberstone, Charles G. Clarke', 'Charles S. Belden', 'Sidney Toler, Phyllis Brooks, Victor Sen Yung, Eddie Collins, John ''Dusty'' King, Claire Dodd, George Zucco, Robert Barrat', null, 'While Charlie is distracted with the birth of his first grandchild, son Jimmy impersonates his father in order to investigate a murder aboard a freighter in the harbor.', 'While Charlie is distracted with the birth of his first grandchild, son Jimmy impersonates his father in order to investigate a murder aboard a freighter in the harbor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/53VOY3Pm0YEgET5npYUTeHQq74w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33392'),
  ('537892357758913880', 'Charlie Chan in London', 1934, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Eugene Forde, Samuel Kaylin, L. William O''Connell', 'Philip MacDonald', 'Warner Oland, Drue Leyton, Ray Milland, Mona Barrie, Douglas Walton, Alan Mowbray, George Barraud, Paul England', 'NR', 'Charlie Chan is sought out by Pamela Gray, a desperate young socialite whose brother Paul awaits execution for the murder of a weapons inventor. Pamela is convinced of his innocence.', 'Charlie Chan is sought out by Pamela Gray, a desperate young socialite whose brother Paul awaits execution for the murder of a weapons inventor. Pamela is convinced of his innocence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wfnnyrPbXxm3TQ7Eu3mkONZ18T8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33391'),
  ('949944006088303501', 'Charlie Chan in Panama', 1940, 'Crime, Thriller, Mystery, Comedy', 'Norman Foster', 'John Larkin', 'Sidney Toler, Jean Rogers, Lionel Atwill, Mary Nash, Victor Sen Yung, Kane Richmond, Chris-Pin Martin, Lionel Royce', 'NR', 'Charlie impersonates an employee of the U.S. government to foil an espionage plot which would destroy part of the Panama Canal, trapping a Navy fleet on its way to the Pacific after maneuvers in the Atlantic.', 'Charlie impersonates an employee of the U.S. government to foil an espionage plot which would destroy part of the Panama Canal, trapping a Navy fleet on its way to the Pacific after maneuvers in the Atlantic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oFmgkqu2eXQPzGdf4gpe5w58jLl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38458'),
  ('233157043611242402', 'Charlie Chan in Paris', 1935, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Lewis Seiler, Hamilton MacFadden', 'Edward T. Lowe Jr., Stuart Anthony', 'Warner Oland, Mary Brian, Thomas Beck, Erik Rhodes, John Miljan, Murray Kinnell, Minor Watson, John Qualen', 'NR', 'Charlie''s visit to Paris, ostensibly a vacation, is really a mission to investigate a bond-forgery racket. But his agent, apache dancer Nardi is killed before she can tell him much. The case, complicated by a false murder accusation for banker''s daughter Yvette, climaxes with a strange journey through the Paris sewers.', 'Charlie''s visit to Paris, ostensibly a vacation, is really a mission to investigate a bond-forgery racket. But his agent, apache dancer Nardi is killed before she can tell him much. The case, complicated by a false murder accusation for banker''s daughter Yvette, climaxes with a strange journey through the Paris sewers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/leUDQsYg3X6IbPxCppNJODu1Vf8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33393'),
  ('270841994949628013', 'Charlie Chan in Reno', 1939, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Norman Foster', 'Frances Hyland', 'Sidney Toler, Ricardo Cortez, Phyllis Brooks, Slim Summerville, Kane Richmond, Victor Sen Yung, Pauline Moore, Eddie Collins', 'NR', 'Mary Whitman has gone to Reno to obtain a divorce. While there she is arrested on suspicion of murdering a fellow guest at her hotel (which specializes in divorcers). There are many others at the hotel who wanted the victim out of the way. Charlie comes from his home in Honolulu to solve the murder.', 'Mary Whitman has gone to Reno to obtain a divorce. While there she is arrested on suspicion of murdering a fellow guest at her hotel (which specializes in divorcers). There are many others at the hotel who wanted the victim out of the way. Charlie comes from his home in Honolulu to solve the murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pGmwoMtEurXHKNO0cOsfmmwqoth.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33394'),
  ('173808956022954075', 'Charlie Chan in Rio', 1941, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Harry Lachman', 'Samuel G. Engel, Lester Ziffren', 'Sidney Toler, Victor Sen Yung, Harold Huber, Mary Beth Hughes, Cobina Wright, Victor Jory, Kay Linaker, Hamilton MacFadden', 'NR', 'In Rio de Janiero to arrest a nightclub singer on suspicion of a murder in Hawaii, Charlie Chan becomes involved with the Rio police in solving the singer''s own murder.', 'In Rio de Janiero to arrest a nightclub singer on suspicion of a murder in Hawaii, Charlie Chan becomes involved with the Rio police in solving the singer''s own murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yjgB0pzbh4iW8dFkD8GJRtF2j3L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38461'),
  ('597575343103691521', 'Charlie Chan in Shanghai', 1935, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'James Tinling', 'Gerard Fairlie', 'Warner Oland, Keye Luke, Jon Hall, Irene Hervey, Russell Hicks, Frederick Vogeding, Halliwell Hobbes, Neil Fitzgerald', 'NR', 'When a prominent official is murdered at a banquet honoring Charle Chan, the detective and son Lee team up to expose an opium-smuggling ring.', 'When a prominent official is murdered at a banquet honoring Charle Chan, the detective and son Lee team up to expose an opium-smuggling ring.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g7Fq1naVCuIPPI75j7SJwEvlwAk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33395'),
  ('1141638800633532321', 'Charlie Chan in The Chinese Cat', 1944, 'Mystery, Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Phil Rosen', null, 'Sidney Toler, Joan Woodbury, Mantan Moreland, Benson Fong, Ian Keith, Sam Flint, Cy Kendall, Weldon Heyburn', 'NR', 'To solve the murder of a man shot in a locked room, Chan must wade through a Fun House, the writings of an unscrupulous author, and chess pieces.', 'To solve the murder of a man shot in a locked room, Chan must wade through a Fun House, the writings of an unscrupulous author, and chess pieces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/19vD0wmVUf1xk1HEyW0r1r82FyU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38463'),
  ('108385433481754265', 'Charlie Chan in the Secret Service', 1944, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery', 'Phil Rosen', 'George Callahan', 'Sidney Toler, Mantan Moreland, Arthur Loft, Gwen Kenyon, Sarah Edwards, George J. Lewis, Marianne Quon, Benson Fong', null, 'Charlie Chan is an agent of the US government working in Washington DC and he is assigned to investigate the murder of the inventor of a highly advanced torpedo. Aiding Chan is his overeager but dull-witted son Tommy and his daughter Iris.', 'Charlie Chan is an agent of the US government working in Washington DC and he is assigned to investigate the murder of the inventor of a highly advanced torpedo. Aiding Chan is his overeager but dull-witted son Tommy and his daughter Iris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uwr8hmiV2TIcbExX3MWRGnglURN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38462'),
  ('455756733564852870', 'Charlie Chan on Broadway', 1937, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Eugene Forde, Harry Jackson', null, 'Warner Oland, Keye Luke, Joan Marsh, J. Edward Bromberg, Douglas Fowley, Harold Huber, Donald Woods, Louise Henry', null, 'Returning from European exile where she avoided testifying against her criminal associates, a former singer with a tell-all diary is murdered to insure her silence.', 'Returning from European exile where she avoided testifying against her criminal associates, a former singer with a tell-all diary is murdered to insure her silence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/60aIC1jxjsknG4c11lvUxsVzW9b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38454'),
  ('190847328773639467', 'Charlie Chan''s Murder Cruise', 1940, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Eugene Forde, Virgil Miller', 'Robertson White, Lester Ziffren', 'Sidney Toler, Victor Sen Yung, Leo G. Carroll, Lionel Atwill, Robert Lowery, Marjorie Weaver, Cora Witherspoon, Don Beddoe', null, 'On a cruise ship from Honolulu to San Francisco, the famous Chinese detective encounters four more murders while trying to figure out the murder of a Scotland Yard friend.', 'On a cruise ship from Honolulu to San Francisco, the famous Chinese detective encounters four more murders while trying to figure out the murder of a Scotland Yard friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cmluBTdeZKIf8irEk6PBi5WuEUK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38456'),
  ('278809098785556038', 'Charlie Chan''s Secret', 1936, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Gordon Wiles, Rudolph Maté', 'Helen Logan, Robert Ellis', 'Warner Oland, Rosina Lawrence, Charles Quigley, Henrietta Crosman, Edward Trevor, Astrid Allwyn, Herbert Mundin, Egon Brecher', 'NR', 'Allen Colby, heir to a huge fortune, is presumed drowned after an ocean liner sinks off the coast of Honolulu. Mysteriously, Colby reappears at his mansion only to be murdered soon after. When his body is discovered during a seance, everyone in attendance becomes a suspect, and it''s up to Chan to find the murderer before he or she strikes again.', 'Allen Colby, heir to a huge fortune, is presumed drowned after an ocean liner sinks off the coast of Honolulu. Mysteriously, Colby reappears at his mansion only to be murdered soon after. When his body is discovered during a seance, everyone in attendance becomes a suspect, and it''s up to Chan to find the murderer before he or she strikes again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ewpElWzisU83EnZe8YGaZYX8xzw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33708'),
  ('439848352056184302', 'Charlie Chaplin, The Genius of Liberty', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Yves Jeuland, Brice Leyniat', 'Yves Jeuland, François Aymé', 'Charlie Chaplin, Mathieu Amalric, Henry Bergman, Eric Campbell, Roscoe Arbuckle, Geraldine Chaplin, Oona O''Neill Chaplin, Syd Chaplin', null, 'The whole world knows him. Burlesque comedy genius, popular actor, author, director, producer, composer, choreographer, Charlie Chaplin (1889-1977) used his talent to serve an ideal of justice and freedom. But his best scenario was his own destiny, a story written into the political and artistic history of the 20th century.', 'The whole world knows him. Burlesque comedy genius, popular actor, author, director, producer, composer, choreographer, Charlie Chaplin (1889-1977) used his talent to serve an ideal of justice and freedom. But his best scenario was his own destiny, a story written into the political and artistic history of the 20th century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vl7fHMrmRPQhBV4WCX66no1d8si.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:741802'),
  ('256970382672349940', 'Charlie Countryman', 2013, 'Action, Comedy, Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Fredrik Bond, Roman Vasyanov', 'Matt Drake', 'Shia LaBeouf, Evan Rachel Wood, Mads Mikkelsen, Til Schweiger, Rupert Grint, James Buckley, Ion Caramitru, Vincent D''Onofrio', 'R', 'A young American falls hard for a Romanian cellist whose father has recently died -- and whose violent past could bring about his own demise.', 'A young American falls hard for a Romanian cellist whose father has recently died -- and whose violent past could bring about his own demise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7BbrgKfnRfEFIePqdRcWzuHs3KI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41602'),
  ('524525110407262642', 'Charlie Says', 2006, 'Drama', 'Nicole Garcia, Stéphane Fontaine', 'Frédéric Bélier-Garcia, Jacques Fieschi, Nicole Garcia', 'Jean-Pierre Bacri, Vincent Lindon, Benoît Magimel, Benoît Poelvoorde, Arnaud Valois, Patrick Pineau, Ferdinand Martin, Minna Haapkylä', null, 'The seemingly separate lives of a group of men intersect entwining the fates of each of them over the course of a week.', 'The seemingly separate lives of a group of men intersect entwining the fates of each of them over the course of a week.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1XApWjUDrToGdC7O4vTPvq96ma2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68944'),
  ('795002005083740716', 'Charlie Says', 2019, 'Drama, Crime', 'Lisa Chu, Paul Lindsay, Tamara Wofford', 'Guinevere Turner', 'Hannah Murray, Sosie Bacon, Marianne Rendón, Merritt Wever, Matt Smith, Suki Waterhouse, Chace Crawford, Annabeth Gish', 'R', 'Three young women were sentenced to death in the infamous Manson murder case, but when the death penalty was lifted, their sentence became life imprisonment. One young graduate student was sent in to teach them – and through her we witness their transformations as they face the reality of their horrific crimes.', 'Three young women were sentenced to death in the infamous Manson murder case, but when the death penalty was lifted, their sentence became life imprisonment. One young graduate student was sent in to teach them – and through her we witness their transformations as they face the reality of their horrific crimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cgc4tSc8Q65aYpRroFz3jPNad5j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:471859'),
  ('827587653227053774', 'Charlie St. Cloud', 2010, 'Drama, Romance', 'Burr Steers, Sagar Patil, Enrique Chediak', 'Lewis Colick, Craig Pearce', 'Zac Efron, Charlie Tahan, Amanda Crew, Augustus Prew, Donal Logue, Kim Basinger, Ray Liotta, Dave Franco', 'PG-13', 'Accomplished sailor Charlie St. Cloud has the adoration of his mother Claire and his little brother Sam, as well as a college scholarship that will lead him far from his sleepy Pacific Northwest hometown. But his bright future is cut short when tragedy strikes and takes his dreams with it. After high school classmate Tess returns home unexpectedly, Charlie grows torn between honoring a promise he made four years earlier and moving forward with newfound love. As he finds the courage to let go of the past for good, Charlie discovers the soul most worth saving is his own.', 'Accomplished sailor Charlie St. Cloud has the adoration of his mother Claire and his little brother Sam, as well as a college scholarship that will lead him far from his sleepy Pacific Northwest hometown. But his bright future is cut short when tragedy strikes and takes his dreams with it. After high school classmate Tess returns home unexpectedly, Charlie grows torn between honoring a promise he made four years earlier and moving forward with newfound love. As he finds the courage to let go of the past for good, Charlie discovers the soul most worth saving is his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r4XSrs6N086EU8CNm339dHRPhZg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37950'),
  ('280644914417857373', 'Charlie Wilson''s War', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama, History', 'Mike Nichols, Stephen Goldblatt, Brad Ricker', 'Aaron Sorkin', 'Tom Hanks, Julia Roberts, Philip Seymour Hoffman, Amy Adams, Emily Blunt, Om Puri, Shiri Appleby, Rachel Nichols', 'R', 'A Texas congressman sets a series of events in motion when he conspires with a CIA operative to aid Afghan mujahideen rebels fighting the Soviets.', 'A Texas congressman sets a series of events in motion when he conspires with a CIA operative to aid Afghan mujahideen rebels fighting the Soviets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/45FghqcdSYRWK7PsHUInaFPNd8l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6538'),
  ('563321301925594431', 'Charlie, the Lonesome Cougar', 1967, 'Adventure, Family', 'Winston Hibler', null, 'Ron Brown, Bryan Russell, Linda Wallace, Jim Wilson, Clifford Peterson, Rex Allen', 'G', 'A heartwarming Disney classic in which a cougar, who was rescued as a cub and raised by a group of loggers in the Pacific Northwest, reverts back to his natural instincts, leading to hilarious (and dangerous) consequences.', 'A heartwarming Disney classic in which a cougar, who was rescued as a cub and raised by a group of loggers in the Pacific Northwest, reverts back to his natural instincts, leading to hilarious (and dangerous) consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Nx00VscGdcPsa1PmjmwwMxLe3F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57855'),
  ('929999046103342508', 'Charlie: The Life and Art of Charles Chaplin', 2003, 'Documentary', 'Richard Schickel', 'Richard Schickel', 'Sydney Pollack, Woody Allen, Richard Attenborough, Jeanine Basinger, Claire Bloom, Geraldine Chaplin, Michael Chaplin, Sydney Chaplin', null, 'Brilliant, long in-the-works story of the life and art of the world''s greatest comedian and the cinema''s first genius, Charlie Chaplin. Produced, written and directed by renowned film critic Richard Schickel.', 'Brilliant, long in-the-works story of the life and art of the world''s greatest comedian and the cinema''s first genius, Charlie Chaplin. Produced, written and directed by renowned film critic Richard Schickel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/71HnWfOoUwHAlBzPHG5HYxPSmsE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53367'),
  ('146072021255285244', 'Charlie''s Angels', 2000, 'Action, Comedy, Adventure', 'McG, Russell Carpenter, Christina Fong', 'Ryan Rowe, John August, Ed Solomon', 'Cameron Diaz, Drew Barrymore, Lucy Liu, Bill Murray, Sam Rockwell, Tim Curry, Kelly Lynch, Crispin Glover', 'PG-13', 'The captivating crime-fighting trio who are masters of disguise, espionage and martial arts are back! When a devious mastermind embroils them in a plot to destroy individual privacy, the Angels, aided by their loyal sidekick Bosley, set out to bring down the bad guys. But when a terrible secret is revealed, it makes the Angels targets for assassination.', 'The captivating crime-fighting trio who are masters of disguise, espionage and martial arts are back! When a devious mastermind embroils them in a plot to destroy individual privacy, the Angels, aided by their loyal sidekick Bosley, set out to bring down the bad guys. But when a terrible secret is revealed, it makes the Angels targets for assassination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iHTmZs0BmkwMCYi8rhvMWC5G4EM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4327'),
  ('353274379388329130', 'Charlie''s Angels', 2019, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Klemens Becker, Andreas Olshausen, James Manning', 'Elizabeth Banks', 'Kristen Stewart, Naomi Scott, Ella Balinska, Elizabeth Banks, Patrick Stewart, Djimon Hounsou, Sam Claflin, Jonathan Tucker', 'PG-13', 'Elena Houghlin is a scientist, engineer and inventor of Calisto -- a sustainable energy source that will revolutionize the way people use power. It will be ready as soon as she works out the last issue, if not it could be turned into a dangerous weapon. But when the cutting edge technology is pushed to an investor before she can do that, Elena turns to the Townsend Agency for help. Now, it''s up to the Angels -- Jane, Sabina, and the newly recruited Elena -- to retrieve Calisto before it can be transformed into a weapon of mass destruction.', 'Elena Houghlin is a scientist, engineer and inventor of Calisto -- a sustainable energy source that will revolutionize the way people use power. It will be ready as soon as she works out the last issue, if not it could be turned into a dangerous weapon. But when the cutting edge technology is pushed to an investor before she can do that, Elena turns to the Townsend Agency for help. Now, it''s up to the Angels -- Jane, Sabina, and the newly recruited Elena -- to retrieve Calisto before it can be transformed into a weapon of mass destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1DPUFG6QnGqzpvEaDEv7TaepycM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:458897'),
  ('175875995321644159', 'Charlie''s Angels: Full Throttle', 2003, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'McG, Russell Carpenter, David F. Klassen', 'Marianne Wibberley, Cormac Wibberley, John August', 'Cameron Diaz, Drew Barrymore, Lucy Liu, Demi Moore, Bernie Mac, Justin Theroux, Robert Patrick, Crispin Glover', 'PG-13', 'The Angels are charged with finding a pair of missing rings that are encoded with the personal information of members of the Witness Protection Program. As informants are killed, the ladies target a rogue agent who might be responsible.', 'The Angels are charged with finding a pair of missing rings that are encoded with the personal information of members of the Witness Protection Program. As informants are killed, the ladies target a rogue agent who might be responsible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n4cdJ0Wqxb7C0HmZbcaC4eYnkIf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9471'),
  ('1016292518324751688', 'Charlie''s Farm', 2014, 'Horror', 'Chris Sun, Scott Kimber', 'Chris Sun', 'Tara Reid, Bill Moseley, Kane Hodder, Nathan Jones, Dean Kirkright, Allira Jaques, Sam Coward, Dave Beamish', 'NR', 'Four friends head into the Australian Outback to investigate an urban legend about Charlie''s Farm, where legend has it that an angry mob killed a sadistic family, and encounter a demented giant with a big thirst for revenge.', 'Four friends head into the Australian Outback to investigate an urban legend about Charlie''s Farm, where legend has it that an angry mob killed a sadistic family, and encounter a demented giant with a big thirst for revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kTYBbY9AvbpNdcKEBcK5OwEu72H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:304613'),
  ('484532994711651180', 'Charlie''s Ghost Story', 1995, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Anthony Edwards', 'Lance W. Dreesen, Clint Hutchison', 'Trenton Knight, Cheech Marin, Anthony Edwards, Charles Rocket, Linda Fiorentino, Robert Hy Gorman, Daphne Zuniga, Veronica Lauren', 'PG', 'Charlie is a kid whose archeologist father has made several discoveries while exploring a cave in Colorado. However, Charlie makes a discovery of his own -- the spirit of a long-dead explorer has come back to haunt him until his remains can be recovered and finally buried in a proper place. But Charlie can''t manage this task on his own, with his old man being too busy with his work to aide the restless soul. What''s a supernaturally-afflicted lad like him to do?', 'Charlie is a kid whose archeologist father has made several discoveries while exploring a cave in Colorado. However, Charlie makes a discovery of his own -- the spirit of a long-dead explorer has come back to haunt him until his remains can be recovered and finally buried in a proper place. But Charlie can''t manage this task on his own, with his old man being too busy with his work to aide the restless soul. What''s a supernaturally-afflicted lad like him to do?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tteC4mpHn7Uxk8WeDp1SA9VwmUK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:158257'),
  ('873789473858974621', 'Charlots Go to Spain', 1972, 'Comedy', 'Jean Girault, Jean Penzer', 'Jean Girault, Jacques Vilfrid', 'Gérard Rinaldi, Gérard Filipelli, Jean Sarrus, Jean-Guy Fechner, Gérard Croce, Jacques Legras, Yves Barsacq, Katia Tchenko', null, 'Four friends from Paris are living misadventures of all sorts in Spain when their group of travelers is forced to split due to a travel scam.', 'Four friends from Paris are living misadventures of all sorts in Spain when their group of travelers is forced to split due to a travel scam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oMwL5nOH7eI6uM7EKKhN3V39hlC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79391'),
  ('506200833880907239', 'Charlots'' Connection', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Jean Couturier', 'René Havard, Richard Balducci', 'Gérard Rinaldi, Gérard Filipelli, Jean Sarrus, Alexandra Stewart, Henri Garcin, Franck-Olivier Bonnet, Paulette Dubost, Pascale Rivault', null, 'Three friends begin to work the rent collectors. Fee collection goes with a lot of comic episodes...', 'Three friends begin to work the rent collectors. Fee collection goes with a lot of comic episodes...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8G9P69lUdG5D5JWsmnRD7qoyBR7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79387'),
  ('414531204007354301', 'Charlotte', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Simón Franco, Pablo Desanzo', 'Constanza Cabrera, Lucila Podestá, Simón Franco', 'Ángela Molina, Ignacio Huang, Belén Fretes, Lali González, José Maldonado, Nico García, Fernán Mirás, Gerardo Romano', null, 'A forgotten movie star learns that the director who made her fa-mous will be filming his last film in Paraguay so she sets out on an unusual journey in search of something more than just getting the leading role that she feels belongs to her.', 'A forgotten movie star learns that the director who made her fa-mous will be filming his last film in Paraguay so she sets out on an unusual journey in search of something more than just getting the leading role that she feels belongs to her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2QRrPpx9iP7xkfap0vysld9Id4b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:804770'),
  ('1043158883430433845', 'Charlotte', 2022, 'Animation, Drama, War, History', 'Tahir Rana, Éric Warin', 'David Bezmozgis, Erik Rutherford', 'Keira Knightley, Sam Claflin, Raoul Bhaneja, Hanneke Talbot, Mark Strong, Jim Broadbent, Henry Czerny, Eddie Marsan', null, 'The true story of Charlotte Salomon, a young German-Jewish painter who comes of age in Berlin on the eve of the Second World War. Fiercely imaginative and deeply gifted, she dreams of becoming an artist. Her first love applauds her talent, which emboldens her resolve. When anti-Semitic policies inspire violent mobs, she escapes to the safety of the South of France. There she begins to paint again, and finds new love. But her work is interrupted, this time by a family tragedy that reveals an even darker secret. Believing that only an extraordinary act will save her, she embarks on the monumental adventure of painting her life story.', 'The true story of Charlotte Salomon, a young German-Jewish painter who comes of age in Berlin on the eve of the Second World War. Fiercely imaginative and deeply gifted, she dreams of becoming an artist. Her first love applauds her talent, which emboldens her resolve. When anti-Semitic policies inspire violent mobs, she escapes to the safety of the South of France. There she begins to paint again, and finds new love. But her work is interrupted, this time by a family tragedy that reveals an even darker secret. Believing that only an extraordinary act will save her, she embarks on the monumental adventure of painting her life story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/goUoo1DiQen9TT6sBT6o4LW5cQs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:844135'),
  ('358415638053999618', 'Charlotte and Her Boyfriend', 1958, 'Comedy', 'Jean-Luc Godard, Michel Latouche', 'Jean-Luc Godard', 'Jean-Paul Belmondo, Anne Collette, Gérard Blain, Jean-Luc Godard', null, 'This short features a man who is visited by his ex-lover. The moment she arrives, the man starts his constant barrage of speech; the woman doesn''t say much. She just mocks the man and pretends she isn''t listening. She pulls faces at him and larks about; while the man is trying his best to get her back in his life, then in the next sentence he says he hates her.', 'This short features a man who is visited by his ex-lover. The moment she arrives, the man starts his constant barrage of speech; the woman doesn''t say much. She just mocks the man and pretends she isn''t listening. She pulls faces at him and larks about; while the man is trying his best to get her back in his life, then in the next sentence he says he hates her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eWnjLCJVcE6FljaEuBMvlFlvnmZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44461'),
  ('648865211574126323', 'Charlotte for Ever', 1986, 'Drama', 'Serge Gainsbourg, Willy Kurant', 'Serge Gainsbourg', 'Charlotte Gainsbourg, Serge Gainsbourg, Roland Dubillard, Roland Bertin, Anne Zamberlan, Anne Le Guernec, Sabeline Campo', null, 'Once a successful Hollywood screenwriter, Stan is now a depressive alcoholic who spends most of his time mooching about his house whilst pouring out his troubles to his drinking partner. The only thing that keeps him going is his love for his teenage daughter, Charlotte, but she despises him, believing him to be responsible for the accident in which her mother died.', 'Once a successful Hollywood screenwriter, Stan is now a depressive alcoholic who spends most of his time mooching about his house whilst pouring out his troubles to his drinking partner. The only thing that keeps him going is his love for his teenage daughter, Charlotte, but she despises him, believing him to be responsible for the accident in which her mother died.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6RVezWh5jyfKswEQgYpCWaixVXy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64238'),
  ('269003677527475959', 'Charlotte Gray', 2001, 'Drama, History, Romance, War', 'Gillian Armstrong, Dion Beebe, Stephen Woolfenden', 'Jeremy Brock', 'Cate Blanchett, Billy Crudup, Michael Gambon, Rupert Penry-Jones, Anton Lesser, James Fleet, Abigail Cruttenden, Charlotte McDougall', 'PG-13', 'This is a drama set in Nazi-occupied France at the height of World War II. Charlotte Gray tells the compelling story of a young Scottish woman working with the French Resistance in the hope of rescuing her lover, a missing RAF pilot. Based on the best-selling novel by Sebastian Faulks.', 'This is a drama set in Nazi-occupied France at the height of World War II. Charlotte Gray tells the compelling story of a young Scottish woman working with the French Resistance in the hope of rescuing her lover, a missing RAF pilot. Based on the best-selling novel by Sebastian Faulks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6RnRclsipl3cZKnDfsu0MrqWCwI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12660'),
