  ('72718419683428792', 'Charlotte''s Web', 1973, 'Family, Animation, Drama', 'Charles August Nichols, Iwao Takamoto, Alex Lovy', 'Earl Hamner, Jr.', 'Debbie Reynolds, Henry Gibson, Danny Bonaduce, Agnes Moorehead, Bob Holt, Paul Lynde, Rex Allen, Dave Madden', 'G', 'Wilbur the pig is scared of the end of the season, because he knows that come that time, he will end up on the dinner table. He hatches a plan with Charlotte, a spider that lives in his pen, to ensure that this will never happen.', 'Wilbur the pig is scared of the end of the season, because he knows that come that time, he will end up on the dinner table. He hatches a plan with Charlotte, a spider that lives in his pen, to ensure that this will never happen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eLq5bed09bkNVjUfknlbSil2cfR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15171'),
