  ('729953684763589635', 'Charlotte''s Web 2: Wilbur''s Great Adventure', 2003, 'Adventure, Animation, Drama, Family', 'Mario Piluso', 'Elana Lesser, Cliff Ruby', 'Julia Duffy, David Berón, Charlie Adler, Amanda Bynes, Maria Bamford, Debi Derryberry, Laraine Newman, Anndi McAfee', 'G', 'Wilbur the pig knows how important friendship is - he learned that from a spider named Charlotte. So when Wilbur meets Cardigan, a lonely lamb, Wilbur immediately makes him his friend.', 'Wilbur the pig knows how important friendship is - he learned that from a spider named Charlotte. So when Wilbur meets Cardigan, a lonely lamb, Wilbur immediately makes him his friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/af0H9v4XUotReBCsLnOptBamVRY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21250'),
  ('44212799498586716', 'Charly', 1968, 'Drama, Romance, Science Fiction', 'Ralph Nelson, Arthur J. Ornitz', 'Stirling Silliphant', 'Cliff Robertson, Claire Bloom, Lilia Skala, Leon Janney, Ruth White, Dick Van Patten, Edward McNally, Barney Martin', 'PG', 'An experiment on a simpleton turns him into a genius. When he discovers what has been done to him he struggles with whether or not what was done to him was right.', 'An experiment on a simpleton turns him into a genius. When he discovers what has been done to him he struggles with whether or not what was done to him was right.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uxGt80D4hxEEwGwdOJ5tdVvjXEC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29146'),
  ('465577431599762897', 'Charm City Kings', 2020, 'Drama', 'Ángel Manuel Soto, Katelin Arizmendi', 'Sherman Payne', 'Jahi Di''Allo Winston, Meek Mill, Teyonah Parris, William Catlett, Kezii Curtis, Donielle T. Hansley Jr., Milan Ray, Chandler DuPont', 'R', 'Mouse desperately wants to join The Midnight Clique, the infamous Baltimore dirt bike riders who rule the summertime streets. When Midnight’s leader, Blax, takes 14-year-old Mouse under his wing, Mouse soon finds himself torn between the straight-and-narrow and a road filled with fast money and violence.', 'Mouse desperately wants to join The Midnight Clique, the infamous Baltimore dirt bike riders who rule the summertime streets. When Midnight’s leader, Blax, takes 14-year-old Mouse under his wing, Mouse soon finds himself torn between the straight-and-narrow and a road filled with fast money and violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8oiMFMarbRpcusASIX4cjVXoZKI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:552532'),
  ('669893114047308131', 'Charm School', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Fernando Sariñana', 'Issa López', 'Martha Higareda, Blanca Guerra, Camila Sodi, María Aura, Alejandra Adame, Ximena Sariñana, Daniel Berlanga, Zaide Silvia Gutiérrez', 'R', 'Defiant 18-year-old Adela León pushes her father and an unbending headmistress to the limit in this delicious comedy.', 'Defiant 18-year-old Adela León pushes her father and an unbending headmistress to the limit in this delicious comedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zdT13HYGZ2uXzNTdQyJCpmZDypa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20223'),
  ('949262432100744760', 'Charming', 2018, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Family, Fantasy, Music, Romance', 'Ross Venokur', 'Ross Venokur', 'Demi Lovato, Wilmer Valderrama, Sia, Nia Vardalos, Ashley French, Avril Lavigne, G.E.M., John Cleese', 'NR', 'Three fairy tale princesses find themselves engaged to the same guy, Prince Charming.', 'Three fairy tale princesses find themselves engaged to the same guy, Prince Charming.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jBkQjdlA1EMD2zSX4WLHDbxs6vX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:354279'),
  ('460780306812600862', 'Charming Christmas', 2015, 'TV Movie, Romance, Drama', 'Craig Pryce, Boris Mojsovski', 'Karen McClellan', 'Julie Benz, David Sutcliffe, Bruce Gray, Catherine McNally, Vanessa Matsui, Ashley Leggat, Paul Hopkins, Jake Epstein', 'G', 'Meredith Rossman has made Rossman''s Department store her entire life, not leaving any time for Christmas or romance. But when she is roped into donning the store''s antique Mrs. Claus outfit to play Mrs. Claus at Rossman''s famous Santaville, her life takes some unexpected turns. Through the help of the suit and the charming store Santa, Nick, Meredith rekindles her love of Christmas, the store, their employees and possibly even begins a new love with Nick.', 'Meredith Rossman has made Rossman''s Department store her entire life, not leaving any time for Christmas or romance. But when she is roped into donning the store''s antique Mrs. Claus outfit to play Mrs. Claus at Rossman''s famous Santaville, her life takes some unexpected turns. Through the help of the suit and the charming store Santa, Nick, Meredith rekindles her love of Christmas, the store, their employees and possibly even begins a new love with Nick.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kDPaywj4BrVRq8p183dBURhYR1J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:363476'),
  ('637058279953636166', 'Charming the Hearts of Men', 2021, 'Drama', 'Gavin Struthers, S.E. DeRose', 'S.E. DeRose', 'Anna Friel, Sean Astin, Kelsey Grammer, Tina Ivlev, Aml Ameen, Hendrix Yancey', null, 'A romantic drama set during the politically charged early 60s where a sophisticated woman returns to her Southern home town and discovers her options are limited yet discrimination is plentiful. With the help of a Congressional ally, she inspires historic legislation which allows opportunities and protections never before afforded to women.', 'A romantic drama set during the politically charged early 60s where a sophisticated woman returns to her Southern home town and discovers her options are limited yet discrimination is plentiful. With the help of a Congressional ally, she inspires historic legislation which allows opportunities and protections never before afforded to women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qnTmcUPBpJzZpbyOfNI9M5YwhXf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:693730'),
  ('498941656266757690', 'Charrito', 1984, 'Comedy, Western', 'Roberto Gómez Bolaños', 'Roberto Gómez Bolaños', 'Roberto Gómez Bolaños, Florinda Meza García, María Antonieta de las Nieves, Rubén Aguirre, Víctor Alcocer, Raúl ''Chato'' Padilla, Horacio Gómez Bolaños, Benito Raúl Ibarra', null, 'Charrito is the villain actor in a movie, which is filmed in a town, that only produces headaches to the director, for being extremely distracted', 'Charrito is the villain actor in a movie, which is filmed in a town, that only produces headaches to the director, for being extremely distracted', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/35Prf7F6hTvhccnhl2BTd84dDgW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:181955'),
  ('776420854275526118', 'Charro!', 1969, 'Action, Drama, Western', 'Charles Marquis Warren, Ellsworth Fredericks, George Templeton', 'Charles Marquis Warren', 'Elvis Presley, Ina Balin, Victor French, Barbara Werle, Solomon Sturges, Lynn Kellogg, James B. Sikking, Paul Brinegar', 'G', 'Vince Hackett''s gang steals a prized victory canon from Mexico and blames the deed on ex-member Jess Wade, who wants to go straight.', 'Vince Hackett''s gang steals a prized victory canon from Mexico and blames the deed on ex-member Jess Wade, who wants to go straight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xNokTbYDZf1FslFqFmPUjjytTjR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18688'),
  ('1070320022517758485', 'Charter', 2020, 'Drama', 'Amanda Kernell, Sophia Olsson, Anette Winblad von Walter', 'Amanda Kernell', 'Ane Dahl Torp, Troy Lundkvist, Tintin Poggats Sarri, Sverrir Gudnason, Eva Melander, Siw Erixon, Johan Bäckström, Caroline Söderström', null, 'After a recent and difficult divorce, Alice hasn''t seen her children in two months as she awaits a custody verdict. When her son calls her in the middle of the night, Alice takes action, abducting the children on an illicit charter trip to the Canary Islands.', 'After a recent and difficult divorce, Alice hasn''t seen her children in two months as she awaits a custody verdict. When her son calls her in the middle of the night, Alice takes action, abducting the children on an illicit charter trip to the Canary Islands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5HmswsvTpHYEXDqEU23mYoSflQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:653580'),
  ('60379134681612690', 'Chartres Series', 1994, null, 'Stan Brakhage', null, null, null, 'A year and a half ago the filmmaker Nick Dorsky, hearing I was going to France, insisted I must see the Chartres Cathedral. I, who had studied picture books of its great stained-glass windows, sculpture and architecture for years, having also read Henry Adams'' great book three times, willingly complied and had an experience of several hours (in the discreet company of French filmmaker Jean-Michele Bouhours) which surely transformed my aesthetics more than any other single experience. Then Marilyn''s sister died; and I, who could not attend the funeral, sat down alone and began painting on film one day, this death in mind ... Chartres in mind. Eight months later the painting was completed on four little films which comprise a suite in homage to Chartres and dedicated to Wendy Jull.', 'A year and a half ago the filmmaker Nick Dorsky, hearing I was going to France, insisted I must see the Chartres Cathedral. I, who had studied picture books of its great stained-glass windows, sculpture and architecture for years, having also read Henry Adams'' great book three times, willingly complied and had an experience of several hours (in the discreet company of French filmmaker Jean-Michele Bouhours) which surely transformed my aesthetics more than any other single experience. Then Marilyn''s sister died; and I, who could not attend the funeral, sat down alone and began painting on film one day, this death in mind ... Chartres in mind. Eight months later the painting was completed on four little films which comprise a suite in homage to Chartres and dedicated to Wendy Jull.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gwLsvRvJJ5521poDE59I1Uw4v94.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:363629'),
  ('1024630188095946466', 'Charulata', 1964, 'Drama, Romance', 'Satyajit Ray, Subrata Mitra, Ramen Chatterjee', 'Satyajit Ray', 'Madhabi Mukherjee, Soumitra Chatterjee, Shailen Mukherjee, Shyamal Ghoshal, Gitali Roy, Subrata Sensharma, Bankim Ghosh, Dilip Bose', null, 'In 1870s India, Charulata is an isolated, artistically inclined woman who sees little of her busy journalist husband, Bhupati. Realizing that his wife is alienated and unhappy, he convinces his cousin, Amal, to spend time with Charulata and nourish her creative impulses. Amal is a fledgling poet himself, and he and Charulata bond over their shared love of art.', 'In 1870s India, Charulata is an isolated, artistically inclined woman who sees little of her busy journalist husband, Bhupati. Realizing that his wife is alienated and unhappy, he convinces his cousin, Amal, to spend time with Charulata and nourish her creative impulses. Amal is a fledgling poet himself, and he and Charulata bond over their shared love of art.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uy1x7AFgcurs9twcEw0p0FOVQnx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35790'),
  ('1109357922616943508', 'Chase', 2011, 'Crime, TV Movie, Action', 'Gilles Mimouni, Jean-Paul Seaulieu', 'Grégory Baranès, Natalie Carter, Gilles Mimouni', 'Isabelle Carré, Nicolas Cazalé, Olivier Sitruk, Reda Kateb, Laurent Bateau, Karim Leklou', null, 'The quiet Luis commits a robbery. Two of his childhood friends try to help him get away with it.', 'The quiet Luis commits a robbery. Two of his childhood friends try to help him get away with it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zxpJhU4J9RlwcR6doOUtHlUK1aU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111757'),
