  ('1042012567281086179', 'Chase Me', 2003, 'Animation, Action, Adventure', 'Curt Geda', 'Paul Dini, Alan Burnett', null, null, 'While escaping a dull party, Bruce Wayne finds Catwoman robbing a vault and gives her the chase of her life as Batman. Really great coupled with the Mystery of the Batwoman movie.', 'While escaping a dull party, Bruce Wayne finds Catwoman robbing a vault and gives her the chase of her life as Batman. Really great coupled with the Mystery of the Batwoman movie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1FPibtTI3OpFVwQxnKvvubgh608.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106583'),
  ('243145678517399487', 'Chasers', 1994, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Dennis Hopper, Ueli Steiger, Richard Coad', 'John Rice, Joe Batteer, Dan Gilroy', 'Tom Berenger, William McNamara, Erika Eleniak, Crispin Glover, Matthew Glave, Grand L. Bush, Dean Stockwell, Bitty Schram', 'R', 'Military men Rock Reilly and Eddie Devane are tasked with taking a prisoner, blonde bombshell Toni Johnson, on what becomes an unforgettable road trip. Toni, an enlistee who''s in trouble for deserting her unit, soon proves that she''s craftier than most inmates.', 'Military men Rock Reilly and Eddie Devane are tasked with taking a prisoner, blonde bombshell Toni Johnson, on what becomes an unforgettable road trip. Toni, an enlistee who''s in trouble for deserting her unit, soon proves that she''s craftier than most inmates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mEG6fTyTjsA1vzTTqCXsiJzjdQ5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24405'),
  ('1099542531014502418', 'Chashme Baddoor', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'David Dhawan', 'Sajid Samji, Farhad Samji', 'Ali Zafar, Taapsee Pannu, Siddharth, Divyendu Sharma, Rishi Kapoor, Anupam Kher, Bharati Achrekar, Ayaz Khan', null, 'Seema rejects six marriage proposals set by her father and leaves for Goa. After Jai and Omi fail to impress her, they come up with a cruel plan when they realise that their friend Sid is dating her.', 'Seema rejects six marriage proposals set by her father and leaves for Goa. After Jai and Omi fail to impress her, they come up with a cruel plan when they realise that their friend Sid is dating her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aqTXvi4Jp1BuhJhQ9fyxzgvizFM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:180853'),
  ('1129819569896098621', 'Chashme Buddoor', 1981, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Sai Paranjape, Virendra Saini', 'Sai Paranjape', 'Farooq Shaikh, Deepti Naval, Saeed Jaffrey, Rakesh Bedi, Leela Mishra, Ravi Baswani, Vinod Doshi, Ranjan Grewal', null, 'Womanizing slackers Omi and Jai attempt to woo the new girl in the neighborhood, and fail - miserably. Their third roommate - shy, and a bookworm - succeeds, much to their chagrin. The two scheme up comical ideas to split the two lovebirds, so that their secrets and humiliation are not revealed.', 'Womanizing slackers Omi and Jai attempt to woo the new girl in the neighborhood, and fail - miserably. Their third roommate - shy, and a bookworm - succeeds, much to their chagrin. The two scheme up comical ideas to split the two lovebirds, so that their secrets and humiliation are not revealed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6J69y5YMvzPp3g1nHptG1bST8lq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60392'),
  ('731265597306590190', 'Chasing', 2016, 'Action, Comedy', 'Jeong Hee-jun, Oh In-chun', 'Oh In-chun', 'Kim Seung-woo, Kim Jung-tae, Han Sang-hyuk, Shin Kang-Woo, Kim Min-gue, Moon Yong-seok, Choi Ho-joong, Seo Beom-sik', null, 'Seung-ju, robbed clean of his wallet and phone by four high schoolers! Jung-taek, swept into the chase only to have his gun snatched away by the same teens. An erratic pursuit by two men, stripped of their precious possessions and completely run down and four teenagers, running the grown-ups through a proper drill right in the middle of the night. The furious chase has begun.', 'Seung-ju, robbed clean of his wallet and phone by four high schoolers! Jung-taek, swept into the chase only to have his gun snatched away by the same teens. An erratic pursuit by two men, stripped of their precious possessions and completely run down and four teenagers, running the grown-ups through a proper drill right in the middle of the night. The furious chase has begun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vN59bXO0vdA232WDps9n3h82Mpo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:378084'),
  ('750563760114791014', 'Chasing Amy', 1997, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'David Klein, Kevin Smith, John M. Tyson', 'Kevin Smith', 'Ben Affleck, Joey Lauren Adams, Jason Lee, King Mustafa Obafemi, Jason Mewes, Kevin Smith, Ethan Suplee, Scott Mosier', 'R', 'Holden and Banky are comic book artists. Everything is going good for them until they meet Alyssa, also a comic book artist. Holden falls for her, but his hopes are crushed when he finds out she''s a lesbian.', 'Holden and Banky are comic book artists. Everything is going good for them until they meet Alyssa, also a comic book artist. Holden falls for her, but his hopes are crushed when he finds out she''s a lesbian.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tqydORBcNlQxy3ijgSpPurgDHM2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2255'),
  ('407922362658979582', 'Chasing Butterflies', 1992, 'Drama', 'Otar Iosseliani, William Lubtchansky', 'Otar Iosseliani', 'Narda Blanchet, Pierette Pompom Bailhache, Aleksandr Cherkasov, Thamara Tarassachvili, Alexandra Liebermann, Lilia Ollivier, Emmanuel de Chauvigny, Sacha Piatigorsky', null, 'Two old ladies live in a French chateau. When one of them dies, her sister, who lives in Moscow, inherits the property, which soon ends up in the hands of Japanese businessmen.', 'Two old ladies live in a French chateau. When one of them dies, her sister, who lives in Moscow, inherits the property, which soon ends up in the hands of Japanese businessmen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sFKxVj4EfNMwRzYah02CmpVyAS9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69287'),
  ('77348560750087769', 'Chasing Christmas', 2005, 'Comedy, Family, TV Movie', 'Ron Oliver', 'Todd Berger', 'Tom Arnold, Andrea Roth, Leslie Jordan, Brittney Wilson, Sarah-Jane Redmond, Robert Clarke, Devyn Dalton', 'PG', 'Jack Cameron is a single dad that decides not to observe Christmas because his wife left him around that time. The ghosts of Christmas past and present try and get Jack to relent, but they screw up their jobs and send themselves on a wild ride through time showing up at various times in Jack''s past. As they try and rectify the timeline and get back to the real present, some things are not what they used to be.', 'Jack Cameron is a single dad that decides not to observe Christmas because his wife left him around that time. The ghosts of Christmas past and present try and get Jack to relent, but they screw up their jobs and send themselves on a wild ride through time showing up at various times in Jack''s past. As they try and rectify the timeline and get back to the real present, some things are not what they used to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fXzlspjPJWL6HcQRjzBjpomWSF2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16412'),
  ('86911365595304968', 'Chasing Coral', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Jeff Orlowski, Andrew Ackerman, Jeff Orlowski', 'Davis Coombe, Vickie Curtis, Jeff Orlowski', 'Andrew Ackerman, Pim Bongaerts, Neal Cantin, Phil Dustan, Ruth Gates, Manuel González-Rivero, Ove Hoegh-Guldberg, Joanie Kleypas', null, 'Coral reefs are the nursery for all life in the oceans, a remarkable ecosystem that sustains us. Yet with carbon emissions warming the seas, a phenomenon called “coral bleaching”—a sign of mass coral death—has been accelerating around the world, and the public has no idea of the scale or implication of the catastrophe silently raging underwater.', 'Coral reefs are the nursery for all life in the oceans, a remarkable ecosystem that sustains us. Yet with carbon emissions warming the seas, a phenomenon called “coral bleaching”—a sign of mass coral death—has been accelerating around the world, and the public has no idea of the scale or implication of the catastrophe silently raging underwater.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AvRHRqI4ahmEwscylU10iaNo5RY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:432615'),
  ('595413740775966289', 'Chasing Ghosts', 2005, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Kyle Dean Jackson, Garrett Warren', 'Alan Pao', 'Michael Madsen, Corey Large, Shannyn Sossamon, Meat Loaf, Gary Busey, Sean Whalen, Lochlyn Munro, Tom Wright', null, 'A serial killer targeting the city''s mobsters taunts police with clues and photos left behind at the crime scenes. A veteran cop takes on a rookie partner hoping to crack one last case before retiring. As the web of deception and lies unravels, the truth slowly begins to reveal itself.', 'A serial killer targeting the city''s mobsters taunts police with clues and photos left behind at the crime scenes. A veteran cop takes on a rookie partner hoping to crack one last case before retiring. As the web of deception and lies unravels, the truth slowly begins to reveal itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9GB0DATfGe3ZGjyR0te9ybNPvgF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41726'),
  ('190062843351506894', 'Chasing Ghosts: Beyond the Arcade', 2007, 'Documentary', 'Lincoln Ruchti, Lisa Wiegand', null, 'Billy Mitchell, Walter Day, Steve Sanders, Todd Rogers, Ben Gold, Darren Olsen, Ronald Bailey, Sam Blackburn', 'R', '1982''s Video Game World Champions share their philosophies on joysticks, groupies and life.', '1982''s Video Game World Champions share their philosophies on joysticks, groupies and life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rlmENYfSs1kXOcBYg9BFea7qT24.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15725'),
  ('112341554716500878', 'Chasing Happiness', 2019, 'Documentary, Music', 'John Lloyd Taylor', null, 'Nick Jonas, Joe Jonas, Kevin Jonas, Priyanka Chopra Jonas, Sophie Turner, Danielle Jonas, Frankie Jonas, Miley Cyrus', null, 'From humble roots as pastor''s sons in New Jersey, through their meteoric rise to fame, the Jonas Brothers'' bond was unshakeable-until a surprising and painful breakup led Joe, Kevin and Nick down very different paths. With deeply personal interviews, previously unreleased footage and exclusive music, this is the Jonas Brothers as never seen before.', 'From humble roots as pastor''s sons in New Jersey, through their meteoric rise to fame, the Jonas Brothers'' bond was unshakeable-until a surprising and painful breakup led Joe, Kevin and Nick down very different paths. With deeply personal interviews, previously unreleased footage and exclusive music, this is the Jonas Brothers as never seen before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qbJx8lLgGxMeBbieyYGHKcVWpN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:601169'),
  ('678503797687984548', 'Chasing Ice', 2012, 'Documentary', 'Jeff Orlowski, Jeff Orlowski', 'Mark Monroe', 'James Balog, Svavar Jonatansson, Adam LeWinter, Louie Psihoyos, Kitty Boone, Sylvia Earle, Dennis Dimick, Jason Box', 'PG-13', 'When National Geographic photographer James Balog asked, “How can one take a picture of climate change?” his attention was immediately drawn to ice. Soon he was asked to do a cover story on glaciers that became the most popular and well-read piece in the magazine during the last five years. But for Balog, that story marked the beginning of a much larger and longer-term project that would reach epic proportions.', 'When National Geographic photographer James Balog asked, “How can one take a picture of climate change?” his attention was immediately drawn to ice. Soon he was asked to do a cover story on glaciers that became the most popular and well-read piece in the magazine during the last five years. But for Balog, that story marked the beginning of a much larger and longer-term project that would reach epic proportions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q4T6Wqh7ZXzf30odR2Yo2dLWdZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84185'),
  ('898325681841688062', 'Chasing Johnny', 2024, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Baptiste Debraux, Fabien Benzaquen, Maud Mathery', 'Baptiste Debraux, Armel Gourvennec', 'Bastien Bouillon, Léa Drucker, Pierre Lottin, Marion Barbeau, Théo Navarro-Mussy, Anne Consigny, Philippe Frécon, Wim Willaert', null, 'Johnny, a local activist, is wanted by the police after a robbery gone wrong. Paul, his childhood friend, comes back home after 15 years to find him before the police. Investigator Anna Radoszewski is also on Johnny’s trail. Thus begins a search in which memo- ries and secrets resurface. In a social context that shakes the town, everybody is looking for Johnny, who soon becomes the symbol of a revolt.', 'Johnny, a local activist, is wanted by the police after a robbery gone wrong. Paul, his childhood friend, comes back home after 15 years to find him before the police. Investigator Anna Radoszewski is also on Johnny’s trail. Thus begins a search in which memo- ries and secrets resurface. In a social context that shakes the town, everybody is looking for Johnny, who soon becomes the symbol of a revolt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mKzNHXCW7JCyUyOEPF2w7qlgBGv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1001019'),
  ('335087968354198826', 'Chasing Liberty', 2004, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Henry Forsyth, Mark Raggett, Olivia Lloyd', null, 'Mandy Moore, Matthew Goode, Stark Sands, Caroline Goodall, Jeremy Piven, Annabella Sciorra, Briony Glassco, Sam Ellis', 'PG-13', 'The President''s daughter, unable to experience life like a normal 18 year-old, escapes from her entourage of Secret Service agents while traveling in Europe. She falls in love with a handsome British stranger, who also happens to be working undercover for her father.', 'The President''s daughter, unable to experience life like a normal 18 year-old, escapes from her entourage of Secret Service agents while traveling in Europe. She falls in love with a handsome British stranger, who also happens to be working undercover for her father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aGh5zpJSuxcx4lzFFbZ2QyY8wQP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14844'),
  ('38490712728899853', 'Chasing Love Time Machine', 2018, 'Drama, Romance', null, null, 'Pan Chunchun', null, 'Young student finds a time machine and ventures to the past to win a girl before she meets her husband', 'Young student finds a time machine and ventures to the past to win a girl before she meets her husband', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eogWnCOhRVl9qxEjH8VLycfJGOb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:836988'),
  ('134420505814252416', 'Chasing Mavericks', 2012, 'Drama', 'Curtis Hanson, Michael Apted, Bill Pope', 'Kario Salem', 'Gerard Butler, Jonny Weston, Elisabeth Shue, Abigail Spencer, Leven Rambin, Peter Mel, Zach Wormhoudt, Devin Crittenden', 'PG', 'Surfer Jay Moriarity sets out to ride the Northern California break known as Mavericks.', 'Surfer Jay Moriarity sets out to ride the Northern California break known as Mavericks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7wxJmFqTMcdE05sfWedB6458US1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82684'),
  ('878959208181647239', 'Chasing Papi', 2003, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Linda Mendoza, Jeff Bilger, Jackie C. Lee', 'Steve Antin, Elizabeth Sarnoff, Laura Angelica Simon', 'Roselyn Sánchez, Sofía Vergara, Jaci Velasquez, Eduardo Verástegui, Lisa Vidal, Freddy Rodríguez, María Conchita Alonso, D.L. Hughley', 'PG', 'Playboy Thomas Fuentes has so far been able to skate by in life on good looks and charm alone. But when his duplicitous relationships with three women -- impassioned waitress Cici, meticulous lawyer Lorena and bored socialite Patricia -- spiral out of control, he suffers a mental breakdown. His doctor recommends that he choose just one girlfriend -- but can he choose in time before they discover his deception?', 'Playboy Thomas Fuentes has so far been able to skate by in life on good looks and charm alone. But when his duplicitous relationships with three women -- impassioned waitress Cici, meticulous lawyer Lorena and bored socialite Patricia -- spiral out of control, he suffers a mental breakdown. His doctor recommends that he choose just one girlfriend -- but can he choose in time before they discover his deception?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mdn6NwGZChgaSuWHQzYKYO1KBL6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24621'),
  ('1053052560949241582', 'Chasing Sleep', 2001, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Michael Walker, Jim Denault, Patrick D. Gibbons', 'Michael Walker', 'Jeff Daniels, Molly Price, Gil Bellows, Emily Bergl, Ben Shenkman, Julian McMahon, Zach Grenier, Guy Sanville', 'R', 'A college professor wakes up to find his wife has not returned home, then struggles to understand her disappearance.', 'A college professor wakes up to find his wife has not returned home, then struggles to understand her disappearance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5pC2f3ewFmDV9KA6XbZLPx6tPb8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32166'),
  ('148222919484276506', 'Chasing Summer', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Josephine Decker, Eric Branco, Amina Zadeh, Toby Burge, Donna Davenport', 'Iliza Shlesinger', 'Garrett Wareing, Lola Tung, Cassidy Freeman, Tom Welling, Megan Mullally', null, 'After losing both her job and boyfriend, Jamie retreats to her small Texas hometown where friends and flings from a fateful high school summer turn her life upside down.', 'After losing both her job and boyfriend, Jamie retreats to her small Texas hometown where friends and flings from a fateful high school summer turn her life upside down.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fs7rxXwX5rnax0c3tM7zczfAdwjV.jpg', 'plex:movie:chasing-summer-2026'),
  ('409435764721354359', 'Chasing the Dragon', 2017, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Aman Chang Man, Andrew Yan Hua, Jason Kwan', 'Wong Jing, Jason Kwan', 'Donnie Yen, Andy Lau, Kent Cheng Jak-Si, Wilfred Lau Ho-Lung, Felix Wong Yat-Wah, Philip Keung Ho-Man, Michelle Hu, Xu Dongdong', null, 'An illegal immigrant from Mainland China sneaks into the corrupt British-colonized Hong Kong in 1963, transforming himself into a ruthless drug lord.', 'An illegal immigrant from Mainland China sneaks into the corrupt British-colonized Hong Kong in 1963, transforming himself into a ruthless drug lord.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Lc0XGNZmsFe3uA1UMqhlBiJSY4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:449927'),
  ('884100722855864820', 'Chasing the Dragon II: Wild Wild Bunch', 2019, 'Crime, Action, Thriller', 'Wong Jing, Jason Kwan, Jimmy Kwok Chun-Ming', 'Wong Jing, Lui Koon-Nam', 'Tony Leung Ka-fai, Louis Koo, Gordon Lam Ka-Tung, Sabrina Qiu, Simon Yam, Ye Xiangming, Phat Chan, Willie Wai Ga-Hung', null, 'Based on real-life crimes that terrorized Hong Kong in the 1990s, Logan (Tony Leung Ka-Fai) is the head of leading a notorious human trafficking gang, abducting the children of Hong Kong''s elite. Police forces decide to send in Sky (Louis Koo), a Hong Kong undercover agent whose mission is to infiltrate and save the hostages, all while bringing the gang and their leader to justice.', 'Based on real-life crimes that terrorized Hong Kong in the 1990s, Logan (Tony Leung Ka-Fai) is the head of leading a notorious human trafficking gang, abducting the children of Hong Kong''s elite. Police forces decide to send in Sky (Louis Koo), a Hong Kong undercover agent whose mission is to infiltrate and save the hostages, all while bringing the gang and their leader to justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/orDhf1o1bBFWcjuKhI4x0RG1oix.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:602661'),
  ('500523258870795011', 'Chasing the Kidneystone', 1996, 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Vibeke Idsøe, Kjell Vassdal', 'Vibeke Idsøe', 'Jenny Skavlan, Torbjörn T. Jensen, Benjamin Helstad, Terje Strømdahl, Harald Eia, Sigve Bøe, Kjersti Holmen, Lage Fosheim', null, 'Once 8 year old Simon gets shrunk down to a microscopic level by a talking teddy bear, he ventures into the body of his ailing grandfather in search of the source of his illness.', 'Once 8 year old Simon gets shrunk down to a microscopic level by a talking teddy bear, he ventures into the body of his ailing grandfather in search of the source of his illness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wzye7VXUaBejIsOzGJfw0wCYF1P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56726'),
  ('715266726787991432', 'Chasing the Line', 2021, 'Drama, History', 'Andreas Schmied, Andreas Thalhammer', 'Elisabeth Schmied, Andreas Schmied', 'Julian Waldner, Valerie Huber, Wiltrud Schreiner, Fabian Schiffkorn, Harry Lampl, Noah L. Perktold, Wolfgang Oliver, Doris Dexl', null, 'Barely 22, Franz Klammer finds himself at the “eye of the storm” when he shows up for the men’s downhill competition at the 1976 Winter Olympic Games. Since the previous season the charismatic newcomer has won virtually every race. The pressure from the media and the public and the hopes of an entire nation are off the scales. His sponsor is pushing him to switch equipment right before the competition, the weather is getting steadily worse, and his toughest rivals know that Franz has to do better than just a flawless run. Franz senses that he has to find his own path and that only the love of his life can give him the strength to do that. This is the most important race of his life in which he skis a line that nobody even thought was possible and which will make him to this day a legend in the sport of downhill skiing.', 'Barely 22, Franz Klammer finds himself at the “eye of the storm” when he shows up for the men’s downhill competition at the 1976 Winter Olympic Games. Since the previous season the charismatic newcomer has won virtually every race. The pressure from the media and the public and the hopes of an entire nation are off the scales. His sponsor is pushing him to switch equipment right before the competition, the weather is getting steadily worse, and his toughest rivals know that Franz has to do better than just a flawless run. Franz senses that he has to find his own path and that only the love of his life can give him the strength to do that. This is the most important race of his life in which he skis a line that nobody even thought was possible and which will make him to this day a legend in the sport of downhill skiing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hUVInPmUhzAePhn6jIeMbD1pfmL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:860712'),
  ('631895713029768709', 'Chasing the Wind', 2025, 'Romance', 'Engin Erden, Muratcan Gökçe', 'Ceylan Naz Baycan', 'Hande Erçel, Barış Arduç, Gözde Mutluer, Tuğrul Tülek, Şebnem Sönmez, Barış Aytaç, Olimpia Ahenk, Ahmet Saraçoğlu', 'R', 'A focused city worker and a laid-back surfer - both heirs to the same company - find they have plenty in common when they join forces in the boardroom.', 'A focused city worker and a laid-back surfer - both heirs to the same company - find they have plenty in common when they join forces in the boardroom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pg6sFi0pv8cPelkJGLZqmUxh24F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1318917'),
  ('12623194033277353', 'Chasing Trane', 2017, 'Documentary, Music', 'John Scheinfeld, Stan Taylor', 'John Scheinfeld', 'Denzel Washington, Antonia Andrews, Bill Clinton, Michelle Coltrane, Oran Coltrane, Ravi Coltrane, Common, John Densmore', null, 'An account of the life of the brilliant jazz musician John Coltrane (1926-67), a gifted saxophonist, an extraordinarily talented thinker whose original, avant-garde work has impacted and influenced people all over the world. A story about music''s ability to entertain, inspire and transform.', 'An account of the life of the brilliant jazz musician John Coltrane (1926-67), a gifted saxophonist, an extraordinarily talented thinker whose original, avant-garde work has impacted and influenced people all over the world. A story about music''s ability to entertain, inspire and transform.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pb09v5koCU7GrxCJNfRnliPRIKD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:411012'),
  ('500740777940062381', 'Chasing Two Hares', 1961, 'Comedy', 'Vadym Illienko, Viktor Ivanov, Rostislav Maksimtsov', 'Viktor Ivanov', 'Oleg Borisov, Margarita Krinitsyna, Mykola Yakovchenko, Anna Kushnirenko, Nonna Koperzhynska, Nataliia Naum, Anatolii Yurchenko, Konstantin Ershov', null, 'Based on the Ukrainian vaudeville by Mykhailo Starytskyi, the famous Ukrainian writer. The leading character, Svyryd Petrovych Holokhvosty has his own barbershop in town and a reputation of a dandy. Once, after losing everything he had at cards, he decides to remedy his financial situation by a profitable marriage. A rich but ugly girl named Pronia Sirko falls for the illustrious suitor’s courtship...', 'Based on the Ukrainian vaudeville by Mykhailo Starytskyi, the famous Ukrainian writer. The leading character, Svyryd Petrovych Holokhvosty has his own barbershop in town and a reputation of a dandy. Once, after losing everything he had at cards, he decides to remedy his financial situation by a profitable marriage. A rich but ugly girl named Pronia Sirko falls for the illustrious suitor’s courtship...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9M5yTqfjMw3YWkkY7cyVwi8lxHd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85901'),
  ('46879714178961533', 'Chasing Waterfalls', 2021, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Christie Will Wolf, Stirling Bancroft', 'Jason Bourque, Tamara Junkin, Christie Will Wolf', 'Cindy Busby, Christopher Russell, Cassidy Nugent, Miranda Frigon, Julian LeBlanc, Akiz Aguma, Rhonda Dent, Hamza Fouad', 'G', 'Photographer Amy travels to a remote lodge to find mythical waterfalls and falls for handsome guide, Mark. They adventure to find the mystic waterfall and discover their true feelings.', 'Photographer Amy travels to a remote lodge to find mythical waterfalls and falls for handsome guide, Mark. They adventure to find the mystic waterfall and discover their true feelings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eJxHoF3xqXIqamM0j9WlKxGKZ6a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:793430'),
  ('63207072798626790', 'Chasse-Galerie : La Légende', 2016, 'Thriller, Fantasy', 'Jean-Philippe Duval, Mario Janelle', 'Guillaume Vigneault', 'Francis Ducharme, Caroline Dhavernas, François Papineau, Samian, Fabien Cloutier, Vincent-Guillaume Otis, Hubert Proulx, Gabriel Forest', null, 'In 1863, a group of snow-bound travelers invokes the devil, who gives them a flying canoe for them to go home. When one of them finds his wife about to die in labor, he makes a pact with the devil to save her and his newborn daughter Liza. He then cheats the devil of his prize by sacrificing himself. 25 years later, Liza wants to marry her beloved Jos, who has to go away to a remote logging camp to earn money to save his farm, but the devil is determined to ruin her happiness.', 'In 1863, a group of snow-bound travelers invokes the devil, who gives them a flying canoe for them to go home. When one of them finds his wife about to die in labor, he makes a pact with the devil to save her and his newborn daughter Liza. He then cheats the devil of his prize by sacrificing himself. 25 years later, Liza wants to marry her beloved Jos, who has to go away to a remote logging camp to earn money to save his farm, but the devil is determined to ruin her happiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iTjbqndDw0fgRzXaXY1mtj5LTmh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:384353'),
  ('456488022463351659', 'Chaste and Pure', 1981, 'Comedy', 'Salvatore Samperi, Alberto Spagnoli', 'Ottavio Jemma, Bruno Di Geronimo', 'Laura Antonelli, Fernando Rey, Massimo Ranieri, Christian De Sica, Enzo Cannavale, Riccardo Billi, Sergio Di Pinto, Valeria Fabrizi', null, 'Antonio is married to a very wealthy woman but the sole heir of the family fortune is his daughter. He induce his dying wife to swear in the daughter of remaining "chaste and pure" ( so that she cannot marry ) until his own death.', 'Antonio is married to a very wealthy woman but the sole heir of the family fortune is his daughter. He induce his dying wife to swear in the daughter of remaining "chaste and pure" ( so that she cannot marry ) until his own death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9m5Mp0uQ6TeYWIa84crddg9WdzL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:292592'),
  ('748491509093545292', 'Chasuke''s Journey', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Daisuke Soma, SABU, Jun Shiozaki', 'SABU', 'Kenichi Matsuyama, Ito Ohno, Yūsuke Iseya, Hiromasa Taguchi, Tina Tamashiro, Ren Osugi, Susumu Terajima, Shintaro Yamada', null, 'Things are hectic in heaven. Dozens of scribes sit before a long scroll incessantly scribbling away. They are composing the biographies of earth-dwellers. What is invented by the men in heaven is lived out below. And their employer, God, is increasingly vehement in demanding avant-garde ideas. Take, for example, the beautiful Yuri, a girl who dies in a car crash. Some of the heavenly scribes find this very dull and send former gangster Chas, who has become a heavenly tea-boy, back down to earth with instructions to save Yuri no matter what. And so Chas ends up in Okinawa, gets to know the earth-dwellers, interferes in their fates, becomes celebrated as ''Mr Angel'' and is hounded by brutal enemies. His falling in love with Yuri is of course a foregone conclusion. But no one could anticipate what happens next. Not even God himself', 'Things are hectic in heaven. Dozens of scribes sit before a long scroll incessantly scribbling away. They are composing the biographies of earth-dwellers. What is invented by the men in heaven is lived out below. And their employer, God, is increasingly vehement in demanding avant-garde ideas. Take, for example, the beautiful Yuri, a girl who dies in a car crash. Some of the heavenly scribes find this very dull and send former gangster Chas, who has become a heavenly tea-boy, back down to earth with instructions to save Yuri no matter what. And so Chas ends up in Okinawa, gets to know the earth-dwellers, interferes in their fates, becomes celebrated as ''Mr Angel'' and is hounded by brutal enemies. His falling in love with Yuri is of course a foregone conclusion. But no one could anticipate what happens next. Not even God himself', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z2cSwPEt4VUrEdhzFTWBrvkNemK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:319996'),
  ('486096027000866988', 'Chateau Christmas', 2020, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Ron Stannett, Michael Robison', null, 'Merritt Patterson, Luke Macfarlane, Jesse Hutch, Julia Benson, Jessica Steen, Alix West Lefler, Darien Martin, Hrothgar Mathews', null, 'Margot, a world-renowned pianist, returns to Chateau Newhaus to spend the holidays with her family and is reunited with an ex who helps her rediscover her passion for music.', 'Margot, a world-renowned pianist, returns to Chateau Newhaus to spend the holidays with her family and is reunited with an ex who helps her rediscover her passion for music.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ZgaL0HewMSMlvV6FHXG7VwtTMe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:737779'),
  ('826798313767310279', 'Chatô, The King of Brazil', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy, History', 'Guilherme Fontes, José Roberto Eliezer', 'Guilherme Fontes, Matthew Robbins, João Emanuel Carneiro', 'Marco Ricca, Andréa Beltrão, Leandra Leal, Letícia Sabatella, Paulo Betti, Gabriel Braga Nunes, Zezé Polessa, Eliane Giardini', null, 'The true story of Assis Chateaubriand, the first magnate of communications in Brazil. Due to his influence during the late 1930s up to the early 1960s, he has come to be called ''the Brazilian Citizen Kane''.', 'The true story of Assis Chateaubriand, the first magnate of communications in Brazil. Due to his influence during the late 1930s up to the early 1960s, he has come to be called ''the Brazilian Citizen Kane''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/egVhM16GVuWLovjMGB3iTNBNQZT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:368103'),
  ('158882968347315248', 'Chato''s Land', 1972, 'Western', 'Michael Winner, Antonio Tarruella, Peter Price', 'Gerald Wilson', 'Charles Bronson, Jack Palance, James Whitmore, Simon Oakland, Ralph Waite, Richard Jordan, Victor French, Sonia Rangan', 'PG', 'In 1870s New Mexico, a half-breed kills a bigoted sheriff in self-defense but the posse that eventually hunts him finds itself in dangerous territory.', 'In 1870s New Mexico, a half-breed kills a bigoted sheriff in self-defense but the posse that eventually hunts him finds itself in dangerous territory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hkPgmx39U5rWjyFMcYa3btZnh76.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26119'),
  ('559712594846646387', 'Chatrapathi', 2005, 'Drama, Action', 'K.K. Senthil Kumar, S. S. Rajamouli', 'S. S. Rajamouli', 'Prabhas, Bhanupriya, Shafi, Pradeep Ram Singh Rawat, Shriya Saran, Chatrapathi Sekhar, Kamal Kamaraju, Ajay', null, 'Sivaji and his family are uprooted from their community in Sri Lanka and wind up as bonded labourers in Vishakhapatnam. Like his legendary namesake, he rises up to become the saviour of the oppressed.', 'Sivaji and his family are uprooted from their community in Sri Lanka and wind up as bonded labourers in Vishakhapatnam. Like his legendary namesake, he rises up to become the saviour of the oppressed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xY7vrUDFOyuQPflMiJrMbAm5xB5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79210'),
  ('907115832293698599', 'Chatroom', 2010, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Hideo Nakata, Christian Rigg, Marco Ciglia', 'Enda Walsh', 'Aaron Taylor-Johnson, Imogen Poots, Matthew Beard, Hannah Murray, Tuppence Middleton, Daniel Kaluuya, Megan Dodds, Michelle Fairley', null, 'When strangers Jim, Eva, Emily and Mo meet William online in his new ''Chelsea Teens!'' chatroom, they''re completely seduced by his fast-talking, charismatic character. But beneath the surface lies a much darker truth. William is a dangerous loner, channeling all his energies into cyberspace. He''s become an analyser, a calculating manipulator who finds it almost impossible to interact normally with others in the real world, instead turning his hand to manipulating people online.', 'When strangers Jim, Eva, Emily and Mo meet William online in his new ''Chelsea Teens!'' chatroom, they''re completely seduced by his fast-talking, charismatic character. But beneath the surface lies a much darker truth. William is a dangerous loner, channeling all his energies into cyberspace. He''s become an analyser, a calculating manipulator who finds it almost impossible to interact normally with others in the real world, instead turning his hand to manipulating people online.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/71wg5xa3ASAdM3PCLNrDlqD9sTl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48946'),
