  ('555491191825563016', 'Chaurangi', 2026, 'Family, Drama', 'Vinod Parmar, Payal Prajapati', 'Vinod Parmar, Asif Ajmeri', 'Deeksha Joshi, Sohni Bhatt, Sonali Lele Desai, Nijal Modi, Makrand Shukla', null, 'A young girl, confused by the relationships surrounding her, embarks on a journey of discovery through life''s varied experiences and perspectives, seeking understanding through deep reflection until clarity finally emerges.', 'A young girl, confused by the relationships surrounding her, embarks on a journey of discovery through life''s varied experiences and perspectives, seeking understanding through deep reflection until clarity finally emerges.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BODFkOWNkYjgtNmRmZC00Y2ZiLWIwYzEtMWQzYmYzNzBkNWQ5XkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:chaurangi'),
  ('148790212655199224', 'Chavela', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Catherine Gund, Daresha Kyi', null, 'Chavela Vargas, Pedro Almodóvar, Miguel Bosé, Martirio, Laura García Lorca, Eugenia León, Jesusa Rodríguez, Tania Libertad', null, 'Inspired by an exclusive interview and performance footage of Chavela Vargas shot in 1991 and guided by her unique voice, the film weaves an arresting portrait of a woman who dared to dress, speak, sing, and dream her unique life into being.', 'Inspired by an exclusive interview and performance footage of Chavela Vargas shot in 1991 and guided by her unique voice, the film weaves an arresting portrait of a woman who dared to dress, speak, sing, and dream her unique life into being.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ClkBtUY6Kg6Bc2QrAgWEqBIxrB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:441188'),
  ('1005817920810172707', 'Chaw', 2009, 'Horror, Comedy, Thriller, Action, Adventure', 'Shin Jung-won, Barry Stone, Lee Hwan-hee', 'Kim Yong-cheol, Shin Jung-won', 'Uhm Tae-woong, Jung Yu-mi, Jang Hang-seon, Yoon Je-moon, Park Hyuk-kwon, Park Chang-Ik, Go Seo-hee, Park Hye-jin', null, 'A black comedy about the events that are set into motion in a town after a man-eating boar goes on a rampage.', 'A black comedy about the events that are set into motion in a town after a man-eating boar goes on a rampage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ya1y9xZ0RVyWyXYxougUeBO6vBd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59450'),
  ('576131129530957404', 'Che dottoressa ragazzi!', 1976, 'Comedy', 'Gianfranco Baldanello, Franco Villa', 'Odoardo Fiory, Giuseppe Maggio', 'Femi Benussi, Lucio Como, Maria Pia Conte, Vincenzo De Toma, Mariangela Giordano, Francesco Parisi', null, 'A small Italian village eagerly awaits the long-overdue arrival of a doctor. Everyone expects a male, so when the sexy female doctor Sigrun S. steps out of the bus, it quickly leads to a series of slapstick events.', 'A small Italian village eagerly awaits the long-overdue arrival of a doctor. Everyone expects a male, so when the sexy female doctor Sigrun S. steps out of the bus, it quickly leads to a series of slapstick events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dVyMV8L9bHPLSbTXMArDZAu4xf9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:354278'),
  ('532608018727169574', 'Che: Part One', 2008, 'Drama, History, War', 'Steven Soderbergh, Steven Soderbergh, Lizzie Cuello Gebetsberger', 'Peter Buchman', 'Benicio del Toro, Demián Bichir, Santiago Cabrera, Vladimir Cruz, Alfredo de Quesada, Jsu Garcia, Kahlil Méndez, Elvira Mínguez', 'NR', 'Ernesto Guevara, known as ''Che'', leads a group of Cuban exiles under Fidel Castro in a revolution to overthrow Fulgencio Batista, the dictator of Cuba.', 'Ernesto Guevara, known as ''Che'', leads a group of Cuban exiles under Fidel Castro in a revolution to overthrow Fulgencio Batista, the dictator of Cuba.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ndxoK8RZF1nfHvZzQ3f2sNlkkzg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8881'),
  ('64269756195087870', 'Che: Part Two', 2008, 'Drama, History, War', 'César Morón, Patricia Alonso, Mamen Moya', 'Terrence Malick, Benjamin A. Van Der Veen, Peter Buchman', 'Benicio del Toro, Carlos Bardem, Demián Bichir, Joaquim de Almeida, Pablo Durán, Eduard Fernández, Marc-André Grondin, Óscar Jaenada', 'NR', 'Seven years after his triumph in Cuba, Che winds up in Bolivia, where he tries to ignite the same revolutionary fires as before.', 'Seven years after his triumph in Cuba, Che winds up in Bolivia, where he tries to ignite the same revolutionary fires as before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fKQwwWXYQNkrZa59VbnfVy2kfoF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8880'),
  ('524851984824565183', 'Che!', 1969, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Richard Fleischer, Charles F. Wheeler', 'Michael Wilson', 'Omar Sharif, Jack Palance, Woody Strode, Cesare Danova, Rodolfo Acosta, BarBara Luna, Frank Silvera, Robert Loggia', 'PG-13', 'Biography of Argentinian revolutionary Ernesto "Che" Guevara, who helped Fidel Castro in his struggle against the corrupt Batista regime, eventually resulting in the overthrow of that government and Castro''s taking over of Cuba. The film covers Guevara''s life from when he first landed in Cuba in 1956 to his death in an ambush by government troops in the mountains of Bolivia in 1967.', 'Biography of Argentinian revolutionary Ernesto "Che" Guevara, who helped Fidel Castro in his struggle against the corrupt Batista regime, eventually resulting in the overthrow of that government and Castro''s taking over of Cuba. The film covers Guevara''s life from when he first landed in Cuba in 1956 to his death in an ambush by government troops in the mountains of Bolivia in 1967.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hNPbpo2ar8RFu4VX5ZpZ681WMnp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61411'),
  ('306759170076653461', 'Cheap Smokes', 2001, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Renos Haralambidis', 'Renos Haralambidis', 'Renos Haralambidis, Anna-Maria Papaharalambous, Kostas Tsakonas, Alkis Panagiotidis, Michalis Iatropoulos, Takis Spyridakis, Vana Pefani, Andreas Natsios', null, 'As the lights flicker on a warm August night, amidst vacant Athens'' stillness, a modern bohemian flirts with a woman he just met at a phone booth, while strolling around the city''s quiet night streets.', 'As the lights flicker on a warm August night, amidst vacant Athens'' stillness, a modern bohemian flirts with a woman he just met at a phone booth, while strolling around the city''s quiet night streets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3hgJukti4Is1aZJVgeYvzG27Cqc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121652'),
  ('190046949338817146', 'Cheap Thrills', 2013, 'Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'E.L. Katz, Sebastian Winterø, Andrew Wheeler', 'David Chirchirillo, Trent Haaga', 'Pat Healy, Ethan Embry, Sara Paxton, David Koechner, Amanda Fuller, Laura Covelli, Elissa Dowling, Todd Farmer', null, 'Recently fired and facing eviction, a new dad has his life turned upside down when he meets a wealthy couple who offer a path to financial security... but at a price.', 'Recently fired and facing eviction, a new dad has his life turned upside down when he meets a wealthy couple who offer a path to financial security... but at a price.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cnGzB8L2Y4oEyAZ4VvLxAwTRA3N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175291'),
  ('395140604413724735', 'Cheaper by the Dozen', 1950, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Walter Lang, Leon Shamroy, Lionel Newman', 'Lamar Trotti', 'Clifton Webb, Jeanne Crain, Myrna Loy, Betty Lynn, Edgar Buchanan, Barbara Bates, Mildred Natwick, Sara Allgood', 'G', '"Cheaper by the Dozen", based on the real-life story of the Gilbreth family, follows them from Providence, Rhode Island, to Montclair, New Jersey, and details the amusing anecdotes found in large families.', '"Cheaper by the Dozen", based on the real-life story of the Gilbreth family, follows them from Providence, Rhode Island, to Montclair, New Jersey, and details the amusing anecdotes found in large families.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sGj9auC0z18y25NObFbvWLt8gtX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33839'),
  ('1063068742059199615', 'Cheaper by the Dozen', 2003, 'Comedy, Family, Drama', 'Shawn Levy, Jonathan Brown', 'Sam Harper, Joel Cohen, Alec Sokolow', 'Steve Martin, Bonnie Hunt, Hilary Duff, Tom Welling, Piper Perabo, Kevin G. Schmidt, Alyson Stoner, Jacob Smith', 'PG', 'The Baker brood moves to Chicago after patriarch Tom gets a job coaching football at Northwestern University, forcing his writer wife, Kate, and the couple''s 12 children to make a major adjustment. The transition works well until work demands pull the parents away from home, leaving the kids bored -- and increasingly mischievous.', 'The Baker brood moves to Chicago after patriarch Tom gets a job coaching football at Northwestern University, forcing his writer wife, Kate, and the couple''s 12 children to make a major adjustment. The transition works well until work demands pull the parents away from home, leaving the kids bored -- and increasingly mischievous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/afclGGoQslTYFTnyW1LRMtJMiBp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11007'),
  ('115780324610356217', 'Cheaper by the Dozen', 2022, 'Family, Comedy', 'Mitchell Amundsen, Katrina Sainz, Daniela Medeiros', 'Jenifer Rice-Genzuk Henry, Kenya Barris', 'Gabrielle Union, Zach Braff, Erika Christensen, Timon Kyle Durrett, Journee Brown, Andre Robinson, Caylee Blosenski, Aryan Simhadri', 'PG', 'This remake of the beloved classic follows the raucous exploits of a blended family of 12, the Bakers, as they navigate a hectic home life while simultaneously managing their family business.', 'This remake of the beloved classic follows the raucous exploits of a blended family of 12, the Bakers, as they navigate a hectic home life while simultaneously managing their family business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qNRsouZh5zmhaE3n4QpLDXzy1gQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:691683'),
  ('257835561484914498', 'Cheaper by the Dozen 2', 2005, 'Comedy, Family, Adventure', 'Adam Shankman, Peter James', 'Sam Harper', 'Steve Martin, Eugene Levy, Bonnie Hunt, Tom Welling, Piper Perabo, Hilary Duff, Carmen Electra, Jaime King', 'PG', 'The Baker family, while on vacation, find themselves in competition with a rival family of eight children.', 'The Baker family, while on vacation, find themselves in competition with a rival family of eight children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wD68dEtcKuboxd8bhbqiTTxn6cX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9641'),
  ('750704781134487247', 'Cheat', 2023, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Connor Smyers, Nick Psinakis, Kevin Ignatius', 'Nick Psinakis, Kevin Ignatius', 'Corin Clay, Mick Thyer, April Clark, Danielle Grotsky, Brady O’Donnell, Kyle Corbin, Paul "Doc" Ignatius, Will Bunk', null, 'On the surface it''s believed to be another urban legend - a supernatural being from the afterlife is violently killing anyone who cheats on their significant other in the small college town of Silvercreek, Pennsylvania. But the town''s unusually high suicide rate is finally convincing both locals and college students that everything is not as it seems. When Maeve - a female college student - sleeps with Charlie, the married man of the host family she is staying with, both sense the deadly curse is closing in on them. Unable to get anyone to believe them, Maeve and Charlie seek out a local history student to help find answers and figure out a way to defend themselves. It all comes undone, however, as several people are horrifically killed by the savage being - one-by-one at a rapid pace. Eventually, Maeve, Charlie and the few survivors band together in an attempt to defeat the monster once and for all.', 'On the surface it''s believed to be another urban legend - a supernatural being from the afterlife is violently killing anyone who cheats on their significant other in the small college town of Silvercreek, Pennsylvania. But the town''s unusually high suicide rate is finally convincing both locals and college students that everything is not as it seems. When Maeve - a female college student - sleeps with Charlie, the married man of the host family she is staying with, both sense the deadly curse is closing in on them. Unable to get anyone to believe them, Maeve and Charlie seek out a local history student to help find answers and figure out a way to defend themselves. It all comes undone, however, as several people are horrifically killed by the savage being - one-by-one at a rapid pace. Eventually, Maeve, Charlie and the few survivors band together in an attempt to defeat the monster once and for all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/46Um9OTHNA390mMxwpSSc2m35Zp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1142414'),
  ('556846327176016387', 'Cheat Sheet', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Khaled Diab, Ahmed Gabr', 'Khaled Diab, Sherine Diab, Ahmed El Zoghby', 'Hesham Maged, Reham Abdelghafour, Mostafa Ghareb, Bassem Samra, Hatim Salah', null, 'A supervisor dies during a high school exam. Students try to hide it and cheat, but no one knows the answers. A rule-obsessed top student, the mayor''s son, a dancer, a 60-year-old woman, and an ex-con collide in absurd schemes and chaos.', 'A supervisor dies during a high school exam. Students try to hide it and cheat, but no one knows the answers. A rule-obsessed top student, the mayor''s son, a dancer, a 60-year-old woman, and an ex-con collide in absurd schemes and chaos.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FnCUKBuJjA4Zv1rP8Hh19MTG2A3g.jpg', 'plex:movie:bershama'),
  ('516488749969974705', 'Cheaters', 1984, 'Drama', 'Barbet Schroeder, Robby Müller, Alain Tasma', 'Pascal Bonitzer, Barbet Schroeder', 'Jacques Dutronc, Bulle Ogier, Kurt Raab, Steve Baës, Virgílio Teixeira, Claus-Dieter Reents, Robby Müller, Carlos Wallenstein', null, 'Swaying between pleasure and despair, Elric throws himself into his pathological passion for the casino. Meeting Suzie could have saved him, but the young woman also sinks into gambling hell. The couple then start getting involved in the fearsome world of professional cheaters.', 'Swaying between pleasure and despair, Elric throws himself into his pathological passion for the casino. Meeting Suzie could have saved him, but the young woman also sinks into gambling hell. The couple then start getting involved in the fearsome world of professional cheaters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Z8BVppFbBuCOeH7LWj2OBPpWAW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63328'),
  ('717337115805668006', 'Cheaters', 2000, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'John Stockwell, David Hennings, Drew Ann Rosenberg', 'John Stockwell', 'Jeff Daniels, Jena Malone, Paul Sorvino, Luke Edwards, Blake Heron, Boyd Banks, Dov Tiefenbach, Dan Warry-Smith', null, 'In the fall of 1994, a teacher at Chicago''s run-down Steinmetz High conspires with the school''s academic decathlon team to cheat on an academic competition.', 'In the fall of 1994, a teacher at Chicago''s run-down Steinmetz High conspires with the school''s academic decathlon team to cheat on an academic competition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bk7685BYE1GZmChtcvg1jAZpa0G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15869'),
  ('483255641635740737', 'Cheating in Chains', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Moacyr Góes, Cris D''amato, Paula Horta', 'Jandira Martini, Marcos Caruso', 'Adriana Esteves, Cássio Gabus Mendes, Aílton Graça, Bianca Byington, Mônica Martelli, Otávio Müller, Márcia Cabrita, Mário Schoemberger', null, 'Olímpia loves her bosses, Inês and Eduardo. Eduardo loves Inês, his wife, who loves Eduardo, her husband. Inês is a friend of Lígia´s, who loves her husband Cristiano. Cristiano loves Lígia, his wife. Vera loves Cláudio, her husband, who doesnt love Vera. Inês thinks that Eduardo is having an affair with Salete, Cristiano thinks that Lígia is having an affair with Ricco, Vera thinks that Cláudio has an affair with Inês and Eduardo thinks that Inês has an affair with Cláudio. The action takes place in a middle class condo where Olímpia, a clumsy maid, carries out the most unbelievable confusions, making everybody believes that love is a game in which one always cheats.', 'Olímpia loves her bosses, Inês and Eduardo. Eduardo loves Inês, his wife, who loves Eduardo, her husband. Inês is a friend of Lígia´s, who loves her husband Cristiano. Cristiano loves Lígia, his wife. Vera loves Cláudio, her husband, who doesnt love Vera. Inês thinks that Eduardo is having an affair with Salete, Cristiano thinks that Lígia is having an affair with Ricco, Vera thinks that Cláudio has an affair with Inês and Eduardo thinks that Inês has an affair with Cláudio. The action takes place in a middle class condo where Olímpia, a clumsy maid, carries out the most unbelievable confusions, making everybody believes that love is a game in which one always cheats.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dq34y6qLCtt8VjhOh0tpsWrOCNN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71196'),
  ('651124539934251157', 'Cheating Love', 2006, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Ivan Calbérac, David Quesemand', 'Ivan Calbérac', 'Julien Boisselier, Alexandra Lamy, Gilles Lellouche, Mélanie Doutey, Patrick Chesnais, Claire Nebout, Mélanie Page, Anne Consigny', null, 'Laurent loves Camille but he can’t bring himself to marry her. Then he meets Elodie and discovers what love really is – not the mild cozy affection he has for Camille but a cataclysmic, thunderous all-consuming earthquake of the soul. The only problem is that Elodie is the girlfriend of Laurent’s best friend, François...', 'Laurent loves Camille but he can’t bring himself to marry her. Then he meets Elodie and discovers what love really is – not the mild cozy affection he has for Camille but a cataclysmic, thunderous all-consuming earthquake of the soul. The only problem is that Elodie is the girlfriend of Laurent’s best friend, François...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fC457muOqv2344hzDJy1V1Z5Ogv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40179'),
  ('266283096854877704', 'Cheating Wife', 2017, 'Drama, Romance', 'Lee Min-II', null, 'Hae Il, Ji Oh, Tae Sik, Yeong Seon', null, 'Ji-ho regrets marriage with her selfish, withholding husband. She is desperate for a real relationship and by chance falls for a man who is exhausted from his constant lonely state. It turns out that the man is her husband''s colleague, but she continues to enjoy herself anyway. Her husband returns home from a business trip and witnesses something he didn''t expect to see.', 'Ji-ho regrets marriage with her selfish, withholding husband. She is desperate for a real relationship and by chance falls for a man who is exhausted from his constant lonely state. It turns out that the man is her husband''s colleague, but she continues to enjoy herself anyway. Her husband returns home from a business trip and witnesses something he didn''t expect to see.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xcWv4Ui2z6tDaoDd6XSftZQFAR2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:528141'),
  ('543270023122572637', 'Cheats', 2002, 'Comedy', 'Andrew Gurland, Fred Murphy', 'Andrew Gurland', 'Trevor Fehrman, Elden Henson, Matthew Lawrence, Martin Starr, Griffin Dunne, Maggie Lawson, Mary Tyler Moore, Dixon Cohee', null, 'While other kids buy into countless hours of studying just so they can get a mark in some teacher''s report book, Handsome Davis sees it as nothing more than a system of control over your mind. That''s why Handsome and his three best friends Sammy, Victor and the cribsheet genius Applebee have banded together and found ways to cheat on their tests all through their school years.', 'While other kids buy into countless hours of studying just so they can get a mark in some teacher''s report book, Handsome Davis sees it as nothing more than a system of control over your mind. That''s why Handsome and his three best friends Sammy, Victor and the cribsheet genius Applebee have banded together and found ways to cheat on their tests all through their school years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fHvZndfliyf7TNTu1civhu4Lq8L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16875'),
  ('36742252537859778', 'Chebi: My Fluffy Friend', 2023, 'Comedy, Family', 'Dmitriy Dyachenko, Ivan Lebedev, Tatyana Khrechkova', 'Anatoly Molchanov, Vasily Kutsenko, Vitaly Shlyappo', 'Sergey Garmash, Olga Kuzmina, Polina Maksimova, Fyodor Dobronravov, Sergey Lavygin, Elena Yakovleva, Dmitry Lysenkov, Sofya Zaika', null, 'It takes one little big eared hero to bring back the sun and smiles to the adult world! Amazing adventures await a fluffy restless animal from a distant orange country when he gets to a small sea town. There he will find friends, home and finally a name. Helped – and hindered! – he will be by a unsociable old gardener, a strange fashionista aunt and her capricious granddaughter, a boy who can’t start talking in any way and his mother, who has a hard time, although she cooks the most delicious chocolate in the world. And many, many others, whose lives, along with the aroma of oranges, are about to burst into magic and adventure.', 'It takes one little big eared hero to bring back the sun and smiles to the adult world! Amazing adventures await a fluffy restless animal from a distant orange country when he gets to a small sea town. There he will find friends, home and finally a name. Helped – and hindered! – he will be by a unsociable old gardener, a strange fashionista aunt and her capricious granddaughter, a boy who can’t start talking in any way and his mother, who has a hard time, although she cooks the most delicious chocolate in the world. And many, many others, whose lives, along with the aroma of oranges, are about to burst into magic and adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uvnJo5hTXDrdR1dYZUzNel44315.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:751171'),
  ('995982225650894309', 'Chebi: My Fluffy Friend 2', 2026, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Dmitriy Dyachenko, Ivan Lebedev, Tatyana Khrechkova', 'Anatoly Molchanov, Vasily Kutsenko, Vitaly Shlyappo', 'Olga Kuzmina, Sergey Garmash, Elena Yakovleva, Fyodor Dobronravov, Polina Maksimova, Sergey Lavygin, Dmitry Lysenkov, Artyom Bystrov', null, 'Cheburashka gradually gets used to life with Gena, but like any growing child, Cheburashka begins to show excessive independence, and sometimes even become a hooligan. They live happily until their peaceful life is disrupted by an incredible event. In the second part, not only the already beloved heroes will remain, but also new, unusual characters will appear.', 'Cheburashka gradually gets used to life with Gena, but like any growing child, Cheburashka begins to show excessive independence, and sometimes even become a hooligan. They live happily until their peaceful life is disrupted by an incredible event. In the second part, not only the already beloved heroes will remain, but also new, unusual characters will appear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xDIFCUpuGHWViF8yn9Bnq6feHZk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1228477'),
  ('774258861454575203', 'Cheburashka', 1971, 'Animation, Family', 'Roman Kachanov, Teodor Bunimovich, Georgiy Martynyuk', 'Eduard Uspensky, Roman Kachanov', 'Vasiliy Livanov, Klara Rumyanova, Tamara Dmitrieva, Vladimir Ferapontov', null, 'Second animation about Gena and Cheburashka. Cheburashka wishes Gena the Crocodile a happy birthday and gives him a toy helicopter as a gift. After meeting some pioneers, they decide to be pioneers themselves. They build a playground for the local children and collect scrap metal, after which they become pioneers.', 'Second animation about Gena and Cheburashka. Cheburashka wishes Gena the Crocodile a happy birthday and gives him a toy helicopter as a gift. After meeting some pioneers, they decide to be pioneers themselves. They build a playground for the local children and collect scrap metal, after which they become pioneers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9EOpD2DSyzRmWFW7mDkJvZLILuf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34859'),
  ('622624880806671215', 'Cheburashka', 2010, 'Family, Animation', 'Makoto Nakamura', 'Michiru Shimada, Makoto Nakamura, Ryunosuke Kingetsu', 'Nozomi Ōhashi, Kie Kitano, Hiroshi Tsuchida, Cho, Shunji Fujimura, Garri Bardin', null, 'The film based on the book by Eduard Uspensky "Crocodile Gena and his friends". Crocodile Gena works in a zoo - a crocodile. Every evening he returns home to his lonely apartment. Finally he tired of playing with himself in chess, and Gene decides to make friends. On the ads pasted around the city, responding animals and people. First comes a girl with a homeless puppy Gal, followed by the Cheburashka...', 'The film based on the book by Eduard Uspensky "Crocodile Gena and his friends". Crocodile Gena works in a zoo - a crocodile. Every evening he returns home to his lonely apartment. Finally he tired of playing with himself in chess, and Gene decides to make friends. On the ads pasted around the city, responding animals and people. First comes a girl with a homeless puppy Gal, followed by the Cheburashka...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1xub1f6A6tIOaFT5IsdE8cz6wTT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:275244'),
  ('319412895045698462', 'Cheburashka Goes to School', 1983, 'Animation, Family', 'Roman Kachanov', 'Eduard Uspensky', 'Klara Rumyanova, Vasiliy Livanov, Georgi Burkov', null, 'Fourth animation about Gena and Cheburashka. Gena finds out that Cheburashka is unable to read. Luckily, the next day is September 1, the first day of school, and Gena decides to take Cheburashka to school so he can learn. After failing to buy a school uniform, they go to the school anyway, only to find it is closed for repair. Shapoklyak uses Lariska the Rat to stimulate the workers to repair the school quickly. As the school also doesn''t have enough teachers, Gena and Shapoklyak volunteer to be teachers.', 'Fourth animation about Gena and Cheburashka. Gena finds out that Cheburashka is unable to read. Luckily, the next day is September 1, the first day of school, and Gena decides to take Cheburashka to school so he can learn. After failing to buy a school uniform, they go to the school anyway, only to find it is closed for repair. Shapoklyak uses Lariska the Rat to stimulate the workers to repair the school quickly. As the school also doesn''t have enough teachers, Gena and Shapoklyak volunteer to be teachers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6x11KebmCUfTaRGDwJEg7g1TD4Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79703'),
  ('378357717853186544', 'Chechu y familia', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Álvaro Sáenz de Heredia, Josep M. Civit, Raimundo García', 'Rafael Azcona', 'Fernando Fernán Gómez, César Lucendo, Neus Asensi, Amparo Moreno, Emilio Mellado, Antonio Flores, Raúl Fraire, Luis Lorenzo', null, 'Chechu is a 13 year old boy who lives surrounded by peculiar people: his grandfather, his uncle, and two maids. He falls in love with one of them.', 'Chechu is a 13 year old boy who lives surrounded by peculiar people: his grandfather, his uncle, and two maids. He falls in love with one of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rZBzPx0w6IDE3ST1T7K8uXIZvYf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77429'),
  ('1043734656918681613', 'Check It Out!', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Tim Trachte, Fabian Rösler', 'Tim Trachte', 'Max von der Groeben, Olga von Luckwald, Jim High, Tom Lass, Theo Trebs, Jenny Elvers, Lisa Volz, Thomas Limpinsel', null, 'During a school trip to Prague a group of friends leave the hotel and party through the night.', 'During a school trip to Prague a group of friends leave the hotel and party through the night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cijeNjMqGyCXQnqpAVZSbHSOHOK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:338912'),
  ('72475513389786832', 'Check Mate', 2012, 'Drama, Thriller', 'José María Cabral, Kendy Yanoreth, Hernan Herrera', 'César León López, José María Cabral', 'Adrián Mas, Frank Perozo, Marcos Bonetti, Michelle Vargas, Sharlene Taulé, Alfonso Rodríguez Zorrilla, Evelyna Rodríguez, Olga Bucarelli', null, 'A famous game show host is forced to reveal all his secrets on live TV, with his wife and children held hostage.', 'A famous game show host is forced to reveal all his secrets on live TV, with his wife and children held hostage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4wV6Z3kk20U8IjuJWKnkWqQ4xLV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136736'),
  ('995602529239334221', 'Check Point', 2017, 'Action', 'Thomas J. Churchill, Cambria Hankin', 'Thomas J. Churchill', 'William Forsythe, Kenny Johnson, Kane Hodder, Mindy Robinson, Tyler Mane, Bill Goldberg, Fred Williamson, Michelle Lee', null, 'In Port City, North Carolina, a vagrant discovers plans for an invasion. His attempts to warn law enforcement are ignored but when the Sheriff notices odd interactions with other townsfolk, he begins to look into the claim of a sleeper cell living amongst the locals.', 'In Port City, North Carolina, a vagrant discovers plans for an invasion. His attempts to warn law enforcement are ignored but when the Sheriff notices odd interactions with other townsfolk, he begins to look into the claim of a sleeper cell living amongst the locals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wVeCqZYoAq8SK0CtDxERo2Ze9co.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:442094'),
  ('903801578975697956', 'Check to the Queen', 1969, 'Romance, Drama', 'Pasquale Festa Campanile, Franco Rubartelli', 'Tullio Pinelli, Brunello Rondi', 'Haydée Politoff, Rosanna Schiaffino, Romolo Valli, Aldo Giuffrè, Daniela Surina, Gabriele Tinti, Elvira Tonelli, Ileana Riganò', null, 'Silvia is young, beautiful and rich. When her husband goes on a business trip, she starts working as a secretary for Margaret, a famous film star. Margaret appears to have no problems giving her what she wants and turns her into a sex slave- little by little, she subjects herself to increasingly serious humiliations in a masochistic relationship.', 'Silvia is young, beautiful and rich. When her husband goes on a business trip, she starts working as a secretary for Margaret, a famous film star. Margaret appears to have no problems giving her what she wants and turns her into a sex slave- little by little, she subjects herself to increasingly serious humiliations in a masochistic relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cTyVlPxPZtRidtgDj3W8RW5Kiak.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113801'),
  ('764221696302559303', 'Checker Tobi 3: Die heimliche Herrscherin der Erde', 2026, 'Adventure, Family, Documentary, History', 'Antonia Simm', 'Antonia Simm', 'Tobi Krell, Marina Blanke', null, 'Tobi revisits an old childhood riddle: Who leaves the deepest traces in the earth? His search takes him to places like Madagascar, Spitsbergen, and Mexico, where he uncovers what connects them and finds the answer he was missing as a child.', 'Tobi revisits an old childhood riddle: Who leaves the deepest traces in the earth? His search takes him to places like Madagascar, Spitsbergen, and Mexico, where he uncovers what connects them and finds the answer he was missing as a child.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FfBrCsda9YUhrx6f2YGcWCIXkAK6.jpg', 'plex:movie:checker-tobi-3-die-heimliche-herrscherin-der-erde-2026'),
  ('1089535762950701781', 'Checker Tobi und das Geheimnis unseres Planeten', 2019, 'Family, Documentary, Adventure', 'Martin Tischner', 'Martin Tischner', 'Tobi Krell, Lars Rudolph, Ulla Lohmann, Uli Kunz, Devaki Patil, Esra Bonkowski, Daniela Jansen, Ina Kleitz', null, 'The greatest adventure of his life begins for Checker Tobi on a pirate ship in the middle of the sea. There he discovers a message in a bottle containing a riddle. If he solves it, he will reveal the secret of our planet. An exciting scavenger hunt around the world begins! Tobi climbs the crater of a fire-breathing volcano, dives with sea dragons in the Pacific, explores the loneliest parts of the Arctic with climate researchers and ends up in India at the driest time of the year. In Mumbai, he becomes a Bollywood star before the monsoon transforms the megacity. Tobi finally realizes that he had the solution to the puzzle in mind throughout his journey.', 'The greatest adventure of his life begins for Checker Tobi on a pirate ship in the middle of the sea. There he discovers a message in a bottle containing a riddle. If he solves it, he will reveal the secret of our planet. An exciting scavenger hunt around the world begins! Tobi climbs the crater of a fire-breathing volcano, dives with sea dragons in the Pacific, explores the loneliest parts of the Arctic with climate researchers and ends up in India at the driest time of the year. In Mumbai, he becomes a Bollywood star before the monsoon transforms the megacity. Tobi finally realizes that he had the solution to the puzzle in mind throughout his journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yx7RLUHfIwT2PQxjgncKzUELxZw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:561882'),
  ('362830138263172392', 'Checkered Ninja', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Thorbjørn Christoffersen, Anders Matthesen', 'Anders Matthesen', 'Anders Matthesen, Emma Sehested Høeg, Alfred Bjerre Larsen, Ava Connolly, Aloïs Agaësse-Mahieu, Stéphane Ronchewski, Martial Leminoux', null, 'A possessed Ninja doll teams up with a teenage boy to avenge the murder of a poor child factory worker.', 'A possessed Ninja doll teams up with a teenage boy to avenge the murder of a poor child factory worker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dzN5xbp73TI7pjEqZ66ECNxdWJl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:523536'),
  ('851053371735899373', 'Checkered Ninja 2', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Action, Family', 'Anders Matthesen, Thorbjørn Christoffersen', 'Anders Matthesen', 'Anders Matthesen, Louis Næss-Schmidt, Emma Sehested Høeg, Martin Beyer-Olsen, Jon Sindre Fjellvang, Fridtjof Stensæth Josefsen, Nils Jørgen Kaalstad, Christian Mikkelsen', null, 'After Phillip Eppermint manages to evade a prison sentence in Thailand, Checkered Ninja comes alive and seeks out Alex. Together, with Alex and his entire family, they now have to go to Thailand to bust Eppermint.', 'After Phillip Eppermint manages to evade a prison sentence in Thailand, Checkered Ninja comes alive and seeks out Alex. Together, with Alex and his entire family, they now have to go to Thailand to bust Eppermint.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fjWiVF2vFwd3mhs1dNoS0SOHxqt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:778819'),
  ('575739506938577142', 'Checkin'' It Twice', 2023, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Kevin Fair, Mike Kam', 'Steven Beauregard', 'Kim Matula, Kevin McGarry, Brittany Mitchell, Jamila Hall, Craig March, Desiree Zurowski, Kairo Ellis, Jason Jensen', 'G', 'A journeyman hockey player falls for a real estate agent in a career crisis when he''s traded to her hometown and moves into the cottage in her hockey-loving family''s backyard.', 'A journeyman hockey player falls for a real estate agent in a career crisis when he''s traded to her hometown and moves into the cottage in her hockey-loving family''s backyard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4mJK5blql4Ti3lWJYOr8wwVQ6Pn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1166012'),
  ('46764379484867047', 'Checking Out', 1988, 'Comedy', 'David Leland, Ian Wilson, Eric Heffron', 'Joe Eszterhas', 'Jeff Daniels, Melanie Mayron, Michael Tucker, Kathleen York, Ann Magnuson, Allan Havey, Jo Harvey Allen, Ian Wolfe', 'R', 'When his best friend dies of a heart attack, Ray Macklin becomes a man obsessed with his own mortality. Convinced that all his aches and pains are an indication of his imminent death, Ray''s life turns into a slapstick farce of health-crazed anxiety and hypochondria.', 'When his best friend dies of a heart attack, Ray Macklin becomes a man obsessed with his own mortality. Convinced that all his aches and pains are an indication of his imminent death, Ray''s life turns into a slapstick farce of health-crazed anxiety and hypochondria.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AeEbHPCzGOxEk60bVehikBYqedn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54501'),
  ('118027317753886165', 'Checkmate', 2024, 'Action, Comedy', 'Jorge Nisco', 'Leandro Calderone', 'Adrián Suar, Maggie Civantos, José Eduardo Derbez, Tsahi Halevi, Mike Amigorena, Fiorella Indelicato, Benjamín Amadeo, Charo López', null, 'Duque, an international secret agent who retired years ago after a traumatic event, is forced to return to action when a commando operative kidnaps his niece and forces him to steal a precious scientific formula as part of the ransom.', 'Duque, an international secret agent who retired years ago after a traumatic event, is forced to return to action when a commando operative kidnaps his niece and forces him to steal a precious scientific formula as part of the ransom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o960Qx10rRRA4t44DsjeiYB3Dmh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1217409'),
  ('264984321256787744', 'Checkmates', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Nacho G. Velilla, Andreu Ortoll', 'David S. Olivas, Nacho G. Velilla, Marta Sánchez', 'Alexandra Jiménez, María Adánez, Francesc Orella, Miguel Rellán, Alain Hernández, José Manuel Poga, Luis Callejo, Rocío Velayos', null, 'Candela, the headmistress of an elite school, after a traumatic divorce, returns to her old high school to lead a group of rebellious students through chess. There she will learn that in chess, and in life, it doesn''t matter if you are a king or a pawn, because everyone ends up in the same box.', 'Candela, the headmistress of an elite school, after a traumatic divorce, returns to her old high school to lead a group of rebellious students through chess. There she will learn that in chess, and in life, it doesn''t matter if you are a king or a pawn, because everyone ends up in the same box.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/epxMmvLaQmInLeRNOIMfRaJrhSZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1175075'),
  ('1107855616285344825', 'Checkpoint', 1998, 'War, Drama', 'Aleksandr Rogozhkin, Andrei Zhegalov, Galla Kapitskaya', 'Aleksandr Rogozhkin', 'Aleksei Buldakov, Andrey Krasko, Denis Kirillov, Roman Romantsov, Kirill Ulyanov, Margarita Bychkova, Ivan Kuzmin, Sergei Guslinsky', null, 'A group Russian soldiers is send to an outpost to guard the area. They pass the day patroulling the area, while being shot at from the forest. They never know if the civillions are hostile or friendly to them.', 'A group Russian soldiers is send to an outpost to guard the area. They pass the day patroulling the area, while being shot at from the forest. They never know if the civillions are hostile or friendly to them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/706mwkEW2cPQrT5YDDuZsoJy9vq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4106'),
  ('664315524166940984', 'Cheech & Chong''s Next Movie', 1980, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'King Baggot, Tommy Chong, Newt Arnold', 'Tommy Chong, Cheech Marin', 'Cheech Marin, Tommy Chong, Evelyn Guerrero, Betty Kennedy, Sy Kramer, Rikki Marin, Peter Bromilow, Paul ''Mousie'' Garner', 'R', 'Perennially stoned Cheech and Chong tear through the city of Los Angeles, causing trouble wherever they go. After Cheech loses his job, the two pot enthusiasts head to the welfare offices where Cheech''s girlfriend, Donna, works. Instead of collecting unemployment, they find themselves thrown back on the streets, searching for a way to earn new income. But when Cheech''s cousin, "Red" Mendoza, arrives, things get even crazier.', 'Perennially stoned Cheech and Chong tear through the city of Los Angeles, causing trouble wherever they go. After Cheech loses his job, the two pot enthusiasts head to the welfare offices where Cheech''s girlfriend, Donna, works. Instead of collecting unemployment, they find themselves thrown back on the streets, searching for a way to earn new income. But when Cheech''s cousin, "Red" Mendoza, arrives, things get even crazier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hetHB9L84jOLxajKZLKgaNBRDJ9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13612'),
  ('1013696198777647019', 'Cheech & Chong''s The Corsican Brothers', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Tommy Chong, Peter Macgregor-Scott, Jean Achache', 'Tommy Chong, Cheech Marin', 'Cheech Marin, Tommy Chong, Roy Dotrice, Shelby Chong, Rikki Marin, Edie McClurg, Robbi Chong, Rae Dawn Chong', 'PG', 'Two brothers who can feel each others'' pain and pleasure mess up the French revolution.', 'Two brothers who can feel each others'' pain and pleasure mess up the French revolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vB186e2eiUaKLVlZwvKv4dIJ9GS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14774'),
  ('463531412780450367', 'Cheekatilo', 2026, 'Thriller', 'Sharan Koppisetty, Mallikarjun', 'Chandra Pemmaraju, Sharan Koppisetty', 'Sobhita Dhulipala, Vishwadev Rachakonda, Chaitanya Visalakshmi, Isha Chawla, Jhansi, Aamani, Vadlamani Srinivas, Ravindra Vijay', null, 'When crime anchor Sandhya’s best friend is found dead under suspicious circumstances, she embarks on a dangerous investigation that collides with a dark past. As secrets unravel, Sandhya must face her trauma and rise as a fearless voice for the silenced.', 'When crime anchor Sandhya’s best friend is found dead under suspicious circumstances, she embarks on a dangerous investigation that collides with a dark past. As secrets unravel, Sandhya must face her trauma and rise as a fearless voice for the silenced.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pO86EjZb7QyGYk5RW4Xm4UWe5Uv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1263037'),
  ('647237351127057900', 'Cheeni Kum', 2007, 'Romance, Drama', 'R. Balki, P. C. Sreeram', 'R. Balki', 'Amitabh Bachchan, Tabu, Paresh Rawal, Swini Khara, Vinay Jain, Zohra Sehgal, Jameel Khan, Krishna Bhatt', null, 'Buddhadev Gupta, a 64-year-old chef, falls in love with a 34-year-old software engineer, Nina. However, their future becomes uncertain when he discovers that her father is six years his junior.', 'Buddhadev Gupta, a 64-year-old chef, falls in love with a 34-year-old software engineer, Nina. However, their future becomes uncertain when he discovers that her father is six years his junior.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qjjIQC9v0lH8kfYWSF0lz7jhhDL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16576'),
  ('1032570826979040131', 'Cheer to Life', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Cris D''amato, Dante Belluti, Cibele Santa Cruz', 'Natalia Klein', 'Thati Lopes, Regina Braga, Jonas Bloch, Rodrigo Simas, Diego Martins, Daniel Filho, Aline Dias, Clara Tiezzi', null, 'Jéssica is a simple young woman, dedicated to her job at an antique shop in Rio de Janeiro, but she feels her life lacks purpose. Everything changes when she finds a mysterious locket identical to an item she inherited from her late mother. Driven by the desire to understand the connection between the locket and her family history, Jéssica teams up with Gabriel, a distant relative who appears unexpectedly.', 'Jéssica is a simple young woman, dedicated to her job at an antique shop in Rio de Janeiro, but she feels her life lacks purpose. Everything changes when she finds a mysterious locket identical to an item she inherited from her late mother. Driven by the desire to understand the connection between the locket and her family history, Jéssica teams up with Gabriel, a distant relative who appears unexpectedly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fIjIEZ8ug2pLGbV2JiKytZyj2NG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1186940'),
  ('507949772735749501', 'Cheer Up, Mr. Lee', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy, Family', 'Lee Kae-byeok, Kim Jeong-won, Jung Hae-ji', 'Lee Kae-byeok, Jang Yoon-mi, Kim Hee-jin', 'Cha Seung-won, Um Chae-young, Park Hae-joon, Kim Hye-ok, An Kil-kang, Jeon Hye-bin, Ryu Han-bi, Cho Han-cheul', null, 'Chul-soo is a man with an intellectual disability. One day, Chul-soo finds out that a young girl, Saet-byul, who is in hospital is his daughter. And soon, Saet-byul sneaks out of the hospital and travels by herself to a faraway city for her friend''s birthday. As Chul-soo accompanies Saet-byul''s journey, friendship develops between the two.', 'Chul-soo is a man with an intellectual disability. One day, Chul-soo finds out that a young girl, Saet-byul, who is in hospital is his daughter. And soon, Saet-byul sneaks out of the hospital and travels by herself to a faraway city for her friend''s birthday. As Chul-soo accompanies Saet-byul''s journey, friendship develops between the two.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hqwWHeHRHSMiw6xxMvLvFZYMSX4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:570511'),
  ('931593624125121392', 'Cheerleader Camp', 1988, 'Comedy, Horror, Thriller', 'John Quinn, Bryan England', 'R.L. O''Keefe, David Lee Fein', 'Betsy Russell, Leif Garrett, Lucinda Dickey, Lorie Griffin, George Buck Flower, Teri Weigel, Rebecca Ferratti, Travis McKenna', 'R', 'A cheerleader named Alison is plagued by nightmares about the upcoming all-state finals and attends a summer training camp with her teammates. When a number of deaths start occurring at the camp, Alison''s nightmares turn twisted and brutal, and she begins to believe that she may be responsible for the mayhem.', 'A cheerleader named Alison is plagued by nightmares about the upcoming all-state finals and attends a summer training camp with her teammates. When a number of deaths start occurring at the camp, Alison''s nightmares turn twisted and brutal, and she begins to believe that she may be responsible for the mayhem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7rRki4MybU4wKLo9em6BTHhGJtM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40087'),
  ('1015682405595869238', 'Cheerleader Massacre', 2003, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Jim Wynorski, Chuck Cirino', 'Lenny Juliano, William Langlois', 'Tamie Sheffield, Charity Rahmer, Erin Byron, Lenny Juliano, William Langlois, Samantha Phillips, GiGi Erneta, April Flowers', 'R', 'Five high school cheerleaders, their coach and a couple of adolescent sex-crazed guys travel to a cabin in the woods for a weekend getaway only to be killed off one by one by an unseen maniac.', 'Five high school cheerleaders, their coach and a couple of adolescent sex-crazed guys travel to a cabin in the woods for a weekend getaway only to be killed off one by one by an unseen maniac.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tCYL6G6KISNc6W2qMD2cLVAamTR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9940'),
  ('1122111548278126297', 'Cheers for Miss Bishop', 1941, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Tay Garnett', 'Adelaide Heilbron, Sheridan Gibney', 'Martha Scott, William Gargan, Edmund Gwenn, Sterling Holloway, Dorothy Peterson, Sidney Blackmer, Mary Anderson, Donald Douglas', 'NR', 'Ella Bishop is an inhibited girl whose frustrations grow as she approaches womanhood. As a women, her ambitions to teach cause her to lose her only opportunity for true love. Ella''s life becomes one of missed chances and wrong choices. As she reaches old age, she reflects back and realizes she allowed the years to go by without achieving what she believes to be her true fulfillment. However, her years have not been without glory, and her moment of triumph arrives when her numerous now-famous students from over the years, return to honor their beloved Miss Bishop.', 'Ella Bishop is an inhibited girl whose frustrations grow as she approaches womanhood. As a women, her ambitions to teach cause her to lose her only opportunity for true love. Ella''s life becomes one of missed chances and wrong choices. As she reaches old age, she reflects back and realizes she allowed the years to go by without achieving what she believes to be her true fulfillment. However, her years have not been without glory, and her moment of triumph arrives when her numerous now-famous students from over the years, return to honor their beloved Miss Bishop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qskXMXp76tEuIyKtg117UCG4LqS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142876'),
  ('837156071361426776', 'Cheers to Joy', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama, TV Movie', 'Jérôme Bonnell', 'Jérôme Bonnell', 'Pablo Pauly, Amel Charif, Marc Citti, Charlotte Laemmel, Anne Suarez, Raphael Acloque, Olga Mouak, Gaëtan Peau', null, 'March 2020. Véra makes a quick trip to Paris to feed a friend’s fish and water her plants while she’s hospitalized with a mild case of Covid. France is already abuzz with rumors of the spreading virus. But instead of hopping on a train back to Montpellier, as planned, she impulsively lies to her fiancé and says all trains have been canceled and she’s stuck in Paris… just as everyone else is hightailing it out of the city and the entire country goes into lockdown. So Véra holes up in her friend’s apartment, relieved to have a bit of quiet time to herself. Then she crosses paths with Sam — a chance meeting that changes her life.', 'March 2020. Véra makes a quick trip to Paris to feed a friend’s fish and water her plants while she’s hospitalized with a mild case of Covid. France is already abuzz with rumors of the spreading virus. But instead of hopping on a train back to Montpellier, as planned, she impulsively lies to her fiancé and says all trains have been canceled and she’s stuck in Paris… just as everyone else is hightailing it out of the city and the entire country goes into lockdown. So Véra holes up in her friend’s apartment, relieved to have a bit of quiet time to herself. Then she crosses paths with Sam — a chance meeting that changes her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aYwlSQf8mxABNPHGitCEg5jp9Lb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1098509'),
  ('647412593904524466', 'Cheese Chasers', 1951, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc, Stan Freberg', null, 'After eating their fill at a cheese factory, Hubie and Bertie decide there is nothing left to live for, and try to get Claude Cat to eat them.', 'After eating their fill at a cheese factory, Hubie and Bertie decide there is nothing left to live for, and try to get Claude Cat to eat them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cvv3WW6Dfz2jbNRQB0DdvmqzxTb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102184'),
  ('618535741886202965', 'Cheese Head', 2006, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ariel Winograd, Inés Braun, Guillermo Nieto', 'Ariel Winograd', 'Sebastián Montagna, Mercedes Morán, María Vaner, Carlos Kaspar, Juan Manuel Tenuta, Nahuel Pérez Biscayart, Julieta Zylberberg, Daniel Hendler', null, 'It tells the story of four Jewish boys during a few summer days at the country club where their parents take them, on the outskirts of Buenos Aires, in 1993. Within the club, the four define themselves as outsiders, since they do not participate in the sports activities that are practiced there, and therefore do not fit into the logic that governs the place, being permanently bothered and mocked by the rest of the children of their age.', 'It tells the story of four Jewish boys during a few summer days at the country club where their parents take them, on the outskirts of Buenos Aires, in 1993. Within the club, the four define themselves as outsiders, since they do not participate in the sports activities that are practiced there, and therefore do not fit into the logic that governs the place, being permanently bothered and mocked by the rest of the children of their age.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y491NtLzR6DiyP87bZj8Lnu7E9P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72908'),
  ('243670719726487015', 'Cheese in the Trap', 2018, 'Romance, Drama', 'Kim Je-young, Yun Nam-joo', 'Kim Je-young', 'Park Hae-jin, Oh Yeon-seo, Park Ki-woong, Yoo In-young, Oh Jong-hyuk, Sandara Park, Moon Ji-yoon, Kim Hyun-jin', null, 'Hong Seol, a student from a poor family, meets a rich Yoo Jung, who is her senior at her university. They both develop a rather inconvenient relationship after knowing each other.', 'Hong Seol, a student from a poor family, meets a rich Yoo Jung, who is her senior at her university. They both develop a rather inconvenient relationship after knowing each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jG1nfIvkSpwlEt2EeAG6oGFKyqY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:471335'),
  ('47280568935493035', 'Cheese It, the Cat!', 1957, 'Animation', 'Robert McKimson', null, null, null, 'A working-class mouse, who wants to steal a birthday cupcake for his wife, enlists his friend in an effort to get rid of the cat who has suddenly appeared in the kitchen.', 'A working-class mouse, who wants to steal a birthday cupcake for his wife, enlists his friend in an effort to get rid of the cat who has suddenly appeared in the kitchen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3x1C0QHtKQr1fV1kuCky36d2LpA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235005'),
  ('315695247884098688', 'Cheetah', 1989, 'Drama, Family', 'Jeff Blyth', null, 'Keith Coogan, Lucy Deakins, Timothy Landfield, Colin Mothupi, Breon Gorman, Ka Vundla, Lydia Kigada, Kuldeep Bhakoo', 'G', 'An American boy and girl, spending six months in Kenya with their scientist parents adopt a cheetah, only to realize that they must set it loose so that it can learn to hunt and be free. However, when the animal is captured by poachers planning to race it against greyhounds, the two city kids, together with a young African goat herder they befriended, head off into the wild to rescue the cheetah.', 'An American boy and girl, spending six months in Kenya with their scientist parents adopt a cheetah, only to realize that they must set it loose so that it can learn to hunt and be free. However, when the animal is captured by poachers planning to race it against greyhounds, the two city kids, together with a young African goat herder they befriended, head off into the wild to rescue the cheetah.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m4FoSWnkrBpUaUehWU12XWKRxjs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65157'),
  ('752085290855246374', 'Cheetahs Up Close with Bertie Gregory', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Bertie Gregory, Jigar Ganatra', null, 'Baz Kessy, Denis Mollel, Kelvin Munisi, Douglas Ndanshau, Maria Dennett', 'PG', 'Bertie arrives in the Serengeti as the spectacular wildebeest migration kicks off. He’s here to film the fastest land animal on Earth: the cheetah. As he gets close to a mother caring for her tiny cubs and a young group of males executing phenomenal hunts as a team, he learns about the unexpected challenges the species endures.', 'Bertie arrives in the Serengeti as the spectacular wildebeest migration kicks off. He’s here to film the fastest land animal on Earth: the cheetah. As he gets close to a mother caring for her tiny cubs and a young group of males executing phenomenal hunts as a team, he learns about the unexpected challenges the species endures.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FpSmSgFb1cnRQep0OzcuKWMYWeqR.jpg', 'plex:movie:cheetahs-up-close-with-bertie-gregory-2026'),
  ('505178437372621195', 'Chef', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Jon Favreau, Kramer Morgenthau, Greg Hale', 'Jon Favreau', 'Jon Favreau, John Leguizamo, Bobby Cannavale, Emjay Anthony, Scarlett Johansson, Dustin Hoffman, Sofía Vergara, Oliver Platt', 'R', 'When Chef Carl Casper suddenly quits his job at a prominent Los Angeles restaurant after refusing to compromise his creative integrity for its controlling owner, he is left to figure out what''s next. Finding himself in Miami, he teams up with his ex-wife, his friend and his son to launch a food truck. Taking to the road, Chef Carl goes back to his roots to reignite his passion for the kitchen -- and zest for life and love.', 'When Chef Carl Casper suddenly quits his job at a prominent Los Angeles restaurant after refusing to compromise his creative integrity for its controlling owner, he is left to figure out what''s next. Finding himself in Miami, he teams up with his ex-wife, his friend and his son to launch a food truck. Taking to the road, Chef Carl goes back to his roots to reignite his passion for the kitchen -- and zest for life and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hyp8EXDmO4dSC8V6Q5jU7gD1kcg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:212778'),
  ('486625758690761920', 'Chef', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy, Family', 'Raja Menon, Priya Seth', 'Raja Menon, Ritesh Shah, Suresh Nair', 'Saif Ali Khan, Svar Kamble, Padmapriya Janakiraman, Sobhita Dhulipala, Milind Soman, Neha Saxena, Chandan Roy Sanyal, Shayan Munshi', null, 'Roshan Kalra is a three-star Michelin chef who gets fired from New York''s Gulli restaurant after he punches a customer. Forced to take a break, he flies to Kochi to spend time with his son, Armaan and his estranged wife Radha Menon. It''s a fruitful trip because he manages to mend broken family ties. In a bid to help him get his mojo back, his wife suggests he put up his own food truck and begin afresh.', 'Roshan Kalra is a three-star Michelin chef who gets fired from New York''s Gulli restaurant after he punches a customer. Forced to take a break, he flies to Kochi to spend time with his son, Armaan and his estranged wife Radha Menon. It''s a fruitful trip because he manages to mend broken family ties. In a bid to help him get his mojo back, his wife suggests he put up his own food truck and begin afresh.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6GHPvxiy0Y7hnumdNubwsGqHTc1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:471972'),
  ('1010373036649992697', 'Chef Donald', 1941, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack King', null, 'Clarence Nash', 'NR', 'Donald decides to try cooking along with a radio show.', 'Donald decides to try cooking along with a radio show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fhKRyc1RRKxVuZ5cMXmKlDhS3T6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53474'),
  ('458880180853300650', 'Chef Jack: The Adventurous Cook', 2023, 'Animation, Adventure', 'Guilherme Fiúza Zenha, Andressa Nowasyk, Artur Costa', 'Roger Keesse, Artur Costa, Matheus B. Oliveira', 'Danton Mello, Rodrigo Waschburger, Tásia D''Paula, Renan Rammé, Cecília Fernandes, Álvaro Rosacosta, Ana Laura Salles, Rejane Faria', null, 'Chef Jack and his assistant Leonard will travel through the Culinary Islands to participate in the biggest gastronomic competition in the world and, thus, try to defeat their opponents.', 'Chef Jack and his assistant Leonard will travel through the Culinary Islands to participate in the biggest gastronomic competition in the world and, thus, try to defeat their opponents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ubEXxuWay9lhzTYnRloZmvlge2I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1061617'),
  ('227811918511785616', 'Chef''s Kiss', 2026, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Adrian Powers', 'Amelia Bonnet', 'Adrienne Bailon-Houghton, Tim Robards, Julia Vosnakis, Nat Buchanan, Dina Panozzo', 'Not Rated', 'Lauren travels to Italy to rebrand Russo Pasta Sauce, but her culture clash with Mason and Francesca''s culinary heritage evolves into deeper revelations about love, life, and career priorities.', 'Lauren travels to Italy to rebrand Russo Pasta Sauce, but her culture clash with Mason and Francesca''s culinary heritage evolves into deeper revelations about love, life, and career priorities.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F4%2Fgracenote%2F46afa8ac1af14c74ac13a3bac13290cb.jpg', 'plex:movie:chefs-kiss-2026'),
  ('753902440026272162', 'Chef''s Special', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Nacho G. Velilla, David Omedes', 'Nacho G. Velilla, David S. Olivas, Oriol Capel', 'Javier Cámara, Lola Dueñas, Fernando Tejero, Benjamín Vicuña, Luis Varela, Chus Lampreave, Junio Valverde, Alexandra Jiménez', null, 'Maxi thinks his life is perfect. He is a famous cook who owns a successful restaurant in Chueca and is living his life as a gay man without much complex. But when his son Edu and his daughter Alba appear, and a new attractive neighbor comes along, it will have a strong effect on his life resulting in his values being challenged for ever.', 'Maxi thinks his life is perfect. He is a famous cook who owns a successful restaurant in Chueca and is living his life as a gay man without much complex. But when his son Edu and his daughter Alba appear, and a new attractive neighbor comes along, it will have a strong effect on his life resulting in his values being challenged for ever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kpDxrZD4L84UmA8foham5DWdmf1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15953'),
  ('424748099425142552', 'Chehre', 2021, 'Thriller, Mystery, Drama', 'Rumi Jaffery, Gourov Dasgupta, Abbas Ali Moghul', 'Ranjit Kapoor', 'Amitabh Bachchan, Emraan Hashmi, Krystle D''Souza, Annu Kapoor, Rhea Chakraborty, Siddhanth Kapoor, Dhritiman Chatterjee, Raghubir Yadav', null, 'An ad agency executive takes shelter at an old man''s home in mountains amid a dangerous snow storm, but soon finds himself trapped with no way out when the man and his clan of veterans hook him for a game of crime and punishment.', 'An ad agency executive takes shelter at an old man''s home in mountains amid a dangerous snow storm, but soon finds himself trapped with no way out when the man and his clan of veterans hook him for a game of crime and punishment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/egpv58u11MxepnNwXtzdMOagRdg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:695951'),
  ('88960139091543161', 'Chekist', 1992, 'Drama', 'Aleksandr Rogozhkin, Stanislav Okhapkin, Anatoly Taborov', 'Jacques Baynac, André Milbet, Vladimir Zazubrin', 'Igor Sergeev, Aleksey Poluyan, Mikhail Vasserbaum, Sergei Isavnin, Vasiliy Domrachyov, Aleksandr Medvedev, Aleksandr Kharashkevich, Igor Golovin', null, 'Srubov is a part of CHEKA, the secret police Lenin established after the Bolshevik Revolution. They arrest, interview for a minute, try in ten seconds, and execute intellectuals, aristocrats, Jews, clergy, and their families. In the building basement, five people at a time are shot as they stand naked facing wooden doors. No one to remember their last words; no martyrs, just anonymous bodies. Daily, the kangaroo court, the executions, the loading of bodies onto wagons. Srubov is cold, distant, sexually dysfunctional, and a deep thinker, hated by former friends and his family. As he tries to reason the nature of revolution and the purpose of CHEKA, he slowly goes mad.', 'Srubov is a part of CHEKA, the secret police Lenin established after the Bolshevik Revolution. They arrest, interview for a minute, try in ten seconds, and execute intellectuals, aristocrats, Jews, clergy, and their families. In the building basement, five people at a time are shot as they stand naked facing wooden doors. No one to remember their last words; no martyrs, just anonymous bodies. Daily, the kangaroo court, the executions, the loading of bodies onto wagons. Srubov is cold, distant, sexually dysfunctional, and a deep thinker, hated by former friends and his family. As he tries to reason the nature of revolution and the purpose of CHEKA, he slowly goes mad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y9Xlinx4B9eEGAliCBdnU8RWF0s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119320'),
  ('913242531798875237', 'Chekka Chivantha Vaanam', 2018, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Richard Anthony, Mani Ratnam, Santosh Sivan', 'Mani Ratnam, Sivakumar Ananth', 'Arvind Swamy, Vijay Sethupathi, Arun Vijay, Silambarasan, Jyothika, Aishwarya Rajesh, Aditi Rao Hydari, Dayana Erappa', null, 'A bloody power struggle erupts between three brothers who are vying to take over the family business following the death of their father.', 'A bloody power struggle erupts between three brothers who are vying to take over the family business following the death of their father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kzwMj4FZdeH37I9u9FIbmkmI2Jx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:504184'),
  ('466756210528757616', 'Chelsea Girls', 1966, 'Drama', 'Andy Warhol, Paul Morrissey', 'Andy Warhol, Ronald Tavel', 'Brigid Berlin, Randy Borscheidt, Christian Aaron Boulogne, Angelina ''Pepper'' Davis, Dorothy Dean, Eric Emerson, Patrick Flemming, Ed Hood', null, 'Lacking a formal narrative, Warhol''s mammoth film follows various residents of the Chelsea Hotel in 1966 New York City. The film was intended to be screened via dual projector set-up.', 'Lacking a formal narrative, Warhol''s mammoth film follows various residents of the Chelsea Hotel in 1966 New York City. The film was intended to be screened via dual projector set-up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c1oA8F4IfZrZw10LuvJGSzqmSxx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1686'),
