  ('167986937296488106', 'Chemmeen', 1965, 'Romance, Drama', 'Ramu Kariat, Marcus Bartley, U Rajagopal', 'S L Puram Sadanandan', 'Sheela, Madhu, Sathyan, Kottarakkara Sreedharan Nair, Adoor Bhavani, Latha Raju, Adoor Pankajam, S. P. Pillai', null, 'Karutthamma, the daughter of a Hindu fisherman, falls in love with a Muslim fish trader. However, social prejudices seem to ruin their love life and invite the wrath of their communities.', 'Karutthamma, the daughter of a Hindu fisherman, falls in love with a Muslim fish trader. However, social prejudices seem to ruin their love life and invite the wrath of their communities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jOAjmEQD4LUYFVgR41fAEutaVQb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:265070'),
  ('632508259448114712', 'Chenkol', 1993, 'Action, Drama', 'Sibi Malayil, Venu', 'A K Lohithadas', 'Mohanlal, Thilakan, Kaviyoor Ponnamma, Usha, Surbhi Zaveri Vyas, Mohan Raj, Shanthi Krishna, Kundara Johny', null, 'Sethumadhavan accidentally kills a criminal to save his life and is sent to prison. After completing his term, he tries to lead a happy life, but his past makes it all the more difficult.', 'Sethumadhavan accidentally kills a criminal to save his life and is sent to prison. After completing his term, he tries to lead a happy life, but his past makes it all the more difficult.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z24XBQAln0gv0KZCkU4F75xVyxy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:280269'),
  ('242187554698024337', 'Chennai Express', 2013, 'Romance, Comedy, Action', 'Rohit Shetty, Megha Namdev, Shetty Riyan', 'Yunus Sajawal, Robin Bhatt', 'Shah Rukh Khan, Deepika Padukone, Nikitin Dheer, Sathyaraj, Mukesh Tiwari, Kamini Kaushal, Lekh Tandon, Rakesh Kukreti', 'PG-13', 'Rahul embarks on a journey to a small town in Tamil Nadu to fulfill the last wish of his grandfather: to have his ashes immersed in the Holy water of Rameshwaram. En route, he meets a woman hailing from a unique family down South. As they find love through this journey in the exuberant lands of South India, an unanticipated drive awaits them.', 'Rahul embarks on a journey to a small town in Tamil Nadu to fulfill the last wish of his grandfather: to have his ashes immersed in the Holy water of Rameshwaram. En route, he meets a woman hailing from a unique family down South. As they find love through this journey in the exuberant lands of South India, an unanticipated drive awaits them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9j7XfhBJKNfidMCa8JsNbqU1waV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205022'),
  ('192215988702317182', 'Cherbourg: Entrée des souverains russes et du président de la République sous le hall', 1896, 'Documentary', 'Constant Girel', null, 'Félix François Faure, Czar Nicholas II of Russia, Alexandra Feodorovna', null, 'Sovereign Nicholas II, Alexandra Feodorovna and President Félix Faure, walking by, followed by their respective escorts.', 'Sovereign Nicholas II, Alexandra Feodorovna and President Félix Faure, walking by, followed by their respective escorts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nHSrOSzsd4uuvHdF6UrdHlTP47V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:231070'),
  ('603774569999354402', 'Cherche fiancé tous frais payés', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Aline Issermann', 'Aline Issermann, Brice-Pascal Renault, Jean-Luc Estèbe', 'Alexandra Lamy, Bruno Salomone, Claudia Cardinale, Isabelle Gélinas, Gilles Gaston-Dreyfus, Mathias Mlekuz, Rachida Khalil, Zélie Jobert', null, 'Alexandra, trente ans, s''apprête à passer les vacances d''été en famille. Au moment de prendre la route, elle apprend que sa mère a aussi invité son ex, accompagné d''une "fiancée" jeune et ravissante. Dans un café, elle croise un acteur au chômage et l''engage sur le champ pour tenir le rôle de son fiancé. Comme ça, elle pourra affronter son ex, en toute sérénité.', 'Alexandra, trente ans, s''apprête à passer les vacances d''été en famille. Au moment de prendre la route, elle apprend que sa mère a aussi invité son ex, accompagné d''une "fiancée" jeune et ravissante. Dans un café, elle croise un acteur au chômage et l''engage sur le champ pour tenir le rôle de son fiancé. Comme ça, elle pourra affronter son ex, en toute sérénité.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rp7uPClQantbuSmVXSiSp1ltV2a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19619'),
  ('564503013862028556', 'Cherchez l''idole', 1964, 'Comedy', 'Michel Boisrond, Raymond Lemoigne', 'Richard Balducci', 'Dany Saval, Franck Fernandel, Mylène Demongeot, Sylvie Vartan, Johnny Hallyday, Charles Aznavour, Berthe Granval, Dominique Boschero', null, 'After stealing a diamond from Mylène Demongeot, Richard hides it inside a guitar. But on returning to the music shop he discovers that the precious instrument has just been sold! The problem is complicated by the fact that five stars all bought the same model that morning...', 'After stealing a diamond from Mylène Demongeot, Richard hides it inside a guitar. But on returning to the music shop he discovers that the precious instrument has just been sold! The problem is complicated by the fact that five stars all bought the same model that morning...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pXQDfsGeSFhNFqUOyY9e9Q833x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66906'),
  ('390906087798593938', 'Chéri', 2009, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Stephen Frears, Mark Raggett, Darius Khondji', 'Christopher Hampton', 'Michelle Pfeiffer, Kathy Bates, Rupert Friend, Felicity Jones, Iben Hjejle, Frances Tomelty, Tom Burke, Hubert Tellegen', 'R', 'The son of a courtesan retreats into a fantasy world after being forced to end his relationship with the older woman who educated him in the ways of love.', 'The son of a courtesan retreats into a fantasy world after being forced to end his relationship with the older woman who educated him in the ways of love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b35rv11ebJdqCe5chVmSUZ0RIlX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22215'),
  ('34310230429145340', 'Cherish', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Finn Taylor, Curran G. Engel, Peter Burgess Smith', 'Finn Taylor', 'Robin Tunney, Tim Blake Nelson, Brad Hunt, Liz Phair, Jason Priestley, Nora Dunn, Lindsay Crouse, Kenny Kwong', 'R', 'After a martini-induced rampage, a fantasy-prone young woman is placed under house arrest.', 'After a martini-induced rampage, a fantasy-prone young woman is placed under house arrest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hTNAKGnqi8v4FRPEjm9Wl5S5yMz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18408'),
  ('128430013706935121', 'Chernobyl Diaries', 2012, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Morten Søborg, Vesna Milic, James Andrew Haven', 'Shane van Dyke, Carey van Dyke, Oren Peli', 'Olivia Taylor Dudley, Jesse McCartney, Devin Kelley, Jonathan Sadowski, Ingrid Bolsø Berdal, Nathan Phillips, Alex Feldman, Milutin Milošević', 'R', 'A group of six tourists looking to go off the beaten path, hire an ''extreme tour guide'' who, ignoring warnings, takes them into the city of Pripyat, the former home to the workers of the Chernobyl nuclear reactor, but now a deserted town since the disaster more than 25 years earlier. After a brief exploration of the abandoned city, the group members find themselves stranded, only to discover that they are not alone.', 'A group of six tourists looking to go off the beaten path, hire an ''extreme tour guide'' who, ignoring warnings, takes them into the city of Pripyat, the former home to the workers of the Chernobyl nuclear reactor, but now a deserted town since the disaster more than 25 years earlier. After a brief exploration of the abandoned city, the group members find themselves stranded, only to discover that they are not alone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9AKhThGA8IATBy3gR7I4dw9SEc4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93856'),
  ('175584905176104378', 'Chernobyl: Abyss', 2021, 'Drama, History, Action', 'Natalya Krimenskaya, Alexey Smolyar, Anna Filippova', 'Alexey Kazakov, Elena Ivanova', 'Danila Kozlovsky, Oksana Akinshina, Philipp Avdeev, Ravshana Kurkova, Arthur Beschastny, Nikolay Kozak, Igor Chernevich, Anton Shvarts', 'PG', 'The aftermath of a shocking explosion at the Chernobyl nuclear power station made hundreds of people sacrifice their lives to clean up the site of the catastrophe and to successfully prevent an even bigger disaster that could have turned a large part of the European continent into an uninhabitable exclusion zone. This is their story.', 'The aftermath of a shocking explosion at the Chernobyl nuclear power station made hundreds of people sacrifice their lives to clean up the site of the catastrophe and to successfully prevent an even bigger disaster that could have turned a large part of the European continent into an uninhabitable exclusion zone. This is their story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AmJLuHjxPdIJO6vmymeWADG6jK5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:589761'),
  ('162811827013961746', 'Chernobyl: The Final Warning', 1991, 'Drama, History, TV Movie', 'Anthony Page, Ray Goode', 'Ernest Kinoy', 'Jon Voight, Jason Robards, Sammi Davis, Annette Crosbie, Ian McDiarmid, Vincent Riotta, Steven Hartley, Jim Ishida', null, 'True story about the tragic nuclear power plant accident in Chernobyl.', 'True story about the tragic nuclear power plant accident in Chernobyl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rp0JLxFpPJShwhfvi8VG6uDNep7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137831'),
  ('15867420608713182', 'Chernobyl: The Lost Tapes', 2022, 'Documentary', 'James Jones', null, 'Ronald Reagan, Mikhail Gorbachev', null, 'Thirty-six years after the Chernobyl nuclear reactor exploded in Soviet Ukraine, newly uncovered archival footage and recorded interviews with those who were present paint an emotional and gripping portrait of the extent and gravity of the disaster and the lengths to which the Soviet government went to cover up the incident, including the soldiers sent in to “liquidate” the damage. Chernobyl: The Lost Tapes is the full, unvarnished true story of what happened in one of the least understood tragedies of the twentieth century.', 'Thirty-six years after the Chernobyl nuclear reactor exploded in Soviet Ukraine, newly uncovered archival footage and recorded interviews with those who were present paint an emotional and gripping portrait of the extent and gravity of the disaster and the lengths to which the Soviet government went to cover up the incident, including the soldiers sent in to “liquidate” the damage. Chernobyl: The Lost Tapes is the full, unvarnished true story of what happened in one of the least understood tragedies of the twentieth century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9GGZtNp23SXFbzeCIZb93KwYzPN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:944625'),
  ('110200136287120090', 'Cherry', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Jeffrey Fine, Marvin V. Rush', 'Jeffrey Fine', 'Kyle Gallner, Laura Allen, Britt Robertson, Matt Walsh, Esai Morales, D.C. Pierson, Zosia Mamet, Stephanie Venditto', 'R', 'Ivy League Freshman, Aaron Milton (17) gets a different kind of education when he falls for Linda (34) a vivacious former wild-child who has returned to college to straighten out her life. The curriculum gets more challenging when Aaron meets Linda''s sarcastic 14 year-old daughter, Beth - who quickly develops a crush on him. The math doesn''t work in either direction but the dysfunctional triangle becomes a learning experience for all involved.', 'Ivy League Freshman, Aaron Milton (17) gets a different kind of education when he falls for Linda (34) a vivacious former wild-child who has returned to college to straighten out her life. The curriculum gets more challenging when Aaron meets Linda''s sarcastic 14 year-old daughter, Beth - who quickly develops a crush on him. The math doesn''t work in either direction but the dysfunctional triangle becomes a learning experience for all involved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sTlOUvhrsiGdtwVKbdlB5pAdE2U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47320'),
  ('519596778847033452', 'Cherry', 2021, 'Drama, Crime', 'Joe Russo, Anthony Russo, Newton Thomas Sigel', 'Jessica Goldberg, Angela Russo-Otstot', 'Tom Holland, Ciara Bravo, Jack Reynor, Michael Rispoli, Jeffrey Wahlberg, Forrest Goodluck, Michael Gandolfini, Suhail Dabbach', 'R', 'Cherry drifts from college dropout to army medic in Iraq—anchored only by his one true love, Emily. But after returning from the war with PTSD, his life spirals into drugs and crime as he struggles to find his place in the world.', 'Cherry drifts from college dropout to army medic in Iraq—anchored only by his one true love, Emily. But after returning from the war with PTSD, his life spirals into drugs and crime as he struggles to find his place in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pwDvkDyaHEU9V7cApQhbcSJMG1w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:544401'),
  ('818945190557249911', 'Cherry 2000', 1987, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Jacques Haitkin, Steve De Jarnatt, Jane Jenkins', 'Michael Almereyda', 'Melanie Griffith, David Andrews, Pamela Gidley, Ben Johnson, Marshall Bell, Harry Carey, Jr., Laurence Fishburne, Michael C. Gwynne', 'PG-13', 'When successful businessman Sam Treadwell finds that his android wife, Cherry model 2000 has blown a fuse, he hires sexy renegade tracker E. Johnson to find her exact duplicate. But as their journey to replace his perfect mate leads them into the treacherous and lawless region of ''The Zone'', Treadwell learns the hard way that the perfect woman is made not of computer chips and diodes.', 'When successful businessman Sam Treadwell finds that his android wife, Cherry model 2000 has blown a fuse, he hires sexy renegade tracker E. Johnson to find her exact duplicate. But as their journey to replace his perfect mate leads them into the treacherous and lawless region of ''The Zone'', Treadwell learns the hard way that the perfect woman is made not of computer chips and diodes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t3uds00MHLsibhKLCL0BbCEGxXb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15785'),
  ('1032652410620500480', 'Cherry Blossoms', 2008, 'Drama, Romance', 'Doris Dörrie, Hanno Lentz, Ruth Stadler', 'Doris Dörrie', 'Elmar Wepper, Hannelore Elsner, Nadja Uhl, Maximilian Brückner, Aya Irizuki, Birgit Minichmayr, Felix Eitner, Floriane Daniel', null, 'After finding out that her husband, Rudi, has a fatal illness, Trudi Angermeier arranges a trip to Berlin so they can see their children. Of course, the kids don''t know the real reason they''re visiting -- and the catch is, neither does Rudi...', 'After finding out that her husband, Rudi, has a fatal illness, Trudi Angermeier arranges a trip to Berlin so they can see their children. Of course, the kids don''t know the real reason they''re visiting -- and the catch is, neither does Rudi...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xiBgWmeYFVjo4tHaZYvN7k36dWH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6461'),
  ('761115914256789143', 'Cherry Blossoms & Demons', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Hanno Lentz, Doris Dörrie', 'Doris Dörrie', 'Golo Euler, Aya Irizuki, Elmar Wepper, Hannelore Elsner, Floriane Daniel, Felix Eitner, Birgit Minichmayr, Sophie Rogall', null, 'When everything in his life seems to be going wrong, downtrodden and alcohol-dependent Karl has a fateful encounter in Munich with Yu, a mysterious Japanese dancer from his father’s past. Unexpectedly, Yu begins to help Karl confront his demons (both literal and figurative) and begin to heal.', 'When everything in his life seems to be going wrong, downtrodden and alcohol-dependent Karl has a fateful encounter in Munich with Yu, a mysterious Japanese dancer from his father’s past. Unexpectedly, Yu begins to help Karl confront his demons (both literal and figurative) and begin to heal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ff9NnRE061fJc9tSeFEhkPkatDW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:566420'),
  ('925577575272209555', 'Cherry Crush', 2007, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Nicholas DiBella, Tim Wainwright', 'Nicholas DiBella, Paul Root', 'Nikki Reed, Jonathan Tucker, Julie Gonzalo, Haviland Morris, Dennis Boutsikaris, Frank Whaley, Alessa Neeck, Michael O''Keefe', 'R', 'A high school photographer breaks his own rules and falls in love with his teenage model.', 'A high school photographer breaks his own rules and falls in love with his teenage model.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2qfRDQgQ6eZGInAi9TlI6hROLRp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14127'),
  ('856186934601123542', 'Cherry Falls', 2000, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Geoffrey Wright, Anthony B. Richmond, Jody Spilkoman', 'Ken Selden', 'Brittany Murphy, Jay Mohr, Michael Biehn, Jesse Bradford, Candy Clark, Gabriel Mann, Amanda Anka, Joannah Portman', 'R', 'When students in the small town of Cherry Falls learn a serial killer is targeting virgins, they realize their only chance of survival is to throw a “Pop Your Cherry” party.', 'When students in the small town of Cherry Falls learn a serial killer is targeting virgins, they realize their only chance of survival is to throw a “Pop Your Cherry” party.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hIvskDmQKbvOBpeGaH2OkRg495M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12619'),
  ('642328602528399740', 'Cherry Magic! THE MOVIE', 2022, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Hiroki Kazama', 'Riko Sakaguchi', 'Eiji Akaso, Keita Machida, Kodai Asaka, Yutaro, Takuya Kusakawa, Ryo Sato, Suzunosuke Tanaka', null, 'Still able to read minds, Adachi''s blissful new relationship with his dreamy colleague faces a major challenge when they''re forced to go long-distance.', 'Still able to read minds, Adachi''s blissful new relationship with his dreamy colleague faces a major challenge when they''re forced to go long-distance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9atxF5V7gUC3x5CFHYmsnjJGyV8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:926916'),
  ('1007724995407726606', 'Cherry on the Cake', 2012, 'Drama', 'Laura Morante, Maurizio Calvesi', 'Daniele Costantini, Laura Morante', 'Laura Morante, Isabelle Carré, Pascal Elbé, Samir Guesmi, Frédéric Pierrot, Patrice Thibaud, Loucilia Clément, Ennio Fantastichini', null, 'Amanda believes men are too complicated and has lost faith finding the perfect one. Her friend and a psychoanalyst have a plan how to make her fall in love. She insists that Amanda not stay home alone on New Year''s Eve, and only gets her way after swearing that all the other guests will be couples, except for Maxime, a gay colleague. But Maxime leaves at the last minute to join his lover in Amsterdam, and Antoine, recently separated from his wife, arrives alone at the party.', 'Amanda believes men are too complicated and has lost faith finding the perfect one. Her friend and a psychoanalyst have a plan how to make her fall in love. She insists that Amanda not stay home alone on New Year''s Eve, and only gets her way after swearing that all the other guests will be couples, except for Maxime, a gay colleague. But Maxime leaves at the last minute to join his lover in Amsterdam, and Antoine, recently separated from his wife, arrives alone at the party.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p3sILOhLa5vXSYLnfizh4PJ0OhO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109154'),
  ('611936897898232402', 'Cherry Pop', 2017, 'Comedy, Music', 'Assaad Yacoub, Prince Domonick, Palesa Lebona', 'Nick Landa', 'Lars Berge, Detox, Tempest DuJour, Bob the Drag Queen, Misty Violet, Mayhem Miller, Latrice Royale, Toccara Jones', null, 'When Zaza, headliner of a weekly drag show, ''CHERRY POP'', refuses to come out of her dressing room, all hell breaks loose backstage. A young newcomer, The Cherry, is hiding a huge secret from the girls while getting ready for his debut performance.', 'When Zaza, headliner of a weekly drag show, ''CHERRY POP'', refuses to come out of her dressing room, all hell breaks loose backstage. A young newcomer, The Cherry, is hiding a huge secret from the girls while getting ready for his debut performance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/egonvS0GnvrswGTJhGBRqXaI6ZL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:442896'),
  ('562254815126202144', 'Cherry Tree Lane', 2010, 'Crime, Thriller, Horror', 'Paul Andrew Williams', 'Paul Andrew Williams', 'Rachael Blake, Jennie Jacques, Tom Kane, Tom Butcher, Ashley Chin, Jumayn Hunter, Sonny Muslim, Corinne Douglas', 'R', 'Prosperous professional couple Mike and Christine are settling in for a standard evening of wine, TV and low-level marital hostility when a ring on their doorbell changes everything. Turns out their son Sebastian is in a little trouble with some local boys, who are quite prepared to camp out and wait for him to get home ... the resulting culture-clash chamber drama is raw, revealing and nerve-splittingly tense.', 'Prosperous professional couple Mike and Christine are settling in for a standard evening of wine, TV and low-level marital hostility when a ring on their doorbell changes everything. Turns out their son Sebastian is in a little trouble with some local boys, who are quite prepared to camp out and wait for him to get home ... the resulting culture-clash chamber drama is raw, revealing and nerve-splittingly tense.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nx15pr00KmnWqOdGUltMrdaMCev.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47259'),
  ('604057103953651767', 'Cherry, Harry & Raquel!', 1969, 'Action, Comedy', 'Russ Meyer, Russ Meyer', 'Tom McGowan', 'Larissa Ely, Linda Ashton, Charles Napier, Bert Santos, Frank Bolger, Uschi Digard, Michelle Grand, John Koester', null, 'In a small border town, a sheriff and his ''associate'', involved in an operation in which they divert marijuana through the border, must kill another smuggler who has gone into business for himself.', 'In a small border town, a sheriff and his ''associate'', involved in an operation in which they divert marijuana through the border, must kill another smuggler who has gone into business for himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gzPVbOSvGuS0KWBA8wf4omeFF4i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5742'),
  ('819810139723312883', 'Cherrybomb', 2009, 'Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Lisa Barros D''Sa, Glenn Leyburn', 'Daragh Carville', 'Rupert Grint, Robert Sheehan, James Nesbitt, Niamh Quinn, Paul Kennedy, Conor MacNeill, Greer Taylor Ellison, Kimberley Nixon', 'R', 'Teenagers Luke, Malachy, and Michelle embark on a wild weekend of drink, drugs, shop-lifting and stealing cars. But what starts out as a game turns deadly serious when the three discover that they can''t get off the wild ride they''ve set in motion.', 'Teenagers Luke, Malachy, and Michelle embark on a wild weekend of drink, drugs, shop-lifting and stealing cars. But what starts out as a game turns deadly serious when the three discover that they can''t get off the wild ride they''ve set in motion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q3NdckfHKjXyrsRNoZyAidMf9em.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40850'),
  ('968187618265734438', 'Chers parents', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Emmanuel Patron, Antoine Monod, Laurent Lecêtre', 'Emmanuel Patron, Armelle Patron', 'André Dussollier, Miou-Miou, Arnaud Ducret, Thomas Solivérès, Pauline Clément, Frédérique Tirmont, Bernard Alane', null, 'A trio of siblings faces turmoil when their parents reveal they''ve won the lottery but refuse to share a cent, unraveling buried secrets, unspoken tensions, and deep-seated jealousy that shake the family to its core.', 'A trio of siblings faces turmoil when their parents reveal they''ve won the lottery but refuse to share a cent, unraveling buried secrets, unspoken tensions, and deep-seated jealousy that shake the family to its core.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dOTZP3gnMjJHva914Xrzljhyl7c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1368830'),
  ('491232368255426816', 'Chespirito: El Niño Que Somos', 2001, 'Documentary', 'Diana Roldán', null, 'Roberto Gómez Bolaños, Florinda Meza García, Ramón Valdés, Carlos Villagrán, María Antonieta de las Nieves, Angelines Fernández, Rubén Aguirre, Edgar Vivar', null, 'As a child, Roberto Gómez Bolaños dreamed of being a soccer player or an engineer; acting seemed ridiculous to him. But as time went by he discovered his true calling. First as a writer and then as an actor, he gave life to several characters, including two of the most popular in the history of Mexican television.', 'As a child, Roberto Gómez Bolaños dreamed of being a soccer player or an engineer; acting seemed ridiculous to him. But as time went by he discovered his true calling. First as a writer and then as an actor, he gave life to several characters, including two of the most popular in the history of Mexican television.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fBK5YTjBtyNTyToENeuSQHmLtgF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:547513'),
  ('1124416816200104181', 'Chess Fever', 1925, 'Comedy', 'Vsevolod Pudovkin, B. Sveshnikov, Anatoli Golovnya', 'Mykola Shpykovskyi', 'Vladimir Fogel, Anna Zemtsova, Natalya Glan, Mikhail Zharov, Anatoli Ktorov, José Raúl Capablanca, Yakov Protazanov, Yuli Raizman', null, 'With an international chess tournament in progress, a young man becomes completely obsessed with the game. His fiancée has no interest in it, and becomes frustrated and depressed by his neglect of her, but wherever she goes she finds that she cannot escape chess. On the brink of giving up, she meets the world champion, Capablanca himself, with interesting results.', 'With an international chess tournament in progress, a young man becomes completely obsessed with the game. His fiancée has no interest in it, and becomes frustrated and depressed by his neglect of her, but wherever she goes she finds that she cannot escape chess. On the brink of giving up, she meets the world champion, Capablanca himself, with interesting results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jiQmwTB8iTPghllOnVLpbKUoxo2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51892'),
