  ('441508373234214726', 'Chevalier', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Athina Rachel Tsangari, Christos Karamanis, Emmanuela Fragiadaki', 'Athina Rachel Tsangari, Efthimis Filippou', 'Vangelis Mourikis, Makis Papadimitriou, Sakis Rouvas, Kostas Filippoglou, Panos Koronis, Yiorgos Kendros, Giannis Drakopoulos, Nikos Orphanos', null, 'In the middle of the Aegean Sea, six men on a fishing trip on a luxury yacht decide to play a game. During this game, things will be compared. Things will be measured. Songs will be butchered, and blood will be tested. Friends will become rivals and rivals will become hungry. But at the end of the journey, when the game is over, the man who wins will be the best man. And he will wear on his smallest finger the victory ring: the Chevalier.', 'In the middle of the Aegean Sea, six men on a fishing trip on a luxury yacht decide to play a game. During this game, things will be compared. Things will be measured. Songs will be butchered, and blood will be tested. Friends will become rivals and rivals will become hungry. But at the end of the journey, when the game is over, the man who wins will be the best man. And he will wear on his smallest finger the victory ring: the Chevalier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/RnL5hL9f5tZl84Mqf9EtYaSY2V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:314220'),
  ('1008178604120734748', 'Chevalier', 2023, 'Music, Drama, History', 'Stephen Williams, Frantisek Weber, Daniel Vaclavik', 'Stefani Robinson', 'Kelvin Harrison Jr., Samara Weaving, Lucy Boynton, Alex Fitzalan, Minnie Driver, Sian Clifford, Henry Lloyd-Hughes, Marton Csokas', 'PG-13', 'The illegitimate son of an African slave and a French plantation owner, Joseph Bologne rises to improbable heights in French society as a celebrated violinist-composer and fencer, complete with an ill-fated love affair and a falling out with Marie Antoinette and her court.', 'The illegitimate son of an African slave and a French plantation owner, Joseph Bologne rises to improbable heights in French society as a celebrated violinist-composer and fencer, complete with an ill-fated love affair and a falling out with Marie Antoinette and her court.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iLhp2fqA0VDIhnC20QHDnw5Yrcf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:812635'),
  ('312402557210321287', 'Chevrotine', 2022, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Laetitia Masson, Emmanuelle Collinot', 'Laetitia Masson', 'Élodie Bouchez, Rafi Pitts, Aurore Clément, Jérôme Kircher, Ernest Cereijo, Max Rutkowski, Roman Williams, Luz Sanchez Godin', null, 'Pierre is still mourning his dead wife when he meets Laura, a joyful and sensual woman with whom he will have a new child, little Autumn. But will this passionate and unexpected love be able to resist the demons of the past?', 'Pierre is still mourning his dead wife when he meets Laura, a joyful and sensual woman with whom he will have a new child, little Autumn. But will this passionate and unexpected love be able to resist the demons of the past?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/boM9GYVO67txpsL48CEwc0fVuCX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:926615'),
  ('801021090750618477', 'Chew-Chew Baby', 1945, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Shamus Culhane', null, 'Mel Blanc, Ben Hardaway, Hans Conried, Jack Mather', 'NR', 'Boarding house proprietor Wally Walrus takes out an ad in the local paper looking for a sweetheart. Woody Woodpecker reads this and decides he might be able to trick Wally out of some cooking if he dresses up like a girl and answers the ad.', 'Boarding house proprietor Wally Walrus takes out an ad in the local paper looking for a sweetheart. Woody Woodpecker reads this and decides he might be able to trick Wally out of some cooking if he dresses up like a girl and answers the ad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tTphrynlVO75iIZinWJfStRG2FC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85936'),
  ('254972902584000882', 'Chewingum', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Giuseppe Maccari, Biagio Proietti', 'Osvaldo De Micheli, Biagio Proietti', 'Mauro Di Francesco, Isabella Ferrari, Massimo Ciavarro, Mara Venier, Fabrizio Temperini, Orsetta Gregoretti, Liliana Eritrei, Anna Melato', null, 'Geared to a teen and pre-teen audience, this juvenile romance is set in the last year of high school and involves the attraction between Isabella, a beautiful newcomer to the school, and Massimo, an introverted, hard-working young student .', 'Geared to a teen and pre-teen audience, this juvenile romance is set in the last year of high school and involves the attraction between Isabella, a beautiful newcomer to the school, and Massimo, an introverted, hard-working young student .', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xLwppJC7O99lbUvjjUpJdF6j06.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103343'),
  ('43825227354421726', 'Cheyenne', 1947, 'Western', 'Raoul Walsh, Sidney Hickox, Ridgeway Callow', 'Alan Le May, Thames Williamson', 'Dennis Morgan, Jane Wyman, Janis Paige, Bruce Bennett, Alan Hale, Arthur Kennedy, Barton MacLane, Tom Tyler', 'NR', 'Slick gambler James Wylie is apprehended by the law and given the option to forgo a prison sentence if he poses as a bandit. His mission is to uncover the identity of the Poet, a notorious outlaw who has been holding up bank-owned stagecoaches and leaving verses at the crime scenes to taunt the authorities. James finds time to woo the Poet''s lovely wife, Ann, who initially cold-shoulders him. But, as a romance develops, they partner up to find the robber.', 'Slick gambler James Wylie is apprehended by the law and given the option to forgo a prison sentence if he poses as a bandit. His mission is to uncover the identity of the Poet, a notorious outlaw who has been holding up bank-owned stagecoaches and leaving verses at the crime scenes to taunt the authorities. James finds time to woo the Poet''s lovely wife, Ann, who initially cold-shoulders him. But, as a romance develops, they partner up to find the robber.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/57zUuw2dQQBUTEwE0hvLdZRIeYZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175386'),
  ('834113309146382294', 'Cheyenne Autumn', 1964, 'Western', 'John Ford, William H. Clothier, Ray Kellogg', 'James R. Webb', 'Richard Widmark, Carroll Baker, Karl Malden, Sal Mineo, Dolores del Río, Ricardo Montalban, Gilbert Roland, Arthur Kennedy', null, 'A reluctant cavalry Captain must track a defiant tribe of migrating Cheyenne.', 'A reluctant cavalry Captain must track a defiant tribe of migrating Cheyenne.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kYc1NuT9Cvm6GHAdf5nlEXb3evl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40630'),
  ('423527040543816569', 'Cheyenne Warrior', 1994, 'Western, TV Movie', 'Mark Griffiths', 'Michael B. Druxman', 'Kelly Preston, Bo Hopkins, Dan Haggerty, Clint Howard, Pato Hoffmann, Nik Winterhawk, Patricia Van Ingen, Frankie Avina', 'PG', 'An interracial love story, set in the turbulent wild west, stirs up tensions between the Indians and the settlers.', 'An interracial love story, set in the turbulent wild west, stirs up tensions between the Indians and the settlers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wzgdLPqPPMqFAKF9oBRxrm8g28u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60563'),
  ('760453527845778330', 'Chez Gino', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Samuel Benchetrit, Guillaume Schiffman', 'Samuel Benchetrit, Gábor Rassov', 'José Garcia, Anna Mouglalis, Samuel Benchetrit, Sergi López, Ben Gazzara, Adèle Exarchopoulos, Martin Jobert, Serge Larivière', null, 'Gino Roma holds a pizzeria for thirty years in Brussels, purchased with money from his wife Simone. His quiet life is turned upside down when he learns of the imminent death of his uncle, godfather of the Mafia, Italian billionaire with a promised big inheritance. Gino must prove to his uncle that he is a formidable godfather reigning on Brussels pizzerias, ordering a director, a documentary to present it as a major mobster. Nothing happens quite as planned: Gino family does not quite agree and the crew is not "open" to Gino orders, taking his new role very seriously, especially as the comedy soon attracts the malevolent eye of a true thug.', 'Gino Roma holds a pizzeria for thirty years in Brussels, purchased with money from his wife Simone. His quiet life is turned upside down when he learns of the imminent death of his uncle, godfather of the Mafia, Italian billionaire with a promised big inheritance. Gino must prove to his uncle that he is a formidable godfather reigning on Brussels pizzerias, ordering a director, a documentary to present it as a major mobster. Nothing happens quite as planned: Gino family does not quite agree and the crew is not "open" to Gino orders, taking his new role very seriously, especially as the comedy soon attracts the malevolent eye of a true thug.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uULb4cIkCCzmQbOwPaIRXhcohUe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74848'),
  ('37703383509377886', 'Chhaava', 2025, 'History, Action, Drama', 'Laxman Utekar, Vaibhav Vishant, Saurabh Goswami', 'Rishi Virmani, Laxman Utekar, Kaustubh J. Savarkar', 'Vicky Kaushal, Rashmika Mandanna, Akshaye Khanna, Ashutosh Rana, Divya Dutta, Pradeep Ram Singh Rawat, Vineet Kumar Singh, Neil Bhoopalam', null, 'Shivaji''s death sparks the Maratha-Mughal conflict. His son Sambhaji leads resistance against Aurangzeb''s forces. Amid battles and intrigue, both sides face challenges in a struggle for power.', 'Shivaji''s death sparks the Maratha-Mughal conflict. His son Sambhaji leads resistance against Aurangzeb''s forces. Amid battles and intrigue, both sides face challenges in a struggle for power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ubRsrzb6NRW8YhVTJ6jG1kpNvCi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1196943'),
  ('42524450955786694', 'Chhalaang', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Eeshit Narain, Hansal Mehta, Harpal Singh', 'Luv Ranjan, Aseem Arora, Zeishan Quadri', 'Rajkummar Rao, Nushrratt Bharuccha, Mohammed Zeeshan Ayyub, Saurabh Shukla, Satish Kaushik, Ila Arun, Jatin Sarna, Baljinder Kaur', null, 'Chhalaang humorously addresses the value of Sports Education in the school curriculum. It follows a hilarious, yet an inspirational journey of a typical PT Master from a semi government-funded school in Northern India, Montu, for whom it’s just a job and is forced to do what he has never done - Teach.', 'Chhalaang humorously addresses the value of Sports Education in the school curriculum. It follows a hilarious, yet an inspirational journey of a typical PT Master from a semi government-funded school in Northern India, Montu, for whom it’s just a job and is forced to do what he has never done - Teach.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AcWLGCxCMOeHs1vqMplBIzQ6ME5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:667585'),
  ('455535873413929577', 'Chhapaak', 2020, 'Drama', 'Meghna Gulzar, Malay Prakash, Ghazal Javed', 'Meghna Gulzar, Atika Chohan', 'Deepika Padukone, Vikrant Massey, Madhurjeet Sarghi, Anand Tiwari, Vaibhavi Upadhyay, Payal Nair, Geeta Agrawal Sharma, Delzad Hiwale', null, 'A true story based on acid attack survivor Malti''s grueling and glorious journey from her medical treatment, court proceedings leading to her emotional healing.', 'A true story based on acid attack survivor Malti''s grueling and glorious journey from her medical treatment, court proceedings leading to her emotional healing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cr5KqiolMMRUEJxrNLWESxyVVeU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:590404'),
  ('713604518605643538', 'Chhichhore', 2019, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Amalendu Chaudhary, Nitesh Tiwari, Riya Kulkarni', 'Nitesh Tiwari, Piyush Gupta, Nikhil Mehrotra', 'Sushant Singh Rajput, Shraddha Kapoor, Tahir Raj Bhasin, Varun Sharma, Naveen Polishetty, Tushar Pandey, Saharsh Kumar Shukla, Prateik Smita Patil', null, 'Following a group of friends from university as they progress into middle-age life and go their own separate ways.', 'Following a group of friends from university as they progress into middle-age life and go their own separate ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cGDPQtQ5igtPMt3oJ6BCAor6dFp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:596650'),
  ('44674585459776207', 'Chhorii', 2021, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Utkarsh Bhardwaj, Vishal Furia, Anshul Chobey', 'Vishal Kapoor', 'Nushrratt Bharuccha, Mita Vashisht, Rajesh Jais, Saurabh Goyal, Pallavi Ajay Patil, Yaaneea Bhardwaj', null, 'Sakshi is eight months pregnant with her first child when she and Hemant are forced out of their home. They escape from the city and seek refuge in a house located deep inside sugarcane fields. The house is ridden with dark secrets that start unravelling as the story unfolds, posing a threat to Sakshi and her unborn child. Even as Sakshi tries to save herself and her unborn baby, scary sightings of three mysterious kids and a charred monster coupled with an eerie lullaby, emanating from an old transistor, wreak havoc with her sanity.', 'Sakshi is eight months pregnant with her first child when she and Hemant are forced out of their home. They escape from the city and seek refuge in a house located deep inside sugarcane fields. The house is ridden with dark secrets that start unravelling as the story unfolds, posing a threat to Sakshi and her unborn child. Even as Sakshi tries to save herself and her unborn baby, scary sightings of three mysterious kids and a charred monster coupled with an eerie lullaby, emanating from an old transistor, wreak havoc with her sanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sXMwQnF7yEgCY0AwjG49vK1t4dz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:711643'),
  ('301973412986159037', 'Chhorii 2', 2025, 'Horror, Drama', 'Vishal Furia', 'Ajit Jagtap, Vishal Furia, Divya Prakash Dubey', 'Nushrratt Bharuccha, Soha Ali Khan, Pallavi Patil, Saurabh Goyal, Shyam Gopal, Kuldeep Sareen, Hardika Sharma', null, 'Sakshi must rescue her seven year old daughter from being sacrificed by an evil cult to satisfy their resident leader, while fighting societal superstitions and the horror that continues to haunt her and young women around her.', 'Sakshi must rescue her seven year old daughter from being sacrificed by an evil cult to satisfy their resident leader, while fighting societal superstitions and the horror that continues to haunt her and young women around her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mCgKANxZJW645pXdmJdBb4ysRPk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1084031'),
  ('93818342504484369', 'Chhoti Si Baat', 1976, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Basu Chatterjee', 'Sharad Joshi', 'Amol Palekar, Vidya Sinha, Ashok Kumar, Asrani, C.S. Dubey, Nandita Thakur, Rajan Haksar, Ashim Kumar', null, 'Arun is a timid accountant in Bombay who dreams of romancing Prabha, but is too shy to share his feelings. While Arun twiddles his thumbs, the suave Nagesh steps into the picture and turns on the heat, prompting Arun to take "love coaching" from "romance specialist" Julius Nagendranath to win Prabha back.', 'Arun is a timid accountant in Bombay who dreams of romancing Prabha, but is too shy to share his feelings. While Arun twiddles his thumbs, the suave Nagesh steps into the picture and turns on the heat, prompting Arun to take "love coaching" from "romance specialist" Julius Nagendranath to win Prabha back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eyBoAbb7FimutcqGAww8w82WmvF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71756'),
  ('925131686447584778', 'Chi m''ha visto', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Giulio Cupperi, Ilaria Schipa, Alessandro Pondi', 'Giuseppe Fiorello, Alessandro Pondi, Paolo Logli', 'Pierfrancesco Favino, Giuseppe Fiorello, Mariela Garriga, Dino Abbrescia, Mariolina De Fano, Michele Sinisi, Maurizio Lombardi, Oriana Celentano', null, 'Working in the shadows of music stars, a gifted guitarist returns to his hometown and decides to stage a disappearing act in order to propel him to fame.', 'Working in the shadows of music stars, a gifted guitarist returns to his hometown and decides to stage a disappearing act in order to propel him to fame.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Dbb7qveSMQpY14wVXYRgWtuwbx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:478434'),
