  ('923131089327401437', 'Chiara', 2022, 'Drama', 'Susanna Nicchiarelli, Crystel Fournier, Nicola Scorza', 'Susanna Nicchiarelli', 'Margherita Mazzucco, Andrea Carpenzano, Carlotta Natoli, Paola Tiziana Cruciani, Flaminia Mancin, Valentino Campitelli, Paolo Briguglia, Giulia Testi', null, 'Assisi, 1211. Chiara is eighteen years old and one night she runs away from home to join her friend Francesco: from that moment on her life changes forever. With charisma and conviction, she breaks free from her family''s constraints and stands up to the Pope himself. She fights for herself, for the women who join her and for her dream of freedom. The story of a Saint. The story of a girl and her revolution.', 'Assisi, 1211. Chiara is eighteen years old and one night she runs away from home to join her friend Francesco: from that moment on her life changes forever. With charisma and conviction, she breaks free from her family''s constraints and stands up to the Pope himself. She fights for herself, for the women who join her and for her dream of freedom. The story of a Saint. The story of a girl and her revolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sNGONEgXZiYx994U54DoynrfmuZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:910782'),
  ('750720299019237429', 'Chiara e Francesco', 2007, 'History', 'Fabrizio Costa, Giovanni Galasso', 'Francesco Arlanch', 'Ettore Bassi, Maria P. Petruolo, Gabriele Cirilli, Ivano Marescotti, Luigi Diberti, Antonella Fattori, Lando Buzzanca, Ángela Molina', null, 'Italy, XIII century. The story of friendship between two young people who dedicated their lives to God and others: St. Francis and St. Clare of Assisi. Children of the bourgeoisie and the nobility, respectively, gave up their lives accommodated by a life of sacrifice, humility and proselytizing ...', 'Italy, XIII century. The story of friendship between two young people who dedicated their lives to God and others: St. Francis and St. Clare of Assisi. Children of the bourgeoisie and the nobility, respectively, gave up their lives accommodated by a life of sacrifice, humility and proselytizing ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ZTvl9w0BGniQVu2rBD48QsnjlP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138129'),
  ('574786202252964595', 'Chiara Ferragni: Unposted', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Elisa Amoruso, Martina Cocco', 'Elisa Amoruso', 'Chiara Ferragni, Fedez, Paris Hilton, Delphine Arnault, Derek Blasberg, Silvia Avallone', null, 'Chiara Ferragni, the first fashion influencer in the world, reveals how the digital revolution has changes business world, communication, fashion, culture, through a portrait in which she''s the protagonist, both as a woman and as digital entrepreneur.', 'Chiara Ferragni, the first fashion influencer in the world, reveals how the digital revolution has changes business world, communication, fashion, culture, through a portrait in which she''s the protagonist, both as a woman and as digital entrepreneur.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aJaJrgexnUjL1dEGMJQoLIvBjuu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:618253'),
  ('680334351873556653', 'Chiara Lubich - L''amore vince tutto', 2021, 'Drama, History', 'Giacomo Campiotti, Stefano Ricciotti', 'Lea Tafuri, Luisa Cotta Ramosino, Giacomo Campiotti', 'Cristiana Capotondi, Aurora Ruffino, Eugenio Franceschini, Greta Ferro, Valentina Ghelfi, Andrea Tidona, Paolo Graziosi, Roberto Citran', null, 'Chiara is a young teacher who lives the horror of war trying desperately to make sense of what is happening. In the aftermath of the armistice, plagued by a thousand doubts and a thousand questions, while she wanders through the bombed-out city, she stops in front of a statue of the Madonna and realizes that God is the only ideal that has not collapsed. Thus she chooses to live the Gospel concretely with a single mission: to ensure that "all may be one".', 'Chiara is a young teacher who lives the horror of war trying desperately to make sense of what is happening. In the aftermath of the armistice, plagued by a thousand doubts and a thousand questions, while she wanders through the bombed-out city, she stops in front of a statue of the Madonna and realizes that God is the only ideal that has not collapsed. Thus she chooses to live the Gospel concretely with a single mission: to ensure that "all may be one".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Wji6CNwO4zzsx8pxV5nOOmIa0N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:782220'),
  ('57312164460115077', 'Chibi Maruko-chan: The Boy from Italy', 2015, 'Family, Animation, Comedy', 'Yasunori Honda, Jun Takagi', 'Momoko Sakura', 'TARAKO, Tomoko Naka, Tsutomu Kashiwakura, Masami Kikuchi, Naoko Watanabe, Nobuo Tobita, Miki Narahashi, Chafurin', null, 'Students from five different countries arrive in Maruko''s town. Maruko and her classmates can barely contain their curiosity, and their new friends are full of surprises. And Maruko''s family will house a boy from Italy!', 'Students from five different countries arrive in Maruko''s town. Maruko and her classmates can barely contain their curiosity, and their new friends are full of surprises. And Maruko''s family will house a boy from Italy!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r76KIpWZE9hueyvp3Lnup1hqOnS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:411614'),
  ('299485085006150094', 'Chic!', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Jérôme Cornuau, Stéphane Cami', 'Jean-Paul Bathany', 'Fanny Ardant, Marina Hands, Éric Elmosnino, Laurent Stocker, Catherine Hosmalin, Philippe Duquesne, India Hair, Clémence Bretécher', null, 'Helene must act as a matchmaker for her world famous fashion designer boss, Alicia Ricosi.', 'Helene must act as a matchmaker for her world famous fashion designer boss, Alicia Ricosi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j001jrNNlOBXPyCPcldtSQqVWYv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:314490'),
  ('788335546637063711', 'Chicago', 1927, 'Comedy, Drama, Crime', 'Frank Urson, Roy Burns, J. Peverell Marley', 'Lenore J. Coffee', 'Phyllis Haver, Victor Varconi, Virginia Bradford, Robert Edeson, Eugene Pallette, Warner Richmond, T. Roy Barnes, Clarence Burton', null, 'Based on a true story, two-timing boozing wife Roxie Hart kills her lover in cold blood after he leaves her, and finagles her way out being indicted. The basis for Kander/Ebb''s 1975 Broadway musical of the same name and its Oscar-winning 2002 film adaptation.', 'Based on a true story, two-timing boozing wife Roxie Hart kills her lover in cold blood after he leaves her, and finagles her way out being indicted. The basis for Kander/Ebb''s 1975 Broadway musical of the same name and its Oscar-winning 2002 film adaptation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wHhy6wzhEo6zRA0NKWWD7K1jXUu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128298'),
  ('669914025503512868', 'Chicago', 2002, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Rob Marshall, Dion Beebe, Grant Lucibello', 'Bill Condon', 'Renée Zellweger, Catherine Zeta-Jones, Richard Gere, Queen Latifah, Ekaterina Chtchelkanova, John C. Reilly, Christine Baranski, Lucy Liu', 'PG-13', 'Murderesses Velma Kelly and Roxie Hart find themselves on death row together and fight for the fame that will keep them from the gallows in 1920s Chicago.', 'Murderesses Velma Kelly and Roxie Hart find themselves on death row together and fight for the fame that will keep them from the gallows in 1920s Chicago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ED8cWCXY9zkx77Sd0N5qMbsdDP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1574'),
  ('543983583994320558', 'Chicago Boys', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Carola Fuentes, Rafael Valdeavellano, Rafael Valdeavellano', 'Carola Fuentes', 'Joaquín Lavín, Jaime Guzmán, Salvador Allende, Patricio Aylwin, Augusto Pinochet, Michelle Bachelet, Sebastián Piñera', null, 'The economists behind the implementation of the most extreme capitalist system in the world observe with surprise the discontent of its countrymen. For the first time, they tell the story of how they became Milton Friedman''s students in Chicago in the 1950s and what were they willing to do to pursue their extreme economic ideas, aided by Pinochet''s dictatorship in the 70s. Unseen images and testimonies that allow us to understand the historic process that transformed the Chilean people and Chile in the country that it is today, an image of success and discontent.', 'The economists behind the implementation of the most extreme capitalist system in the world observe with surprise the discontent of its countrymen. For the first time, they tell the story of how they became Milton Friedman''s students in Chicago in the 1950s and what were they willing to do to pursue their extreme economic ideas, aided by Pinochet''s dictatorship in the 70s. Unseen images and testimonies that allow us to understand the historic process that transformed the Chilean people and Chile in the country that it is today, an image of success and discontent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1MUTsl25gWI9pTk8DHKQbNqd5y8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:370168'),
  ('99345352724384619', 'Chicago Cab', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Don H. Julien, Mary Cybulski, John Tintori', 'Will Kern', 'Paul Dillon, Michael Ironside, Laurie Metcalf, John C. Reilly, Gillian Anderson, John Cusack, Julianne Moore, Moira Sinise', 'R', 'A day in the life of a Chicago cab driver is examined as he picks up fares from the good and bad parts of the city and emotionally connects to many of his passengers.', 'A day in the life of a Chicago cab driver is examined as he picks up fares from the good and bad parts of the city and emotionally connects to many of his passengers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rOQZwzJTdXZlQGdn4vEghwVyji8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116008'),
  ('28968273983424639', 'Chicago Confidential', 1957, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Sidney Salkow, Kenneth Peach', 'Bernard Gordon', 'Brian Keith, Beverly Garland, Dick Foran, Douglas Kennedy, Paul Langton, Elisha Cook Jr., Gavin Gordon, Beverly Tyler', 'NR', 'In the Windy City, the mob infiltrates a powerful union.', 'In the Windy City, the mob infiltrates a powerful union.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4UWD5VBmCw5qIOLt1snKA8CWyA2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46047'),
  ('425877460270122535', 'Chicago Deadline', 1949, 'Drama, Crime', 'John F. Seitz, Lewis Allen, Alvin Ganzer', 'Warren Duff', 'Alan Ladd, Donna Reed, June Havoc, Irene Hervey, Arthur Kennedy, Berry Kroeger, Harold Vermilyea, Shepperd Strudwick', 'NR', 'On Chicago''s South Side reporter Ed Ames finds the body of a dead girl. Her address book leads to a host of names of men frightened by her death but claiming never to have known her. Ames comes to know quite a lot, dangerously so.', 'On Chicago''s South Side reporter Ed Ames finds the body of a dead girl. Her address book leads to a host of names of men frightened by her death but claiming never to have known her. Ames comes to know quite a lot, dangerously so.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rElQBpIVuakGvnqVCc5Qt9QE5Lb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33923'),
  ('668181173031336908', 'Chicago Joe and the Showgirl', 1990, 'Romance, Drama, Crime', 'Bernard Rose, Mike Southon', 'David Yallop', 'Kiefer Sutherland, Patsy Kensit, Emily Lloyd, Keith Allen, Alexandra Pigg, Liz Fraser, Harry Fowler, John Surman', 'R', 'During World War II, an American serviceman in London decides to impress his English girlfriend by acting as an American gangster, which soon turns deadly.', 'During World War II, an American serviceman in London decides to impress his English girlfriend by acting as an American gangster, which soon turns deadly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tSziSS7yfB26tEQF3CV4G7Asap2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27450'),
  ('812506005496869687', 'Chicago Massacre: Richard Speck', 2007, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Michael Feifer', 'Michael Feifer', 'Corin Nemec, Andrew Divoff, Tony Todd, Debbie Rochon, Joanne Chew, Amy Lyndon, Daniel Bonjour', null, 'A thriller film based on a real-life mass murder that took place in 1966. Richard Franklin Speck was a mass murderer who systematically tortured, raped and murdered eight student nurses from South Chicago Community Hospital in 1966.', 'A thriller film based on a real-life mass murder that took place in 1966. Richard Franklin Speck was a mass murderer who systematically tortured, raped and murdered eight student nurses from South Chicago Community Hospital in 1966.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hFAsW3uyDGIvLITUSp3wf8XFqay.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28101'),
  ('602533492057621778', 'Chicago Overcoat', 2009, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Brian Caunter, Kevin Moss', 'John Bosher, Josh Staman, Brian Caunter', 'Frank Vincent, Kathrine Narducci, Mike Starr, Stacy Keach, Armand Assante, Danny Goldring, Tim Gamble, Martin Shannon', 'R', 'The fates of an aging hitman and a washed up detective become entwined when one last job leads to one last chance to settle an old score.', 'The fates of an aging hitman and a washed up detective become entwined when one last job leads to one last chance to settle an old score.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6saeAm5xt4vVM632Hxw3tV0tRsJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43213'),
  ('173108488925144921', 'Chicago Police Parade', 1896, 'Documentary', 'Alexandre Promio', null, null, null, 'Walking four abreast, in groups of six rows, 144 of Chicago''s finest parade past a stationary camera. Each of the six groups that pass is escorted by an officer. All are men, all are white, all look tall, all wear identical high-buttoned uniforms and badges and carry a nightstick. Almost all sport mustaches. Behind the police comes a horse-drawn carriage.', 'Walking four abreast, in groups of six rows, 144 of Chicago''s finest parade past a stationary camera. Each of the six groups that pass is escorted by an officer. All are men, all are white, all look tall, all wear identical high-buttoned uniforms and badges and carry a nightstick. Almost all sport mustaches. Behind the police comes a horse-drawn carriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AqEglLp8aC7WYcwqdatTVFOVgMl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:178758'),
  ('822766155609319280', 'Chicago Syndicate', 1955, 'Crime, Drama', 'Fred F. Sears, Fred Jackman Jr., Leonard Katzman', 'Joseph Hoffman', 'Dennis O''Keefe, Abbe Lane, Paul Stewart, Allison Hayes, Xavier Cugat, Richard H. Cutting, Chris Alcaide, William Challee', 'NR', 'An ex-military accountant is recruited by the FBI to infiltrate the mob in Chicago in an attempt to break open the rackets. To complicate his job, two women stand in his way, each with their own agenda.', 'An ex-military accountant is recruited by the FBI to infiltrate the mob in Chicago in an attempt to break open the rackets. To complicate his job, two women stand in his way, each with their own agenda.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Frj8hrdDa4m6qKvUllzRspK03Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188750'),
  ('291844969343723823', 'Chichinette: The Accidental Spy', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Nicola Hens', null, 'Marthe Cohn, L Cohn', null, 'When it seems that all the stories about World War II have already been told, a new one is often found. Marthe Cohn is a French Jew, whose life resembles a real-world blockbuster. During the war, she took the cover name Chichinette, became a spy, and gathered intel that helped organize an important military operation. Chichinette suffered many losses during the war, having been born in a Jewish family in a small industrial town close to the border between France and Germany. Now Marthe is 98 years old. Despite her age, she is savvy in modern technology and loves traveling the globe - she is often invited to go abroad and tell the story of her military achievements.', 'When it seems that all the stories about World War II have already been told, a new one is often found. Marthe Cohn is a French Jew, whose life resembles a real-world blockbuster. During the war, she took the cover name Chichinette, became a spy, and gathered intel that helped organize an important military operation. Chichinette suffered many losses during the war, having been born in a Jewish family in a small industrial town close to the border between France and Germany. Now Marthe is 98 years old. Despite her age, she is savvy in modern technology and loves traveling the globe - she is often invited to go abroad and tell the story of her military achievements.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uxcNPSMcrDRqGyIFwrjzl8DDSND.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:635823'),
  ('87319864414923207', 'Chick Fight', 2021, 'Action, Comedy, Drama', 'Paul Leyden, Steven Holleran, SB Weathersby', 'Joseph Downey', 'Malin Åkerman, Bella Thorne, Dulcé Sloan, Kevin Connolly, Kevin Nash, Alec Mapa, Dominique Jackson, Fortune Feimster', 'R', 'When Anna Wyncomb is introduced to an underground, all-female fight club in order to turn the mess of her life around, she discovers she is much more personally connected to the history of the club than she could ever imagine.', 'When Anna Wyncomb is introduced to an underground, all-female fight club in order to turn the mess of her life around, she discovers she is much more personally connected to the history of the club than she could ever imagine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ZocdxnOO6q2UbdKye2wgofLFhB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:682377'),
  ('666520115137264594', 'Chick Seeking Giraffe', 2026, 'Short, Comedy, Romance', 'Etienne Chédeville, Plume Fabre', 'Etienne Chédeville', 'Mako Tounkara, Sandrine Jacob, Jeanne Alamercy, Laurian Rufflé, Eudes Quittelier', null, 'Big costume birthday party. Harry, dressed as a chick, doesn''t want to be unmasked. He frantically searches for a giraffe, his giraffe. But he runs into a fox who won''t let him go.', 'Big costume birthday party. Harry, dressed as a chick, doesn''t want to be unmasked. He frantically searches for a giraffe, his giraffe. But he runs into a fox who won''t let him go.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F1FsRwrIJyTC9fuubxZOaVZCEwGI.jpg', 'plex:movie:poussin-cherche-girafe-2026'),
  ('953594588966902682', 'Chicken', 2001, 'Drama', 'Peter Robertson, Barry Dignam', 'Audrey O''Reilly', 'Darren Healy, Niall O''Shea', null, 'Mick and Kev, teen Irish lads, are at the shore, throwing rocks at empty cans, drinking cider. Mick''s the pushy one, engaging Kev in a game of mumbly peg, his hand on top of Kev''s, fingers splayed. As Mick moves the knife between their fingers, a train is heard approaching. What''s Mick''s purpose?', 'Mick and Kev, teen Irish lads, are at the shore, throwing rocks at empty cans, drinking cider. Mick''s the pushy one, engaging Kev in a game of mumbly peg, his hand on top of Kev''s, fingers splayed. As Mick moves the knife between their fingers, a train is heard approaching. What''s Mick''s purpose?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e2RnDt6UQ8KN2XVm2sWNHTAMCNA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:271698'),
  ('302419170507097847', 'Chicken and Duck Talk', 1988, 'Comedy', 'Clifton Ko Chi-Sum, Andy Lam Kwok-Wah, Derek Wan Man-Kit', 'Clifton Ko Chi-Sum', 'Michael Hui Koon-Man, Ricky Hui Koon-Ying, Sylvia Chang, Pak Yan, Teddy Yip Wing-Cho, Lowell Lo Koon-Ting, Stephen Ho Kai-Nam, Hui Ying-Ying', null, 'A witty and thoroughly engaging send-up of both the fast food business and the cut-throat techniques often employed by conglomerates to crush independent competition.', 'A witty and thoroughly engaging send-up of both the fast food business and the cut-throat techniques often employed by conglomerates to crush independent competition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gKa56NxubWOzh7XWjwOoTQFkcjG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47291'),
  ('495228467413856040', 'Chicken Feed for Little Birds', 1963, 'Comedy', 'Marcel Carné, Pierre Laurent, Jacques Natteau', 'Jacques Sigurd, Marcel Carné', 'Paul Meurisse, Dany Saval, Suzy Delair, Roland Lesaffre, Jean Richard, Suzanne Gabriello, Franco Citti, Jeanne Fusier-Gir', null, 'In a building close to the Place de la Contrescarpe in Paris, a tale of criss‑crossings in turn romantic, gourmet, interested or mystical, between an Italian gigolo and a nightclub hostess, a family of butchers and an apprentice rocker, a mystic tailor, a writer sending himself telegrams, an alert paralytic woman, a thoughtful concierge, a bird breeder and a just‑out‑of‑jail hooligan. Little by little each one discovers each other’s more or less troubled history… when a mysterious death introduces the Police within this huis clos, hastens disclosure of well‑kept secrets and ruffle this little World.', 'In a building close to the Place de la Contrescarpe in Paris, a tale of criss‑crossings in turn romantic, gourmet, interested or mystical, between an Italian gigolo and a nightclub hostess, a family of butchers and an apprentice rocker, a mystic tailor, a writer sending himself telegrams, an alert paralytic woman, a thoughtful concierge, a bird breeder and a just‑out‑of‑jail hooligan. Little by little each one discovers each other’s more or less troubled history… when a mysterious death introduces the Police within this huis clos, hastens disclosure of well‑kept secrets and ruffle this little World.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yYQA4RR7Zg4NTByn9iX0XNCoHaY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76685'),
  ('80042128169507549', 'Chicken for Linda!', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Music', 'Chiara Malta, Sébastien Laudenbach', 'Chiara Malta, Sébastien Laudenbach', 'Mélinée Leclerc, Clotilde Hesme, Laetitia Dosch, Estéban, Patrick Pineau, Claudine Acs, Jean-Marie Fonbonne, Antoine Momey', 'NR', 'Single mother Paulette decides to make up for her mistake by cooking a chicken with peppers for her daughter—only she can''t cook and shopkeepers are on strike.', 'Single mother Paulette decides to make up for her mistake by cooking a chicken with peppers for her daughter—only she can''t cook and shopkeepers are on strike.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zi0ywrS2804eP3RD3sow0KN7xIp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:589026'),
  ('45661211187613184', 'Chicken Hawk: Men Who Love Boys', 1994, 'Documentary', 'Adi Sideman', 'Adi Sideman, Nadav Harel', 'Barbara Adler, Mimi Turner, Allen Ginsberg, Bill Andriette, Bill Bickly, Russ Coleman, Rennato Corazza, Charles Lee Dodson', null, 'Members of the controversial group NAMBLA (North American Man/Boy Love Association) discuss why their organization supports "boys and men who have or desire engagements in sexual or emotional relationships."', 'Members of the controversial group NAMBLA (North American Man/Boy Love Association) discuss why their organization supports "boys and men who have or desire engagements in sexual or emotional relationships."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jTjdDripZnTRJIVKkBmFmB0qK8A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106796'),
  ('506724378735522930', 'Chicken in the Rough', 1951, 'Animation, Family', 'Jack Hannah', null, 'Dessie Flynn, James MacDonald, Florence Gill, Mary Lawrence', 'NR', 'Chip ''n'' Dale wander into a farmyard to collect acorns. Dale mistakes an egg for a nut, but when he tries to demonstrate to a newly hatched chick how to get back into the egg, a rooster mistakes him for one of his chicks.', 'Chip ''n'' Dale wander into a farmyard to collect acorns. Dale mistakes an egg for a nut, but when he tries to demonstrate to a newly hatched chick how to get back into the egg, a rooster mistakes him for one of his chicks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qFj94qDctASg30bqygQAoxN2EQu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74956'),
  ('612911986513339651', 'Chicken Little', 1943, 'Animation, Family', 'Clyde Geronimi', null, 'Frank Graham, Florence Gill, Clarence Nash', 'NR', 'It''s a peaceful day at the local poultry farm until Foxy Loxy happens along intent on a chicken dinner. He takes the advice of a book on psychology by striking "the least intelligent" first and convinces dim witted Chicken Little the sky is falling. Chicken Little spreads the word but when head man Cocky Locky proves the story to be false, Foxy Loxy spreads rumors that Cocky Locky isn''t the smart chicken he appears to be, which leads to the ultimate undoing of the chickens at the hands of Foxy Loxy.', 'It''s a peaceful day at the local poultry farm until Foxy Loxy happens along intent on a chicken dinner. He takes the advice of a book on psychology by striking "the least intelligent" first and convinces dim witted Chicken Little the sky is falling. Chicken Little spreads the word but when head man Cocky Locky proves the story to be false, Foxy Loxy spreads rumors that Cocky Locky isn''t the smart chicken he appears to be, which leads to the ultimate undoing of the chickens at the hands of Foxy Loxy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zdrosivsi8MP9F5rHPqp3KFMxJk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64648'),
  ('937821119169402068', 'Chicken Little', 2005, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Mark Dindal, Dan Cooper', 'Steve Bencich, Ron J. Friedman, Ron Anderson', 'Zach Braff, Garry Marshall, Don Knotts, Amy Sedaris, Steve Zahn, Joan Cusack, Patrick Stewart, Fred Willard', 'G', 'When the sky really is falling and sanity has flown the coop, who will rise to save the day? Together with his hysterical band of misfit friends, Chicken Little must hatch a plan to save the planet from alien invasion and prove that the world''s biggest hero is a little chicken.', 'When the sky really is falling and sanity has flown the coop, who will rise to save the day? Together with his hysterical band of misfit friends, Chicken Little must hatch a plan to save the planet from alien invasion and prove that the world''s biggest hero is a little chicken.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/87FpA4b90eTaw3U6zmCNikoPLir.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9982'),
  ('268725181911976630', 'Chicken Park', 1996, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Jerry Calà, Blasco Giurato', 'Gino Capone', 'Jerry Calà, Demetra Hampton, Lawrence Steven Meyers, Alessia Marcuzzi, Rossy de Palma, Simone Canosa, Eleonora Rossi, Jeff Blynn', null, 'Vladimiro travels to the Dominican Republic with his fighting-chicken when it gets stolen. While searching for his lost chicken he discovers Chicken Park, a zoo full of giant chickens.', 'Vladimiro travels to the Dominican Republic with his fighting-chicken when it gets stolen. While searching for his lost chicken he discovers Chicken Park, a zoo full of giant chickens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r2I4FtgvGePSxinvezLz42PDydw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65758'),
  ('88506608978050641', 'Chicken Run', 2000, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Peter Lord, Nick Park, Tristan Oliver', 'Karey Kirkpatrick', 'Julia Sawalha, Mel Gibson, Imelda Staunton, Jane Horrocks, Lynn Ferguson, Miranda Richardson, Tony Haygarth, Benjamin Whitrow', 'G', 'The creators of Wallace & Gromit bring you an exciting and original story about a group of chickens determined to fly the coop–even if they can’t fly! It’s hardly poultry in motion when Rocky attempts to teach Ginger and her feathered friends to fly…but, with teamwork, determination and a little bit o’ cluck, the fearless flock plots one last attempt in a spectacular bid for freedom.', 'The creators of Wallace & Gromit bring you an exciting and original story about a group of chickens determined to fly the coop–even if they can’t fly! It’s hardly poultry in motion when Rocky attempts to teach Ginger and her feathered friends to fly…but, with teamwork, determination and a little bit o’ cluck, the fearless flock plots one last attempt in a spectacular bid for freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8XgmIsbpVamdhwcNVsYzohFZTtT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7443'),
  ('1094729001273969169', 'Chicken Run: Dawn of the Nugget', 2023, 'Family, Animation, Adventure, Comedy', 'Charles Copping, Matt Perry, Jeff Newitt', 'John O''Farrell, Karey Kirkpatrick, Rachel Tunnard', 'Thandiwe Newton, Zachary Levi, Bella Ramsey, Imelda Staunton, Lynn Ferguson, David Bradley, Jane Horrocks, Romesh Ranganathan', 'PG', 'A band of fearless chickens flock together to save poultry-kind from an unsettling new threat: a nearby farm that''s cooking up something suspicious.', 'A band of fearless chickens flock together to save poultry-kind from an unsettling new threat: a nearby farm that''s cooking up something suspicious.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/exNtEY8QUuQh9e23wSQjkPxKIU3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:520758'),
  ('163255238867654681', 'Chicken with Plums', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Marjane Satrapi, Vincent Paronnaud, Christophe Beaucarne', 'Marjane Satrapi, Vincent Paronnaud', 'Mathieu Amalric, Golshifteh Farahani, Édouard Baer, Maria de Medeiros, Isabella Rossellini, Éric Caravaca, Chiara Mastroianni, Mathis Bour', null, 'Since his beloved violin was broken, Nasser-Ali Khan, one of the most renowned musicians of his day, has lost all taste for life. Finding no instrument worthy of replacing it, he decides to confine himself to bed to await death.', 'Since his beloved violin was broken, Nasser-Ali Khan, one of the most renowned musicians of his day, has lost all taste for life. Finding no instrument worthy of replacing it, he decides to confine himself to bed to await death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2wPrGdPG2Zn6vFSAMfWsrcTrQTr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78206'),
  ('274537404863281597', 'Chickenhare and the Hamster of Darkness', 2022, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Benjamin Mousquet, Magali Rigaudias, Ben Stassen', 'David Collard', 'Jordan Tartakow, Joe Ochman, Laila Berzins, Danny Fehsenfeld, Chris McCune, Michael Orenstein, Dino Andrade, Kyle Hebert', 'PG', 'Young Chickenhare is the adopted son of King Peter, a famous adventurer. Part chicken and part hare, he has a really tough time growing up and disguises himself as a hare to avoid the mockeries of his peers. When the day of the Royal Adventurer Society trials comes, Chickenhare, hampered by his disguise, fails miserably. But he is determined to grab a second chance and find the Scepter of the Hamster of Darkness, before his evil Uncle Lapin. The Scepter will give immense power to its holder. If Lapin gets hold of it, he will be unstoppable. Accompanied by his faithful servant Abe, a sarcastic turtle, and Meg, a martial arts expert skunk, he sets of on an epic and initiatory quest.', 'Young Chickenhare is the adopted son of King Peter, a famous adventurer. Part chicken and part hare, he has a really tough time growing up and disguises himself as a hare to avoid the mockeries of his peers. When the day of the Royal Adventurer Society trials comes, Chickenhare, hampered by his disguise, fails miserably. But he is determined to grab a second chance and find the Scepter of the Hamster of Darkness, before his evil Uncle Lapin. The Scepter will give immense power to its holder. If Lapin gets hold of it, he will be unstoppable. Accompanied by his faithful servant Abe, a sarcastic turtle, and Meg, a martial arts expert skunk, he sets of on an epic and initiatory quest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2v6f1EqTo4FUxVT9MDXpF6158AX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:778855'),
  ('763879772302834593', 'Chickens Come Home', 1931, 'Comedy', 'James W. Horne, Jack Stevens, Art Lloyd', null, 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Thelma Todd, James Finlayson, Mae Busch, Baldwin Cooke, Gordon Douglas, Norma Drew', 'NR', 'Ollie is running for mayor when an old flame tries to blackmail him with a old photo.', 'Ollie is running for mayor when an old flame tries to blackmail him with a old photo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c1d31lPOHtxb1CZ79PqYNNBCENy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50865'),
  ('831806464034537382', 'Chicks', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Sophie Letourneur, Claire Mathon', 'Sophie Letourneur, Delphine Agut', 'Sarah-Jane Sauvegrain, Eulalie Juster, Mahault Mollaret, Elsa Pierret, Jade Tong Cuong, Angèle Ferreux, Benjamin Siksou', 'NR', 'Pam is twenty. She and her girlfriends hang out together on the couch at The Ranch, the apartment she shares with Manon. Sitting around chatting, drinking, smoking, and dancing are part of life at their age, but there comes a time when you need to cut loose from the group and go your own way...', 'Pam is twenty. She and her girlfriends hang out together on the couch at The Ranch, the apartment she shares with Manon. Sitting around chatting, drinking, smoking, and dancing are part of life at their age, but there comes a time when you need to cut loose from the group and go your own way...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7X9nxDzePBwnzqm5CiLb2ifV7bk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63774'),
  ('193951936891025251', 'Chico & Rita', 2010, 'Animation, Music, Romance', 'Fernando Trueba, Tono Errando, Javier Mariscal', 'Fernando Trueba, Ignacio Martínez de Pisón', 'Mario Guerra, Limara Meneses, Eman Xor Oña, Jon Adams, Renny Arozarena, Blanca Rosa Blanco, Jackie de la Nuez, Rigoberto Ferrera', 'NR', 'Chico is a young piano player with big dreams. Rita is a beautiful singer with an extraordinary voice. Music and romantic desire unites them, but their journey - in the tradition of the Latin ballad, the bolero - brings heartache and torment.', 'Chico is a young piano player with big dreams. Rita is a beautiful singer with an extraordinary voice. Music and romantic desire unites them, but their journey - in the tradition of the Latin ballad, the bolero - brings heartache and torment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Kj9JAhMNSektw6RVYR1oJWGZWa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63498'),
  ('221666369913838257', 'Chico Xavier', 2010, 'Drama', 'Daniel Filho, Ruy Brito, Tatiana Fragoso', 'Marcos Bernstein, Cris D''amato', 'Nelson Xavier, Ângelo Antônio, Matheus Costa, Tony Ramos, Christiane Torloni, Luís Melo, Letícia Sabatella, Giulia Gam', null, 'A biography of spiritual medium and author Francisco Candido Xavier.', 'A biography of spiritual medium and author Francisco Candido Xavier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yBrPBKHU69tKiic4UgF9Z4iO9P0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41520'),
  ('87727306082212838', 'Chico: Brazilian Artist', 2015, 'Documentary, Music', 'Miguel Faria Jr., Lauro Escorel', 'Diana Vasconcellos, Miguel Faria Jr.', 'Chico Buarque, Marília Pêra, Miúcha, Antônio Carlos Jobim, Carminho, Hugo Carvana, Marieta Severo, Ney Matogrosso', null, 'Chico Buarque is a constant presence in Brazil''s art scene and makes up its citizen''s popular culture. This wealth in music, poems, theater and novels has been created over the last 50 years and in this film Chico Buarque converses about his memories, shows, daily life, work methods, creative process, in summary all his trajectory. The musician’s search for his German brother, whom he never got to meet, serves as one of the axis for the narrative.', 'Chico Buarque is a constant presence in Brazil''s art scene and makes up its citizen''s popular culture. This wealth in music, poems, theater and novels has been created over the last 50 years and in this film Chico Buarque converses about his memories, shows, daily life, work methods, creative process, in summary all his trajectory. The musician’s search for his German brother, whom he never got to meet, serves as one of the axis for the narrative.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cNySjJRiKZcPjFnvNDiQGVBYtBe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:359807'),
  ('104414728895360661', 'Chicogrande', 2010, 'History, Drama, War', 'Felipe Cazals, Damián García', 'Ricardo Garibay, Felipe Cazals', 'Damián Alcázar, Bruno Bichir, Juan Manuel Bernal, Alejandro Calva, Pablo Fulgueira, Johnny Gerland, Ivan Rafael Gonzalez, Tenoch Huerta Mejía', null, 'Butch Fenton, major of American army, comes for Villa''s head and he''s gonna get it. The "Punitive Expedition" proved to be the last major campaign of the U.S. Cavalry. Mexican revolution is the first social movement of the century.', 'Butch Fenton, major of American army, comes for Villa''s head and he''s gonna get it. The "Punitive Expedition" proved to be the last major campaign of the U.S. Cavalry. Mexican revolution is the first social movement of the century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vMfPpwJG0Lsuy0IQbEuyS0FxQFM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144161'),
  ('43984223361409469', 'Chicuarotes', 2019, 'Drama, Crime', 'Gael García Bernal, Juan Pablo Ramírez', 'Augusto Mendoza', 'Benny Emmanuel, Gabriel Carbajal, Leidi Gutiérrez, Dolores Heredia, Enoc Leaño, Daniel Giménez Cacho, Pedro Joaquín, Alejandro de la Rosa', null, 'Cagalera and Moloteco are two teenagers from San Gregorio Atlapulco who are desperate to get out and move up and away from oppressive circumstances. When they hear of an opportunity to buy a spot in the electrician’s union, which could transform their lives, they quickly devolve into the criminal, adult underworld of Mexico City in a bid to buy their freedom.', 'Cagalera and Moloteco are two teenagers from San Gregorio Atlapulco who are desperate to get out and move up and away from oppressive circumstances. When they hear of an opportunity to buy a spot in the electrician’s union, which could transform their lives, they quickly devolve into the criminal, adult underworld of Mexico City in a bid to buy their freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vN43s4gcqANLuVn5ImuTyb673iz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:571391'),
  ('392912507528503511', 'Chie the Brat', 1981, 'Family, Animation, Comedy, Drama', 'Isao Takahata, Yasuo Otsuka, Hirokata Takahashi', 'Noboru Shiroyama, Isao Takahata', 'Chinatsu Nakayama, Norio Nishikawa, Yoshio Kamigata, Gannosuke Ashiya, Kyōko Mitsubayashi, Utako Kyō, Keisuke Otori, Bunshi Katsura VI', null, 'Chie Takemoto is a dependable girl who struggles to help her troublesome father run a small tavern in Osaka. Unbeknown to her dad, she occasionally visits her mother who left him not too long ago. She plans on trying to reunite them, but not until her father gets a job.', 'Chie Takemoto is a dependable girl who struggles to help her troublesome father run a small tavern in Osaka. Unbeknown to her dad, she occasionally visits her mother who left him not too long ago. She plans on trying to reunite them, but not until her father gets a job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h1rzXMf9YsbAbA7nzOdIWxdbcK5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70927'),
  ('891601987974742874', 'Chief Crazy Horse', 1955, 'Western', 'George Sherman, Marshall Green, Harold Lipstein', 'Gerald Drayson Adams, Franklin Coen', 'Victor Mature, Suzan Ball, John Lund, Ray Danton, Keith Larsen, Paul Guilfoyle, David Janssen, Robert Warwick', 'NR', 'When young Crazy Horse, of whom great things were predicted, wins his bride, rival Little Big Man goes to villainous traders with evidence of gold in the sacred Lakota burial ground. Of course, a new gold rush starts despite all treaties, and Crazy Horse becomes military leader of his people. Initial Indian victories lead to the inevitable result. Uniquely, all is told from the Indian perspective.', 'When young Crazy Horse, of whom great things were predicted, wins his bride, rival Little Big Man goes to villainous traders with evidence of gold in the sacred Lakota burial ground. Of course, a new gold rush starts despite all treaties, and Crazy Horse becomes military leader of his people. Initial Indian victories lead to the inevitable result. Uniquely, all is told from the Indian perspective.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a9cYyC7hp4KaJYIBK1DoZ969Ox6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21006'),
  ('558891192411806740', 'Chief Daddy 2: Going for Broke', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Niyi Akinmolayan', null, 'Shaffy Bello, Funke Akindele, Joke Silva, Kate Henshaw-Nuttal, Rahama Sadau, Mawuli Gavor, Beverly Naya, Falz', null, 'The Beecroft family are ready to spend all of Chief Daddy''s inheritance, but not if the CEO of his company has anything to do with it.', 'The Beecroft family are ready to spend all of Chief Daddy''s inheritance, but not if the CEO of his company has anything to do with it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mCOhpT4thaUTPbBvFKYibgpNnCy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:922017'),
  ('1022319542576901127', 'Chief of Station', 2024, 'Action, Thriller', 'Jesse V. Johnson, Norbert Vilonya, Adél Lengyel', 'George Mahaffey', 'Aaron Eckhart, Olga Kurylenko, Alex Pettyfer, Chris Petrovski, Laëtitia Eïdo, Nick Moran, Daniel Bernhardt, Nina Bergman', 'NR', 'After learning that the death of his wife was not an accident, a former CIA Station Chief is forced back into the espionage underworld, teaming up with an adversary to unravel a conspiracy that challenges everything he thought he knew.', 'After learning that the death of his wife was not an accident, a former CIA Station Chief is forced back into the espionage underworld, teaming up with an adversary to unravel a conspiracy that challenges everything he thought he knew.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yndlj5aNPWAZ5ayJ4a2S37o98lq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1093995'),
  ('706345787198001867', 'Chihayafuru: Part I', 2016, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Norihiro Koizumi, Hiro''o Yanagida', 'Norihiro Koizumi', 'Suzu Hirose, Shuhei Nomura, Mackenyu, Mone Kamishiraishi, Yuma Yamoto, Yuki Morinaga, Hiroya Shimizu, Ryotaro Sakaguchi', null, 'When Chihaya Ayase was in the 6th grade of elementary school, she met Arata Wataya. Arata Wataya transferred from Fukui Prefecture. Taichi Mashima was Chihaya Ayase''s friend since they were little. Arata got close to Chihaya and Taichi from the card game karuta. Four years later, Chihaya is a high school student. Chihaya learns that Arata, who went back to Fukui Prefecture, doesn''t play karuta anymore. Believing they will meet Arata again, Chihaya and Taichi starts a karuta club at their high school.', 'When Chihaya Ayase was in the 6th grade of elementary school, she met Arata Wataya. Arata Wataya transferred from Fukui Prefecture. Taichi Mashima was Chihaya Ayase''s friend since they were little. Arata got close to Chihaya and Taichi from the card game karuta. Four years later, Chihaya is a high school student. Chihaya learns that Arata, who went back to Fukui Prefecture, doesn''t play karuta anymore. Believing they will meet Arata again, Chihaya and Taichi starts a karuta club at their high school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2eJQKiM6mz4qCFl7j6QVttaOuh2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:407936'),
  ('300837559565446518', 'Chihayafuru: Part II', 2016, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Norihiro Koizumi, Hiro''o Yanagida', 'Norihiro Koizumi', 'Suzu Hirose, Shuhei Nomura, Mackenyu, Mayu Matsuoka, Mone Kamishiraishi, Yuma Yamoto, Yuki Morinaga, Hiroya Shimizu', null, 'After successfully won the Tokyo qualifying tournament, Chihaya and her friends are set to go on to the nationals. As they prepare, Chihaya is faced with new personal issues as her childhood friend and inspiration, Arata, has announced that he has quit competitive karuta. Not only that, but a new rival emerges in the reigning female champion karuta player, Shinobu Wakamiya, a karuta prodigy who became the nation''s and the world''s greatest female karuta player as a 9th grader. All of this forces Chihaya to reexamine her love of the game in the midst of preparing for one of the biggest tournaments of the year.', 'After successfully won the Tokyo qualifying tournament, Chihaya and her friends are set to go on to the nationals. As they prepare, Chihaya is faced with new personal issues as her childhood friend and inspiration, Arata, has announced that he has quit competitive karuta. Not only that, but a new rival emerges in the reigning female champion karuta player, Shinobu Wakamiya, a karuta prodigy who became the nation''s and the world''s greatest female karuta player as a 9th grader. All of this forces Chihaya to reexamine her love of the game in the midst of preparing for one of the biggest tournaments of the year.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fH9ze51RlYmbdMjO8csrfCb32TW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:408574'),
  ('430342651907601043', 'Chihayafuru: Part III', 2018, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Haruka Kawai, Norihiro Koizumi, Hiro''o Yanagida', 'Norihiro Koizumi', 'Suzu Hirose, Shuhei Nomura, Mackenyu, Mone Kamishiraishi, Yuma Yamoto, Yuki Morinaga, Mio Yuki, Hayato Sano', null, 'Story takes place 2 years after "Chihayafuru Part 2" and Chihaya is now a high school senior.', 'Story takes place 2 years after "Chihayafuru Part 2" and Chihaya is now a high school senior.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rQew6IX92T2z5WA8zOXyzGvYh3X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:485114'),
  ('801804771797796829', 'Chikamatsu Monogatari', 1954, 'Drama, Romance', 'Kenji Mizoguchi, Akira Naitō, Kazuo Miyagawa', 'Yoshikata Yoda, Matsutarō Kawaguchi', 'Kazuo Hasegawa, Kyōko Kagawa, Eitarō Shindō, Eitarō Ozawa, Yōko Minamida, Haruo Tanaka, Chieko Naniwa, Ichirō Sugai', null, 'When the wife of a 17th-century Kyoto scrollmaker is falsely accused of having an affair with his best employee, the pair flee the city and find themselves truly falling for one another.', 'When the wife of a 17th-century Kyoto scrollmaker is falsely accused of having an affair with his best employee, the pair flee the city and find themselves truly falling for one another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3FTzr49lQKouUEutQRX5bqMCO4C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35861'),
  ('871542217555431926', 'Chiko', 2008, 'Drama, Crime', 'Özgür Yildirim, Matthias Bolliger', 'Özgür Yildirim', 'Denis Moschitto, Volkan Özcan, Moritz Bleibtreu, Fahri Yardım, Reyhan Sahin, Lilay Huser, Philipp Baltus, Hans Löw', null, 'This is the story of Isa, who grows up in a Hamburg suburb. It might be one of the world''s richest cities but every beast has its belly and here, in the very underbelly, Chiko lives in a world where violence, staking and keeping a claim, and drug taking are the norm. Where down is not an option, Chiko is determined to rise to the top, whatever and whomever it costs.', 'This is the story of Isa, who grows up in a Hamburg suburb. It might be one of the world''s richest cities but every beast has its belly and here, in the very underbelly, Chiko lives in a world where violence, staking and keeping a claim, and drug taking are the norm. Where down is not an option, Chiko is determined to rise to the top, whatever and whomever it costs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7jvu0BUsrsojDVDmar3QddRgCEF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8064'),
  ('957692357200519704', 'Chilangolandia', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Carlos Santos', 'Carlos Santos', 'Silverio Palacios, Liliana Arriaga, Luis Felipe Tovar, Pierre Louis, Carlos Corona, Moisés Iván Mora, Francisco Denis, Aaron Aguilar', null, 'Mexico City, or "Chilangolandia," is a chaotic metropolis where millions of stories take place every day. Some of them are part of this fun comedy full of familiar characters and others that defy stereotypes. Ramiro is a taxi driver who hopes his problems will end when his nephew "El Chulo" becomes a national soccer star. On the other hand, Carmen and Miguel are couple who unexpectedly receive a suitcase with a large sum of money, just what they need to get out of their financial situation. But when the true owners of the cash realize that it fell into the wrong hands, endless adventures and misunderstandings break out within this complex city.', 'Mexico City, or "Chilangolandia," is a chaotic metropolis where millions of stories take place every day. Some of them are part of this fun comedy full of familiar characters and others that defy stereotypes. Ramiro is a taxi driver who hopes his problems will end when his nephew "El Chulo" becomes a national soccer star. On the other hand, Carmen and Miguel are couple who unexpectedly receive a suitcase with a large sum of money, just what they need to get out of their financial situation. But when the true owners of the cash realize that it fell into the wrong hands, endless adventures and misunderstandings break out within this complex city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gNObb3Q1P2yO2Z14bs6AXx0cWVy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:865140'),
  ('219122709320103923', 'Child 44', 2015, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Martin Šácha, Pavel Tatar, Sallie Hard', 'Richard Price', 'Tom Hardy, Gary Oldman, Noomi Rapace, Fares Fares, Joel Kinnaman, Paddy Considine, Jason Clarke, Mark Lewis Jones', 'R', 'Set in Stalin-era Soviet Union, a disgraced MGB agent is dispatched to investigate a series of child murders -- a case that begins to connect with the very top of party leadership.', 'Set in Stalin-era Soviet Union, a disgraced MGB agent is dispatched to investigate a series of child murders -- a case that begins to connect with the very top of party leadership.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p8uTx2xm72vXqI0H4W5kU3ku9ND.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:181283'),
  ('9409877457904846', 'Child Bride', 1938, 'Drama, Romance', 'Harry Revier, Felix Mills, Marcel Le Picard', 'Harry Revier', 'Shirley Mills, Bob Bollinger, Warner Richmond, Diana Durrell, Dorothy Carrol, George Humphreys, Frank Martin, Angelo Rossitto', null, 'Jennie is a twelve-year-old girl living with her parents in extremely rural mountain country. Her schoolteacher, Miss Carol, though a mountain girl herself, has gone off to be educated and returned in hopes of stopping the tradition of child marriage which permeates the culture. Jennie''s father Ira is a good man who tries to protect Miss Carol from the men who threaten her if she doesn''t call off her crusade. One of these men, Jake Bolby, has his eye on little Jennie and plots to make her his bride.', 'Jennie is a twelve-year-old girl living with her parents in extremely rural mountain country. Her schoolteacher, Miss Carol, though a mountain girl herself, has gone off to be educated and returned in hopes of stopping the tradition of child marriage which permeates the culture. Jennie''s father Ira is a good man who tries to protect Miss Carol from the men who threaten her if she doesn''t call off her crusade. One of these men, Jake Bolby, has his eye on little Jennie and plots to make her his bride.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6mPmvxBnDEwxbpEQQ23nkeYWR3h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89581'),
  ('304636680461928197', 'Child Bride of Short Creek', 1981, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Robert Michael Lewis, Gary Graver', null, 'Christopher Atkins, Diane Lane, Conrad Bain, Kiel Martin, Helen Hunt, Warren Vanders, Joan Shawlee, Dee Wallace', 'NR', 'A dramatization of the true account of a fundamentalist sect in Arizona that practices polygamy, and a returning Korean War veteran''s rebellion against his father when he learns that the latter plans to increase his stable of wives by adding the 15-year-old girl with whom his son is romantically involved.', 'A dramatization of the true account of a fundamentalist sect in Arizona that practices polygamy, and a returning Korean War veteran''s rebellion against his father when he learns that the latter plans to increase his stable of wives by adding the 15-year-old girl with whom his son is romantically involved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bweCxHrcxltub3qP8UxYGoW278M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:207330'),
  ('819282387293205955', 'Child by Children', 2008, 'Drama', 'Koji Hagiuda', 'Koji Hagiuda', 'Haruna Amari, Kumiko Aso, Yoshiko Miyazaki, Mitsuki Tanimura, Reiko Kusamura, Satoru Saito, Hyōe Enoki, Toshiyuki Kitami', null, 'Haruna is a lively tomboy in the 5th year at elementary school. One day, while playing with Hiroyuki, a boy whom she has known for a long time, they play a game of putting their private parts together. A sex education lesson given by a new teacher, Yagi, makes Haruna suspect that she might be pregnant.', 'Haruna is a lively tomboy in the 5th year at elementary school. One day, while playing with Hiroyuki, a boy whom she has known for a long time, they play a game of putting their private parts together. A sex education lesson given by a new teacher, Yagi, makes Haruna suspect that she might be pregnant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dJGOKKa6KtAy5Nx3wWw1ltCq9w2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:517561'),
  ('6541442178931650', 'Child Eater', 2016, 'Horror', 'Erlingur Thoroddsen, John Wakayama Carey, Cameron Morton', 'Erlingur Thoroddsen', 'Caitlin Bliss, Colin Critchley, Jason Martin, James Wilcox, Dave Klasko, Brandon Smalls, Melinda Chilton, Andrew Kaempfer', null, 'A simple night of babysitting takes a horrifying turn when Helen realizes the boogeyman really is in little Lucas'' closet.', 'A simple night of babysitting takes a horrifying turn when Helen realizes the boogeyman really is in little Lucas'' closet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5oyUNNUMmXBNSbBltvbPhVa43kP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:417501'),
  ('849362975330285614', 'Child in the Night', 1990, 'Mystery, Thriller, Drama, TV Movie, Horror', 'Mike Robe, Gerald Hirschfeld', 'Michael Petryni', 'JoBeth Williams, Tom Skerritt, Season Hubley, Mike Pniewski, Tim Choate, Thom Bray, Elijah Wood, Darren McGavin', null, 'Traumatized after seeing his father brutally murdered by a hook wielding assailant, young Luke is tasked to help unmask the killer.', 'Traumatized after seeing his father brutally murdered by a hook wielding assailant, young Luke is tasked to help unmask the killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/40IFGw9V2d7UAwdsT5NP4ubp33H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136946'),
  ('1035770810664362369', 'Child of Darkness, Child of Light', 1991, 'Horror, TV Movie', 'Marina Sargenti', null, 'Tony Denison, Brad Davis, Paxton Whitehead, Claudette Nevins, Sydney Penny, Kristin Dattilo, Alan Oppenheimer, Eric Christmas', null, 'A Catholic priest is sent to investigate reports of two virgin conceptions. One is about to give birth to the child of God and the other is the child of the Devil and he must decide which one is good and which one is evil before Satan''s followers can stop him.', 'A Catholic priest is sent to investigate reports of two virgin conceptions. One is about to give birth to the child of God and the other is the child of the Devil and he must decide which one is good and which one is evil before Satan''s followers can stop him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/38HBgMyxySU2lssnrJtdUiymf7l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101592'),
  ('626820986033406315', 'Child of Glass', 1978, 'Drama, Family, Fantasy, TV Movie, Horror, Adventure', 'John Erman, Michael J. Dmytryk, William Cronjager', 'Jim Lawrence', 'Barbara Barrie, Biff McGuire, Anthony Zerbe, Nina Foch, Katy Kurtzman, Steve Shaw, Olivia Barash, Denise Nickerson', 'NR', 'Alexander Armsworth and his family move to an authentic antebellum mansion which once was owned by a river pirate. Alexander is drawn into a century-old mystery when he sees the ghost of a little girl and she asks for his help in finding the "child of glass" by reciting a riddle. He has only a day or two to solve the riddle...or be haunted for the rest of his life!', 'Alexander Armsworth and his family move to an authentic antebellum mansion which once was owned by a river pirate. Alexander is drawn into a century-old mystery when he sees the ghost of a little girl and she asks for his help in finding the "child of glass" by reciting a riddle. He has only a day or two to solve the riddle...or be haunted for the rest of his life!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dPWePISlur6AAO87t61vQbQqsHP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64248'),
  ('873137439302805681', 'Child of God', 2014, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Iris Torres, Caroline Aragon, Sam Holdren', 'James Franco, Vince Jolivette', 'Scott Haze, Wade Hunt Williams, James Franco, Tim Blake Nelson, Jim Parrack, Fallon Goodson, Vince Jolivette, Jeremy Ambler', 'R', 'A dispossessed, violent man''s life is a disastrous attempt to exist outside the social order. Successively deprived of parents and homes and with few other ties, he descends to the level of a cave dweller and falls deeper into crime and degradation.', 'A dispossessed, violent man''s life is a disastrous attempt to exist outside the social order. Successively deprived of parents and homes and with few other ties, he descends to the level of a cave dweller and falls deeper into crime and degradation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6HFUfOnpwHeuHJLs8o4w4QK20C2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152736'),
  ('860538961397916221', 'Child of Kamiari Month', 2021, 'Animation, Drama, Fantasy, Family', 'Takana Shirai, Yoshikazu Iwanami, Junpei Takatsu', 'Ryuta Miyake, Tetsuro Takita', 'Aju Makita, Maaya Sakamoto, Miyu Irino, Riko Nagase, Chafurin, Wataru Takagi, Ko Shibasaki, Arata Iura', 'PG', 'A year after losing her mother, a young girl learns that she must journey across Japan to the annual gathering of gods in the sacred land of Izumo.', 'A year after losing her mother, a young girl learns that she must journey across Japan to the annual gathering of gods in the sacred land of Izumo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ffPIWQjps6NrIYog22yJ8IEAuCT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:628964'),
  ('623640329086094337', 'Child of Rage', 1992, 'Drama, Horror', 'Larry Peerce', 'Suzette Couture, Phil Penningroth', 'Mel Harris, Dwight Schultz, Ashley Peldon, Rosanna DeSoto, Sam Gifaldi, Nan Martin, George D. Wallace, Mariette Hartley', null, 'A priest and his wife adopt a brother and sister, but the girl has terrible outbursts of rage. They get her in treatment and try to find out the reason for this.', 'A priest and his wife adopt a brother and sister, but the girl has terrible outbursts of rage. They get her in treatment and try to find out the reason for this.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q3VAFT3He0RtYGHLyY81kIbUrg4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86131'),
  ('52014858808234732', 'Child of Rage: A Story of Abuse', 1990, 'Documentary', 'Gaby Monet', null, 'Joel Craiger, Ken Magid, Beth Thomas', null, 'Beth Thomas is a six year old girl suffering from reactive attachment disorder as a result of being sexually abused as a child. This documentary consists of interviews with Beth, followed by her treatment and partial recovery at a special center for kids.', 'Beth Thomas is a six year old girl suffering from reactive attachment disorder as a result of being sexually abused as a child. This documentary consists of interviews with Beth, followed by her treatment and partial recovery at a special center for kids.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bu5C5m2wZ1hZ1Lu4Vt9CoGL8DRu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127124'),
  ('1096299079192683146', 'Child of Sorrow', 1956, 'Crime, Drama', 'Lamberto V. Avellana, Mike Accion', 'Rolf Bayer', 'Rosa Rosal, Tony Santos, Joseph de Cordova, Vic Silayan, Vic Bacani, Leroy Salvador, Rosa Aguirre, Oscar Kesse', null, 'A war hero forced to participate in a smuggling ring meets a prostitute in the postwar ruins of Manila.', 'A war hero forced to participate in a smuggling ring meets a prostitute in the postwar ruins of Manila.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/smq4wyI7sCs6uo8HqlE6ywfraCN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253059'),
  ('258917060141495182', 'Child Star', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Demi Lovato, Nicola B. Marsh, Danny Grunes', null, 'Demi Lovato, Drew Barrymore, Christina Ricci, Kenan Thompson, Raven-Symoné, JoJo Siwa, Alyson Stoner, Chris Columbus', 'R', 'Explore the highs and lows of growing up in the spotlight through the lens of some of the world’s most famous former child stars. Through celebrity interviews, verite scenes, and archival footage, this film deconstructs the stages of earlier stardom and looks at the entertainment system over the last century.', 'Explore the highs and lows of growing up in the spotlight through the lens of some of the world’s most famous former child stars. Through celebrity interviews, verite scenes, and archival footage, this film deconstructs the stages of earlier stardom and looks at the entertainment system over the last century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qonoT25IHa7v2j82IkYQwyxZUb6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1323753'),
  ('36225938079098555', 'Child''s Play', 1972, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Sidney Lumet, Gerald Hirschfeld, Hank Moonjean', 'Leon Prochnik', 'James Mason, Robert Preston, Beau Bridges, Ron Weyand, Charles White, David Rounds, Kate Harrington, Jamie Alexander', 'PG', 'At an exclusive boys'' school, a new gym teacher is drawn into a feud between two older instructors, and he discovers that everything at the school is not quite as staid, tranquil and harmless as it seems.', 'At an exclusive boys'' school, a new gym teacher is drawn into a feud between two older instructors, and he discovers that everything at the school is not quite as staid, tranquil and harmless as it seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sOfwI5dzqTwFWQh40C86fjQz07M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82465'),
  ('79841077938481297', 'Child''s Play', 1988, 'Horror', 'Bill Butler, Arthur Anderson, Linnea Ebba Wicklund', 'Don Mancini, John Lafia, Tom Holland', 'Alex Vincent, Brad Dourif, Catherine Hicks, Chris Sarandon, Dinah Manoff, Tommy Swerdlow, Jack Colvin, Neil Giuntoli', 'R', 'After being shot in a toy store, a serial killer transfers his soul into a Good Guy doll. A mother then gifts it to her 6-year old son Andy, which unleashes terror upon the city.', 'After being shot in a toy store, a serial killer transfers his soul into a Good Guy doll. A mother then gifts it to her 6-year old son Andy, which unleashes terror upon the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wvpgvcWNkF2HLuTEMIM7K83MvZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10585'),
  ('926292384726775096', 'Child''s Play', 2019, 'Horror, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Matthew Johnson, Stephanie Wells, Lars Klevberg', 'Tyler Burton Smith', 'Mark Hamill, Aubrey Plaza, Gabriel Bateman, Brian Tyree Henry, Tim Matheson, David James Lewis, Beatrice Kitsos, Ty Consiglio', 'R', 'Karen, a single mother, gifts her son Andy a Buddi doll for his birthday, unaware of its more sinister nature. A contemporary re-imagining of the 1988 horror classic.', 'Karen, a single mother, gifts her son Andy a Buddi doll for his birthday, unaware of its more sinister nature. A contemporary re-imagining of the 1988 horror classic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rpS7ROczWulqfaXG2klYapULXKm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:533642'),
  ('393231458655879820', 'Child''s Play 2', 1990, 'Horror, Thriller', 'John Lafia, Stefan Czapsky, Dennis M. White', 'Don Mancini', 'Alex Vincent, Brad Dourif, Christine Elise, Jenny Agutter, Gerrit Graham, Grace Zabriskie, Peter Haskell, Beth Grant', 'R', 'Chucky is reconstructed by a toy factory to dispel the negative publicity surrounding the doll, and tracks young Andy Barclay to a foster home where the chase begins again.', 'Chucky is reconstructed by a toy factory to dispel the negative publicity surrounding the doll, and tracks young Andy Barclay to a foster home where the chase begins again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2tPQbPQeHEYAGoXFSW61IWNmoce.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11186'),
  ('1007130734316082837', 'Child''s Play 3', 1991, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Jack Bender, John R. Leonetti', 'Don Mancini', 'Justin Whalin, Brad Dourif, Perrey Reeves, Jeremy Sylvers, Travis Fine, Dean Jacobson, Peter Haskell, Dakin Matthews', 'R', 'Eight years after seemingly destroying the killer doll, teen Andy Barclay is placed in a military school, and the spirit of Chucky returns to renew his quest and seek vengeance after being recreated from a mass of melted plastic.', 'Eight years after seemingly destroying the killer doll, teen Andy Barclay is placed in a military school, and the spirit of Chucky returns to renew his quest and seek vengeance after being recreated from a mass of melted plastic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6toMk9OCuDYEEf733Bzlq3yiw3z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11187'),
  ('306331474796157703', 'Child''s Pose', 2013, 'Drama', 'Călin Peter Netzer, Andrei Butica', 'Călin Peter Netzer, Răzvan Rădulescu', 'Vlad Ivanov, Luminița Gheorghiu, Bogdan Dumitrache, Florin Zamfirescu, Mimi Brănescu, Tania Popa, Adrian Titieni, Ilinca Goia', null, 'Child''s Pose is a contemporary drama focusing on the relationship between a mother and her 32-year-old son. After the accidental killing of a boy in a car crash, the mother tries to prevent her son being charged for the death, and she refuses to accept that her son is a grown-up man.', 'Child''s Pose is a contemporary drama focusing on the relationship between a mother and her 32-year-old son. After the accidental killing of a boy in a car crash, the mother tries to prevent her son being charged for the death, and she refuses to accept that her son is a grown-up man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eS7eDNgdk9UHbY8ZY3A5w4aI824.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160118'),
  ('872516858446880134', 'Childish Games', 2012, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Antonio Chavarrías, Guillermo Granillo', 'Sergi Belbel, Antonio Chavarrías', 'Juan Diego Botto, Bárbara Lennie, Mágica Pérez, Marc Rodríguez, Àgata Roca, Nora Navas, Cristina Azofra', null, 'Daniel agrees to take Julia, the daughter of an old childhood friend who has just died, into his home.', 'Daniel agrees to take Julia, the daughter of an old childhood friend who has just died, into his home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nB8YiJz7zIvh3o8YTvcRptXoCz9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120194'),
  ('23817253092863562', 'Childish Quarrel', 1896, 'Documentary', 'Louis Lumière', null, 'Suzanne Lumière, Andrée Lumière', null, 'Two babies are shown seated next to each other, in high chairs, apparently enjoying themselves. Suddenly one snatches a toy from the other and they indulge in hair-pulling.', 'Two babies are shown seated next to each other, in high chairs, apparently enjoying themselves. Suddenly one snatches a toy from the other and they indulge in hair-pulling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4XNmFiW8Sza7hQsyQoEvspmHFFJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152457'),
  ('600364920170107016', 'Children', 1976, 'Drama', 'Terence Davies, Dave Wheeler', 'Terence Davies', 'Phillip Mawdsley, Robin Hooper, Nick Stringer, Valerie Lilley, Linda Beckett, Colin Hignet, Robin Bowen, Trevor Eve', null, 'Robert Tucker, a young gay man who is almost without affect, sits in various waiting rooms. As he sits, he recalls events from the year of his childhood when his father dies. He''s ten or eleven that year, picked on by bullies at the Catholic school he attends. He seems friendless. At home, his mother is quiet, his father is ill and angry. After his father''s death, there''s a wake, the coffin arrives, the body is removed. The lad grieves, alone.', 'Robert Tucker, a young gay man who is almost without affect, sits in various waiting rooms. As he sits, he recalls events from the year of his childhood when his father dies. He''s ten or eleven that year, picked on by bullies at the Catholic school he attends. He seems friendless. At home, his mother is quiet, his father is ill and angry. After his father''s death, there''s a wake, the coffin arrives, the body is removed. The lad grieves, alone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ZDsHP9mc10gqgzTn5RYnyRN4Ag.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48142'),
