  ('917383148325953879', 'Children in the Wind', 1937, 'Drama', 'Hiroshi Shimizu, Masao Saito', null, 'Reikichi Kawamura, Mitsuko Yoshikawa, Masao Hayama, Bakudan Kozo, Takeshi Sakamoto, Fumiko Okamura, Takayuki Suematsu, Fujiko Osafune', null, 'On vacation''s eve, a boy is sent to the countryside to live with his uncle after his father is imprisoned and accused of embezzlement.', 'On vacation''s eve, a boy is sent to the countryside to live with his uncle after his father is imprisoned and accused of embezzlement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2EhQBVNhQbDza5H1hjWa5JvhxLL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:211256'),
  ('979712024709237843', 'Children of a Lesser God', 1986, 'Drama, Romance', 'Randa Haines, John Seale, Kim H. Winther', 'Mark Medoff, Hesper Anderson', 'William Hurt, Marlee Matlin, Piper Laurie, Philip Bosco, Allison Gompf, John F. Cleary, Philip Holmes, Georgia Ann Cline', 'R', 'Starting his new job as an instructor at a New England school for the deaf, James Leeds meets Sarah Norman, a young deaf woman who works at the school as a member of the custodial staff. In spite of Sarah''s withdrawn emotional state, a romance slowly develops between the pair.', 'Starting his new job as an instructor at a New England school for the deaf, James Leeds meets Sarah Norman, a young deaf woman who works at the school as a member of the custodial staff. In spite of Sarah''s withdrawn emotional state, a romance slowly develops between the pair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yAiJlASIXC306qpqe5NZX2GgVlQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1890'),
  ('924665606404550230', 'Children of Chaos', 1989, 'Drama', 'Yannick Bellon, Pierre-William Glenn, Edith Vergne', 'Gérard Sergue, Loleh Bellon, Rémi Waterhouse', 'Emmanuelle Béart, Patrick Catalifo, Mona Bausson, Robert Hossein, Christiane Desbois, Pierre Megemont, Anthony Souter', null, 'Marie is a young woman recently released from prison on drug charges. As a condition of her release, she joins a theatrical troupe composed of young delinquents, and at the same time faces a difficult journey of reintegration into society and strives to rebuild her life.', 'Marie is a young woman recently released from prison on drug charges. As a condition of her release, she joins a theatrical troupe composed of young delinquents, and at the same time faces a difficult journey of reintegration into society and strives to rebuild her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/438U5fwzohy4XCPACkteuoeWgUr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66446'),
  ('471957817964774577', 'Children of Darkness', 1983, 'Documentary', 'Ara Chekmayan, Richard Kotuk, Chuck Levey', 'Ara Chekmayan, Richard Kotuk', 'Peter Thomas, Richard Kotuk, John Brooks, Billy Calhoun, Mary Calhoun, Gerald Davidson, Alice Dunn, Kenneth Kaufman', null, 'A significant number of American children and teenagers - from all social backgrounds - suffer from mental disorders, schizophrenia, autism and emotional problems, leading them to isolation from society while treating their issues in mental health facilities. But there''s no end in sight for those young individuals when they face obstacles and mistreatment in inadequate places under the supervision of careless and inexperienced professionals. The documentary follows some of those public mental institutions and another private center dealing with troubled kids and reveals what''s wrong with their procedures, and the irreparable harm they cause in those patients.', 'A significant number of American children and teenagers - from all social backgrounds - suffer from mental disorders, schizophrenia, autism and emotional problems, leading them to isolation from society while treating their issues in mental health facilities. But there''s no end in sight for those young individuals when they face obstacles and mistreatment in inadequate places under the supervision of careless and inexperienced professionals. The documentary follows some of those public mental institutions and another private center dealing with troubled kids and reveals what''s wrong with their procedures, and the irreparable harm they cause in those patients.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zkffa8H8DzU9HzuSXTuHz8CVQ0C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149374'),
  ('795043564941316133', 'Children of Divorce', 1927, 'Romance, Drama', 'Frank Lloyd, Norbert Brodine, Victor Milner', 'Hope Loring, Louis D. Lighton', 'Clara Bow, Esther Ralston, Gary Cooper, Einar Hanson, Norman Trevor, Hedda Hopper, Edward Martindel, Julia Swayne Gordon', null, 'A young flapper tricks her childhood sweetheart into marrying her. He really loves another woman, but didn''t marry her for fear the marriage would end in divorce, like his parents''. Complications ensue.', 'A young flapper tricks her childhood sweetheart into marrying her. He really loves another woman, but didn''t marry her for fear the marriage would end in divorce, like his parents''. Complications ensue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/628E01MG8iCXpa391BmsFiv0ve.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:170979'),
  ('832550353396448605', 'Children of Don Quixote', 1966, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Yevgeni Karelov, Emil Gulidov, Raisa Margachyova', 'Nina Fomina', 'Anatoliy Papanov, Vera Orlova, Vladimir Korenev, Lev Prygunov, Natalya Fateyeva, Natalya Sedykh, Nikolai Parfyonov, Zoya Vasilkova', null, 'A film about the large family of the head of a maternity hospital. Living by very strict moral standards and nicknamed Don Quixote for this, he brings up his sons in the same spirit. And the sons turn out to be worthy of their father, although they often have to overcome various, both serious and comic, difficulties in life.', 'A film about the large family of the head of a maternity hospital. Living by very strict moral standards and nicknamed Don Quixote for this, he brings up his sons in the same spirit. And the sons turn out to be worthy of their father, although they often have to overcome various, both serious and comic, difficulties in life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6omaho92ADBghGVrOG153BVHsQ1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:386880'),
  ('506084299454318241', 'Children of Glory', 2006, 'Drama, History', 'Krisztina Goda, János Vecsernyés, Buda Gulyás', 'Géza Bereményi, Joe Eszterhas, Éva Gárdos', 'Kata Dobó, Iván Fenyő, Sándor Csányi, Károly Gesztesi, Ildikó Bánsági, Tamás Jordán, Viktória Szávai, Zsolt Huszár', null, 'During the ill-fated Hungarian revolution of 1956, Karcsi Szabo, star player on the water polo team, is torn between his love for a revolutionary student and his training for the Melbourne Olympics.', 'During the ill-fated Hungarian revolution of 1956, Karcsi Szabo, star player on the water polo team, is torn between his love for a revolutionary student and his training for the Melbourne Olympics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nItIaVLewCOqeEWt8Kamj8TBM9B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13616'),
  ('1126431867171023894', 'Children of Hannibal', 1998, 'Comedy', 'Giovanni Cavallini, Lorenzo Dalla Vedova, Daniele Cascella', 'Davide Ferrario, Diego Abatantuono', 'Silvio Orlando, Diego Abatantuono, Valentina Cervi, Flavio Insinna, Elena Giove, Ugo Conti, Pietro Ghislandi, Vita Francioso', 'PG-13', 'Unemployed Domenico robs a bank, but is forced to take a hostage when things go wrong. The hostage, Tommaso, is a man who hates his wife and job, and who was already planning to run away with his gay cop lover anyway, so this seems to him like a good opportunity to disappear and start over again: the kidnapped becomes the kidnapper, and things get even more complicated when the two are joined by Rita, Tommaso''s beautiful daughter.', 'Unemployed Domenico robs a bank, but is forced to take a hostage when things go wrong. The hostage, Tommaso, is a man who hates his wife and job, and who was already planning to run away with his gay cop lover anyway, so this seems to him like a good opportunity to disappear and start over again: the kidnapped becomes the kidnapper, and things get even more complicated when the two are joined by Rita, Tommaso''s beautiful daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5oPg6lwkdNRB9CYkEmTyvOoE3uC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:239783'),
  ('1081867203998384691', 'Children of Hiroshima', 1952, 'Drama, War', 'Kaneto Shindō, Zenju Imaizumi, Takeo Itō', 'Kaneto Shindō', 'Nobuko Otowa, Osamu Takizawa, Masao Shimizu, Jūkichi Uno, Akira Yamanouchi, Jun Tatara, Tsutomu Shimomoto, Hideji Ōtaki', null, 'Shows the devastation caused by the atomic bomb, and by use of a fictional storyline, portrays the struggle of the ordinary Japanese people in dealing with the aftermath.', 'Shows the devastation caused by the atomic bomb, and by use of a fictional storyline, portrays the struggle of the ordinary Japanese people in dealing with the aftermath.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/od3ZsMNLJvfqqQUCqmbawnmRdno.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77057'),
  ('370987773351216080', 'Children of Hotel America', 1991, 'Drama', 'Raimundas Banionis, Jonas Tomaševičius', 'Maciej J. Drygas', 'Augustas Šavelis, Gabija Jaraminaitė Ryškuvienė, Jurga Kaščiukaitė, Rolandas Kazlas, Raimundas Gaižutis, Giedrius Čaikauskas, Gediminas Karka, Linas Paugis', null, 'Kaunas, Lithuania, 1972... Young people are sitting in the Hotel "America" basement and listen to Western Radio.', 'Kaunas, Lithuania, 1972... Young people are sitting in the Hotel "America" basement and listen to Western Radio.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rJTQS74yuRAJJVYZuWF0fJVavBx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171159'),
  ('963987909819362917', 'Children of Men', 2006, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Peter James, Philip Elton, Stephen Forrest-Smith', 'David Arata, Alfonso Cuarón, Timothy J. Sexton', 'Clive Owen, Clare-Hope Ashitey, Chiwetel Ejiofor, Julianne Moore, Michael Caine, Pam Ferris, Charlie Hunnam, Danny Huston', 'R', 'In 2027, in a chaotic world in which humans can no longer procreate, a former activist agrees to help transport a miraculously pregnant woman to a sanctuary at sea, where her child''s birth may help scientists save the future of humankind.', 'In 2027, in a chaotic world in which humans can no longer procreate, a former activist agrees to help transport a miraculously pregnant woman to a sanctuary at sea, where her child''s birth may help scientists save the future of humankind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lQcXgb0fFzffnLV5WY0Q0X2WW7E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9693'),
  ('197059415565206784', 'Children of Nature', 1991, 'Romance, Drama', 'Fridrik Thor Fridriksson, Ari Kristinsson', 'Einar Már Guðmundsson, Fridrik Thor Fridriksson', 'Gísli Halldórsson, Sigríður Hagalín, Baldvin Halldórsson, Björn Karlsson, Bruno Ganz, Bryndis Petra Bragadóttir, Egill Ólafsson, Eiríkur Guðmundsson', null, 'An elderly couple leave their retirement home to make one last journey back to their home in the Western Fjords.', 'An elderly couple leave their retirement home to make one last journey back to their home in the Western Fjords.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lsYKr51GWOwNjZvu6lyry1nNH9S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26880'),
  ('1056396883564701386', 'Children of the Beehive', 1948, 'Drama', 'Hiroshi Shimizu, Saburo Furuyama', 'Hiroshi Shimizu', 'Daisuke Iwanami, Shimamura Shusaku, Shinichiro Kubota, Yoshikatsu Chiba, Yotaka Iwamoto, Sadao Nakamura, Kiyoshi Taira, Hiroyuki Mihara', null, 'A group of war orphans initially seen scratching out an existence through black market work, as they are taken under the wing of a nameless soldier, just repatriated after the war.', 'A group of war orphans initially seen scratching out an existence through black market work, as they are taken under the wing of a nameless soldier, just repatriated after the war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/371KRPFgkCvMhAuh1IKoFHgyXF4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97714'),
  ('518901729313777913', 'Children of the Corn', 1984, 'Horror, Thriller', 'João Fernandes, Fritz Kiersch', 'George Goldsmith', 'Peter Horton, Linda Hamilton, R.G. Armstrong, John Franklin, Courtney Gains, Anne Marie McEvoy, Robby Kiger, Julie Maddalena', 'R', 'A traveling couple end up in an abandoned Nebraska town inhabited by a cult of murderous children who worship a demon that lives in the local cornfields.', 'A traveling couple end up in an abandoned Nebraska town inhabited by a cult of murderous children who worship a demon that lives in the local cornfields.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jJTrFHu3rjAgP1lryKGEsC9hqyM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10823'),
  ('584891362155883462', 'Children of the Corn', 2009, 'Horror, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Donald P. Borchers, Jamie Thompson', 'Donald P. Borchers, Stephen King', 'David Anders, Kandyse McClure, Daniel Newman, Preston Bailey, Robert Gerdisch, Jordan Schmidt, Jake White, Zita Vass', null, 'A traveling couple end up in an abandoned Nebraska town inhabited by a cult of murderous children who worship a demon that lives in the local cornfields.', 'A traveling couple end up in an abandoned Nebraska town inhabited by a cult of murderous children who worship a demon that lives in the local cornfields.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y9sFEgoTkjfy8i0CQzLADxFC0Hf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25754'),
  ('378452782094532177', 'Children of the Corn', 2020, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Andrew Rowlands, Kurt Wimmer', 'Kurt Wimmer', 'Elena Kampouris, Kate Moyer, Callan Mulvey, Jayden McGinlay, Joe Klocek, Bruce Spence, Stephen Hunter, Erika Heynatz', 'R', 'A psychopathic twelve-year-old girl in a small town in Nebraska recruits all the other children and goes on a bloody rampage, killing the corrupt adults and anyone else who opposes her. A bright high schooler who won''t go along with the plan is the town''s only hope of survival.', 'A psychopathic twelve-year-old girl in a small town in Nebraska recruits all the other children and goes on a bloody rampage, killing the corrupt adults and anyone else who opposes her. A bright high schooler who won''t go along with the plan is the town''s only hope of survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ooZbBL28oXDHfc8xSt2VRHU8jkO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:701121'),
  ('573048705762977909', 'Children of the Corn 666: Isaac''s Return', 1999, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Kari Skogland, Richard Clabaugh', 'Tim Sulka, John Franklin', 'John Franklin, Natalie Ramsey, Paul Popowich, Nancy Allen, Stacy Keach, Alix Koromzay, John Patrick White, Sydney Bennett', 'R', 'A girl called Hannah goes back to her hometown (Gatlin) to find her mother but on the way she picks up a strange man who fore-shadows her life with a passage from the bible. When she gets there she wakes up Isaac from a coma he has been in for 19 years. Isaac is awake and wants to fulfil the final prophecy.', 'A girl called Hannah goes back to her hometown (Gatlin) to find her mother but on the way she picks up a strange man who fore-shadows her life with a passage from the bible. When she gets there she wakes up Isaac from a coma he has been in for 19 years. Isaac is awake and wants to fulfil the final prophecy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3c0HiaAAljaWRHWkgNp0uM6sFRD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25752'),
  ('1011825601309700805', 'Children of the Corn II: The Final Sacrifice', 1992, 'Horror', 'David Price, Phil Robinson, Levie Isaacks', 'Gilbert Adler, A L Katz', 'Terence Knox, Paul Scherrer, Ryan Bollman, Christie Clark, Rosalind Allen, Ned Romero, Ed Grady, Matthew Hunter', 'R', 'When a tabloid reporter and his son travel to a quiet Midwestern town to investigate a gruesome massacre, they fall victim to a possessed orphan named Micah.', 'When a tabloid reporter and his son travel to a quiet Midwestern town to investigate a gruesome massacre, they fall victim to a possessed orphan named Micah.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5UaH4zhfKT1taJGHUwPxm29ZENf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25748'),
  ('49654959908529101', 'Children of the Corn III: Urban Harvest', 1995, 'Horror, Thriller', 'James D.R. Hickox, Gerry Lively', 'Dode B. Levenson', 'Daniel Cerny, Ron Melendez, Jim Metzler, Nancy Lee Grahn, Jon Clair, Mari Morrow, Michael Ensign, Duke Stroud', 'R', 'After a couple adopts a pair of orphaned brothers, it becomes alarmingly clear the boys are much more than they seem.', 'After a couple adopts a pair of orphaned brothers, it becomes alarmingly clear the boys are much more than they seem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xTNGI3MGTlOTiYU9ucfWd79kV2k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25749'),
  ('1093346068480559477', 'Children of the Corn IV: The Gathering', 1996, 'Horror', 'Greg Spence, Thom Buckley, Neal Allen', 'Stephen Berger, Greg Spence', 'Naomi Watts, Jamie Renée Smith, Karen Black, Mark Salling, Brent Jennings, Lewis Flanagan III, Brandon Kleyla, William Windom', 'R', 'A bright young medical student must solve the frightening mystery that plagues the children of a small Midwestern town.', 'A bright young medical student must solve the frightening mystery that plagues the children of a small Midwestern town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tRjeV9AZgCXGTqyvlp7Ui55Yb3l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25750'),
  ('508310140677589989', 'Children of the Corn V: Fields of Terror', 1998, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Ethan Wiley, Bill Berry, Brad Arnold', 'Ethan Wiley', 'Stacy Galina, Alexis Arquette, Eva Mendes, Greg Vaughan, Angela Jones, Ahmet Zappa, Fred Williamson, Dave Buzzotta', 'R', 'Six college students take a wrong turn and find themselves lost in a strangely deserted rural town... only to discover that this deceptively quiet place hides a murderous cult of children.', 'Six college students take a wrong turn and find themselves lost in a strangely deserted rural town... only to discover that this deceptively quiet place hides a murderous cult of children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uC6wip2EXdCYQwDDs9FnoakUZQL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25751'),
  ('825363655629658173', 'Children of the Corn: Genesis', 2011, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Joel Soisson, John Stecenko, David Litz', 'Joel Soisson', 'Kelen Coleman, Tim Rock, Billy Drago, Barbara Nedeljakova, Duane Whitaker, Dusty Burwell, J.J. Banicki, Diane Peterson', 'R', 'Tim and Allie seek shelter in a remote desert compound after becoming lost and stranded. A strange Manson-like character, Preacher, reluctantly allows them inside with strict orders to be gone by morning and not wander "where you are not invited."', 'Tim and Allie seek shelter in a remote desert compound after becoming lost and stranded. A strange Manson-like character, Preacher, reluctantly allows them inside with strict orders to be gone by morning and not wander "where you are not invited."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qZvAcvZyT4Duvi5kaPoNoJg2TT9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70575'),
  ('446190603640754874', 'Children of the Corn: Revelation', 2001, 'Horror', 'Guy Magar, Danny Nowak', 'S.J. Smith', 'Claudette Mink, Kyle Cassie, Michael Ironside, Troy Yorke, Michael J Rogers, Taylor Hobbs, Jeffrey Ballard, Sean Smith', 'R', 'When calls to her grandmother go unanswered, Jamie Lowell uncovers the truth behind her mysterious disappearance.', 'When calls to her grandmother go unanswered, Jamie Lowell uncovers the truth behind her mysterious disappearance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sL3ZaPFwgkfn9KuIsh861zsPX0Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25753'),
  ('870603833883148863', 'Children of the Corn: Runaway', 2018, 'Horror', 'John Gulager, Samuel Calvin', 'Joel Soisson', 'Marci Miller, Jake Ryan Scott, Lynn Andrews III, JR Hatchett, Debbi Tucker, Sara Moore, Mary Kathryn Bryant, Kevin Harvey', 'R', 'The plot of Children of the Corn: Runaway follows a young pregnant Ruth who escapes a murderous child cult in a small Midwestern town. She spends the next decade living anonymously in an attempt to spare her son the horrors that she experienced as a child. She lands in the small Oklahoma town, but something is following her. Now, she must confront this evil or lose her child.', 'The plot of Children of the Corn: Runaway follows a young pregnant Ruth who escapes a murderous child cult in a small Midwestern town. She spends the next decade living anonymously in an attempt to spare her son the horrors that she experienced as a child. She lands in the small Oklahoma town, but something is following her. Now, she must confront this evil or lose her child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6PHzwnvTYLMdIHzJaMx9jUJlWXh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:445710'),
  ('26632835760005917', 'Children of the Damned', 1964, 'Drama, Horror, Mystery, Science Fiction', 'Anton Leader, Davis Boulton, Ted Sturgis', 'John Briley', 'Ian Hendry, Alan Badel, Barbara Ferris, Alfred Burke, Clive Powell, Yoke-Moon Lee, Roberta Rex, Gerald del Sol', 'NR', 'Six children are found spread through out the world that not only have enormous intelligence, but identical intelligence and have a strange bond to each other.', 'Six children are found spread through out the world that not only have enormous intelligence, but identical intelligence and have a strange bond to each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l8zpr1tq03YPqdOz6aAmnSpD7o6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30202'),
  ('1052094870729310910', 'Children of the Lie', 2018, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Éric Duret', 'Emmanuel Patron, Armelle Patron', 'Sara Martins, Théo Frilet, Antoine Duléry, Florence Pernel, Philippe Laudenbach, Melodie Raymond Dejoie, Alban Aumard, Robert Rousselle', null, 'A week before her wedding, Agathe Plichard, a pretty young woman of mixed race, is found drowned in the Creuse river. The police treat the case as an accident but her fiancé, Félix Bricourt, is convinced she was murdered. He decides to investigate by himself, despite the wishes of his family, a wealthy dynasty of the region. Won over by Félix''s resolve, police inspector Carole Levasseur also decides to find out the truth. The murder of an independent journalist changes the course of the investigation, stirring up the past and unveiling the forgotten "Children of the Creuse" affair.', 'A week before her wedding, Agathe Plichard, a pretty young woman of mixed race, is found drowned in the Creuse river. The police treat the case as an accident but her fiancé, Félix Bricourt, is convinced she was murdered. He decides to investigate by himself, despite the wishes of his family, a wealthy dynasty of the region. Won over by Félix''s resolve, police inspector Carole Levasseur also decides to find out the truth. The murder of an independent journalist changes the course of the investigation, stirring up the past and unveiling the forgotten "Children of the Creuse" affair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qxxqFshbREQFG8qTIJsIvedAa1Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:570711'),
  ('939009672888942747', 'Children of the Living Dead', 2001, 'Horror', 'Tor Ramsey, Bill Hinzman', 'Karen Lee Wolf', 'Tom Savini, Damien Luvara, Jamie McCoy, Sam Nicotero, Heidi Hinzman, Tom Stoviak, A. Barrett Worland, Martin Schiff', null, 'Starting a new life in a quiet Pennsylvania town, Matthew Michaels only thought is to turn an old farm property into a profitable car dealership. He soon discovers that beneath the gentle surface, this small town is anything but calm and peaceful. Firstly, he learns that his new property is located on the site of a graveyard, which all the townsfolk regard as an evil place that must never be visited. He then discovers that years earlier the town had suffered an infestation of the living dead ...zombies who prey on human flesh. One zombie, the infamous Abbot Hayes, escaped destruction. As the construction team begin degging, they unleash the thing the townsfolk fear the most, the wrath of Abbot Hayes and the awakening of ... The Children of the Living Dead.', 'Starting a new life in a quiet Pennsylvania town, Matthew Michaels only thought is to turn an old farm property into a profitable car dealership. He soon discovers that beneath the gentle surface, this small town is anything but calm and peaceful. Firstly, he learns that his new property is located on the site of a graveyard, which all the townsfolk regard as an evil place that must never be visited. He then discovers that years earlier the town had suffered an infestation of the living dead ...zombies who prey on human flesh. One zombie, the infamous Abbot Hayes, escaped destruction. As the construction team begin degging, they unleash the thing the townsfolk fear the most, the wrath of Abbot Hayes and the awakening of ... The Children of the Living Dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6TFP297jwagAf7Qa6CIkO2bVxrN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34004'),
  ('448264565343929077', 'Children of the Night', 1991, 'Horror', 'Tony Randel, Richard Michalak', 'Nicolas Falacci', 'Karen Black, Peter DeLuise, Ami Dolenz, Maya McLaughlin, Evan MacKenzie, Garrett Morris, David Sawyer, Shirley Spiegler Jacobs', 'R', 'In the quiet little town of Allburg, friends Lucy and Cindy are on the verge of going away to college when they partake in a cleansing ritual by swimming in an abandoned church crypt. After Lucy accidentally drops her crucifix in the water, it drifts down and awakens the ancient vampire Czakyr, who becomes thirsty for Lucy''s virgin blood.', 'In the quiet little town of Allburg, friends Lucy and Cindy are on the verge of going away to college when they partake in a cleansing ritual by swimming in an abandoned church crypt. After Lucy accidentally drops her crucifix in the water, it drifts down and awakens the ancient vampire Czakyr, who becomes thirsty for Lucy''s virgin blood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hvXqvntgMKFxhwxt18sD7R0tuLq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61054'),
  ('1110400216836546936', 'Children of the Night', 2011, 'War, Drama, Romance', 'Pascale Marin, Caroline Deruas', 'Caroline Deruas, Claire Legendre', 'Yves Donval, Adèle Haenel, Arthur Igual, Felix M. Ott', null, 'Spring 1944. «Some love stories seem self-evident. Perhaps they were unaware of its fatal outcome. In any case, it was inevitable.» Coming from a family of Resistance fighters, Henriette lives the inconceivable : she falls in love with Josef, a young German soldier. Marcel, her friend since childhood, secretly in love with her, discovers their romance and joins the maquis the day before the Liberation. When he will come back, he will not be alone anymore, and they will wear the armband of the FFI.', 'Spring 1944. «Some love stories seem self-evident. Perhaps they were unaware of its fatal outcome. In any case, it was inevitable.» Coming from a family of Resistance fighters, Henriette lives the inconceivable : she falls in love with Josef, a young German soldier. Marcel, her friend since childhood, secretly in love with her, discovers their romance and joins the maquis the day before the Liberation. When he will come back, he will not be alone anymore, and they will wear the armband of the FFI.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gWkzoeMWjuSrMz9HhXbi5Jl3KSE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:300811'),
  ('915193119265599592', 'Children of the Night', 2014, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Iván Noel, Iván Noel, Diego Savignano', 'Iván Noel', 'Ana María Giunta, Sabrina Ramos, Gregorio Muñoz, Lauro Veron, Toto Muñoz, Angel Diaz de Villaverde, Angelo Correa, Emilio Atti', 'PG-13', 'Limbo centers around a secluded colony of child-vampires between the ages of 4 and 120, who were all the victims of shameless adult vampires. They are led by a formidable and deeply religious ex-nurse whose destiny in life is to find these ‘lost souls’ and raise them in her colony. Through religious teachings and rituals adapted from Catholicism, and the occasional visit to local towns for blood, she prepares the children for what God had in mind for them…', 'Limbo centers around a secluded colony of child-vampires between the ages of 4 and 120, who were all the victims of shameless adult vampires. They are led by a formidable and deeply religious ex-nurse whose destiny in life is to find these ‘lost souls’ and raise them in her colony. Through religious teachings and rituals adapted from Catholicism, and the occasional visit to local towns for blood, she prepares the children for what God had in mind for them…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8wKqqujJZxHa74AS26a3us2NmX5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:308650'),
  ('793116092530125437', 'Children of the Night', 2016, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime, Thriller', 'Andrea De Sica, Stefano Falivene, Lucille Cristaldi', 'Andrea De Sica, Mariano Di Nardo, Gloria Malatesta', 'Vincenzo Crea, Ludovico Succio, Fabrizio Rongione, Yuliia Sobol, Luigi Bignone, Pietro Monfreda, Michael Bernhard Plattner, Marco Boriero', null, 'Somewhere in the bleak Italian Alps is an isolated boarding school for troubled boys of the ultra privileged. 17-year old Giulio is sent there by his mother and finds himself instantly at odds with both his peers and the staff until the arrival of the eccentric Eduordo. The pair bond over their mutual desire for escape, which they eventually do, and run away to a nightclub in the middle of the woods. There they meet Elena, a young prostitute whose destiny will be unforgettably linked to theirs. For the boys, the night is full of freedom, disturbing experiences, and secrets. But what they discover about their experiences, and their school, may be the biggest secret of all.', 'Somewhere in the bleak Italian Alps is an isolated boarding school for troubled boys of the ultra privileged. 17-year old Giulio is sent there by his mother and finds himself instantly at odds with both his peers and the staff until the arrival of the eccentric Eduordo. The pair bond over their mutual desire for escape, which they eventually do, and run away to a nightclub in the middle of the woods. There they meet Elena, a young prostitute whose destiny will be unforgettably linked to theirs. For the boys, the night is full of freedom, disturbing experiences, and secrets. But what they discover about their experiences, and their school, may be the biggest secret of all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tyji4KRSq3d1vzcnsYF5YX0dM1n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:425332'),
  ('446978541499131978', 'Children of the Otherside', 2008, 'Action, Drama, Crime', 'Aydın Bulut', null, 'Mehmet Ali Nuroğlu, İsmail Hacıoğlu, Eyşan Özhim, Volga Sorgu, Ertan Saban, Bülent İnal, Rıza Kocaoğlu, Erkan Bektaş', null, 'Semih, who was discharged from the army a month early for his "heroism" in operations in the southeast, encounters his brother''s funeral on the day he returns from the army. When he sets out to find his brother''s killer, Semih is drawn into another battle filled with difficult questions. As he searches for the truth, he will realize that what was lost was not just his brother''s life, but also the harsh reality of lives doomed to be lost in "The Other Istanbul," fueled by anger and helplessness.', 'Semih, who was discharged from the army a month early for his "heroism" in operations in the southeast, encounters his brother''s funeral on the day he returns from the army. When he sets out to find his brother''s killer, Semih is drawn into another battle filled with difficult questions. As he searches for the truth, he will realize that what was lost was not just his brother''s life, but also the harsh reality of lives doomed to be lost in "The Other Istanbul," fueled by anger and helplessness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gqT5cQCvaPWUZSAvoauafEkItjU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52189'),
  ('528041358322684165', 'Children of the Revolution', 1996, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Martin McGrath, Peter Duncan, Jennifer Leacey', 'Peter Duncan', 'Judy Davis, Sam Neill, F. Murray Abraham, Richard Roxburgh, Rachel Griffiths, Geoffrey Rush, Russell Kiefel, John Gaden', null, 'A man (Richard Roxburgh) the Australian government blames for 1990s political woes blames his mother (Judy Davis), a communist Stalin seduced in 1951.', 'A man (Richard Roxburgh) the Australian government blames for 1990s political woes blames his mother (Judy Davis), a communist Stalin seduced in 1951.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jfL0X3Ym9R9QDkUQZufwzVq12F0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9977'),
  ('773132108253661352', 'Children of the Sea', 2019, 'Animation, Fantasy, Adventure, Mystery', 'Kenichi Konishi, Kenichi Konishi, Koji Kasamatsu', 'Saku Konohana', 'Mana Ashida, Hiiro Ishibashi, Seishu Uragami, Win Morisaki, Goro Inagaki, Yu Aoi, Tohru Watanabe, Min Tanaka', 'NR', 'Ruka is a young girl whose parents are separated and whose father works in an aquarium. When two boys, Umi and Sora, who were raised in the sea by dugongs, are brought to the aquarium, Ruka feels drawn to them and begins to realize that she has the same sort of supernatural connection to the ocean that they do. Umi and Sora''s special power seems to be connected to strange events that have been occurring more and more frequently, such as the appearance of sea creatures far from their home territory and the disappearance of aquarium animals around the world. However, the exact nature of the boys'' power and of the abnormal events is unknown, and Ruka gets drawn into investigating the mystery that surrounds her new friends.', 'Ruka is a young girl whose parents are separated and whose father works in an aquarium. When two boys, Umi and Sora, who were raised in the sea by dugongs, are brought to the aquarium, Ruka feels drawn to them and begins to realize that she has the same sort of supernatural connection to the ocean that they do. Umi and Sora''s special power seems to be connected to strange events that have been occurring more and more frequently, such as the appearance of sea creatures far from their home territory and the disappearance of aquarium animals around the world. However, the exact nature of the boys'' power and of the abnormal events is unknown, and Ruka gets drawn into investigating the mystery that surrounds her new friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Fch8X5C5yW2srPVBiq6LNRvwd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:585077'),
  ('550012765612410580', 'Children of the Stork', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Tony Gatlif, Claude Garnier, Éric Guichard', 'Tony Gatlif', 'Romain Duris, Rona Hartner, Ouassini Embarek, Noël Simsolo, Suzanne Flon, Christine Pignet, Daniel Laloux', null, 'Three French pals take to the road in a stolen car and discover a talking, wounded stork — who claims to have deserted the Algerian army — and help it to escape to the home of a relative in Germany.', 'Three French pals take to the road in a stolen car and discover a talking, wounded stork — who claims to have deserted the Algerian army — and help it to escape to the home of a relative in Germany.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sfx4c7i1o3qfm0R5wGPu9WULBc5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31670'),
  ('109439003959718115', 'Children Playing Marbles', 1896, 'Documentary', 'Louis Lumière', null, null, null, 'Game of marbles between four or five boys.', 'Game of marbles between four or five boys.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zVk4TbbT24vPdm7koMpaPhUFPia.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190567'),
  ('261908064656364524', 'Children Shouldn''t Play with Dead Things', 1972, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Bob Clark, Jack McGowan', 'Bob Clark', 'Alan Ormsby, Valerie Mamches, Jeff Gillen, Anya Ormsby, Paul Cronin, Jane Daly, Roy Engleman, Robert Philip', 'PG', 'Six actors go to a graveyard on a remote island to act out a necromantic ritual. The ritual works, and soon the dead are walking about and chowing down on human flesh.', 'Six actors go to a graveyard on a remote island to act out a necromantic ritual. The ritual works, and soon the dead are walking about and chowing down on human flesh.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bLWtAzj3zlqVBjv07v9KcGOLpiv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20842'),
  ('505874768807356794', 'Children Underground', 2001, 'Documentary', 'Edet Belzberg, Wolfgang Held', null, 'Cristina Ionescu, Mihai Alexandre Tudose, Violeta ''Macarena'' Rosu, Ana Turturica, Marian Turturica, Alexandru Beschina, Florin Ionut Calciu, Adrian Chiru', null, 'Children Underground follows the story of five street children, aged eight to sixteen who live in a subway station in Bucharest, Romania. The street kids are encountered daily by commuting adults, who pass them by in the station as they starve, swindle, and steal, all while searching desperately for a fresh can of paint to get high with.', 'Children Underground follows the story of five street children, aged eight to sixteen who live in a subway station in Bucharest, Romania. The street kids are encountered daily by commuting adults, who pass them by in the station as they starve, swindle, and steal, all while searching desperately for a fresh can of paint to get high with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uacoFb7DHq0MrUjMcjjMZlIgmu2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51722'),
  ('209829493014606354', 'Children Who Chase Lost Voices', 2011, 'Animation, Adventure, Fantasy, Family', 'Makoto Shinkai, Takayo Nishimura, Kenichi Tsuchiya', 'Makoto Shinkai', 'Hisako Kanemoto, Kazuhiko Inoue, Miyu Irino, Rina Hidaka, Fumiko Orikasa, Sumi Shimamoto, Junko Takeuchi, Kanae Itou', 'PG', 'The film centers on Asuna, a young girl who spends her solitary days listening to the mysterious music emanating from the crystal radio she received from her late father as a memento. One day while walking home she is attacked by a fearsome monster and saved by a mysterious boy named Shun. However, Shun disappears and Asuna embarks on a journey of adventure to the land of Agartha with her teacher Mr. Morisaki to meet a Shun again. Through her journey she comes to know the cruelty and beauty of the world, as well as loss.', 'The film centers on Asuna, a young girl who spends her solitary days listening to the mysterious music emanating from the crystal radio she received from her late father as a memento. One day while walking home she is attacked by a fearsome monster and saved by a mysterious boy named Shun. However, Shun disappears and Asuna embarks on a journey of adventure to the land of Agartha with her teacher Mr. Morisaki to meet a Shun again. Through her journey she comes to know the cruelty and beauty of the world, as well as loss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hWyBwsjMgtuZL2i1QBWQY0OCh0M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79707'),
  ('318571809319978083', 'Children...', 2011, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Lee Kyu-man, Choe Won-kyung, Ki Se-hun', 'Lee Kyu-man, Lee Hyeon-Jin', 'Park Yong-woo, Ryu Seung-ryong, Sung Ji-ru, Kim Yeo-jin, Sung Dong-il, Park Byung-eun, Kim Koo-taek, Park Mi-hyeon', null, 'On March 26, 1991, five boys set off to the mountain to go frog hunting and never come back to their family. While a documentary producer, detective and professor try to solve the mystery of the incident, one of the boys'' parents is a suspect.', 'On March 26, 1991, five boys set off to the mountain to go frog hunting and never come back to their family. While a documentary producer, detective and professor try to solve the mystery of the incident, one of the boys'' parents is a suspect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1RRzcPFHgBUBMJWb2D5OsDQ7Rm7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72066'),
  ('261939023158954093', 'Children''s Ball', 1896, 'Documentary', 'Louis Lumière', null, null, null, 'A group of ten infant girls are on a playground. They are in pairs, matched in height. They are doing an organised dance. Each pair twirls simultaneously, while all five pairs rotate in a circular sequence. They often stop their circular rotation so that each pair can perform the same manoeuvre as the other four simultaneously.', 'A group of ten infant girls are on a playground. They are in pairs, matched in height. They are doing an organised dance. Each pair twirls simultaneously, while all five pairs rotate in a circular sequence. They often stop their circular rotation so that each pair can perform the same manoeuvre as the other four simultaneously.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wGrZqjZKQcgtNyfqrxB3dPKYJtd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:231128'),
  ('67162234198758303', 'Children''s Island', 1980, 'Drama, Family, Romance', 'Roland Sterner, Kay Pollak', 'Carl-Johan Seth, Ola Olsson, Kay Pollak', 'Tomas Fryk, Anita Ekström, Ingvar Hirdwall, Börje Ahlstedt, Lars-Erik Berenett, Sif Ruud, Hjördis Petterson, Malin Ek', null, 'Reine is supposed to go to a summer camp called Children''s Island but decides to remain in Stockholm over the summer while his mother is working at a hospital. She thinks he is at the camp, and he tells her he is. We then follow him around Stockholm that summer and see what he encounters on the path of life.', 'Reine is supposed to go to a summer camp called Children''s Island but decides to remain in Stockholm over the summer while his mother is working at a hospital. She thinks he is at the camp, and he tells her he is. We then follow him around Stockholm that summer and see what he encounters on the path of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AuITSUgOJBEojLNxOPL4KevufvK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80310'),
  ('964727146899426052', 'Children''s Party', 1938, null, 'Joseph Cornell', null, null, null, 'Director Joseph Cornell evokes the nostalgia of childhood by filming a children''s party.', 'Director Joseph Cornell evokes the nostalgia of childhood by filming a children''s party.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2O6uUH6uuwfHzdUxfCKgx3pzF80.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145283'),
  ('357398856499675116', 'Children''s Play', 2001, 'Drama, Fantasy, Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Laurent Tuel, Denis Rouden', 'Laurent Tuel, Constance Verluca', 'Karin Viard, Charles Berling, Camille Vatel, Alexandre Bongibault, Ludivine Sagnier, Aurélien Recoing, Pierre Julien, Manuela Gourary', null, 'Marianne and Jacques are a young middle-class couple who live in a chic Parisian apartment with their two young children. One day, Marianne receives an unexpected visit from two strangers, Mr and Mrs Worms, who claim to have lived in the apartment when they were children and who ask if they can just take a look around their former home. Marianne agrees, but no sooner have the mysterious Worms left than things take an inexplicable turn for the worse...', 'Marianne and Jacques are a young middle-class couple who live in a chic Parisian apartment with their two young children. One day, Marianne receives an unexpected visit from two strangers, Mr and Mrs Worms, who claim to have lived in the apartment when they were children and who ask if they can just take a look around their former home. Marianne agrees, but no sooner have the mysterious Worms left than things take an inexplicable turn for the worse...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AmxoMJ8ZibI6hpOODPAoomGFM8D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64839'),
  ('708535656292631703', 'Chile ''76', 2022, 'Drama', 'Soledad Rodríguez, Manuela Martelli, Gwenn Joyaux', 'Alejandra Moffat, Manuela Martelli', 'Aline Küppenheim, Nicolás Sepúlveda, Hugo Medina, Alejandro Goic, Carmen Gloria Martinez, Amalia Kassai, Gabriel Urzúa, Luis Cerda', null, 'Chile, 1976. Carmen heads off to her beach house. When the family priest asks her to take care of a young man he is sheltering in secret, Carmen steps onto unexplored territories, away from the quiet life she is used to.', 'Chile, 1976. Carmen heads off to her beach house. When the family priest asks her to take care of a young man he is sheltering in secret, Carmen steps onto unexplored territories, away from the quiet life she is used to.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e8cO013usqWgawu520n1OdmX3jp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:957461'),
  ('958129168065436416', 'Chile: Obstinate Memory', 1997, 'Documentary', 'Patricio Guzmán, Álvaro Silva Wuth, Eric Pittard', null, 'Patricio Guzmán, Vincent Davy, José Balmes, Hortensia Allende, Pablo Perelman, Salvador Allende', null, 'After decades of fascist rule in Chile, Patricio Guzmán returns to his country to screen his documentary The Battle of Chile.', 'After decades of fascist rule in Chile, Patricio Guzmán returns to his country to screen his documentary The Battle of Chile.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1QTRTFaByM7yMeLehjqBb7tILll.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168421'),
  ('1137733338898140772', 'Chili Weather', 1963, 'Animation', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Speedy Gonzales helps his fellow mice get food from the Guadalajara Food Processing plant, guarded by Sylvester the Cat.', 'Speedy Gonzales helps his fellow mice get food from the Guadalajara Food Processing plant, guarded by Sylvester the Cat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yxi2nMhG0ecmFyTeP6yopsZSeRR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175185'),
  ('781592621849438401', 'Chill Factor', 1999, 'Action, Comedy, Thriller', 'Hugh Johnson, David Gribble, Jerry G. Callaway', 'Drew Gitlin, Mike Cheda', 'Cuba Gooding Jr., Skeet Ulrich, Peter Firth, David Paymer, Hudson Leick, Daniel Hugh Kelly, Kevin J. O''Connor, Judson Mills', 'R', 'A store clerk and an ice cream truck driver are thrown together when a dying scientist entrusts them with a deadly chemical kept in ice. This chemical will kill every living thing once it melts. They have to take the chemical codenamed ''Elvis'' to the next nearest military base while being chased by terrorists who want it to hold the country for ransom.', 'A store clerk and an ice cream truck driver are thrown together when a dying scientist entrusts them with a deadly chemical kept in ice. This chemical will kill every living thing once it melts. They have to take the chemical codenamed ''Elvis'' to the next nearest military base while being chased by terrorists who want it to hold the country for ransom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fgPC0xS3o6J5eWFwetssfSD2SEK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2162'),
  ('851688753850473498', 'Chill Out, Scooby-Doo!', 2007, 'Family, Comedy, Animation, Adventure, Mystery', 'Joe Sichta', 'Adam Scheinman, Joe Sichta', 'Frank Welker, Casey Kasem, Grey DeLisle, Mindy Cohn, Kim Mai Guest, René Auberjonois, Alfred Molina, James Sie', 'NR', 'The gang''s vacation to Paris takes a wrong turn when Scooby and Shaggy miss their flight and end up on a skydiving expedition in the Himalayas. To make matters worse, upon arrival they must outrun the Abominable Snowmonster.', 'The gang''s vacation to Paris takes a wrong turn when Scooby and Shaggy miss their flight and end up on a skydiving expedition in the Himalayas. To make matters worse, upon arrival they must outrun the Abominable Snowmonster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n1SgvnX4SJ6gZEpDSQEbcmQOslJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13354'),
  ('525437160318777215', 'Chill Out!', 2003, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Dunia Ayaso, Félix Sabroso, Kiko de la Rica', 'Félix Sabroso', 'Pepón Nieto, Candela Peña, Loles León, Rubén Ochandiano, Carmen Machi, José Ángel Egido, Óscar Jaenada, Pilar Castro', null, 'Just Santos, cabaret actor with a talent for imitation, receives the offer of a role in a movie that could change his life and his family.', 'Just Santos, cabaret actor with a talent for imitation, receives the offer of a role in a movie that could change his life and his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4hFEJ581cC91PetxyWA1P98rEft.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145594'),
  ('1118357336647167478', 'Chillar Party', 2011, 'Drama, Comedy, Family', 'Nitesh Tiwari, Vikas Bahl', 'Nitesh Tiwari, Vijay Maurya, Vikas Bahl', 'Irfan Khan, Sanath Menon, Rohan Grover, Naman Jain, Visshesh Tiwari, Chinmay Chandraunshuh, Aarav Khanna, Vedant Desai', null, 'A gang of innocent but feisty kids who lead carefree lives in Chandan Nagar colony, take on the big bad world of politics when one of their friend''s life is endangered.', 'A gang of innocent but feisty kids who lead carefree lives in Chandan Nagar colony, take on the big bad world of politics when one of their friend''s life is endangered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8YiD2WbKltx1XzpWZ83sNIUttGX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69891'),
  ('414839285565320969', 'Chiller', 1985, 'Horror, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Wes Craven, Frank Thackery', 'J.D. Feigelson', 'Michael Beck, Beatrice Straight, Laura Johnson, Dick O''Neill, Alan Fudge, Craig Richard Nelson, Paul Sorvino, Jill Schoelen', 'PG-13', 'A wealthy industrialist arranges for his body to be kept on ice in a high-tech cryonic chamber. When the instructions are not followed properly, he emerges from the frozen crypt as an empty, soulless creature with an appetite for destruction.', 'A wealthy industrialist arranges for his body to be kept on ice in a high-tech cryonic chamber. When the instructions are not followed properly, he emerges from the frozen crypt as an empty, soulless creature with an appetite for destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/euvmc9IrdCHJ04xb1CX8eGRIxWG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58798'),
  ('123169837200779734', 'Chillerama', 2011, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Adam Green, Adam Rifkin, Tim Sullivan', 'Joe Lynch, Adam Rifkin, Tim Sullivan', 'Richard Riehle, Adam Rifkin, Ray Wise, Sarah Mutch, Eric Roberts, Owen Benjamin, Kelly Divine, Joel David Moore', 'NR', 'It''s the closing night at the last drive-in theater in America and Cecil B. Kaufman has planned the ultimate marathon of lost film prints to unleash upon his faithful cinephile patrons. Four films so rare that they have never been exhibited publicly on American soil until this very night! With titles like Wadzilla, I Was a Teenage Werebear, The Diary of Anne Frankenstein, and Zom-B-Movie, Chillerama not only celebrates the golden age of drive-in B horror shlock but also spans over four decades of cinema with something for every bad taste.', 'It''s the closing night at the last drive-in theater in America and Cecil B. Kaufman has planned the ultimate marathon of lost film prints to unleash upon his faithful cinephile patrons. Four films so rare that they have never been exhibited publicly on American soil until this very night! With titles like Wadzilla, I Was a Teenage Werebear, The Diary of Anne Frankenstein, and Zom-B-Movie, Chillerama not only celebrates the golden age of drive-in B horror shlock but also spans over four decades of cinema with something for every bad taste.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eQsZdgCHvPKjLnK30ABVnt9wJcw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79771'),
  ('281385103719970867', 'Chillers', 1987, 'Horror', 'Daniel Boyd, Bill Hogan', 'Daniel Boyd', 'Jesse Emery, Marjorie Fitzsimmons, Laurie Pennington, Jim Wolfe, David Wohl, Gary Brown, Jesse Johnson, Thom Delventhal', 'NR', 'While waiting for their bus, five passengers who have all just had horrible nightmares decide to tell them to each other to help kill time.', 'While waiting for their bus, five passengers who have all just had horrible nightmares decide to tell them to each other to help kill time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/raPqKBkpMQ8TneMsLtRU1lucYzJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97971'),
  ('254965592916076308', 'Chilly Dogs', 2001, 'Adventure, Action, Comedy', 'Bob Spiers', 'William Osborne', 'Skeet Ulrich, Natasha Henstridge, Leslie Nielsen, Campbell Lane, Rik Mayall, Lochlyn Munro, Jay Brazeau, Benita Ha', null, 'A man must participate in the Iditarod dog race across Alaska to inherit property from his legendary grandfather, but ends up getting much more than he bargained for.', 'A man must participate in the Iditarod dog race across Alaska to inherit property from his legendary grandfather, but ends up getting much more than he bargained for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gw1CJY7i2mYtPIr4uDwTv5jjEQl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31910'),
  ('957492996826865122', 'Chilly Scenes of Winter', 1979, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Joan Micklin Silver, Bo Welch, Lorin Bennett Salob', 'Joan Micklin Silver', 'John Heard, Mary Beth Hurt, Peter Riegert, Kenneth McMillan, Gloria Grahame, Nora Heflin, Jerry Hardin, Tarah Nutter', 'PG', 'Charles is a bored civil servant struggling through a harsh Utah winter. He spends most of his time reflecting on his romance with Laura, a coworker who left him to return to her husband, an A-Frame salesman.', 'Charles is a bored civil servant struggling through a harsh Utah winter. He spends most of his time reflecting on his romance with Laura, a coworker who left him to return to her husband, an A-Frame salesman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/teN4NJdGcHbIm9IwXerysNknmGh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42173'),
  ('103226933720490374', 'Chilly Willy', 1953, 'Animation', 'Paul J. Smith', null, null, null, 'A schooner anchors at the South Pole, and the skipper goes ashore and leaves the ship''s mascot, a St. Bernard dog, to stand watch and guard the ship. A small penguin, Chilly Willy (the only penguin not equipped for cold weather...anywhere), sees the ship and tries to get warm by its stove. The watchdog attempts to get rid of him, but Willy manages to get the dog drunk from the rum in its own cask. The captain returns to find Willy saving the ship from sinking, while the dog is found sleeping it off. Willy is made mascot and the dog is tossed in the ship''s brig.', 'A schooner anchors at the South Pole, and the skipper goes ashore and leaves the ship''s mascot, a St. Bernard dog, to stand watch and guard the ship. A small penguin, Chilly Willy (the only penguin not equipped for cold weather...anywhere), sees the ship and tries to get warm by its stove. The watchdog attempts to get rid of him, but Willy manages to get the dog drunk from the rum in its own cask. The captain returns to find Willy saving the ship from sinking, while the dog is found sleeping it off. Willy is made mascot and the dog is tossed in the ship''s brig.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d75rnCxuT4vKPX9UHRQgzavSQf8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235829'),
  ('1012024070572536121', 'Chilsu and Mansu', 1988, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Park Kwang-su, Kim Dong-ho, You Yong-kil', 'Ji Sang-hak, Huang Chunming, Choi In-seok', 'Ahn Sung-ki, Park Joong-hoon, Bae Jong-ok, Kwon Jae-hee, Choi In-seok, Kim Myeong-kuk, Kang Shin-il', null, 'An aimless young man and his sign-painter friend draw a crowd when they climb to the top of a high-rise billboard.', 'An aimless young man and his sign-painter friend draw a crowd when they climb to the top of a high-rise billboard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wYXaJPj5j438jZMOT8BZlmgu5v8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257638'),
  ('1043862585163991408', 'Chime', 2024, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Kiyoshi Kurosawa, Takahide Sakai, Kōichi Furuya', 'Kiyoshi Kurosawa', 'Mutsuo Yoshioka, Seiichi Kohinata, Hana Amano, Junpei Yasui, Koji Seki, Giko, Noa Kawazoe, Koki Ishige', null, 'A chef''s life is disrupted by a chime that brings with it an increasing sense of dread.', 'A chef''s life is disrupted by a chime that brings with it an increasing sense of dread.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s6bBgT11fFHwKrzrFluCoKfcjdU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1219556'),
  ('490169693736612450', 'Chimères', 2013, 'Horror, Drama, Romance', 'Olivier Beguin', 'Colin Vettier, Olivier Beguin', 'Jasna Kohoutova, Yannick Rosset, Catriona MacColl, Ruggero Deodato, Paulo dos Santos', null, 'A young couple, Alexander and Livia, take off on holiday to Romania. Hospitalized after being hit by a car, Alexander must undergo a blood transfusion—with horrifying consequences: upon his return, he seems afflicted with a strange disease.', 'A young couple, Alexander and Livia, take off on holiday to Romania. Hospitalized after being hit by a car, Alexander must undergo a blood transfusion—with horrifying consequences: upon his return, he seems afflicted with a strange disease.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2EdZU3017dsHUZK6dZXAi7riNJX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171280'),
  ('575908597578473286', 'Chimes at Midnight', 1965, 'Comedy, Drama, History, War', 'Edmond Richard, Orson Welles, Jesús Franco', 'Orson Welles', 'Orson Welles, Keith Baxter, John Gielgud, Jeanne Moreau, Margaret Rutherford, Marina Vlady, Walter Chiari, Michael Aldridge', 'NR', 'Henry IV usurps the English throne, sets in motion the factious War of the Roses and now faces a rebellion led by Northumberland scion Hotspur. Henry''s heir, Prince Hal, is a ne''er-do-well carouser who drinks and causes mischief with his low-class friends, especially his rotund father figure, John Falstaff. To redeem his title, Hal may have to choose between allegiance to his real father and loyalty to his friend.', 'Henry IV usurps the English throne, sets in motion the factious War of the Roses and now faces a rebellion led by Northumberland scion Hotspur. Henry''s heir, Prince Hal, is a ne''er-do-well carouser who drinks and causes mischief with his low-class friends, especially his rotund father figure, John Falstaff. To redeem his title, Hal may have to choose between allegiance to his real father and loyalty to his friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Fjxyz3u2Zdco4WeuC3wQ6O5tYQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:986'),
  ('696968051037025396', 'Chimpanzee', 2012, 'Documentary', 'Alastair Fothergill, Mark Linfield, Nicholas Hooper', null, 'Tim Allen', 'G', 'A nature documentary centered on a family of chimps living in the Ivory Coast and Ugandan rain forests. Through Oscar, a little chimpanzee, we discover learning about life in the heart of the African tropical forest and follow his first steps in this world with humor, emotion and anguish. Following a tragedy, he finds himself separated from his mother and left alone to face the hostility of the jungle. Until he is picked up by an older chimpanzee, who will take him under her protection.', 'A nature documentary centered on a family of chimps living in the Ivory Coast and Ugandan rain forests. Through Oscar, a little chimpanzee, we discover learning about life in the heart of the African tropical forest and follow his first steps in this world with humor, emotion and anguish. Following a tragedy, he finds himself separated from his mother and left alone to face the hostility of the jungle. Until he is picked up by an older chimpanzee, who will take him under her protection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zmqWHkCXHM9n28zqL2LrPmJ5a7W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72334'),
  ('1013707960699989069', 'China', 1943, 'War, Drama, Adventure', 'John Farrow, Leo Tover', 'Frank Butler', 'Alan Ladd, Loretta Young, William Bendix, Philip Ahn, Iris Wong, Victor Sen Yung, Marianne Quon, Richard Loo', 'NR', 'Shortly before Pearl Harbor, American opportunist Jones and partner Johnny are in China to sell oil to the invading Japanese army. Cynical about the sufferings of the Chinese, Jones meets compassionate teacher Carolyn Grant while travelling cross-country to Shanghai. Sparks fly between these strong-willed characters, neither budging an inch. But when Jones witnesses a Japanese atrocity, his feelings toward his customers (and Carolyn) begin to change...', 'Shortly before Pearl Harbor, American opportunist Jones and partner Johnny are in China to sell oil to the invading Japanese army. Cynical about the sufferings of the Chinese, Jones meets compassionate teacher Carolyn Grant while travelling cross-country to Shanghai. Sparks fly between these strong-willed characters, neither budging an inch. But when Jones witnesses a Japanese atrocity, his feelings toward his customers (and Carolyn) begin to change...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eaYa9wBgmePr7mWvvlxKkB1hKSI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162641'),
  ('865326672728954760', 'China 9, Liberty 37', 1978, 'Action, Western', 'Monte Hellman, Giuseppe Rotunno', 'Jerry Harvey, Douglas Venturelli', 'Fabio Testi, Warren Oates, Jenny Agutter, Sam Peckinpah, Isabel Mestres, Gianrico Tondinelli, Franco Interlenghi, Charly Bravo', 'R', 'Gunslinger Clayton Drumm is about to be hanged when he is given a chance to live if he agrees to murder Matthew, a miner who has steadfastly refused to sell his land to the railroad company. Matthew’s refusal is a major obstacle to the railroad’s plans for expansion.', 'Gunslinger Clayton Drumm is about to be hanged when he is given a chance to live if he agrees to murder Matthew, a miner who has steadfastly refused to sell his land to the railroad company. Matthew’s refusal is a major obstacle to the railroad’s plans for expansion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uPLXVL9cvMI29McjLnBcldZizeJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22396'),
  ('518350152456887220', 'China and Sex', 1994, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Joe D''Amato', null, 'Marc Gosálvez, Nongkok Kok, Lora Luna, Lim Yao, Li Yu', null, 'A wealthy man falls for a woman who does not accept his courtship which forces him to enters a dangerous and erotic dream world.', 'A wealthy man falls for a woman who does not accept his courtship which forces him to enters a dangerous and erotic dream world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dfhMVZAa5vr5taUWrceW3SJDOVx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:378900'),
  ('18463619006873708', 'China Gate', 1957, 'Action, War, Drama', 'Samuel Fuller, Joseph F. Biroc', 'Samuel Fuller', 'Gene Barry, Angie Dickinson, Nat King Cole, Paul Dubov, Lee Van Cleef, George Givot, Gerald Milton, Neyle Morrow', 'NR', 'Near the end of the French phase of the Vietnam War, a group of mercenaries are recruited to travel through enemy territory to the Chinese border.', 'Near the end of the French phase of the Vietnam War, a group of mercenaries are recruited to travel through enemy territory to the Chinese border.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pVc5V8iljUjrODwzfBlvWXJ3XzP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86777'),
  ('105588672212266935', 'China Gate', 1998, 'Action, Adventure, Western', 'Rajkumar Santoshi, Piyush Shah', 'Rajkumar Santoshi', 'Om Puri, Naseeruddin Shah, Danny Denzongpa, Mamta Kulkarni, Ila Arun, Kulbhushan Kharbanda, Paresh Rawal, Tinnu Anand', null, 'After witnessing the brutal slaying of her Forest Officer father, Sunder Rajan, at the hands of dreaded dacoit Jageera, Sandhya goes to Colonel Krishnakant Puri and asks for his assistance in bringing an end to Jageera''s rule in the Devdurg region. Krishnakant agrees to assist her, and summons about a dozen of his fellow officers and subordinates to assist him. They all assemble at Devdurg with all the necessary ammunitions and arms to combat Jageera, not realizing that Jageera has influence over the local police detachment, who will prevent Puri and his men to possess any guns and weapons. This does not deter Puri and his men, and they continue to stay on in Devdurg and gain the confidence of the villagers. What the villagers do not know that Krishnakant and his men had all been dishonorably discharged from the army for cowardice and retreating when attacked by the enemy. Will Puri and his men abandon Devdurg and let history repeat itself?', 'After witnessing the brutal slaying of her Forest Officer father, Sunder Rajan, at the hands of dreaded dacoit Jageera, Sandhya goes to Colonel Krishnakant Puri and asks for his assistance in bringing an end to Jageera''s rule in the Devdurg region. Krishnakant agrees to assist her, and summons about a dozen of his fellow officers and subordinates to assist him. They all assemble at Devdurg with all the necessary ammunitions and arms to combat Jageera, not realizing that Jageera has influence over the local police detachment, who will prevent Puri and his men to possess any guns and weapons. This does not deter Puri and his men, and they continue to stay on in Devdurg and gain the confidence of the villagers. What the villagers do not know that Krishnakant and his men had all been dishonorably discharged from the army for cowardice and retreating when attacked by the enemy. Will Puri and his men abandon Devdurg and let history repeat itself?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/83Z4Vx01zIwftnpeoELknrGz8Lu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103048'),
  ('933107667570739998', 'China Girl', 1942, 'Romance, Drama, War', 'Henry Hathaway, Lee Garmes', 'Ben Hecht, Darryl F. Zanuck', 'George Montgomery, Gene Tierney, Lynn Bari, Victor McLaglen, Alan Baxter, Sig Ruman, Myron McCormick, Robert Blake', 'NR', 'Two-fisted newsreel photographer Johnny Williams is stationed in Burma and China in the early stage of WW II. Captured by the Japanese, he escapes from a concentration camp with the aid of beautiful, enigmatic ''China Girl'' Miss Young. The two arduously make their way back to friendly lines so that Johnny can deliver the vital military information he''s managed to glean from his captors.', 'Two-fisted newsreel photographer Johnny Williams is stationed in Burma and China in the early stage of WW II. Captured by the Japanese, he escapes from a concentration camp with the aid of beautiful, enigmatic ''China Girl'' Miss Young. The two arduously make their way back to friendly lines so that Johnny can deliver the vital military information he''s managed to glean from his captors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ObpWYvuHb6OAjqxR9ntpt0WKJo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52983'),
  ('452739629739546470', 'China Girl', 1987, 'Romance, Crime, Drama', 'Abel Ferrara, Bojan Bazelli', 'Nicholas St. John', 'James Russo, Richard Panebianco, Sari Chang, David Caruso, Russell Wong, Joey Chin, Judith Malina, James Hong', 'R', 'Teenage lovers Tony and Tyan-Hwa tip the balance of power in New York''s Little Italy and Chinatown.', 'Teenage lovers Tony and Tyan-Hwa tip the balance of power in New York''s Little Italy and Chinatown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x0VilySeyfLX3HSobjWv3CXxvCp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47212'),
  ('907382904285150063', 'China Is Near', 1967, 'Drama', 'Marco Bellocchio, Tonino Delli Colli', 'Marco Bellocchio, Elda Tattoli', 'Glauco Mauri, Paolo Graziosi, Daniela Surina, Elda Tattoli, Pierluigi Aprà, Alessandro Haber, Claudio Trionfi, Claudio Cassinelli', null, 'A pair of working class lovers - a secretary and an accountant, scheme to marry into the rich landed gentry.', 'A pair of working class lovers - a secretary and an accountant, scheme to marry into the rich landed gentry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oqGa7o2u5gRRsbs1OhqMvKP4Cf1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49783'),
  ('402333790711607600', 'China Moon', 1994, 'Mystery, Thriller, Crime', 'John Bailey, Willy Kurant, Eric Jewett', 'Roy Carlson', 'Ed Harris, Madeleine Stowe, Charles Dance, Patricia Healy, Benicio del Toro, Tim Powell, Pruitt Taylor Vince, Robb Edward Morris', 'R', 'Detective Kyle Bodine falls for Rachel Munro who is trapped in a violent marriage. After she shoots her husband, Kyle relucantly agrees to help hide the body, but his partner is showing an unusual flair for finding clues.', 'Detective Kyle Bodine falls for Rachel Munro who is trapped in a violent marriage. After she shoots her husband, Kyle relucantly agrees to help hide the body, but his partner is showing an unusual flair for finding clues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v2o5uqHety8727LukhGfyAfA8EE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26337'),
  ('1109970666771128222', 'China O''Brien', 1990, 'Action, Thriller', 'Robert Clouse, Kent L. Wakeford, Kelly Schroeder', 'Robert Clouse', 'Cynthia Rothrock, Richard Norton, Keith Cooke, Doug Wright , Nijel, Arturo Rivera, Scott McMillan, Patrick Adamson', 'R', 'China O''Brien; big city police woman; martial arts trainer, is forced to hand in her badge and head home to her father and the small town where she grew up. The peaceful town she knew is now struggling against the clutches of organized crime. When her father, the town sheriff, is killed China decides to run for his position and clean up the town. The poll results spark a series of confrontations that finally decide who runs the town . . .', 'China O''Brien; big city police woman; martial arts trainer, is forced to hand in her badge and head home to her father and the small town where she grew up. The peaceful town she knew is now struggling against the clutches of organized crime. When her father, the town sheriff, is killed China decides to run for his position and clean up the town. The poll results spark a series of confrontations that finally decide who runs the town . . .', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bJ8ZR3bg5DMKtCXAzXzzy8GGhsW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13293'),
  ('838771466649107993', 'China O''Brien II', 1990, 'Action', 'Robert Clouse, Kent L. Wakeford', 'Robert Clouse, Craig Clyde, James Hennessy', 'Cynthia Rothrock, Richard Norton, Keith Cooke, Frank Magner, Harlow Marks, Tiffany Soter, Tricia Quai, Donré Sampson', 'R', 'This time China O''Brien has trouble with a dealer who puts a price on her head because she had spoiled an important drug deal of his. But all the world''s criminals will not be enough to catch up with China O''Brian, one of the masters of the martial arts.', 'This time China O''Brien has trouble with a dealer who puts a price on her head because she had spoiled an important drug deal of his. But all the world''s criminals will not be enough to catch up with China O''Brian, one of the masters of the martial arts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uwmZobKV1lqnLhQNiY413Bb1zKe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13295'),
  ('399036278203886884', 'China Salesman', 2017, 'Action, Thriller', 'Tan Bing', 'Tan Bing, Sholom Gelt', 'Li Dongxue, Mike Tyson, Janicke Askevold, Steven Seagal, Li Ai, Ériq Ebouaney, Wang Zijian, Bryan Byrne', null, 'Yan Jian, a young Chinese IT engineer who volunteers to go to North Africa and help the company he works for to win a competition. The winner can own the right to control the communication between south and north. French spy Michael works for the West. His boss ordered him to go to the North Africa and win the competition, and they can control the great mineral resources of Africa. He hired the best mercenary in Africa whose name is Lauder and a former general Kabbah to help him. Yan has discovered their conspiracy, he is the only one who can stop them.', 'Yan Jian, a young Chinese IT engineer who volunteers to go to North Africa and help the company he works for to win a competition. The winner can own the right to control the communication between south and north. French spy Michael works for the West. His boss ordered him to go to the North Africa and win the competition, and they can control the great mineral resources of Africa. He hired the best mercenary in Africa whose name is Lauder and a former general Kabbah to help him. Yan has discovered their conspiracy, he is the only one who can stop them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/TmO5oywb87UwHBkpAulR13Y06m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:461714'),
  ('1020158621012817689', 'China Sea', 2026, 'Drama', 'Jurgis Matulevičius, Bartosz Świniarski, Antons Barons', 'Saulė Bliuvaitė', 'Marius Repšys, Severija Janušauskaitė, Jag Huang, Vaidotas Martinaitis, Sonia Yuan', null, 'Disqualified from the sports federation for hitting a girl on the street, a martial arts champion gets canceled and is forced to stay in his desolate hometown city, where he tries to find a way back into people''s hearts.', 'Disqualified from the sports federation for hitting a girl on the street, a martial arts champion gets canceled and is forced to stay in his desolate hometown city, where he tries to find a way back into people''s hearts.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F5f5yFMzMGRLW8JFlmb8VEtEQbQB.jpg', 'plex:movie:china-sea'),
  ('16416612445858689', 'China Seas', 1935, 'Adventure, Action, Drama', 'Tay Garnett, Ray June, Joseph M. Newman', 'Monckton Hoffe, Maurice Revnes', 'Clark Gable, Jean Harlow, Wallace Beery, Lewis Stone, Rosalind Russell, Dudley Digges, C. Aubrey Smith, Robert Benchley', 'NR', 'Captain Alan Gaskell sails the perilous waters between Hong Kong and Singapore with a secret cargo: a fortune in British gold. That''s not the only risky cargo he carries; both his fiery mistress and his refined fiancee are aboard!', 'Captain Alan Gaskell sails the perilous waters between Hong Kong and Singapore with a secret cargo: a fortune in British gold. That''s not the only risky cargo he carries; both his fiery mistress and his refined fiancee are aboard!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aCYCbwSJHEd6SJpxLJfE8fnY25m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71282'),
  ('1121450624546539174', 'China Strike Force', 2000, 'Action, Thriller', 'Stanley Tong Gwai-Lai, Ailen Sit Chun-Wai, Stanley Tong Gwai-Lai', 'Stanley Tong Gwai-Lai, Steven Whitney', 'Aaron Kwok, Leehom Wang, Norika Fujiwara, Mark Dacascos, Coolio, Ruby Lin, Paul Chun Pui, Lau Siu-Ming', 'R', 'A young Chinese Security Officer, Darren, is called for Team 808, which fights against the smuggling of drugs and corruption. Noriko, a Japanese Interpol officer, collaborates with Darren for the destruction of a large international drug cartel. At the same time, a senior government officer''s daughter is suspected of corruption.', 'A young Chinese Security Officer, Darren, is called for Team 808, which fights against the smuggling of drugs and corruption. Noriko, a Japanese Interpol officer, collaborates with Darren for the destruction of a large international drug cartel. At the same time, a senior government officer''s daughter is suspected of corruption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7beE2wimzlaTQPMOoTquKNPoymh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34856'),
  ('895556002162250759', 'China White', 1989, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller, Romance', 'Ronny Yu, Andrew Lau Wai-Keung', 'F.W. Silleroy', 'Russell Wong, Andy Lau, Steven Vincent Leigh, Lisa Schrage, Billy Drago, Tommy Wong, Shing Fui-On, Alex Man Chi-Leung', null, 'In Amsterdam - in the time before the legalisation of some drugs and the following growth of competition on the market - takes place a war between the Italian and Chinese mafia because of the control of the heroin market.', 'In Amsterdam - in the time before the legalisation of some drugs and the following growth of competition on the market - takes place a war between the Italian and Chinese mafia because of the control of the heroin market.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hqLfDI7HcSTpnLnhbuDeXbOIHdC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91919'),
  ('588774265930431372', 'China: The Uighur Tragedy', 2022, 'Documentary', 'François Reinhardt, François Reinhardt, Lorenz Huber', 'François Reinhardt, Romain Franklin', 'Alexis Victor, Sean Roberts, Xia Ming, Shen Dingli, Christopher Buckley, Shohret Hoshur, Adrian Zenz, Olsi Jazexhi', null, 'A relentless chronicle of the tragedy of the Uighurs, an ethnic minority of some eleven million people who live in the Xinjiang region of northwest China, speak a Turkic language and practice the Muslim religion. The Uighurs suffer brutal cultural and political oppression by Xin Jinping''s tyrannical government: torture, disappearances, forced labor, re-education of children and adults, mass sterilizations, extensive surveillance and destruction of historical heritage.', 'A relentless chronicle of the tragedy of the Uighurs, an ethnic minority of some eleven million people who live in the Xinjiang region of northwest China, speak a Turkic language and practice the Muslim religion. The Uighurs suffer brutal cultural and political oppression by Xin Jinping''s tyrannical government: torture, disappearances, forced labor, re-education of children and adults, mass sterilizations, extensive surveillance and destruction of historical heritage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/siWdAu9zUm147eqURMnrjQGqonG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:936281'),
  ('897029467588153559', 'China''s Haze: Under the Doom', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Cissie Fan, 侯鑫强, 侯鑫强', null, 'Chai Jing', null, 'Chai Jing''s documentary about the massive smog problem in China. Chai Jing started making the documentary when her as yet unborn daughter developed a tumour in the womb, which had to be removed very soon after her birth. Chai blames air pollution for the tumour. The film, which combines footage of a lecture with interviews and factory visits, has been compared with Al Gore''s An Inconvenient Truth in both its style and likely impact. The film openly criticises state-owned energy companies, steel producers and coal factories, as well as showing the inability of the Ministry of Environmental Protection to act against the big polluters.', 'Chai Jing''s documentary about the massive smog problem in China. Chai Jing started making the documentary when her as yet unborn daughter developed a tumour in the womb, which had to be removed very soon after her birth. Chai blames air pollution for the tumour. The film, which combines footage of a lecture with interviews and factory visits, has been compared with Al Gore''s An Inconvenient Truth in both its style and likely impact. The film openly criticises state-owned energy companies, steel producers and coal factories, as well as showing the inability of the Ministry of Environmental Protection to act against the big polluters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3n3wlWJLKOVtRHq3BA79y5som7C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:329174'),
  ('441658676394726520', 'Chinaman', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Henrik Ruben Genz', 'Kim Fupz Aakeson', 'Bjarne Henriksen, Vivian Wu, Charlotte Fich, Paw Henriksen, Nicolas Winding Refn, Lin Kun Wu, Johan Rabaeus, Jeppe Kaas', null, 'Keld is in a rut. His wife of 25 years has left him. For sustenance, he eats his way through the menu at the local Chinese takeaway. The owner talks him into a marriage of convenience with his sister from China and the unplanned-for happens. A delicate romance blossoms between these two damaged, fragile individuals, but a secret gives their relationship a fateful twist. A subtle and touching story of life''s diversity.', 'Keld is in a rut. His wife of 25 years has left him. For sustenance, he eats his way through the menu at the local Chinese takeaway. The owner talks him into a marriage of convenience with his sister from China and the unplanned-for happens. A delicate romance blossoms between these two damaged, fragile individuals, but a secret gives their relationship a fateful twist. A subtle and touching story of life''s diversity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pKPjpEx4y61KhuF3ZE88fcxPDNs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23019'),
  ('614217344243668723', 'Chinas', 2023, 'Drama', 'Arantxa Echevarría, Pilar Sánchez Díaz, Alba Simón', 'Arantxa Echevarría', 'Daniela Shiman Yang, Xinyi Ye, Ella Qiu, Pablo Molinero, Leonor Watling, Carolina Yuste, Yeju Ji, Valeria Fernández', null, 'In Madrid, Spain, Lucía and Xiang, two nine-year-old Chinese girls, meet at the beginning of the school year.', 'In Madrid, Spain, Lucía and Xiang, two nine-year-old Chinese girls, meet at the beginning of the school year.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xXDegCxZZLP66xghr8N5VMnhCga.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1034387'),
  ('510413848222148937', 'Chinatown', 1974, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'John A. Alonzo, Roman Polanski, Hawk Koch', 'Robert Towne', 'Jack Nicholson, Faye Dunaway, John Huston, Perry Lopez, John Hillerman, Diane Ladd, Roman Polanski, Roy Jenson', 'R', 'Private eye Jake Gittes lives off of the murky moral climate of sunbaked, pre-World War II Southern California. Hired by a beautiful socialite to investigate her husband''s extra-marital affair, Gittes is swept into a maelstrom of double dealings and deadly deceits, uncovering a web of personal and political scandals that come crashing together.', 'Private eye Jake Gittes lives off of the murky moral climate of sunbaked, pre-World War II Southern California. Hired by a beautiful socialite to investigate her husband''s extra-marital affair, Gittes is swept into a maelstrom of double dealings and deadly deceits, uncovering a web of personal and political scandals that come crashing together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kZRSP3FmOcq0xnBulqpUQngJUXY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:829'),
