  ('421604990611350608', 'Chomsky & Cie', 2008, 'Documentary', 'Olivier Azam, Daniel Mermet', 'Daniel Mermet', 'Noam Chomsky', null, 'At a time when powerlessness and resignation carry the day, Noam Chomsky''s work is a radical antidote for all those who want to put an end to the factory of powerlessness and its intellectual media star watchdogs. Theoretician of language, born in Philadelphia in 1928, Noam Chomsky revolutionized linguistics with the "generative grammar." But Chomsky is also a political analyst involved in all political struggles for decades. His clear analysis and rational ideological mechanisms of our societies is a crucial resource for critical thinking today.', 'At a time when powerlessness and resignation carry the day, Noam Chomsky''s work is a radical antidote for all those who want to put an end to the factory of powerlessness and its intellectual media star watchdogs. Theoretician of language, born in Philadelphia in 1928, Noam Chomsky revolutionized linguistics with the "generative grammar." But Chomsky is also a political analyst involved in all political struggles for decades. His clear analysis and rational ideological mechanisms of our societies is a crucial resource for critical thinking today.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7OJskye8nBfLmlWB4fKSuY9R0VX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:259560'),
  ('834038528275730350', 'Chongqing Blues', 2010, 'Drama', 'Wang Xiaoshuai', 'Wang Xiaoshuai, Yishu Yang', 'Wang Xueqi, Fan Bingbing, Qin Hao, Wang Ziyi, Ding Jiali, Zhang Jiayi, Wang Kuirong, Li Fei''er', null, 'Lin, a sea captain, returns from a 6 month journey when he is told that his 25-year-old son Lin Bo has been gunned down by the police. In his quest to understand what happened, he realizes he knew very little about his own son. He starts a journey back to Chongqin, a city he once lived. He will understand the impact of his paternal repeated absence on the life of his child.', 'Lin, a sea captain, returns from a 6 month journey when he is told that his 25-year-old son Lin Bo has been gunned down by the police. In his quest to understand what happened, he realizes he knew very little about his own son. He starts a journey back to Chongqin, a city he once lived. He will understand the impact of his paternal repeated absence on the life of his child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1aXoesJC08BFpLO5WMNC2lLbaXV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63458'),
  ('378080888511290913', 'Chongqing Hot Pot', 2016, 'Drama', 'Liao Ni, Yang Qing', 'Yang Qing', 'Chen Kun, Bai Baihe, Qin Hao, Yu Entai, Wang Yanlin, Li Jiuxiao, Zhang Yichi, Chen Nuo', 'NR', 'When three friends open a hot pot restaurant in a former bomb shelter, they discover it’s linked by a single wall to the bank vault next door. While deciding to take the easy money or go to the police, they find out one of the bank’s employees is a former classmate and look to enlist her in deciding their future.', 'When three friends open a hot pot restaurant in a former bomb shelter, they discover it’s linked by a single wall to the bank vault next door. While deciding to take the easy money or go to the police, they find out one of the bank’s employees is a former classmate and look to enlist her in deciding their future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2drSTNudM11yUkOCwqf5xS4JCZ6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:388403'),
