  ('1012079603511276660', 'Choose Me', 1984, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Jan Kiesser, Alan Rudolph, Hope R. Goodwin', 'Alan Rudolph', 'Geneviève Bujold, Keith Carradine, Lesley Ann Warren, Patrick Bauchau, Rae Dawn Chong, John Larroquette, Edward Ruscha, Gailard Sartain', 'R', 'Several lost-soul night-owls, including a nightclub owner, a talk radio relationship counselor, and an itinerant stranger have encounters that expose their contradictions and anxieties about love and acceptance.', 'Several lost-soul night-owls, including a nightclub owner, a talk radio relationship counselor, and an itinerant stranger have encounters that expose their contradictions and anxieties about love and acceptance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/itp6SexrLaS5cVkyXSbou2FyfuG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42086'),
  ('796333075669629550', 'Choose or Die', 2022, 'Horror, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Oliver Edinburgh, Catherine Derry, Toby Meakins', 'Matthew James Wilkinson, Simon Allen, Toby Meakins', 'Iola Evans, Asa Butterfield, Robert Englund, Angela Griffin, Ryan Gage, Eddie Marsan, Kate Fleetwood, Pete MacHale', 'NR', 'In pursuit of an unclaimed $125,000 prize, a broke college dropout decides to play an obscure, 1980s survival computer game. But the game curses her, and she’s faced with dangerous choices and reality-warping challenges. After a series of unexpectedly terrifying moments, she realizes she’s no longer playing for the money but for her life.', 'In pursuit of an unclaimed $125,000 prize, a broke college dropout decides to play an obscure, 1980s survival computer game. But the game curses her, and she’s faced with dangerous choices and reality-warping challenges. After a series of unexpectedly terrifying moments, she realizes she’s no longer playing for the money but for her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jEYE5BPFd5FuPa1judcjpW6xqKp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:838484'),
  ('1069834231853468073', 'Chop Chop', 2020, 'Crime, Thriller, Horror', 'Rony Patel', 'Andrew Ericksen, Rony Patel', 'Atala Arce, Jake Taylor, David Harper, Emily Katter, James McCabe, Mandy Martino, Mikael Mattsson, Natasha Missick', null, 'A night of chaos ensues when a murderous psychopath targets a loving young couple who might be harboring a secret of their own.', 'A night of chaos ensues when a murderous psychopath targets a loving young couple who might be harboring a secret of their own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ny8lUIm3Zjqkww2ku8i1PhqJhS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:746157'),
  ('686400177249193163', 'Chop Shop', 2008, 'Drama', 'Ramin Bahrani, Michael Simmonds', 'Bahareh Azimi, Ramin Bahrani', 'Alejandro Polanco, Isamar Gonzales, Ahmad Razvi, Carlos Zapata, Rob Sowulski, Anthony Felton, Evelisse ''Lilah'' Ortiz, Michael ''Gringo'' Nieto', null, 'Alejandro, a tough and ambitious Latino street orphan on the verge of adolescence, lives and works in an auto-body repair shop in a sprawling junkyard on the outskirts of Queens, New York. In this chaotic world of adults, young Alejandro struggles to make a better life for himself and his 16-year-old sister, Isamar.', 'Alejandro, a tough and ambitious Latino street orphan on the verge of adolescence, lives and works in an auto-body repair shop in a sprawling junkyard on the outskirts of Queens, New York. In this chaotic world of adults, young Alejandro struggles to make a better life for himself and his 16-year-old sister, Isamar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5yuXy0aiEJRUIsSqCHDhrJcO5s5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15555'),
  ('396181076420697246', 'Chopper', 2000, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Geoffrey Hall, Kevin Hayward, Andrew Dominik', 'Andrew Dominik', 'Eric Bana, Vince Colosimo, Simon Lyndon, David Field, Dan Wyllie, Bill Young, Kate Beahan, Gary Waddell', 'R', 'The true and infamous story of Australia''s notorious criminal Mark ''Chopper'' Read and his years of crime, interest in violence, drugs and prostitutes.', 'The true and infamous story of Australia''s notorious criminal Mark ''Chopper'' Read and his years of crime, interest in violence, drugs and prostitutes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Ua4voSMwqzlL8DzYi6dOOe1Dxw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9519'),
  ('797291980440853641', 'Chopper Chicks in Zombietown', 1989, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Dan Hoskins, Tom Fraser, Jeff Shiffman', 'Dan Hoskins', 'Jamie Rose, Catherine Carlen, Lycia Naff, Vicki Frederick, Kristina Loggia, Gretchen Palmer, Nina von Arx, Whitney Reis', 'R', 'Riding around on their motorbikes, a gang of tough women bikers are the only thing that stands between a crowd of zombies, which have been accidentally let out of their secure cave, and those still alive in the town.', 'Riding around on their motorbikes, a gang of tough women bikers are the only thing that stands between a crowd of zombies, which have been accidentally let out of their secure cave, and those still alive in the town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2iViC9lCEmmrDHir1sBLcPV690U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27070'),
  ('791601284388333176', 'Chopping Mall', 1986, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Jim Wynorski, Terence J. Edwards, Kristine Peterson', 'Jim Wynorski, Steve Mitchell', 'Kelli Maroney, Tony O''Dell, Russell Todd, Karrie Emerson, Barbara Crampton, Nick Segal, John Terlesky, Suzee Slater', 'R', 'High-tech robots equipped with state-of-the-art security devices have been recruited as the new mechanical "night watchmen" for the Park Plaza Mall. When a jolting bolt of lightning short-circuits the main computer control, the robots turn into "killbots" on the loose after unsuspecting shoppers!', 'High-tech robots equipped with state-of-the-art security devices have been recruited as the new mechanical "night watchmen" for the Park Plaza Mall. When a jolting bolt of lightning short-circuits the main computer control, the robots turn into "killbots" on the loose after unsuspecting shoppers!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ggHbJPYJsjiJnEwHi4xUyJxWpmS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28941'),
  ('678548937748411579', 'Chopsticks', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Sachin Yardi', 'Sachin Yardi', 'Mithila Palkar, Abhay Deol, Vijay Raaz, Benafsha Soonawalla, Achint Kaur, Dilip Rawal, Marlene Marie, Sailee Gaikwad', null, 'A gifted but insecure woman is in for a transformative experience when she enlists the help of an enigmatic con artist to recover her stolen car.', 'A gifted but insecure woman is in for a transformative experience when she enlists the help of an enigmatic con artist to recover her stolen car.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ejFfjFbK7t3kGFJJiANUQBWxITk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:601801'),
  ('114941643386567669', 'Choque', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Nacho Vigalondo, Jon D. Domínguez', 'Nacho Vigalondo', 'Bárbara Goenaga, Nacho Vigalondo', null, 'A couple discovers a bumper car floor. When there some youngsters appear, the man gets caught into a personal battle with himself.', 'A couple discovers a bumper car floor. When there some youngsters appear, the man gets caught into a personal battle with himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gNOvlvZo6HpyN6gLJkkoUSLLiHI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100507'),
  ('433277865953292315', 'Chor Nikal Ke Bhaga', 2023, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Ajay Singh, Gianni Giannelli, Shiv Chauhan', 'Siraj Ahmed, Raj Kumar Gupta, Amar Kaushik', 'Yami Gautam Dhar, Sunny Kaushal, Sharad Kelkar, Indraneil Sengupta, Barun Chanda, Sunil Palwal, Ghanshyam Lalsa, Robin Das', null, 'A flight attendant and her boyfriend must steal a cache of diamonds to clear an old debt — but the plan spins into a mayhem when the plane gets hijacked.', 'A flight attendant and her boyfriend must steal a cache of diamonds to clear an old debt — but the plan spins into a mayhem when the plane gets hijacked.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1MIDERaEUMw1rYDM99tGZPY80Ap.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1018228'),
  ('1148156133460218847', 'Chorar de Rir', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Toniko Melo, Júnior Malta', 'José Roberto Torero', 'Leandro Hassum, Otávio Müller, Monique Alfradique, Jandira Martini, Perfeito Fortuna, Natália Lage, Rafael Portugal, Caito Mainier', null, 'Nilo Perequê is a successful comedian who stars in a TV show. When he wins the award for best comedian of the year, the comedian decides to radically change his career and devote himself totally to drama, leaving his family and businessman desperate.', 'Nilo Perequê is a successful comedian who stars in a TV show. When he wins the award for best comedian of the year, the comedian decides to radically change his career and devote himself totally to drama, leaving his family and businessman desperate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rXiFuLi7qnz9v8ZY6wTH4qD8pXh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:580075'),
  ('251494856334629013', 'Chori Chori', 2003, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Milan Luthria', null, 'Ajay Devgn, Rani Mukerji, Sonali Bendre, Kamini Kaushal, Tiku Talsania, Smita Jaykar, Kulbhushan Kharbanda, Shashikala', null, '''Chori Chori'' is a romantic film telling the story of Ranbir (Ajay Devgan) and Khushi (Rani Mukherjee) who are as different as chalk and cheese. They bump into each other on the streets of Delhi. It certainly isn''t love at first sight for them. In fact there is nothing but war of words and arguments. Circumstances keep Ranbir and Khushi together, much to their discomfort. Till they realize that th', '''Chori Chori'' is a romantic film telling the story of Ranbir (Ajay Devgan) and Khushi (Rani Mukherjee) who are as different as chalk and cheese. They bump into each other on the streets of Delhi. It certainly isn''t love at first sight for them. In fact there is nothing but war of words and arguments. Circumstances keep Ranbir and Khushi together, much to their discomfort. Till they realize that th', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n9Qm19Jj8NFEjI9vVuXH0yLH4PQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25020'),
  ('80900245092556975', 'Chori Chori Chupke Chupke', 2001, 'Drama, Romance', 'Roshaan Garry Bhinder, Abbas Alibhai Burmawalla, Mustan Alibhai Burmawalla', 'Shyam Goel', 'Salman Khan, Preity Zinta, Rani Mukerji, Amrish Puri, Dalip Tahil, Farida Jalal, Prem Chopra, Johny Lever', null, 'Raj and Priya are newly married. Priya is heavy with children, but due to unexpected circumstances, she loses her child and is unable to conceive again. Enter Madhoo, a prostitute who is willing to become surrogate mother for the couple. Their relationship becomes entangled with love triangle when Madhoo falls in love with Raj.', 'Raj and Priya are newly married. Priya is heavy with children, but due to unexpected circumstances, she loses her child and is unable to conceive again. Enter Madhoo, a prostitute who is willing to become surrogate mother for the couple. Their relationship becomes entangled with love triangle when Madhoo falls in love with Raj.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lwanyGNvbpMO7AzRj18qhO46bcs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107548'),
  ('890809407186578688', 'Chorus', 2015, 'Drama', 'François Delisle, Pierre Pageau, Robert Marcel Lepage', 'François Delisle', 'Sébastien Ricard, Fanny Mallette, Geneviève Bujold, Pierre Curzi, Antoine L''Écuyer, Luc Senay, Didier Lucien', null, 'A separated couple meet again after 10 years when the body of their missing son is found. Amid the guilt of losing a loved one, they hesitantly move toward affirmation of life, acceptance of death, and even the possibility of reconciliation.', 'A separated couple meet again after 10 years when the body of their missing son is found. Amid the guilt of losing a loved one, they hesitantly move toward affirmation of life, acceptance of death, and even the possibility of reconciliation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pWSJs6j5n3J1HEiVQe9SoVnnUMv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:310507'),
  ('327533999595894457', 'Chosen', 2001, 'Action', 'Ang Lee, Frederick Elmes', 'David Carter', 'Clive Owen, Mason Lee, Jamie Harris, Brian Smyj, Satoru Tsufura, Sonom Gualson, Losang Gyatso, Jeff Jensen', null, 'The Driver is carrying an Asian child who has been chosen for a strange ritual. He must drive him through a dark night in the city to get to a monk''s house, while eluding several American cars out to get the child.', 'The Driver is carrying an Asian child who has been chosen for a strange ritual. He must drive him through a dark night in the city to get to a monk''s house, while eluding several American cars out to get the child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/62FYfcDwWJIVvsCaUr0kvAF6GRq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30091'),
  ('1064380308731193209', 'Chosen Survivors', 1974, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Sutton Roley, Gabriel Torres', 'Harry Spalding, Joe Reb Moffly', 'Jackie Cooper, Alex Cord, Richard Jaeckel, Bradford Dillman, Pedro Armendáriz Jr., Diana Muldaur, Lincoln Kilpatrick, Gwenn Mitchell', 'PG', 'A group of diverse individuals are suddenly taken from their homes and flown via helicopter to a futuristic bomb shelter in the desert, nearly two miles below the surface of the Earth. There they learn that a nuclear holocaust is taking place and that they''ve been "chosen" by computer to survive in the shelter in order to continue the human race. The shelter is designed to allow the people to exist underground comfortably for years, but they are faced with a threat nobody could have predicted: a colony of thousands of bloodthirsty vampire bats finds a way into the shelter and launches a series of vicious attacks where they claim the humans one by one.', 'A group of diverse individuals are suddenly taken from their homes and flown via helicopter to a futuristic bomb shelter in the desert, nearly two miles below the surface of the Earth. There they learn that a nuclear holocaust is taking place and that they''ve been "chosen" by computer to survive in the shelter in order to continue the human race. The shelter is designed to allow the people to exist underground comfortably for years, but they are faced with a threat nobody could have predicted: a colony of thousands of bloodthirsty vampire bats finds a way into the shelter and launches a series of vicious attacks where they claim the humans one by one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v2nTYKZmVMvBYu0Cr38BgReWJxa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85236'),
  ('133153018253856000', 'Chotta Mumbai', 2007, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Anwar Rasheed, Alagappan N', 'Benny P. Nayarambalam', 'Mohanlal, Saikumar, Kalabhavan Mani, Siddique, Jagathy Sreekumar, Indrajith Sukumaran, Bijukuttan, Manikuttan', null, 'Vasco and his family witness a murder carried out by a local goon. Problems start brewing in their lives when this criminal starts plotting against him.', 'Vasco and his family witness a murder carried out by a local goon. Problems start brewing in their lives when this criminal starts plotting against him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4lvX5OvpI7YyoBKmSOolWJKu8Oh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234532'),
  ('650505310419168136', 'Chou Deneiban SD Gundam Sangokuden Brave Battle Warriors', 2010, 'Animation, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Kunihiro Mori', null, 'Yuki Kaji, Masayuki Katou, Rikiya Koyama, Atsushi Miyauchi, Hiroki Yasumoto', null, 'A Romance of the Three Kingdoms retelling using SD Gundams. (Source: Myanimelist.net)', 'A Romance of the Three Kingdoms retelling using SD Gundams. (Source: Myanimelist.net)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sow8oeZ9sjwC5rbuEkFtl57rjpr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:580333'),
  ('876762462046239307', 'Chouans !', 1988, 'Drama, History, War', 'Philippe de Broca, Bernard Zitzermann', 'Daniel Boulanger, Philippe de Broca', 'Philippe Noiret, Lambert Wilson, Roger Dumas, Sophie Marceau, Stéphane Freiss, Jean-Pierre Cassel, Charlotte de Turckheim, Michael Gempart', null, 'Directed by Philippe de Broca, the film recounts a bloody episode of the French Revolution. 1793, the Terror . In Vendée and in Bretagne, the chouans are revolting against the young Republic and fight for the monarchy restauration. The civil war divides also the family of the Count Savinien de Kerfadec, a liberal and generous noble and a flying machines inventor.', 'Directed by Philippe de Broca, the film recounts a bloody episode of the French Revolution. 1793, the Terror . In Vendée and in Bretagne, the chouans are revolting against the young Republic and fight for the monarchy restauration. The civil war divides also the family of the Count Savinien de Kerfadec, a liberal and generous noble and a flying machines inventor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/srna9365W8pRnLSsfd8bPLEpEsA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50796'),
  ('928739245387748652', 'Chouchou', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Merzak Allouache, Laurent Machuel', 'Merzak Allouache, Gad Elmaleh', 'Gad Elmaleh, Alain Chabat, Claude Brasseur, Roschdy Zem, Catherine Frot, Julien Courbey, Fawzi B. Saichi, Arié Elmaleh', null, 'Choukri, alias Chouchou, a transvestite Maghrebi with clear eyes, comes illegally to Paris to find his nephew. Hired as an assistant by a psychotherapist, known for his good mood, he also work as a waiter in a transvestite cabaret of Clichy where he meets Stanislas.', 'Choukri, alias Chouchou, a transvestite Maghrebi with clear eyes, comes illegally to Paris to find his nephew. Hired as an assistant by a psychotherapist, known for his good mood, he also work as a waiter in a transvestite cabaret of Clichy where he meets Stanislas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/74Bv2j3LVWxArUqoN2EZwS0Hr7x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17684'),
  ('469905501334273123', 'Chouf', 2016, 'Drama', 'Karim Dridi', 'Karim Dridi', 'Sofian Khammes, Foued Nabba, Nailia Harzoune, Zine Darar, Foziwa Mohamed, Tony Fourmann, Mourad Tahar Boussatha, Hatika Karaoui', null, 'Chouf: It means “look” in Arabic, but it is also the name of the watchmen in the drug cartels of Marseille. Sofiane is 20. A brilliant student, he comes back to spend his holiday in the Marseille ghetto where he was born. His brother, a dealer, gets shot before his eyes. Sofiane gives up on his studies and gets involved in the drug network, ready to avenge him. He quickly rises to the top and becomes the boss’s right hand. Trapped by the system, Sofiane is dragged into a spiral of violence…', 'Chouf: It means “look” in Arabic, but it is also the name of the watchmen in the drug cartels of Marseille. Sofiane is 20. A brilliant student, he comes back to spend his holiday in the Marseille ghetto where he was born. His brother, a dealer, gets shot before his eyes. Sofiane gives up on his studies and gets involved in the drug network, ready to avenge him. He quickly rises to the top and becomes the boss’s right hand. Trapped by the system, Sofiane is dragged into a spiral of violence…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gFqlr1vUzGJG7Fg3kjrXcnmNs2S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:394259'),
  ('1006820393771984672', 'Chouquette', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Lubomir Bakchev, Patrick Godeau', null, 'Sabine Azéma, Michèle Laroque, Michèle Moretti, Antonin Brunelle-Rémy', null, 'Chouquette has invited people to celebrate her husband''s birthday;only his former mistress turns up..', 'Chouquette has invited people to celebrate her husband''s birthday;only his former mistress turns up..', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nxTt7mJaBxWnAryZUwKGsBzdy3h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:459960'),
  ('174448205959161287', 'Chow Hound', 1951, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'John T. Smith, Bea Benaderet, Mel Blanc, Stan Freberg', 'NR', 'A muscular dog exploits a cat and a mouse for food, but they keep forgetting to bring him gravy!', 'A muscular dog exploits a cat and a mouse for food, but they keep forgetting to bring him gravy!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mjUOQIzuHPvWV4LQ30jlvCEOFRM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83749'),
  ('754963005691272987', 'Chris Brown: Welcome to My Life', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Andrew Sandler', null, 'Chris Brown, Usher, DJ Khaled, Jamie Foxx, Jennifer Lopez, Justin Bieber, Mike Tyson', null, 'This compelling Documentary moves beyond the spotlight and past the attention-grabbing headlines to give pop superstar Chris Brown a chance to tell his own story. New interviews with the international phenomenon reveal long-awaited answers about his passion for making music, his tumultuous and much publicized relationships, and the pitfalls of coming of age in the public eye. Also included is new concert footage, behind-the-scenes access, and special interviews from Usher, Jennifer Lopez, DJ Khaled, Mike Tyson, Jamie Foxx and others.', 'This compelling Documentary moves beyond the spotlight and past the attention-grabbing headlines to give pop superstar Chris Brown a chance to tell his own story. New interviews with the international phenomenon reveal long-awaited answers about his passion for making music, his tumultuous and much publicized relationships, and the pitfalls of coming of age in the public eye. Also included is new concert footage, behind-the-scenes access, and special interviews from Usher, Jennifer Lopez, DJ Khaled, Mike Tyson, Jamie Foxx and others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pZlujGBOc1eqARYYYZGqNdxEYd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:456508'),
  ('725196386690214195', 'Chris D''Elia: No Pain', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Matt D''Elia', 'Chris D''Elia', 'Chris D''Elia', null, 'Chris D''Elia takes the stage in Minneapolis to offer his thoughts on everything from self-censorship to problematic dolphins to lame mutant powers.', 'Chris D''Elia takes the stage in Minneapolis to offer his thoughts on everything from self-censorship to problematic dolphins to lame mutant powers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9IJrsG8UCW9Lk91IOY1pKoXJDDd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:687136'),
  ('832442421228600848', 'Chris Fleming: Live at the Palace', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Bill Benz, Dylan Sanford', 'Chris Fleming', 'Chris Fleming', null, 'From the Cadillac Palace Theatre in Chicago, comedian Chris Fleming bursts onto the screen with a fun and lighthearted blend of skillful storytelling and wild physicality in his first HBO stand-up special. A high-energy performer who seamlessly pivots from one everyday topic to another – from Trader Joe’s to Oreos, NPR, and dog breeds – Fleming bounds across the stage as he shares his unique takes on masculinity, conga lines, and more.', 'From the Cadillac Palace Theatre in Chicago, comedian Chris Fleming bursts onto the screen with a fun and lighthearted blend of skillful storytelling and wild physicality in his first HBO stand-up special. A high-energy performer who seamlessly pivots from one everyday topic to another – from Trader Joe’s to Oreos, NPR, and dog breeds – Fleming bounds across the stage as he shares his unique takes on masculinity, conga lines, and more.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FjPcgD4iPiXNhaEaugepoYHzZ0Jm.jpg', 'plex:movie:chris-fleming-live-at-the-palace-2026'),
  ('597678270280307473', 'Chris Rock: Big Ass Jokes', 1994, 'Comedy', 'Keith Truesdell', 'Chris Rock', 'Chris Rock', null, 'Taped in Atlanta, Jokes offers Rock''s take on everything from school busing (he''s against it) to older women (in general, he prefers them to younger ones). His best routine, involving the inexpensive plain-wrap food his mother bought when he was a child, wouldn''t be out of place on a classic Bill Cosby record.', 'Taped in Atlanta, Jokes offers Rock''s take on everything from school busing (he''s against it) to older women (in general, he prefers them to younger ones). His best routine, involving the inexpensive plain-wrap food his mother bought when he was a child, wouldn''t be out of place on a classic Bill Cosby record.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/MKBivBeYBdo0IHcW1iGJ9KF0lA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54108'),
  ('1049870195896865318', 'Chris Rock: Bigger & Blacker', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Keith Truesdell', 'Chris Rock', 'Chris Rock, Slick Rick', 'R', 'Chris Rock brings his critically acclaimed brand of social commentary-themed humour to this HBO Special, extolling his razor-sharp wit and wisdom on such topics as gun control, President Clinton, homophobia, racism, black leaders and relationships.', 'Chris Rock brings his critically acclaimed brand of social commentary-themed humour to this HBO Special, extolling his razor-sharp wit and wisdom on such topics as gun control, President Clinton, homophobia, racism, black leaders and relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b5T4xRePE7VckU5xAFZh6jUEgD0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17870'),
  ('215148451101367265', 'Chris Rock: Bring the Pain', 1996, 'Comedy', 'Keith Truesdell', 'Chris Rock', 'Chris Rock', null, 'A true equal-opportunity offender, Chris Rock''s brand of humor will make you think after you''re done laughing.', 'A true equal-opportunity offender, Chris Rock''s brand of humor will make you think after you''re done laughing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iKBOkpJY53iCc5Ur3DjxVnlbd26.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18128'),
  ('24856188641785678', 'Chris Rock: Kill the Messenger', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Marty Callner', 'Chris Rock', 'Chris Rock', null, 'An HBO special edited from three performances from Chris Rock''s 2008 comedy tour: London (dark suit, dark shirt), Johannesburg (black suit, white shirt) and New York (shiny jacket). Topics include the ongoing presidential campaign, the possibility of a black president, George W. Bush, gas prices, low-paid jobs, ringtones and bottled water, sex, relationships and the correct use of the n-word', 'An HBO special edited from three performances from Chris Rock''s 2008 comedy tour: London (dark suit, dark shirt), Johannesburg (black suit, white shirt) and New York (shiny jacket). Topics include the ongoing presidential campaign, the possibility of a black president, George W. Bush, gas prices, low-paid jobs, ringtones and bottled water, sex, relationships and the correct use of the n-word', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cIuIOVRl558GziBkX3GbpsVGaik.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14244'),
  ('1054645314041997624', 'Chris Rock: Never Scared', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Joel Gallen', 'Chris Rock', 'Chris Rock', null, 'Chris Rock, the three-time Emmy Award-winner, comedian, actor, and host of HBO''s acclaimed The Chris Show, stars in his fourth solo stand-up special for HBO, Chris Rock: Never Scared. Featuring his unique, insightful, and hilarious views on a host of social, political and, celebrity issues, Rock confirms his stature as the leading comic of our time.', 'Chris Rock, the three-time Emmy Award-winner, comedian, actor, and host of HBO''s acclaimed The Chris Show, stars in his fourth solo stand-up special for HBO, Chris Rock: Never Scared. Featuring his unique, insightful, and hilarious views on a host of social, political and, celebrity issues, Rock confirms his stature as the leading comic of our time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wM0BIi1olItUHNCvGKNaeeERsk8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17871'),
  ('737716127335871166', 'Chris Rock: Selective Outrage', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Joel Gallen', 'Chris Rock', 'Chris Rock', 'R', 'Chris Rock delivers an electric stand-up set on non-racist yoga pants, spoiling his kids, the Kardashians and his thoughts on the Will Smith fiasco.', 'Chris Rock delivers an electric stand-up set on non-racist yoga pants, spoiling his kids, the Kardashians and his thoughts on the Will Smith fiasco.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hGTJfBzS8rpNQiitbg6ZnwnD6um.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1065890'),
