  ('347959710223843763', 'Chris the Swiss', 2018, 'Animation, Documentary', 'Anja Kofmel, Guy Faessler, Philipp Künzli', 'Anja Kofmel', 'Joel Basman, Milton Welsh, Megan Gay, Marko Cindrić, Domagoj Janković, Dean Krivačić, Damjan Simic', null, 'Croatia, 7th of January 1992: In the middle of the war, a young journalist''s body is discovered dressed in the uniform of an international mercenary group. Twenty years later, his cousin Anja Kofmel investigates his story.', 'Croatia, 7th of January 1992: In the middle of the war, a young journalist''s body is discovered dressed in the uniform of an international mercenary group. Twenty years later, his cousin Anja Kofmel investigates his story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7NZo1HHNv7y0ODjNLNZ9TL2qpAX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:501547'),
