  ('305426255997732402', 'Chris Watts: Confessions of a Killer', 2020, 'Crime, TV Movie', 'David Herrington, Michael Nankin', 'Barbara Marshall', 'Sean Kleier, Ashley Williams, Brooke Smith, April Telek, Chloe Van Landschoot, Dan Willmott, Ellie McPhee, Dahlia Oldham', null, 'When Chris Watts stoically yet smirkingly pleaded to television cameras for the safe return of his missing pregnant wife Shanann and their two young daughters, dark secrets loomed just beneath the surface.', 'When Chris Watts stoically yet smirkingly pleaded to television cameras for the safe return of his missing pregnant wife Shanann and their two young daughters, dark secrets loomed just beneath the surface.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r1l8RNzMdIXZHf4ddJw8lzMzIIg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:667039'),
  ('580033029828682184', 'Christ Stopped at Eboli', 1979, 'Drama', 'Francesco Rosi, Pasqualino De Santis, Gianni Arduini', 'Tonino Guerra, Francesco Rosi, Raffaele La Capria', 'Gian Maria Volonté, Paolo Bonacelli, Alain Cuny, Lea Massari, Irene Papas, François Simon, Luigi Infantino, Accursio Di Leo', null, 'In the fascist Italy of 1935, a painter trained as a doctor is exiled to a remote region near Eboli. Over time, he learns to appreciate the beauty and wisdom of the peasants, and to overcome his isolation.', 'In the fascist Italy of 1935, a painter trained as a doctor is exiled to a remote region near Eboli. Over time, he learns to appreciate the beauty and wisdom of the peasants, and to overcome his isolation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gHcB9EFbBQfaJNPbMjcsfmNuLMt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42169'),
  ('209287948653325262', 'Christ(Off)', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Vincent Gallot, Pierre Dudan', 'Julien Arruti, Sophie Depooter, Victoria Bedos', 'Michaël Youn, Lucien Jean-Baptiste, Victoria Bedos, Bernard Le Coq, Jarry, Simon Astier, JoeyStarr, Vincent Desagnat', null, 'At 33 years old, and after numerous failed attempt to make it as a musician, Chris still lives with his mother. One day he crosses paths with a young missionary in need of a guitarist for his new religious band, he recruits Chris and disguises him as Father Christophe.', 'At 33 years old, and after numerous failed attempt to make it as a musician, Chris still lives with his mother. One day he crosses paths with a young missionary in need of a guitarist for his new religious band, he recruits Chris and disguises him as Father Christophe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kLeBccUQV88Dv5dILPQcG18tq1u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:525916'),
  ('944204284136876638', 'Christian Mingle', 2014, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Corbin Bernsen', 'Corbin Bernsen', 'Lacey Chabert, Jonathan Patrick Moore, Stephen Tobolowsky, Saidah Arrika Ekulona, John O''Hurley, Morgan Fairchild, David Keith, Corbin Bernsen', 'PG', 'A young, modern single woman enters the world of online dating looking for an instant soul mate.', 'A young, modern single woman enters the world of online dating looking for an instant soul mate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hWLXcrthWIJfle0VJY8r8IqnA32.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:296456'),
  ('838291395944433938', 'Christiane F.', 1981, 'Drama', 'Uli Edel, Jürgen Jürges, Justus Pankau', 'Herman Weigel', 'Natja Brunckhorst, Thomas Haustein, Jens Kuphal, Rainer Woelk, David Bowie, Eberhard Auriga, Peggy Bussieck, Lothar Chamski', 'R', 'This movie portrays the drug scene in Berlin in the 70s, following tape recordings of Christiane F. 14 years old Christiane lives with her mother and little sister in a typical multi-storey apartment building in Berlin. She''s fascinated by the ''Sound'', a new disco with most modern equipment. Although she''s legally too young, she asks a friend to take her. There she meets Detlef, who''s in a clique where everybody''s on drugs. Step by step she gets drawn deeper into the scene.', 'This movie portrays the drug scene in Berlin in the 70s, following tape recordings of Christiane F. 14 years old Christiane lives with her mother and little sister in a typical multi-storey apartment building in Berlin. She''s fascinated by the ''Sound'', a new disco with most modern equipment. Although she''s legally too young, she asks a friend to take her. There she meets Detlef, who''s in a clique where everybody''s on drugs. Step by step she gets drawn deeper into the scene.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dHNonSmzgxMzEWp0FrzQIVvcBD6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9589'),
  ('453561966583222137', 'Christina', 1984, 'Drama, Crime', 'Alejandro Ulloa, Francisco Lara Polop', 'Harry Alan Towers', 'Jewel Shepard, Ian Sera, Enrique Johson, Emilio Linder, Tony Isbert, Pepita Full James, Emiliano Redondo, Helen Devon', 'R', 'Christina Von Belle, a wealthy heiress, is kidnapped by a lesbian terrorist group and held for ransom. She escapes the lesbian terrorists only to fall into the clutches of a gang of gourmet chefs who want a piece of the ransom themselves.', 'Christina Von Belle, a wealthy heiress, is kidnapped by a lesbian terrorist group and held for ransom. She escapes the lesbian terrorists only to fall into the clutches of a gang of gourmet chefs who want a piece of the ransom themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/YsTyG8AA2AwxHMFOcwd8YpkrOC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106120'),
  ('692401325876992842', 'Christina''s House', 2000, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Gavin Wilding', 'Stuart Allison', 'Brendan Fehr, Brad Rowe, Allison Lange, John Savage, Lorne Stewart, Crystal Bublé, Jerry Wasserman, Chelsea Hobbs', 'R', 'A teenage girl is plagued by bizarre occurrences and deaths related to her new home.', 'A teenage girl is plagued by bizarre occurrences and deaths related to her new home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/avPfOqBpx2cMQSS8xal2Ed2KHlh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38503'),
  ('694021364412476063', 'Christine', 1958, 'Drama, Romance', 'Christian Matras, Pierre Gaspard-Huit, Pierre Lary', null, 'Romy Schneider, Alain Delon, Jean-Claude Brialy, François Chaumette, Jacques Duby, Sophie Grimaldi, Jean Davy, Bernard Dhéran', null, 'Vienna, 1906. A passionate love story develops between Franz Lobheiner and the young Christine. Lobheiner is, however, currently seeing the married Baroness von Eggersdorf. Upon learning of his wife''s infidelity, the Baron von Eggersdorf provokes a duel with Lobheiner. But the former is no longer a real threat to the Baron. Lobheiner is now passionately in love with Christine. How will this love quartet end?', 'Vienna, 1906. A passionate love story develops between Franz Lobheiner and the young Christine. Lobheiner is, however, currently seeing the married Baroness von Eggersdorf. Upon learning of his wife''s infidelity, the Baron von Eggersdorf provokes a duel with Lobheiner. But the former is no longer a real threat to the Baron. Lobheiner is now passionately in love with Christine. How will this love quartet end?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mGCJpRSp3XKKZqqsm8TXCNjZfDX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4956'),
  ('1005811129193267202', 'Christine', 1983, 'Horror', 'Donald M. Morgan, John Carpenter, Jack Philbrick', 'Bill Phillips', 'Keith Gordon, John Stockwell, Alexandra Paul, Robert Prosky, Harry Dean Stanton, Christine Belford, Roberts Blossom, William Ostrander', 'R', 'Nerdy high schooler Arnie Cunningham falls for Christine, a rusty 1958 Plymouth Fury, and becomes obsessed with restoring the classic automobile to her former glory. As the car changes, so does Arnie, whose newfound confidence turns to arrogance behind the wheel of his exotic beauty. Arnie''s girlfriend Leigh and best friend Dennis reach out to him, only to be met by a Fury like no other.', 'Nerdy high schooler Arnie Cunningham falls for Christine, a rusty 1958 Plymouth Fury, and becomes obsessed with restoring the classic automobile to her former glory. As the car changes, so does Arnie, whose newfound confidence turns to arrogance behind the wheel of his exotic beauty. Arnie''s girlfriend Leigh and best friend Dennis reach out to him, only to be met by a Fury like no other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mMtUJke2TtIoT6JB9hkvERmsSu8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8769'),
  ('325823359082696943', 'Christine', 1987, 'TV Movie, Drama', 'Alan Clarke, Steve Saunderson, David Jackson', 'Alan Clarke, Arthur Ellis', 'Vicky Murdock, Kelly George, Mark Harvey, Joanne Mapp, Anthony Smith', null, 'Christine is a pasty-faced teen in a windbreaker and ill-fitting striped shirt who walks endlessly from one friend''s house to another, delivering heroin while their parents are absent.', 'Christine is a pasty-faced teen in a windbreaker and ill-fitting striped shirt who walks endlessly from one friend''s house to another, delivering heroin while their parents are absent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l0l1Yftd8fyeriGBxYC5mKpE57M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168238'),
