  ('1028377578320901742', 'Christman in London - God Save the Queen', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Volfango De Biasi, Tani Canevari', 'Volfango De Biasi, Gianluca Ansanelli, Paola Tiziana Cruciani', 'Lillo Petrolo, Claudio Gregori, Paolo Ruffini, Nino Frassica, Eleonora Giovanardi, Monica Lima, Enzo Iuppariello, Vincent Riotta', null, 'Two brothers go to London to try to score a sensational blow and kidnap the precious dogs of the Queen of England.', 'Two brothers go to London to try to score a sensational blow and kidnap the precious dogs of the Queen of England.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dzVYbvraWZ8qYwABHJyCqCmeGC6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:419508'),
  ('873507004823976533', 'Christmas', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Sebastián Lelio, Benjamín Echazarreta', 'Sebastián Lelio, Gonzalo Maza', 'Manuela Martelli, Diego Ruiz, Alicia Rodríguez', null, 'Alejandro and Aurora, two young students, leave Santiago and are on their way to spend Christmas with family in Aurora. At the foot of the Andes, the frustrations of Alejandro and Aurora’s doubts about her sexual identity cause tension. The two teens are on the verge of collapse when they discover the presence of a young girl, Alicia, a fragile girl of sixteen years who has fled her home. Gathered around an improvised Christmas tree, Alejandro and Aurora are fascinated by the enigmatic Alicia, who is becoming the object of their desire.', 'Alejandro and Aurora, two young students, leave Santiago and are on their way to spend Christmas with family in Aurora. At the foot of the Andes, the frustrations of Alejandro and Aurora’s doubts about her sexual identity cause tension. The two teens are on the verge of collapse when they discover the presence of a young girl, Alicia, a fragile girl of sixteen years who has fled her home. Gathered around an improvised Christmas tree, Alejandro and Aurora are fascinated by the enigmatic Alicia, who is becoming the object of their desire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ibqEzqtTHQgpOUBL1BePGsZ1zF8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:179533'),
  ('315418745302851196', 'Christmas & Co.', 2017, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Family', 'Alain Chabat, Antoine Sanier, Alexandre Sauthier', 'Alain Chabat', 'Alain Chabat, Golshifteh Farahani, Audrey Tautou, Pio Marmaï, Bruno Sanches, David Marsais, Grégoire Ludig, Johann Dionnet', null, 'Christmas is on its way and with it disaster. The 92,000 responsible for manufacturing children''s toys all become sick at the same time! It''s a tough moment for Santa, better known as Father Christmas. He''s left no choice: he must make an emergency trip to Earth with his reindeer to search for a remedy. When he arrives, he must find some allies to save the magic of Christmas.', 'Christmas is on its way and with it disaster. The 92,000 responsible for manufacturing children''s toys all become sick at the same time! It''s a tough moment for Santa, better known as Father Christmas. He''s left no choice: he must make an emergency trip to Earth with his reindeer to search for a remedy. When he arrives, he must find some allies to save the magic of Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sRsrP5iowmCGV2IvVWMga1EmHZA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:451500'),
  ('929468790863565992', 'Christmas à la Carte', 2021, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Graeme Campbell', 'Kelly G. Crawford', 'Erin Agostino, Dillon Casey, Deborah Tennant, Maya Misaljevic, Brittany Charlotte Smith, Marcia Bennett, Rex Hagon, Cory Lee', 'G', 'When food correspondent, Carly, gets a shot at her own show, she is sent to Angel Heights to help Grant open his diner and film it as a Holiday special for her TV show. Will Grant and Carly open their hearts too?', 'When food correspondent, Carly, gets a shot at her own show, she is sent to Angel Heights to help Grant open his diner and film it as a Holiday special for her TV show. Will Grant and Carly open their hearts too?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yedmx0JOedqghOJCoI8y3bpiqKF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:844869'),
  ('423963727799585123', 'Christmas Angel', 2009, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'John Lyde, Brian Brough', 'Scott Champion, Brittany Wiscombe', 'K.C. Clyde, Kari Hawker-Diaz, Bruce Davison, Jennifer Klekas, Michael W. Lee, Hank Pond, Connie Young, Maureen Eastwood', 'PG', 'Ashley has been on her own all her life. She feels even more alone this Christmas as she searches fruitlessly for a job. The seasonal cheer around her only rubs salt in her wounds as she scrapes by to support herself and her dog, Dash. But her neighbor, Nick, knows exactly what to do. He offers her a job, to be his assistant in the best work-helping others. There''s one catch that Ashley must honor though-she can''t tell anyone that her new boss is a sort of Secret Santa, helping others anonymously. Through her new job, Ashley meets Will, a writer for a business magazine who uncovers what Ashley is doing, and more importantly, Nick''s involvement. As Ashley and Nick help people in need, Ashley tries to protect Nick''s secret, and her own heart, while Will must weigh the consequences of what he does.', 'Ashley has been on her own all her life. She feels even more alone this Christmas as she searches fruitlessly for a job. The seasonal cheer around her only rubs salt in her wounds as she scrapes by to support herself and her dog, Dash. But her neighbor, Nick, knows exactly what to do. He offers her a job, to be his assistant in the best work-helping others. There''s one catch that Ashley must honor though-she can''t tell anyone that her new boss is a sort of Secret Santa, helping others anonymously. Through her new job, Ashley meets Will, a writer for a business magazine who uncovers what Ashley is doing, and more importantly, Nick''s involvement. As Ashley and Nick help people in need, Ashley tries to protect Nick''s secret, and her own heart, while Will must weigh the consequences of what he does.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c1HZZB7ZWHWyEryKJgoT3rRFfCb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50454'),
  ('1055936564128924213', 'Christmas As Usual', 2023, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Petter Holmsen, Matthew Weston, Peter Bruteig Henriksen', 'Petter Holmsen', 'Ida Ursin-Holm, Kanan Gill, Marit Andreassen, Erik Follestad, Veslemøy Mørkrid, Matilde Hovdegard, Mads Sjøgård Pettersen, Jonas Strand Gravli', 'PG-13', 'To celebrate their engagement, Thea takes Jashan home — but his Indian roots and her family''s Norwegian traditions clash in a chaotic Christmas.', 'To celebrate their engagement, Thea takes Jashan home — but his Indian roots and her family''s Norwegian traditions clash in a chaotic Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/suDjK0qIsPoBNrAhWUtIjkIWx1G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1202584'),
  ('663297669067383410', 'Christmas at Cartwright''s', 2014, 'Romance, Family, Drama, TV Movie', 'Peter Benison, Graeme Campbell', 'Margaret Oberman', 'Alicia Witt, Gabriel Hogan, Wallace Shawn, T.J. McGibbon, Linda Kash, Gabrielle Miller, Jayne Eastwood, Ron Lea', null, 'With Christmas approaching, a struggling single mom finds herself working as a department store Santa Claus, as a real-life angel delivers good fortune and the possibility of holiday romance.', 'With Christmas approaching, a struggling single mom finds herself working as a department store Santa Claus, as a real-life angel delivers good fortune and the possibility of holiday romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A2cB6LmmzSZrJOSk50mDWPKswRK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:299588'),
  ('503728565128341947', 'Christmas at Castle', null, 'Romance', null, null, 'Brooke Burfitt, Dan Jeannotte, Geraldine Somerville', null, 'This Christmas, Blaire (Brooke Burfitt), a perfume expert from New York, is sent to remote Scotland to find a rare fragrance. But when she arrives, she finds the dashing license owner Alistair (Dan Jeannotte) is a stubborn aristocrat who won''t sell.', 'This Christmas, Blaire (Brooke Burfitt), a perfume expert from New York, is sent to remote Scotland to find a rare fragrance. But when she arrives, she finds the dashing license owner Alistair (Dan Jeannotte) is a stubborn aristocrat who won''t sell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pm1yG7Kfgb6w71Cl1AVVA1ZZwFX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1464604'),
  ('1109361636356761002', 'Christmas at Castle Hart', 2021, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Stefan Scaini, Ciarán Tanham', 'Rick German, Paul Campbell', 'Lacey Chabert, Stuart Townsend, Ali Hardiman, Aoife Spratt, Ali White, Kate O''Toole, Natalie Radmall-Quirke, Kevin McGahern', 'G', 'Brooke Bennett goes to Ireland for Christmas to search for her Irish roots. While there, she meets Aiden Hart, Earl of Glaslough. Mistaken for an elite event planner, she’s hired to host his castle’s epic Christmas party.', 'Brooke Bennett goes to Ireland for Christmas to search for her Irish roots. While there, she meets Aiden Hart, Earl of Glaslough. Mistaken for an elite event planner, she’s hired to host his castle’s epic Christmas party.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vgDcBPhEOTvAd7BrmuoRc9jduib.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:874166'),
  ('951670434398850351', 'Christmas at Deejay''s House: A Christmas Carol', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Lorenzo Bassano, Marco Bassano', 'Rocco Tanica, Linus, Andrea Garello', 'Linus, DJ Angelo, Platinette, Alessio Bertallot, Albertino, Luciana Littizzetto, Fiorello, Paola Cortellesi', null, 'Miser Ebenezer Scrooge is awakened on Christmas Eve by spirits who reveal to him his own miserable existence, what opportunities he wasted in his youth, his current cruelties, and the dire fate that awaits him if he does not change his ways. Scrooge is faced with his own story of growing bitterness and meanness, and must decide what his own future will hold: death or redemption. A reinterpretation of Charles Dickens'' timeless 1843 novella by the cast of Radio Deejay.', 'Miser Ebenezer Scrooge is awakened on Christmas Eve by spirits who reveal to him his own miserable existence, what opportunities he wasted in his youth, his current cruelties, and the dire fate that awaits him if he does not change his ways. Scrooge is faced with his own story of growing bitterness and meanness, and must decide what his own future will hold: death or redemption. A reinterpretation of Charles Dickens'' timeless 1843 novella by the cast of Radio Deejay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lIFUOEv9UpaPaR12gHqHup1MKtw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143072'),
  ('919759586744503477', 'Christmas at Graceland', 2018, 'TV Movie, Family, Romance', 'Shawn Maurer, Eric Close', 'Gregg Rossen, Brian Sawyer', 'Kellie Pickler, Wes Brown, Ned Vaughn, Rhoda Griffis, Sara Antonio, Tamara Austin, Tommy Cresswell, Angela Fox', null, 'Laurel, a Chicago-based business executive, travels to Memphis to secure one of the city''s oldest family-owned banks. While in Memphis, Laurel reunites with old flame Clay, a local music promoter with loftier aspirations. Though Laurel tries to keep her eye on the prize of the business acquisition, Clay is very persuasive reminding her of the days when they were a performing duo on the brink of stardom. Now Laurel''s focus turns to the home of the Blues and dreams of making music again.', 'Laurel, a Chicago-based business executive, travels to Memphis to secure one of the city''s oldest family-owned banks. While in Memphis, Laurel reunites with old flame Clay, a local music promoter with loftier aspirations. Though Laurel tries to keep her eye on the prize of the business acquisition, Clay is very persuasive reminding her of the days when they were a performing duo on the brink of stardom. Now Laurel''s focus turns to the home of the Blues and dreams of making music again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1KhJ3cxhMbgsIudXpG0coqnftLn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:535808'),
  ('425932533085832704', 'Christmas at Grand Valley', 2018, 'TV Movie, Family, Romance', 'Russ Goozee, Don McCutcheon', 'Sue Tenney, Mark Amato, Karen Berger', 'Danica McKellar, Brennan Elliott, Zarrin Darnell-Martin, Chad Connell, Gage Graham-Arbuthnot, Hattie Kragten, Dan Lauria, Angela Asher', 'G', 'Burned out from the hubbub of the Chicago gallery world, artist Kelly returns home to the picturesque Grand Valley just in time for Christmas. Leo, businessman and all-star dad to his children, struggles to balance his time this holiday season. When he is assigned to review a hotel in Grand Valley for its value, he sees this as the perfect opportunity for a Christmas family vacation. It isn’t long until Kelly and Leo’s worlds collide.', 'Burned out from the hubbub of the Chicago gallery world, artist Kelly returns home to the picturesque Grand Valley just in time for Christmas. Leo, businessman and all-star dad to his children, struggles to balance his time this holiday season. When he is assigned to review a hotel in Grand Valley for its value, he sees this as the perfect opportunity for a Christmas family vacation. It isn’t long until Kelly and Leo’s worlds collide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/R8O6BlBD2J8N0Z5EI6fjuWQTDS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:550024'),
  ('478397786882773143', 'Christmas at Holly Lodge', 2017, 'Drama, TV Movie, Romance', 'Jem Garrard', 'Melissa Salmons', 'Alison Sweeney, Jordan Bridges, Sheryl Lee Ralph, Latonya Williams, Yan-Kay Crystal Lowe, Toby Levins, Audrey Smallman, Adrian Hough', 'G', 'Sophie Bennett begins a new holiday tradition of spending every holiday at the Evergreen Inn and Ski Lodge, which she inherited from her parents. Evergreen Inn is a special place filled with people who cannot make it home for the holidays or who have had such wonderful experiences that it has become their home-away-from-holiday-home. This Christmas, Sophie will meet an unforgettable family, and her own life will be forever changed.', 'Sophie Bennett begins a new holiday tradition of spending every holiday at the Evergreen Inn and Ski Lodge, which she inherited from her parents. Evergreen Inn is a special place filled with people who cannot make it home for the holidays or who have had such wonderful experiences that it has become their home-away-from-holiday-home. This Christmas, Sophie will meet an unforgettable family, and her own life will be forever changed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iwLkbvvDIBVVmILnoBUUSaqcvVm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:480622'),
  ('410228656164198979', 'Christmas at Pemberley Manor', 2018, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Branden James Maxham, Colin Theys', 'Rick Garman', 'Jessica Lowndes, Michael Rady, Cole Gleason, Maddie McCormick, Steve Larkin, Ben Estus, Elaine Hendrix', 'G', 'As Christmas approaches, Elizabeth Bennett, a New York event planner is sent to a quaint, small town to organize a holiday festival. When she arrives, she finds William Darcy, a high-profile billionaire lacking in holiday spirit, in the process of selling the charming estate she hoped to use as a venue. Elizabeth persuades the reluctant Darcy to let her hold the festival on the historical estate and, before long, the unlikely pair begins falling for each other.', 'As Christmas approaches, Elizabeth Bennett, a New York event planner is sent to a quaint, small town to organize a holiday festival. When she arrives, she finds William Darcy, a high-profile billionaire lacking in holiday spirit, in the process of selling the charming estate she hoped to use as a venue. Elizabeth persuades the reluctant Darcy to let her hold the festival on the historical estate and, before long, the unlikely pair begins falling for each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a9Dja61XK00gxXdl5pwFZUO0cYY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:549301'),
  ('332259884294963873', 'Christmas at the Chalet', 2023, 'TV Movie, Romance, Comedy', 'Lucie Guest, Christopher Ajtony', 'Julia Cranney', 'Teri Hatcher, Brendan McRae, Dan Payne, Gigi Neil, William deVry, Patti Allan, Mila Jones, Aleksandra Cross', null, 'When ex TV host and socialite Lex finds herself faced with the possibility of spending Christmas sharing a luxury chalet with her son, ex husband and his new girlfriend, she volunteers to work in the chalet to avoid things getting too close to home, while documenting her every move for a new wave of followers loving this new chapter of her life.', 'When ex TV host and socialite Lex finds herself faced with the possibility of spending Christmas sharing a luxury chalet with her son, ex husband and his new girlfriend, she volunteers to work in the chalet to avoid things getting too close to home, while documenting her every move for a new wave of followers loving this new chapter of her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m9GivfCh53JVGQzCX868FtrWPQ0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1173912'),
  ('1059216416508860085', 'Christmas at the Cupiello House', 1962, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Eduardo De Filippo', 'Eduardo De Filippo', 'Eduardo De Filippo, Nina De Padova, Pietro De Vico, Enzo Cannavale, Enzo Petito, Pietro Carloni, Lello Grotta, Carlo Lima', null, 'Luca Cupiello lives with the wife Concetta, the son Tommasino, and a brother, Pasquale. The son is wild, living by gimmicks and stealing from his uncle; the daughter Ninuccia does not get along with her husband Nicolino and plans to run away with her lover Vittorio; the wife tries to hide her family''s troubles from her husband. Luca, who silently suffers the family situation, takes refuge in setting up the Nativity scene.', 'Luca Cupiello lives with the wife Concetta, the son Tommasino, and a brother, Pasquale. The son is wild, living by gimmicks and stealing from his uncle; the daughter Ninuccia does not get along with her husband Nicolino and plans to run away with her lover Vittorio; the wife tries to hide her family''s troubles from her husband. Luca, who silently suffers the family situation, takes refuge in setting up the Nativity scene.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ujmZ9h7YuqcnzwmfC48yjQpXSNg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148392'),
  ('774894926688653523', 'Christmas at the Cupiello Household', 1977, 'Comedy, Drama, TV Movie', 'Eduardo De Filippo, Davide Altschüler, Anna Maria Campolonghi', 'Eduardo De Filippo, Aldo Nicolaj', 'Eduardo De Filippo, Pupella Maggio, Gino Maringola, Luca De Filippo, Lina Sastri, Marina Confalone, Luigi Uzzo, Marzio Honorato', null, 'Luca Cupiello, like every Christmas, prepares the crib, amid the disinterest of his wife Concetta and his son Tommasino. Ninuccia, the other daughter, writes a letter to her husband in which she communicates that she leaves him for her lover. The letter happens in the hands of Luca who hands it over to his son-in-law, who thus learns of his wife''s betrayal. During lunch on Christmas Eve, the two rivals, who were confronted by Luca''s carelessness, clash violently.', 'Luca Cupiello, like every Christmas, prepares the crib, amid the disinterest of his wife Concetta and his son Tommasino. Ninuccia, the other daughter, writes a letter to her husband in which she communicates that she leaves him for her lover. The letter happens in the hands of Luca who hands it over to his son-in-law, who thus learns of his wife''s betrayal. During lunch on Christmas Eve, the two rivals, who were confronted by Luca''s carelessness, clash violently.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xqqPzmUwZ8MTpGMSw87mf0WmDj1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:486646'),
  ('915705084227671074', 'Christmas at the Drive-In', 2022, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Don McBrearty', 'Rick Garman', 'Danica McKellar, Neal Bledsoe, Jennifer Wigmore, Ayesha Mansur Gonsalves, Luke Marty, Jim Annan, Elisa Moolecherry', 'G', 'Sadie Walker is starting over in her hometown of Chesterfield, New York, following a series of major life disruptions that include leaving her law practice after losing her biggest case and no longer being engaged.', 'Sadie Walker is starting over in her hometown of Chesterfield, New York, following a series of major life disruptions that include leaving her law practice after losing her biggest case and no longer being engaged.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oxA95knlryWfwtR52kb7sKGNSsy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1026941'),
  ('277551624203077161', 'Christmas at the Palace', 2018, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Alexandra Burca, Elion Olson, Daniela Soare', 'Joie Botkin, Rick Garman', 'Merritt Patterson, Andrew Cooper, Brittany Bristow, Nicholas Banks, Geraldine Fitzgerald, India Fowler, Esh Alladi, Antonio Aakeel', 'G', 'Katie, a former professional ice skater, is hired by the king of San Senova, Alexander, to help his daughter in a Christmas ice skating performance. As Katie spends time in the castle and with the king, she and Alex begin to develop feelings for each other and ultimately fall in love. But will the tradition-loving people of San Senova allow their king to make a foreigner their queen?', 'Katie, a former professional ice skater, is hired by the king of San Senova, Alexander, to help his daughter in a Christmas ice skating performance. As Katie spends time in the castle and with the king, she and Alex begin to develop feelings for each other and ultimately fall in love. But will the tradition-loving people of San Senova allow their king to make a foreigner their queen?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lD6xv3dz6AStcYsrDk6sqHKMgxD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:550023'),
  ('624387504360338886', 'Christmas at the Plaza', 2019, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Ron Oliver, Thomas M. Harting', 'Ron Oliver', 'Elizabeth Henstridge, Ryan Paevey, Bruce Davison, Julia Duffy, Karen Holness, David Lafontaine, Nelson Wong, Wanda Cannon', 'G', 'With Christmas approaching in New York City, historian Jessica is hired to create an exhibition honoring the history of Christmas at The Plaza Hotel. When she is paired with Nick, a handsome decorator, they wind up enjoying a host of holiday traditions together and find themselves falling for each other.', 'With Christmas approaching in New York City, historian Jessica is hired to create an exhibition honoring the history of Christmas at The Plaza Hotel. When she is paired with Nick, a handsome decorator, they wind up enjoying a host of holiday traditions together and find themselves falling for each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qR7u96cUlmZ7B9jB8Yyv0teszrm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:630916'),
  ('1112133488933976694', 'Christmas at the Ranch', 2021, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Christin Baker, David Y. Chung', 'Julie Anton, Christin Baker', 'Amanda Righetti, Laur Allen, Lindsay Wagner, Archie Kao, Dia Frampton, Aaron Branch, Patrick O''Sullivan, Brittany Goodwin', null, 'When Haley Hollis returns to her family ranch to try and save it from closure, she wasn''t banking on spending so much time with ranch hand Kate - or falling for her.', 'When Haley Hollis returns to her family ranch to try and save it from closure, she wasn''t banking on spending so much time with ranch hand Kate - or falling for her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ynYg2kSmXImV0xr6pxDluNB3tQl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:805973'),
  ('275253561794043463', 'Christmas Bedtime Stories', 2022, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Alysse Leite-Rogers, Andrew Coppin', 'Andrea Canning', 'Erin Cahill, Steve Lund, Charlie Weber, Victoria Dunsmore, Tegan Moss, Ecstasia Sanders, Sarah Kelley, Jerry Trimble', 'G', 'When Danielle’s husband goes missing in action during his deployment, she is left to raise her daughter on her own. Three years later, as she acclimates to life without him, she begins to tell her daughter bedtime stories of her father.', 'When Danielle’s husband goes missing in action during his deployment, she is left to raise her daughter on her own. Three years later, as she acclimates to life without him, she begins to tell her daughter bedtime stories of her father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zhW480dt2LCJH0PcoDeFkw4nFnh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1027431'),
  ('891907647983136244', 'Christmas Belle', 2013, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Alex Wright, Miko Dannels, Ellen Rosentreter', 'Joany Kane', 'Haylie Duff, Nicholas Gonzalez, Mark Famiglietti, C. Thomas Howell, Sheree J. Wilson, Jerry Hauck, Cliff Mathieson', null, 'With her California hometown in the rearview mirror, Belle heads north on business to catalog the sale of a large mansion. While the job is a dream, the client, Hunter Lowell, is not. But, as the two spend more time together, his icy demeanor begins to melt. Although their relationship is budding, Belle’s long-time suitor, Tony, arrives, sending mixed signals to Hunter while adding chaos to the holiday season.', 'With her California hometown in the rearview mirror, Belle heads north on business to catalog the sale of a large mansion. While the job is a dream, the client, Hunter Lowell, is not. But, as the two spend more time together, his icy demeanor begins to melt. Although their relationship is budding, Belle’s long-time suitor, Tony, arrives, sending mixed signals to Hunter while adding chaos to the holiday season.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sh822zcLjxGfF2BogCOLLNCPvSu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:245792'),
  ('696918352968080864', 'Christmas Bells Are Ringing', 2018, 'Family, TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Pat Williams', 'Nicole Baxter', 'Emilie Ullerup, Josh Kelly, Rebecca Staab, Roz Murray, Hamza Fouad, Teagan Vincze, Mark Humphrey, Cameron McDonald', null, 'Samantha, a freelance photographer, is returning to Cape Cod for the first time since the death of her mother years earlier. She’s going to celebrate her father’s Christmas Eve wedding but is anxious to revisit past memories. On a deadline for a big Christmas spread that could ignite her career, she enlists the help of her childhood friend, Mike, to show her around. In the time she spends in Cape Cod, she realizes that Christmas is wherever your family is.', 'Samantha, a freelance photographer, is returning to Cape Cod for the first time since the death of her mother years earlier. She’s going to celebrate her father’s Christmas Eve wedding but is anxious to revisit past memories. On a deadline for a big Christmas spread that could ignite her career, she enlists the help of her childhood friend, Mike, to show her around. In the time she spends in Cape Cod, she realizes that Christmas is wherever your family is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bJV4HVbYZMblIEa1bqk6mSHQ5YJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:555281'),
  ('711997496519542264', 'Christmas Bloody Christmas', 2022, 'Horror', 'Joe Begos, Brian Sowell', 'Joe Begos', 'Riley Dandy, Sam Delich, Jonah Ray Rodrigues, Dora Madison, Jeff Daniel Phillips, Abraham Benrubi, Jeremy Gardner, Kansas Bowling', null, 'It''s Christmas Eve and Tori just wants to get drunk and party, but when a robotic Santa Claus at a nearby toy store goes haywire and begins a rampant killing spree through her small town, she''s forced into a battle for survival.', 'It''s Christmas Eve and Tori just wants to get drunk and party, but when a robotic Santa Claus at a nearby toy store goes haywire and begins a rampant killing spree through her small town, she''s forced into a battle for survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/60Dy8eA5QyUHKHBmojXUtZxWdo8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1019836'),
  ('137016089349566297', 'Christmas Break-In', 2018, 'Family, Drama', 'Kyle Moe, Michael Kampa', 'Spanky Dustin Ward', 'Lexi Giovagnoli, Denise Richards, Katrina Begin, Ali Daniels, Sean O''Bryan, Danny Glover, Cameron Seely', null, 'Izzy is an energetic 9-year-old. Overscheduled and running late, Izzy''s parents can''t pick her up on-time the last day of school before Christmas break. A blizzard complicates the matter, but not as much as a pair of bad guys who are freezing in an ice cream truck. The school''s janitor is kidnapped by the intruders, and it''s up to Izzy to save the day.', 'Izzy is an energetic 9-year-old. Overscheduled and running late, Izzy''s parents can''t pick her up on-time the last day of school before Christmas break. A blizzard complicates the matter, but not as much as a pair of bad guys who are freezing in an ice cream truck. The school''s janitor is kidnapped by the intruders, and it''s up to Izzy to save the day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qZmPodMlyRNOHrVPYLTGehM2s3q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:566494'),
  ('205126129768713441', 'Christmas by Starlight', 2020, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'Gary Yates', null, 'Kimberley Sustad, Paul Campbell, Rebecca Staab, Malcolm Stewart, Bruce Dawson, Jeff Reyes, Darren Martens, Scarlett Smith', null, 'Annie, a lawyer, must help her loved ones this holiday season. Her family’s restaurant, The Starlight Café, is slated for demolition. The heir to the development firm responsible, William, makes her an unlikely proposition: he’ll spare the café if Annie spends the week “appearing” as the legal counsel his father is demanding he hire in the wake of some costly mistakes.', 'Annie, a lawyer, must help her loved ones this holiday season. Her family’s restaurant, The Starlight Café, is slated for demolition. The heir to the development firm responsible, William, makes her an unlikely proposition: he’ll spare the café if Annie spends the week “appearing” as the legal counsel his father is demanding he hire in the wake of some costly mistakes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zYIfYIz0FRSZKrgz7cuw0NKX0NC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:746045'),
  ('108800849505856687', 'Christmas Caper', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama, Family, TV Movie', 'David Winkler, Patricia Dyer Walden, Sara MacDonald', 'April Blair', 'Shannen Doherty, Ty Olsson, Conrad Coates, Stefanie von Pfetten, Sonya Salomaa, David James Lewis, Michael P. Northey, Natasha Calis', null, 'A Grinch-like thief retreats to her hometown in Connecticut after a con goes bad. There, she gets stuck baby-sitting her niece and nephew until their parents can make it home for Christmas. She spends most of her time devising ways to even the score with her old partner in crime, until the spirit of the holidays help put her priorities back on track.', 'A Grinch-like thief retreats to her hometown in Connecticut after a con goes bad. There, she gets stuck baby-sitting her niece and nephew until their parents can make it home for Christmas. She spends most of her time devising ways to even the score with her old partner in crime, until the spirit of the holidays help put her priorities back on track.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eSYQeSLlZYzOWn9ennFTkmZ6jA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51593'),
  ('324764860236962794', 'Christmas Carol', 2022, 'Action, Thriller', 'Kim Sung-soo, Lee Seok-jun, Kang Ji-hyeon', 'Kim Sung-soo', 'Jinyoung, Kim Young-min, Kim Dong-hwi, Song Geon-hee, Heo Dong-won, Hwang In-sung, Seo Jin-won, Kim Jeong-jin', null, 'On a Christmas Eve, a lifeless body of teenage boy is found. The victim''s revenge-driven twin brother checks himself into a juvie to hunt down the suspects.', 'On a Christmas Eve, a lifeless body of teenage boy is found. The victim''s revenge-driven twin brother checks himself into a juvie to hunt down the suspects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xiDbyI2Ttp6I49aUieqjrf4pK2O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:882580'),
  ('502804238591108010', 'Christmas Carol: The Movie', 2001, 'Animation, Family, Drama', 'Jimmy T. Murakami', 'Robert Llewellyn, Piet Kroon', 'Simon Callow, Kate Winslet, Nicolas Cage, Jane Horrocks, Michael Gambon, Rhys Ifans, Juliet Stevenson, Robert Llewellyn', null, 'Animated version of the classic Charles Dickens story. Warned by the ghost of his old business partner Marley that his sins would lead to punishment in the afterlife, the cruel and greedy Scrooge is visited by the Ghosts of Christmas Past, Present and Future to show him how the course of his life led him to where he is - and where it will lead if he doesn''t change his ways.', 'Animated version of the classic Charles Dickens story. Warned by the ghost of his old business partner Marley that his sins would lead to punishment in the afterlife, the cruel and greedy Scrooge is visited by the Ghosts of Christmas Past, Present and Future to show him how the course of his life led him to where he is - and where it will lead if he doesn''t change his ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/38NCcPC1zJ6hzQYvzPor5uguvDs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35257'),
  ('61564786461037648', 'Christmas Carole', 2024, 'Comedy, Family', 'Jeanne Gottesdiener, Vincent Muller', 'Jeanne Gottesdiener, Julie Ponsonnet', 'Didier Bourdon, Noémie Lvovsky, Jules Sagot, Christophe Montenez, Sissi Duparc, Camille Pistone, Janaïna Halloy Fokan, Alice Daubelcour', null, 'Carole, the mayoress of a small town, is trying to juggle her municipal duties and family celebrations to little success.', 'Carole, the mayoress of a small town, is trying to juggle her municipal duties and family celebrations to little success.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7pVykyIuGIfikETG3pMSWyqz3Zs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1147114'),
  ('446185771815346472', 'Christmas CEO', 2021, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'Jonathan Wright, Peter Benison', 'Anna White', 'Paul Greene, Marisol Nichols, Veronica Marin-Estrada, Tedd Dillon, Daniella Dela Peña, Barbara Eve Harris, Amanda Martínez, Bert Cardozo', 'G', 'A small toy company CEO gets a once in a lifetime offer to merge with a mega toy company but will need her estranged ex-business partner''s signature to seal the deal. What he helps her rediscover will change both of their lives.', 'A small toy company CEO gets a once in a lifetime offer to merge with a mega toy company but will need her estranged ex-business partner''s signature to seal the deal. What he helps her rediscover will change both of their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sEr64YRNev9EW7YIyUqpcxK8Z9T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:874193'),
  ('1005267885072488291', 'Christmas Class Reunion', 2022, 'TV Movie, Romance, Comedy', 'Jonathan A. Rosenbaum, Randal Platt', 'Erin Rodman', 'Aimee Teegarden, Tanner Novlan, Dejan Loyola, Maya Ford, Stephanie Bennett, Marshall Williams, Dylan Archambault, Yasmeen Kelders', 'G', 'High school classmates, who once dubbed themselves the “cursed class,” reconnect at Christmas for their 15-year reunion. Over the course of their time reconnecting, the classmates challenge each other to remember who they were, who they are, and who they want to be.', 'High school classmates, who once dubbed themselves the “cursed class,” reconnect at Christmas for their 15-year reunion. Over the course of their time reconnecting, the classmates challenge each other to remember who they were, who they are, and who they want to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1sYxuse7fhYQ0Zej8Z0tGizD9uu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1028537'),
  ('170071316903213469', 'Christmas Comes But Once a Year', 1936, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Seymour Kneitel, Dave Fleischer', null, 'Jack Mercer, Mae Questel, Everett Clark', null, 'At an orphanage, the children are sad because they received used defective toys as gifts. Professor Grampy sees the children while passing by in his sled and has an idea on how to give them a merry Christmas.', 'At an orphanage, the children are sad because they received used defective toys as gifts. Professor Grampy sees the children while passing by in his sled and has an idea on how to give them a merry Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/98NArcZwwpfDUFy342YaqFFRQG9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46240'),
  ('903949257006913554', 'Christmas Comes to Pac-land', 1982, 'Animation, Family, TV Movie, Comedy', 'Ray Patterson', 'Jeffrey Scott', 'Peter Cullen, Marty Ingels, Barbara Minkus, Russi Taylor, Barry Gordon, Chuck McCann, Neil Ross, Susan Silo', null, 'Pac-Man and friends try to help Santa fix his sleigh and save Christmas!', 'Pac-Man and friends try to help Santa fix his sleigh and save Christmas!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9VkiUuva18CM14dVWWAtZcAfuu3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46165'),
  ('542820619800105674', 'Christmas Comes to Willow Creek', 1987, 'Drama, Family, TV Movie', 'Richard Lang, Brenton Spencer', 'Andy Siegel, Michael Norell', 'John Schneider, Tom Wopat, Kim Delaney, Zachary Ansley, Joy Coghill, Antony Holland, Hoyt Axton, Dwight Koss', 'G', 'Two brothers'' lives are changed forever when they hit the road to a snowbound Alaskan village. Brother Ray and Pete had been feuding for years. So, when their ailing father asks them to drive a semitruck full of gifts and supplies from California to the isolated Alaskan village of Willow Creek, they agree ---- reluctantly. Along the way, they pick up trouble when they''re joined by Jessie, who is Ray''s estranged wife and Pete''s ex-girlfriend. Then, a blizzard strands the truck deep in the Alaskan wilderness. Miles from help, with time running our fast, they realize only a miracle can save them. But, as they are about to be reminded, Christmas...is the season for miracles.', 'Two brothers'' lives are changed forever when they hit the road to a snowbound Alaskan village. Brother Ray and Pete had been feuding for years. So, when their ailing father asks them to drive a semitruck full of gifts and supplies from California to the isolated Alaskan village of Willow Creek, they agree ---- reluctantly. Along the way, they pick up trouble when they''re joined by Jessie, who is Ray''s estranged wife and Pete''s ex-girlfriend. Then, a blizzard strands the truck deep in the Alaskan wilderness. Miles from help, with time running our fast, they realize only a miracle can save them. But, as they are about to be reminded, Christmas...is the season for miracles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r1JWnvbK9Upu4xFz2ERa089U0Q7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51591'),
  ('1102714296628087410', 'Christmas Connection', 2017, 'Drama, TV Movie, Mystery, Romance', 'Steven R. Monroe', 'Andrea Stevens, Gregg Rossen, Brian Sawyer', 'Brooke Burns, Tom Everett Scott, Sophie Neudorfer, Micheline Marchildon, Adriana O''Neil, John B. Lowe, Erik Athavale, Gino Anania', 'G', 'Adventurous flight attendant Sydney’s plans for a tropical Christmas get delayed when she helps an unaccompanied minor get home to Chicago to her dad Jonathan, a handsome widower and investigative reporter. Faced with a shortage of out-going flights, Sydney is marooned for several days in the Windy City – once her home as a small girl — and tags along with Jonathan, his daughter, and their exuberantly festive family until she can find a connecting flight. Jonathan makes her a deal: he helps her chase down the story of how her late parents met, and she helps him to write the perfect Christmas story and keep his job, and along the way, sparks form between them.', 'Adventurous flight attendant Sydney’s plans for a tropical Christmas get delayed when she helps an unaccompanied minor get home to Chicago to her dad Jonathan, a handsome widower and investigative reporter. Faced with a shortage of out-going flights, Sydney is marooned for several days in the Windy City – once her home as a small girl — and tags along with Jonathan, his daughter, and their exuberantly festive family until she can find a connecting flight. Jonathan makes her a deal: he helps her chase down the story of how her late parents met, and she helps him to write the perfect Christmas story and keep his job, and along the way, sparks form between them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tFeLk3FgGTO8LahmFdMVAWopvqW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:474994'),
  ('1040329386712166341', 'Christmas Cookies', 2016, 'TV Movie, Romance, Drama', 'James Head', 'Robert Tate Miller', 'Jill Wagner, Wes Brown, Tiera Skovbye, Chelsey Reist, Marci T. House, Jim Thorburn, P. Lynn Johnson, Chris Gauthier', 'G', 'Aunt Sally''s Christmas Cookie Company is sold to a large conglomerate and executive Hannah must seal the deal and shut down the factory, which is the small town of Cookie Jar''s lifeblood. What was supposed to be a simple assignment for Hannah becomes complicated when she meets Jake, the factory owner who''s determined to keep the factory in town. Despite not being a fan of the holiday, the Christmas spirit in this small town is infectious and she gets swept up in the joy of the season while also falling in love with Jake.', 'Aunt Sally''s Christmas Cookie Company is sold to a large conglomerate and executive Hannah must seal the deal and shut down the factory, which is the small town of Cookie Jar''s lifeblood. What was supposed to be a simple assignment for Hannah becomes complicated when she meets Jake, the factory owner who''s determined to keep the factory in town. Despite not being a fan of the holiday, the Christmas spirit in this small town is infectious and she gets swept up in the joy of the season while also falling in love with Jake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ut0buWDVWX3xOdFco7ODrmHeVWh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:410317'),
  ('150138527919697310', 'Christmas Cottage', 2008, 'Drama, Romance, Family', 'Michael Campus, Robert Brinkmann', 'Ken LaZebnik', 'Jared Padalecki, Marcia Gay Harden, Peter O''Toole, Chris Elliott, Charlotte Rae, Ed Asner, Aaron Ashmore, Richard Burgi', 'PG', 'Inspired by the picturesque paintings of Thomas Kinkade, The Christmas Cottage tells the semi-autobiographical tale of how a young boy is propelled to launch a career as an artist after he learns that his mother is in danger of losing the family home.', 'Inspired by the picturesque paintings of Thomas Kinkade, The Christmas Cottage tells the semi-autobiographical tale of how a young boy is propelled to launch a career as an artist after he learns that his mother is in danger of losing the family home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xgVxmbD4mLtvelP8U5jbT7Rxjiv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13610'),
  ('452145532151848136', 'Christmas Crossfire', 2020, 'Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Detlev Buck, Armin Franzen', 'Martin Behnke, Detlev Buck', 'Kostja Ullmann, Alli Neumann, Detlev Buck, Peter Kurth, Sophia Thomalla, Anika Mauer, Merlin Rose, Sascha Alexander Geršak', null, 'A man foils an attempted murder, then flees the crew of would-be killers along with their intended target as a woman he''s just met tries to find him.', 'A man foils an attempted murder, then flees the crew of would-be killers along with their intended target as a woman he''s just met tries to find him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ajKpYK7XdzIYjy9Uy8nkgRboKyv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:765123'),
  ('749601464574690597', 'Christmas Cupid', 2010, 'Romance, Comedy, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Gil Junger, Valerie Finkel, Robert Ballentine', 'Aury Wallington', 'Christina Milian, Ashley Benson, Chad Michael Murray, Burgess Jenkins, Ryan Sypek, Cara Mantella, Mark LaMura, Patrick Johnson', 'G', 'Sloan is beautiful, stylish, and on the fast track to success at her public relations firm. After her client Caitlin ends up in a coma and becomes her own personal ghost of Christmas past, present, and future; she finds out first hand that her unethical ways needs to change and reuniting with a past jilted lover may be the answer.', 'Sloan is beautiful, stylish, and on the fast track to success at her public relations firm. After her client Caitlin ends up in a coma and becomes her own personal ghost of Christmas past, present, and future; she finds out first hand that her unethical ways needs to change and reuniting with a past jilted lover may be the answer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ldW5GWiktjjakPa8yZWnCK8Z0Dz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52060'),
  ('264340055854972961', 'Christmas Day', 1928, 'Documentary', 'Antonio Rodríguez Fuentes, Josefina Barrera Fuentes', null, null, null, 'This 1920s home movie, shot by longtime Corpus Christi resident Antonio Rodríguez Fuentes, may well represent some of the earliest produced by a Mexican-American filmmaker about the Mexican-American community in Texas. In the footage, Fuentes captures his five children-Ruben, Ophelia, Mercedes, Antonio, and Carmen-on Christmas Day 1928. The children surround the outdoor Christmas tree, playing with the gifts they received.', 'This 1920s home movie, shot by longtime Corpus Christi resident Antonio Rodríguez Fuentes, may well represent some of the earliest produced by a Mexican-American filmmaker about the Mexican-American community in Texas. In the footage, Fuentes captures his five children-Ruben, Ophelia, Mercedes, Antonio, and Carmen-on Christmas Day 1928. The children surround the outdoor Christmas tree, playing with the gifts they received.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9eHhRmAlBuUeRnZ5kofKMhjpMD3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:496535'),
  ('603148828335233028', 'Christmas Dinner', 2016, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Marco Ponti, Roberto Forza', 'Piero Bodrato, Marco Ponti, Luca Bianchini', 'Riccardo Scamarcio, Laura Chiatti, Michele Placido, Maria Pia Calzone, Antonella Attili, Eugenio Franceschini, Antonio Gerardi, Veronica Pivetti', null, 'In Polignano a Mare, covered in snow, they are more nervous than usual. Hysterics, anxiousness, pregnancy tests, lost rings and stuck lifts - what else can happen?', 'In Polignano a Mare, covered in snow, they are more nervous than usual. Hysterics, anxiousness, pregnancy tests, lost rings and stuck lifts - what else can happen?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sbzJ4H1m3VKRa0oHEf18YZyoTaV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:419502'),
  ('645360316678563702', 'Christmas Do-Over', 2006, 'Comedy, Family, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Catherine Cyran, Ken Blakey, Rex Piano', 'Trevor Reed Cristow, Jacqueline David', 'Jay Mohr, Daphne Zuniga, David Millbern, Adrienne Barbeau, Tim Thomerson, Logan Grove, Ruta Lee, Steve Hart', null, 'Kevin tries to be involved with his son and ex-wife''s family for Christmas. During dinner, he thought his Christmas *day* couldn''t be more screwed; his son suddenly wishes it was Christmas every day. After that, it was a regular Groundhog''s Day. Kevin learns new dance moves and can actually sing. Don''t let the caroling fool you.', 'Kevin tries to be involved with his son and ex-wife''s family for Christmas. During dinner, he thought his Christmas *day* couldn''t be more screwed; his son suddenly wishes it was Christmas every day. After that, it was a regular Groundhog''s Day. Kevin learns new dance moves and can actually sing. Don''t let the caroling fool you.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/51DoG45RuZCiXJc49MA6QUgX1FX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26987'),
  ('542479299009182950', 'Christmas Encore', 2017, 'Romance, Drama, TV Movie', 'Bradley Walsh', 'Jennifer Notas Shapiro, Mark Amato', 'Maggie Lawson, Brennan Elliott, Art Hindle, Tracey Hoyt, Mercedes de la Zerda, Mika Amonsen, Sherry Miller, Sabryn Rock', null, 'A struggling actress is cast in her last off (off) Broadway show - a modern take on “A Christmas Carol” - before giving up her dream and moving home. Instead, she finds romance with her director and a renewed passion for her craft and the city. But when the historic theater loses its lease and the show is set to fold, she and her cast mates are need of a Christmas miracle.', 'A struggling actress is cast in her last off (off) Broadway show - a modern take on “A Christmas Carol” - before giving up her dream and moving home. Instead, she finds romance with her director and a renewed passion for her craft and the city. But when the historic theater loses its lease and the show is set to fold, she and her cast mates are need of a Christmas miracle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oNL3C9ifCxM1eTcBecQxTFxZDNg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:475833'),
  ('497006861264927329', 'Christmas Eve', 1947, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Edwin L. Marin, Joseph Depew, Gordon Avil', 'Laurence Stallings', 'George Raft, George Brent, Randolph Scott, Joan Blondell, Virginia Field, Dolores Moran, Ann Harding, Reginald Denny', 'NR', 'The greedy nephew of eccentric Matilda Reid seeks to have her judged incompetent so he can administer her wealth, but she will be saved if her three long-lost adopted sons appear for a Christmas Eve reunion. Separate stories reveal Michael as a bankrupt playboy loved by loyal Ann; Mario as a seemingly shady character tangling with a Nazi war criminal in South America; Jonathan as a hard-drinking rodeo rider intent on a flirtatious social worker. Is there hope for Matilda?', 'The greedy nephew of eccentric Matilda Reid seeks to have her judged incompetent so he can administer her wealth, but she will be saved if her three long-lost adopted sons appear for a Christmas Eve reunion. Separate stories reveal Michael as a bankrupt playboy loved by loyal Ann; Mario as a seemingly shady character tangling with a Nazi war criminal in South America; Jonathan as a hard-drinking rodeo rider intent on a flirtatious social worker. Is there hope for Matilda?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9r4ZnIxFhI2VlUI7bGU9p2b2nWY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58799'),
  ('249083536717405596', 'Christmas Eve', 2015, 'Family, Comedy, Romance', 'Mitch Davis, Ty Arnold', 'Mitch Davis, Tyler McKellar', 'Patrick Stewart, Cheryl Hines, Gary Cole, Jon Heder, James Roday Rodriguez, Max Casella, Julianna Guill, Christina Chong', 'PG', 'Hilarity, romance, and transcendence prevail after a power outage traps six different groups of New Yorkers inside elevators on Christmas Eve.', 'Hilarity, romance, and transcendence prevail after a power outage traps six different groups of New Yorkers inside elevators on Christmas Eve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vViH6PCa56kvCTm58gF45uucZWi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:340816'),
  ('7658477444828559', 'Christmas Eve in Miller''s Point', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Tyler Taormina, David Croley Broyles, Carson Lund', 'Eric Berger, Tyler Taormina', 'Matilda Fleming, Maria Dizzia, Ben Shenkman, Francesca Scorsese, Elsie Fisher, Michael Cera, Gregg Turkington, Sawyer Spielberg', 'PG-13', 'A family gathers on Christmas Eve for what could be the last holiday in their ancestral home. As the night wears on and tensions arise, one of the teenagers sneaks out with her friends to claim the wintry suburb for her own.', 'A family gathers on Christmas Eve for what could be the last holiday in their ancestral home. As the night wears on and tensions arise, one of the teenagers sneaks out with her friends to claim the wintry suburb for her own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tJ5q6TbdRtoXDqXdkbg4aGGLLkC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1073650'),
  ('120518799794298915', 'Christmas Eve on Sesame Street', 1978, 'Comedy, Family, Music, TV Movie', 'Jon Stone, Ozzie Alfonso, Dave Clark', 'Jon Stone, Joseph A. Bailey', 'Caroll Spinney, Jim Henson, Frank Oz, Jerry Nelson, Richard Hunt, Bob McGrath, Debbie Chen, Will Lee', null, 'Everyone on Sesame Street is preparing for Christmas: Bert and Ernie exchange gifts in a "The Gift of the Magi" fashion, Cookie Monster wants to get his most desired treat this year, and Big Bird worries when Oscar tells him that if Santa Claus can''t fit down the chimney on Christmas Eve, nobody would get presents. Luckily for him, Grover and Kermit the Frog (along with some interviewed kids) decide to help with his investigation, but when Big Bird decides to take matters into his own hands, all of Sesame Street is thrown into a mad dash to find him.', 'Everyone on Sesame Street is preparing for Christmas: Bert and Ernie exchange gifts in a "The Gift of the Magi" fashion, Cookie Monster wants to get his most desired treat this year, and Big Bird worries when Oscar tells him that if Santa Claus can''t fit down the chimney on Christmas Eve, nobody would get presents. Luckily for him, Grover and Kermit the Frog (along with some interviewed kids) decide to help with his investigation, but when Big Bird decides to take matters into his own hands, all of Sesame Street is thrown into a mad dash to find him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6W2DvQl7GkkWjzzXXEs6XopkpyM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:306685'),
  ('1049879997613938846', 'Christmas Every Day', 1996, 'Family, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Larry Peerce', 'Stephen Alix', 'Erik von Detten, Robert Hays, Bess Armstrong, Yvonne Zima, Robert Curtis Brown, Robin Riker, Julia Whelan, Tyler Mason Buckalew', 'G', 'Billy Jackson is not having a good Christmas. He got a basketball for Christmas and just cannot make a jump shot. His Uncle David is coming to town to open a ValueMall, which will put his Dad''s store out of business. When he tells his little sister Sarah that there is no Santa, she makes a wish that it would be Christmas every day. Billy now has to relive Christmas Day over and over again.', 'Billy Jackson is not having a good Christmas. He got a basketball for Christmas and just cannot make a jump shot. His Uncle David is coming to town to open a ValueMall, which will put his Dad''s store out of business. When he tells his little sister Sarah that there is no Santa, she makes a wish that it would be Christmas every day. Billy now has to relive Christmas Day over and over again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r5GgnXk32vmI98ho7WB9GPMzohg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61550'),
  ('739169346245037282', 'Christmas Evil', 1980, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Lewis Jackson, Ricardo Aronovich', 'Lewis Jackson', 'Brandon Maggart, Jeffrey DeMunn, Dianne Hull, Andy Fenwick, Brian Neville, Joe Jamrog, Wally Moran, Gus Salud', 'R', 'Garbed in his red suit, Harry, a toy factory worker, decides that the only thing he can do to save the spirit of Christmas is to become Santa Claus himself and make all of the naughty townspeople pay... in blood!', 'Garbed in his red suit, Harry, a toy factory worker, decides that the only thing he can do to save the spirit of Christmas is to become Santa Claus himself and make all of the naughty townspeople pay... in blood!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c3R6U8sOGoyY45Ovqho0DkqB5hK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27230'),
  ('1042428234476742424', 'Christmas Full of Grace', 2022, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Pedro Antônio, Rodrigo Graciosa, Diana Galantini', 'Carolina Garcia', 'Vera Fischer, Gessica Kayane, Sergio Malheiros, Monique Alfradique, Heitor Martinez, Letícia Isnard, Flávia Reis, Marianna Armellini', 'R', 'After discovering a betrayal, Carlinhos takes a fun stranger to accompany him on Christmas. But Graça proves to be a madwoman capable of bringing the traditional family home down.', 'After discovering a betrayal, Carlinhos takes a fun stranger to accompany him on Christmas. But Graça proves to be a madwoman capable of bringing the traditional family home down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iHRphB4zfPTuUHVrbO2vTmCLuHO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1042984'),
  ('404191632232311868', 'Christmas Getaway', 2017, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'William McKnight, Mel Damski', null, 'Bridget Regan, Travis Van Winkle, Raven Stewart, Teryl Rothery, Sarah Smyth, Dan Payne, Alvin Sanders, Kiefer O''Reilly', 'G', 'When a reservation mix-up at a mountain resort forces a newly-single travel writer to share a cabin with a handsome widower and his precocious daughter over the holidays, their lives are transformed by the magic of Christmas and the unexpected power of love.', 'When a reservation mix-up at a mountain resort forces a newly-single travel writer to share a cabin with a handsome widower and his precocious daughter over the holidays, their lives are transformed by the magic of Christmas and the unexpected power of love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ohBJhAI7YJrlYmnr4czCvZj1FW7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:480623'),
  ('507474093290170094', 'Christmas Holiday', 1944, 'Crime, Drama', 'Robert Siodmak, Bernard B. Brown, Hans J. Salter', 'Herman J. Mankiewicz', 'Deanna Durbin, Gene Kelly, Richard Whorf, Dean Harens, Gladys George, Gale Sondergaard, David Bruce, Eddie Acuff', 'NR', 'A young femme fatale realizes that the man she married is an incorrigible wastrel.', 'A young femme fatale realizes that the man she married is an incorrigible wastrel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nTrumh0ynfCuB8AT0DxRAgtXvOI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26530'),
  ('153946570297405590', 'Christmas Holidays', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Moraldo Rossi, Rinaldo Ricci, Claudio Cirillo', 'Enrico Vanzina, Carlo Vanzina', 'Jerry Calà, Christian De Sica, Claudio Amendola, Antonella Interlenghi, Karina Huff, Riccardo Garrone, Rossella Como, Roberta Lerici', null, 'Christmas holidays on the snow of Cortina D''Ampezzo. Mario, a guy from Rome who has not much money, falls in love with the American Samantha, the girlfriend of hypochondriac Roberto. Billo, a singer and a playboy, meets Ivana: she''s married with a rich man, Donatone, but in the past she had a flirt with Billo, who wants to reignite the flame.', 'Christmas holidays on the snow of Cortina D''Ampezzo. Mario, a guy from Rome who has not much money, falls in love with the American Samantha, the girlfriend of hypochondriac Roberto. Billo, a singer and a playboy, meets Ivana: she''s married with a rich man, Donatone, but in the past she had a flirt with Billo, who wants to reignite the flame.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gk7NPFDuWt3aiXBqu7CdAibSHxX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42442'),
  ('418379326781517158', 'Christmas Icetastrophe', 2014, 'Drama, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Jonathan Winfrey, Garett Griffin, Robert Crippen', 'David Sanderson', 'Victor Webster, Jennifer Spence, Richard Harmon, Tiera Skovbye, Ben Cotton, Mike Dopud, Johannah Newmarch, Boti Bliss', 'PG', 'This Christmas, a super frozen object is going to slam into the Earth. In the middle of a small town, and very quickly, dreams of a "White Christmas" will turn into a FROZEN NIGHTMARE.', 'This Christmas, a super frozen object is going to slam into the Earth. In the middle of a small town, and very quickly, dreams of a "White Christmas" will turn into a FROZEN NIGHTMARE.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vVmKjZLrLKBiAklTbkVzVbPc4SW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:301816'),
  ('1124524001717537967', 'Christmas in Angel Falls', 2017, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Bradley Walsh', null, 'Rachel Boston, Paul Greene, Beau Bridges, Allison Hossack, Bill Lake, Ehren Kassam, Andrew Moodie, Jill Frappier', 'G', 'Gabby Messinger, a Guardian Angel who has trouble following the rules and is known for meddling in the love live’s of others, is tasked by the Angel Michael to help the town of Angel Falls find its Christmas spirit again.', 'Gabby Messinger, a Guardian Angel who has trouble following the rules and is known for meddling in the love live’s of others, is tasked by the Angel Michael to help the town of Angel Falls find its Christmas spirit again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4IgTSlhqoRqAFTl7rumyQ5gy60N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:483548'),
  ('295598633407349895', 'Christmas in August', 1998, 'Drama, Romance', 'Hur Jin-ho, Kim Dong-ho, Ryu Jang-ha', 'Hur Jin-ho, Oh Seung-uk, Shin Dong-hwan', 'Han Suk-kyu, Shim Eun-ha, Shin Gu, Oh Ji-hye, Lee Han-wi, Jeon Mi-seon, Kim Ae-ra, Min Kyung-jin', null, 'It''s a sweltering summer, but Jung-won, a terminally ill, thirty-something photographer, is already in the winter of his life when he begins a tentative romance with a young traffic cop who doesn''t know about his condition. Is their relationship doomed before it even begins?', 'It''s a sweltering summer, but Jung-won, a terminally ill, thirty-something photographer, is already in the winter of his life when he begins a tentative romance with a young traffic cop who doesn''t know about his condition. Is their relationship doomed before it even begins?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vCRcrz5zuQ9d8lgM3oEmgIqEe6b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26935'),
  ('501792077975816776', 'Christmas in Boston', 2005, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Russ Goozee, Neill Fearnley, Julian Grant', 'Stephanie T. Baxendale', 'Marla Sokoloff, Patrick J. Adams, Lindy Booth, Jonathan Cherry, Shawn Lawrence, Art Hindle', null, 'Gina and Seth have been pen pals for 13 years and now will have the chance to meet. Both used their best friends pictures to send to each other and now will let their friends meet. True love is found in the end for all.', 'Gina and Seth have been pen pals for 13 years and now will have the chance to meet. Both used their best friends pictures to send to each other and now will let their friends meet. True love is found in the end for all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u5NBMvek4BafCZySKPwWvSxBkuC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7088'),
  ('486668323204684891', 'Christmas in Connecticut', 1945, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Peter Godfrey, Carl E. Guthrie, Leo F. Forbstein', 'Adele Comandini, Lionel Houser', 'Barbara Stanwyck, Dennis Morgan, Sydney Greenstreet, Reginald Gardiner, S.Z. Sakall, Robert Shayne, Una O''Connor, Frank Jenks', 'NR', 'While recovering in a hospital, war hero Jefferson Jones grows familiar with the "Diary of a Housewife" column written by Elizabeth Lane. Jeff''s nurse arranges with Elizabeth''s publisher, Alexander Yardley, for Jeff to spend the holiday at Elizabeth''s bucolic Connecticut farm with her husband and child. But the column is a sham, so Elizabeth and her editor, Dudley Beecham, in fear of losing their jobs, hasten to set up the single, childless and entirely nondomestic Elizabeth on a country farm.', 'While recovering in a hospital, war hero Jefferson Jones grows familiar with the "Diary of a Housewife" column written by Elizabeth Lane. Jeff''s nurse arranges with Elizabeth''s publisher, Alexander Yardley, for Jeff to spend the holiday at Elizabeth''s bucolic Connecticut farm with her husband and child. But the column is a sham, so Elizabeth and her editor, Dudley Beecham, in fear of losing their jobs, hasten to set up the single, childless and entirely nondomestic Elizabeth on a country farm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oH1hM9wOZZflPZ5smKqWXvLXcyX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13669'),
  ('411674806893465028', 'Christmas in Connecticut', 1992, 'Comedy, Romance, TV Movie', 'Arnold Schwarzenegger, Chuck Colwell', null, 'Dyan Cannon, Kris Kristofferson, Tony Curtis, Richard Roundtree, Kelly Cinnante, Gene Lythgow, Sonny Carl Davis, Jimmy Workman', null, 'Elizabeth is the star of a successful cooking show and author of several cookbooks. But when her manager, Alexander sees forest ranger Jefferson, who lost his cabin in a fire, comment on TV about wishing he could get a home-cooked Christmas dinner, he arranges for a special live show on Christmas, for Elizabeth to cook him Christmas Dinner. Only Elizabeth can''t cook, and trying to keep Jefferson and the viewing public from finding out on a live show may be a little difficult.', 'Elizabeth is the star of a successful cooking show and author of several cookbooks. But when her manager, Alexander sees forest ranger Jefferson, who lost his cabin in a fire, comment on TV about wishing he could get a home-cooked Christmas dinner, he arranges for a special live show on Christmas, for Elizabeth to cook him Christmas Dinner. Only Elizabeth can''t cook, and trying to keep Jefferson and the viewing public from finding out on a live show may be a little difficult.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Alwn4aKfVwqHPNYcUMNuuvZSlE6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55596'),
  ('232539311801813478', 'Christmas in Conway', 2013, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'James Chressanthis, John Kent Harrison', 'Luis Ugaz, Stephen P. Lindsey', 'Andy Garcia, Mary-Louise Parker, Mandy Moore, Riley Smith, Cheri Oteri, Mark Jeffrey Miller, Ric Reitz, Greg Perrow', null, 'Duncan Mayor decides the perfect Christmas present for his terminally ill wife, Suzy, is a ride on a real Ferris wheel, set up in their very own back yard. As a young man, it was the perfect place for a wedding proposal. Now, years later, in order to relive the experience with his wife, Duncan will go to any length to make their fantasy become a reality.', 'Duncan Mayor decides the perfect Christmas present for his terminally ill wife, Suzy, is a ride on a real Ferris wheel, set up in their very own back yard. As a young man, it was the perfect place for a wedding proposal. Now, years later, in order to relive the experience with his wife, Duncan will go to any length to make their fantasy become a reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wF0jcqPfIz0Se5LNFVpu7dkb6Go.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:240820'),
  ('382193643367115549', 'Christmas in Evergreen', 2017, 'Romance, TV Movie, Drama', 'Alex Zamm, Randal Platt', 'Rick Garman', 'Ashley Williams, Teddy Sears, Holly Robinson Peete, Barbara Niven, Jaeda Lily Miller, Marcus Rosner, Keith Martin Gordey, Malcolm Stewart', 'G', 'Allie, a veterinarian in Evergreen, reluctantly will spend Christmas with her long-distance boyfriend. Bound for the airport, she has engine trouble, and Ryan, headed to Florida with his daughter Zoe, stops to help. Sure they won’t meet again, they ignore their attraction, and part ways. At the diner, Zoe wishes on a snow globe, and a storm seems to grant her wish.', 'Allie, a veterinarian in Evergreen, reluctantly will spend Christmas with her long-distance boyfriend. Bound for the airport, she has engine trouble, and Ryan, headed to Florida with his daughter Zoe, stops to help. Sure they won’t meet again, they ignore their attraction, and part ways. At the diner, Zoe wishes on a snow globe, and a storm seems to grant her wish.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eLeWrVjdFmgwUtPBGHmv2w8YfjO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:474977'),
  ('181111978072758982', 'Christmas in Evergreen: Bells Are Ringing', 2020, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Linda-Lisa Hayter', 'Shari Sharpe, Zac Hug', 'Holly Robinson Peete, Colin Lawrence, Rukiya Bernard, Antonio Cayonne, Barbara Niven, Ashley Williams, Chris Cope, Marci T. House', null, 'As Michelle’s wedding approaches, Hannah steps up to help finish the launch of the new Evergreen museum while questioning her relationship and future with Elliot.', 'As Michelle’s wedding approaches, Hannah steps up to help finish the launch of the new Evergreen museum while questioning her relationship and future with Elliot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/myeWipLioMj5vtflpg5IEiBsaPx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:746047'),
  ('758365339902226237', 'Christmas in Evergreen: Letters to Santa', 2018, 'Family, Romance, TV Movie', 'Sean McNamara, Tyler Walzak', null, 'Jill Wagner, Mark Deklin, Holly Robinson Peete, Barbara Niven, Andrew Francis, Ashley Williams, Michelle Martin, Daryl Shuttleworth', 'G', 'Lisa''s trip home to Evergreen for the holidays finds her shepherding an effort to save the town''s beloved general store, fulfilling the wishes of a Christmas past and finding a romance full of Christmas magic.', 'Lisa''s trip home to Evergreen for the holidays finds her shepherding an effort to save the town''s beloved general store, fulfilling the wishes of a Christmas past and finding a romance full of Christmas magic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c7sbYi97TdjSPwUboF802yWidPP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:550025'),
  ('696914523855423994', 'Christmas In Evergreen: Tidings of Joy', 2019, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Sean McNamara, Adam Sliwinski', 'Zac Hug', 'Paul Greene, Maggie Lawson, Barbara Niven, Holly Robinson Peete, Rukiya Bernard, Colin Lawrence, Ashley Williams, Jill Wagner', null, 'A skeptical writer shows up in Evergreen to get the scoop on the town''s famed passion for Christmas during a search for a long-lost time capsule.', 'A skeptical writer shows up in Evergreen to get the scoop on the town''s famed passion for Christmas during a search for a long-lost time capsule.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ulLuMX7E9ddrTeLga0SiohrFGwT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:630921'),
  ('102853862120518369', 'Christmas in Homestead', 2016, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Steven R. Monroe, Brian O''Sullivan', null, 'Taylor Cole, Michael Rady, Michael Nardelli, Brooklyn Rae Silzer, Jeff Branson, Katrina Norman, Brandhyze Stanley, Sylvia Jefferies', null, 'Jessica is one of the most famous actresses in the world, leading a glamorous – if tabloid worthy – life. But all that is thrown for a loop when she goes on location to shoot a holiday themed film in the Christmas-obsessed town of Homestead, Iowa. While a romance brews between her and Matt, a local inn keeper who is a single dad, she also gets a taste of small-town life and rediscovers the true meaning of Christmas.', 'Jessica is one of the most famous actresses in the world, leading a glamorous – if tabloid worthy – life. But all that is thrown for a loop when she goes on location to shoot a holiday themed film in the Christmas-obsessed town of Homestead, Iowa. While a romance brews between her and Matt, a local inn keeper who is a single dad, she also gets a taste of small-town life and rediscovers the true meaning of Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f8kzIaRuMHrDuFzjbpIgPhbecNi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:421620'),
  ('377826612169937473', 'Christmas in July', 1940, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Preston Sturges, Victor Milner, Barton Adams', 'Preston Sturges', 'Dick Powell, Ellen Drew, Raymond Walburn, Alexander Carr, William Demarest, Ernest Truex, Franklin Pangborn, Rod Cameron', 'NR', 'An office clerk loves entering contests in the hopes of someday winning a fortune and marrying the girl he loves. His latest attempt is the Maxford House Coffee Slogan Contest. As a joke, some of his co-workers put together a fake telegram which says that he won the $25,000 grand prize.', 'An office clerk loves entering contests in the hopes of someday winning a fortune and marrying the girl he loves. His latest attempt is the Maxford House Coffee Slogan Contest. As a joke, some of his co-workers put together a fake telegram which says that he won the $25,000 grand prize.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kbu3N6dIRO6UjKFrPJsx0KQU9QR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34778'),
  ('50213654256767300', 'Christmas in Love', 2004, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Gianlorenzo Battaglia, Neri Parenti', 'Fausto Brizzi, Neri Parenti, Marco Martani', 'Christian De Sica, Massimo Boldi, Danny DeVito, Anna Maria Barbera, Ronn Moss, Sabrina Ferilli, Tosca D''Aquino, Cristiana Capotondi', null, 'A middle-aged man’s relationship with a young model is questioned by his daughter, who’s dating an older man herself.', 'A middle-aged man’s relationship with a young model is questioned by his daughter, who’s dating an older man herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e19QwaABdZb1Gknw1EiqJ7P6b8p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43561'),
  ('914047857327736330', 'Christmas in Love', 2018, 'TV Movie, Romance, Family, Comedy', 'Peter Benison, Don McBrearty', 'Stephen A. Stewart, Bob Sáenz', 'Brooke D''Orsay, Daniel Lissing, Jamie Spilchuk, Chris Renaud, Mary-Margaret Humes, Carolina Bartczak, Marty Moreau, David Keeley', null, 'Ellie Hartman is an aspiring crafter working in her small town’s bakery making famous Christmas Kringles. When the new, big-city CEO Nick Carlingson visits the bakery, he arrives filled with modernization ideas destined to lay off many employees.', 'Ellie Hartman is an aspiring crafter working in her small town’s bakery making famous Christmas Kringles. When the new, big-city CEO Nick Carlingson visits the bakery, he arrives filled with modernization ideas destined to lay off many employees.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iDK96L8yN092QuRbfVqFUmT2FnS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:550020'),
  ('550390480222974648', 'Christmas in Miami', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Neri Parenti, Tani Canevari', 'Marco Martani, Fausto Brizzi, Neri Parenti', 'Massimo Boldi, Christian De Sica, Massimo Ghini, Francesco Mandelli, Paolo Ruffini, Giuseppe Sanfelice, Vanessa Hessler, Raffaella Bergé', null, 'In Christmastime Miami, heartbroken divorcée Giorgio invites himself to stay at his best friend Mario''s — unaware that the latter is having an affair with his ex-wife — and ends up pursued by Mario''s barely-of-age daughter; nosy and out-of-touch Ranuccio crashes his son''s sex-themed holidays before ending up in a series of mishaps with Giorgio.', 'In Christmastime Miami, heartbroken divorcée Giorgio invites himself to stay at his best friend Mario''s — unaware that the latter is having an affair with his ex-wife — and ends up pursued by Mario''s barely-of-age daughter; nosy and out-of-touch Ranuccio crashes his son''s sex-themed holidays before ending up in a series of mishaps with Giorgio.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c2mo0g4w7QMMyp7BJv4OFlHQbo2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42434'),
  ('327057160164268074', 'Christmas in My Heart', 2021, 'TV Movie, Drama, Romance, Music', 'Pat Kiely, Serge Desrosiers', 'Liz Storm, Jamie Pachino, Shari Sharpe', 'Heather Hemmens, Luke Macfarlane, Maria Nash, Larry Day, Kathleen Fee, Andrew Shaver, Melissa Paulson, Conni Miu', 'G', 'With Christmas fast approaching, concert violinist Beth returns to her hometown after the recent death of her mother, the elementary school’s beloved music department head.', 'With Christmas fast approaching, concert violinist Beth returns to her hometown after the recent death of her mother, the elementary school’s beloved music department head.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tLmDLwzBCJu1oID4EkiORECVrZb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:874152'),
  ('542830337600155386', 'Christmas in Notting Hill', 2023, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Peter Robertson, Nick McCarthy, Ali Liebert', 'Alex Yonks', 'Sarah Ramos, William Moseley, Killian Donnelly, Joelle Rae, Michael James Ford, Conor Mullen, Deborah Wiseman, Anne Kent', 'G', 'Football star, Graham Savoy, has always been too busy for love, but when he comes home to Notting Hill for Christmas, he changes his mind after meeting the one person who has no idea who he is.', 'Football star, Graham Savoy, has always been too busy for love, but when he comes home to Notting Hill for Christmas, he changes his mind after meeting the one person who has no idea who he is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qZ4DpLKt1uVpjwbApyuJIkD1OaZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1142710'),
  ('1064229749193491825', 'Christmas in Paradise', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Philippe Martinez', 'Philippe Martinez, Megan Brown', 'Kelsey Grammer, Elizabeth Hurley, Billy Ray Cyrus, Nathalie Cox, Naomi Frederick, Ray Fearon, Victoria Ekanoye, Rafael Martinez', 'PG', 'Joanna’s plans for a quiet, cozy holiday season are shattered when her sisters call with the news that their dad has been dumped by his fiancée and has disappeared to Nevis, a tiny Caribbean island, and is not responding to any calls. The sisters decide to go to the island to save their father and bring him home for Christmas. Can the newly reconnected Christmas family survive a crazy Christmas?', 'Joanna’s plans for a quiet, cozy holiday season are shattered when her sisters call with the news that their dad has been dumped by his fiancée and has disappeared to Nevis, a tiny Caribbean island, and is not responding to any calls. The sisters decide to go to the island to save their father and bring him home for Christmas. Can the newly reconnected Christmas family survive a crazy Christmas?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6WKIDanEhGkaEmoEoxntk1YBcqj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1037391'),
  ('227416411293033630', 'Christmas in Rome', 2019, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Viorel Sergovici, Ernie Barbarash', null, 'Lacey Chabert, Sam Page, Franco Nero, Holly Hayes, Bryan Bounds, Fernanda Diniz, Petar Cvirn, Natasha Estelle', 'G', 'An independent-minded American tour guide is fired from her job in Rome just before Christmas. She crosses paths with an American executive named Oliver, who wants to buy a high-end Italian ceramics company. Oliver hires Angela to be his tour guide around the Eternal City, as the owner of the ceramics company won’t sell it to him until he learns “the heart and soul of Rome.” But is there another heart and soul that he may win?', 'An independent-minded American tour guide is fired from her job in Rome just before Christmas. She crosses paths with an American executive named Oliver, who wants to buy a high-end Italian ceramics company. Oliver hires Angela to be his tour guide around the Eternal City, as the owner of the ceramics company won’t sell it to him until he learns “the heart and soul of Rome.” But is there another heart and soul that he may win?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q5QaNyeS5TA7F0v4oTv652XGUUc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:626315'),
  ('16057692867548276', 'Christmas in Scotland', 2023, 'TV Movie, Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'David Lumsden, Graham Pritz-Bennett', 'Steve Turner', 'Jill Winternitz, Dom Watters, Scott Mooney, Adam Bond', 'NR', 'On vacation in Scotland, a New York installation designer finds herself tasked with helping a small, rural community create a festive light display and compete in a ‘Best Christmas Village’ festival, despite the interventions of a wealthy, influential heir who sees Christmas as an inconvenience. Forced to work together, the decorator and the heir unite to bring seasonal magic to the entire community, making both realize they wish to spend next and every Christmas together.', 'On vacation in Scotland, a New York installation designer finds herself tasked with helping a small, rural community create a festive light display and compete in a ‘Best Christmas Village’ festival, despite the interventions of a wealthy, influential heir who sees Christmas as an inconvenience. Forced to work together, the decorator and the heir unite to bring seasonal magic to the entire community, making both realize they wish to spend next and every Christmas together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ofEpMQIIPvl3LK5YzG3vmVjxabJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1152738'),
  ('333302848509506585', 'Christmas in Tahoe', 2021, 'TV Movie, Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Rob Lieberman, Jesse D.E. Young', null, 'Laura Osnes, Kyle Selig, Pat Monahan, George López, Alex Gullason, Rebecca Staab, Tom Butler, Lynda Boyd', 'G', 'To save her family hotel''s Christmas show, talent booker Claire must ask for help from her ex-boyfriend Ryan, the lead guitarist of a now-famous band that fired her as their manager years ago.', 'To save her family hotel''s Christmas show, talent booker Claire must ask for help from her ex-boyfriend Ryan, the lead guitarist of a now-famous band that fired her as their manager years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oTqpT4yqo2uXr7CSYDWHTiIOe6c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:874226'),
  ('44030267967163642', 'Christmas in the Air', 2017, 'TV Movie, Romance, Drama', 'Martin Wood, Michael Balfry', 'Janna King', 'Catherine Bell, Eric Close, Ken Tremblett, Malcolm Stewart, Emily Holmes, Trinity Likins, Jesse Filkow, David Stuart', 'G', 'Lydia, a successful professional organizer, is constantly trying to grow her business, but even her ambition takes a back seat to love when she meets Robert, a frazzled widower with two young children. A toy inventor, Robert is asked to present his new Christmas toy line to a superstore. His challenge is he only has 12 days to get his life and his business in order. Talk about a Christmas rush! Lydia shows Robert that this task goes way deeper than messy junk drawers and encompasses every aspect of his life. While she’s intent on helping him straighten out details he had long ignored, Robert teaches the buttoned-up Lydia that messiness can be a delightful part of life.', 'Lydia, a successful professional organizer, is constantly trying to grow her business, but even her ambition takes a back seat to love when she meets Robert, a frazzled widower with two young children. A toy inventor, Robert is asked to present his new Christmas toy line to a superstore. His challenge is he only has 12 days to get his life and his business in order. Talk about a Christmas rush! Lydia shows Robert that this task goes way deeper than messy junk drawers and encompasses every aspect of his life. While she’s intent on helping him straighten out details he had long ignored, Robert teaches the buttoned-up Lydia that messiness can be a delightful part of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fq4oaBOE9UNUfkuRJ2lmlLLRE7H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:474981'),
  ('484889491375857080', 'Christmas in the Caribbean', 2001, 'Animation', 'Walter Tournier, Santiago Epstein, Diego Velazco', 'Penélope Middleboe, Walter Tournier, Carl McMullin', null, null, 'The governor of a small Caribbean island is about to be visited by his European nephews, so he decides to treat them with the celebration a traditional Christmas day. This includes eating turkey for dinner, decorating the Christmas tree, and watching the snow fall. His subjects are willing to fullfil this task in order to improve the distribution and protection of drinking water that comes from a spring.', 'The governor of a small Caribbean island is about to be visited by his European nephews, so he decides to treat them with the celebration a traditional Christmas day. This includes eating turkey for dinner, decorating the Christmas tree, and watching the snow fall. His subjects are willing to fullfil this task in order to improve the distribution and protection of drinking water that comes from a spring.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rOig5Kl9uXggkMk80Ui4X5DFxed.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:239157'),
  ('653931537182825030', 'Christmas in the Spotlight', 2024, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Michelle Ouellet, Jeff Maher', 'Eirene Donohue', 'Jessica Lord, Laith Wallschleger, Jeannie Mai, Haley Kalil, Dennis Andres, Madeleine Cox, Carlisle J. Williams, David Pinard', null, 'A pop star named Bowyn hasn’t found Mr. Right, until she meets Drew, a professional football player, backstage at one of her shows. When Drew publicly declares he has a crush on Bowyn, they decide to give dating a shot. Their feelings grow stronger, but can it last in the limelight?', 'A pop star named Bowyn hasn’t found Mr. Right, until she meets Drew, a professional football player, backstage at one of her shows. When Drew publicly declares he has a crush on Bowyn, they decide to give dating a shot. Their feelings grow stronger, but can it last in the limelight?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2gGLFRAPEmN64uAdOudS61ddwcY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1372028'),
  ('363350157608643799', 'Christmas in Vienna', 2020, 'Romance, Drama, TV Movie', 'Maclain Nelson, Kristoffer Carrillo', 'Joie Botkin', 'Sarah Drew, Brennan Elliott, Alina Fritsch, Stefan Gorski, Oskar Ricketts, Allegra Tinnefeld, Abigail Vollnhofer, Tina von Carlowitz', null, 'Jess, a concert violinist whose heart just isn’t in it anymore, goes to Vienna for a performance. While there, she finds the inspiration she has been missing, and a new love.', 'Jess, a concert violinist whose heart just isn’t in it anymore, goes to Vienna for a performance. While there, she finds the inspiration she has been missing, and a new love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cRKI2spqkQ90X67IVW9SpoU8vqw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:726523'),
  ('511018698495287224', 'Christmas in Wonderland', 2007, 'Comedy', 'James Orr, Duane ''DC'' Manwiller', 'Wanda Birdsong Shope, James Orr, Jim Cruickshank', 'Patrick Swayze, Matthew Knight, Amy Schlagel, Tim Curry, Carmen Electra, Chris Kattan, Preston Lacy, Cameron Bright', 'PG', 'Three kids and their Dad move from L.A to Edmonton. When they go shopping at West Edmonton Mall they find counterfeit cash. They inadvertently help catch the crooks, and later make a discovery about Santa', 'Three kids and their Dad move from L.A to Edmonton. When they go shopping at West Edmonton Mall they find counterfeit cash. They inadvertently help catch the crooks, and later make a discovery about Santa', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vcbJSQapwpZ4HQAvGTMtF2C6O6E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14094'),
  ('524471632335626506', 'Christmas Incorporated', 2015, 'TV Movie, Drama', 'Jonathan Wright, Nelson Rogers, Ron Leach', 'Brook Durham', 'Shenae Grimes-Beech, Steve Lund, Ron Lea, Jane Moffat, Miranda Millar, Hannah Spear, Penny Eizenga, Sara Botsford', null, 'Sometimes, life just seems to hand you exactly what you need – particularly at Christmastime. Riley is scraping bottom when she miraculously lands a job with a wealthy New York City entrepreneur. He’s a bad-boy socialite type who is poised to play Scrooge by closing one of his factories just before Christmas, which would devastate an entire town. It’s left to Riley to talk him out of it and turn him into a man of virtue rather than shame.', 'Sometimes, life just seems to hand you exactly what you need – particularly at Christmastime. Riley is scraping bottom when she miraculously lands a job with a wealthy New York City entrepreneur. He’s a bad-boy socialite type who is poised to play Scrooge by closing one of his factories just before Christmas, which would devastate an entire town. It’s left to Riley to talk him out of it and turn him into a man of virtue rather than shame.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4niQ2AEHm0fRSSKALjvWdNkwOGA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:363480'),
  ('1026327280663048176', 'Christmas Inheritance', 2017, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Peter Benison, Ernie Barbarash', 'Dinah Eng', 'Eliza Taylor, Andie MacDowell, Jake Lacy, Ben Rosenbaum, Neil Crone, Michael Xavier, Lori Hallier, Anthony Sherwood', null, 'To inherit her father''s company, socialite Ellen must first visit his small hometown, where she learns the value of hard work and helping others.', 'To inherit her father''s company, socialite Ellen must first visit his small hometown, where she learns the value of hard work and helping others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sqdbF40nBzS2IZVAGPxJT7loxoM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:449755'),
  ('619070923730740265', 'Christmas Inventory', 2000, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Miguel Gomes, Rui Poças, Luís Botelho', 'Miguel Gomes', 'Alberto Seixas Santos, Marta Morais Tavares, Manuel Mozos, João Nicolau, Mariana Ricardo', null, 'A family gathers to celebrate Christmas.', 'A family gathers to celebrate Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/141nmIKtP52riSa0sOqjHL4iDuj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130187'),
  ('136192088949580628', 'Christmas Is Canceled', 2021, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Prarthana Mohan, Robert Patrick Stern', 'Sara Endsley', 'Hayley Orrantia, Dermot Mulroney, Janel Parrish, Michael Naizu, Mirelly Taylor, Emilie Modaff, Caito Aase', 'R', 'A father begins dating his 29-year-old daughter Emma''s high school frenemy soon after his wife passes away. His daughter embarks on a mission to break up the happy couple.', 'A father begins dating his 29-year-old daughter Emma''s high school frenemy soon after his wife passes away. His daughter embarks on a mission to break up the happy couple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Vivy2G7Kx8duhN35eUG74B8JXK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:899382'),
  ('652108935308834234', 'Christmas Is Cancelled', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Javier Colinas', 'Adriana Pelusi, Itzel Lara, El Huevo Charlie Barrientos', 'Gala Montes, Michel Duval, Leticia Huijara, Anette Michel, Alejandro Camacho, Axel Chunga Trujillo, Giovanna Reynaud, Kenneth Lavíll', null, 'Newlyweds Lidia and Manuel face their biggest challenge yet when they bring their wildly different families together for Christmas. As clashing personalities spark both hilarity and tension, their relationship hangs in the balance amidst the holiday chaos.', 'Newlyweds Lidia and Manuel face their biggest challenge yet when they bring their wildly different families together for Christmas. As clashing personalities spark both hilarity and tension, their relationship hangs in the balance amidst the holiday chaos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cTQIU3kJBPI5BG5WGVnUuU5yAnB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1391524'),
  ('1027167920150070528', 'Christmas Island', 2023, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'David Weaver, Ryan McMaster, Kat Shubaly', 'Samantha Herman', 'Rachel Skarsten, Andrew W. Walker, Jefferson Brown, Kate Drummond, Peter MacNeill, Lauren Hammersley, Britt Loder, Lincoln MacNeil', 'G', 'When a snowstorm diverts Kate''s first private flight bound for Switzerland, to Christmas Island in Nova Scotia, she must team up with an air traffic controller to secure her dream job as the family''s pilot.', 'When a snowstorm diverts Kate''s first private flight bound for Switzerland, to Christmas Island in Nova Scotia, she must team up with an air traffic controller to secure her dream job as the family''s pilot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aw3ApBYlH0KIJ377vcUiqbPMth5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1180841'),
  ('517630060060268091', 'Christmas Joy', 2018, 'Family, TV Movie, Romance', 'Toby Gorman, Monika Mitchell', null, 'Danielle Panabaker, Matt Long, Lucia Walters, Taylor Hastings, Beverley Elliott, Shannon Chan-Kent, Gabrielle Rose, Susan Hogan', null, 'Joy Holbrook, is a corporate market researcher, gunning for a promotion within her firm. Just as her company''s CEO is taking notice, Joy finds out her Aunt Ruby has broken her ankle and will be undergoing surgery. Despite the less than opportune timing, Joy makes her way back home to Crystal Falls, NC to be with her Aunt. Stars seem to be aligned as Joy sees her former crush, Ben Andrews, while at the hospital. At first, Joy is focused solely on helping her Aunt heal; even taking over her position as chair of the local Cookie Crawl competition. Eventually, she begins to let Ben in and remembers there''s no place like home for the holidays. The pair work together on the Cookie Crawl to make the event a success.', 'Joy Holbrook, is a corporate market researcher, gunning for a promotion within her firm. Just as her company''s CEO is taking notice, Joy finds out her Aunt Ruby has broken her ankle and will be undergoing surgery. Despite the less than opportune timing, Joy makes her way back home to Crystal Falls, NC to be with her Aunt. Stars seem to be aligned as Joy sees her former crush, Ben Andrews, while at the hospital. At first, Joy is focused solely on helping her Aunt heal; even taking over her position as chair of the local Cookie Crawl competition. Eventually, she begins to let Ben in and remembers there''s no place like home for the holidays. The pair work together on the Cookie Crawl to make the event a success.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nyBL0NqfIgMrtAGTp7W2ilosvpz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:535812'),
  ('732523968459985169', 'Christmas Land', 2015, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'Theo Angell, Antonio Bardales, Danielle de Arakal', 'Jay Cipriani, Daisy MacLean, Robin Archer', 'Nikki DeLoach, Luke Macfarlane, Maureen McCormick, Richard Karn, Chonda Pierce, Cynthia Gibb', 'G', 'Jules has just inherited a quaint magical Christmas-themed village and Christmas tree farm bequeathed her by her grandmother. She plans to sell it and use the profits to buy her dream home in New York City. But the longer Jules stays on the farm and the more she learns how important Christmas Land has been to so many families, the more Jules starts to question her motives to sell.', 'Jules has just inherited a quaint magical Christmas-themed village and Christmas tree farm bequeathed her by her grandmother. She plans to sell it and use the profits to buy her dream home in New York City. But the longer Jules stays on the farm and the more she learns how important Christmas Land has been to so many families, the more Jules starts to question her motives to sell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mSvM4uXrUTRdKg7wYLyg6JTd2Fk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369054'),
  ('405557398339875088', 'Christmas List', 2016, 'Comedy, Romance, TV Movie', 'Paul A. Kaufman, Kevin Leslie', 'Duane Poole', 'Alicia Witt, Gabriel Hogan, Peter Benson, Chance Hurstfield, Wanda Cannon, Christine Chatelain, Susan Hogan, Doug Abrahams', null, 'Isobel Gray plans a storybook Christmas with her boyfriend, including a snow-covered cottage in the Northwest, and a carefully composed bucket list of classic holiday traditions. But when the boyfriend goes AWOL, the list proves challenging and a tempting new romance turns her life upside down. Will Isobel have a White Christmas ending under the mistletoe?', 'Isobel Gray plans a storybook Christmas with her boyfriend, including a snow-covered cottage in the Northwest, and a carefully composed bucket list of classic holiday traditions. But when the boyfriend goes AWOL, the list proves challenging and a tempting new romance turns her life upside down. Will Isobel have a White Christmas ending under the mistletoe?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bKJZfzE86oW2ELAec7qR19i8aES.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:416251'),
  ('155002334548638708', 'Christmas Lodge', 2011, 'Drama, Family, TV Movie, Romance, Fantasy', 'Terry Ingram', 'Renee de Roche, Lawrence S. Richardson Jr', 'Erin Karpluk, Michael Shanks, Rukiya Bernard, Rebecca Toolan, John Innes, Victoria Banks, Michael Kopsa, Michelle Creber', 'G', 'Mary Tobin has wonderful memories of family gatherings at the Christmas Lodge. When she arrives for a weekend vacation, she quickly realizes that the lodge that she loves has fallen into serious disrepair. With a lack of funds and a looming deadline, she not only restores the Christmas lodge''s charm but finds love along the way.', 'Mary Tobin has wonderful memories of family gatherings at the Christmas Lodge. When she arrives for a weekend vacation, she quickly realizes that the lodge that she loves has fallen into serious disrepair. With a lack of funds and a looming deadline, she not only restores the Christmas lodge''s charm but finds love along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zHb0FI0RrAkAUldcjIyHmVlHjyz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79987'),
  ('963113916728259319', 'Christmas Made to Order', 2018, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'Theo Angell, Buzz Hughes, Tony Aronovitz', 'Matt Marx, Anna White', 'Alexa PenaVega, Jonathan Bennett, Jo Marie Payton, Jacob Young, Chelsea Gilson, Andrew Roach, Nathan Nonhof, Bailee Michelle Johnson', null, 'When architect and Christmas amateur Steven finds himself hosting his family for Christmas, he recruits holiday coordinator Gretchen to bring holiday joy to his home. Gretchen’s expert Christmas spirit brings Steven’s family together, but neither expected it to bring them closer to each other. After a great opportunity presents itself to Gretchen, she and Steven must decide what’s really important in life.', 'When architect and Christmas amateur Steven finds himself hosting his family for Christmas, he recruits holiday coordinator Gretchen to bring holiday joy to his home. Gretchen’s expert Christmas spirit brings Steven’s family together, but neither expected it to bring them closer to each other. After a great opportunity presents itself to Gretchen, she and Steven must decide what’s really important in life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wNs1pd1EBQKxJqnQaIkbpCw5gd8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:550035'),
  ('406243949522034137', 'Christmas Mail', 2010, 'Comedy, Family, TV Movie', 'John Murlowski, Justin Duval', 'Steven Palmer Peterson', 'Ashley Scott, A.J. Buckley, Lochlyn Munro, Rolonda Watts, Vanessa Evigan, Piper Mackenzie Harris, Ron Roggé, Lisa Long', null, 'In this holiday romantic comedy, a mysterious woman who works at the post office answering Santa''s mail captures the heart of a disillusioned postal carrier.', 'In this holiday romantic comedy, a mysterious woman who works at the post office answering Santa''s mail captures the heart of a disillusioned postal carrier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dumR7pD3PxK200RzJNycAZlMmIC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76706'),
  ('291068601489354072', 'Christmas Next Door', 2017, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Russ Goozee, Jonathan Wright', 'Sandra Berg, Judith Berg', 'Jesse Metcalfe, Fiona Gubelmann, Brittany Bristow, Tara Yelland, Eugene Clark, Joy Tanner, Jenna Weir, Liam MacDonald', 'G', 'Eric Randall, an author of bachelor lifestyle books, is left in charge of his young niece and nephew for the holidays. Eric turns to his neighbor April, a lover of all things Christmas, for help.', 'Eric Randall, an author of bachelor lifestyle books, is left in charge of his young niece and nephew for the holidays. Eric turns to his neighbor April, a lover of all things Christmas, for help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vY8GqUw4qXds2HblGYhRu1XcAu1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:490146'),
  ('930984048953611862', 'Christmas On Call', 2024, 'TV Movie, Romance, Drama', 'Jeff Beesley, Paul Suderman, Reid A. Dunlop', null, 'Sara Canning, Ser''Darius Blain, Tamara Almeida, Paul Essiembre, Monique Marcker, Erik Athavale, Reena Jolly, John B. Lowe', null, 'The lives of first responders in Philadelphia intersect over the holiday season while juggling work, personal lives, and their dedication to protect and serve their city.', 'The lives of first responders in Philadelphia intersect over the holiday season while juggling work, personal lives, and their dedication to protect and serve their city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rCevH4qPZasa6MHTjyYpY9EqqOS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1361154'),
  ('52664270091541233', 'Christmas on Cherry Lane', 2023, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Gail Harvey, David Bercovici-Artieda, Jennifer Nelson', 'Rick Garman', 'Catherine Bell, Jonathan Bennett, John Brotherton, Erin Cahill, James Denton, Vincent Rodriguez III, Lynda Boyd, Fred Henderson', 'PG', 'Three couples at different parts of life navigate big turning points in their lives over the holidays.', 'Three couples at different parts of life navigate big turning points in their lives over the holidays.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ggZsX97GTu47mhQ7jz04gAFcxAG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1180665'),
  ('338547571929315420', 'Christmas on Honeysuckle Lane', 2018, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'Maggie Greenwald, Valerie McCaffrey, Branden James Maxham', 'Caitlin D. Fryers', 'Alicia Witt, Colin Ferguson, Gary Lindemann, Laura Leighton, Jordan Dean, John Palladino, Jill Larson, José Ramón Rosario', 'G', 'Emma Reynolds returns to Oliver''s Well to celebrate Christmas for the last time with her siblings in the home they grew up in. After their parents recently passed, the siblings reluctantly agree to sell the family home on Honeysuckle Lane after the New Year, leaving Emma in charge of its belongings. While antiques expert Morgan Shelby appraises Emma''s mother''s collection, they find a hidden surprise in an antique desk that takes them on a journey to discover the power of love and family during the holidays.', 'Emma Reynolds returns to Oliver''s Well to celebrate Christmas for the last time with her siblings in the home they grew up in. After their parents recently passed, the siblings reluctantly agree to sell the family home on Honeysuckle Lane after the New Year, leaving Emma in charge of its belongings. While antiques expert Morgan Shelby appraises Emma''s mother''s collection, they find a hidden surprise in an antique desk that takes them on a journey to discover the power of love and family during the holidays.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yEEXq5VYP0gvaCYRiyag4BvZcTx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:553798'),
  ('294651488696775632', 'Christmas on Ice', 2020, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'James Simeone, Teddy Pryor, John Stimpson', 'John Stimpson', 'Abigail Klein, Ryan Cooper, Caroline Portu, Will Lyman, Matthew Grimaldi, Meara Mahoney Gross, Rena Maliszewski, Naheem Garcia', null, 'Courtney Bennett, a former US figure skating hopeful, runs the city’s public skating rink but when the Mayor announces its closing, Courtney is heartbroken but determined to save it. After Courtney’s attempts to warm the Mayor’s Scrooge-like heart fail, she enlists the help of Noah Tremblay, a former professional hockey player and single dad, who owns the new indoor skating center, to help her, and together they find more than just the spirit of holidays on the ice.', 'Courtney Bennett, a former US figure skating hopeful, runs the city’s public skating rink but when the Mayor announces its closing, Courtney is heartbroken but determined to save it. After Courtney’s attempts to warm the Mayor’s Scrooge-like heart fail, she enlists the help of Noah Tremblay, a former professional hockey player and single dad, who owns the new indoor skating center, to help her, and together they find more than just the spirit of holidays on the ice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/seK2Gr5SfDcvDeWV06BTOkcBMnv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:744925'),
  ('319518451898133949', 'Christmas on Mistletoe Farm', 2022, 'Family, Comedy', 'Debbie Isitt, Sean Van Hales', 'Debbie Isitt', 'Scott Garnham, Kathryn Drysdale, Scott Paige, Sydney Isitt-Ager, Ashley Jensen, Gabriel Vick, Celia Imrie, Carolyn Pickles', 'G', 'After inheriting a farm at Christmas time, a widowed father makes a bumpy adjustment to village life — while his kids hatch a plan to stay there forever.', 'After inheriting a farm at Christmas time, a widowed father makes a bumpy adjustment to village life — while his kids hatch a plan to stay there forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rGCwI76dylPViDF9VXFY0ORRhls.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1038627'),
  ('309497027034170135', 'Christmas On My Mind', 2019, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'Maclain Nelson', null, 'Ashley Greene, Andrew W. Walker, Jackée Harry, Debs Howard, Donna Benedicto, Preston Vanderslice, Desiree Zurowski, Sebastian Billingsley-Rodriguez', null, 'When Lucy wakes up with a wedding dress in hand, she believes that she is late to her wedding with her ex-boyfriend Zac. However, she has no recollection of the past 2 years, including the fact that she is engaged to another man.', 'When Lucy wakes up with a wedding dress in hand, she believes that she is late to her wedding with her ex-boyfriend Zac. However, she has no recollection of the past 2 years, including the fact that she is engaged to another man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4qF8PmqmLSrqf81Zk2GgXa9knz2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:630922'),
  ('204263474378151234', 'Christmas on the Farm', 2021, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama, TV Movie', 'Jason Hargreaves, Christopher Weekes, Bethany Stoke', 'Jennifer Notas Shapiro', 'Poppy Montgomery, Hugh Sheridan, Darren McMullen, Nicholas Brown, Jeanette Cronin, Asmara Feik, Carie Kawa, Lynn Gilmartin', null, 'Emmy''s book about living on an Australian farm is about to be a publishing sensation – and the CEO publisher and her handsome son are coming to see her country life firsthand. Only problem is, it''s not her life!', 'Emmy''s book about living on an Australian farm is about to be a publishing sensation – and the CEO publisher and her handsome son are coming to see her country life firsthand. Only problem is, it''s not her life!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c8FgK92umNLI4KU2WcXoyt8oyrH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:899235'),
  ('472171036685133928', 'Christmas on the Menu', 2020, 'Romance, TV Movie, Comedy', 'Lars Lindstrom, Jake Helgren', 'Jake Helgren', 'Kim Shaw, Clayton James, Cynthia Gibb, Jesse Kove, Michael Steger, Shanica Knowles, Katrina Norman, Stefanie Black', 'G', 'Josie Jennings a celebrated, romantic, 35-year old chef in the city heads home to spend the holidays at the quaint, magical bed and breakfast where she grew up, and where her mother Shannon has just opened a new restaurant. Famous food critic Tanner Rhodes, who has given Josie harsh reviews in the past, comes to town to review the new restaurant and Josie’s Christmas Cuisine. As the holidays unfold, Josie and Tanner get to know each other better, and a romance soon begins to blossom but will Tanner find a way to right his wrongs, write a rave review for the bistro’s delicious cuisine, and win Josie’s heart by Christmas Eve?', 'Josie Jennings a celebrated, romantic, 35-year old chef in the city heads home to spend the holidays at the quaint, magical bed and breakfast where she grew up, and where her mother Shannon has just opened a new restaurant. Famous food critic Tanner Rhodes, who has given Josie harsh reviews in the past, comes to town to review the new restaurant and Josie’s Christmas Cuisine. As the holidays unfold, Josie and Tanner get to know each other better, and a romance soon begins to blossom but will Tanner find a way to right his wrongs, write a rave review for the bistro’s delicious cuisine, and win Josie’s heart by Christmas Eve?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/998E0DvDcK3kGO3IJT4WmUVA1Rt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:744955'),
  ('157943193741601312', 'Christmas on Windmill Way', 2023, 'Romance, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Jonathan Yapp, Jillian Hickey, Don McBrearty', 'Billy Schofield', 'Christa Taylor Brown, Chad Michael Murray, Marcia Bennett, Erin Agostino, Michael Copeman, Kent Sheridan, Jon McLaren, Darrin Baker', 'G', 'Mia Meijer gets ready for the Christmas Market Dutch Bake-Off and suspects that her grandmother, Ann, will walk away with the cherished Golden Rolling Pin thanks to her Kerststol, a traditional Dutch fruited Christmas bread. But Mia''s world is rocked when she learns that Ann was having financial troubles and had to sell the land deed to the Windmill Way property in her family for generations. Making matters worse, the buyer is Mia''s former boyfriend, property developer Brady Schaltz, who must let Mia and Ann know the Meijer family-owned heritage Dutch sawmill, renowned for the past 90 years for its fine millwork and beautiful wooden furniture, will be torn down to put up a luxurious resort.', 'Mia Meijer gets ready for the Christmas Market Dutch Bake-Off and suspects that her grandmother, Ann, will walk away with the cherished Golden Rolling Pin thanks to her Kerststol, a traditional Dutch fruited Christmas bread. But Mia''s world is rocked when she learns that Ann was having financial troubles and had to sell the land deed to the Windmill Way property in her family for generations. Making matters worse, the buyer is Mia''s former boyfriend, property developer Brady Schaltz, who must let Mia and Ann know the Meijer family-owned heritage Dutch sawmill, renowned for the past 90 years for its fine millwork and beautiful wooden furniture, will be torn down to put up a luxurious resort.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bRDWHhiVLllPWBU2ADV61acyqT7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1150521'),
  ('1028753355863171444', 'Christmas Pen Pals', 2018, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Siobhan Devine, Peter Dashkewytch, David Heimbecker', 'Carley Smale', 'Sarah Drew, Niall Matter, William Vaughan, Jag Bal, Jesse Carroll, Vincent Dangerfield, Kathleen Duborg, Chelsea Gill', 'PG', 'Following an unexpected breakup weeks before Christmas, Hannah, tech wiz and creator of the dating app, Perfect One, heads home for the holidays, challenged to save her failing business by re-conceiving a new romantic dating model. Upon her return she runs into her high school boyfriend, Sam, who she has carefully avoided for years and reluctantly makes a deal with her dad to sign up for the town’s Christmas Cupid, an anonymous holiday pen pal service. As the season progresses, Hannah is smitten by each beautifully written letter she receives and starts to believe that her Christmas pen pal could be her soul mate.', 'Following an unexpected breakup weeks before Christmas, Hannah, tech wiz and creator of the dating app, Perfect One, heads home for the holidays, challenged to save her failing business by re-conceiving a new romantic dating model. Upon her return she runs into her high school boyfriend, Sam, who she has carefully avoided for years and reluctantly makes a deal with her dad to sign up for the town’s Christmas Cupid, an anonymous holiday pen pal service. As the season progresses, Hannah is smitten by each beautifully written letter she receives and starts to believe that her Christmas pen pal could be her soul mate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mInqhPVWs9l9pr4ZLxCCbKLaVmW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:550648'),
  ('294309772307042720', 'Christmas Plus One', 2022, 'TV Movie, Romance, Family, Comedy', 'Meeshelle Neal', 'Erica Deutschman', 'Emily Alatalo, Corey Sevier, Vanessa Smythe, Jane Moffat, Michael Dickson, Andrew Bushell, Danièle Henkel, Leighton Alexander Williams', null, 'When sisters Cara and Amy make a pact to find their soulmates by next Christmas, they’re not expecting to be so successful! One year later, Amy’s winter wedding approaches and Cara finally finds her own perfect man, inviting him as her plus one. But after immediately losing his number, all hope is lost. Will she find him in time to make her Christmas wish come true? Or does love have other plans for Cara?', 'When sisters Cara and Amy make a pact to find their soulmates by next Christmas, they’re not expecting to be so successful! One year later, Amy’s winter wedding approaches and Cara finally finds her own perfect man, inviting him as her plus one. But after immediately losing his number, all hope is lost. Will she find him in time to make her Christmas wish come true? Or does love have other plans for Cara?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9bVRzDR1sOBT5leH8iXtkDnGEKh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:993030'),
  ('294446082754932230', 'Christmas Present', 1986, 'Drama', 'Pupi Avati, Pasquale Rachini, Salvatore Marcarelli', 'Pupi Avati', 'Carlo Delle Piane, Diego Abatantuono, Gianni Cavina, Alessandro Haber, George Eastman, Kristina Sevieri, Gianna Piaz, Ferdinando Orlandi', null, 'On Christmas night, four estranged friends reunite to rip off a wealthy businessman in a game of poker, but old grudges get in the way.', 'On Christmas night, four estranged friends reunite to rip off a wealthy businessman in a game of poker, but old grudges get in the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i2UDcAcNK9sXxt5e0kOFTQRGt7v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61218'),
  ('307617147275050632', 'Christmas Rematch', 2004, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Pupi Avati, Pasquale Rachini, Giovanni Amadei', 'Pupi Avati, Maurizio Ridolfi', 'Diego Abatantuono, Alessandro Haber, Gianni Cavina, Carlo Delle Piane, George Eastman, Petra Khruz, Edoardo Romano, Osvaldo Ruggieri', null, '15 years after that fateful card game on Christmas Eve, Franco gets his onetime friends back at the poker table for the rematch and a long-awaited payback.', '15 years after that fateful card game on Christmas Eve, Franco gets his onetime friends back at the poker table for the rematch and a long-awaited payback.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d1K8GwzUCZ5PbWnCTtZjlENQuLd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45990'),
  ('628768205733201615', 'Christmas Sail', 2021, 'Comedy, Romance, TV Movie, Drama', 'Stacey N. Harding, Ryan McMaster', 'Robin Gadsby', 'Katee Sackhoff, Patrick Sabongui, Terry O''Quinn, Lossen Chambers, Emma Oliver, Sunita Prasad, Jason McKinnon, Tosca Baggoo', 'G', 'When Liz returns home to take care of her estranged father, she is determined to give her daughter a perfect Christmas and reconnects with her best friend.', 'When Liz returns home to take care of her estranged father, she is determined to give her daughter a perfect Christmas and reconnects with her best friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l1hEbHfFI4UCW3X5MBtommRcOcQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:874228'),
  ('551445483233049433', 'Christmas She Wrote', 2020, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'Terry Ingram', 'Andrea Canning', 'Danica McKellar, Dylan Neal, Andrew Francis, April Telek, Jim Thorburn, Keith MacKechnie, Ava Telek, Karen Kruper', null, 'When Kayleigh, a romance writer, has her column cancelled right before Christmas, she heads home to reconnect with her family. Kayleigh gets an unexpected visit from the man who cancelled her column who fights not only to bring her back to the publisher but also for her heart.', 'When Kayleigh, a romance writer, has her column cancelled right before Christmas, she heads home to reconnect with her family. Kayleigh gets an unexpected visit from the man who cancelled her column who fights not only to bring her back to the publisher but also for her heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gxzNvCMMXCyb9u6eQZ9l8sUodjU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:746048'),
  ('100453419033542672', 'Christmas Story', 2007, 'Fantasy, Family', 'Juha Wuolijoki, Jouni Mutanen, Yrjö Nieminen', 'Marko Leino', 'Hannu-Pekka Björkman, Otto Gustavsson, Jonas Rinne, Kari Väänänen, Minna Haapkylä, Mikko Leppilampi, Mikko Kouki, Laura Birn', null, 'Hundreds of years ago in Lapland, a little boy named Nikolas loses his family in an accident. The villagers decide to look after the orphaned boy together. Once a year - at Christmas - Nikolas moves to a new home. To show his gratitude, Nikolas decides to make toys for the children of the families as good-bye presents. Over the years, Nikolas''s former adoptive families become many, and soon almost every house has presents on its doorstep on Christmas morning. At thirteen, Nikolas is sent to live and work with Iisakki, a grumpy old carpenter, who forbids Nikolas to continue making presents for Christmas. Gradually, however, Nikolas wins Iisakki''s trust. Together they begin to look after the Christmas traditional that Nikolas has begun. When the aged Iisakki has to leave Nikolas and move away, the tradition of Christmas presents is once again at risk. Thankfully, Nikolas comes up with a solution that brings children joy every Christmas, even continuing to today.', 'Hundreds of years ago in Lapland, a little boy named Nikolas loses his family in an accident. The villagers decide to look after the orphaned boy together. Once a year - at Christmas - Nikolas moves to a new home. To show his gratitude, Nikolas decides to make toys for the children of the families as good-bye presents. Over the years, Nikolas''s former adoptive families become many, and soon almost every house has presents on its doorstep on Christmas morning. At thirteen, Nikolas is sent to live and work with Iisakki, a grumpy old carpenter, who forbids Nikolas to continue making presents for Christmas. Gradually, however, Nikolas wins Iisakki''s trust. Together they begin to look after the Christmas traditional that Nikolas has begun. When the aged Iisakki has to leave Nikolas and move away, the tradition of Christmas presents is once again at risk. Thankfully, Nikolas comes up with a solution that brings children joy every Christmas, even continuing to today.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9SBgvVBhaedbQods3ZcIRY2NS4X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21501'),
  ('172392595695301076', 'Christmas Thieves', 2021, 'Family, Comedy, Crime, Animation', 'Francesco Cinquemani, Patrizio Patrizi', 'Ferdinando Dell''Omo, Andrea Fazzini, Mario Bellina', 'Michael Madsen, Tom Arnold, Katie McGovern, Lorenzo McGovern Zaini, Esmeralda Spadea, Mia McGovern Zaini, Gabriele Greggio, Mark Thompson-Ashworth', null, 'After a robbery goes wrong, Frank and Vince break into a home when two kids mistake them for their babysitters. Hoping to make them fall asleep so they can make their getaway, Frank reads stories from a magic book that he stole during the robbery, taking them to the enchanted world of Arctic Friends. The two thieves have to endure the kid’s hijinks as they make various absurd attempts to escape.', 'After a robbery goes wrong, Frank and Vince break into a home when two kids mistake them for their babysitters. Hoping to make them fall asleep so they can make their getaway, Frank reads stories from a magic book that he stole during the robbery, taking them to the enchanted world of Arctic Friends. The two thieves have to endure the kid’s hijinks as they make various absurd attempts to escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/flVj08Gc2WMs7qRXnt3RGPVgQqn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:779003'),
  ('625487449458191404', 'Christmas Time Is Here', 2021, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Christie Will Wolf', 'Lisa Canfield, Joel Canfield', 'Rukiya Bernard, Dewshane Williams, Tom Pickett, Jason Cermak, Jocelyn Ott, Jill Morrison', 'G', 'Nia Moore ia a successful small-town real estate agent trying to sell a resort to her client, Julian. Much to Nia''s dismay, the only resort that Julian wants to buy belongs to her widower father, Patrick. Patrick is ready to retire, but Nia wants to keep the property and the family memories it holds.', 'Nia Moore ia a successful small-town real estate agent trying to sell a resort to her client, Julian. Much to Nia''s dismay, the only resort that Julian wants to buy belongs to her widower father, Patrick. Patrick is ready to retire, but Nia wants to keep the property and the family memories it holds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ay1EBaNZa8Bkh8uvNhfJ9rY70pk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:878417'),
  ('16887933748707357', 'Christmas Town', 2008, 'Fantasy, Drama, Action, Comedy, Thriller, Family, TV Movie', 'George Erschbamer, Cliff Hokanson', 'Ron McGee', 'Nicole De Boer, Patrick Muldoon, Garry Chalk, Gig Morton, Jocelyne Loewen, Gabe Khouth, Karin Konoval, Peter Ruginis', null, 'A week before Christmas Liza McCann visit her estranged father who strangely lives in a town decked out for the holidays and is full of Christmas spirit. Strange events immediately occur when they arrive challenging everything Liza had once believed in.', 'A week before Christmas Liza McCann visit her estranged father who strangely lives in a town decked out for the holidays and is full of Christmas spirit. Strange events immediately occur when they arrive challenging everything Liza had once believed in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/59lgpjWNZUSFTETgKYymPkROFFw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26381'),
  ('59032474858074564', 'Christmas Town', 2019, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'David Weaver, Ryan McMaster', 'Donald Martin, Wesley Bishop', 'Candace Cameron Bure, Tim Rozon, Beth Broderick, Sunita Prasad, Caitlin Stryker, Jason Cermak, Jesse Filkow, Anne Marie DeLuise', null, 'Lauren Gabriel leaves everything behind in Boston to embark on a new chapter in her life and career. But an unforeseen detour to the charming town of Grandon Falls has her discover unexpected new chapters - of the heart and of family - helping her to embrace, once again, the magic of Christmas.', 'Lauren Gabriel leaves everything behind in Boston to embark on a new chapter in her life and career. But an unforeseen detour to the charming town of Grandon Falls has her discover unexpected new chapters - of the heart and of family - helping her to embrace, once again, the magic of Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jgot7PGO2RTU2AK9n3MFMvSGCW9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:626318'),
  ('635087430319835910', 'Christmas Tree Lane', 2020, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Steven R. Monroe', 'Michael J. Murray', 'Alicia Witt, Andrew W. Walker, Shannon Engemann, Briana Price, Paul Anthony McLean, Aubrey Reynolds, Matthew Bellows, Malaika Guttoh', null, 'Music store owner Meg spearheads the community effort to save the Christmas Tree Lane shopping district from demolition. As she finds herself falling for Nate, a recent acquaintance, she’s thrown when she learns his surprising tie to the developer.', 'Music store owner Meg spearheads the community effort to save the Christmas Tree Lane shopping district from demolition. As she finds herself falling for Nate, a recent acquaintance, she’s thrown when she learns his surprising tie to the developer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vs5yakgP0dmgi5WjbyfgkegF0V6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:737791'),
  ('1073177702343328471', 'Christmas Twister', 2012, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Action, TV Movie, Thriller, Adventure', 'Roberto Schein, Peter Sullivan, Kacy Bartleigh', 'Hanz Wasserburger, Peter Sullivan', 'Casper Van Dien, Victoria Pratt, Richard Burgi, Madelyn Deutch, Steven Williams, Christina DeRosa, Haley Lu Richardson, Dmitri Schuyler-Linch', null, 'During the holiday season, Ethan, a meteorologist, and his wife Addison, a TV news reporter, must put aside their differences and band together to help save others and rescue their missing children from a massive F6 twister that has unexpectedly descended upon their small Texas town.', 'During the holiday season, Ethan, a meteorologist, and his wife Addison, a TV news reporter, must put aside their differences and band together to help save others and rescue their missing children from a massive F6 twister that has unexpectedly descended upon their small Texas town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4KZ8qCBmvJccKpjDQpSehrR3Zrz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:208466'),
  ('723370669211019656', 'Christmas U.S.A.', 1949, 'Romance', 'Gregory J. Markopoulos', 'Gregory J. Markopoulos', 'Mario Antonnini, Frederic Burae Davenport, John Markopoulos, Maria Markopoulos, Andrew Markopoulos, Elaine Markopoulos', null, 'Things spin: amusement park rides, a phonograph record. A man wakes, shaves, and takes a phone call. Another man, in a kimono, walks in the woods, stops, and opens a small decorative box on the forest floor. People at an amusement park called Little Harlem enjoy themselves. A man walks through another amusement park, called Cavalcade Worlds, as midway rides spin. At a house, an older woman cleans; a pre-teen girl sets the table; a teenaged boy showers. After he dresses, he holds a candle high above his head and walks swiftly toward a young man standing bare-chested, his arms extended. A man arrives home where the girl has set the table. The youth sleeps. Christmas?', 'Things spin: amusement park rides, a phonograph record. A man wakes, shaves, and takes a phone call. Another man, in a kimono, walks in the woods, stops, and opens a small decorative box on the forest floor. People at an amusement park called Little Harlem enjoy themselves. A man walks through another amusement park, called Cavalcade Worlds, as midway rides spin. At a house, an older woman cleans; a pre-teen girl sets the table; a teenaged boy showers. After he dresses, he holds a candle high above his head and walks swiftly toward a young man standing bare-chested, his arms extended. A man arrives home where the girl has set the table. The youth sleeps. Christmas?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/om9MufOh3ueLAI2S423SnwndJbf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189111'),
  ('510335932141508319', 'Christmas Under the Northern Lights', 2024, 'TV Movie, Romance, Comedy', 'Ernie Barbarash', 'Amyn Kaderali', 'Jill Wagner, Bruce Boxleitner, Jesse Hutch, Lauren Holly, Josh Bainbridge, Paloma Nuñez, Doug MacLeod, Allan MacAskill', null, 'Erin joins her dad Doug for a Christmas in the family’s former hometown of Aurora on a mission that is part business – selling the family home – and major bucket list item for Erin to see the Aurora Borealis light up the Northern sky. Realtor Lori and family friend and local tour guide Trevor create a Christmas inspired at every turn by faith, love, and hope, so much so that Christmas bells hung over decades in a forest grove ring an unbroken song, a harbinger of miracles to come.', 'Erin joins her dad Doug for a Christmas in the family’s former hometown of Aurora on a mission that is part business – selling the family home – and major bucket list item for Erin to see the Aurora Borealis light up the Northern sky. Realtor Lori and family friend and local tour guide Trevor create a Christmas inspired at every turn by faith, love, and hope, so much so that Christmas bells hung over decades in a forest grove ring an unbroken song, a harbinger of miracles to come.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5GGWK9BTu3rMv4IxucJsvrELAXa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1341123'),
  ('807797260643551453', 'Christmas Under the Stars', 2019, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Randal Platt, Allan Harmon', null, 'Autumn Reeser, Jesse Metcalfe, Clarke Peters, Anthony Bolognese, Yoshie Bancroft, Zoriah Wong, Michael Kopsa, Ken Camroux-Taylor', null, 'When Nick is fired from his high-powered investment firm at Christmastime, he takes a job at a Christmas tree lot. There, he meets Julie, an astronomy teacher who’s always looked to the stars for hope. As the Christmas spirit washes over him—and he begins falling for Julie—the once self-centered Nick discovers the joy of helping others.', 'When Nick is fired from his high-powered investment firm at Christmastime, he takes a job at a Christmas tree lot. There, he meets Julie, an astronomy teacher who’s always looked to the stars for hope. As the Christmas spirit washes over him—and he begins falling for Julie—the once self-centered Nick discovers the joy of helping others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zjNW72nSDBNYduhD1wf0EBWVhNl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:629985'),
  ('695286647312865025', 'Christmas Under Wraps', 2014, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'Peter Sullivan, Theo Angell', 'Jennifer Notas Shapiro', 'Candace Cameron Bure, David O''Donnell, Brian Doyle-Murray, Robert Pine, Joyce Cohen, Kendra Mylnechuk, Page Petrucka, James Gaisford', null, 'When a driven doctor doesn''t get the prestigious position she planned for, she unexpectedly finds herself moving to a remote Alaskan town. While she meets the locals and even starts a new romance, she has to learn to let the life she planned for give way to a love she never could have imagined, and finds this festive small town is hiding one big holiday secret.', 'When a driven doctor doesn''t get the prestigious position she planned for, she unexpectedly finds herself moving to a remote Alaskan town. While she meets the locals and even starts a new romance, she has to learn to let the life she planned for give way to a love she never could have imagined, and finds this festive small town is hiding one big holiday secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r2tadWhvP5oyRma1aYrVtAIQMe9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:299584'),
  ('129696738100323739', 'Christmas Unfiltered', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Sarah Sherman, Zachary Ray Sherman, Chris Freilich', 'Billie Bates', 'Alison Fernández, Judy Reyes, Andrew Hunter, David DeLao, Taylor Castro, Gavin Bedell, Anya Ruoss, Eli Daoudi', null, 'A teen who feels ignored by her family makes a Christmas wish to be listened to, then wakes up and discovers she can only tell the whole truth.', 'A teen who feels ignored by her family makes a Christmas wish to be listened to, then wakes up and discovers she can only tell the whole truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mquQYEWVLqz8fb8umolFgyG9CVK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1032454'),
  ('315421937227078862', 'Christmas Unwrapped', 2020, 'Romance, TV Movie, Comedy, Drama', 'Peter Benison, Bosede Williams', 'Gary Hardwick, Carley Smale', 'Amber Stevens West, Marco Grazzini, Cherion Drakes, Anthony Sherwood, Cheryl Ladd, Morgan Kelly, Izzy Perry, Jodi Larratt', null, 'Charity, an ambitious reporter, learns the true meaning of Christmas when she investigates Erik Gallagher, a beloved member of the town who insists all the gifts he provides every Christmas are from none-other than Santa himself.', 'Charity, an ambitious reporter, learns the true meaning of Christmas when she investigates Erik Gallagher, a beloved member of the town who insists all the gifts he provides every Christmas are from none-other than Santa himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hcnijhC5tQl59PmvkY35xxX6XC2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:734278'),
  ('688758785083305546', 'Christmas Vacation ''90', 1990, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Enrico Oldoini, Roberto Palmerini', 'Franco Ferrini', 'Christian De Sica, Massimo Boldi, Ezio Greggio, Andrea Roncato, Diego Abatantuono, Corinne Cléry, Moira Orfei, Giannina Facio', null, 'Several characters coincide during the Christmas holidays in the winter season of Saint Moritz.', 'Several characters coincide during the Christmas holidays in the winter season of Saint Moritz.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pJKKjFIItN4QTMGxa6P8ZxUHjei.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42443'),
  ('574350686608094502', 'Christmas Vacation ''91', 1991, 'Comedy', 'Enrico Oldoini, Sergio Salvati, Paolo Costella', 'Enrico Oldoini, Alberto Sordi, Giovanni Veronesi', 'Christian De Sica, Massimo Boldi, Nino Frassica, Ezio Greggio, Ornella Muti, Andrea Roncato, Alberto Sordi, Nadia Rinaldi', null, 'This coarse bedroom farce takes place at the St. Moritz ski resort over a Christmas vacation. Among the couples whose lives intersect are a widowed artist honeymooning with his second wife, a gay man traveling with his son and his lover (and hiding each from the other), a snobbish couple from Milan who have been forced to share a suite with a pair of crass Romans, etc.', 'This coarse bedroom farce takes place at the St. Moritz ski resort over a Christmas vacation. Among the couples whose lives intersect are a widowed artist honeymooning with his second wife, a gay man traveling with his son and his lover (and hiding each from the other), a snobbish couple from Milan who have been forced to share a suite with a pair of crass Romans, etc.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ebdWxVHgU1SzBriebeXb2tB9Mr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42444'),
  ('1138232299706867474', 'Christmas Vacation ''95', 1995, 'Comedy', 'Neri Parenti, Gianlorenzo Battaglia, Germano Tarricone', 'Neri Parenti', 'Massimo Boldi, Christian De Sica, Luke Perry, Elizabeth Nottoli, Claire Farwell, Cristiana Capotondi, Paolo Bonacelli, Howard Ross', null, 'Two Italians are on holiday in Aspen in Colorado. The first one is Lorenzo whose daughter is crazy about Luke Perry (Beverly Hills 90210 actor) and wants to meet him at all costs. The second one wants to win back his wife who has left him because of his gambling problem.', 'Two Italians are on holiday in Aspen in Colorado. The first one is Lorenzo whose daughter is crazy about Luke Perry (Beverly Hills 90210 actor) and wants to meet him at all costs. The second one wants to win back his wife who has left him because of his gambling problem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nO6xSa7GUJp6pFI1alFuqTCRhIW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42445'),
  ('1118731025062274759', 'Christmas Vacation 2: Cousin Eddie''s Island Adventure', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Rohn Schmidt, Nick Marck, Jerram A. Swartz', 'Matty Simmons', 'Randy Quaid, Miriam Flynn, Dana Barron, Jake Thomas, Sung-Hi Lee, Julian Stone, Beverly Garland, Stephen Furst', null, 'Though Eddie''s fired right at Christmastime, his boss sends him and his family on a South Pacific vacation, hoping Eddie won''t sue him after being bitten by a lab monkey. When the Tuttle family winds up trapped on a tropical island, however, Eddie manages to provide for everyone and prove himself a real man.', 'Though Eddie''s fired right at Christmastime, his boss sends him and his family on a South Pacific vacation, hoping Eddie won''t sue him after being bitten by a lab monkey. When the Tuttle family winds up trapped on a tropical island, however, Eddie manages to provide for everyone and prove himself a real man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wTtEMlMul5Xpg4L2lOrj6Kp0R4I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11155'),
  ('268393916133026989', 'Christmas Vacation 2000', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Carlo Vanzina, Gianlorenzo Battaglia', 'Carlo Vanzina, Enrico Vanzina', 'Massimo Boldi, Christian De Sica, Megan Gale, Enzo Salvi, Carmen Electra, Monica Scattini, Irene Ferri, Virginie Marsan', null, 'Superenalotto winner Pasquale Esposito with his family, two penniless students from Emilia and the Colombo and Covelli families, who accidentally rent the same chalet, will spend the Christmas holidays in Cortina d''Ampezzo.', 'Superenalotto winner Pasquale Esposito with his family, two penniless students from Emilia and the Colombo and Covelli families, who accidentally rent the same chalet, will spend the Christmas holidays in Cortina d''Ampezzo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b6QOiOc9Wqb5EwY9Kf7eTc4QRjC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42446'),
  ('662711850469786096', 'Christmas Waltz', 2020, 'TV Movie, Romance, Drama', 'Michael Damian, Tyler Walzak', 'Janeen Damian, Michael Damian', 'Lacey Chabert, Will Kemp, Marco Soriano, Julia Harnett, Lane Edwards, Beatrice King, Chris Cope, John Talan Church', null, 'After Avery’s storybook Christmas wedding is canceled unexpectedly, dance instructor Roman helps her rebuild her dreams.', 'After Avery’s storybook Christmas wedding is canceled unexpectedly, dance instructor Roman helps her rebuild her dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6YewfKDTQmzVwwBKog6IWOLhENP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:733032'),
  ('457232196465677370', 'Christmas Wedding Planner', 2017, 'Romance, Family, TV Movie', 'Martin Buzora, Justin G. Dyck', 'Keith Cooper', 'Jocelyn Hudon, Stephen Huszar, Kelly Rutherford, Rebecca Dalton, Eric Hicks, Joey Fatone, Melinda Shankar, Gabrielle Graham', 'PG', 'Wedding Planner, Kelsey Wilson, is about to have her big break: planning her beloved cousin''s lavish and exclusive wedding. Everything is going smoothly until Connor McClane, a devilishly handsome private investigator, shows up and turns Kelsey''s world upside-down. Hired by a secret source, Connor quickly disrupts the upcoming nuptials but wins Kelsey''s heart in the process.', 'Wedding Planner, Kelsey Wilson, is about to have her big break: planning her beloved cousin''s lavish and exclusive wedding. Everything is going smoothly until Connor McClane, a devilishly handsome private investigator, shows up and turns Kelsey''s world upside-down. Hired by a secret source, Connor quickly disrupts the upcoming nuptials but wins Kelsey''s heart in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6AvDenAws6MmF4Y6ZahRINYLbud.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:488113'),
  ('247561202266485248', 'Christmas Wishes & Mistletoe Kisses', 2019, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'D.J. Viola, David McGrory', 'Liz Sczudlo', 'Jill Wagner, Matthew Davis, Wyatt Hunt, Donna Mills, Rachel Hendrix, Brandon Quinn, Darby Hinton, Marquita Goings', 'G', 'Single mom Abbey takes a leap of faith to pursue her passion for interior design. When she gets hired to decorate the estate of local businessman Nick, Abbey must complete the job by Christmas Eve. With the holidays fast approaching, Abbey must figure out how to break down the wall between her and Nick, as this could be the opportunity that jump-starts her career.', 'Single mom Abbey takes a leap of faith to pursue her passion for interior design. When she gets hired to decorate the estate of local businessman Nick, Abbey must complete the job by Christmas Eve. With the holidays fast approaching, Abbey must figure out how to break down the wall between her and Nick, as this could be the opportunity that jump-starts her career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gh9iUFpPkbS30bJFaek34JLDkls.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:604553'),
  ('796050360807782641', 'Christmas with a Crown', 2020, 'TV Movie, Romance, Drama', 'Dylan Pearce, Eric B. Spoeth', 'Michael Varrati', 'Lisa Durupt, Marcus Rosner, Michael Lazarovitch, Faith Louissaint, John Treleaven, Teryl Rothery, Dianne Wulf, Diana-Marie Stolz', null, 'When a successful woman returns to her hometown to revive her family''s Christmas festival, she meets a dashing stranger who''s volunteered to help organize the event. Sparks begin to fly between them, but little does she know that he''s really a prince in disguise, longing to find the true spirit of the holidays. It will take a Christmas miracle of royal proportions for their hearts to meet as one.', 'When a successful woman returns to her hometown to revive her family''s Christmas festival, she meets a dashing stranger who''s volunteered to help organize the event. Sparks begin to fly between them, but little does she know that he''s really a prince in disguise, longing to find the true spirit of the holidays. It will take a Christmas miracle of royal proportions for their hearts to meet as one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h6ysmPFNUZhng7fEpcoEedJIWhn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:757771'),
  ('305107806435924202', 'Christmas with a Prince', 2018, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie, Comedy', 'Jeff Maher, Colin Pember, Emma Jean Sutherland', 'Keith Cooper', 'Kaitlyn Leeb, Nick Hounslow, Josh Dean, Melinda Shankar, Charles Shaughnessy, Liam MacDonald, Ilamaria Ebrahim, Julia Baldwin', null, 'Pediatric specialist Tasha Mason is focused on one thing; keeping the kids in her ward as healthy and happy as possible. So when her high-school crush, who just happens to be handsome Prince Alexander Cavalieri, breaks his leg on a nearby ski-slope, Tasha is forced to allow him to secretly get well on her floor and she’s furious that a spoiled Royal is interrupting the precious healing time her kids so badly need. Soon, however, Tasha learns that some tough love and a lot of Christmas spirit, could turn this royal pain into a knight in shining armor.', 'Pediatric specialist Tasha Mason is focused on one thing; keeping the kids in her ward as healthy and happy as possible. So when her high-school crush, who just happens to be handsome Prince Alexander Cavalieri, breaks his leg on a nearby ski-slope, Tasha is forced to allow him to secretly get well on her floor and she’s furious that a spoiled Royal is interrupting the precious healing time her kids so badly need. Soon, however, Tasha learns that some tough love and a lot of Christmas spirit, could turn this royal pain into a knight in shining armor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f36niI1QKbUUN7hh6lbeIEUIv4P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:566039'),
  ('675450159822858844', 'Christmas with a Prince: The Royal Baby', 2021, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'Marco Deufemia, Aldo Quirván', 'Celina Dean, Josh Dean', 'Kaitlyn Leeb, Nick Hounslow, Josh Dean, Melinda Shankar, Lanette Ware, Charles Shaughnessy, Suzanne Cyr, Tom Morton', null, 'Things get complicated for the expecting Prince Alexander and Dr. Tasha when a Royal State Visit is planned abroad, passing through her hometown. The couple must struggle with defying tradition and delivering, literally, on expectations.', 'Things get complicated for the expecting Prince Alexander and Dr. Tasha when a Royal State Visit is planned abroad, passing through her hometown. The couple must struggle with defying tradition and delivering, literally, on expectations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bxP1plGJTyk7l8mVzbtziJGcXLI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:882224'),
  ('611304731442036700', 'Christmas with a View', 2018, 'TV Movie, Romance, Family', 'Justin G. Dyck, Russ De Jong', 'David Finley', 'Kaitlyn Leeb, Scott Cavalheiro, Joseph Cannata, Vivica A. Fox, Patrick Duffy, Nicole Stamp, Genevieve Kang, Mark Ghanimé', null, 'This Christmas, Thunder Mountain Ski Resort is abuzz when celebrity chef Shane Roarke is named the new head chef. Clara Garrison isn''t as excited and is instead focused on getting resettled after her failed attempt at opening a restaurant in the city. With their paths constantly crossing, will their shared passion for cooking bring them together or will secrets keep them apart?', 'This Christmas, Thunder Mountain Ski Resort is abuzz when celebrity chef Shane Roarke is named the new head chef. Clara Garrison isn''t as excited and is instead focused on getting resettled after her failed attempt at opening a restaurant in the city. With their paths constantly crossing, will their shared passion for cooking bring them together or will secrets keep them apart?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jzDSyPq80DPRzTryh9qBOiJQI8o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:550385'),
  ('518826278944191172', 'Christmas with Holly', 2012, 'Drama, Family, TV Movie, Romance', 'Allan Arkush, Charles Minsky, Annie Bradley', 'Pnenah Goldstein', 'Sean Faris, Eloise Mumford, Lucy Gallina, Dana Watkins, Daniel Eric Gold, Vanessa Matsui, Fiona Forsythe, Catherine Bérubé', null, 'After being dumped at the altar on her wedding day, Maggie Conway moves to the island town of Friday Harbor in Washington State, where she meets Mark Nagle, the local coffee shop owner.', 'After being dumped at the altar on her wedding day, Maggie Conway moves to the island town of Friday Harbor in Washington State, where she meets Mark Nagle, the local coffee shop owner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bGbvMw4pkSHLFAYVjvOZsR0WwPZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149786'),
  ('900885812487264227', 'Christmas with the Campbells', 2022, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Clare Niederpruem, Kristoffer Carrillo', 'Dan Lagana, Vince Vaughn, Barbara Kymlicka', 'Brittany Snow, Justin Long, Alex Moffat, Julia Duffy, George Wendt, JoAnna Garcia Swisher, Duane Stephens, Annette Wright', 'NR', 'When Jesse is dumped right before the holidays by her boyfriend, Shawn, his parents convince her to still spend Christmas with them, and Shawn''s handsome cousin, while Shawn is away.', 'When Jesse is dumped right before the holidays by her boyfriend, Shawn, his parents convince her to still spend Christmas with them, and Shawn''s handsome cousin, while Shawn is away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eZATja47WCrQNJqZw34Qa8OeHwT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:934559'),
