  ('895705551409540451', 'Christmas with the Kranks', 2004, 'Comedy, Family', 'Joe Roth, Don Burgess, Christopher Burian-Mohr', 'Chris Columbus', 'Tim Allen, Jamie Lee Curtis, Dan Aykroyd, M. Emmet Walsh, Elizabeth Franz, Erik Per Sullivan, Cheech Marin, Jake Busey', 'PG', 'When their only daughter Blair leaves the family nest, Luther and Nora Krank decide to book an island cruise to beat the yuletide blues and just skip the holidays. But their decision to boycott tradition has the whole neighborhood in an uproar, and when Blair calls on Christmas Eve to announce a surprise visit with her new fiancée, the Kranks have just twelve hours to perform a miracle and pull themselves and their neighbors together to throw the best celebration ever!', 'When their only daughter Blair leaves the family nest, Luther and Nora Krank decide to book an island cruise to beat the yuletide blues and just skip the holidays. But their decision to boycott tradition has the whole neighborhood in an uproar, and when Blair calls on Christmas Eve to announce a surprise visit with her new fiancée, the Kranks have just twelve hours to perform a miracle and pull themselves and their neighbors together to throw the best celebration ever!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q866vL3KhAjbkZH1enT7AoxmRHx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13673'),
  ('772330182632240492', 'Christmas with the Tuches', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Alain Carsoux, Olivier Baroux, Christian Abomnes', 'Olivier Baroux', 'Jean-Paul Rouve, Isabelle Nanty, Michel Blanc, Claire Nadeau, Sarah Stern, Pierre Lottin, Théo Fernandez, Jérémy Lopez', null, 'After having resigned from his post as President of the Republic, Jeff and his family are happy to be back in their village of Bouzolles. As the end of the year holidays approach, Cathy asks for a unique gift: to reconnect with her sister Maguy, and her husband Jean-Yves, with whom Jeff has been angry for 10 years. The reconciliation could have gone smoothly, except that during a lunch, Jeff and Jean-Yves, will once again find a subject of contention: Christmas. This family feud, which should never have left Bouzolles, will turn into a standoff between Jeff and a giant of Internet distribution.', 'After having resigned from his post as President of the Republic, Jeff and his family are happy to be back in their village of Bouzolles. As the end of the year holidays approach, Cathy asks for a unique gift: to reconnect with her sister Maguy, and her husband Jean-Yves, with whom Jeff has been angry for 10 years. The reconciliation could have gone smoothly, except that during a lunch, Jeff and Jean-Yves, will once again find a subject of contention: Christmas. This family feud, which should never have left Bouzolles, will turn into a standoff between Jeff and a giant of Internet distribution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i3sANKJlvSnIIOug3dpiHU72w99.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:613335'),
  ('586351293285364756', 'Christmas with You', 2022, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Alice Johnson, Dan Levy, Christine Lois', 'Paco Farias, Jennifer C. Stetson, Michael Varrati', 'Aimee Garcia, Freddie Prinze Jr., Deja Monique Cruz, Zenzi Williams, Kyndra Sanchez, Socorro Santiago, Helena Betancourt, Elisa Bocanegra', 'PG', 'Feeling career burnout, pop star Angelina escapes to grant a young fan''s wish in small-town New York, where she not only finds the inspiration to revitalize her career but also a shot at true love.', 'Feeling career burnout, pop star Angelina escapes to grant a young fan''s wish in small-town New York, where she not only finds the inspiration to revitalize her career but also a shot at true love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/26RZloFHUyc0GTsybmnUPpSCPHb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:936960'),
  ('1101453201450355011', 'Christmas Wonderland', 2018, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'Stuart Brereton, Sean Olson', 'Jay Cipriani, Anna White', 'Emily Osment, Ryan Rottman, Kelly Hu, Jacob Buster, Trinity Roberts, Sarah Jackson, Scott Christopher, Jake Stormoen', null, 'Heidi, who initially left her small town of Pleasant Valley with the dream of one day becoming a successful painter, has put her own art on hold to excel as an art gallery curator. Now, a week before the gallery’s big Christmas party, she must return home to watch her niece and nephew. She comes face to face with her high school love, Chris, now a teacher, and offers to help him find a new last-minute location for the Christmas dance.', 'Heidi, who initially left her small town of Pleasant Valley with the dream of one day becoming a successful painter, has put her own art on hold to excel as an art gallery curator. Now, a week before the gallery’s big Christmas party, she must return home to watch her niece and nephew. She comes face to face with her high school love, Chris, now a teacher, and offers to help him find a new last-minute location for the Christmas dance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3QwvhdOZSNJdHbHcL9aIwp3l9mD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:550032'),
  ('144906232956236091', 'Christmas, Inc.', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Alejandro Martínez, Manuel Hinojosa, Fernando Rovzar', 'Fernando Rovzar', 'Pedro Armendáriz Jr., Alejandra Ambrosi, Mauricio Barrientos, Héctor Jiménez, Diego Velázquez, Hanna Valeria Cervantes, Adal Ramones, Eduardo España', null, 'With Christmas approaching, Santa Claus has to contend with the fact that the North Pole is melting and find a way to rid the holiday of its capitalist nature.', 'With Christmas approaching, Santa Claus has to contend with the fact that the North Pole is melting and find a way to rid the holiday of its capitalist nature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7aOCeKNAo2KBabxGkUnEqgwy22P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26528'),
  ('445856293998883718', 'Christmas...Again?!', 2021, 'Family, Comedy, Fantasy, TV Movie, Drama', 'Anthony E. Cabral, Andy Fickman, David Hennings', 'Doan La', 'Scarlett Estevez, Daniel Sunjata, Alexis Carra, Priscilla Lopez, Ashlyn Jade Lopez, Beth Lacke, Gary Anthony Williams, James McCracken', 'G', 'Rowena "Ro" is a high-spirited 11-year-old hoping to add more spunk to her Christmas celebrations when her parents’ divorce is going anything but smoothly.', 'Rowena "Ro" is a high-spirited 11-year-old hoping to add more spunk to her Christmas celebrations when her parents’ divorce is going anything but smoothly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tCE4EHfSfGJHKSBIvbSCtplElLE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:762879'),
  ('822156495962443631', 'Christopher and His Kind', 2011, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Geoffrey Sax, Kieran McGuigan, Barry Keil', 'Kevin Elyot', 'Matt Smith, Imogen Poots, Lindsay Duncan, Perry Milward, Toby Jones, Pip Carter, Alexander Dreymon, Faolan Morgan', 'NR', 'In 1931, budding author Christopher Isherwood goes to Berlin at the invitation of his friend W. H. Auden for the gay sex that abounds in the city. He falls for street sweeper Heinz, paying medical bills for the boy''s sickly mother, to the disapproval of her other son, Nazi Gerhardt.', 'In 1931, budding author Christopher Isherwood goes to Berlin at the invitation of his friend W. H. Auden for the gay sex that abounds in the city. He falls for street sweeper Heinz, paying medical bills for the boy''s sickly mother, to the disapproval of her other son, Nazi Gerhardt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lUSNRk7zmkIXaMwnAyI3796wR41.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60170'),
  ('423771665254435617', 'Christopher Columbus', 1949, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, History', 'David MacDonald, Muir Mathieson, Stephen Dade', 'Muriel Box, Sydney Box, Cyril Roberts', 'Fredric March, Florence Eldridge, Francis L. Sullivan, Kathleen Ryan, Derek Bond, Nora Swinburne, Abraham Sofaer, Linden Travers', 'NR', 'Christopher Columbus overcomes intrigue at the Spanish court and convinces Queen Isabella that his plan to reach the East by sailing west is practical.', 'Christopher Columbus overcomes intrigue at the Spanish court and convinces Queen Isabella that his plan to reach the East by sailing west is practical.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AhA9L5AgzjE7Y20cHWOoUeQzSXI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157283'),
  ('189713646586454345', 'Christopher Columbus, The Enigma', 2007, 'Drama, History', 'Manoel de Oliveira, Sabine Lancelin', 'Manoel de Oliveira', 'Ricardo Trêpa, Leonor Baldaque, Manoel de Oliveira, Maria Isabel de Oliveira, Leonor Silveira, Luis Miguel Cintra, José Pinto, Adelaide Teixeira', null, 'A true story of a doctor and his wife who went on a journey in order to prove that discoverer Christopher Columbus was in fact Portuguese. Inspired by the book "Cristóvão Colon Era Português".', 'A true story of a doctor and his wife who went on a journey in order to prove that discoverer Christopher Columbus was in fact Portuguese. Inspired by the book "Cristóvão Colon Era Português".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7iqVHvszm3XFr9WtDHrDTEEuTmf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57673'),
  ('948169078124997947', 'Christopher Columbus: The Discovery', 1992, 'History, Adventure', 'John Glen, Alec Mills', 'John Briley, Cary Bates, Mario Puzo', 'Georges Corraface, Marlon Brando, Tom Selleck, Rachel Ward, Robert Davi, Catherine Zeta-Jones, Oliver Cotton, Benicio del Toro', 'PG-13', 'Genoan navigator Christopher Columbus has a dream to find an alternative route to sail to the Indies, by traveling west instead of east, across the unchartered Ocean sea. After failing to find backing from the Portugese, he goes to the Spanish court to ask Queen Isabella and King Ferdinand for help. After surviving a grilling from the Head of the Spanish Inquisition Tomas de Torquemada, he eventually gets the blessing from Queen Isabella and sets sail in three ships to travel into the unknown. Along the way he must deal with sabotage from Portugese spies and mutiny from a rebellious crew.', 'Genoan navigator Christopher Columbus has a dream to find an alternative route to sail to the Indies, by traveling west instead of east, across the unchartered Ocean sea. After failing to find backing from the Portugese, he goes to the Spanish court to ask Queen Isabella and King Ferdinand for help. After surviving a grilling from the Head of the Spanish Inquisition Tomas de Torquemada, he eventually gets the blessing from Queen Isabella and sets sail in three ships to travel into the unknown. Along the way he must deal with sabotage from Portugese spies and mutiny from a rebellious crew.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2VUr81cOU0jsZtzBs2EoVHcDJDW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41682'),
  ('461553923116391560', 'Christopher Robin', 2018, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Marc Forster, Michael Stevenson, Matthias Koenigswieser', 'Alex Ross Perry, Allison Schroeder, Tom McCarthy', 'Ewan McGregor, Hayley Atwell, Bronte Carmichael, Jim Cummings, Brad Garrett, Nick Mohammed, Toby Jones, Peter Capaldi', 'PG', 'Christopher Robin, the boy who had countless adventures in the Hundred Acre Wood, has grown up and lost his way. Now it’s up to his spirited and loveable stuffed animals, Winnie The Pooh, Tigger, Piglet, and the rest of the gang, to rekindle their friendship and remind him of endless days of childlike wonder and make-believe, when doing nothing was the very best something.', 'Christopher Robin, the boy who had countless adventures in the Hundred Acre Wood, has grown up and lost his way. Now it’s up to his spirited and loveable stuffed animals, Winnie The Pooh, Tigger, Piglet, and the rest of the gang, to rekindle their friendship and remind him of endless days of childlike wonder and make-believe, when doing nothing was the very best something.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i6Ytex4d3CdfIKJFxB5v5vh24vb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:420814'),
  ('286436147092284661', 'Christopher Strong', 1933, 'Drama, Romance', 'Dorothy Arzner, Bert Glennon, Edward Killy', 'Zoë Akins', 'Katharine Hepburn, Colin Clive, Billie Burke, Helen Chandler, Ralph Forbes, Irene Browne, Jack La Rue, Desmond Roberts', 'NR', 'A romance develops between a happily married middle-aged British politician and an adventurous young aviatrix.', 'A romance develops between a happily married middle-aged British politician and an adventurous young aviatrix.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jhPBTEHlgw4xONmNxdJzWRuugMm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37581'),
  ('955650349956015434', 'Christopher''s Christmas Mission', 1975, 'Animation, Family, TV Movie', 'Per Åhlin, Pelle Svensson, Per Svensson', 'Per Åhlin', 'Tage Danielsson, Per Andrén, Toivo Pawlo, Marianne Stjernqvist, Åke Fridell, Catrin Westerlund', null, '"Christopher''s Christmas Mission"- A tale about a boy who steals Christmas gifts from the wealthy to give to the poor people of Stockholm, while working in a post office on Christmas Eve.', '"Christopher''s Christmas Mission"- A tale about a boy who steals Christmas gifts from the wealthy to give to the poor people of Stockholm, while working in a post office on Christmas Eve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bK3Wv9vN29pTPtC65qvkIaEOsN5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74354'),
  ('761857750117631284', 'Christus', 1916, 'Drama', 'Giulio Antamoro, Renato Cartoni, Enrico Guazzoni', 'Ignazio Lupi, Giulio Antamoro', 'Alberto Pasquali, Amleto Novelli, Leda Gys, Augusto Mastripietri, Amalia Cataneo, Maria Caserini, Aurelia Cattaneo, Lina De Chiesa', null, 'Antamoro''s CHRISTUS, epic in scale and ambition, and featuring decidedly otherworldly special effects, was released in 1916. Telling the story of the Life of Christ, the film is divided into three segments-- three Mysteries. The first of these includes the Birth of Jesus, the arrival of the Magi, Herod and the slaughter of the innocents, the flight into Egypt. The second Mystery features the expulsion of the merchants from the Temple, Mary Magdalene''s conversion and Christ''s entry into Jerusalem. The third Mystery is itself divided into three separate parts, which are The Passion, The Death and The Resurrection.', 'Antamoro''s CHRISTUS, epic in scale and ambition, and featuring decidedly otherworldly special effects, was released in 1916. Telling the story of the Life of Christ, the film is divided into three segments-- three Mysteries. The first of these includes the Birth of Jesus, the arrival of the Magi, Herod and the slaughter of the innocents, the flight into Egypt. The second Mystery features the expulsion of the merchants from the Temple, Mary Magdalene''s conversion and Christ''s entry into Jerusalem. The third Mystery is itself divided into three separate parts, which are The Passion, The Death and The Resurrection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uLTwa9ATsVRPCsCmSBudFXAhVkJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174569'),
  ('989453297087228673', 'Christy', 2025, 'History, Drama', 'David Michôd, Germain McMicking, Alisa Fredericks', 'David Michôd, Mirrah Foulkes', 'Sydney Sweeney, Ben Foster, Merritt Wever, Katy O''Brian, Ethan Embry, Jess Gabor, Chad L. Coleman, Tony Cavalero', 'R', 'Christy Martin never imagined life beyond her small-town roots in West Virginia—until she discovered a knack for punching people. Fueled by grit, raw determination, and an unshakable desire to win, she charges into the world of boxing under the guidance of her trainer and manager-turned-husband, Jim. But while Christy flaunts a fiery persona in the ring, her toughest battles unfold outside it—confronting family, identity, and a relationship that just might become life-or-death.', 'Christy Martin never imagined life beyond her small-town roots in West Virginia—until she discovered a knack for punching people. Fueled by grit, raw determination, and an unshakable desire to win, she charges into the world of boxing under the guidance of her trainer and manager-turned-husband, Jim. But while Christy flaunts a fiery persona in the ring, her toughest battles unfold outside it—confronting family, identity, and a relationship that just might become life-or-death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ssy1uHGZkuXLkIWJWrtsBczPvVC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1287322'),
  ('559796261389207394', 'ChromeSkull: Laid to Rest 2', 2011, 'Horror', 'Andrew Shepherd, Shannon Murray, Ryan Copeland', 'Robert Hall, Kevin Bocarde', 'Brian Austin Green, Thomas Dekker, Mimi Michaels, Owain Yeoman, Danielle Harris, Gail O''Grady, Angelina Armani, Brett Wagner', 'R', 'After his gruesome encounter with a girl, and being outmatched by his own assistant, ChromeSkull resurges with a horrifying massacre of his own.', 'After his gruesome encounter with a girl, and being outmatched by his own assistant, ChromeSkull resurges with a horrifying massacre of his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vZSoi9OyOXKoHRevs2T28tZ1Lfz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55723'),
  ('321122240141325705', 'Chromophobia', 1966, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Raoul Servais', 'Raoul Servais', null, null, 'An invading army destroys all color in a harmless town and brings it into a state of depression. Then a jester arrives.', 'An invading army destroys all color in a harmless town and brings it into a state of depression. Then a jester arrives.', null, 'tmdb:movie:45315'),
  ('212720910463726032', 'Chromophobia', 2006, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Martha Fiennes, George Tiffin, Ben Howarth', 'Martha Fiennes', 'Ben Chaplin, Kristin Scott Thomas, Damian Lewis, Ralph Fiennes, Penélope Cruz, Rhys Ifans, Harriet Walter, Clem Tibber', null, 'Encouraged by his editor to seek ''sexy stories that sell'', a reporter preys upon the private life of an erstwhile friend, with disastrous results.', 'Encouraged by his editor to seek ''sexy stories that sell'', a reporter preys upon the private life of an erstwhile friend, with disastrous results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w80QHQSpygtgBXT45uP29RE8Bcf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17086'),
  ('385639943258336600', 'Chronic', 2015, 'Drama', 'Michel Franco, Yves Cape', 'Michel Franco', 'Tim Roth, Sarah Sutherland, Robin Bartlett, Rachel Pickup, Michael Cristofer, David Dastmalchian, Elizabeth Tulloch, Claire van der Boom', 'R', 'David is a nurse who works with terminally ill patients. Dedicated to his profession, he develops strong relationships with the people he cares for. But outside of work, it''s a different story altogether.', 'David is a nurse who works with terminally ill patients. Dedicated to his profession, he develops strong relationships with the people he cares for. But outside of work, it''s a different story altogether.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wZKskeOrrftsVBVgVu4egXxxmdF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:337104'),
  ('463262886414155190', 'Chronically Unfeasible', 2000, 'Comedy', 'Sérgio Bianchi', 'Sérgio Bianchi, Gustavo Steinberg', 'Dan Stulbach, Dira Paes, Maria Alice Vergueiro, Zezé Motta, Zezeh Barbosa, Roberto Bomtempo, Daniel Dantas, Gero Camilo', null, 'Filmed over a five-year period, Chronically Unfeasible dissects Brazilian problems, using six people who meet in a restaurant in São Paulo as models to illustrate political, sociological and economic disparities between Brazil''s upper and lower classes.', 'Filmed over a five-year period, Chronically Unfeasible dissects Brazilian problems, using six people who meet in a restaurant in São Paulo as models to illustrate political, sociological and economic disparities between Brazil''s upper and lower classes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/73ovGujmpmjjlGPR3MUwgsItDJw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52751'),
  ('566447660433039409', 'Chronicle', 2012, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Thriller', 'Jim Brebner, Charlie Watson, Mark Bunting', 'Max Landis', 'Dane DeHaan, Alex Russell, Michael B. Jordan, Michael Kelly, Ashley Hinshaw, Bo Petersen, Anna Wood, Rudi Malcolm', 'PG-13', 'Three high school students make an incredible discovery, leading to their developing uncanny powers beyond their understanding. As they learn to control their abilities and use them to their advantage, their lives start to spin out of control, and their darker sides begin to take over.', 'Three high school students make an incredible discovery, leading to their developing uncanny powers beyond their understanding. As they learn to control their abilities and use them to their advantage, their lives start to spin out of control, and their darker sides begin to take over.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kdyrdFIt29FUmLIKvedAc2j4rpo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76726'),
  ('781153970737410968', 'Chronicle of a Blood Merchant', 2015, 'Drama', 'Ha Jung-woo, Kim Sung-kwan, Park Ho-chan', 'Ha Jung-woo, Kim Joo-ho', 'Ha Jung-woo, Ha Ji-won, Nam Da-reum, No Kang-min, Jeon Hye-jin, Jang Kwang, Min Moo-je, Ju Jin-mo', null, 'Set in a village right after the Korean War, poor but good-hearted Heo Sam-gwan sets out to win the most beautiful girl in the village, Heo Ok-ran, by selling his blood to earn money. Years later, the two are happily married with three children, but their family undergoes a crisis when Sam-gwan''s eldest son doesn''t resemble him and rumors spread about the boy''s paternity.', 'Set in a village right after the Korean War, poor but good-hearted Heo Sam-gwan sets out to win the most beautiful girl in the village, Heo Ok-ran, by selling his blood to earn money. Years later, the two are happily married with three children, but their family undergoes a crisis when Sam-gwan''s eldest son doesn''t resemble him and rumors spread about the boy''s paternity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zwNXAq1YgbzYt8JJAhMVPWPEh1y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:321191'),
  ('331243820846140100', 'Chronicle of a Boy Alone', 1965, 'Drama', 'Leonardo Favio, Francisco Zapata, Eliseo Subiela', 'Leonardo Favio, Jorge Zuhair Jury', 'Diego Puente, Victoriano Moreira, Leonardo Favio, Tino Pascali, Óscar ''Cacho'' Espíndola, Beto Gianola, María Vaner, Elcira Olivera Garcés', null, 'The story of a delinquent eleven-year-old orphan in authoritarian Argentina.', 'The story of a delinquent eleven-year-old orphan in authoritarian Argentina.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yxdgxxtFfZUbn5idvtLSh4ryol3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47142'),
  ('370652819246360853', 'Chronicle of a Death Foretold', 1987, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Francesco Rosi, Pasqualino De Santis, Carlo Lastricati', 'Tonino Guerra, Francesco Rosi', 'Rupert Everett, Ornella Muti, Gian Maria Volonté, Lucia Bosè, Anthony Delon, Alain Cuny, Sergi Mateu, Vicky Hernández', null, 'This suspenseful Italian crime drama is set in a Colombian river town and chronicles the series of events that led up to murder. Based on a novel by distinguished author Gabriel Garcia Marquez, the tale begins in the present as a middle-aged doctor returns to the village after a twenty-year absence to investigate the murder that occurred just before he left.', 'This suspenseful Italian crime drama is set in a Colombian river town and chronicles the series of events that led up to murder. Based on a novel by distinguished author Gabriel Garcia Marquez, the tale begins in the present as a middle-aged doctor returns to the village after a twenty-year absence to investigate the murder that occurred just before he left.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/umcKJZB2eQpRux2OWKNR6gyw1ME.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163706'),
  ('756082300082355982', 'Chronicle of a Disappearance', 1996, 'Drama', 'Elia Suleiman, Ula Tabari, Harel Calderon', 'Elia Suleiman', 'Elia Suleiman, Nazira Suleiman, Fuad Suleiman, Ali Suliman, Juliet Mazzawi, Fawaz Eilemi, Leonid Alexeenko, Ula Tabari', null, 'Chronicle of a Disappearance unfolds in a series of seemingly unconnected cinematic tableaux, each of them focused on incidents or characters which seldom reappear later in the film. Among the many unrelated scenes, there is a Palestinian actress struggling to find an apartment in West Jerusalem, the owner of the Holy Land souvenir shop preparing merchandise for incoming Japanese tourists, a group of old women gossiping about their relatives, and an Israeli police van which screeches to a halt so several heavily armed soldiers can get off the car and urinate.', 'Chronicle of a Disappearance unfolds in a series of seemingly unconnected cinematic tableaux, each of them focused on incidents or characters which seldom reappear later in the film. Among the many unrelated scenes, there is a Palestinian actress struggling to find an apartment in West Jerusalem, the owner of the Holy Land souvenir shop preparing merchandise for incoming Japanese tourists, a group of old women gossiping about their relatives, and an Israeli police van which screeches to a halt so several heavily armed soldiers can get off the car and urinate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1F3cyDFl14E1epelr6KmuPaPHck.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49104'),
  ('702857410106306135', 'Chronicle of a Homicide', 1972, 'Crime, Drama', 'Mauro Bolognini, Giuseppe Ruzzolini', 'Ugo Liberatore, Ugo Pirro', 'Massimo Ranieri, Martin Balsam, Valentina Cortese, Turi Ferro, Pino Colizzi, Salvo Randone, Luigi Diberti, Petra Pauly', null, 'Roma.During a clash between demonstrating laborers (whose fight the students have joined) a policeman and a student are both killed. The investigating magistrate - in charge of the case with two commissioners - wants to believe to the version of the police: the student was killed by one of the laborers, while the policeman would have been killed by Massimo Trotti.', 'Roma.During a clash between demonstrating laborers (whose fight the students have joined) a policeman and a student are both killed. The investigating magistrate - in charge of the case with two commissioners - wants to believe to the version of the police: the student was killed by one of the laborers, while the policeman would have been killed by Massimo Trotti.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3srBQZXGKc8bsdtZ7XllUMpz0Q0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:260884'),
  ('89237246291993837', 'Chronicle of a Summer', 1961, 'Documentary', 'Jean Rouch, Edgar Morin, Michel Brault', null, 'Edgar Morin, Jean Rouch, Marceline Loridan-Ivens, Marilù Parolini, Jean-Pierre Sergent, Régis Debray, Nadine Ballot, Modeste Landry', null, 'Paris, summer 1960. Anthropologist and filmmaker Jean Rouch and sociologist and film critic Edgar Morin wander through the crowded streets asking passersby how they cope with life''s misfortunes.', 'Paris, summer 1960. Anthropologist and filmmaker Jean Rouch and sociologist and film critic Edgar Morin wander through the crowded streets asking passersby how they cope with life''s misfortunes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cKsFs0FUJBy4b8ihPpaeyRl2SJs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84972'),
  ('541255149782870864', 'Chronicle of Amorous Accidents', 1986, 'Drama', 'Andrzej Wajda, Edward Kłosiński', 'Tadeusz Konwicki, Andrzej Wajda', 'Paulina Młynarska, Piotr Wawrzyńczak, Bernadetta Machela, Dariusz Dobkowski, Jarosław Gruda, Tadeusz Konwicki, Tadeusz Łomnicki, Jaroslaw Dobrowski', null, 'Set in the summer months preceding the September 1939 outbreak of World War II in Polish part of Lithuania. A young highschool lad, Witek, is hoping to pass the entrance exams to the university. His love interest is Alina, his high-school colleague.', 'Set in the summer months preceding the September 1939 outbreak of World War II in Polish part of Lithuania. A young highschool lad, Witek, is hoping to pass the entrance exams to the university. His love interest is Alina, his high-school colleague.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zVbx23sgiLhmLkYWEVMAzuLq5cl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270735'),
  ('316106728249075404', 'Chronicle of an Escape', 2006, 'Thriller', 'Adrián Caetano, Julián Apezteguia, Diego García', 'Adrián Caetano, Esteban Student, Julian Loyola', 'Rodrigo de la Serna, Pablo Echarri, Nazareno Casero, Lautaro Delgado Tymruk, Matías Marmorato, Diego Alonso, Guillermo Fernández, César Albarracín', 'R', 'The true story of four men who narrowly escaped death at the hands of Argentina''s military death squads in 1977. Claudio Tamburrini is a goalie for a minor-league football team when he is abducted by members of the Argentine military police and taken to an unofficial detention center on the false suspicion that he is a terrorist. As he is tortured by intelligence agents looking for information he doesn''t have, Tamburrini fully expects to be killed. After many sessions of brutal torture, Tamburrini and his fellow captives Guillermo and Tano are being readied for execution when, in a final desperate act, Tamburrini dives out a window during a rainstorm.', 'The true story of four men who narrowly escaped death at the hands of Argentina''s military death squads in 1977. Claudio Tamburrini is a goalie for a minor-league football team when he is abducted by members of the Argentine military police and taken to an unofficial detention center on the false suspicion that he is a terrorist. As he is tortured by intelligence agents looking for information he doesn''t have, Tamburrini fully expects to be killed. After many sessions of brutal torture, Tamburrini and his fellow captives Guillermo and Tano are being readied for execution when, in a final desperate act, Tamburrini dives out a window during a rainstorm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rjizxUO1zTNre3vOLyF6Zc9pAxf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25532'),
  ('880009664685336569', 'Chronicle of Anna Magdalena Bach', 1968, 'Music, Drama', 'Jean-Marie Straub, Danièle Huillet, Saverio Diamante', 'Jean-Marie Straub, Danièle Huillet', 'Gustav Leonhardt, Christiane Lang, Paolo Carlini, Ernst Castelli, Hans-Peter Boye, Joachim Wolff, Rainer Kirchner, Eckart Bruntjen', null, 'The life and music of Johann Sebastian Bach as presented by his wife, Anna.', 'The life and music of Johann Sebastian Bach as presented by his wife, Anna.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bABKBHPge6UHlRbTkN1hgEiuOG5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95600'),
  ('554327889412680896', 'Chronicle of Flaming Years', 1961, 'War, Drama', 'Yuliya Solntseva, Aleksei Temerin, Fyodor Provorov', 'Oleksandr Dovzhenko', 'Svetlana Zhgun, Sergei Lukyanov, Vasili Merkuryev, Mikhail Mayorov, Zinaida Kirienko, Vladimir Seleznyov, Boris Andreyev, Mykola Vinhranovskyi', null, 'Once again, director Yulia Solnsteva directs a movie that her late husband Alexandre Dovchenko scripted but did not live long enough to shoot. In this wartime drama, the emphasis is on the heroics of both the civilians and the soldiers during times of severe stress in World War II. At the core of the action is one man in particular, whose sacrifices and heroics speak for a much larger group.', 'Once again, director Yulia Solnsteva directs a movie that her late husband Alexandre Dovchenko scripted but did not live long enough to shoot. In this wartime drama, the emphasis is on the heroics of both the civilians and the soldiers during times of severe stress in World War II. At the core of the action is one man in particular, whose sacrifices and heroics speak for a much larger group.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eh7VOlvQych4DKIaXfRzuN5KtUd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198902'),
  ('1143887634004871033', 'Chronicle of My Mother', 2012, 'Drama', 'Masato Harada, Akiko Ashizawa, Masayuki Taniguchi', 'Masato Harada', 'Koji Yakusho, Kirin Kiki, Aoi Miyazaki, Kaho Minami, Midoriko Kimura, Mimura, Akiko Kikuchi, Takahiro Miura', null, 'Best-selling novelist Kosaku Igami has made a career out of using his family as fodder for his novels, much to their dismay. When his mother, the spirited family matriarch, is diagnosed with dementia, Igami must come to terms with the toll his own behavior has taken on his increasingly distant family and resolve his own long-simmering resentments. Evocative of classic Ozu, this gorgeously wrought epic family portrait explores the tenderness and trappings of familial bonds.', 'Best-selling novelist Kosaku Igami has made a career out of using his family as fodder for his novels, much to their dismay. When his mother, the spirited family matriarch, is diagnosed with dementia, Igami must come to terms with the toll his own behavior has taken on his increasingly distant family and resolve his own long-simmering resentments. Evocative of classic Ozu, this gorgeously wrought epic family portrait explores the tenderness and trappings of familial bonds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xfsTECkAPamOczfpGhQEYvc25RQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129609'),
  ('278739575785800953', 'Chronicle of Poor Lovers', 1954, 'Drama, Romance', 'Gianni Di Venanzo, Paolo Russo, Enzo Alfonsi', 'Carlo Lizzani, Sergio Amidei, Massimo Mida', 'Anna Maria Ferrero, Cosetta Greco, Antonella Lualdi, Marcello Mastroianni, Bruno Berellini, Irene Cefaro, Adolfo Consolini, Giuliano Montaldo', null, 'Florence, Italy, 1925, during the fascist dictatorship. In order to live near his girlfriend Bianca, young Mario moves to a humble street in the old city center, where he befriends Maciste and Ugo, two anti-fascists.', 'Florence, Italy, 1925, during the fascist dictatorship. In order to live near his girlfriend Bianca, young Mario moves to a humble street in the old city center, where he befriends Maciste and Ugo, two anti-fascists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ahZ8PpY0PApMjhFbjiIP8zF2oPu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107035'),
  ('604205788446513352', 'Chronicle of the Years of Fire', 1975, 'Drama, War, History', 'Areski Nebti, Abderrahmane Bouguermouh, Mohammed Lakhdar-Hamina', 'Tewfik Farès, Rachid Boudjedra, Mohammed Lakhdar-Hamina', 'Yorgo Voyagis, Leila Shenna, Mohammed Lakhdar-Hamina, Nourredine Meziane (Cheikh Nourredine), Sissani (Mohamed Djediat), Hadj Smaine Mohamed Seghir, Yahia Benmabrouk, Keltoum (Aïcha Adjouri)', null, 'A meticulous chronicle of the evolution of the Algerian national movement from 1939 until the outbreak of the revolution on November 1, 1954, the film unequivocally demonstrates that the "Algerian War" is not an accident of history, but a slow process of suffering and warlike revolts, uninterrupted, from the start of colonization in 1830, until this "Red All Saints'' Day" of November 1, 1954. At its center, Ahmed gradually awakens to political awareness against colonization, under the gaze of his son, a symbol of the new Algeria, and that of Miloud, half-mad haranguer, half-prophet, incarnation of Popular memory of the revolt, the liberation of Algeria and its people.', 'A meticulous chronicle of the evolution of the Algerian national movement from 1939 until the outbreak of the revolution on November 1, 1954, the film unequivocally demonstrates that the "Algerian War" is not an accident of history, but a slow process of suffering and warlike revolts, uninterrupted, from the start of colonization in 1830, until this "Red All Saints'' Day" of November 1, 1954. At its center, Ahmed gradually awakens to political awareness against colonization, under the gaze of his son, a symbol of the new Algeria, and that of Miloud, half-mad haranguer, half-prophet, incarnation of Popular memory of the revolt, the liberation of Algeria and its people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wtx3qqdwwp3sNANYfAFXl5tKZE6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52555'),
  ('974571716197733918', 'Chronicles from the Siege', 2026, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Abdallah Al-Khatib, Talal Khoury, Abdallah Al Khatib', 'Abdallah Al-Khatib, Abdallah Al Khatib', 'Nadeem Rimawi, Saja Kilani, Idir Benaibouche, Maria Zreik, Omar AlMajali', null, 'When their city is placed under siege, the lives of a group of ordinary people are turned upside down, forcing each of them to confront impossible choices in pursuit of what they believe is survival in a war zone.', 'When their city is placed under siege, the lives of a group of ordinary people are turned upside down, forcing each of them to confront impossible choices in pursuit of what they believe is survival in a war zone.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F4EpKC0cqNyEQFkVIiagvsxuM80F.jpg', 'plex:movie:chronicles-from-the-siege'),
  ('264122204595344319', 'Chronicles of the Ghostly Tribe', 2015, 'Adventure, Action, Thriller', 'Lu Chuan, Cao Yu, Moon Sung-oh', 'Lu Chuan', 'Yao Chen, Mark Chao You-Ting, Rhydian Vaughan, Jerry Lee, Tang Yan, Li Feng, Si Ligeng, Li Jiawen', null, 'In 1979, a young soldier is working in China''s snowcapped mountains when an explosion reveals bizarre fossils hidden deep in the mountain caverns. What they discover next will change his life and human history forever.', 'In 1979, a young soldier is working in China''s snowcapped mountains when an explosion reveals bizarre fossils hidden deep in the mountain caverns. What they discover next will change his life and human history forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/paMpCe1sapr0dWMZtu3Pgl6UlVu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:364324'),
  ('836575650015541993', 'Chronopolis', 1983, 'Science Fiction, Animation', 'Piotr Kamler, Daniel Buthiaux, Piotr Kamler', 'Gabrielle Althen, Piotr Kamler', 'Michael Lonsdale', null, 'In a gargantuan city lurking in the sky, powerful immortals who have become jaded with eternal life. Most of their time is spent monotonously constructing bizarre and unusual objects while waiting for the ultimate gift to arrive.', 'In a gargantuan city lurking in the sky, powerful immortals who have become jaded with eternal life. Most of their time is spent monotonously constructing bizarre and unusual objects while waiting for the ultimate gift to arrive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9An9FKnD3vUTQU5cZtzKOFBejhk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65504'),
  ('1122748987954077789', 'Chronos', 1985, 'Documentary', 'Ron Fricke, Ron Fricke', 'Genevieve Nicholas, Constantine Nicholas', null, null, 'Carefully picked scenes of nature and civilization are viewed at high speed using time-lapse cinematography in an effort to demonstrate the history of various regions.', 'Carefully picked scenes of nature and civilization are viewed at high speed using time-lapse cinematography in an effort to demonstrate the history of various regions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ciGeeT92K7wMu8wAJntoizImwvG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18493'),
