  ('598468933929106671', 'Chrysalis', 2011, 'Drama', 'Paula Ortiz, Migue Amoedo', 'Paula Ortiz', 'Maribel Verdú, Leticia Dolera, Luisa Gavasa, Roberto Álamo, Miguel Alcíbar, Carlos Álvarez-Nóvoa, Álex Angulo, José María Asín', null, 'Interwoven emotions and struggles of three women of different generations aiming to build the lives they desire, their own future, love and dreams. All of them lose the love of their lives and they will have to pursue their happiness and fight for their dignity in a dark and hostile word.', 'Interwoven emotions and struggles of three women of different generations aiming to build the lives they desire, their own future, love and dreams. All of them lose the love of their lives and they will have to pursue their happiness and fight for their dignity in a dark and hostile word.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/80Z1XgeQoseTk6C4FaXM3o92lK0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85452'),
  ('704718957194579555', 'Chubby', 2014, 'Family, Comedy', 'Bruno Deville, Jean-François Hensgens', 'Bruno Deville, Antoine Jaccoud', 'David Thielemans, Julie Ferrier, Swann Arlaud, Lisa Harder, François Hadji-Lazaro, Dodi Mbemba, Stefan Liberski, Themis Pauwels', null, 'Chubby is the nickname of Kevin, a 12 years old kid already weights 100 kilos (220.46 lb). If he keeps devours fries, pastries and ice cream everyday, he''s gonna have heart attack sooner or later unless he decides to change his diet to turn around and stop eating junk food.', 'Chubby is the nickname of Kevin, a 12 years old kid already weights 100 kilos (220.46 lb). If he keeps devours fries, pastries and ice cream everyday, he''s gonna have heart attack sooner or later unless he decides to change his diet to turn around and stop eating junk food.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/69kRkZxBCP08zYWV7T9WV3BEe0D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:285394'),
