  ('453853717198709742', 'Chuck & Buck', 2000, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Miguel Arteta, Chuy Chávez', 'Mike White', 'Mike White, Chris Weitz, Lupe Ontiveros, Beth Colt, Paul Weitz, Maya Rudolph, Mary Wigmore, Paul Sand', 'R', 'Chuck and Buck are childhood best friends whose lives have taken very different paths. While Chuck moved away and now has a real life, Buck stayed behind and developed a dangerous fixation—on Chuck''s life.', 'Chuck and Buck are childhood best friends whose lives have taken very different paths. While Chuck moved away and now has a real life, Buck stayed behind and developed a dangerous fixation—on Chuck''s life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k0GY9haWiwZtBOf2T7winwNcsep.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44490'),
  ('81412884270296127', 'Chuck Amuck: The Movie', 1991, 'Documentary', 'John Needham', 'John Needham', 'Dick Vosburgh, Chuck Jones', null, 'Chuck Amuck: The Movie is a 1991 documentary film about Chuck Jones'' career with Warner Bros., centered on his work with Looney Tunes; narrated by Dick Vosburgh.', 'Chuck Amuck: The Movie is a 1991 documentary film about Chuck Jones'' career with Warner Bros., centered on his work with Looney Tunes; narrated by Dick Vosburgh.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lMPWvF8MoSI1rWGPfilMzCvoXpR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:286938'),
  ('675856753441627426', 'Chuck Berry: Hail! Hail! Rock ''n'' Roll', 1987, 'Documentary, Music', 'Taylor Hackford, Oliver Stapleton', null, 'Chuck Berry, Keith Richards, Ingrid Berry, Eric Clapton, Robert Cray, Bo Diddley, Don Everly, Phil Everly', 'PG-13', 'St. Louis, 1986. For Chuck Berry''s 60th, Keith Richards assembles a pickup band of Robert Cray, Joey Spampinato, Eric Clapton, himself and long-time Berry pianist, Johnnie Johnson. Joined on stage by Etta James, Linda Ronstadt and Julian Lennon, Berry performs his classic rock songs. His abilities as a composer, lyricist, singer, musician and entertainer are on display and, in behind-the-scenes interviews, are discussed by Bo Diddley, Little Richard, Jerry Lee Lewis, Bruce Springstein, the Everly Brothers, Roy Orbison and others. There''s even a rarity for Berry—a rehearsal. Archival footage from the early 1950s and a duet with John Lennon round out this portrait of a master.', 'St. Louis, 1986. For Chuck Berry''s 60th, Keith Richards assembles a pickup band of Robert Cray, Joey Spampinato, Eric Clapton, himself and long-time Berry pianist, Johnnie Johnson. Joined on stage by Etta James, Linda Ronstadt and Julian Lennon, Berry performs his classic rock songs. His abilities as a composer, lyricist, singer, musician and entertainer are on display and, in behind-the-scenes interviews, are discussed by Bo Diddley, Little Richard, Jerry Lee Lewis, Bruce Springstein, the Everly Brothers, Roy Orbison and others. There''s even a rarity for Berry—a rehearsal. Archival footage from the early 1950s and a duet with John Lennon round out this portrait of a master.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l2UO83nc3Z2xluh355pD8ZWgjpd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42003'),
  ('1098357970229765864', 'Chuck Billy and The Marvelous Guava Tree', 2025, 'Family, Adventure, Comedy', 'Gustavo Hadba, Fernando Fraiha, Rafael Dutra', 'Elena Altheman, Fernando Fraiha, Raul Chequer', 'Isaac Amendoim, Pedro Dantas, Anna Júlia Dias, Lorena Oliveira, Davi Okabe, Guilherme Tavares, Enzo Henrique, Luís Lobianco', null, 'Chuck Billy has spent his life picking guavas from Jed’s guava tree. But now that Dr. Agripino is going to build a road that will take down the tree, Chuck and his friends are going to do everything they can to stop it.', 'Chuck Billy has spent his life picking guavas from Jed’s guava tree. But now that Dr. Agripino is going to build a road that will take down the tree, Chuck and his friends are going to do everything they can to stop it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lzkVE5ISBCqlxOVmG4YoI5Fdnx0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:935766'),
  ('51923851743644794', 'Chuck Norris vs Communism', 2015, 'Documentary, History', 'Dana-Nicoletta Both, Ilinca Calugareanu, Jose Ruiz', 'Ilinca Calugareanu', 'Irina Margareta Nistor, Teodor Zamfir, Mircea Cojocaru, Vlad Craioveanu, Mihai Dobrovolschi, Adrian Sitaru, Paul Stefanescu, Alexandru Eremia', null, 'In late eighties, in Ceausescu''s Romania, a black market VHS bootlegger and a courageous female translator brought the magic of Western films to the Romanian people and sowed the seeds of a revolution.', 'In late eighties, in Ceausescu''s Romania, a black market VHS bootlegger and a courageous female translator brought the magic of Western films to the Romanian people and sowed the seeds of a revolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ojrUA0bfzPuDrGgGnOJElqcSTbL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:312152'),
