  ('1111105425628599670', 'Chunhyang', 2000, 'Drama, Romance', 'Im Kwon-taek, Jung Il-sung, Kim Dae-seung', 'Kim Myung-gon, Hye-yun Kang', 'Hyo-jeong Lee, Cho Seung-woo, Kim Sung-nyeo, Hak-young Kim, Lee Jeong-heon, Choi Jin-yeong, Lee Hae-eun, Hong Kyeong-yeon', null, 'A courtesan''s daughter''s fidelity to her husband, the governor''s son, is tested when he and his family leave for Seoul and the new governor attempts to possess her.', 'A courtesan''s daughter''s fidelity to her husband, the governor''s son, is tested when he and his family leave for Seoul and the new governor attempts to possess her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eFrFFk33vPVYdR4VHFqqXQYabK1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54986'),
  ('993711781279484820', 'Chup', 2022, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Abhay Raha, Balakrishnan Thevar, Shruti Mahajan', 'R. Balki', 'Dulquer Salmaan, Sunny Deol, Shreya Dhanwanthary, Pooja Bhatt, Saranya Ponvannan, Adhyayan Suman, Pravishi Das, Rajeev Ravindranathan', null, 'A series of bizarre and disturbing murders rock the city of Mumbai. Film critics are being killed week after week with the release of every new film. Arvind Mathur, Head of Crime Branch Mumbai, is tasked with solving the case. With the help of Zenobia, a criminal psychologist, he tries to understand the mind of the killer to trap him.', 'A series of bizarre and disturbing murders rock the city of Mumbai. Film critics are being killed week after week with the release of every new film. Arvind Mathur, Head of Crime Branch Mumbai, is tasked with solving the case. With the help of Zenobia, a criminal psychologist, he tries to understand the mind of the killer to trap him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n3tJMHzqCa3R1CA9lW4n6obJvxJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:883125'),
  ('1106118583614531754', 'Chup Chup Ke', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Priyadarshan, S. Thirunavukkarasu', 'Priyadarshan', 'Shahid Kapoor, Paresh Rawal, Rajpal Yadav, Kareena Kapoor Khan, Neha Dhupia, Om Puri, Shakti Kapoor, Suniel Shetty', null, 'After surviving a suicide attempt in which his family and fellow villagers believe he drowned, a debt-ridden man decides to start his life afresh in another village. He pretends to be mute and starts working for a rich man where he falls in love with his mute daughter.', 'After surviving a suicide attempt in which his family and fellow villagers believe he drowned, a debt-ridden man decides to start his life afresh in another village. He pretends to be mute and starts working for a rich man where he falls in love with his mute daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/daXoADAtEPis5bBvSrXVWfRa77X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19637'),
  ('493794209799833696', 'Chupa', 2023, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Family', 'Nico Aguilar, Chris Craine, Jonás Cuarón', 'Sean Kennedy Moore, Joe Barnathan, Marcus Rinehart', 'Evan Whitten, Demián Bichir, Christian Slater, Ashley Ciarra, Julio Cesar Cedillo, Alex Knight, Nickolas Verdugo, Adriana Paz', 'PG', 'While visiting family in Mexico, a lonely boy befriends a mythical creature hiding on his grandfather''s ranch and embarks on the adventure of a lifetime.', 'While visiting family in Mexico, a lonely boy befriends a mythical creature hiding on his grandfather''s ranch and embarks on the adventure of a lifetime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ra3xm8KFAkwK0CdbPRkfYADJYTB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:736790'),
  ('821294965092446598', 'Chupacabra Terror', 2005, 'Horror', 'John Shepphird, Neal Brown', 'John Shepphird, Steve Jankowski', 'John Rhys-Davies, Dylan Neal, Chelan Simmons, Giancarlo Esposito, Paula Shaw, David Millbern, Mark Viniello, Matthew R. Anderson', null, 'Cryptozoologist Doctor Peña traps the legendary Chupacabra on a remote Caribbean Island to make his name in the scientific community. When he smuggles it aboard the cruise ship Regent Queen, commanded by Captain Randolph, the monster breaks out of the cargo hold and makes a smorgasbord out of the passengers and crew.', 'Cryptozoologist Doctor Peña traps the legendary Chupacabra on a remote Caribbean Island to make his name in the scientific community. When he smuggles it aboard the cruise ship Regent Queen, commanded by Captain Randolph, the monster breaks out of the cargo hold and makes a smorgasbord out of the passengers and crew.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bO9lA5CRNYAAaxBQIdwECySdVuL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33197'),
  ('38866555754093088', 'Chupke Chupke', 1975, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Jaywant Pathare, Hrishikesh Mukherjee, Nityananda Datta', 'Gulzar, D.N. Mukherjee', 'Dharmendra, Sharmila Tagore, Om Prakash, Usha Kiran, Amitabh Bachchan, Asrani, Jaya Bachchan, Lily Chakravarty', null, 'Sulekha is in awe of her brother-in-law Raghavendra for his intelligence. Parimal, her husband, decides to take up the challenge of fooling Raghavendra and goes to work for him as a driver.', 'Sulekha is in awe of her brother-in-law Raghavendra for his intelligence. Parimal, her husband, decides to take up the challenge of fooling Raghavendra and goes to work for him as a driver.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yNZf2yhQE42f3uIcR1IXOiMQ72c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21459'),
