  ('978567832436194415', 'Chûshingura', 1962, 'History, Drama, Action', 'Hiroshi Inagaki, Kazuo Yamada', 'Toshio Yasumi', 'Matsumoto Hakuō I, Toshirō Mifune, Takashi Shimura, Tatsuya Mihashi, Yūzō Kayama, Akira Takarada, Yōsuke Natsuki, Makoto Satō', null, 'After their lord is tricked into committing ritual suicide, forty-seven samurai warriors await the chance to avenge their master and reclaim their honor.', 'After their lord is tricked into committing ritual suicide, forty-seven samurai warriors await the chance to avenge their master and reclaim their honor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ac9n6tJOhfLz9SYaoMKkMJaoLQd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44662'),
