  ('910730813728223312', 'Ci vediamo a casa', 2012, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Maurizio Ponzi, Mimmo Verdesca, Maurizio Calvesi', 'Giancarlo De Cataldo, Maurizio Ponzi, Piero Spila', 'Ambra Angiolini, Myriam Catania, Antonello Fassari, Giulio Forges Davanzati, Edoardo Leo, Primo Reggiani, Nicolas Vaporidis, Giuliana De Sio', null, 'Three different couples are looking for a house to live.', 'Three different couples are looking for a house to live.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c4f2FQUrwEvnUCbROGUbssC2Wwp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:178404'),
  ('836128312863656312', 'Ci vuole un gran fisico', 2013, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Sophie Chiarello, Giovanni Fiore Coltellacci, Marcella Libonati', 'Pasquale Plastino, Valerio Bariletti, Walter Fontana', 'Angela Finocchiaro, Elio, Antonella Lo Coco, Raul Cremona, Giovanni Storti, Aldo Baglio, Giacomo Poretti, Laura Marinoni', null, 'Torn between family and work, Eva is a woman enslaved by her sense of duty, always in a rush and invariably stressed. Four days shy of her fateful 50th birthday, Eva works as a clerk in the cosmetics department of a department store to support Francesca, her "rocker" daughter, and Lidia, her sprightly mother, after separating from Gino, her ex-husband who has never grown up and continues to complicate her life. The sudden dismissal of a colleague by department head Pagliai fuels Eva''s fear that the same fate may befall her, and in an attempt to appear flawless, she will make several mistakes that will further complicate her life. A sort of guardian angel, a strange character who follows her around at all times, will guide her toward solving her problems.', 'Torn between family and work, Eva is a woman enslaved by her sense of duty, always in a rush and invariably stressed. Four days shy of her fateful 50th birthday, Eva works as a clerk in the cosmetics department of a department store to support Francesca, her "rocker" daughter, and Lidia, her sprightly mother, after separating from Gino, her ex-husband who has never grown up and continues to complicate her life. The sudden dismissal of a colleague by department head Pagliai fuels Eva''s fear that the same fate may befall her, and in an attempt to appear flawless, she will make several mistakes that will further complicate her life. A sort of guardian angel, a strange character who follows her around at all times, will guide her toward solving her problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/czBXokvaOP4mzKpqKpma1SgMPX9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175791'),
  ('339813274184146862', 'Ciao', 2008, 'Drama, Romance', 'Yen Tan, James M. Johnston', 'Alessandro Calza, Yen Tan', 'Adam Neal Smith, Chuck Blaum, Ethel Lung', null, 'A man learns that his late friend had a secret online lover who is on the way from Italy.', 'A man learns that his late friend had a secret online lover who is on the way from Italy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pvmEaE0lzlLqMpAXVLOGaf5rLX5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19603'),
  ('722708430364865170', 'Ciao Alberto', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'McKenna Jean Harris, Leo Santos, Amy Rae Jones', 'McKenna Jean Harris', 'Jack Dylan Grazer, Marco Barricelli, Jacob Tremblay, Gino La Monica, Arturo Sorino', 'PG', 'With his best friend Luca away at school, Alberto is enjoying his new life in Portorosso working alongside Massimo—the imposing, tattooed, one-armed fisherman of few words—who''s quite possibly the coolest human in the entire world as far as Alberto is concerned. He wants more than anything to impress his mentor, but it''s easier said than done.', 'With his best friend Luca away at school, Alberto is enjoying his new life in Portorosso working alongside Massimo—the imposing, tattooed, one-armed fisherman of few words—who''s quite possibly the coolest human in the entire world as far as Alberto is concerned. He wants more than anything to impress his mentor, but it''s easier said than done.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1SyTnaY0wte69oKdqxQLvxPT3hs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:876716'),
  ('861823420982999941', 'Ciao, Brother!', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Nicola Barnaba, Alessio De Leonardis', 'Giulio Base, Filippo Ascione', 'Fabrizio Nardi, Nico Di Renzo, Benedicta Boccoli, Francesca Della Ragione, Clayton Norcross, Christian Marazziti, Massimo Ceccherini, Roberto Ciufoli', null, 'Angelo is a forty-year-old messy man, nice but a bit of a scoundrel. He makes a living by selling fake paintings to rich Japanese on holiday, until one day he is unmasked and to escape the police who are hunting him he takes the first flight to an unknown destination. As luck would have it, the first plane he can catch takes him to Los Angeles. Having arrived in California penniless and with his credit cards blocked, he gets by for a few days as a bum when suddenly he comes up with a brilliant idea. Angelo, in fact, reads in a newspaper that the rich Italian-American entrepreneur Vittorio Di Spirito has died leaving a boundless inheritance to his son George, and he cannot help but notice that the dead rich man looks like his father in every way. Thanks to this resemblance, Angelo shows up at the funeral, staging a dramatic and heartfelt condolence, and then shows up at George''s villa declaring that he is his brother...', 'Angelo is a forty-year-old messy man, nice but a bit of a scoundrel. He makes a living by selling fake paintings to rich Japanese on holiday, until one day he is unmasked and to escape the police who are hunting him he takes the first flight to an unknown destination. As luck would have it, the first plane he can catch takes him to Los Angeles. Having arrived in California penniless and with his credit cards blocked, he gets by for a few days as a bum when suddenly he comes up with a brilliant idea. Angelo, in fact, reads in a newspaper that the rich Italian-American entrepreneur Vittorio Di Spirito has died leaving a boundless inheritance to his son George, and he cannot help but notice that the dead rich man looks like his father in every way. Thanks to this resemblance, Angelo shows up at the funeral, staging a dramatic and heartfelt condolence, and then shows up at George''s villa declaring that he is his brother...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t4JI9WTMduBSzwc4PTJJHOqKzbO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:400130'),
  ('847480776292955869', 'Ciao, Professore!', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Lina Wertmüller, Ilaria Cirino Pomicino, Antonio Gabrielli', 'Andrej Longo', 'Paolo Villaggio, Isa Danieli, Paolo Bonacelli, Gigio Morra, Sergio Solli, Ester Carloni, Mario Porfito, Filomena Lieto', 'R', 'A bureaucratic snafu sends Marco Tullio Sperelli, a portly, middle-aged northern Italian, to teach third grade in a poor town outside Naples', 'A bureaucratic snafu sends Marco Tullio Sperelli, a portly, middle-aged northern Italian, to teach third grade in a poor town outside Naples', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b4wZkB4FNUi7SK46Tw9kxT5oW8M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23637'),
  ('398756351897303975', 'Ciao! Manhattan', 1973, 'Documentary, Drama', 'David Weisman, John Palmer, John Palmer', 'John Palmer, David Weisman', 'Edie Sedgwick, Wesley Hayes, Isabel Jewell, Jeff Briggs, Paul America, Tom Flye, Gabriel Lampa, Pat Hartley', null, 'Fiction and documentary mingle in a freewheeling portrait of Susan Superstar, a New York celebrity on a drug-fueled downward slide that mirrors Edie Sedgwick’s own self-destructive spiral.', 'Fiction and documentary mingle in a freewheeling portrait of Susan Superstar, a New York celebrity on a drug-fueled downward slide that mirrors Edie Sedgwick’s own self-destructive spiral.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vwqnH6omAWc7EVBSGSikrCddEzM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42479'),
  ('288528042747749497', 'Ciccio Forgives, I Don''t', 1968, 'Comedy, Western', 'Marcello Ciorciolini, Ezio Palaggi, Alessandro D''Eva', 'Marcello Ciorciolini, Amedeo Sollazzo', 'Franco Franchi, Ciccio Ingrassia, Fernando Sancho, Adriano Micantoni, Mario Maranzana, Gia Sandri, Rossella Bergamonti, Renato Baldini', null, 'Franco and Ciccio are small time horse thieves who get involved with the bandit, El Diablo, and two former members of his gang who are after his gold. Fortunately two pretty, sharp shooting saloon girls come to the bumbling duo''s rescue.', 'Franco and Ciccio are small time horse thieves who get involved with the bandit, El Diablo, and two former members of his gang who are after his gold. Fortunately two pretty, sharp shooting saloon girls come to the bumbling duo''s rescue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/obBLu9RUz1BSAjGKjBjIHsJ5rlB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144968'),
  ('686836669647854369', 'Cici', 2022, 'Drama', 'Berkun Oya, Yağız Yavru', 'Berkun Oya', 'Ayça Bingöl, Okan Yalabık, Fatih Artman, Funda Eryiğit, Nur Sürer, Olgun Şimşek, Yılmaz Erdoğan, İncinur Daşdemir', null, 'A family migrates to the city after a tragic loss. When they reunite in their hometown 30 years later, buried emotions and painful secrets resurface.', 'A family migrates to the city after a tragic loss. When they reunite in their hometown 30 years later, buried emotions and painful secrets resurface.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fxNW0JZdqy39IjYMJixn9vj7B1d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1026822'),
