  ('550084120894637524', 'Cien veces no debo', 1990, 'Comedy', 'Alejandro Doria', 'Alejandro Doria', 'Norma Aleandro, Luis Brandoni, Andrea Del Boca, Federico Luppi, Darío Grandinetti, Oscar Ferrigno Jr., Verónica Llinás, Clotilde Borella', null, 'A comedy about a young girl who gets pregnant on a traditional Argentinean family.', 'A comedy about a young girl who gets pregnant on a traditional Argentinean family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/soUSqTZKkV26SNs4gH5N4ftqF9W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118192'),
  ('547474541056054125', 'Cigarette Burns', 2005, 'Horror, TV Movie', 'John Carpenter', 'Rebecca Swan, Drew McWeeny', 'Norman Reedus, Udo Kier, Christopher Redman, Chris Gauthier, Zara Taylor, Gary Hetherington, Julius Chapple, Taras Kostyuk', null, 'With a torrid past that haunts him, a movie theatre owner is hired to search for the only existing print of a film so notorious that its single screening caused the viewers to become homicidally insane.', 'With a torrid past that haunts him, a movie theatre owner is hired to search for the only existing print of a film so notorious that its single screening caused the viewers to become homicidally insane.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rXDGsLihFMoEAMjQTcnMyJePvBY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:327389'),
  ('350773919749938674', 'Cigarettes & Coffee', 1993, 'Drama, Crime', 'Paul Thomas Anderson, Vincent Baldino', 'Paul Thomas Anderson', 'Kirk Baltz, Philip Baker Hall, Scott Coffey, Kim Gillingham, Miguel Ferrer, Michael Harris, Jennifer Kaplan, Bonnie Fidelman', 'NR', 'At a desert diner, the lives of five strangers become linked through a single twenty-dollar bill. Shot for $20,000 and starring Philip Baker Hall, the short premiered at Sundance and later inspired Anderson’s debut feature Hard Eight (1996).', 'At a desert diner, the lives of five strangers become linked through a single twenty-dollar bill. Shot for $20,000 and starring Philip Baker Hall, the short premiered at Sundance and later inspired Anderson’s debut feature Hard Eight (1996).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gapJGcwC2aEtcYWPp7d5WosUsU0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107380'),
  ('1025579893923372802', 'Cigarettes et bas nylons', 2010, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Fabrice Cazeneuve, Pierre Milon', 'Jean-Claude Grumberg, Fabrice Cazeneuve', 'Adélaïde Leroux, Salomé Stévenin, Mélodie Richard, Yeelem Jappain, Nina Meurisse', null, 'France, Normandy, towards the end of World War II: Young French women are recruited as wives for American GIs. In US Army recreation camps, the so-called "Cigarette Camps", they are being prepared for their trip to the US - to men who have married them.', 'France, Normandy, towards the end of World War II: Young French women are recruited as wives for American GIs. In US Army recreation camps, the so-called "Cigarette Camps", they are being prepared for their trip to the US - to men who have married them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/laqdsL41W9qoBmgZ9WLG29I8PRt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:309337'),
  ('471690155611680746', 'Cigars of the Pharaoh', 1991, 'Animation, Adventure, Mystery, Crime, TV Movie, Action, Comedy, Family', 'Stéphane Bernasconi, Peter Hudecki', 'Aaron Barzman', 'Thierry Wermuth, Yves Barsacq, Jean-Pierre Moulin, Susan Roman, Marc Moro, Serge Sauvion, Sophie Arthuys, Serge Lhorca', null, 'While on vacation in Egypt, Tintin encounters an eccentric archaeologist who believes to have found the whereabouts of Pharaoh Kih-Oskh''s tomb. There Tintin finds a cigar marked with a strange emblem.', 'While on vacation in Egypt, Tintin encounters an eccentric archaeologist who believes to have found the whereabouts of Pharaoh Kih-Oskh''s tomb. There Tintin finds a cigar marked with a strange emblem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yj8UC8bcHJLK9AgR2sTKdSZ4jZJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:441108'),
  ('198253339925143925', 'Cimarron', 1931, 'Western, Drama', 'Wesley Ruggles, Edward Cronjager, Doran Cox', 'Howard Estabrook', 'Richard Dix, Irene Dunne, Estelle Taylor, Nance O''Neil, William Collier Jr., Roscoe Ates, George E. Stone, Stanley Fields', null, 'When the government opens up the Oklahoma territory for settlement, restless Yancey Cravat claims a plot of the free land for himself and moves his family there from Wichita. A newspaperman, lawyer, and just about everything else, Cravat soon becomes a leading citizen of the boom town of Osage. Once the town is established, however, he begins to feel confined once again, and heads for the Cherokee Strip, leaving his family behind. During this and other absences, his wife Sabra must learn to take care of herself and soon becomes prominent in her own right.', 'When the government opens up the Oklahoma territory for settlement, restless Yancey Cravat claims a plot of the free land for himself and moves his family there from Wichita. A newspaperman, lawyer, and just about everything else, Cravat soon becomes a leading citizen of the boom town of Osage. Once the town is established, however, he begins to feel confined once again, and heads for the Cherokee Strip, leaving his family behind. During this and other absences, his wife Sabra must learn to take care of herself and soon becomes prominent in her own right.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cqvfhi9s1VsTgXcV1B7vX0Cb1qA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42861'),
  ('540884105616879791', 'Cimarron', 1960, 'Western', 'Anthony Mann, Robert Surtees, Ridgeway Callow', 'Arnold Schulman', 'Glenn Ford, Maria Schell, Anne Baxter, Arthur O''Connell, Russ Tamblyn, Mercedes McCambridge, Vic Morrow, Robert Keith', 'NR', 'The epic story of a family involved in the Oklahoma Land Rush of April 22, 1889.', 'The epic story of a family involved in the Oklahoma Land Rush of April 22, 1889.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9xPw8iIAWymvNBG0D7kSt45M9c2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46623'),
  ('888152818305781512', 'Cincinnati''s Rock ''N Roll Legends', 1995, 'Documentary, Music', null, null, 'Lemon Pipers, Lonnie Mack, Rick Derringer, Hank Ballard, Vince Gill, Otis Williams, Bobby Bare, Syd Nathan', 'NR', 'An excellent comprehensive look at all the music that came out of Cincinnati, Ohio. Cincinnati "Rock Legends" "James Brown" "King Records" "Pure Prairie League" "Lemon Pipers" "Syd Nathan" WEBN "Bootsy Collins" "Lonnie Mack" "The Who concert 1979" "Rick Derringer"', 'An excellent comprehensive look at all the music that came out of Cincinnati, Ohio. Cincinnati "Rock Legends" "James Brown" "King Records" "Pure Prairie League" "Lemon Pipers" "Syd Nathan" WEBN "Bootsy Collins" "Lonnie Mack" "The Who concert 1979" "Rick Derringer"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bR5OoKHI7PwkiZzGx1auPr1PZkC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:464355'),
  ('927788298230131369', 'Cinco de Mayo: The Battle', 2013, 'War, History, Drama', 'Germán Lammers, Rafael Lara Ruiz', 'Rafael Lara Ruiz', 'Christian Vazquez, Liz Gallardo, Angélica Aragón, Kuno Becker, Ginés García Millán, Noé Hernández, Andrés Montiel, Pablo Abitia', 'R', 'On May 5th, 1862, a few thousand Mexican soldiers put their lives on the line against the world''s largest and most powerful army in one legendary battle for freedom and for Mexico.', 'On May 5th, 1862, a few thousand Mexican soldiers put their lives on the line against the world''s largest and most powerful army in one legendary battle for freedom and for Mexico.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7MAtraeiaKnTrbtzUBbc9SHkdct.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184374'),
  ('749195803391623051', 'Cinco nacos asaltan Las Vegas', 1987, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'Alfredo B. Crevenna', 'José A. Rodríguez', 'Eduardo de la Peña, Luis de Alba, Sergio Corona, Guillermo Rivas, Sergio Ramos, Lilia Prado', null, 'Five friends decide to go to Las Vegas to get money and one of them thinks of robbing a casino.', 'Five friends decide to go to Las Vegas to get money and one of them thinks of robbing a casino.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b5D0vZVFgk8Zck3jtfrhEMFeBts.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:524661'),
  ('792311514501944615', 'Cinderella', 1899, 'Drama, Family, Fantasy, Romance', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès, Bleuette Bernon, Carmelli, Jehanne d''Alcy, Dupeyron, Mlle Barral', null, 'A fairy godmother magically turns Cinderella''s rags to a beautiful dress, and a pumpkin into a coach. Cinderella goes to the ball, where she meets the Prince - but will she remember to leave before the magic runs out? Méliès based the art direction on engravings by Gustave Doré. First known example of a fairy-tale adapted to film, and the first film to use dissolves to go from one scene to another.', 'A fairy godmother magically turns Cinderella''s rags to a beautiful dress, and a pumpkin into a coach. Cinderella goes to the ball, where she meets the Prince - but will she remember to leave before the magic runs out? Méliès based the art direction on engravings by Gustave Doré. First known example of a fairy-tale adapted to film, and the first film to use dissolves to go from one scene to another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j0GSDrWtlkMQ3vH6Bxjlt8KLLvA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114108'),
  ('715659155102853337', 'Cinderella', 1922, 'Animation', 'Walt Disney, George Lowerre', 'Walt Pfeiffer', null, null, 'Cinderella, the "ash girl," is kept in menial labor by her two wicked stepsisters. Meanwhile the handsome prince of the territory is out hunting bears. His father invites everyone in the country to a ball, and a fairy godmother appears to help Cinderella attend in style. The prince falls for her, but she runs away as her fairy godmother''s deadline of midnight arrives. The prince finds her lost slipper and searches the territory for its rightful owner, hoping to live happily ever after when he finds her.', 'Cinderella, the "ash girl," is kept in menial labor by her two wicked stepsisters. Meanwhile the handsome prince of the territory is out hunting bears. His father invites everyone in the country to a ball, and a fairy godmother appears to help Cinderella attend in style. The prince falls for her, but she runs away as her fairy godmother''s deadline of midnight arrives. The prince finds her lost slipper and searches the territory for its rightful owner, hoping to live happily ever after when he finds her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/38yrNvZdoI5GLYx4DNnY3NWy9KO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154450'),
  ('53861539329368091', 'Cinderella', 1947, 'Comedy, Family, Fantasy, Romance', 'Mikhail Shapiro, Nadezhda Kosheverova, Yevgeni Shapiro', 'Yevgeni Shvarts', 'Yanina Zheymo, Aleksey Konsovskiy, Erast Garin, Faina Ranevskaya, Yelena Yunger, Tamara Sezenevskaya, Vasili Merkuryev, Aleksandr Rumnyov', null, 'In the fairy kingdom live stepmother, her evil daughters — Anna and Maryana, a limp husband-forester and his daughter from his first marriage — Cinderella. The stepmother exploits the poor girl as a housekeeper. With the help of her godmother-fairy, Cinderella gets to the royal ball, where a beautiful and very kind prince falls in love with her. At midnight, the magic ends, and poor Cinderella has to return to her former life. But on the crystal shoe that Cinderella lost while fleeing the palace to the battle of the palace chimes, the prince searches for the bride.', 'In the fairy kingdom live stepmother, her evil daughters — Anna and Maryana, a limp husband-forester and his daughter from his first marriage — Cinderella. The stepmother exploits the poor girl as a housekeeper. With the help of her godmother-fairy, Cinderella gets to the royal ball, where a beautiful and very kind prince falls in love with her. At midnight, the magic ends, and poor Cinderella has to return to her former life. But on the crystal shoe that Cinderella lost while fleeing the palace to the battle of the palace chimes, the prince searches for the bride.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ygRrn9QEgH0XlhjGaSUUuH0l8lN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42651'),
  ('795233701767673744', 'Cinderella', 1950, 'Family, Fantasy, Animation, Romance', 'Hamilton Luske, Clyde Geronimi, Wilfred Jackson', null, 'Ilene Woods, Eleanor Audley, Verna Felton, Claire Du Brey, Rhoda Williams, James MacDonald, Helene Stanley, Luis van Rooten', 'G', 'Cinderella has faith her dreams of a better life will come true. With help from her loyal mice friends and a wave of her Fairy Godmother''s wand, Cinderella''s rags are magically turned into a glorious gown and off she goes to the Royal Ball. But when the clock strikes midnight, the spell is broken, leaving a single glass slipper... the only key to the ultimate fairy-tale ending!', 'Cinderella has faith her dreams of a better life will come true. With help from her loyal mice friends and a wave of her Fairy Godmother''s wand, Cinderella''s rags are magically turned into a glorious gown and off she goes to the Royal Ball. But when the clock strikes midnight, the spell is broken, leaving a single glass slipper... the only key to the ultimate fairy-tale ending!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ug3ndicuPM1V07vhVFGLMsd4AZl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11224'),
  ('386434992502537649', 'Cinderella', 1957, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Ralph Nelson, Rowland Vance, Robert Barry', null, 'Julie Andrews, Jon Cypher, Ilka Chase, Kaye Ballard, Alice Ghostley, Edie Adams, Howard Lindsay, Dorothy Stickney', null, 'Julie Andrews was nominated for an Emmy for portraying the titular scullery maid who finds true love with a prince in this legendary adaptation of one of the most famous fairy tales of all time. A musical, made-for-television, with music by Richard Rodgers and book and lyrics by Oscar Hammerstein II, it is the only of the legendary composing team''s musicals created specifically for that medium. It was originally broadcast live on CBS on March 31, 1957, and was a phenomenal success, viewed by more than 107 million people. Though it originally aired in full color, only a black & white kinescope of the production has survived.', 'Julie Andrews was nominated for an Emmy for portraying the titular scullery maid who finds true love with a prince in this legendary adaptation of one of the most famous fairy tales of all time. A musical, made-for-television, with music by Richard Rodgers and book and lyrics by Oscar Hammerstein II, it is the only of the legendary composing team''s musicals created specifically for that medium. It was originally broadcast live on CBS on March 31, 1957, and was a phenomenal success, viewed by more than 107 million people. Though it originally aired in full color, only a black & white kinescope of the production has survived.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qx6Ttai1fzsmxj947MM2TKNbU88.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44459'),
  ('102023645529241910', 'Cinderella', 1965, 'Fantasy, Romance, TV Movie, Music', 'Ed S. Hill, Charles S. Dubin, Johnny Green', null, 'Lesley Ann Warren, Stuart Damon, Ginger Rogers, Walter Pidgeon, Celeste Holm, Jo Van Fleet, Pat Carroll, Barbara Ruick', 'G', 'After the success of the live 1957 Cinderella on CBS (with Julie Andrews), the network decided to produce another television version. The new script hewed closer to the traditional tale, although nearly all of the original songs were retained and performed in their original settings. Added to the Rodgers and Hammerstein score was "Loneliness of Evening", which had been composed for South Pacific but not used.', 'After the success of the live 1957 Cinderella on CBS (with Julie Andrews), the network decided to produce another television version. The new script hewed closer to the traditional tale, although nearly all of the original songs were retained and performed in their original settings. Added to the Rodgers and Hammerstein score was "Loneliness of Evening", which had been composed for South Pacific but not used.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/60gQBt16TakffKrR2sizX7SWJ1M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25892'),
  ('151077030215930065', 'Cinderella', 1977, 'Comedy', 'Michael Pataki, Joseph Mangine', 'Frank Ray Perilli', 'Cheryl Smith, Yana Nirvana, Jennifer Stace, Marilyn Corwin, Sy Richardson, Brett Smiley, Kirk Scott, Pamela Stonebrook', 'R', 'Cinderella, with the help of her "fairy" godmother, is granted heightened sexual prowess to win over Prince Charming. After a blindfolded orgy at the royal castle, the nerdy Prince must sleep with every willing woman in his kingdom until he finds that one, mysterious lover who so "stood out" on the night of the sex Ball.', 'Cinderella, with the help of her "fairy" godmother, is granted heightened sexual prowess to win over Prince Charming. After a blindfolded orgy at the royal castle, the nerdy Prince must sleep with every willing woman in his kingdom until he finds that one, mysterious lover who so "stood out" on the night of the sex Ball.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nLP4FSHXRTNRbMy6PYPxEAX1xkm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62752'),
  ('998049934747050789', 'Cinderella', 1979, 'Animation, Fantasy, Family', 'Ivan Aksenchuk, Boris Kotov', 'Genrikh Sapgir', 'Tatyana Shabelnikova, Igor Ivanov, Ludmila Shaposhnikova, Elvira Brunovskaya, Vsevolod Larionov', null, 'The Cinderella story.', 'The Cinderella story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nzynJDalWAfipRn2K3cGXnTbcjA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90281'),
  ('62099069541321612', 'Cinderella', 1994, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Toshiyuki Hiruma, Takashi Masunaga, Masanori Miura', null, 'Tony Ail, Nathan Aswell, Bailee Reid, Kathleen Barr, Garry Chalk, Lillian Carlson, Ian James Corlett, Michael Donovan', null, 'Cinderella, the beautiful and kind-hearted girl who lives with her greedy stepmother and two selfish stepsisters, charms a handsome prince when her fairy godmother sends her to the royal ball. She must leave the ball by midnight before all the magic is gone, but Cinderella has so much fun that she forgets all about the warning, and when she flees the castle she leaves behind one glass slipper.', 'Cinderella, the beautiful and kind-hearted girl who lives with her greedy stepmother and two selfish stepsisters, charms a handsome prince when her fairy godmother sends her to the royal ball. She must leave the ball by midnight before all the magic is gone, but Cinderella has so much fun that she forgets all about the warning, and when she flees the castle she leaves behind one glass slipper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3jXXCaUNmcBSsbVXVX2zUYuvQGS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105875'),
  ('760254777422612278', 'Cinderella', 1995, 'Animation', 'Ricky Corradi, Takaaki Ishiyama, Hiroshi Sasagawa', 'Orlando Corradi', null, null, 'Cinderella, an orphan, is now under the control of her evil stepmother and stepsisters. With the help of her friends, she is able to fall in love with the Prince, while helping him win over his own obstacles.', 'Cinderella, an orphan, is now under the control of her evil stepmother and stepsisters. With the help of her friends, she is able to fall in love with the Prince, while helping him win over his own obstacles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zgvt5rwM2rsFf6gZEZb0GfI2vSo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:431006'),
  ('147945344910514605', 'Cinderella', 1997, 'TV Movie, Family, Fantasy, Music, Romance', 'Robert Iscove, Victoria E. Rhodes, Tyrone L. Mason', null, 'Brandy Norwood, Whitney Houston, Victor Garber, Whoopi Goldberg, Bernadette Peters, Jason Alexander, Paolo Montalbán, Natalie Desselle-Reid', 'G', 'Cinderella chafes under the cruelty of her wicked stepmother and her evil stepsisters, until her Fairy Godmother steps in to change her life for one unforgettable night. At the ball, she falls for handsome Prince Christopher, whose parents, King Maximillian and Queen Constantina, are anxious for him to find a suitable paramour.', 'Cinderella chafes under the cruelty of her wicked stepmother and her evil stepsisters, until her Fairy Godmother steps in to change her life for one unforgettable night. At the ball, she falls for handsome Prince Christopher, whose parents, King Maximillian and Queen Constantina, are anxious for him to find a suitable paramour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/54awQrtekrsI11bKg2NwQrBHLIe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42884'),
  ('325841214227187622', 'Cinderella', 2000, 'Fantasy, Drama, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Alexey Rodionov, Beeban Kidron', 'Nick Dear', 'Kathleen Turner, Katrin Cartlidge, David Warner, Jane Birkin, Lucy Punch, Marcella Plunkett, Leslie Phillips, Sharon Maughan', null, 'Zezolla and her family live mid 20th century, where fashion is practically everything. As her father is won over by a selfish woman named Claudette, Cinderella must keep her new step-mother from murdering the only family she has left. Add in an anti-social mermaid literally living in a cave, a bored prince with an ear for rock n'' roll, and the glamour of the 1950''s and one''ll find that this story can''t grow old.', 'Zezolla and her family live mid 20th century, where fashion is practically everything. As her father is won over by a selfish woman named Claudette, Cinderella must keep her new step-mother from murdering the only family she has left. Add in an anti-social mermaid literally living in a cave, a bored prince with an ear for rock n'' roll, and the glamour of the 1950''s and one''ll find that this story can''t grow old.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gMYkSooSEr8bw4zbAkJf7HCN36x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:289673'),
  ('1021964888197429595', 'Cinderella', 2006, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Bong Man-dae', 'Son Kwang-soo', 'Shin Sae-kyeong, Ahn Ah-yung, Do Ji-won, Gyu-ryun Ahn, Jeon So-min, Yoo Da-in, Cho Seong-ha', null, 'With a renowned plastic surgeon for a mother, Hyun-soo is always surrounded by girls in line for beauty consultations. But her happiness comes to an end as her friends who have received facial surgery from her mother start to commit mysterious suicides by cutting out their faces.', 'With a renowned plastic surgeon for a mother, Hyun-soo is always surrounded by girls in line for beauty consultations. But her happiness comes to an end as her friends who have received facial surgery from her mother start to commit mysterious suicides by cutting out their faces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/meRMLuM4Hd29TPA3J0t15xVqRzY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41401'),
  ('1058236270110454496', 'Cinderella', 2015, 'Romance, Fantasy, Family, Drama', 'Kenneth Branagh, Leslie Tomkins, Gary Freeman', 'Chris Weitz', 'Lily James, Cate Blanchett, Richard Madden, Stellan Skarsgård, Holliday Grainger, Sophie McShera, Derek Jacobi, Helena Bonham Carter', 'PG', 'When her father unexpectedly passes away, young Ella finds herself at the mercy of her cruel stepmother and her daughters. Never one to give up hope, Ella''s fortunes begin to change after meeting a dashing stranger in the woods.', 'When her father unexpectedly passes away, young Ella finds herself at the mercy of her cruel stepmother and her daughters. Never one to give up hope, Ella''s fortunes begin to change after meeting a dashing stranger in the woods.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j91LJmcWo16CArFOoapsz84bwxb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150689'),
  ('640549557512068689', 'Cinderella', 2021, 'Fantasy, Romance, Comedy', 'Henry Braham, Kay Cannon, Chloe Kletsa', 'Kay Cannon', 'Camila Cabello, Nicholas Galitzine, Idina Menzel, Pierce Brosnan, Minnie Driver, Tallulah Greive, Billy Porter, Maddie Baillio', 'PG', 'Cinderella, an orphaned girl with an evil stepmother, has big dreams and with the help of her Fabulous Godmother, she perseveres to make them come true.', 'Cinderella, an orphaned girl with an evil stepmother, has big dreams and with the help of her Fabulous Godmother, she perseveres to make them come true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/clDFqATL4zcE7LzUwkrVj3zHvk7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:593910'),
  ('199925172298785376', 'Cinderella ''80', 1984, 'Drama, Fantasy, Romance, Music', 'Roberto Malenotti, Dante Spinotti', 'Carlo Cristallini', 'Bonnie Bianco, Pierre Cosso, Sandra Milo, Adolfo Celi, Vittorio Caprioli, Kendal Kaldwell, Sylva Koscina, Edy Angelillo', null, 'A feisty 18-year-old Italian-American New Yorker named Cindy is sent off to Rome with her irascible stepmother and vain stepsisters. On the way, she meets and falls in love with, globetrotting bagpacker Mizio, who eventually turns out to be of Italian nobility. There''s a fairy stand-in in the form of a spaced-out astrologer, a dance, and she even loses a shoe at one point. Care to venture a guess how it all turns out?', 'A feisty 18-year-old Italian-American New Yorker named Cindy is sent off to Rome with her irascible stepmother and vain stepsisters. On the way, she meets and falls in love with, globetrotting bagpacker Mizio, who eventually turns out to be of Italian nobility. There''s a fairy stand-in in the form of a spaced-out astrologer, a dance, and she even loses a shoe at one point. Care to venture a guess how it all turns out?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/69Sp3PHJ7JIuceoEL2CQzrmwUOa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70690'),
  ('810735792920295397', 'Cinderella 2000', 1977, 'Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Al Adamson, Louis Horvath', 'Budd Donnelly', 'Catharine Burgess, Jay B. Larson, Vaughn Armstrong, Renee Harmon, Erwin Fuller, Bhurni Cowans, Adina Ross, Eddie Garetti', 'R', 'In the year 2047, sex is forbidden and Big Brother uses robots to keep an eye on everyone. One young girl tries to outwit the government so she can be with the man she loves.', 'In the year 2047, sex is forbidden and Big Brother uses robots to keep an eye on everyone. One young girl tries to outwit the government so she can be with the man she loves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pL2nAxPeHv65NolZrx78KQRqZZA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29420'),
  ('235630407538524391', 'Cinderella and the Secret Prince', 2018, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Lynne Southerland', 'Francis Glebas, Stephanie Bursill, Russell Fung', 'Cassandra Lee Morris, Stephen Mendel, R. Martin Klein, Stephanie Sanditz, Terrence Stone, Wendee Lee, Kirsten Day, Chris Niosi', 'PG', 'Cinderella discovers a secret that could shake their world: an evil witch turned the prince into a mouse and replaced him with a look-alike. Cinderella and her friends must save the real prince and help him defeat the evil witch.', 'Cinderella discovers a secret that could shake their world: an evil witch turned the prince into a mouse and replaced him with a look-alike. Cinderella and her friends must save the real prince and help him defeat the evil witch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4oIIM7i4sFPyGFWP0GYZo3pNAH7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:543583'),
  ('749884672440882176', 'Cinderella Baiana', 1998, 'Drama, Music, Comedy, Family, Romance', 'Conrado Sanchez, Conrado Sanchez, Raquel Shaw', 'Conrado Sanchez', 'Carla Perez, Alexandre Pires, Perry Salles, Val Perré, Fábio Vidal, Lázaro Ramos, Antônio Cozido, Lucci Ferreira', null, 'A poor family, lives in a city near Salvador. The father is cleaner and, mother and daughter help making small services. Until they decide to try the luck in the big city and the father, João, get a job near Pelourinho, next to a dance academy. The daughter, Carla, in contacting music, discovers her true vocation and becomes a very successful dancer. But she does not let himself take away from fame and back to his origins, meets with poor children and teaches them to dance.', 'A poor family, lives in a city near Salvador. The father is cleaner and, mother and daughter help making small services. Until they decide to try the luck in the big city and the father, João, get a job near Pelourinho, next to a dance academy. The daughter, Carla, in contacting music, discovers her true vocation and becomes a very successful dancer. But she does not let himself take away from fame and back to his origins, meets with poor children and teaches them to dance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Ypi8NxzwSGRTMVJ3Phncg6JRJe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81876'),
  ('769537644245662424', 'Cinderella II: Dreams Come True', 2002, 'Family, Animation, Romance, Fantasy', 'John Kafka, Kenichi Tsuchiya, Takeshi Atomura', 'Tom Rogers, Jill E. Blotevogel, Jule Selbo', 'Jennifer Hale, Rob Paulsen, Corey Burton, Andre Stojka, Russi Taylor, Susanne Blakeslee, Tress MacNeille, Holland Taylor', 'G', 'As a newly crowned princess, Cinderella quickly learns that life at the Palace - and her royal responsibilities - are more challenging than she had imagined. In three heartwarming tales, Cinderella calls on her animal friends and her Fairy Godmother to help as she brings her own grace and charm to her regal role and discovers that being true to yourself is the best way to make your dreams come true.', 'As a newly crowned princess, Cinderella quickly learns that life at the Palace - and her royal responsibilities - are more challenging than she had imagined. In three heartwarming tales, Cinderella calls on her animal friends and her Fairy Godmother to help as she brings her own grace and charm to her regal role and discovers that being true to yourself is the best way to make your dreams come true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kEDbtKhZsqPo7ypCzoz3fkq73Pc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14128'),
  ('697998662721224657', 'Cinderella III: A Twist in Time', 2007, 'Animation, Romance, Family, Fantasy', 'Frank Nissen', 'Dan Berendsen, Margaret Heidenry, Colleen Millea Ventimilia', 'Jennifer Hale, Christopher Daniel Barnes, Susanne Blakeslee, Tress MacNeille, Russi Taylor, Andre Stojka, Holland Taylor, Rob Paulsen', 'G', 'When Lady Tremaine steals the Fairy Godmother''s wand and changes history, it''s up to Cinderella to restore the timeline and reclaim her prince.', 'When Lady Tremaine steals the Fairy Godmother''s wand and changes history, it''s up to Cinderella to restore the timeline and reclaim her prince.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9QzKXbQfPp59iZ3rwnkKEAkPaXx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16119'),
  ('278847979098786372', 'Cinderella Liberty', 1973, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Charles Bonniwell, Tim Zinnemann, Mark Rydell', 'Darryl Ponicsan', 'James Caan, Marsha Mason, Kirk Calloway, Eli Wallach, Burt Young, Bruno Kirby, Allyn Ann McLerie, Dabney Coleman', 'R', 'A lonely Navy sailor falls in love with a Seattle hooker and becomes a surrogate father figure for her son during an extended liberty due to his service records being lost.', 'A lonely Navy sailor falls in love with a Seattle hooker and becomes a surrogate father figure for her son during an extended liberty due to his service records being lost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eySmZJyPAJ4nQDvrpU59NSCbZHI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84847'),
  ('265258552119065957', 'Cinderella Man', 2005, 'Romance, Drama, History', 'Salvatore Totino, Ron Howard, William M. Connor', 'Akiva Goldsman, Cliff Hollingsworth', 'Russell Crowe, Renée Zellweger, Paul Giamatti, Craig Bierko, Paddy Considine, Bruce McGill, David Huband, Connor Price', 'PG-13', 'The true story of boxer Jim Braddock who, following his retirement in the 1930s, makes a surprise comeback in order to lift his family out of poverty.', 'The true story of boxer Jim Braddock who, following his retirement in the 1930s, makes a surprise comeback in order to lift his family out of poverty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wkeOjIcpuqLMW4GnVowlM9VI0JE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:921'),
  ('863210575336359376', 'Cinderella or The Glass Slipper', 1912, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Louise Lagrange, Jacques Feyder, Marthe Vinot', null, 'Georges Méliès''s first attempt at Cinderella was in 1899. That film was extraordinary then for having multiple scenes and a semblance of a narrative; additionally, the use of dissolves as transitions in it influenced other filmmakers for years to do the same. Méliès was the cinema world''s preeminent leader then. By 1912, however, that was no longer the case; frankly, as evidenced by this feature, his style had become dated. Moreover, Méliès had begun to adopt techniques from other filmmakers, such as direct cuts instead of dissolves, and there''s even a match on action shot during the slipper trying-on scene.', 'Georges Méliès''s first attempt at Cinderella was in 1899. That film was extraordinary then for having multiple scenes and a semblance of a narrative; additionally, the use of dissolves as transitions in it influenced other filmmakers for years to do the same. Méliès was the cinema world''s preeminent leader then. By 1912, however, that was no longer the case; frankly, as evidenced by this feature, his style had become dated. Moreover, Méliès had begun to adopt techniques from other filmmakers, such as direct cuts instead of dissolves, and there''s even a match on action shot during the slipper trying-on scene.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tBA5kfn2MQtoLNx8TTmSDQ7m3Jb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:193890'),
  ('65802621432171114', 'Cinderella the Cat', 2017, 'Animation, Crime, Thriller', 'Ivan Cappiello, Marino Guarnieri, Alessandro Rak', 'Ivan Cappiello, Marino Guarnieri, Alessandro Rak', 'Massimiliano Gallo, Maria Pia Calzone, Alessandro Gassmann, Daniele Bigliardo, Marino Guarnieri, Renato Carpentieri, Antonio Brachi, Luciano Stella', null, 'Cenerentola struggles to escape the shadow and evil schemes of her stepmother and six stepsisters who all live aboard the Megaride, a ship stuck in the port of a decaying future Naples.', 'Cenerentola struggles to escape the shadow and evil schemes of her stepmother and six stepsisters who all live aboard the Megaride, a ship stuck in the port of a decaying future Naples.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9BgTsTWDJCGJYiOKa0JjrMR9tr4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:471880'),
  ('505661501699228692', 'Cinderella: Once Upon a Time in the West', 2012, 'Animation, Family, Action, Adventure, Western', 'Pascal Hérold, Louise Durand, Patrice Vilacèque', 'Pascal Hérold, Alexandre Apergis, Jérôme Apergis', 'Alexandra Lamy, Yolande Moreau, Michel Boujenah, Isabelle Nanty, Antoine de Caunes, Philippe Peythieu, Véronique Augereau, Audrey Lamy', null, 'Cinderella is transformed for a night at the royal ball, but finds herself battling a band of gorilla pirates who have kidnapped Prince Vladimir and the Duchess. Will she have time to save the day and fall in love before the clock strikes twelve?', 'Cinderella is transformed for a night at the royal ball, but finds herself battling a band of gorilla pirates who have kidnapped Prince Vladimir and the Duchess. Will she have time to save the day and fall in love before the clock strikes twelve?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/leIJVSig4Borhku5BheQOY30jEs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123506'),
  ('824569982833344352', 'Cinderella''s Curse', 2024, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Louisa Warren', 'Harrison Thomas Boxley', 'Kelly Rian Sanson, Chrissie Wunna, Natasha Tosini, Lauren Budd, Danielle Scott, Sam Barrett, Charlotte Coleman, Peter Watson', null, 'Desperate Cinderella summons her fairy godmother from an ancient flesh-bound book, seeking revenge on her evil stepmother and stepsisters who abuse and torment her daily.', 'Desperate Cinderella summons her fairy godmother from an ancient flesh-bound book, seeking revenge on her evil stepmother and stepsisters who abuse and torment her daily.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8M4G8mRPCFE3kkNhDyUd5KpKiAs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1130053'),
  ('297207747264038786', 'Cinderella''s Hot Night', 2017, 'Fantasy, Comedy', 'Terrance Ryker, Dean McKendrick', 'Suzanne Cabot', 'Karlie Montana, Christine Nguyen, Beverly Lynne, Sarah Hunter, Blair Williams, Penny Pax, Kyle Knies, Ryan Driller', null, 'Cinderella''s Hot Night presents a lively retelling of the classic fairy tale...with a slightly more mature, erotic twist. Follow the adventures of the bewildered Cindy as she falls prey to her wicked sex-crazed benefactor all the while pining for her secret love, a noble European Prince. With the help of her smoking hot Fairy Godmother, Cindy finally realizes her dream of becoming a real-life Princess.', 'Cinderella''s Hot Night presents a lively retelling of the classic fairy tale...with a slightly more mature, erotic twist. Follow the adventures of the bewildered Cindy as she falls prey to her wicked sex-crazed benefactor all the while pining for her secret love, a noble European Prince. With the help of her smoking hot Fairy Godmother, Cindy finally realizes her dream of becoming a real-life Princess.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9CwaR4p3CK0NAIbZ72LrqUENJup.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:452030'),
  ('728482081583687143', 'Cinderella''s Revenge', 2024, 'Fantasy, Horror', 'Andy Edwards, Liam Hejsak, Fred Searle', 'Tom Jolliffe', 'Natasha Henstridge, Lauren Staerck, Stephanie Lodge, Beatrice Fletcher, Megan Purvis, Darrell Griggs, Ricardo Freitas, Zach Devereux', null, 'Cinderella finds freedom from her wicked stepmother with the help of her fairy godmother. Only this time, they unleash a plan of bloody vengeance.', 'Cinderella finds freedom from her wicked stepmother with the help of her fairy godmother. Only this time, they unleash a plan of bloody vengeance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cYB3SHhITJSbRoisgn9QQTP8YkZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1140847'),
  ('72641199344126046', 'Cinderello', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Beto Gómez', 'Francisco Payó González, Beto Gómez', 'William Levy, Joaquín Cosío, Miguel Rodarte, Eva Arias, Stephany Liriano, Hans Martinez, Solly Duran, Fady Kerko', null, 'Marlon, an insecure and not-so-attractive photographer, is hit with a spell that every night transforms him into Brando, a handsome womanizer. Things will get harder when the spell becomes his biggest obstacle to obtain true love.', 'Marlon, an insecure and not-so-attractive photographer, is hit with a spell that every night transforms him into Brando, a handsome womanizer. Things will get harder when the spell becomes his biggest obstacle to obtain true love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c1AgMptn6mnC25wgGfo8tiZodST.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:568106'),
  ('167874236317290668', 'Cinderfella', 1960, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Music', 'Frank Tashlin, Haskell B. Boggs, Ralph Axness', 'Frank Tashlin', 'Jerry Lewis, Ed Wynn, Judith Anderson, Henry Silva, Robert Hutton, Anna Maria Alberghetti, Count Basie, Joe Williams', 'NR', 'When his father dies, poor Fella is left at the mercy of his snobbish stepmother and her two no-good sons Maximilian and Rupert. As he slaves away for his nasty step-family, Maximilian and Rupert attempt to find a treasure Fella''s father has supposedly hidden on the estate. Hoping to restore her dwindling fortunes, the stepmother plans a fancy ball in honor of the visiting Princess Charmein whom she hopes will marry Rupert. Eventually, Fella''s Fairy Godfather shows up to convince him that he has a shot at winning the Princess himself.', 'When his father dies, poor Fella is left at the mercy of his snobbish stepmother and her two no-good sons Maximilian and Rupert. As he slaves away for his nasty step-family, Maximilian and Rupert attempt to find a treasure Fella''s father has supposedly hidden on the estate. Hoping to restore her dwindling fortunes, the stepmother plans a fancy ball in honor of the visiting Princess Charmein whom she hopes will marry Rupert. Eventually, Fella''s Fairy Godfather shows up to convince him that he has a shot at winning the Princess himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5vjqG69ktqkWjmrzdUKuRDDcJF4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18973'),
  ('102337302737216505', 'Cindy La Regia', 2020, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Catalina Aguilar Mastretta, Santiago Limón', 'María Hinojos', 'Cassandra Sánchez Navarro, Regina Blandón, Diana Bovio, Nicolasa Ortíz Monasterio, Isela Vega, Giuseppe Gamba, Roberto Quijano, Enoc Leaño', null, 'When Cindy decides that she doesn''t want to marry her boyfriend, she runs to Mexico City, where new friendships and unexpected paths teach her that there are so much more possibilities on her life and her talent than she imagines.', 'When Cindy decides that she doesn''t want to marry her boyfriend, she runs to Mexico City, where new friendships and unexpected paths teach her that there are so much more possibilities on her life and her talent than she imagines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1KGbMtuySUtRggWlYPXyTWFcxLx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:579792'),
  ('828311840626257621', 'Cine Holliúdy', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Halder Gomes, Carina Sanginitto, Mikaela Feitosa', 'Halder Gomes', 'Edmilson Filho, Miriam Freeland, Joel Gomes, Roberto Bomtempo, Angeles Woo, Fiorella Mattheis, Márcio Greyck, Falcão', null, 'During the seventies, the massive arrival of television in the Brazilian countryside puts in jeopardy the business of running small movie theaters. Francisgleydisson is the owner of Cine Holliudy, and he must be extremely creative to keep his passion for cinema alive.', 'During the seventies, the massive arrival of television in the Brazilian countryside puts in jeopardy the business of running small movie theaters. Francisgleydisson is the owner of Cine Holliudy, and he must be extremely creative to keep his passion for cinema alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rvTLvv9hxJEcdLfbhOWtZP7swkh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:214355'),
  ('924819903093207836', 'Cine Holliúdy 2: A Chibata Sideral', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Halder Gomes, Carina Sanginitto, Mikaela Feitosa', 'L.G. Bayão, Halder Gomes, Edmilson Filho', 'Edmilson Filho, Miriam Freeland, Ariclenes Barroso, Roberto Bomtempo, Samantha Schmütz, Gorete Milagres, Falcão, Milhem Cortaz', null, 'With the arrival of the VCR in people''s homes, Francisgleydisson is forced to close his beloved Cine Holliudy. This jeopardizes your son''s college tuition, now 18 years old. To salvage his situation, he decides to produce an alien movie using the ugliest people in the local population.', 'With the arrival of the VCR in people''s homes, Francisgleydisson is forced to close his beloved Cine Holliudy. This jeopardizes your son''s college tuition, now 18 years old. To salvage his situation, he decides to produce an alien movie using the ugliest people in the local population.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q0F73jsNQNAr2825JRz90SFC18s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:555793'),
  ('893535616998321566', 'Cinema Hong Kong: Kung Fu', 2003, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Ian Taylor, Hamdani Milas', 'Ian Taylor', 'Jackie Chan, Jet Li, John Woo, Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Sek Kin, Lau Kar-Leung, Shannon Yao, Terry Tong Gei-Ming', null, 'Filmmaker Ian Taylor examines the impressive legacy of Hong Kong cinema -- specifically, how martial arts crossed borders and become an international phenomenon -- with the help of footage and interviews with the stars who made the genre what it is today. Director Lau Ka Leung (who helmed The 36th Chamber of Shaolin) joins in, sharing his thoughts on how certain cinematic technologies have improved martial arts films and expanded their appeal, on the set of Drunken Monkey (2003).', 'Filmmaker Ian Taylor examines the impressive legacy of Hong Kong cinema -- specifically, how martial arts crossed borders and become an international phenomenon -- with the help of footage and interviews with the stars who made the genre what it is today. Director Lau Ka Leung (who helmed The 36th Chamber of Shaolin) joins in, sharing his thoughts on how certain cinematic technologies have improved martial arts films and expanded their appeal, on the set of Drunken Monkey (2003).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/itZn7x7TpRltlfZF4Xz9eHqfomK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118545'),
  ('412432979108001076', 'Cinema Novo', 2016, 'Documentary, History', 'Eryk Rocha', 'Juan Posada, Eryk Rocha', 'Nelson Pereira dos Santos, Glauber Rocha, Leon Hirszman, Joaquim Pedro de Andrade, Carlos Diegues, Paulo César Saraceni, Ruy Guerra, Luiz Carlos Barreto', null, 'A deep investigation, in the way of a poetic essay, on one of the main Latin American movements in cinema, analyzed via the thoughts of its main authors, who invented, in the early 1960s, a new way of making movies in Brazil, with a political attitude, always near to people''s problems, that combined art and revolution.', 'A deep investigation, in the way of a poetic essay, on one of the main Latin American movements in cinema, analyzed via the thoughts of its main authors, who invented, in the early 1960s, a new way of making movies in Brazil, with a political attitude, always near to people''s problems, that combined art and revolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tKPqAg486tpjt0FlPoDRDzo85Tn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:398488'),
  ('107861660836169202', 'Cinema Paradiso', 1988, 'Drama, Romance', 'Giuseppe Tornatore, Blasco Giurato, Giuseppe Giglietti', 'Vanna Paoli', 'Philippe Noiret, Jacques Perrin, Marco Leonardi, Salvatore Cascio, Agnese Nano, Antonella Attili, Pupella Maggio, Enzo Cannavale', 'PG', 'A filmmaker recalls his childhood, when he fell in love with the movies at his village''s theater and formed a deep friendship with the theater''s projectionist.', 'A filmmaker recalls his childhood, when he fell in love with the movies at his village''s theater and formed a deep friendship with the theater''s projectionist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gCI2AeMV4IHSewhJkzsur5MEp6R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11216'),
  ('321051546936505923', 'Cinema Perverso', 2015, 'Documentary, History', 'Oliver Schwehm', 'Oliver Schwehm', 'Jörg Buttgereit, Uwe Boll, Ben Becker, Mechthild Großmann, Wolfgang Niedecken, Christian Anders, René Weller, Kai Novak', null, 'Before there were home video formats and the internet, the “Bahnhofskinos” (“Train station cinemas”) in West Germany regularly showed trash and erotica movies. Various filmmakers and especially contemporary witnesses recount in the documentary “Cinema Perverso – the wonderful and broken world of Bahnhofskino” their experiences and impressions.', 'Before there were home video formats and the internet, the “Bahnhofskinos” (“Train station cinemas”) in West Germany regularly showed trash and erotica movies. Various filmmakers and especially contemporary witnesses recount in the documentary “Cinema Perverso – the wonderful and broken world of Bahnhofskino” their experiences and impressions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/upkOVc3zxkPIjK3PHNVTbgg2HFr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:364935'),
  ('703902801693109732', 'Cinema Verite', 2011, 'Drama', 'Robert Pulcini, Affonso Beato, Shari Springer Berman', 'David Seltzer', 'Diane Lane, Tim Robbins, James Gandolfini, Thomas Dekker, Caitlin Custer, Kaitlyn Dever, Nick Eversman, Johnny Simmons', 'PG-13', 'In 1973, the Loud family became a television sensation of a new kind. It was long before a metal rock star showed his eccentric family on the small screen and decades before housewives had screaming matches with each other on camera in public. CINEMA VERITE tells the behind-the-scenes story of the groundbreaking documentary "An American Family," which chronicled the lives of the Louds in the early 1970s and catapulted the Santa Barbara family to notoriety while creating a new television genre: the reality TV series.', 'In 1973, the Loud family became a television sensation of a new kind. It was long before a metal rock star showed his eccentric family on the small screen and decades before housewives had screaming matches with each other on camera in public. CINEMA VERITE tells the behind-the-scenes story of the groundbreaking documentary "An American Family," which chronicled the lives of the Louds in the early 1970s and catapulted the Santa Barbara family to notoriety while creating a new television genre: the reality TV series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yyXW04JEfVHBoK6ijeHiBle0odo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64566'),
  ('643990061787422582', 'Cinema, Aspirins and Vultures', 2005, 'Drama', 'Marcelo Gomes, Mauro Pinheiro Jr., Júlia Pacheco Jordão', 'Karim Aïnouz, Marcelo Gomes, Paulo Caldas', 'Peter Ketnath, João Miguel, Mano Fialho, Francisco Figueiredo, Arilson Lopes, José Leite, Zezita Matos, Hermila Guedes', null, '1942, in the middle of Northeastern Brazil, two very different men meet along the road: Johan, an aspirin salesman avoiding the German draft, and Ranulpho, a rural Brazilian seeking escape from the drought.', '1942, in the middle of Northeastern Brazil, two very different men meet along the road: Johan, an aspirin salesman avoiding the German draft, and Ranulpho, a rural Brazilian seeking escape from the drought.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8lCLU3vMgauPutirtcbHDC3pRUI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43420'),
  ('978006523933846995', 'CineMagia: The Story of São Paulo''s Video Stores', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Alan Oliveira', 'Alan Oliveira', 'Rubens Ewald Filho, Raphael Cubakowic, André Sturm, Oceano Vieira de Melo, Carlos Cardoso, Carlos Mota, José Neto, Bruno Pereira', null, 'Before the streaming era, the video stores were the key for the beginning of home video experience in Brazil. The documentary narrates the history of São Paulo''s mom-and-pop video stores from its appearance to the vanishing of this platform. Owners, employees, customers and critics talk about the experience of renting a movie.', 'Before the streaming era, the video stores were the key for the beginning of home video experience in Brazil. The documentary narrates the history of São Paulo''s mom-and-pop video stores from its appearance to the vanishing of this platform. Owners, employees, customers and critics talk about the experience of renting a movie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vhGsHyw9rAVljiUUJUqTKf0S7ep.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:367915'),
  ('705656484692675719', 'Cineman', 2009, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Yann Moix, Jérôme Alméras, Rémy Chevrin', 'Olivier Dazat', 'Franck Dubosc, Lucy Gordon, Pierre-François Martin-Laval, Jean-Christophe Bouvet, Anne Marivin, Michel Galabru, Pierre Richard, Olivier Dazat', null, 'A maths teacher acquires the power to travel into movies to save the woman of his dreams and bring her back to her correct film.', 'A maths teacher acquires the power to travel into movies to save the woman of his dreams and bring her back to her correct film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i2JBMCJ5ssdwIQhaqY9I3CgIA7X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34279'),
  ('1069808695363468541', 'Cinemania', 2002, 'Documentary', 'Stephen Kijak, Angela Christlieb, Angela Christlieb', null, 'Jack Angstreich, Eric Chadbourne, Bill Heidbreder, Roberta Hill, Harvey Schwarz, Richard Aidala, Tia Bonacore', null, 'This documentary about the culture of intense cinephilia in New York City reveals the impassioned world of five obsessed movie buffs. These human encyclopedias of cinema see two to five films a day, and from 600 to 2,000 films per year. This is the story of their lives, their memories, their unbending habits and the films they love.', 'This documentary about the culture of intense cinephilia in New York City reveals the impassioned world of five obsessed movie buffs. These human encyclopedias of cinema see two to five films a day, and from 600 to 2,000 films per year. This is the story of their lives, their memories, their unbending habits and the films they love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yDxDCCxuyDx6MrJkLqZwcvPWamq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51230'),
  ('700124954775196035', 'Cinerama''s Russian Adventure', 1966, 'Documentary', 'Solomon Kogan, Roman Karmen, Boris Dolin', 'Homer McCoy', 'Bing Crosby', 'G', 'Following an introduction by Bing Crosby, the Cinerama screen widens for scenes of landscapes, cities, peoples, and entertainments of the Soviet Union. Highlights include the historic buildings and churches of Moscow, as the Kremlin; its subway and streets, a spring carnival, the seaside resorts on the Black Sea, a trip down the Volga River, skiers, a troika racing along a snow-covered road, a helicopter view of the North Pole, an Antarctic whale hunt, the capture of a wild boar in the Moyun-Kum of Central Asia, a race by reindeer-drawn sleds, divers in the Sea of Okhotsk, battling an octopus, the capture of antelopes, rafting logs down the Tisza River, and the development of new towns in Siberia. Other scenes include a visit to the Moscow Circus, where the renowned clown Oleg Popov performs, the dancing of the Moiseyev and Piatnitsky companies, and excerpts from the repertoire of the Bolshoi Theater Ballet.', 'Following an introduction by Bing Crosby, the Cinerama screen widens for scenes of landscapes, cities, peoples, and entertainments of the Soviet Union. Highlights include the historic buildings and churches of Moscow, as the Kremlin; its subway and streets, a spring carnival, the seaside resorts on the Black Sea, a trip down the Volga River, skiers, a troika racing along a snow-covered road, a helicopter view of the North Pole, an Antarctic whale hunt, the capture of a wild boar in the Moyun-Kum of Central Asia, a race by reindeer-drawn sleds, divers in the Sea of Okhotsk, battling an octopus, the capture of antelopes, rafting logs down the Tisza River, and the development of new towns in Siberia. Other scenes include a visit to the Moscow Circus, where the renowned clown Oleg Popov performs, the dancing of the Moiseyev and Piatnitsky companies, and excerpts from the repertoire of the Bolshoi Theater Ballet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/euPv3fYW5ZbsoBYxAkyjf8aM1KQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:421230'),
  ('1104244446491724077', 'Cingöz Recai', 2017, 'Action, Adventure, Crime', 'Onur Ünlü, Vedat Özdemir', null, 'Kenan İmirzalıoğlu, Haluk Bilginer, Meryem Uzerli, Musa Uzunlar, Fatih Artman, Algı Eke, Ushan Çakır, Selim Bayraktar', null, 'An ex-thief returns for the revange of his father''s murder makes an intelligent plan to reach the killer, a godfather named as Ghost. During his robbery operations, he plays with the police chief who is trying to stop him. In his final robbery, he finds something different than what he expects, something bigger.', 'An ex-thief returns for the revange of his father''s murder makes an intelligent plan to reach the killer, a godfather named as Ghost. During his robbery operations, he plays with the police chief who is trying to stop him. In his final robbery, he finds something different than what he expects, something bigger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nCLIYFDgmgohaEsBuGYx7G2XU8k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:474716'),
  ('1032258678500893486', 'Cinque secondi', 2025, 'Drama', 'Paolo Virzì, Luca Bigazzi, Elisabetta Boni', 'Paolo Virzì, Francesco Bruni, Carlo Virzì', 'Valerio Mastandrea, Galatea Bellugi, Valeria Bruni Tedeschi, Ilaria Spada, Anna Ferraioli Ravel, Andrea Palma, Pietro Paschini, Claudio Segaluscio', null, 'Who is that scruffy-looking guy who lives alone in the renovated stables of Villa Guelfi? He spends his days doing nothing and avoiding contact with everyone. And when he realizes that a community of young people has settled illegally in the villa and is dedicated to caring for the abandoned countryside and vineyards, he gets nervous and wants to chase them away. They are students, recent graduates, agronomists, and among them is Matilde, who was born there and worked in the vineyard with her grandfather, Count Guelfo Guelfi, as a child. They too are intrigued by this misanthropic gentleman with a mysterious past: why does he live there alone and refuse to have contact with anyone? As the seasons pass, the conflict with this community of young men and women turns into coexistence, and eventually into an alliance. And Adriano finds himself looking after, in his brusque way, the young Countess Matilde, who is pregnant by one of the young men...', 'Who is that scruffy-looking guy who lives alone in the renovated stables of Villa Guelfi? He spends his days doing nothing and avoiding contact with everyone. And when he realizes that a community of young people has settled illegally in the villa and is dedicated to caring for the abandoned countryside and vineyards, he gets nervous and wants to chase them away. They are students, recent graduates, agronomists, and among them is Matilde, who was born there and worked in the vineyard with her grandfather, Count Guelfo Guelfi, as a child. They too are intrigued by this misanthropic gentleman with a mysterious past: why does he live there alone and refuse to have contact with anyone? As the seasons pass, the conflict with this community of young men and women turns into coexistence, and eventually into an alliance. And Adriano finds himself looking after, in his brusque way, the young Countess Matilde, who is pregnant by one of the young men...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5hPjY75ddE90l6XzfAC6zrMRnNg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1368519'),
  ('1128931443088664376', 'Cipher', 1989, 'Animation, Drama', 'Yukari Kobayashi, Tsuneo Tominaga, Motoaki Ikegami', 'Yuko Sakurai, Machiko Kondo', 'Jay Kabira, Elly Narita, Mark Helgesen, Jennifer Watt, Eugene Nomura, Lisa Patrick, Yuko Yunokawa, Yoko Narahashi', null, 'Two brothers are in the spotlight: one a movie star making a football movie, the other a musician who occasionally goes to school (to cover for his sibling). What will destiny bring them?', 'Two brothers are in the spotlight: one a movie star making a football movie, the other a musician who occasionally goes to school (to cover for his sibling). What will destiny bring them?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fLl3dRazLrcq0mjmVhm4s7hjLbP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:390539'),
  ('881909093201206010', 'Cipollino', 1961, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Boris Dyozhkin, Elena Petrova', 'Mstislav Pashchenko', 'Nina Gulyayeva, Vera Orlova, Anastasiya Georgiyevskaya, Erast Garin, Sergei Martinson, Grigoriy Shpigel, Georgiy Vitsin, Yuri Khrzhanovsky', null, 'In a world inhabited by anthropomorphic produce, "Cipollino, the Onion Boy" fights the unjust treatment of his fellow vegetable townsfolk by the fruit royalty (Prince Lemon and the overly proud Lord Tomato) in the garden kingdom.', 'In a world inhabited by anthropomorphic produce, "Cipollino, the Onion Boy" fights the unjust treatment of his fellow vegetable townsfolk by the fruit royalty (Prince Lemon and the overly proud Lord Tomato) in the garden kingdom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aLhBO9lmwHAnmhi3jhF2fTaXxVD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91142'),
  ('1064790184268081704', 'Circle', 2015, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Mystery, Thriller', 'Zoran Popović, Aaron Hann, Mario Miscione', 'Aaron Hann, Mario Miscione', 'Julie Benz, Carter Jenkins, Cesar Garcia, Mercy Malick, Lisa Pelikan, Molly Jackson, Sara Sanderson, Michael Nardelli', 'NR', 'In a massive, mysterious chamber, fifty strangers awaken to find themselves trapped with no memory of how they got there. Organized in an inward-facing circle and unable to move, they quickly learn that every two minutes, one of them must die…executed by a strange device in the center of the room.', 'In a massive, mysterious chamber, fifty strangers awaken to find themselves trapped with no memory of how they got there. Organized in an inward-facing circle and unable to move, they quickly learn that every two minutes, one of them must die…executed by a strange device in the center of the room.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hbIL53MdZFJXsgxXaSOVuApWTs8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:335866'),
  ('238683471582098699', 'Circle Line', 2023, 'Action, Horror', 'James Hia, J. D. Chua', 'Siew Pek Chye, Allan Ho, Andrew Ngin Chiang Meng', 'Jesseca Liu, Andie Chen, Peter Yu, Patrick Lee, Nathaniel Ng, Alan Tan, Ashley Seow, Johnny Ng', null, 'Trapped in the underground train tunnel system, a single mother’s resolve to protect her son is tested to the extreme as both of them are the few remaining survivors of an attack by a monster. Meanwhile in the control room, duty engineers fight desperately to rescue the trapped survivors.', 'Trapped in the underground train tunnel system, a single mother’s resolve to protect her son is tested to the extreme as both of them are the few remaining survivors of an attack by a monster. Meanwhile in the control room, duty engineers fight desperately to rescue the trapped survivors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i2F9mk8ssi6hVHwYiV3DbxDfRq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1055733'),
  ('1058489858246372694', 'Circle of Atonement', 2015, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Lee Dong-ha, Park Eun-kyung, Jeon Dae-seong', 'Park Eun-kyung, Lee Dong-ha', 'Sung Dong-il, Kim Yoo-jung, Son Ho-jun, Seo Yea-ji, Jin Kyung, Jo Eun-joo, Lim Hyung-jun, Nam Il-woo', null, 'A policeman discovers a love affair between his teenage daughter and her teacher which leads him back to an unsolved murder case he investigated 10 years ago.', 'A policeman discovers a love affair between his teenage daughter and her teacher which leads him back to an unsolved murder case he investigated 10 years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wrCblCof6wRPi6m7mN3VtuzptBO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:366445'),
  ('702811564703114448', 'Circle of Danger', 1951, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Oswald Morris, Jacques Tourneur, Gilbert Taylor', 'Philip MacDonald', 'Ray Milland, Patricia Roc, Marius Goring, Hugh Sinclair, Naunton Wayne, Edward Rigby, Marjorie Fielding, John Bailey', 'NR', 'An American comes to Britain to investigate the murky circumstances of his brother''s death that occurred during a WW2 commando raid.', 'An American comes to Britain to investigate the murky circumstances of his brother''s death that occurred during a WW2 commando raid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fwRcaUO6RuyiLge7cLIp1uNXYPN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49368'),
  ('1125412238834128875', 'Circle of Deceit', 1981, 'Drama, War', 'Volker Schlöndorff, Igor Luther', 'Jean-Claude Carrière, Margarethe von Trotta, Volker Schlöndorff', 'Bruno Ganz, Hanna Schygulla, Jerzy Skolimowski, Jean Carmet, Gila von Weitershausen, Peter Martin Urtel, Hans Peter Korff, Fouad Naim', null, 'To escape his crumbling marriage, German journalist Laschen travels to Beirut during the fights between Christians and Palestinians to produce an essay. Together with his photographer, he meets some influential people and discovers the everyday face of the war.', 'To escape his crumbling marriage, German journalist Laschen travels to Beirut during the fights between Christians and Palestinians to produce an essay. Together with his photographer, he meets some influential people and discovers the everyday face of the war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eJbpcEUxJvWPlqu3Qe2LB6w3LaE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65002'),
  ('688360592725436065', 'Circle of Eight', 2009, 'Mystery, Horror', 'Stephen Cragg, Michael Lohmann, Sage Asteak', 'Dave Brewman, Brian Horiuchi', 'Austin Highsmith Garces, Ryan Doom, Katie Lowes, Josh Kelly, John Bishop, Natashia Williams, Jesse Johnson, DJ Qualls', 'NR', 'Jessica moves into a loft on the eighth floor of a Los Angeles apartment building called The Dante. The other tenants all seem friendly at first, but when she starts witnessing horrible deaths, she must team up with her neighbor Evan (Doom) to solve the mystery -- and uncover her own connection to the place.', 'Jessica moves into a loft on the eighth floor of a Los Angeles apartment building called The Dante. The other tenants all seem friendly at first, but when she starts witnessing horrible deaths, she must team up with her neighbor Evan (Doom) to solve the mystery -- and uncover her own connection to the place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8vYv3AardmZ1kMVnQtDTqVETRmT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31687'),
  ('294755010686034511', 'Circle of Friends', 1995, 'Drama, Romance', 'Pat O''Connor, Kenneth MacMillan, Terence A. Clegg', 'Andrew Davies', 'Chris O''Donnell, Minnie Driver, Geraldine O''Rawe, Saffron Burrows, Alan Cumming, Colin Firth, Aidan Gillen, Mick Lally', 'PG-13', 'Three girlhood friends now at college share first loves, first kisses and first betrayals. At the center of it all is the best-looking boy on campus. Can a self-conscious dreamer hook the biggest fish in the pond?', 'Three girlhood friends now at college share first loves, first kisses and first betrayals. At the center of it all is the best-looking boy on campus. Can a self-conscious dreamer hook the biggest fish in the pond?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bnSBsGCIfGGiN68MSBIoviaoh9a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22625'),
  ('548231182331727665', 'Circle of Iron', 1978, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Richard Moore, Nissim Lvy, Jacob Kotzky', 'Stirling Silliphant, Stanley Mann', 'David Carradine, Jeff Cooper, Christopher Lee, Roddy McDowall, Eli Wallach, Anthony De Longis, Earl Maynard, Erica Creer', 'R', 'In a mystical desert kingdom, young martial arts fighter Cord loses a contest to determine who will journey to take the powerful Book of All Knowedge from Zetan, an evil wizard. Despite his lack of a sponsor, Cord''s rule-breaking nature leads him to try retrieving the book anyway. Help is offered by a mysterious blind man who gives advice as Cord fights his way through multiple opponents, discovering more about himself as he gets closer to Zetan.', 'In a mystical desert kingdom, young martial arts fighter Cord loses a contest to determine who will journey to take the powerful Book of All Knowedge from Zetan, an evil wizard. Despite his lack of a sponsor, Cord''s rule-breaking nature leads him to try retrieving the book anyway. Help is offered by a mysterious blind man who gives advice as Cord fights his way through multiple opponents, discovering more about himself as he gets closer to Zetan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iIlXKisxeMZAWbonYRIrWoqxAGD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23739'),
  ('67107863220196585', 'Circle of Love', 1964, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Roger Vadim, Henri Decaë', 'Jean Anouilh', 'Jean-Claude Brialy, Francine Bergé, Marie Dubois, Jane Fonda, Claude Giraud, Anna Karina, Bernard Noël, Maurice Ronet', null, 'In a chain reaction of romantic adventures, various people play musical beds in a remake of Max Ophul''s "La Ronde."', 'In a chain reaction of romantic adventures, various people play musical beds in a remake of Max Ophul''s "La Ronde."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gYxlOHY9abUPvvWXrgh13DmXWNx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63876'),
  ('452636070227987875', 'Circles', 1933, 'Animation', 'Oskar Fischinger', null, null, null, 'One of the first color films in Europe, made with the Gaspar Color process.', 'One of the first color films in Europe, made with the Gaspar Color process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ymZQxIIyUMrTteV0qPQn0YDdEGl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142194'),
  ('366390429486868953', 'Circuit', 2001, 'Romance, Drama', 'Dirk Shafer, Joaquin Sedillo', 'Dirk Shafer, Gregory Hinton', 'Jonathan Wade-Drahos, Andre Khabbazi, Brian Lane Green, Kiersten Warren, Darryl Stephens, William Katt, Nancy Allen, Bruce Vilanch', 'NR', 'The hunky John is a closeted small-town cop who moves to L.A., where he is quickly seduced into the gay life of workouts and dusk-to-dawn parties. With actual circuit party footage and mounds of glistening and chiseled flesh, the pulsating Circuit is bound to get your juices flowing.', 'The hunky John is a closeted small-town cop who moves to L.A., where he is quickly seduced into the gay life of workouts and dusk-to-dawn parties. With actual circuit party footage and mounds of glistening and chiseled flesh, the pulsating Circuit is bound to get your juices flowing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c4dRn9y8b1FgqYvv60IVLZiti7y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5760'),
  ('322418973992339601', 'Circuitry Man', 1990, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Steven Lovy, Jamie Thompson, Richard Oswald', 'Robert Lovy, Steven Lovy', 'Jim Metzler, Dana Wheeler-Nicholson, Lu Leonard, Vernon Wells, Barbara Alyn Woods, Dennis Christopher, Paul Willson, Garry Goodrow', 'R', 'In a future where most humans have moved underground to escape the pollution, one of the few pleasures left is a kind of narcotic in the form of chips which can be plugged directly into the brain. Lori, a female body guard steals a case of such chips and flees underground Los Angeles with Danner, a pleasure android so that they can smuggle the chips to New York. In pursuit is Plughead, a dangerous criminal so named because of the many sockets and ports which decorate his scalp so that he can test and use the chips that he is after.', 'In a future where most humans have moved underground to escape the pollution, one of the few pleasures left is a kind of narcotic in the form of chips which can be plugged directly into the brain. Lori, a female body guard steals a case of such chips and flees underground Los Angeles with Danner, a pleasure android so that they can smuggle the chips to New York. In pursuit is Plughead, a dangerous criminal so named because of the many sockets and ports which decorate his scalp so that he can test and use the chips that he is after.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/egG9mkgtexR6tIKoaANjbQ5lcxH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30655'),
  ('489272682773318063', 'Circumstance', 2011, 'Drama', 'Maryam Keshavarz, Brian Rigney Hubbard', 'Maryam Keshavarz', 'Nikohl Boosheri, Sarah Kazemy, Reza Sixo Safai, Soheil Parsa, Nasrin Pakkho, Sina Amedson, Keon Alexander, Amir Barghashi', null, 'A wealthy Iranian family struggles to contain a teenager''s growing sexual rebellion and her brother''s newfound conservatism.', 'A wealthy Iranian family struggles to contain a teenager''s growing sexual rebellion and her brother''s newfound conservatism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fs4Qi07K9htZzI73YaukSQFqmHk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60421'),
  ('708865731146243460', 'Circus', 1936, 'Music, Comedy', 'Grigori Aleksandrov, Boris Petrov, Vladimir Nilsen', 'Grigori Aleksandrov', 'Lyubov Orlova, Vladimir Volodin, Sergey Stolyarov, Pavel Massalsky, Lev Sverdlin, Solomon Mikhoels, Yevgeniya Melnikova, Fyodor Kurikhin', null, 'An American circus performer finds herself the victim of racism after it is revealed that she''s the mother of a mixed-race child. In the midst of the public scandal, she finds happiness, love, and refuge in the USSR.', 'An American circus performer finds herself the victim of racism after it is revealed that she''s the mother of a mixed-race child. In the midst of the public scandal, she finds happiness, love, and refuge in the USSR.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aUQpKgrfeeNSzL1OdpjzXxU2aoQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87799'),
  ('659061818656197662', 'Circus', 2000, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Ben Seresin, Rob Walker', 'David Logan', 'John Hannah, Famke Janssen, Peter Stormare, Eddie Izzard, Fred Ward, Brian Conley, Amanda Donohoe, Jason Watkins', 'R', 'Bruno, a sadistic criminal, wants clever con man Leo out of the way. Leo and his equally clever wife, Lily, are up to something. So too is Julius: he hires Leo to kill Gloria, Julius''s wife. Leo does it, but then Julius shows up with the murder on tape, saying Gloria isn''t his wife - it''s blackmail. Leo''s bookie, Troy, is also closing in, wanting to be paid. Bruno and Lily as well as Bruno and Julius have their own scams running, and Leo is their target. Maybe Leo can get Troy off his back, avoid Moose (Bruno''s huge enforcer), send Gloria''s corpse out of England, turn the tables on Bruno''s murderous brother Caspar, and outfox Lily. Or is Lily his fox? It''s a three-ring circus.', 'Bruno, a sadistic criminal, wants clever con man Leo out of the way. Leo and his equally clever wife, Lily, are up to something. So too is Julius: he hires Leo to kill Gloria, Julius''s wife. Leo does it, but then Julius shows up with the murder on tape, saying Gloria isn''t his wife - it''s blackmail. Leo''s bookie, Troy, is also closing in, wanting to be paid. Bruno and Lily as well as Bruno and Julius have their own scams running, and Leo is their target. Maybe Leo can get Troy off his back, avoid Moose (Bruno''s huge enforcer), send Gloria''s corpse out of England, turn the tables on Bruno''s murderous brother Caspar, and outfox Lily. Or is Lily his fox? It''s a three-ring circus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ueuu6NbMuypthtEFXOM4hOIRpu7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51179'),
  ('591834286019828001', 'Circus Kane', 2017, 'Horror', 'Christopher Ray, Alexander Yellen', 'Sean Sellars, Zack Ward, James Cullen Bressack', 'Jonathan Lipnicki, Tim Abell, Richard Moll, Mark Christopher Lawrence, Victoria Konefal, Nicole Fox, Ted Monte, Cameron Jebo', null, 'A reclusive circus master invites a group of social media stars to his house of haunts. Anyone who can make it out before being scared into submission will earn $250,000 - but the stars soon learn they are not only competing for money, but also fighting for their lives.', 'A reclusive circus master invites a group of social media stars to his house of haunts. Anyone who can make it out before being scared into submission will earn $250,000 - but the stars soon learn they are not only competing for money, but also fighting for their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vJVF3Voz6LbJeMlLl6O4m8CjNhb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:459667'),
  ('375939689673241605', 'Circus Maximus', 2023, 'Music', 'Alexander Dahl, Søren la Cour Frederiksen, Niels Nørløv Hansen', 'Travis Scott', 'Travis Scott, Rick Rubin, James Blake, Sheck Wes, Yung Lean, Teezo Touchdown, Jazzelle Zanaughtti, RaysCorruptedMind', null, 'Travis Scott takes his audience on a mind-bending visual odyssey across the globe, woven together by the speaker rattling sounds of his highly anticipated upcoming album "UTOPIA". A surreal and psychedelic journey, uniting a collective of visionary filmmakers from around the world in a kaleidoscopic exploration of human experience and the power of soundscapes.', 'Travis Scott takes his audience on a mind-bending visual odyssey across the globe, woven together by the speaker rattling sounds of his highly anticipated upcoming album "UTOPIA". A surreal and psychedelic journey, uniting a collective of visionary filmmakers from around the world in a kaleidoscopic exploration of human experience and the power of soundscapes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u54X9NvsbLL6UDceqXInYMlKDsf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:857451'),
  ('2184505541897473', 'Circus of Books', 2019, 'Documentary, History', 'Rachel Mason, Gretchen Warthen', 'Rachel Mason, Kathryn Robson', 'Rachel Mason, Josh Mason, Larry Flynt, Jeff Stryker, Alaska Thunderfuck, Phil Tarley, John Weston, Don Norman', null, 'For decades, a nice Jewish couple ran Circus of Books, a porn shop and epicenter for gay LA. Their director daughter documents their life and times.', 'For decades, a nice Jewish couple ran Circus of Books, a porn shop and epicenter for gay LA. Their director daughter documents their life and times.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y19U39IccjFpn70UmYIET9B3dBV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:597594'),
  ('658586948795344427', 'Circus of Fear', 1966, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'John Llewellyn Moxey, Ernest Steward, Werner Jacobs', 'Harry Alan Towers', 'Christopher Lee, Leo Genn, Anthony Newlands, Heinz Drache, Eddi Arent, Klaus Kinski, Margaret Lee, Suzy Kendall', null, 'A circus becomes the location for stolen loot and murder.', 'A circus becomes the location for stolen loot and murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/is2RTtVLOOY9TNaq16ljS8QUarV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42717'),
  ('529786357829937859', 'Circus of Horrors', 1960, 'Horror, Crime', 'Douglas Slocombe, Sidney Hayers', 'George Baxt', 'Anton Diffring, Erika Remberg, Yvonne Monlaur, Donald Pleasence, Jane Hylton, Kenneth Griffith, Conrad Phillips, Jack Gwillim', 'NR', 'A plastic surgeon and his nurse join a bizarre circus to escape from the police. Here he befriends deformed women and transforms them for his "Temple of Beauty". However, when they threaten to leave, they meet with mysterious accidents.', 'A plastic surgeon and his nurse join a bizarre circus to escape from the police. Here he befriends deformed women and transforms them for his "Temple of Beauty". However, when they threaten to leave, they meet with mysterious accidents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9sfshfTBXOFOAutfceewC6Rvgxq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27405'),
  ('1040674434757434696', 'Circus on Ice', 1954, 'Documentary', 'Gordon Sparling', 'Constance Jaquays', 'Ken Davey', null, 'Based on the 40th Annual Carnival of the Toronto Skating Club.', 'Based on the 40th Annual Carnival of the Toronto Skating Club.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ozgL6MNOeIp3xgr451fvUwl147.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:353399'),
  ('1055646238625827010', 'Circus World', 1964, 'Drama', 'Henry Hathaway, Jack Hildyard, José López Rodero', 'Ben Hecht, Julian Zimet, James Edward Grant', 'John Wayne, Claudia Cardinale, Rita Hayworth, Lloyd Nolan, Richard Conte, John Smith, Katherine Kath, Wanda Rotha', 'NR', 'Circus owner Matt Masters is beset by disasters as he attempts a European tour of his circus. At the same time, he is caught in an emotional bind between his adopted daughter and her mother.', 'Circus owner Matt Masters is beset by disasters as he attempts a European tour of his circus. At the same time, he is caught in an emotional bind between his adopted daughter and her mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vwioP29cTAsQP1dUrVa1yvLVNmz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42782'),
  ('909597704416731654', 'Cirkus', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jomon T. John, Rohit Shetty', 'Yunus Sajawal', 'Ranveer Singh, Varun Sharma, Pooja Hegde, Jacqueline Fernandez, Johny Lever, Sanjay Mishra, Murali Sharma, Ashwini Kalsekar', 'NR', 'Two sets of identical twins are accidentally separated at birth. Several years later, when they are coincidentally in the same town, there is a lot of confusion and misunderstanding when people mistake them for each other.', 'Two sets of identical twins are accidentally separated at birth. Several years later, when they are coincidentally in the same town, there is a lot of confusion and misunderstanding when people mistake them for each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/if1EDRozDB2LJ8IO2d7lzt46Ahh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:755045'),
  ('833843792130260581', 'Ciro and Me', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Miguel Salazar, Miguel Salazar', 'Miguel Salazar', 'Ciro Galindo, Esneider Galindo', null, 'Ciro Galindo was born on August 29th, 1952 in Colombia. Wherever he''s gone, war has found him. After twenty years of friendship, I understood Ciro ''s life sums up Colombia''s history. As so many Colombians he is a survivor, who has run away from war for more than sixty years, and now dreams of living in peace. "Ciro and Me" is a journey to memory, seeking to give sorrow words; a journey, similar to that of Colombia in times of peace, in search to recover its dignity.', 'Ciro Galindo was born on August 29th, 1952 in Colombia. Wherever he''s gone, war has found him. After twenty years of friendship, I understood Ciro ''s life sums up Colombia''s history. As so many Colombians he is a survivor, who has run away from war for more than sixty years, and now dreams of living in peace. "Ciro and Me" is a journey to memory, seeking to give sorrow words; a journey, similar to that of Colombia in times of peace, in search to recover its dignity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/65i0LxfxWwYI9Dm7jSEiwvqtW5S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:509729'),
  ('1047199373806344220', 'Cirque du Freak: The Vampire''s Assistant', 2009, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Action, Thriller', 'Paul Weitz, J. Michael Muro', 'Paul Weitz, Brian Helgeland', 'Chris Massoglia, John C. Reilly, Josh Hutcherson, Patrick Fugit, Salma Hayek Pinault, Jessica Carlson, Michael Cerveris, Ray Stevenson', 'PG-13', 'When Darren Shan is taken to a circus that''s chock-full of sideshow oddities, he meets a vampire and receives a life-changing bite on the neck.', 'When Darren Shan is taken to a circus that''s chock-full of sideshow oddities, he meets a vampire and receives a life-changing bite on the neck.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8DSRpomxdPAsyecjDH2sgMqYBkL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24418'),
  ('536662379962570819', 'Cirque du Soleil: Alegria', 2001, 'Documentary, Music, Family', 'Nick Morris, Franco Dragone', null, 'Ebon Grayman, Francesca Gagnon, Eve Montpetit, Tamir Erdenesaikan, Elena Lev, Batmuhkh Batjargal, Piotr Matula, Kristina Ivanova', 'G', 'Alegría is a mood, a state of mind. The themes of the show, whose name means "jubilation" in Spanish, are many. Power and the handing down of power over time, the evolution from ancient monarchies to modern democracies, old age, youth - it is against this backdrop that the characters of Alegría play out their lives. Kings'' fools, minstrels, beggars, old aristocrats and children make up its universe, along with the clowns, who alone are able to resist the passing of time and the social transformations that accompany it.', 'Alegría is a mood, a state of mind. The themes of the show, whose name means "jubilation" in Spanish, are many. Power and the handing down of power over time, the evolution from ancient monarchies to modern democracies, old age, youth - it is against this backdrop that the characters of Alegría play out their lives. Kings'' fools, minstrels, beggars, old aristocrats and children make up its universe, along with the clowns, who alone are able to resist the passing of time and the social transformations that accompany it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/slEvZ2jzyWBIBOICOARD9ypFfch.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15549'),
  ('238427915790701168', 'Cirque du Soleil: Corteo', 2006, 'Documentary, Family, Music', 'Daniele Finzi Pasca, Jocelyn Barnabé, Daniele Finzi Pasca', null, 'Mauro Mozzani, Sean Lomax, Igor Issakov, Valentyna Pahlevanyan, Grigor Pahlevanyan, Victorino Lujan, Paul Bisson, Estelle Esse', 'G', 'Corteo, which means "cortege" in Italian, is a joyous procession, a festive parade imagined by a clown. The show brings together the passion of the actor with the grace and power of the acrobat to plunge the audience into a theatrical world of fun, comedy and spontaneity situated in a mysterious space between heaven and earth.', 'Corteo, which means "cortege" in Italian, is a joyous procession, a festive parade imagined by a clown. The show brings together the passion of the actor with the grace and power of the acrobat to plunge the audience into a theatrical world of fun, comedy and spontaneity situated in a mysterious space between heaven and earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kzDXhg31RFrGJJMl6IcoJr3S0JM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15551'),
  ('357216042649875718', 'Cirque du Soleil: Dralion', 2001, 'Music, Family', 'David Mallet, Guy Caron', null, 'Erik Karol, Agnès Sohier, Sheetal Gandhi, Henriette Gbou, Juliana Neves, Luis Pelegrini, Zhao Jian, Viktor Kee', null, 'The Chinese consider the lion a symbol of good luck, so it''s a half-dragon, half-lion – a dralion – that is the symbol of the East-meets-West fusion of this performance in which 36 Chinese acrobats join the renowned Canadian troupe. Celebrating the four elements as represented in four colours – blue (air), green (water), red (fire) and ochre (earth) – Dralion combines ancient Chinese circus traditions with Cirque du Soleil''s usual stunning elements: the techno-oriented single ring; the multicoloured lights and costumes; the music that mixes rock, New Age and various world influences (though not Chinese); and the madcap clowns that pull a victim out of the audience.', 'The Chinese consider the lion a symbol of good luck, so it''s a half-dragon, half-lion – a dralion – that is the symbol of the East-meets-West fusion of this performance in which 36 Chinese acrobats join the renowned Canadian troupe. Celebrating the four elements as represented in four colours – blue (air), green (water), red (fire) and ochre (earth) – Dralion combines ancient Chinese circus traditions with Cirque du Soleil''s usual stunning elements: the techno-oriented single ring; the multicoloured lights and costumes; the music that mixes rock, New Age and various world influences (though not Chinese); and the madcap clowns that pull a victim out of the audience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fl5qaYXKUEWN2mKKjHRgF8qxXWp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15548'),
  ('1108506178753750025', 'Cirque du Soleil: Journey of Man', 2000, 'Drama, Family, Music, Fantasy', 'Keith Melton, Rod Smith, Reed Smoot', 'Steve Roberts, Peter Wagg', 'Ian McKellen, Nicky Dewhurst, Brian Dewhurst , Anait Karagyezyan, Chris Van Wagenen, Cully Smoller, Kenny Raskin, Mikhail Matorin', null, 'A child is born. We see underwater swimmers representing this. He is young, in a jungle setting, with two fanciful "instincts" guiding him as swooping bird-like acrobats initially menace, then delight. As an adolescent, he enters a desert, where a man spins a large cube of metal tubing. He leaves his instinct-guides behind, and enters a garden where two statues dance in a pond. As he watches their sensual acrobatics of love, he becomes a man. He is offered wealth (represented by a golden hat) by a devil figure. In a richly decorated room, a scruffy troupe of a dozen acrobats and a little girl reawaken the old man''s youthful nature and love.', 'A child is born. We see underwater swimmers representing this. He is young, in a jungle setting, with two fanciful "instincts" guiding him as swooping bird-like acrobats initially menace, then delight. As an adolescent, he enters a desert, where a man spins a large cube of metal tubing. He leaves his instinct-guides behind, and enters a garden where two statues dance in a pond. As he watches their sensual acrobatics of love, he becomes a man. He is offered wealth (represented by a golden hat) by a devil figure. In a richly decorated room, a scruffy troupe of a dozen acrobats and a little girl reawaken the old man''s youthful nature and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h2kFMJNhC9q1gL8YESKqW3yIouF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16641'),
  ('192234934095264025', 'Cirque du Soleil: Quidam', 1999, 'Documentary, Music', 'Steve Nolan, David Mallet, Barrie Dodd', null, 'Audrey Brisson-Jutras, John Gilkey, Matthew Baker, Richard D. Price, Natalia Pestova, Edward Skwirsky', null, 'A young girl has already seen everything there is to see and her world has lost all meaning. Her anger shatters her world and she finds herself in the universe of QUIDAM, where she is joined by a playful companion, as well as another mysterious character who attempts to seduce her with the marvelous, the unsettling and the terrifying.', 'A young girl has already seen everything there is to see and her world has lost all meaning. Her anger shatters her world and she finds herself in the universe of QUIDAM, where she is joined by a playful companion, as well as another mysterious character who attempts to seduce her with the marvelous, the unsettling and the terrifying.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nwsv5bNEEMEDjtxL04BR9mbgs2n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15546'),
  ('860749937530978589', 'Cirque du Soleil: Saltimbanco', 1997, 'Documentary, Family, Music', 'Jacques Payette, Franco Dragone', 'Franco Dragone', 'René Bazinet, Anton Chelnokov, Francine Poitras, Dimitri A. Arnaoutov, Ann Bernard, Pawel Biegaj, Witek Biegaj, Martin Boisvert', null, 'From the Italian ''saltare in banco'' – which literally means ''to jump on a bench'' – Saltimbanco explores the urban experience in all its myriad forms. Between whirlwind and lull, prowess and poetry, it takes spectators on an allegorical and acrobatic journey into the heart and soul of the modern city.', 'From the Italian ''saltare in banco'' – which literally means ''to jump on a bench'' – Saltimbanco explores the urban experience in all its myriad forms. Between whirlwind and lull, prowess and poetry, it takes spectators on an allegorical and acrobatic journey into the heart and soul of the modern city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wFOhpILpHKrPUXiAbtcd0sWwrWj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15550'),
  ('1012103864205602493', 'Cirque du Soleil: Worlds Away', 2012, 'Fantasy, Family, Music, Drama, Romance', 'Andrew Adamson, Brett Turnbull', 'Andrew Adamson', 'Erica Linz, Igor Zaripov, Matt Gillanders, Jason Berrent, Dallas Barnett, Sophia Elisabeth, Lutz Halbhubner, Andy Jones', 'PG', 'An original story featuring performances by Cirque du Soleil. A young woman is entranced by an Aerialist. When they fall into the dreamlike world of Cirque du Soleil and are separated, they travel through the different tent worlds trying to find each other.', 'An original story featuring performances by Cirque du Soleil. A young woman is entranced by an Aerialist. When they fall into the dreamlike world of Cirque du Soleil and are separated, they travel through the different tent worlds trying to find each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jAt4ugebhXKmAnirHAWe5P6gnMi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94352'),
  ('363620766268014627', 'Cisco Pike', 1971, 'Crime, Drama', 'Bill L. Norton, Vilis Lapenieks, Sheldon Schrager', 'Bill L. Norton', 'Kris Kristofferson, Karen Black, Gene Hackman, Harry Dean Stanton, Viva, Joy Bang, Roscoe Lee Browne, Chuy Franco', 'R', 'A down on his luck former drug dealer is forced by a corrupt LAPD policeman to sell 100 kilos of confiscated marijuana in one weekend.', 'A down on his luck former drug dealer is forced by a corrupt LAPD policeman to sell 100 kilos of confiscated marijuana in one weekend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qaNHDgvSSAlkhpZOX3mHX5LD8Db.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55044'),
  ('136777618331433311', 'Ciske the Rat', 1984, 'Drama', 'Guido Pieters, Frans Bromet', 'Karin Loomans', 'Danny de Munk, Willeke van Ammelrooy, Herman van Veen, Willem Nijholt, Peter Faber, Rijk de Gooyer, Linda van Dyck, Carolien van den Berg', null, 'Lovable Amsterdam street urchin, 11 year old Ciske is nevertheless much in need of love as the Dutch 1984 title suggests. He is a scamp with a heart of gold. He causes havoc in the classroom pouring ink over his teacher yet when a polio-crippled boy joins the class Ciske is one of the only children to befriend him and is bullied as a result. His mother works in a bar and Ciske helps out often late into the night - his father is at sea and his mother supplements her income with prostitution. Ciske is also a very angry young man and he smoulders with rage at life''s injustices.', 'Lovable Amsterdam street urchin, 11 year old Ciske is nevertheless much in need of love as the Dutch 1984 title suggests. He is a scamp with a heart of gold. He causes havoc in the classroom pouring ink over his teacher yet when a polio-crippled boy joins the class Ciske is one of the only children to befriend him and is bullied as a result. His mother works in a bar and Ciske helps out often late into the night - his father is at sea and his mother supplements her income with prostitution. Ciske is also a very angry young man and he smoulders with rage at life''s injustices.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gENwOREHKvAOdkMvOJHR32sw85T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35574'),
  ('833516649136989146', 'Citadel', 2012, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Ciarán Foy, Tim Fleming', 'Ciarán Foy', 'James Cosmo, Aneurin Barnard, Amy Shiels, Wunmi Mosaku, Ian Hanmore, Ingrid Craigie, Chris Hegarty, Pete Murphy', 'R', 'Chronically agoraphobic since the day his wife was murdered, Tommy Cowley finds himself terrorized by a gang of syringe-wielding feral children, who are intent on taking his baby daughter. Upon discovering the nightmarish truth surrounding these hooded children, he learns that to be free of his fears, he must finally face the demons of his past and enter the one place he fears the most - the abandoned tower block, known as the Citadel.', 'Chronically agoraphobic since the day his wife was murdered, Tommy Cowley finds himself terrorized by a gang of syringe-wielding feral children, who are intent on taking his baby daughter. Upon discovering the nightmarish truth surrounding these hooded children, he learns that to be free of his fears, he must finally face the demons of his past and enter the one place he fears the most - the abandoned tower block, known as the Citadel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2NBxSwARcPi4wwpLH1wyFWKXeJo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52001'),
  ('886785612249081100', 'Citation', 2020, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Kunle Afolayan', 'Tunde Babalola', 'Jimmy Jean-Louis, Temi Otedola, Adjetey Anang, Gabriel Afolayan, Joke Silva, Bukunmi Oluwashina, Oyewole Olowomojuore, Yomi Fash-Lanso', null, 'A bright student in Nigeria takes on the academic establishment when she reports a popular professor who tried to rape her. Based on real events.', 'A bright student in Nigeria takes on the academic establishment when she reports a popular professor who tried to rape her. Based on real events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k8medyObgY0XTt2dL7BqjxXkqmw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:755340'),
  ('515329027884833870', 'Cities of Last Things', 2018, 'Drama, Science Fiction, Crime', 'Ho Wi-ding, Jean-Louis Vialard', 'Ho Wi-ding', 'Lee Hong-chi, Jack Kao, Louise Grinberg, Ding Ning, Huang Lu, Vickey Liu, Chang Kuo-Chu, Shih Chin-Hang', null, 'Three key events during three different time periods, in three seasons, and on three nights culminate to change the life of Zhang Dong Ling.', 'Three key events during three different time periods, in three seasons, and on three nights culminate to change the life of Zhang Dong Ling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e0OQZl8lIITSVCB9eSR8QK9RrJU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:541340'),
  ('936086596878922851', 'Citizen', 2001, 'Drama, Action, Crime', 'Ravi K. Chandran, Saravana Subbiah', 'Saravana Subbiah', 'Ajith Kumar, Vasundhara Das, Meena, Nagma, Nizhalgal Ravi, Devan, Pandiyan, Dr. Sharmila', null, 'Three prominent members of society, a judge, a police official and a district collector are kidnapped in broad daylight by a man who calls himself ''Citizen''. As CBI Officer Sarojini (Nagma) follows his trail she finds clues to a shocking mystery, of a village called Attipatthi which simply disappeared off the map of India, and to which each of these men is connected', 'Three prominent members of society, a judge, a police official and a district collector are kidnapped in broad daylight by a man who calls himself ''Citizen''. As CBI Officer Sarojini (Nagma) follows his trail she finds clues to a shocking mystery, of a village called Attipatthi which simply disappeared off the map of India, and to which each of these men is connected', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A7OYNRIbsDA91PIE3EgzfyA1Swb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69399'),
  ('603669993348324140', 'Citizen Cohn', 1992, 'Drama, TV Movie, History', 'Frank Pierson, Mary Colquhoun, Paul Elliott', 'David Franzoni', 'James Woods, Joe Don Baker, Joseph Bologna, Ed Flanders, Frederic Forrest, Lee Grant, Pat Hingle, John McMartin', 'R', 'As lawyer and power broker Roy Cohn lies dying of AIDS in a private hospital room, ghosts from his past visit him as he reflects on his life and loves.', 'As lawyer and power broker Roy Cohn lies dying of AIDS in a private hospital room, ghosts from his past visit him as he reflects on his life and loves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Eqgea16BiNen8nFzFV5IDQCq7o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75145'),
  ('741601025383263872', 'Citizen Dog', 2004, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Romance', 'Wisit Sasanatieng, Rewat Prelert, Prompop Leelapan', 'Wisit Sasanatieng', 'Mahasamut Boonyaruk, Sangthong Keduthong, Sawatwong Palakawong Na Autthaya, Nattha Wattanapaiboon, Raenkum Saninn, Pakapat Bunsomtom, Pattareeya Sanitwate, Phasin Maloyaphan', null, 'Pod decides to change jobs after losing his finger at a sardine packing plant. His new job as a security guard comes with an unexpected perk in the form of a lanky maid who carries a mysterious white book.', 'Pod decides to change jobs after losing his finger at a sardine packing plant. His new job as a security guard comes with an unexpected perk in the form of a lanky maid who carries a mysterious white book.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A9Roojb8irRKPyyhDKCRzVc16NI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25755'),
  ('769121034702057530', 'Citizen Kane', 1941, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Orson Welles, Gregg Toland', 'Orson Welles, Herman J. Mankiewicz', 'Orson Welles, Joseph Cotten, Dorothy Comingore, Ray Collins, George Coulouris, Agnes Moorehead, Paul Stewart, Ruth Warrick', 'NR', 'Newspaper magnate Charles Foster Kane is taken from his mother as a boy and made the ward of a rich industrialist. As a result, every well-meaning, tyrannical or self-destructive move he makes for the rest of his life appears in some way to be a reaction to that deeply wounding event.', 'Newspaper magnate Charles Foster Kane is taken from his mother as a boy and made the ward of a rich industrialist. As a result, every well-meaning, tyrannical or self-destructive move he makes for the rest of his life appears in some way to be a reaction to that deeply wounding event.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sav0jxhqiH0bPr2vZFU0Kjt2nZL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15'),
  ('511630862510999101', 'Citizen Kitano', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Yves Montmayeur, Stéphane Rossi, Yves Montmayeur', 'Yves Montmayeur', 'Takeshi Kitano, Kayoko Kishimoto, Jia Zhangke, Michel Temman, Diao Yinan', null, 'Takeshi Kitano is an international icon. We know the actor, the multi-award-winning filmmaker, but many ignore his double personality: the crazy TV star, the street kid from Tokyo close to the Yakuza, and the political satirist who blasted taboos! Can we dream of a better guide to introduce us to the cultural history of Japan?', 'Takeshi Kitano is an international icon. We know the actor, the multi-award-winning filmmaker, but many ignore his double personality: the crazy TV star, the street kid from Tokyo close to the Yakuza, and the political satirist who blasted taboos! Can we dream of a better guide to introduce us to the cultural history of Japan?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qPVYNoCfBPEIlNB13tYNcjZsrzZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:750008'),
  ('1071956705076305679', 'Citizen of a Kind', 2024, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Lee Gil-gyu, Lee Hyung-bin, Park Young-ju', 'Park Young-ju', 'Ra Mi-ran, Gong Myoung, Yeom Hye-ran, Park Byung-eun, Jang Yoon-ju, Lee Mu-saeng, Ahn Eun-jin, Lee Ju-seung', null, 'After losing her laundry store to a fire incident, a single mom Duk-hee receives a call from a bank offering a generous upfront loan so she takes it right away. But soon after, she finds out that she has become a victim of a voice phishing scheme. Devastated, Duk-hee turns to the police for help, only to be more disappointed that there is no hope of retrieving her money. At the moment of despair, Jae-min, the phisher who tricked her, rings her phone once again to tip Duk-hee off about the criminal organization that locked him up and coerced him to make voice phishing calls from China. With that call, Duk-hee makes up her mind to investigate this case for herself and take a plane to China with her friends.', 'After losing her laundry store to a fire incident, a single mom Duk-hee receives a call from a bank offering a generous upfront loan so she takes it right away. But soon after, she finds out that she has become a victim of a voice phishing scheme. Devastated, Duk-hee turns to the police for help, only to be more disappointed that there is no hope of retrieving her money. At the moment of despair, Jae-min, the phisher who tricked her, rings her phone once again to tip Duk-hee off about the criminal organization that locked him up and coerced him to make voice phishing calls from China. With that call, Duk-hee makes up her mind to investigate this case for herself and take a plane to China with her friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gF2yhuzy1o0uVWuKQ799LwDXH1V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:696047'),
  ('285761451538542077', 'Citizen Piszczyk', 1989, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Andrzej Kotkowski, Witold Adamek', 'Andrzej Kotkowski, Jerzy Stefan Stawiński', 'Jerzy Stuhr, Maria Pakulnis, Kazimierz Kaczor, Krzysztof Zaleski, Krystyna Tkacz, Grzegorz Warchoł, Janusz Bukowski, Andrzej Szczepkowski', null, 'This film is a sequel to Munk''s Zezowate Szczescie and it''s much the same, only more so. The film begins in a cinema, where the last scenes of Zezowate Szczescie are being shown. Born unlucky, a victim of the errors and distortions of Stalinism, he is released in 1956. He meets a politically feverish woman, her influential parents, and finally becomes the father of her child. But bad luck, or perhaps an unlucky era, will not let him forget.', 'This film is a sequel to Munk''s Zezowate Szczescie and it''s much the same, only more so. The film begins in a cinema, where the last scenes of Zezowate Szczescie are being shown. Born unlucky, a victim of the errors and distortions of Stalinism, he is released in 1956. He meets a politically feverish woman, her influential parents, and finally becomes the father of her child. But bad luck, or perhaps an unlucky era, will not let him forget.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rbqUPr9UrW0P0HSGPpw5vNqIMiz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270410'),
  ('558047597243294892', 'Citizen Ruth', 1996, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Alexander Payne, James Glennon, Basti Van Der Woude', 'Alexander Payne, Jim Taylor', 'Laura Dern, Swoosie Kurtz, Kurtwood Smith, Mary Kay Place, Kelly Preston, M.C. Gainey, Kenneth Mars, David Graf', 'R', '"Citizen Ruth" is the story of Ruth Stoops, a woman who nobody even noticed -- until she got pregnant. Now, everyone wants a piece of her. The film is a comedy about one woman caught in the ultimate tug-of-war: a clash of wild, noisy, ridiculous people that rapidly dissolves into a media circus.', '"Citizen Ruth" is the story of Ruth Stoops, a woman who nobody even noticed -- until she got pregnant. Now, everyone wants a piece of her. The film is a comedy about one woman caught in the ultimate tug-of-war: a clash of wild, noisy, ridiculous people that rapidly dissolves into a media circus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hMGWyETjqWpfud4Cmeva6qfVogZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13891'),
  ('514816283304781214', 'Citizen Toxie: The Toxic Avenger IV', 2001, 'Action, Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Lloyd Kaufman, Brendan Flynt, Joanna Shattuck', 'Trent Haaga, Patrick Cassidy, Gabriel Friedman', 'David Mattey, Debbie Rochon, Clyde Lewis, Heidi Sjursen, Ron Jeremy, Tom Fulp, Paul Kyrmse, Stan Lee', 'R', 'A horrific explosion creates a dimensional portal between Tromaville and its dimensional mirror image, Amortville. While the Toxie is trapped in the mirror dimension, Tromaville comes under the control of his evil doppelganger, the Noxious Offender.', 'A horrific explosion creates a dimensional portal between Tromaville and its dimensional mirror image, Amortville. While the Toxie is trapped in the mirror dimension, Tromaville comes under the control of his evil doppelganger, the Noxious Offender.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wR4VvqrRd2r9M4GYXPnoV02aUNG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27601'),
  ('433557040813100457', 'Citizen X', 1995, 'Crime, Drama', 'Chris Gerolmo, Robert Fraisse, Michelangelo Csaba Bolla', 'Chris Gerolmo', 'Stephen Rea, Donald Sutherland, Max von Sydow, Jeffrey DeMunn, Joss Ackland, John Wood, Radu Amzulescu, Imelda Staunton', 'R', 'Based on the true story of a Russian serial killer who, over many years, claimed victim to over 50 people. His victims were mostly under the age of 17. In what was then a communists state, the police investigations were hampered by bureaucracy, incompetence and those in power. The story is told from the viewpoint of the detective in charge of the case.', 'Based on the true story of a Russian serial killer who, over many years, claimed victim to over 50 people. His victims were mostly under the age of 17. In what was then a communists state, the police investigations were hampered by bureaucracy, incompetence and those in power. The story is told from the viewpoint of the detective in charge of the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mr3lIjSRhXGVP2o9HY3P9PX2KsH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12554'),
  ('1012560194728412964', 'Citizenfour', 2014, 'Documentary', 'Laura Poitras, Katy Scoggin, Kirsten Johnson', null, 'Edward Snowden, Glenn Greenwald, Laura Poitras, William Binney, Barack Obama, Jacob Appelbaum, Julian Assange, Jeremy Scahill', 'R', 'In June 2013, Laura Poitras and reporter Glenn Greenwald flew to Hong Kong for the first of many meetings with Edward Snowden. She brought her camera with her.', 'In June 2013, Laura Poitras and reporter Glenn Greenwald flew to Hong Kong for the first of many meetings with Edward Snowden. She brought her camera with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nOVhX69EAxtSKEEnr5UcSd5UVci.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:293310'),
