  ('1057189072130231030', 'Citizens Of The World', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Gian Enrico Bianchi, Gianni Di Gregorio, Francesca Borromeo', 'Gianni Di Gregorio, Marco Pettenello', 'Gianni Di Gregorio, Ennio Fantastichini, Giorgio Colangeli, Galatea Ranzi, Roberto Herlitzka, Daphne Scoccia, Silvia Gallerano, Marco Felli', null, 'Three Italian retirees embark on a journey to find a new country to live in.', 'Three Italian retirees embark on a journey to find a new country to live in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jJHr9FjHKDdFAOQG4ethILjAvcN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:613614'),
  ('1028819859652594180', 'Citoyen d''honneur', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Mohamed Hamidi, Antoine Marteau', 'Alain-Michel Blanc, Mohamed Hamidi', 'Kad Merad, Fatsah Bouyahmed, Oulaya Amamra, Brahim Bouhlel, Zinedine Soualem, Soumaya Akaaboune, Anne-Elisabeth Blateau, Brahim Bihi', null, 'Samir Amin is a fulfilled writer, Nobel Prize for Literature, who lives in Paris, far from his native country, Algeria.He systematically refuses all the invitations made to him. Until the day when he decides to accept to be made "Honorary Citizen" of Sidi Mimoun, the small town where he was born.But should he again meet with the inhabitants of this city, who year after year became the heroes of his various novels?', 'Samir Amin is a fulfilled writer, Nobel Prize for Literature, who lives in Paris, far from his native country, Algeria.He systematically refuses all the invitations made to him. Until the day when he decides to accept to be made "Honorary Citizen" of Sidi Mimoun, the small town where he was born.But should he again meet with the inhabitants of this city, who year after year became the heroes of his various novels?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gMrwq2Ey6GDIdoPEGZ7hmgdFUMI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:944945'),
  ('711371205004730602', 'City Beneath the Sea', 1953, 'Adventure, Action, Drama', 'Budd Boetticher, Joseph E. Kenney, Joseph Gershenson', 'Jack Harvey, Ramon Romero', 'Robert Ryan, Mala Powers, Anthony Quinn, Suzan Ball, George Mathews, Karl Stepanek, Hilo Hattie, Lalo Rios', null, 'Two adventures dive for treasure off the coast of Jamaica.', 'Two adventures dive for treasure off the coast of Jamaica.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h5nRcZ1HO4T8oNNZmXgBD0kRr9x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49327'),
  ('879168376474825700', 'City Beneath the Sea', 1971, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Irwin Allen, Kenneth Peach', 'John Meredyth Lucas', 'Stuart Whitman, Robert Wagner, Rosemary Forsyth, Robert Colbert, Burr DeBenning, Susana Miranda, Paul Stewart, Whit Bissell', 'G', 'A group of 21st-century colonists inhabit an underwater city called Pacifica. Originally intended as a purely scientific installation, the U. S. government wants to stash all its gold reserves from Fort Knox there, along with a fantastic new radioactive element. The brother of Pacifica''s returning former commander plans to steal the gold and on top of that, the city faces destruction by an asteroid from outer space!', 'A group of 21st-century colonists inhabit an underwater city called Pacifica. Originally intended as a purely scientific installation, the U. S. government wants to stash all its gold reserves from Fort Knox there, along with a fantastic new radioactive element. The brother of Pacifica''s returning former commander plans to steal the gold and on top of that, the city faces destruction by an asteroid from outer space!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9zQi1wBhwzjxtsvuBHcywF8HQHE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49326'),
  ('731605723402510912', 'City Boys: Golden Boyz', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Mihai Bendeac', 'Mihai Bendeac', 'Anca Dinicu, Vlad Drăgulin, Lorena Luchian, Cosmin Nedelcu, Doina Teodoru', null, 'Explore ambition, status, loyalty, and identity, as the City Boys face a new Bucharest and redefine what success truly means.', 'Explore ambition, status, loyalty, and identity, as the City Boys face a new Bucharest and redefine what success truly means.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fzy5iaAFr4WMjF3xwcQyzEVtGU5P.jpg', 'plex:movie:city-boys-golden-boyz'),
  ('482342668354449144', 'City by the Sea', 2002, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Michael Caton-Jones, Karl Walter Lindenlaub, Shawn Griffith', 'Ken Hixon, Mike McAlary', 'Robert De Niro, Frances McDormand, James Franco, Eliza Dushku, William Forsythe, Patti LuPone, Anson Mount, John Doman', 'R', 'Vincent LaMarca is a dedicated and well-respected New York City police detective who has gone to great lengths to distance himself from his past, but then makes the terrible discovery that his own son has fallen into a life of crime.', 'Vincent LaMarca is a dedicated and well-respected New York City police detective who has gone to great lengths to distance himself from his past, but then makes the terrible discovery that his own son has fallen into a life of crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vpjKtnE5SGTfmdw4YtJsnrfFJs0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13536'),
  ('153477056731035223', 'City Cops', 1989, 'Action, Crime, Comedy', 'Lau Kar-Wing, Joe Chan Kwong-Hung', 'Barry Wong Ping-Yiu', 'Cynthia Rothrock, Michael Miu Kiu-Wai, Kent Tong Chun-Yip, Suki Kwan Sau-Mei, Michiko Nishiwaki, Shing Fui-On, Woo Fung, Luk Chuen', null, 'Cindy is an American FBI agent, who is currently in Hong Kong, seeking arch-criminal Kent Tong. In order to bring down Tong and his criminal organization, she teams up with local HK cops, David and Johnny.', 'Cindy is an American FBI agent, who is currently in Hong Kong, seeking arch-criminal Kent Tong. In order to bring down Tong and his criminal organization, she teams up with local HK cops, David and Johnny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rf7GVX5yc7EXE3nJSc6LTckyGnl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144610'),
  ('198481443644004476', 'City for Conquest', 1940, 'Romance, Drama, Crime', 'Sol Polito, Anatole Litvak, James Wong Howe', 'John Wexley', 'James Cagney, Ann Sheridan, Frank Craven, Donald Crisp, Frank McHugh, Arthur Kennedy, George Tobias, Jerome Cowan', 'NR', 'The heartbreaking but hopeful tale of Danny Kenny and Peggy Nash, two sweethearts who meet and struggle through their impoverished lives in New York City. When Peggy, hoping for something better in life for both of them, breaks off her engagement to Danny, he sets out to be a championship boxer, while she becomes a dancer paired with a sleazy partner. Will tragedy reunite the former lovers?', 'The heartbreaking but hopeful tale of Danny Kenny and Peggy Nash, two sweethearts who meet and struggle through their impoverished lives in New York City. When Peggy, hoping for something better in life for both of them, breaks off her engagement to Danny, he sets out to be a championship boxer, while she becomes a dancer paired with a sleazy partner. Will tragedy reunite the former lovers?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pwWBxZMFfgSEvi82PjR8099lcl9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31148'),
  ('1119156106309097892', 'City Girl', 1930, 'Drama, Romance', 'F. W. Murnau, Ernest Palmer, William Tummel', 'Berthold Viertel, Marion Orth', 'Charles Farrell, Mary Duncan, David Torrence, Edith Yorke, Guinn ''Big Boy'' Williams, Anne Shirley, Tom McGuire, Richard Alexander', 'NR', 'A waitress from Chicago falls in love with a man from rural Minnesota and marries him, with the intent of living a better life - but life on the farm has its own challenges.', 'A waitress from Chicago falls in love with a man from rural Minnesota and marries him, with the intent of living a better life - but life on the farm has its own challenges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d0ioAdV4cg9euanBb2OdA3zpAsT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34796'),
