  ('353634644322125555', 'City Hunter', 2019, 'Action, Comedy, Adventure', 'Vincent Richard-Marquis, Philippe Lacheau', 'Philippe Lacheau, Julien Arruti, Pierre Dudan', 'Philippe Lacheau, Élodie Fontan, Tarek Boudali, Julien Arruti, Didier Bourdon, Pamela Anderson, Gérard Jugnot, Kamel Guenfoud', null, 'Nicky Larson is tasked to recover the perfume of Cupid, a perfume that would make anyone who uses it irresistible.', 'Nicky Larson is tasked to recover the perfume of Cupid, a perfume that would make anyone who uses it irresistible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rrwejDUmCSaca2Afubznkdp3ogB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:469274'),
  ('110600931242905771', 'City Hunter', 2024, 'Action', 'Motonobu Kiyoku, Yuichi Satoh, Mitsuhiro Yamada', 'Tatsuro Mishima', 'Ryohei Suzuki, Misato Morita, Masanobu Ando, Fumino Kimura, Asuka Hanamura, Isao Hashizume, Tetta Sugimoto, Ayame Misaki', 'R', 'An exceptional marksman and hopeless playboy, private eye Ryo Saeba reluctantly forms an alliance with his late partner''s sister to investigate his death.', 'An exceptional marksman and hopeless playboy, private eye Ryo Saeba reluctantly forms an alliance with his late partner''s sister to investigate his death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cjQzJ9xFdaN9KAwu7HUImIgbc2Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1061990'),
  ('381501996696013428', 'City Hunter Special: Goodbye My Sweetheart', 1997, 'Action, Animation, Comedy, Crime', 'Kazuo Yamazaki, Kenji Hayama, Masaaki Kannan', 'Yuuichi Higurashi', 'Akira Kamiya, Kazue Ikura, Tessyo Genda, Yoko Asagami, Mami Koyama, Hiroshi Ishida, Isao Nakayama, Izumi Okami', null, 'A mysterious soldier known only as Professor takes his revenge on the government that betrayed him - and Tokyo is brought to its knees! Unless the government pays the Professor an impossible ransom, downtown Tokyo will be completely destroyed, and the Professor''s beautiful sister will be the first to go! Only City Hunter, expert detective and shameless ladies'' man, can keep Tokyo from being blown sky high!The bullets fly furiously, and the women have never been tempting as City Hunter takes it to the edge in this action-packed animated feature. Explosive action will rock your senses as you witness City Hunter''s greatest challenge ever!', 'A mysterious soldier known only as Professor takes his revenge on the government that betrayed him - and Tokyo is brought to its knees! Unless the government pays the Professor an impossible ransom, downtown Tokyo will be completely destroyed, and the Professor''s beautiful sister will be the first to go! Only City Hunter, expert detective and shameless ladies'' man, can keep Tokyo from being blown sky high!The bullets fly furiously, and the women have never been tempting as City Hunter takes it to the edge in this action-packed animated feature. Explosive action will rock your senses as you witness City Hunter''s greatest challenge ever!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e7TtB5CEhaA8umkk0c6RHgh6njQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21770'),
  ('1042484469477333559', 'City Hunter Special: The Death of Vicious Criminal Saeba Ryo', 1999, 'Animation, Action, Comedy', 'Masaharu Okuwaki, Yasuo Uragami, Shinichi Sakuma', 'Nobuaki Kishima', 'Akira Kamiya, Kazue Ikura, Mami Koyama, Tessyo Genda, Yoko Asagami, Akio Nojima, Hironori Machida, Hiroshi Naka', null, 'City Hunter, Saeba Ryo, after months of idleness, finally scores a client and it is none other than the beautiful Mega City TV newscaster, Sayaka, who fears for her life. What''s more, the enemy are her employers who are ready to resort to any means necessary to kill her. Ryo takes on the might of a TV station in a bid to save Sayaka, but finds that all is not what it seems...', 'City Hunter, Saeba Ryo, after months of idleness, finally scores a client and it is none other than the beautiful Mega City TV newscaster, Sayaka, who fears for her life. What''s more, the enemy are her employers who are ready to resort to any means necessary to kill her. Ryo takes on the might of a TV station in a bid to save Sayaka, but finds that all is not what it seems...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mVQcQEoiv276muMUH2m4Kf0TGkD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189077'),
  ('233716552530263024', 'City Hunter Special: The Secret Service', 1996, 'Action, Animation, Comedy, Crime', 'Takeo Kitahara, Yasuo Uragami, Youichi Hasegawa', 'Akinori Endo, Kenji Kodama', 'Akira Kamiya, Kazue Ikura, Tessyo Genda, Yoko Asagami, Akio Otsuka, Mami Koyama, Daiki Nakamura, Hiroshi Naka', null, 'City Hunter, the globally adored hero, becomes embroiled in an adventure that takes him deep into the political intrigue of a Third World country and into the pain and anguish of one man''s tortured past. James McGuire''s life is so dangerous he has to hire bodyguards for his Secret Service agents. It doesn''t help that his chief agent is actually his long-lost daughter. Luckily for him, City Hunter and Kaori are behind on the rent and need the work. But a dark secret from McGuire''s past threatens to destroy him and his lonely daughter Anna. Will he live to rescue his country? Will his resentful daughter learn to love him again? Will City Hunter finally get some action?', 'City Hunter, the globally adored hero, becomes embroiled in an adventure that takes him deep into the political intrigue of a Third World country and into the pain and anguish of one man''s tortured past. James McGuire''s life is so dangerous he has to hire bodyguards for his Secret Service agents. It doesn''t help that his chief agent is actually his long-lost daughter. Luckily for him, City Hunter and Kaori are behind on the rent and need the work. But a dark secret from McGuire''s past threatens to destroy him and his lonely daughter Anna. Will he live to rescue his country? Will his resentful daughter learn to love him again? Will City Hunter finally get some action?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ktE4Oey20K7tjpYDkU5K1zmSeq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38952'),
  ('782194967634488184', 'City Hunter the Movie: Angel Dust', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Action, Drama', 'Kazuyoshi Takeuchi, Shinji Saito, Takuji Goto', 'Yasuyuki Muto', 'Akira Kamiya, Kazue Ikura, Yoko Asagami, Mami Koyama, Tessyo Genda, Rica Fukami, Kenyu Horiuchi, Ryo Ito', 'NR', 'When video creator Angie knocks on the door of the City Hunter detective agency looking for a missing cat, Ryo Saeba and Kaori Makimura think they have a simple case on their hands. But an attempt on Angie''s life changes the game, leaving Ryo in the crosshairs of mysterious assassins on the trail of Angel Dust, a military technology capable of creating super soldiers. Under the watchful eye of his adoptive father Kaibara, Ryo will have to deal with a past he has tried to escape for too long.', 'When video creator Angie knocks on the door of the City Hunter detective agency looking for a missing cat, Ryo Saeba and Kaori Makimura think they have a simple case on their hands. But an attempt on Angie''s life changes the game, leaving Ryo in the crosshairs of mysterious assassins on the trail of Angel Dust, a military technology capable of creating super soldiers. Under the watchful eye of his adoptive father Kaibara, Ryo will have to deal with a past he has tried to escape for too long.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5X5qzKUh6gbJWXzxeCsc9MY2S9l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1056133'),
  ('768065230354228248', 'City Hunter: .357 Magnum', 1989, 'Animation, Action, Crime, Comedy', 'Yasuo Uragami, Kazuhiro Furubayashi, Kenji Kodama', 'Akinori Endo', 'Akira Kamiya, Kazue Ikura, Yoko Asagami, Tessyo Genda, Mari Okamoto, Chafurin, Ichiro Nagai, Iemasa Kayumi', null, 'A beautiful pianist comes to Tokyo for a charity concert - and City Hunter is there. But music isn''t his forte. He wants lessons in the language of love. Desperation is the word as bodies start dropping. A foreign dignitary is assassinated in cold blood. Secret agents scour the streets for a missing microchip. And diplomatic infighting swirls around the upcoming concert until Nina the pianist and her grandfather Klaus are kidnapped. A maelstrom of exploding grenades, the rumble of Falcon''s jeep, and the tinkling of the ivories all set the stage for City Hunter: . 357 Magnum. The show must go on!', 'A beautiful pianist comes to Tokyo for a charity concert - and City Hunter is there. But music isn''t his forte. He wants lessons in the language of love. Desperation is the word as bodies start dropping. A foreign dignitary is assassinated in cold blood. Secret agents scour the streets for a missing microchip. And diplomatic infighting swirls around the upcoming concert until Nina the pianist and her grandfather Klaus are kidnapped. A maelstrom of exploding grenades, the rumble of Falcon''s jeep, and the tinkling of the ivories all set the stage for City Hunter: . 357 Magnum. The show must go on!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sxn56IEAsAxnaNYEMGCfIP0aNkT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38954'),
  ('168440983242748265', 'City Hunter: Bay City Wars', 1990, 'Action, Comedy, Animation, Thriller, Crime', 'Yasuo Uragami, Youichi Hasegawa, Kenji Kodama', 'Yasushi Hirano', 'Akira Kamiya, Kazue Ikura, Yoko Asagami, Tessyo Genda, Miki Ito, Hirohiko Kakegawa, Hochu Otsuka, Kazuhiko Kishino', null, 'Rival private eyes Ryo Saeba and Umibozu must find a way into a high-tech luxury hotel to rescue their friends who are being held hostage and stop a mad South American dictator''s plans to use the hotel''s supercomputer to unleash a nuclear holocaust. Highly reminiscent of Die Hard, right down to a scene where Ryu bunjee-jumps off of the roof of the hotel skyscraper with a fire hose. Written by Christopher E. Meadows', 'Rival private eyes Ryo Saeba and Umibozu must find a way into a high-tech luxury hotel to rescue their friends who are being held hostage and stop a mad South American dictator''s plans to use the hotel''s supercomputer to unleash a nuclear holocaust. Highly reminiscent of Die Hard, right down to a scene where Ryu bunjee-jumps off of the roof of the hotel skyscraper with a fire hose. Written by Christopher E. Meadows', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4D8oQeBtF6wGOfgJLvWMntxlMNk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189068'),
  ('183933569136445260', 'City Hunter: Million Dollar Conspiracy', 1990, 'Action, Animation, Comedy, Thriller', 'Youichi Hasegawa, Kenji Kodama, Sachiko Kamimura', 'Shōji Tonoike', 'Akira Kamiya, Kazue Ikura, Yoko Asagami, Tessyo Genda, Miki Ito, Yusaku Yara, Hiroshi Takemura, Hiroya Ishimaru', null, 'Beautiful American Emily O''Hara offers the City Hunter (Ryo Saeba & Kaori Makimura) one million dollars to protect her from a man named Douglas. Ryo & Kaori take the job, but things are not quite what they seem. The real target just might be Ryo, but it''s unclear who wants Saeba dead.', 'Beautiful American Emily O''Hara offers the City Hunter (Ryo Saeba & Kaori Makimura) one million dollars to protect her from a man named Douglas. Ryo & Kaori take the job, but things are not quite what they seem. The real target just might be Ryo, but it''s unclear who wants Saeba dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jVdSJifVGcyZReyAIOD0QJThk5e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189071'),
  ('1126272456360692381', 'City Hunter: Shinjuku Private Eyes', 2019, 'Animation, Action, Comedy, Crime, Mystery', 'Teruo Sato, Takahiko Kyougoku, Aimi Yamauchi', 'Yoichi Kato', 'Akira Kamiya, Kazue Ikura, Marie Iitoyo, Koichi Yamadera, Yoko Asagami, Tessyo Genda, Mami Koyama, Hochu Otsuka', 'NR', 'Ryo Saeba works the streets of Tokyo as the City Hunter. He''s a "sweeper" and with his sidekick Kaori Makimura, he keeps the city clean. People hire the City Hunter to solve their dangerous problems, which he does with a Colt Python. When Ryo''s not working on a case, he''s working on getting the ladies, and Kaori must keep him in check with her trusty 10 kg hammer.', 'Ryo Saeba works the streets of Tokyo as the City Hunter. He''s a "sweeper" and with his sidekick Kaori Makimura, he keeps the city clean. People hire the City Hunter to solve their dangerous problems, which he does with a Colt Python. When Ryo''s not working on a case, he''s working on getting the ladies, and Kaori must keep him in check with her trusty 10 kg hammer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7urbWvWNsWuBAxJ34sccIevPP2E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:540141'),
  ('1114822122880333017', 'City in Darkness', 1939, 'Crime, Thriller, Mystery', 'Herbert I. Leeds, Virgil Miller', 'Robert Ellis', 'Sidney Toler, Harold Huber, Pedro de Cordoba, Lynn Bari, Richard Clarke, Dorothy Tree, Noel Madison, Leo G. Carroll', 'NR', 'Chan, in Paris for a reunion with friends from World War I, becomes involved in investigating the murder of a munitions manufacturer who was supplying arms to the enemy, even as the rising clouds of World War II force the city into nightly blackout status..', 'Chan, in Paris for a reunion with friends from World War I, becomes involved in investigating the murder of a munitions manufacturer who was supplying arms to the enemy, even as the rising clouds of World War II force the city into nightly blackout status..', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rOv6CRm8WcUI7wsvUcfwk01lqWS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33389'),
  ('546361932892379908', 'City Island', 2009, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Raymond De Felitta, Eric Henriquez, Vanja Černjul', 'Raymond De Felitta', 'Andy Garcia, Julianna Margulies, Steven Strait, Emily Mortimer, Ezra Miller, Dominik Garcia, Carrie Baker Reynolds, Hope Glendon-Ross', 'PG-13', 'The Rizzos, a family who doesn''t share their habits, aspirations, and careers with one another, find their delicate web of lies disturbed by the arrival of a young ex-con brought home by Vince, the patriarch of the family, who is a corrections officer in real life, and a hopeful actor in private.', 'The Rizzos, a family who doesn''t share their habits, aspirations, and careers with one another, find their delicate web of lies disturbed by the arrival of a young ex-con brought home by Vince, the patriarch of the family, who is a corrections officer in real life, and a hopeful actor in private.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t7LJY2LCcGRLP9E4QbwBkLpZ2W7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28053'),
  ('429045041409494254', 'City Lights', 2014, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Hansal Mehta', null, 'Rajkummar Rao, Manav Kaul, Pramod Pathak, Sadiya Siddiqui, Patralekhaa, Vinod Rawat, Amarjeet Singh, Khushboo Upadhyay', null, 'Deepak Singh was an ex army person and owned a small garment shop in a Rajasthani village. When his life struck by a tragedy, he migrates to Mumbai, with his wife and young child, hoping for a better life. However, upon arriving, he soon discovers the challenges of life in a big city.', 'Deepak Singh was an ex army person and owned a small garment shop in a Rajasthani village. When his life struck by a tragedy, he migrates to Mumbai, with his wife and young child, hoping for a better life. However, upon arriving, he soon discovers the challenges of life in a big city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rrzypABFDyTpwbTLbmsXU9A8qEM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:277223'),
  ('305400188102736823', 'City Limits', 1985, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Aaron Lipstadt, Tim Suhrstedt', 'Don Keith Opper', 'John Stockwell, Darrell Larson, Rae Dawn Chong, James Earl Jones, Kim Cattrall, Don Keith Opper, Kane Hodder, Robby Benson', 'PG-13', 'A series of teenage gangs struggle against each other in a not-so-distant future. Eventually they unite against an evil corporation, as represented by evil CEO Robby Benson who wants to control everything.', 'A series of teenage gangs struggle against each other in a not-so-distant future. Eventually they unite against an evil corporation, as represented by evil CEO Robby Benson who wants to control everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2jigpy6ULAPYw8Y8Zklwm4Mgv8k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108059'),
  ('818922473641330635', 'City of Angels', 1998, 'Romance, Drama, Fantasy', 'Brad Silberling, John Seale, Michele Panelli-Venetis', 'Wim Wenders, Peter Handke, Richard Reitinger', 'Nicolas Cage, Meg Ryan, Andre Braugher, Dennis Franz, Colm Feore, Robin Bartlett, Joanna Merlin, Sarah Dampf', 'PG-13', 'When a guardian angel – who invisibly watches over the citizens of Los Angeles – becomes captivated by a strong-willed heart surgeon, he ponders trading in his pure, otherworldly existence for a mortal life with his beloved. The couple embarks on a tender but forbidden romance spanning heaven and Earth.', 'When a guardian angel – who invisibly watches over the citizens of Los Angeles – becomes captivated by a strong-willed heart surgeon, he ponders trading in his pure, otherworldly existence for a mortal life with his beloved. The couple embarks on a tender but forbidden romance spanning heaven and Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iuzxpUjHsbQJXV3kB9ZAdCimM60.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:795'),
  ('388357089208423348', 'City of Ember', 2008, 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Xavier Grobet, Gil Kenan, Jon Billington', 'Caroline Thompson', 'Saoirse Ronan, Harry Treadaway, Bill Murray, David Ryall, Tim Robbins, Mackenzie Crook, Marianne Jean-Baptiste, Mary Kay Place', 'PG', 'For generations, the people of the City of Ember have flourished in an amazing world of glittering lights. But Ember''s once powerful generator is failing and the great lamps that illuminate the city are starting to flicker. Now, two teenagers, in a race against time, must search Ember for clues that will unlock the ancient mystery of the city''s existence, before the the lights go out forever.', 'For generations, the people of the City of Ember have flourished in an amazing world of glittering lights. But Ember''s once powerful generator is failing and the great lamps that illuminate the city are starting to flicker. Now, two teenagers, in a race against time, must search Ember for clues that will unlock the ancient mystery of the city''s existence, before the the lights go out forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xHYxFNsl8KuT4tHai8d1Y5gJI0F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13600'),
  ('540071780620096478', 'City of Fear', 1959, 'Thriller', 'Lucien Ballard, Irving Lerner', 'Robert Dillon, Steven Ritch', 'Vince Edwards, Lyle Talbot, John Archer, Steven Ritch, Patricia Blair, Kelly Thordsen, Joseph Mell, Sherwood Price', 'NR', 'An escaped convict gets a hold of some radioactive material after his escape. Authorities desperately try to find the man that unknowingly is threating the lives of everyone in the city.', 'An escaped convict gets a hold of some radioactive material after his escape. Authorities desperately try to find the man that unknowingly is threating the lives of everyone in the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dDULZxXTs2g8iix5GF1OVmQUe8u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37942'),
  ('651734579033592354', 'City of Ghosts', 2002, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Matt Dillon, Jim Denault', 'Barry Gifford, Matt Dillon', 'Matt Dillon, James Caan, Natascha McElhone, Gérard Depardieu, Stellan Skarsgård, Rose Byrne, Shawn Andrews, Christopher Curry', 'R', 'A con man who is on the run from law enforcement in the U.S. travels to Cambodia to collect his share in an insurance scam but discovers more than he bargained for.', 'A con man who is on the run from law enforcement in the U.S. travels to Cambodia to collect his share in an insurance scam but discovers more than he bargained for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1nZbFdgEjJELfbZeXWLjXx5evHa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31932'),
  ('111432925740944489', 'City of Ghosts', 2017, 'War, Documentary', 'Matthew Heineman, Matthew Heineman', null, 'Abu Bakr Al-Baghdadi, Hamoud, Hassan, Hussam, Naji Jerf, Mohamad', 'R', 'With unprecedented access, this documentary follows the extraordinary journey of “Raqqa is Being Slaughtered Silently”—a group of anonymous citizen journalists who banded together after their homeland was overtaken by ISIS—as they risk their lives to stand up against one of the greatest evils in the world today.', 'With unprecedented access, this documentary follows the extraordinary journey of “Raqqa is Being Slaughtered Silently”—a group of anonymous citizen journalists who banded together after their homeland was overtaken by ISIS—as they risk their lives to stand up against one of the greatest evils in the world today.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c1RxAfjPsSWV1PxuxnJM9BXMTFP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:428501'),
  ('594630297885335584', 'City of Glass', 1998, 'Drama, Romance', 'Mabel Cheung Yuen-Ting, Jingle Ma Choh-Sing', 'Alex Law Kai-Yui, Mabel Cheung Yuen-Ting', 'Leon Lai Ming, Shu Qi, Eason Chan Yik-Shun, Nicola Cheung Sun-Yuet, Daniel Wu, Vincent Kok Tak-Chiu, Pauline Yam Bo-Lam, Joe Cheung Tung-Cho', null, 'The story of man and ex-girlfriend found dead after a car crash and how their children come together to retell the story.', 'The story of man and ex-girlfriend found dead after a car crash and how their children come together to retell the story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2FcLcilrHUffu7Eu4qvHEcRsXDV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45399'),
  ('318558659872238804', 'City of God', 2002, 'Drama, Crime', 'César Charlone, Malu Miranda, Isabella Teixeira', 'Bráulio Mantovani', 'Alexandre Rodrigues, Leandro Firmino, Phellipe Haagensen, Douglas Silva, Jonathan Haagensen, Matheus Nachtergaele, Seu Jorge, Jefechander Suplino', 'R', 'In the poverty-stricken favelas of Rio de Janeiro in the 1970s, two young men choose different paths. Rocket is a budding photographer who documents the increasing drug-related violence of his neighborhood, while José “Zé” Pequeno is an ambitious drug dealer diving into a dangerous life of crime.', 'In the poverty-stricken favelas of Rio de Janeiro in the 1970s, two young men choose different paths. Rocket is a budding photographer who documents the increasing drug-related violence of his neighborhood, while José “Zé” Pequeno is an ambitious drug dealer diving into a dangerous life of crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k7eYdWvhYQyRQoU2TB2A2Xu2TfD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:598'),
  ('984791394194022139', 'City of God: 10 Years Later', 2013, 'Documentary', 'Luciano Vidigal, Cavi Borges', 'André Sampaio, Cavi Borges, Luciano Vidigal', 'Alexandre Rodrigues, Leandro Firmino, Roberta Rodrigues, Jonathan Haagensen, Seu Jorge, Alice Braga, Thiago Martins, Darlan Cunha', null, 'City of God – 10 Years Later investigates what happened to the actors who took part in the award-winning film directed by Fernando Meirelles and Katia Lund. This documentary shows what City of God’s worldwide success meant to their lives. Were the actors prepared for the film’s success? Did the social background of some of them prove stronger than the opportunity that came their way?', 'City of God – 10 Years Later investigates what happened to the actors who took part in the award-winning film directed by Fernando Meirelles and Katia Lund. This documentary shows what City of God’s worldwide success meant to their lives. Were the actors prepared for the film’s success? Did the social background of some of them prove stronger than the opportunity that came their way?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dz3ynaQbL0etAuAv119jH8DfoEJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:300605'),
  ('70963469194111968', 'City of Gold', 1957, 'Documentary', 'Wolf Koenig, Colin Low, Douglas Roberts', 'Gilbert Choquette, Roman Kroitor, Pierre Berton', 'Pierre Berton', null, 'Classic short film depicts the Klondike gold rush at its peak, when would-be prospectors struggled through harsh conditions to reach the fabled gold fields over 3000 km north of civilization. Still photographs juxtapose Dawson City today against its bustling height in the gold rush.', 'Classic short film depicts the Klondike gold rush at its peak, when would-be prospectors struggled through harsh conditions to reach the fabled gold fields over 3000 km north of civilization. Still photographs juxtapose Dawson City today against its bustling height in the gold rush.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xgnzwD8iJ2jNRuMcOxnccXAt27d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128441'),
  ('181595737024997609', 'City of Hope', 1991, 'Drama', 'Robert Richardson, John Sayles, Gregory Jacobs', 'John Sayles', 'Vincent Spano, Tony Lo Bianco, Joe Morton, Jace Alexander, Todd Graff, Frankie Faison, Gloria Foster, Angela Bassett', null, 'This gritty inner-city film follows various people living in a troubled New Jersey setting, most notably Nick Rinaldi, a disillusioned contractor who has been helped along his whole life by his wealthy father. Other characters in this ensemble drama about urban conflict and corruption include Asteroid , an unstable homeless person, and Wynn, an idealistic young politician.', 'This gritty inner-city film follows various people living in a troubled New Jersey setting, most notably Nick Rinaldi, a disillusioned contractor who has been helped along his whole life by his wealthy father. Other characters in this ensemble drama about urban conflict and corruption include Asteroid , an unstable homeless person, and Wynn, an idealistic young politician.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cPCahQHDhAOAaw2mU4L5Hfpq6OF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1772'),
  ('1095801456674845973', 'City of Industry', 1997, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'John Irvin, Thomas Burstyn, Ernie F. Orsatti', 'Ken Solarz', 'Harvey Keitel, Stephen Dorff, Timothy Hutton, Famke Janssen, Wade Dominguez, Michael Jai White, Lucy Liu, Reno Wilson', 'R', 'A retired thief swears revenge on the lunatic who murdered his brother and partner, while going on the run with the loot they stole.', 'A retired thief swears revenge on the lunatic who murdered his brother and partner, while going on the run with the loot they stole.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8sLhOGSCTVeaihjXIy0OjL520F2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18420'),
  ('334308894951982159', 'City of Joy', 1992, 'Drama', 'Roland Joffé, Adam Somner, Cliff Lanning', 'Dominique LaPierre', 'Patrick Swayze, Om Puri, Pauline Collins, Shabana Azmi, Ayesha Dharker, Art Malik, Nabil Shaban, Suneeta Sengupta', 'PG-13', 'Max Lowe is a Houston surgeon who has grown weary of the bureaucracy of American medicine. When he loses a patient on the operating table, Max impulsively decides to leave America and travel to India in the hope of finding himself. Not long after he arrives in Calcutta, Max is attacked by a group of thugs and left without money or a passport.', 'Max Lowe is a Houston surgeon who has grown weary of the bureaucracy of American medicine. When he loses a patient on the operating table, Max impulsively decides to leave America and travel to India in the hope of finding himself. Not long after he arrives in Calcutta, Max is attacked by a group of thugs and left without money or a passport.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/heq4BXSPGkhpLXEc20zkDlwQgUe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47821'),
  ('543074476437432301', 'City of Lies', 2018, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Brad Furman', 'Christian Contreras', 'Johnny Depp, Forest Whitaker, Toby Huss, Dayton Callie, Neil Brown Jr., Shea Whigham, Xander Berkeley, Louis Herthum', 'R', 'Los Angeles Police Department detective Russell Poole has spent years trying to solve his biggest case -- the murders of The Notorious B.I.G. and Tupac Shakur -- but after two decades, the investigation remains open. Jack Jackson, a reporter desperate to save his reputation and career, is determined to find out why. In search of the truth, the two team up and unravel a growing web of institutional corruption and lies.', 'Los Angeles Police Department detective Russell Poole has spent years trying to solve his biggest case -- the murders of The Notorious B.I.G. and Tupac Shakur -- but after two decades, the investigation remains open. Jack Jackson, a reporter desperate to save his reputation and career, is determined to find out why. In search of the truth, the two team up and unravel a growing web of institutional corruption and lies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pK7IYQdtdWtMDBJZfMqDxgMjXEt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:433501'),
  ('758463460754853304', 'City of Life and Death', 2009, 'Drama, History, War', 'Lu Chuan, Cao Yu', 'Lu Chuan', 'Liu Ye, Gao Yuanyuan, Hideo Nakaizumi, John Paisley, Beverly Peckous, Fan Wei, Qin Lan, Ryu Kohata', 'R', 'In 1937, during the height of the Second Sino-Japanese War, the Imperial Japanese Army has just captured Nanjing, then-capital of the Republic of China. What followed was known as the Nanking Massacre, or the Rape of Nanking, a six week period wherein tens of thousands of Chinese soldiers and civilians were killed.', 'In 1937, during the height of the Second Sino-Japanese War, the Imperial Japanese Army has just captured Nanjing, then-capital of the Republic of China. What followed was known as the Nanking Massacre, or the Rape of Nanking, a six week period wherein tens of thousands of Chinese soldiers and civilians were killed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xY6OUM2aRCmmq1ySTg2eu5rVmcq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21345'),
