  ('1122393955248182105', 'City Under Siege', 2010, 'Science Fiction, Action, Thriller', 'Benny Chan Muk-Sing, Anthony Pun Yiu-Ming', 'Benny Chan Muk-Sing', 'Aaron Kwok, Shu Qi, Wu Jing, Zhang Jingchu, Yuen Wah, Collin Chou, Tie Nan, Karen Cheung Bo-Man', null, 'Sunny is a naïve circus performer who dreams of inheriting his father''s knife-throwing skills. However, his hostile colleagues continue to bully him, relegating him to a lowly clown. On a tour to Malaysia, Cheung and other performers discover a cave occupied by the Japanese army during World War II. Instead of finding treasure, the performers - including Sunny - are sprayed with a mysterious chemical that turns them into superhuman mutants...', 'Sunny is a naïve circus performer who dreams of inheriting his father''s knife-throwing skills. However, his hostile colleagues continue to bully him, relegating him to a lowly clown. On a tour to Malaysia, Cheung and other performers discover a cave occupied by the Japanese army during World War II. Instead of finding treasure, the performers - including Sunny - are sprayed with a mysterious chemical that turns them into superhuman mutants...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8FDwOGJT7OSE3Rho4qDoifMpOTW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44263'),
