  ('489025391000904389', 'Çılgın Dersane 4: Ada', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Kamil Çetin', 'Şafak Güçlü', 'Okan Karacan, Fulya Keskin, Ozan Aydemir, Hilmi Cem İntepe, Veysel Diker, Ferhat Yılmaz, Serkan Şengül, Esra Sönmezer', null, 'This time, the team we see with Ada is adapting to the conditions of an island while enjoying the sea and sun, setting sail for new adventures. While struggling to survive on the island where they will stay for a certain period of time, things start to get complicated with the addition of mysterious and even scary characters to the comical events they experience.', 'This time, the team we see with Ada is adapting to the conditions of an island while enjoying the sea and sun, setting sail for new adventures. While struggling to survive on the island where they will stay for a certain period of time, things start to get complicated with the addition of mysterious and even scary characters to the comical events they experience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2BUd7oL3trsVWpqSNsOGwv9MXG5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:348834'),
  ('478658078029765243', 'Çılgın Dersane Kampta', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Faruk Aksoy', 'Şafak Güçlü', 'Cüneyt Arkın, Alp Kırşan, Simge Tertemiz, Ceyda Ateş, Paşhan Yılmazel, Bahar Akça, İlhan Daner, Berke Hürcan', null, 'After winning a competition organized by the Antalya Tutoring Centers Association, Istanbul Özlem Tutoring Center is saved from debt and returns to its building in Istanbul to continue its education. Meanwhile, Kerem and Özlem leave to study at a university in London on scholarships. At the same time, thanks to the successful program in Antalya, many new students enroll in the tutoring center. One of them is the famous pop singer Berksan. Months pass, and with just one month left before the university exam, it is decided to go on a camping trip to a natural paradise with rivers and waterfalls, following Hadi Hoca''s idea, to have fun, escape exam stress, consume plenty of oxygen, and continue with accelerated courses to prepare for the exam.', 'After winning a competition organized by the Antalya Tutoring Centers Association, Istanbul Özlem Tutoring Center is saved from debt and returns to its building in Istanbul to continue its education. Meanwhile, Kerem and Özlem leave to study at a university in London on scholarships. At the same time, thanks to the successful program in Antalya, many new students enroll in the tutoring center. One of them is the famous pop singer Berksan. Months pass, and with just one month left before the university exam, it is decided to go on a camping trip to a natural paradise with rivers and waterfalls, following Hadi Hoca''s idea, to have fun, escape exam stress, consume plenty of oxygen, and continue with accelerated courses to prepare for the exam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vrjpobx9mOz4ddFlqoWk7ODipiI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86319'),
