  ('113326754916385962', 'Clair Obscur', 2017, 'Drama', 'Michael Hammon, Yeşim Ustaoğlu', 'Yeşim Ustaoğlu', 'Funda Eryiğit, Ecem Uzun, Mehmet Kurtuluş, Okan Yalabık, Serkan Keskin, Sema Poyraz, Metin Akdülger, Evren Duyal', null, 'Şehnaz, a young female psychiatrist from Istanbul, starts mandatory duty in a provincial town. Back in the city, she maintains a marriage that looks flawless on the outside. Elmas, a young woman on the verge of breakdown, opens a new path in her.', 'Şehnaz, a young female psychiatrist from Istanbul, starts mandatory duty in a provincial town. Back in the city, she maintains a marriage that looks flawless on the outside. Elmas, a young woman on the verge of breakdown, opens a new path in her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/um5XZsYoKCB2gt6I6dk7z1Yf01n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:412200'),
  ('434344318148506008', 'Claire Andrieux', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Olivier Jahan, Rémy Chevrin', 'Olivier Jahan, Diastème', 'Thomas VDB, Emma de Caunes, Yannick Renier, Christine Brücher, Michel Vuillermoz, Jeanne Rosa, Olivia Ross, Pierre-Benoist Varoclier', null, 'A single forty-something, with a well-regulated life, sees a heavy secret poisoning her budding relationship with a man she fell in love with.', 'A single forty-something, with a well-regulated life, sees a heavy secret poisoning her budding relationship with a man she fell in love with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/seYTqIe89NapU6O5coI23iX6Wt2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:749015'),
  ('869416864661709869', 'Claire Darling', 2019, 'Drama', 'Julie Bertuccelli, Irina Lubtchansky', 'Julie Bertuccelli, Sophie Fillières', 'Catherine Deneuve, Chiara Mastroianni, Alice Taglioni, Olivier Rabourdin, Samir Guesmi, Johan Leysen, Laure Calamy, Yasin Houicha', null, 'On this beautiful, bright first day of summer, Claire Darling has decided to get rid of all her estate. She’s laid down all her favourite objects on her front lawn for one splendid garage sale. As a horde of curious bystanders and neighbors fights over the ridiculously underpriced antiques, each object resurrects flashes of Claire Darling’s tragic and flamboyant life. Alerted by her childhood friends, Marie Darling, Claire’s estranged daughter, is forced to come back to the family mansion to stop this sale and unveil the reasons behind her mother’s eccentric decision.', 'On this beautiful, bright first day of summer, Claire Darling has decided to get rid of all her estate. She’s laid down all her favourite objects on her front lawn for one splendid garage sale. As a horde of curious bystanders and neighbors fights over the ridiculously underpriced antiques, each object resurrects flashes of Claire Darling’s tragic and flamboyant life. Alerted by her childhood friends, Marie Darling, Claire’s estranged daughter, is forced to come back to the family mansion to stop this sale and unveil the reasons behind her mother’s eccentric decision.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/htVovYJE966Rk2TGiBrbG9g20Ne.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:482710'),
  ('44370729077306814', 'Claire Dolan', 1998, 'Drama', 'Lodge Kerrigan, Teodoro Maniaci, John M. Tyson', 'Lodge Kerrigan', 'Katrin Cartlidge, Vincent D''Onofrio, Colm Meaney, Patrick Husted, Muriel Maida, Madison Arnold, Ed Hodson, Sean Powers', 'NR', 'A high-priced call girl, shocked by her mother''s death, decides to get out of the business and have a baby.', 'A high-priced call girl, shocked by her mother''s death, decides to get out of the business and have a baby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3tTruxVJkXSgm0SdZhu7fTJZFZo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47186'),
  ('421500127611842244', 'Claire''s Camera', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Hong Sang-soo, Lee Jin-keun', 'Hong Sang-soo', 'Isabelle Huppert, Kim Min-hee, Chang Mi-hee, Jung Jin-young, Shahira Fahmy, Yoon Hee-sun, Mark Peranson, Kang Tae-u', null, 'On a business trip to the Cannes Film Festival, Manhee is accused of being dishonest, and fired. A teacher named Claire goes around taking photos with a Polaroid camera. She gets to know Manhee and sympathizes with her. Claire is like a person who can see Manhee''s possible future or past selves, through the mysterious power of the beach tunnel. Through taking photos, Claire has acquired the ability to look slowly at things, and to transform objects. Now, Claire goes with Manhee to the café where she was fired. We look forward to seeing Claire''s power at work.', 'On a business trip to the Cannes Film Festival, Manhee is accused of being dishonest, and fired. A teacher named Claire goes around taking photos with a Polaroid camera. She gets to know Manhee and sympathizes with her. Claire is like a person who can see Manhee''s possible future or past selves, through the mysterious power of the beach tunnel. Through taking photos, Claire has acquired the ability to look slowly at things, and to transform objects. Now, Claire goes with Manhee to the café where she was fired. We look forward to seeing Claire''s power at work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n12X1HWLOLQXmh781WvG8McLuDI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:432507'),
  ('773592883809641388', 'Claire''s Knee', 1970, 'Drama, Romance', 'Éric Rohmer, Néstor Almendros', 'Éric Rohmer', 'Jean-Claude Brialy, Aurora Cornu, Béatrice Romand, Laurence de Monaghan, Michèle Montel, Gérard Falconetti, Fabrice Luchini, Sandra Franchina', null, 'On the eve of his wedding, on holiday on the Lake Annecy shore, a career diplomat visits an old acquaintance, perhaps a former girlfriend. Through her he meets an intense teenager, Laura, and then lusts after her sister, Claire. Whilst Laura attempts to flirt with him, his fantasy becomes focused on wanting to caress Claire''s knee.', 'On the eve of his wedding, on holiday on the Lake Annecy shore, a career diplomat visits an old acquaintance, perhaps a former girlfriend. Through her he meets an intense teenager, Laura, and then lusts after her sister, Claire. Whilst Laura attempts to flirt with him, his fantasy becomes focused on wanting to caress Claire''s knee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wekWNf0Nj6fkfR6pOjPojMAqz69.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2860'),
  ('886844564896312304', 'Clambake', 1967, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Claude Binyon Jr., William Margulies, Arthur H. Nadel', 'Arthur Browne Jr.', 'Elvis Presley, Shelley Fabares, Will Hutchins, Bill Bixby, Gary Merrill, James Gregory, Suzie Kaye, Harold Peary', 'NR', 'The heir to an oil fortune trades places with a water-ski instructor at a Florida hotel to see if girls will like him for himself, rather than his father''s money.', 'The heir to an oil fortune trades places with a water-ski instructor at a Florida hotel to see if girls will like him for himself, rather than his father''s money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2d7E9eattf7dkFR16OVJmHBmBsr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26299'),
