  ('457518817924103069', 'Clan of Amazons', 1978, 'Action', 'Chor Yuen, Tong Kai, Huang Pei-Chih', 'Chor Yuen', 'Tony Liu Tian-jue, Ling Yun, Norman Tsui Siu-Keung, Ching Li, Elliot Ngok Wah, Mannor Chan Man-Na, Shih Szu, Eddie Koo Koon Chung', null, 'The Embroidery Bandit is stealing treasures while blinding his victims. The hero Liu Xiaofeng is called in to solve the mystery. The evidence points to the all-woman Clan of the Red Shoes - but appearances can be deceptive.', 'The Embroidery Bandit is stealing treasures while blinding his victims. The hero Liu Xiaofeng is called in to solve the mystery. The evidence points to the all-woman Clan of the Red Shoes - but appearances can be deceptive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h8yS6KSBJJZHH8EPUaWsNSx32LN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64304'),
  ('1094858798362452635', 'Clan of the White Lotus', 1980, 'Action, Drama', 'Lo Lieh, Huang Pa-Ching, Lee Tai-Hang', 'Huang Tien', 'Gordon Liu Chia-Hui, Lo Lieh, Kara Hui Ying-Hung, Lam Fai-Wong, Johnny Wang Lung-Wei, King Lee King-Chu, Yeung Ching-Ching, Hsiao Ho', null, 'The Qing emperor releases all detained Shaolin disciples, but the vindictive White Lotus clan decides to exterminate all the disciples. One martial artist survives the onslaught, and constantly trains while in hiding for revenge.', 'The Qing emperor releases all detained Shaolin disciples, but the vindictive White Lotus clan decides to exterminate all the disciples. One martial artist survives the onslaught, and constantly trains while in hiding for revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pEzzzy3vzge65hdbKsTNFYcDdyO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41377'),
  ('974241405247022494', 'Clandestine Childhood', 2012, 'Drama', 'Benjamín Ávila, Bruno Roberti, Luis Bernárdez', 'Marcelo Müller, Benjamín Ávila', 'Ernesto Alterio, Natalia Oreiro, César Troncoso, Teo Gutiérrez Moreno, Cristina Banegas, Mayana Neiva, Douglas Simon, Violeta Palukas', null, 'Juan lives in clandestinity. Just like his mum, his dad and his adored uncle Beto, outside his home he has another name. At school, Juan is known as Ernesto. And he meets María, who only has one name. Based on true events, set in the Argentina of 1979, this film is one about love.', 'Juan lives in clandestinity. Just like his mum, his dad and his adored uncle Beto, outside his home he has another name. At school, Juan is known as Ernesto. And he meets María, who only has one name. Based on true events, set in the Argentina of 1979, this film is one about love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f9kD66dPRbJZYZkw1jCU4ubCjCC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127880'),
  ('397359519161067954', 'Clandestinos', 2008, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Antonio Hens, César Hernando', 'Antonio Hens, Gabriel Olivares', 'Israel Rodríguez, Mehroz Arif, Hugo Catalán, Juanma Lara, Elena Martínez, Inma Cuevas, Pepa Aniorte, Fanny de Castro', null, 'Xabi, a troubled boy, meets Iñaki, a member of the terrorist gang ETA who becomes his mentor and ideological inspiration. Some time later, Xabi is arrested for throwing a Molotov cocktail and confined in a juvenile detention center, where he meets Joel, a Mexican, and Driss, a Moroccan, with whom he manages to flee and reach Madrid with the purpose of finding Iñaki and joining the gang.', 'Xabi, a troubled boy, meets Iñaki, a member of the terrorist gang ETA who becomes his mentor and ideological inspiration. Some time later, Xabi is arrested for throwing a Molotov cocktail and confined in a juvenile detention center, where he meets Joel, a Mexican, and Driss, a Moroccan, with whom he manages to flee and reach Madrid with the purpose of finding Iñaki and joining the gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6aO8GD5ENdS3a8uH3Q58qlA4nYV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44320'),
  ('910410281641121354', 'Clannad: The Motion Picture', 2007, 'Animation, Drama, Romance', 'Osamu Dezaki, Youichi Oonishi, Chiaki Yamada', 'Makoto Nakamura', 'Kenji Nojima, Mai Nakahara, Ryotaro Okiayu, Kikuko Inoue, Daisuke Sakaguchi, Houko Kuwashima, Ryo Hirohashi, Hikaru Midorikawa', 'PG', 'Plagued by a seemingly endless stream of haunting dreams, Tomoya drifts through life with an almost overwhelming sense of anger and emptiness. Then, one fateful day, he meets the mysterious and beautiful Nagisa, and his world begins to change. While helping Nagisa revive the defunct Drama Club at their high school, Tomoya discovers that she has the same dreams. Their story starts beneath the cherry blossoms, but where will fate lead them?', 'Plagued by a seemingly endless stream of haunting dreams, Tomoya drifts through life with an almost overwhelming sense of anger and emptiness. Then, one fateful day, he meets the mysterious and beautiful Nagisa, and his world begins to change. While helping Nagisa revive the defunct Drama Club at their high school, Tomoya discovers that she has the same dreams. Their story starts beneath the cherry blossoms, but where will fate lead them?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/crJYdKEriRiyimMr5TUHxNW0XP5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16516'),
  ('200755713058613052', 'Clans of Intrigue', 1977, 'Action, Drama, Mystery', 'Chor Yuen, Chang Chuan-tsan, Chan Fen', 'Ni Kuang', 'Ti Lung, Elliot Ngok Wah, Li Ching, Nora Miao, Betty Pei Ti, Ling Yun, Tin Ching, Nancy Yen Nan-See', null, 'Chu Liuxiang is having drinks with his friend, Monk Wuhua. Gong Nanyan of the Holy Water Palace suddenly appears and accuses Chu of having stolen the palace''s Heaven''s One Holy Water and committed a series of murders. She agrees to give Chu a month''s time to clear his name, or else the mistress of the palace will kill him. Chu''s curiosity and eagerness to prove his innocence spur him to investigate the case.', 'Chu Liuxiang is having drinks with his friend, Monk Wuhua. Gong Nanyan of the Holy Water Palace suddenly appears and accuses Chu of having stolen the palace''s Heaven''s One Holy Water and committed a series of murders. She agrees to give Chu a month''s time to clear his name, or else the mistress of the palace will kill him. Chu''s curiosity and eagerness to prove his innocence spur him to investigate the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2TzJoDTc8E5Dt6TBI1kPyCrgDsr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88048'),
  ('949630232552838199', 'Clapham Junction', 2007, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Adrian Shergold', 'Kevin Elyot', 'Rupert Graves, Samantha Bond, Paul Nicholls, Luke Treadaway, Lucy Russell, James Wilby, Stuart Bunce, David Leon', null, 'Set in the Clapham district of south London, England, the film is inspired by true events. The paths of several men intersect during a dramatic thirty-six hours in which their lives are changed forever.', 'Set in the Clapham district of south London, England, the film is inspired by true events. The paths of several men intersect during a dramatic thirty-six hours in which their lives are changed forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tFfbPg1prSGZIybOEdc1azYnjcA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39517'),
  ('899471014829216576', 'Clara', 2008, 'Drama, Music', 'Helma Sanders-Brahms, Jürgen Jürges', 'Helma Sanders-Brahms, Nicole-Lise Bernheim, Colo Tavernier O''Hagan', 'Martina Gedeck, Pascal Greggory, Malik Zidi, Christine Oesterlein, Péter Takátsy, Rainer Delventhal, Béla Fesztbaum, Rainer Goernemann', null, 'A look at the lives of 19th-century composers Clara and Robert Schumann.', 'A look at the lives of 19th-century composers Clara and Robert Schumann.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bzu90qwySYknzRK7cFRFPWSmdL2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8890'),
