  ('810616184699219792', 'Clara and the Why Not', 1981, 'Music, Comedy, Drama', 'Jacques Monnet, Yves Lafaye', 'Jean-Loup Dabadie', 'Isabelle Adjani, Thierry Lhermitte, Daniel Auteuil, Josiane Balasko, Christian Clavier, Roland Giraud, Christophe Bourseiller, Marianne Sergent', null, 'Three days in the lives of six friends who are nearly 30 years old, live in Grenoble, and have a rock band called the "Why Notes?". They''re to play in Paris at Charles''s school reunion. In getting to Paris and back, the characters interact with Aimee''s ex-husband and her abrasive, cruel ex-mentor, Louise''s would-be lover who turns out to have a husband, Mickey''s long-time lover and her children, Bertrand''s Germanic wife and their children who speak no French, and Frederic''s distant mother. The band also meets Clara, a mercurial free spirit who beguiles Bertrand, then Mickey, then takes up with someone else in the band.', 'Three days in the lives of six friends who are nearly 30 years old, live in Grenoble, and have a rock band called the "Why Notes?". They''re to play in Paris at Charles''s school reunion. In getting to Paris and back, the characters interact with Aimee''s ex-husband and her abrasive, cruel ex-mentor, Louise''s would-be lover who turns out to have a husband, Mickey''s long-time lover and her children, Bertrand''s Germanic wife and their children who speak no French, and Frederic''s distant mother. The band also meets Clara, a mercurial free spirit who beguiles Bertrand, then Mickey, then takes up with someone else in the band.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pRNUY8YLyvt9wlPV8AKWYQlLnzw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49959'),
  ('1042543463609732023', 'Clara Sola', 2021, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Sophie Winqvist, Nathalie Álvarez Mesén', 'María Camila Arias, Nathalie Álvarez Mesén', 'Wendy Chinchilla Araya, Ana Julia Porras Espinoza, Daniel Castañeda Rincón, Flor María Vargas Chaves, Laura Román Arguedas, María Belén Román Quesada, Rodolfo Esquivel Gómez, Luis Gerardo Cruz Cruz', null, 'In a remote village in Costa Rica, Clara, a withdrawn 40-year-old woman, experiences a sexual and mystical awakening as she begins a journey to free herself from the repressive religious and social conventions which have dominated her life.', 'In a remote village in Costa Rica, Clara, a withdrawn 40-year-old woman, experiences a sexual and mystical awakening as she begins a journey to free herself from the repressive religious and social conventions which have dominated her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hiNpCAQJiE812sdfhanGsUecRrh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:785212'),
  ('874156762184573808', 'Clara''s Heart', 1988, 'Drama', 'Robert Mulligan, Freddie Francis', 'Mark Medoff', 'Whoopi Goldberg, Michael Ontkean, Kathleen Quinlan, Neil Patrick Harris, Spalding Gray, Jason Downs, Hattie Winston, Beverly Todd', null, 'David is a teenager whose parents are in a deteriorating marriage after their infant daughter dies. Clara is a chambermaid at a Jamaican resort who''s hired to be a housekeeper. She and David develop a close bond, opening his eyes and heart to new experiences, and eventually leading to a disturbing secret in Clara''s past.', 'David is a teenager whose parents are in a deteriorating marriage after their infant daughter dies. Clara is a chambermaid at a Jamaican resort who''s hired to be a housekeeper. She and David develop a close bond, opening his eyes and heart to new experiences, and eventually leading to a disturbing secret in Clara''s past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sb5fGw0l8PVFPL14lu2UN7Ibed0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73079'),
  ('667429712628654685', 'Clara''s Summer', 2004, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Patrick Grandperret', 'Nathalie Stragier', 'Selma Brook, Soko, Salomé Stévenin, Bastien Catenacci, Léo Grandperret, Fanny Florido', 'NR', 'Clara goes to summer camp with her best friend Zoé. Far from their parents, they hope to make love to a boy for the first time. After Zoé rejects the advances by Sébastien, because she finds him too forward, she returns to Clara and declares her love. But Clara rejects the advances of Zoé - and meets the sulphurous Sonia.', 'Clara goes to summer camp with her best friend Zoé. Far from their parents, they hope to make love to a boy for the first time. After Zoé rejects the advances by Sébastien, because she finds him too forward, she returns to Clara and declares her love. But Clara rejects the advances of Zoé - and meets the sulphurous Sonia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/upN0OcYwqniyvRplUhP8qAAHplZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81456'),
  ('638489011341533285', 'Clarence, the Cross-Eyed Lion', 1965, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Andrew Marton', 'Alan Caillou', 'Marshall Thompson, Betsy Drake, Richard Haydn, Alan Caillou, Rockne Tarkington, Maurice Marsac, Robert DoQui, Cheryl Miller', null, 'When a native village is apparently terrorized by a Lion, the local sergeant enlists the help of a veterinarian working at a nearby animal study center. It is soon discovered that the Lion has a unique problem, it has double vision due to the fact that it is cross eyed and therefore cannot hunt. The Lion is taken back to the study center and is soon adopted by the vet''s daughter. Meanwhile, a dangerous criminal is planning to capture young Gorillas and sell them on the black market...', 'When a native village is apparently terrorized by a Lion, the local sergeant enlists the help of a veterinarian working at a nearby animal study center. It is soon discovered that the Lion has a unique problem, it has double vision due to the fact that it is cross eyed and therefore cannot hunt. The Lion is taken back to the study center and is soon adopted by the vet''s daughter. Meanwhile, a dangerous criminal is planning to capture young Gorillas and sell them on the black market...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/75XsQNtdyqK1muGkmKiTM6jyQQE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106919'),
