  ('1129353457755985977', 'Claws in the Lease', 1963, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Sylvester Cat and his son, Junior, live in a dump, and Junior decides to find them a home. He does, but the fat lady who lives there only wants to adopt Junior and separates the kitten from his father. So, Sylvester makes a number of attempts to gain access to her house.', 'Sylvester Cat and his son, Junior, live in a dump, and Junior decides to find them a home. He does, but the fat lady who lives there only wants to adopt Junior and separates the kitten from his father. So, Sylvester makes a number of attempts to gain access to her house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ySQ4W4roUJuWGEo5BD7ltanbQ2o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234463'),
  ('420245457315097314', 'Clay Pigeons', 1998, 'Crime, Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'David Dobkin, Matias Alvarez, Michael Hennessey', 'Matthew L. Healy', 'Joaquin Phoenix, Vince Vaughn, Janeane Garofalo, Scott Wilson, Gregory Sporleder, Georgina Cates, Vince Vieluf, Joseph D. Reitman', 'R', 'Clay is a young man in a small town who witnesses his friend, Earl, kill himself because of the ongoing affair that Clay was having with the man''s wife, Amanda. Feeling guilty, Clay now resists the widow when she presses him to continue with the affair. Clay unknowingly befriends a serial killer named Lester Long who murders the widow in an attempt to "help" his "fishing buddy."', 'Clay is a young man in a small town who witnesses his friend, Earl, kill himself because of the ongoing affair that Clay was having with the man''s wife, Amanda. Feeling guilty, Clay now resists the widow when she presses him to continue with the affair. Clay unknowingly befriends a serial killer named Lester Long who murders the widow in an attempt to "help" his "fishing buddy."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6cxoftMuiwcQ9xzXfvGWAQfWUmK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26618'),
  ('3840519148956726', 'Claymation Christmas Celebration', 1987, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Will Vinton, Barry Bruce, Douglas Aberle', 'Ralph Liddle', 'Tim Conner, Johnny Counterfit', null, 'Herb and Rex, the Jurassic odd couple, guide a Christmas choral celebration in this Emmy Award-winning special, guest-starring the California Raisins! Segments feature the Three Wise Men, singing camels, ice-skating penguins, and the hilarious Paris Bellharmonic Orchestra.', 'Herb and Rex, the Jurassic odd couple, guide a Christmas choral celebration in this Emmy Award-winning special, guest-starring the California Raisins! Segments feature the Three Wise Men, singing camels, ice-skating penguins, and the hilarious Paris Bellharmonic Orchestra.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kv5qk7wSVKu7G2mRdj2KnQCXkkV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21386'),
  ('216913560423612854', 'Clean', 2004, 'Drama', 'Olivier Assayas, Éric Gautier', 'Olivier Assayas', 'Maggie Cheung, Nick Nolte, Béatrice Dalle, Jeanne Balibar, Don McKellar, Martha Henry, James Johnston, James Dennis', null, 'After she ends up in prison and loses custody of her son, a woman struggles to assimilate outside her former life and remain clean long enough to regain custody of her son.', 'After she ends up in prison and loses custody of her son, a woman struggles to assimilate outside her former life and remain clean long enough to regain custody of her son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/srenglG0ITLow4pR35IvJiAYuiX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39851'),
  ('467239236449319589', 'Clean', 2022, 'Crime, Action, Drama', 'Ryan Alan Dearth, Zoran Popović, Paul Solet', 'Paul Solet, Adrien Brody', 'Adrien Brody, Glenn Fleshler, Richie Merritt, Chandler DuPont, Mykelti Williamson, Michelle Wilson, John Bianco, RZA', null, 'Tormented by a past life, garbage man Clean attempts a life of quiet redemption. But when his good intentions mark him a target of a local crime boss, Clean is forced to reconcile with the violence of his past.', 'Tormented by a past life, garbage man Clean attempts a life of quiet redemption. But when his good intentions mark him a target of a local crime boss, Clean is forced to reconcile with the violence of his past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kRpKJstAW7DsoPAEBW2Kk1uD9Q6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:689700'),
  ('1095445687771645187', 'Clean and Sober', 1988, 'Drama', 'Glenn Gordon Caron, Jan Kiesser', 'Tod Carroll', 'Michael Keaton, Kathy Baker, Morgan Freeman, Tate Donovan, Henry Judd Baker, Claudia Christian, J. David Krassner, Dakin Matthews', 'R', 'Hotshot real estate salesman Daryl has a bad cocaine habit. After embezzling his company''s money, he wakes up next to a girl who overdosed. To hide from the police, he checks into a rehabilitation program guaranteeing anonymity. Under the mentorship of counselor Craig, Daryl accepts that he has a substance abuse problem. As he falls in love with fellow patient Charlie, Daryl begins committing to a newly sober life.', 'Hotshot real estate salesman Daryl has a bad cocaine habit. After embezzling his company''s money, he wakes up next to a girl who overdosed. To hide from the police, he checks into a rehabilitation program guaranteeing anonymity. Under the mentorship of counselor Craig, Daryl accepts that he has a substance abuse problem. As he falls in love with fellow patient Charlie, Daryl begins committing to a newly sober life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cU2VrB1SbKg3WypvK2Z0u1jLQEK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14441'),
  ('232882511767232032', 'Clean Pastures', 1937, 'Animation, Comedy, Music', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc, Danny Webb', null, 'The Lord sees that the stock value of "Pair-o-dice" is dropping on the exchange so he dispatches a slow-witted and slow-talking angel to sinful Harlem to recruit new customers. When this fails, God finds success sending a group of musical angels with a little more swing in their style, so much so that even the Devil wants to join up! One of the “Censored 11” banned from TV syndication by United Artists in 1968 for racist stereotyping.', 'The Lord sees that the stock value of "Pair-o-dice" is dropping on the exchange so he dispatches a slow-witted and slow-talking angel to sinful Harlem to recruit new customers. When this fails, God finds success sending a group of musical angels with a little more swing in their style, so much so that even the Devil wants to join up! One of the “Censored 11” banned from TV syndication by United Artists in 1968 for racist stereotyping.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7O7LUjnyjKav6y6nk40luNl66CO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205877'),
  ('1150930766744650809', 'Clean Sex', 2015, 'Comedy', 'María Conchita Díaz', 'Dariela Pérez, María Conchita Díaz', 'Cosette Borges, Tarek Becerril', null, 'Mariana has an obsessive cleaning habit. After starting a troubled relationship with Enrique. She must accept that sex is dirty and impulsive.', 'Mariana has an obsessive cleaning habit. After starting a troubled relationship with Enrique. She must accept that sex is dirty and impulsive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/57zuiN6e8D82p15HsHV9JxwKxhJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:350640'),
  ('182320121479951695', 'Clean Slate', 1994, 'Comedy, Mystery', 'Mick Jackson, Andrew Dunn, Mindy Marin', 'Robert King', 'Dana Carvey, Valeria Golino, James Earl Jones, Kevin Pollak, Michael Gambon, Michael Murphy, Jayne Brook, Vyto Ruginis', 'PG-13', 'Pogue is a private eye with a problem: every morning when he wakes up, he has total amnesia, waking up with a ''blank slate''. Since he is in the middle of a hot investigation and has a developing romance, this is less than convenient.', 'Pogue is a private eye with a problem: every morning when he wakes up, he has total amnesia, waking up with a ''blank slate''. Since he is in the middle of a hot investigation and has a developing romance, this is less than convenient.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kAYsvQvBVshLHGTIDGHcj9jTJq0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18658'),
  ('1044408950778869719', 'Clean, Shaven', 1995, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Teodoro Maniaci, Lodge Kerrigan', 'Lodge Kerrigan', 'Peter Greene, Robert Albert, Megan Owen, Jennifer MacDonald, Molly Castelloe, J. Dixon Byrne, Alice Levitt, Eliot Rockett', 'NR', 'Peter Winter is a young schizophrenic who is desperately trying to get his daughter back from her adoptive family. He attempts to function in a world that, for him, is filled with strange voices, electrical noise, disconcerting images, and jarringly sudden emotional shifts. During his quest, he runs afoul of the law and an ongoing murder investigation.', 'Peter Winter is a young schizophrenic who is desperately trying to get his daughter back from her adoptive family. He attempts to function in a world that, for him, is filled with strange voices, electrical noise, disconcerting images, and jarringly sudden emotional shifts. During his quest, he runs afoul of the law and an ongoing murder investigation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kpMXYy0L2GHrIVyDF0HkEiDK1Wd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1479'),
  ('302759549078175883', 'Cleaner', 2007, 'Crime, Thriller, Mystery', 'Renny Harlin, Scott Kevan, Mary Ellen Woods', 'Matthew Aldrich', 'Samuel L. Jackson, Ed Harris, Eva Mendes, Luis Guzmán, Keke Palmer, Maggie Lawson, Jose Pablo Cantillo, Robert Forster', 'R', 'Single father and former cop Tom Cutler has an unusual occupation: he cleans up death scenes. But when he''s called in to sterilize a wealthy suburban residence after a brutal shooting, Cutler is shocked to learn he may have unknowingly erased crucial evidence, entangling himself in a dirty criminal cover-up.', 'Single father and former cop Tom Cutler has an unusual occupation: he cleans up death scenes. But when he''s called in to sterilize a wealthy suburban residence after a brutal shooting, Cutler is shocked to learn he may have unknowingly erased crucial evidence, entangling himself in a dirty criminal cover-up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8KhDbFg9STRlvrOLvaQ7PjOo7XT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13252'),
  ('138333985275806849', 'Cleaner', 2025, 'Action, Thriller', 'Martin Campbell, Eigil Hansen, Mark Harris', 'Matthew Orton, Simon Uttley, Paul Andrew Williams', 'Daisy Ridley, Taz Skylar, Matthew Tuck, Flavia Watson, Ruth Gemmell, Clive Owen, Rufus Jones, Lee Boardman', 'R', 'When a group of radical activists take over an energy company''s annual gala, seizing 300 hostages, an ex-soldier turned window cleaner suspended 50 storeys up on the outside of the building must save those trapped inside, including her older brother.', 'When a group of radical activists take over an energy company''s annual gala, seizing 300 hostages, an ex-soldier turned window cleaner suspended 50 storeys up on the outside of the building must save those trapped inside, including her older brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mwzDApMZAGeYCEVjhegKvCzDX0W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1125899'),
  ('169256318327921650', 'Cleaning Up!!?', 1921, 'Animation', 'Walt Disney', null, null, null, 'First film produced by Laugh-O-Gram Studio, as part of demo reel. This film is not really animated, it just consists of Walt drawing a single frame. Part of the Newman Laugh-O-Grams Series.', 'First film produced by Laugh-O-Gram Studio, as part of demo reel. This film is not really animated, it just consists of Walt drawing a single frame. Part of the Newman Laugh-O-Grams Series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yFe4iKa1v6NELGolE48uFnP3LNE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:222387'),
  ('406377771031230027', 'Cleanskin', 2012, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Ian Howes, Jude Campbell, Ben Burt', 'Hadi Hajaig', 'Sean Bean, Abhin Galeya, Charlotte Rampling, Peter Polycarpou, Tuppence Middleton, Tom Burke, Sam Douglas, Michelle Ryan', 'R', 'While working undercover as a bodyguard to arms dealer Harry, former-soldier-turned-secret-service-agent Ewan survives a bloody shootout with a member of an Islamic terrorist cell who steals Harry''s briefcase full of Semtex explosives and escapes. Ewan''s spymasters task Ewan with hunting down the cell members and retrieving the briefcase.', 'While working undercover as a bodyguard to arms dealer Harry, former-soldier-turned-secret-service-agent Ewan survives a bloody shootout with a member of an Islamic terrorist cell who steals Harry''s briefcase full of Semtex explosives and escapes. Ewan''s spymasters task Ewan with hunting down the cell members and retrieving the briefcase.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dgHAFprnEkdD8vFZTFnjoWgmucP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95516'),
  ('1106934778045484651', 'Clear and Present Danger', 1994, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Donald McAlpine, Phillip Noyce, Michael Green', 'Steven Zaillian, John Milius, Donald E. Stewart', 'Harrison Ford, Willem Dafoe, Joaquim de Almeida, Henry Czerny, Harris Yulin, Donald Moffat, Miguel Sandoval, Raymond Cruz', 'PG-13', 'Agent Jack Ryan becomes acting Deputy Director of Intelligence for the CIA when Admiral Greer is diagnosed with cancer. When an American businessman, and friend of the president, is murdered on his yacht, Ryan starts discovering links between the man and drug dealers. As former CIA agent John Clark is sent to Colombia to kill drug cartel kingpins in retaliation, Ryan must fight through multiple cover-ups to figure out what happened and who''s responsible.', 'Agent Jack Ryan becomes acting Deputy Director of Intelligence for the CIA when Admiral Greer is diagnosed with cancer. When an American businessman, and friend of the president, is murdered on his yacht, Ryan starts discovering links between the man and drug dealers. As former CIA agent John Clark is sent to Colombia to kill drug cartel kingpins in retaliation, Ryan must fight through multiple cover-ups to figure out what happened and who''s responsible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6xTM8FPxrLRYwz6I3fqtwh7xybs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9331'),
  ('1110054582534922676', 'Clear Cut', 2024, 'Thriller, Action', 'Brian Skiba', 'Joe Perruccio', 'Clive Standen, Tom Welling, Stephen Dorff, Alec Baldwin, Jesse Metcalfe, Lochlyn Munro, Lucy Martin, Chelsey Reist', 'R', 'Every moment is filled with danger for a man cutting timber in the Pacific Northwest, but Jack becomes the target of a brutal assault from more than the elements in this action-packed thriller. As Jack ventures deeper into the woods, he crosses paths with a criminal band of madmen from his past intent on killing him before he can fight his way back to civilization.', 'Every moment is filled with danger for a man cutting timber in the Pacific Northwest, but Jack becomes the target of a brutal assault from more than the elements in this action-packed thriller. As Jack ventures deeper into the woods, he crosses paths with a criminal band of madmen from his past intent on killing him before he can fight his way back to civilization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xQE8Hz8OraOg1r5d0fibIjVpQPF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1309770'),
  ('820496143418902648', 'Clear History', 2013, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Jim Denault, Greg Mottola', 'David Mandel, Larry David, Jeff Schaffer', 'Larry David, Jon Hamm, Kate Hudson, Eva Mendes, Danny McBride, Michael Keaton, Liev Schreiber, Bill Hader', 'R', 'Nathan Flomm, in order to avoid the humiliation of having missed out on a hugely successful business, assumes a new identity on Martha''s Vineyard. He plots revenge when his former business partner moves to the same town.', 'Nathan Flomm, in order to avoid the humiliation of having missed out on a hugely successful business, assumes a new identity on Martha''s Vineyard. He plots revenge when his former business partner moves to the same town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AtzfH2YCWVjyk3XjQqzLtUuZXEG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133790'),
  ('243083325853927021', 'Clear Skies', 1961, 'Drama, War, Romance', 'Grigoriy Chukhray, Sergei Poluyanov, Leonid Bulgakov', 'Daniil Khrabrovitsky', 'Nina Drobysheva, Evgeniy Urbanskiy, Natalya Kuzmina, Vitaliy Konyaev, Georgiy Kulikov, Leonid Knyazev, Georgi Georgiu, Oleg Tabakov', null, 'For many years, Sasha Lvova has been waiting for the return of her lover, pilot Aleksei Astakhov, refusing to believe in his death at the front. And he really returns to her and his son after captivity, but this is a completely different person, rejected by society, expelled from the profession. It is difficult to say how Aleksei’s fate would have been if it hadn’t for Sasha’s love, her ability to survive in the most difficult circumstances.', 'For many years, Sasha Lvova has been waiting for the return of her lover, pilot Aleksei Astakhov, refusing to believe in his death at the front. And he really returns to her and his son after captivity, but this is a completely different person, rejected by society, expelled from the profession. It is difficult to say how Aleksei’s fate would have been if it hadn’t for Sasha’s love, her ability to survive in the most difficult circumstances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mUY8f3vn2jXb2ItVDAG6PknEaqJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190785'),
  ('580951302679149133', 'Clearcut', 1991, 'Thriller, Horror, Western, Drama', 'François Protat, Ryszard Bugajski, Ron Oxley', 'Robert Forsyth', 'Ron Lea, Graham Greene, Michael Hogan, Floyd ''Red Crow'' Westerman, Tia Smith, Rebecca Jenkins, Tom Jackson, Raoul Max Trujillo', 'R', 'A white lawyer finds his values shaken when he is paired with an angry Indigenous activist who insists on kidnapping the head of a logging company to teach him the price of his destruction.', 'A white lawyer finds his values shaken when he is paired with an angry Indigenous activist who insists on kidnapping the head of a logging company to teach him the price of his destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6r1PkbA2EdOGNaGxNJIZKbk2GQi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116494'),
  ('515905534154760526', 'ClearMind', 2024, 'Science Fiction, Comedy, Thriller', 'Rebecca Eskreis', 'Seana Kofoed', 'Rebecca Creskoff, Toks Olagundoye, Rob Benedict, Kadeem Hardison, Jenn Lyon, Seana Kofoed, Jessica Meraz, Alec Mapa', null, 'A grieving woman uses her virtual reality therapy to exact revenge on her former friends.', 'A grieving woman uses her virtual reality therapy to exact revenge on her former friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7GqEmx1pUQE8pLJR7OR0urXfBuu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1142101'),
  ('870620914839076622', 'Clemency', 2019, 'Drama', 'Mark Jopling, Carlos A. Salazar, Brittany Meyerhardt', 'Chinonye Chukwu', 'Alfre Woodard, Richard Schiff, Aldis Hodge, Wendell Pierce, Danielle Brooks, Michael O''Neill, Richard Gunn, LaMonica Garrett', 'R', 'Years of carrying out death row executions have taken a toll on prison warden Bernadine Williams. As she prepares to execute another inmate, Bernadine must confront the psychological and emotional demons her job creates, ultimately connecting her to the man she is sanctioned to kill.', 'Years of carrying out death row executions have taken a toll on prison warden Bernadine Williams. As she prepares to execute another inmate, Bernadine must confront the psychological and emotional demons her job creates, ultimately connecting her to the man she is sanctioned to kill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uQgi5hq29saWiG4DbmQfz2EEnKI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:565307'),
  ('1008222767430752563', 'Clement', 2001, 'Drama, Romance', 'Emmanuelle Bercot, Crystel Fournier', 'Emmanuelle Bercot, Guillaume Schiffman', 'Olivier Gueritée, Emmanuelle Bercot, Kevin Goffette, Rémi Martin, Lou Castel, Catherine Vinatier, Jocelyn Quivrin, David Saada', null, 'Benoit turns 13 and develops an intense crush on his godmother, Marion. As they lie on beaches in the summer, she humors him by talking about the mysteries of women.', 'Benoit turns 13 and develops an intense crush on his godmother, Marion. As they lie on beaches in the summer, she humors him by talking about the mysteries of women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vwdZpyozXuTYw9ZD3slaxp1He1c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48601'),
  ('1090867076645241851', 'Clément, Alex, and Everyone Else', 2019, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Kuo Cheng-chui, Julien Gidoin', 'Kuo Cheng-chui', 'Yannis Bougeard, David Mora, Carolina Jurczak, Chloé Berthier, Bellamine Abdelmalek, Nadine Alari, Laura Boujenah, Gautier Dulion', null, 'Clement is gay. Alex is gay. They are looking for a new roommate for their big apartment in Paris with only one demand: he must be gay. And they find Leo, a charming student who is in deep trouble to find a place to sleep. Leo will do anything to get that room, whatever it takes.', 'Clement is gay. Alex is gay. They are looking for a new roommate for their big apartment in Paris with only one demand: he must be gay. And they find Leo, a charming student who is in deep trouble to find a place to sleep. Leo will do anything to get that room, whatever it takes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lZg1eNxvumA6cv63XCVaJCvOihu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:608956'),
  ('833942785375496527', 'Clementine', 2004, 'Thriller, Drama, Action', 'Kim Du-yeong, Koo Kyo-hwan', 'Eun Hye-rim', 'Lee Dong-jun, Hye-ri Kim, Steven Seagal, Eun Seo-woo, Ki Joo-bong, Im Ho, Lim Hyeok-pil, Jeong Ju-hwan', 'NR', 'Kim, a Taekwondo champion decides to give up his fighting career for good in order to take care of his daughter Sa Rang. But when an evil gambling kingpin kidnaps Sa Rang, Kim must agree to fight in a rigged boxing match in exchange for Sa Rang''s freedom.', 'Kim, a Taekwondo champion decides to give up his fighting career for good in order to take care of his daughter Sa Rang. But when an evil gambling kingpin kidnaps Sa Rang, Kim must agree to fight in a rigged boxing match in exchange for Sa Rang''s freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jbZtQcnO7oNZd6GRXwkMpEHfS6I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47336'),
  ('679669183733903089', 'Cleo', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Erik Schmitt, Johannes Louis', 'Stefanie Ren, Erik Schmitt', 'Marleen Lohse, Jeremy Mockridge, Max Mauff, Heiko Pinkowski, Fabian Busch, Anna Böttcher, Andrea Sawatzki, Max Befort', null, 'Can Cleo turn back time? It seems that misfortune has been haunting her loved ones since she was born. A legendary treasure sounds like the solution to her problems, but Cleo will have to let go of the past.', 'Can Cleo turn back time? It seems that misfortune has been haunting her loved ones since she was born. A legendary treasure sounds like the solution to her problems, but Cleo will have to let go of the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c1TN0Z19cE2I61XxeNSqBAmuR2N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:485882'),
  ('256474094609227944', 'Cléo & Paul', 2018, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Stéphane Demoustier, Sylvain Verdet', 'Stéphane Demoustier', 'Cléo Demoustier, Paul Demoustier, Vimala Pons, Anders Danielsen Lie, Elsa Wolliaston, Sam Louwyck, Oussama Kheddam, Maxime Bouteraon', null, 'Lost in Paris, Cléo is looking for Paul and Paul is looking for Cléo. A poetic adventure lived in 3-year-old kids'' shoes.', 'Lost in Paris, Cléo is looking for Paul and Paul is looking for Cléo. A poetic adventure lived in 3-year-old kids'' shoes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g3XyE1quq0f07yEfGWRB1ViZZ5N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:493909'),
  ('522514818335838145', 'Cléo from 5 to 7: Remembrances and Anecdotes', 2005, 'Documentary', 'Agnès Varda', null, 'Agnès Varda, Corinne Marchand, Antoine Bourseiller, Dorothée Blanck, Bernard Toublanc-Michel, Marin Karmitz', null, 'More than 40 years after making "Cléo de 5 à 7," Agnes Varda invites her star, two other cast members, and her assistant directors to look back. She takes us through the film, from opening scene to the end, visiting its Paris locales, placing her aged actors in the same spots, telling stories, and listening to others'' reflections on the making of the film. She and they talk about making a film on a low budget, its showing at Cannes, and trying to fix a problem in the last shot. Her assistant directors discuss casting, costumes, sets, and the ways the film changed their approaches to filmmaking.', 'More than 40 years after making "Cléo de 5 à 7," Agnes Varda invites her star, two other cast members, and her assistant directors to look back. She takes us through the film, from opening scene to the end, visiting its Paris locales, placing her aged actors in the same spots, telling stories, and listening to others'' reflections on the making of the film. She and they talk about making a film on a low budget, its showing at Cannes, and trying to fix a problem in the last shot. Her assistant directors discuss casting, costumes, sets, and the ways the film changed their approaches to filmmaking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wvOtlHqcTGL8cP66yggC067N80j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:409979'),
  ('82298786886990611', 'Cleopatra', 1934, 'History, Drama, Romance', 'Cecil B. DeMille, Victor Milner, David MacDonald', 'Waldemar Young, Vincent Lawrence', 'Claudette Colbert, Warren William, Henry Wilcoxon, Joseph Schildkraut, Ian Keith, Gertrude Michael, C. Aubrey Smith, Irving Pichel', 'NR', 'The queen of Egypt barges the Nile and flirts with Mark Antony and Julius Caesar.', 'The queen of Egypt barges the Nile and flirts with Mark Antony and Julius Caesar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2JxuGqS1zLTy0lKUp0twIVPlk4B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43902'),
  ('412137542780903704', 'Cleopatra', 1963, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'Ray Kellogg, Andrew Marton, Joseph L. Mankiewicz', 'Sidney Buchman, Ranald MacDougall, Joseph L. Mankiewicz', 'Elizabeth Taylor, Richard Burton, Rex Harrison, Pamela Brown, George Cole, Hume Cronyn, Cesare Danova, Kenneth Haigh', 'G', 'Determined to hold on to the throne, Cleopatra seduces the Roman emperor Julius Caesar. When Caesar is murdered, she redirects her attentions to his general, Marc Antony, who vows to take power—but Caesar’s successor has other plans.', 'Determined to hold on to the throne, Cleopatra seduces the Roman emperor Julius Caesar. When Caesar is murdered, she redirects her attentions to his general, Marc Antony, who vows to take power—but Caesar’s successor has other plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bj7rUGUewofA9cpHt1h36gvDFfy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8095'),
  ('775002750590432935', 'Cleopatra', 2003, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Eduardo Mignogna, Marcelo Camorino, Silvana Savastano', 'Eduardo Mignogna, Silvina Chague', 'Norma Aleandro, Natalia Oreiro, Leonardo Sbaraglia, Héctor Alterio, Alberto de Mendoza, Boy Olmi, Oscar Ferrigno Jr., Eugenia Levin', null, 'A retired teacher and a soap star leave their routines and the men in their lives behind and embark on a weekend trip.', 'A retired teacher and a soap star leave their routines and the men in their lives behind and embark on a weekend trip.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tVbasLQsCsA5wK9eOWqeo87IQqQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71114'),
  ('970805186541693567', 'Cleopatra', 2007, 'Romance, Drama', 'Júlio Bressane, Walter Carvalho', 'Júlio Bressane', 'Alessandra Negrini, Miguel Falabella, Bruno Garcia, Taumaturgo Ferreira, Heitor Martinez, Lúcio Mauro, Nildo Parente, Josie Antello', null, 'The great battles are the backdrop for the unfolding of the Egyptian Queen''s personal life. The strategy of Cleopatra is to seduce the Roman General Julius Caesar and Mark Antony to protect their civilization.', 'The great battles are the backdrop for the unfolding of the Egyptian Queen''s personal life. The strategy of Cleopatra is to seduce the Roman General Julius Caesar and Mark Antony to protect their civilization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rJ8xiTAV98o2yFEvPsq7Hxt1Fvh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46649'),
  ('916327756103993750', 'Cleopatra', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Curtis Ryan Woodside', 'Curtis Ryan Woodside', 'Zahi Hawass, Kathleen Martinez, Curtis Ryan Woodside, Sofia Aziz', null, 'Discover the REAL Cleopatra...A figure whose name and legacy is burned into the minds of billions. Coming from a tenacious greek Macedonian family, she had to fight and even kill for her place on the throne, a Noble attempt to save a failing egypt. She left her mark during the final days of ancient egypt. Her story has been warped so much through out history, from biast opinions to praise, yet who was she really? Everyone thinks they know her, everyone has a different opinion, but most of those are modern, based on films and misinformed play writes. How much do we really know about the true… Cleopatra.', 'Discover the REAL Cleopatra...A figure whose name and legacy is burned into the minds of billions. Coming from a tenacious greek Macedonian family, she had to fight and even kill for her place on the throne, a Noble attempt to save a failing egypt. She left her mark during the final days of ancient egypt. Her story has been warped so much through out history, from biast opinions to praise, yet who was she really? Everyone thinks they know her, everyone has a different opinion, but most of those are modern, based on films and misinformed play writes. How much do we really know about the true… Cleopatra.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o5oXzzfB3XNKLIQC1dFhqjKMr4x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1124799'),
  ('1004036399232831813', 'Cleopatra Jones', 1973, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Jack Starrett, David M. Walsh, Ronald Martinez', 'Sheldon Keller, Max Julien', 'Tamara Dobson, Bernie Casey, Shelley Winters, Brenda Sykes, Antonio Fargas, Dan Frazer, Bill McKinney, Stafford Morgan', 'PG', 'After federal agent Cleopatra Jones orders the burning of a Turkish poppy field, the notorious drug lord Mommy vows to destroy her.', 'After federal agent Cleopatra Jones orders the burning of a Turkish poppy field, the notorious drug lord Mommy vows to destroy her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j13LI9r1Jim2XPvmJUvwGFtD0ag.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26196'),
  ('776684841034906384', 'Cleopatra Jones and the Casino of Gold', 1975, 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Alan Hume, Charles Bail', 'William Tennant', 'Tamara Dobson, Stella Stevens, Norman Fell, Tanny Tien-Ni, Albert Popwell, Caro Kenyatta, Chan Shen, Christopher Hunt', 'R', 'When fellow operatives and friends disappear during a mission in Hong Kong, Cleopatra Jones comes to help. She discovers the disappearance involves The Dragon Lady, a feared lipstick lesbian who runs a casino and the local drug trade.', 'When fellow operatives and friends disappear during a mission in Hong Kong, Cleopatra Jones comes to help. She discovers the disappearance involves The Dragon Lady, a feared lipstick lesbian who runs a casino and the local drug trade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yqXTLGEnQ8wjo6RkzPOXY61WgVc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2139'),
  ('153905675422813602', 'Cleopatra: Queen of Sex', 1970, 'Animation, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Osamu Tezuka, Eiichi Yamamoto, Tsuyoshi Honda', 'Shigemi Satoyoshi', 'Chinatsu Nakayama, Hajime Hana, Kotoe Hatsui, Jitsuko Yoshimura, Nachi Nozawa, Nobuo Tsukamoto, Osami Nabe, Kazuko Imai', null, 'Three people from the future, who travel spiritually to the era of the Egyptian queen Cleopatra VII Philopator and her Roman lovers Julius Caesar and Mark Antony, become their closest friends as they try to unravel the nature of the plan developed in their own time by a sinister enemy.', 'Three people from the future, who travel spiritually to the era of the Egyptian queen Cleopatra VII Philopator and her Roman lovers Julius Caesar and Mark Antony, become their closest friends as they try to unravel the nature of the plan developed in their own time by a sinister enemy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Gt0jd8XR0NOxX0mq3dLXoPX75M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84488'),
  ('529022378698900607', 'Clerambard', 1969, 'Comedy', 'Yves Robert', 'Jean-Loup Dabadie, Yves Robert', 'Philippe Noiret, Dany Carrel, Gérard Lartigau, Claude Piéplu, Lise Delamare, Roger Carel, Martine Sarcey, Robert Dalban', null, 'When a cruel man is visited by Saint Francis and convinced to change his ways, his family believes him to be insane and locks him away in order to sell his beloved castle', 'When a cruel man is visited by Saint Francis and convinced to change his ways, his family believes him to be insane and locks him away in order to sell his beloved castle', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dfSzDjG8frIujeMzYmGI9Ah7vSs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:155824'),
  ('1011539186514321186', 'Clergy', 2018, 'Drama', 'Wojtek Smarzowski, Tomasz Madejski, Kamil Król', 'Wojciech Rzehak, Wojtek Smarzowski', 'Arkadiusz Jakubik, Robert Więckiewicz, Jacek Braciak, Janusz Gajos, Joanna Kulig, Adrian Zaremba, Magdalena Celówna-Janikowska, Ignacy Klim', null, 'The fate of three Catholic priests were linked together through tragic events a few years back. Every year, on the anniversary of the catastrophe, they gather to celebrate their survival of the tragedy. Lisowski works at a curia in a big city, building his career while dreaming of the Vatican. Standing in his way, Mordowicz, the archbishop, a luxurious church dignitary who is making use of his political connections to build the largest sanctuary in Poland. Trybus, is a parish priest and often submits to human weaknesses. Kukuła also is not doing well. Despite his passion for faith, he is losing the trust of his flock. Soon, through new tragic events, the paths of the three priests will cross again.', 'The fate of three Catholic priests were linked together through tragic events a few years back. Every year, on the anniversary of the catastrophe, they gather to celebrate their survival of the tragedy. Lisowski works at a curia in a big city, building his career while dreaming of the Vatican. Standing in his way, Mordowicz, the archbishop, a luxurious church dignitary who is making use of his political connections to build the largest sanctuary in Poland. Trybus, is a parish priest and often submits to human weaknesses. Kukuła also is not doing well. Despite his passion for faith, he is losing the trust of his flock. Soon, through new tragic events, the paths of the three priests will cross again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ng11hk3cduAXHXcEYL8mCx6xkxt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:547491'),
  ('594288027354044885', 'Clerk', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Malcolm Ingram, Bruce Lee Roberts III', null, 'Kevin Smith, Jason Mewes, Scott Mosier, Penn Jillette, Stan Lee, Brian O''Halloran, Richard Linklater, Grace Smith', null, 'A look at Kevin Smith''s life and career from his childhood in New Jersey, to the day they cemented his footprints at the world famous TCL Chinese Theater, with a flock of famous folks testifying on Silent Bob''s behalf!', 'A look at Kevin Smith''s life and career from his childhood in New Jersey, to the day they cemented his footprints at the world famous TCL Chinese Theater, with a flock of famous folks testifying on Silent Bob''s behalf!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xDzkYcuG3F540M5nu4y7j5catGu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:681947'),
  ('541387072643556784', 'Clerks', 1994, 'Comedy', 'Kevin Smith, David Klein', 'Kevin Smith', 'Brian O''Halloran, Jeff Anderson, Marilyn Ghigliotti, Lisa Spoonauer, Jason Mewes, Kevin Smith, Scott Mosier, Scott Schiaffo', 'R', 'Convenience and video store clerks Dante and Randal are sharp-witted, potty-mouthed and bored out of their minds. So in between needling customers, the counter jockeys play hockey on the roof, visit a funeral home and deal with their love lives.', 'Convenience and video store clerks Dante and Randal are sharp-witted, potty-mouthed and bored out of their minds. So in between needling customers, the counter jockeys play hockey on the roof, visit a funeral home and deal with their love lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9IiSgiq4h4siTIS9H3o4nZ3h5L9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2292'),
  ('700435011791772805', 'Clerks II', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Kevin Smith, David Klein, Chris Carroll', 'Kevin Smith', 'Brian O''Halloran, Jeff Anderson, Rosario Dawson, Jason Mewes, Kevin Smith, Jennifer Schwalbach Smith, Ben Affleck, Trevor Fehrman', 'R', 'A calamity at Dante and Randall''s shops sends them looking for new horizons - but they ultimately settle at Mooby''s, a fictional Disney-McDonald''s-style fast-food empire.', 'A calamity at Dante and Randall''s shops sends them looking for new horizons - but they ultimately settle at Mooby''s, a fictional Disney-McDonald''s-style fast-food empire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cLSW0nW94XT0DmBS69ublcLfQ9c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2295'),
  ('1008578509679279863', 'Clerks III', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Learan Kahanov, Kevin Smith', 'Kevin Smith', 'Brian O''Halloran, Jeff Anderson, Rosario Dawson, Jason Mewes, Kevin Smith, Marilyn Ghigliotti, Trevor Fehrman, Austin Zajur', 'R', 'After narrowly surviving a massive heart attack, Randal enlists his old friend Dante to help him make a movie immortalizing their youthful days at the little convenience store that started it all.', 'After narrowly surviving a massive heart attack, Randal enlists his old friend Dante to help him make a movie immortalizing their youthful days at the little convenience store that started it all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/apzIqZIQLc8fNx5nbbcSSfPFtax.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:635891'),
  ('662671419193654409', 'Cleveland Abduction', 2015, 'Drama, Crime, TV Movie', 'Alex Kalymnios, Richard Wong', 'Stephen Tolkin', 'Taryn Manning, Raymond Cruz, Katie Sarife, Samantha Droke, Pam Grier, Joe Morton, Jane Mowder, Kristina Kopf', null, 'A single mother becomes Ariel Castro''s first kidnapping victim, and finds herself trapped in his home with two other women for 11 years.', 'A single mother becomes Ariel Castro''s first kidnapping victim, and finds herself trapped in his home with two other women for 11 years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j2iCc5fjyJvKRQAW7d6XWwDFzmr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:336845'),
  ('973135911595918191', 'Click', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy', 'Frank Coraci, Dean Semler, Marcei A. Brubaker Brown', 'Steve Koren, Mark O''Keefe', 'Adam Sandler, Kate Beckinsale, Christopher Walken, David Hasselhoff, Henry Winkler, Julie Kavner, Sean Astin, Joseph Castanon', 'PG-13', 'A married workaholic, Michael Newman doesn''t have time for his wife and children, not if he''s to impress his ungrateful boss and earn a well-deserved promotion. So when he meets Morty, a loopy sales clerk, he gets the answer to his prayers: a magical remote that allows him to bypass life''s little distractions with increasingly hysterical results.', 'A married workaholic, Michael Newman doesn''t have time for his wife and children, not if he''s to impress his ungrateful boss and earn a well-deserved promotion. So when he meets Morty, a loopy sales clerk, he gets the answer to his prayers: a magical remote that allows him to bypass life''s little distractions with increasingly hysterical results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oL0k5JA53PyoHSZqKb3cNkhwBCE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9339'),
  ('610586103480044032', 'Click', 2010, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Sangeeth Sivan, Ramji', 'Harish Nayar', 'Shreyas Talpade, Sadha, Sneha Ullal, Rehan Khan, Chunky Panday', null, 'Avi is a photographer having a relationship with Sonia who is a model. One night the couple after driving from a late night party accidentally bumps of a young girl. As Sonia is driving the car, to avoid further complications, Avi insists on them fleeing away from the accident scene. But trouble starts for the couple soon after. While Avis clicked photos start having strange white marks over them, Sonia starts having spooky experiences. Avi also develops a severe shoulder pain and even though he is not overweight he starts weighing 120 kilos. Avi too then starts having similar experiences like Sonia. The couple is petrified when all three of Avis best buddies kill themselves in a similar manner. It then comes to light that the spirit haunting them all has a connection to Avis college life. Meanwhile Sonia finds out that Avi was friends with one Aarti during his college days. What is Aartis connection to all this and what revelation awaits Sonia forms the rest of the film.', 'Avi is a photographer having a relationship with Sonia who is a model. One night the couple after driving from a late night party accidentally bumps of a young girl. As Sonia is driving the car, to avoid further complications, Avi insists on them fleeing away from the accident scene. But trouble starts for the couple soon after. While Avis clicked photos start having strange white marks over them, Sonia starts having spooky experiences. Avi also develops a severe shoulder pain and even though he is not overweight he starts weighing 120 kilos. Avi too then starts having similar experiences like Sonia. The couple is petrified when all three of Avis best buddies kill themselves in a similar manner. It then comes to light that the spirit haunting them all has a connection to Avis college life. Meanwhile Sonia finds out that Avi was friends with one Aarti during his college days. What is Aartis connection to all this and what revelation awaits Sonia forms the rest of the film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6wLzaedZSPRQoMN3QoZLYrh7ToU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59903'),
  ('305802431773756126', 'Cliff Walkers', 2021, 'Thriller, Crime, History, Drama', 'Zhao Xiaoding, Zhang Yimou, Zhao Nan', 'Quan Yongxian', 'Zhang Yi, Qin Hailu, Zhu Yawen, Liu Haocun, Ni Dahong, Yu Hewei, Li Naiwen, Yu Ailei', null, 'In the puppet state of Manchukuo in the 1930s, four Communist party special agents, after returning to China, embark on a secret mission. Sold out by a traitor, the team find themselves surrounded by threats on all sides.', 'In the puppet state of Manchukuo in the 1930s, four Communist party special agents, after returning to China, embark on a secret mission. Sold out by a traitor, the team find themselves surrounded by threats on all sides.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kblteWjPo6eLIfc1I2v2LGH0avv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:639557'),
  ('155509458122905123', 'Cliffhanger', 1993, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Philip C. Pfeiffer, Renny Harlin, Alex Thomson', 'Sylvester Stallone, Michael France', 'Sylvester Stallone, John Lithgow, Michael Rooker, Janine Turner, Rex Linn, Caroline Goodall, Leon, Craig Fairbrass', 'R', 'A year after losing his friend in a tragic 4,000-foot fall, former ranger Gabe Walker and his partner, Hal, are called to return to the same peak to rescue a group of stranded climbers, only to learn the climbers are actually thieving hijackers who are looking for boxes full of money.', 'A year after losing his friend in a tragic 4,000-foot fall, former ranger Gabe Walker and his partner, Hal, are called to return to the same peak to rescue a group of stranded climbers, only to learn the climbers are actually thieving hijackers who are looking for boxes full of money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b28DOM54OHb1c7Lsk6Nu7Kwuonj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9350'),
  ('570679925390723417', 'Clifford', 1994, 'Comedy', 'Paul Flaherty, Douglas E. Wise, Katy Garretson', 'Jay Dee Rock, Steven Kampmann', 'Martin Short, Charles Grodin, Mary Steenburgen, Dabney Coleman, Richard Kind, Jennifer Savidge, Brandis Kemp, Ben Savage', 'PG', 'When his brother asks him to look after his young son, Clifford, Martin Daniels agrees, taking the boy into his home and introducing him to his future wife, Sarah. Clifford is fixated on the idea of visiting a famed theme park, and Martin, an engineer who helped build the park, makes plans to take him. But, when Clifford reveals himself to be a first-rate brat, his uncle goes bonkers, and a loony inter-generational standoff ensues.', 'When his brother asks him to look after his young son, Clifford, Martin Daniels agrees, taking the boy into his home and introducing him to his future wife, Sarah. Clifford is fixated on the idea of visiting a famed theme park, and Martin, an engineer who helped build the park, makes plans to take him. But, when Clifford reveals himself to be a first-rate brat, his uncle goes bonkers, and a loony inter-generational standoff ensues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ym5iYreD35Qa4Kjq9FOmtMqCtMF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2778'),
  ('62091474984716496', 'Clifford the Big Red Dog', 2021, 'Family, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Peter Lyons Collister, Eric Fehlberg, Grant M Guilliams', 'Blaise Hemingway, David Ronn, Jay Scherick', 'Darby Camp, Jack Whitehall, Izaac Wang, John Cleese, Tony Hale, David Alan Grier, Paul Rodríguez, Horatio Sanz', 'PG', 'As Emily struggles to fit in at home and at school, she discovers a small red puppy who is destined to become her best friend. When Clifford magically undergoes one heck of a growth spurt, becomes a gigantic dog and attracts the attention of a genetics company, Emily and her Uncle Casey have to fight the forces of greed as they go on the run across New York City. Along the way, Clifford affects the lives of everyone around him and teaches Emily and her uncle the true meaning of acceptance and unconditional love.', 'As Emily struggles to fit in at home and at school, she discovers a small red puppy who is destined to become her best friend. When Clifford magically undergoes one heck of a growth spurt, becomes a gigantic dog and attracts the attention of a genetics company, Emily and her Uncle Casey have to fight the forces of greed as they go on the run across New York City. Along the way, Clifford affects the lives of everyone around him and teaches Emily and her uncle the true meaning of acceptance and unconditional love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/30ULVKdjBcQTsj2aOSThXXZNSxF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:585245'),
  ('566893166030279167', 'Clifford''s Really Big Movie', 2004, 'Family, Adventure, Animation, Comedy', 'Robert C. Ramirez', 'Norman Bridwell', 'John Ritter, Wayne Brady, Grey DeLisle, Jenna Elfman, John Goodman, Jess Harnell, Kel Mitchell, Judge Reinhold', 'G', 'Fearing that he costs too much to feed, Clifford decides to join a traveling carnival so he can enter a talent contest in hopes of winning a lifetime supply of Tummy Yummies treats. Joined by his friends Cleo and T-Bone, Clifford meets up with Shackleford the High-Flying Ferret and Rodrigo Chihuahua of Steel, as they work together to turn a broken-down act into a record-breaking show.', 'Fearing that he costs too much to feed, Clifford decides to join a traveling carnival so he can enter a talent contest in hopes of winning a lifetime supply of Tummy Yummies treats. Joined by his friends Cleo and T-Bone, Clifford meets up with Shackleford the High-Flying Ferret and Rodrigo Chihuahua of Steel, as they work together to turn a broken-down act into a record-breaking show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cpaynGAqDjr0N5I92JEEqW0dpTl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19016'),
  ('662058533596129203', 'Clika', 2026, 'Music, Drama', 'Michael Greene, Jeff Carolan, Ski-ter Jones', 'Sean Sullivan McBride, Michael Greene', 'Jay Dee, Cristian E. Gutierrez, Daniel ''DoKnows'' Lopez, Laura Lopez, Nana Ponceleon, OhGeesy, Eric Roberts, Uziel Pantoja', 'R', 'Aspiring small-town musician Chito is determined to make it big. When a clip of him performing one of his songs goes viral, he seizes the opportunity and pushes to carve out a place for himself in the new wave of Mexican-American music... and ultimately gets caught in a game more dangerous than anticipated.', 'Aspiring small-town musician Chito is determined to make it big. When a clip of him performing one of his songs goes viral, he seizes the opportunity and pushes to carve out a place for himself in the new wave of Mexican-American music... and ultimately gets caught in a game more dangerous than anticipated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/82Vh8PSzWtBi0CLWrnJdRhGYxEr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1450257'),
  ('578482733698152148', 'Climates', 2006, 'Drama', 'Nuri Bilge Ceylan, Gökhan Tiryaki', 'Nuri Bilge Ceylan', 'Ebru Ceylan, Nuri Bilge Ceylan, Nazan Kesal, Mehmet Eryılmaz, Arif Aşçı, Can Özbatur, Ufuk Bayraktar, Fatma Ceylan', null, 'Man was made to be happy for simple reasons and unhappy for even simpler ones – just as he is born for simple reasons and dies for even simpler ones... Isa and Bahar are two lonely figures dragged through the ever-changing climate of their inner selves in pursuit of a happiness that no longer belongs to them.', 'Man was made to be happy for simple reasons and unhappy for even simpler ones – just as he is born for simple reasons and dies for even simpler ones... Isa and Bahar are two lonely figures dragged through the ever-changing climate of their inner selves in pursuit of a happiness that no longer belongs to them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ikTWwbyIwaFlqAGpD8jwqgghQz0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18421'),
  ('542081542831594189', 'Climax', 2018, 'Thriller, Drama, Horror', 'Gaspar Noé, Benoît Debie, Thierry Poulet', 'Gaspar Noé', 'Sofia Boutella, Romain Guillermic, Souheila Yacoub, Kiddy Smile, Claude-Emmanuelle Gajan-Maull, Giselle Palmer, Taylor Kastle, Thea Carla Schøtt', 'R', 'When a dance troupe is lured to an empty school, a bowl of drug-laced sangria causes their jubilant rehearsal to descend into a dark and explosive nightmare as they try to survive the night—and find who''s responsible—before it''s too late.', 'When a dance troupe is lured to an empty school, a bowl of drug-laced sangria causes their jubilant rehearsal to descend into a dark and explosive nightmare as they try to survive the night—and find who''s responsible—before it''s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/47IXH2iEWwX0F7vIyGXaKQ0psBG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:507076'),
  ('477186792106371644', 'Climax', 2020, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Dharmendra Bharti, Ram Gopal Varma, Agasthya Manju', 'Ram Gopal Varma', 'Mia Malkova, Renan Severo', null, 'Diane and her boyfriend try to do things out of the blue and enter a desert even after there is a no-entry board written on it. In this situation, scary things and some crazy people start troubling them. The couple runs for their life and reaches a small town only to know there are more dangerous situations are in store for them. Who is behind these incidents and how the couple comes out of this mess forms the crux of the story.', 'Diane and her boyfriend try to do things out of the blue and enter a desert even after there is a no-entry board written on it. In this situation, scary things and some crazy people start troubling them. The couple runs for their life and reaches a small town only to know there are more dangerous situations are in store for them. Who is behind these incidents and how the couple comes out of this mess forms the crux of the story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Eb7fS5ms24t8pKzLwgdcPTXdkI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:710667'),
  ('544202916314383173', 'Climber''s High', 2008, 'Drama', 'Masato Harada, Gen Kobayashi, Masayuki Taniguchi', 'Izuru Narushima, Masato Katō, Masato Harada', 'Shinichi Tsutsumi, Masato Sakai, Machiko Ono, Kenichi Endo, Keisuke Horibe, Tsutomu Yamazaki, Tomorowo Taguchi, Masahiro Takashima', null, 'On August 12, 1985, a jumbo jet crashes, causing 520 fatalities, making the accident the biggest single-plane accident in the world. The local press reporters are tossed about by the waves of facts and rumors. While overwhelmed by the magnitude of the accident, Yuuki, in charge of this crash report at a local newspaper, faces a string of decision-making moments. What are news and a reporter? How should a man do his work and survive in a corporate hierarchy? What do family and friends mean to him? An intriguing story, which keeps the audience on the edge of tension and reality.', 'On August 12, 1985, a jumbo jet crashes, causing 520 fatalities, making the accident the biggest single-plane accident in the world. The local press reporters are tossed about by the waves of facts and rumors. While overwhelmed by the magnitude of the accident, Yuuki, in charge of this crash report at a local newspaper, faces a string of decision-making moments. What are news and a reporter? How should a man do his work and survive in a corporate hierarchy? What do family and friends mean to him? An intriguing story, which keeps the audience on the edge of tension and reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kbKRX7ylOUGc0YtVFp9XBqUTwvm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41533'),
  ('54737874236155774', 'Clinic', 1993, 'Animation, Horror', 'Anatolii Havrylov, Izrail Moizhes, Aleksandr Bubnov', 'Aleksandr Bubnov', null, null, 'Have you ever been haunted by terrible nightmares about doctors? All the evil spirits led by Wiy the radiologist and all the worst from the field of medicine await you in the animation "Clinic".', 'Have you ever been haunted by terrible nightmares about doctors? All the evil spirits led by Wiy the radiologist and all the worst from the field of medicine await you in the animation "Clinic".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lw3ptiBIenA2jcmJ00xzguXrEbD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:561817'),
  ('239108431079086888', 'Clinical', 2017, 'Thriller, Horror', 'John Frost, Alistair Legrand', 'Luke Harvis, Alistair Legrand', 'Vinessa Shaw, Kevin Rahm, Aaron Stanford, William Atherton, India Eisley, Nestor Serrano, Sydney Tamiia Poitier, Wilmer Calderon', null, 'A psychiatrist tries to put her life back together after a violent attack by seeking to repair the life of a new patient, but he has his own terrifying history.', 'A psychiatrist tries to put her life back together after a violent attack by seeking to repair the life of a new patient, but he has his own terrifying history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k9baYzut6dLyAXdg8gqmaR4EZ1Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:433244'),
  ('621700552676426784', 'Clint Eastwood: The Last Legend', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Clélia Cohen', 'Clélia Cohen', 'Clint Eastwood, Don Siegel, Sondra Locke, Sergio Leone, Martin Scorsese, Michael Cimino, Orson Welles, Burt Reynolds', null, 'The portrait of the last cowboy Hollywood legend dives into the 65 years of an extraordinary career in Hollywood, highlighted iconic films like The Good, the Bad and the Ugly, as well as Million Dollar Baby, Mystic River and Gran Torino all the way to Cry Macho in 2021. It is no small task to cover more than 60 years of cinema history, especially when it is trying to surveyed with such breadth and diversity: TV star, international star, controversial icon, contested director, filmmaker with a capital F, Eastwood has been through it all, experienced it all, and it is first of all this romantic trajectory, this true American pastoral that the documentary wants to tell with all the passion it possibly can.', 'The portrait of the last cowboy Hollywood legend dives into the 65 years of an extraordinary career in Hollywood, highlighted iconic films like The Good, the Bad and the Ugly, as well as Million Dollar Baby, Mystic River and Gran Torino all the way to Cry Macho in 2021. It is no small task to cover more than 60 years of cinema history, especially when it is trying to surveyed with such breadth and diversity: TV star, international star, controversial icon, contested director, filmmaker with a capital F, Eastwood has been through it all, experienced it all, and it is first of all this romantic trajectory, this true American pastoral that the documentary wants to tell with all the passion it possibly can.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xG5sdTh9a2QDqyhOkbSDPrBsBv3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1039896'),
  ('422872992921623743', 'Clinton and Nadine', 1988, 'Action, Crime, Thriller, Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Jerry Schatzberg, Isidore Mankofsky, Skip Surguine', 'Robert Foster', 'Andy Garcia, Ellen Barkin, Morgan Freeman, Michael Lombard, John C. McGinley, Brad Sullivan, Alan North, Bill Raymond', null, 'Eager to find his brother''s murderer, Clinton enlists the aid of Nadine, an expensive call girl. Together they get sucked into a plot to smuggle guns to the Contra forces in Nicaragua.', 'Eager to find his brother''s murderer, Clinton enlists the aid of Nadine, an expensive call girl. Together they get sucked into a plot to smuggle guns to the Contra forces in Nicaragua.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xmvMrYbrcslR7t1lQJ9fLi1MbVI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104535'),
  ('147795916733684918', 'Clip', 2012, 'Drama', 'Maja Miloš, Vladimir Simić', 'Maja Miloš', 'Isidora Simijonović, Vukašin Jasnić, Sanja Mikitišin, Jovo Maksić, Monja Savić, Katarina Pešić, Sonja Janičić, Jovana Stojiljković', 'NR', 'Jasna, a beautiful teenager, leads a crude life in post-war Serbia. She goes on a spree of sex, drugs and partying until she finds love and tenderness in a harsh environment.', 'Jasna, a beautiful teenager, leads a crude life in post-war Serbia. She goes on a spree of sex, drugs and partying until she finds love and tenderness in a harsh environment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9HMdSbpIv2ro6bAPDBXeKhUZRlO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95775'),
  ('867326765216797909', 'Clive of India', 1935, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, History, War, Romance', 'Richard Boleslawski, Ben Silvey, J. Peverell Marley', 'R. J. Minney, W.P. Lipscomb', 'Ronald Colman, Loretta Young, Colin Clive, Francis Lister, C. Aubrey Smith, Cesar Romero, Montagu Love, Lumsden Hare', 'NR', 'Fort St. David, Cuddalore, southern India, 1748. While colonial empires battle to seize an enormous territory, rich in spices and precious metals beyond the wildest dreams, and try to gain the favor of the local kings, Robert Clive (1725-1774), a frustrated but talented clerk who works for the East Indian Company and struggles to earn his fortune, makes a bold decision that will change his life forever.', 'Fort St. David, Cuddalore, southern India, 1748. While colonial empires battle to seize an enormous territory, rich in spices and precious metals beyond the wildest dreams, and try to gain the favor of the local kings, Robert Clive (1725-1774), a frustrated but talented clerk who works for the East Indian Company and struggles to earn his fortune, makes a bold decision that will change his life forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uppbCk6eKrE0Obtdf2OfK1PfGaU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103584'),
  ('1086651923628985208', 'Cloak & Dagger', 1984, 'Adventure, Action, Family', 'Richard Franklin, Victor J. Kemper', 'Tom Holland', 'Henry Thomas, Dabney Coleman, Michael Murphy, Christina Nigra, John McIntire, Jeanette Nolan, Eloy Casados, Tim Rossovich', 'PG', 'Davey Osborne is an average 11-year-old boy with an overactive imagination. He spends his days playing video games and pretending to be a spy with his imaginary father-figure, Jack Flack - a substitute for his real father, who is struggling with the recent death of Davey''s mother. However, fantasy becomes reality for Davey after he witnesses the murder of an FBI agent, who in his dying breath, gives Davey a mysterious video game cartridge called Cloak & Dagger, which in actuality contains top-secret government information. With the help of his younger friend Kim, the tech savvy Morris, and even a little help from his fictional secret agent mentor, Davey must stay one step ahead of pursuers as he tries to survive a real-life game of espionage in the streets of San Antonio, Texas.', 'Davey Osborne is an average 11-year-old boy with an overactive imagination. He spends his days playing video games and pretending to be a spy with his imaginary father-figure, Jack Flack - a substitute for his real father, who is struggling with the recent death of Davey''s mother. However, fantasy becomes reality for Davey after he witnesses the murder of an FBI agent, who in his dying breath, gives Davey a mysterious video game cartridge called Cloak & Dagger, which in actuality contains top-secret government information. With the help of his younger friend Kim, the tech savvy Morris, and even a little help from his fictional secret agent mentor, Davey must stay one step ahead of pursuers as he tries to survive a real-life game of espionage in the streets of San Antonio, Texas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b7jSCsjZccAwj4nrGXj8XPRAcAc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48677'),
  ('8469904832558423', 'Cloak and Dagger', 1946, 'Drama, Thriller, War', 'Sol Polito, Fritz Lang', 'Ring Lardner, Jr., Albert Maltz', 'Gary Cooper, Lilli Palmer, Robert Alda, Vladimir Sokoloff, J. Edward Bromberg, Marjorie Hoshelle, Ludwig Stössel, Helene Thimig', null, 'Italian partisans help a professor sent by the OSS to find an atomic scientist held by Nazis.', 'Italian partisans help a professor sent by the OSS to find an atomic scientist held by Nazis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zC0oUxvPPBhTHBVZcWNPuQZAtl7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44043'),
  ('117636443729442004', 'Clock', 2023, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Alexis Jacknow, Martim Vian', 'Alexis Jacknow', 'Dianna Agron, Melora Hardin, Jay Ali, Grace Porter, Saul Rubinek, Laura Elizabeth Stuart, Stefan Sims, Nikita Patel', 'R', 'On the eve of her 38th birthday, a woman desperately attempts to fix her broken biological clock.', 'On the eve of her 38th birthday, a woman desperately attempts to fix her broken biological clock.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bkPpmNSdbRIgtscqH86BQFLJXcz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1085103'),
  ('586567320749674127', 'Clock Cleaners', 1937, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Ben Sharpsteen', null, 'Walt Disney, Pinto Colvig, Clarence Nash, James MacDonald, Walter Tetley', 'NR', 'It''s time to laugh like crazy as Mickey, Goofy and Donald fight against raging gears, twisted springs, deafening bells and a sleeping stork. Watch them reach new heights of humor as their valiant efforts to clean a bell tower turn into a real circus!', 'It''s time to laugh like crazy as Mickey, Goofy and Donald fight against raging gears, twisted springs, deafening bells and a sleeping stork. Watch them reach new heights of humor as their valiant efforts to clean a bell tower turn into a real circus!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pbrEbCbr3BD4umm5aytMCVL17Md.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66834'),
  ('1039147440951261563', 'Clockers', 1995, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Spike Lee, Malik Hassan Sayeed, Mike Ellis', 'Richard Price, Spike Lee', 'Harvey Keitel, John Turturro, Delroy Lindo, Mekhi Phifer, Isaiah Washington, Keith David, Peewee Love, Regina Taylor', 'R', 'Strike is a young city drug pusher under the tutelage of drug lord Rodney Little. When a night manager at a fast-food restaurant is found with four bullets in his body, Strike’s older brother turns himself in as the killer. Detective Rocco Klein doesn’t buy the story, however, setting out to find the truth, and it seems that all the fingers point toward Strike & Rodney.', 'Strike is a young city drug pusher under the tutelage of drug lord Rodney Little. When a night manager at a fast-food restaurant is found with four bullets in his body, Strike’s older brother turns himself in as the killer. Detective Rocco Klein doesn’t buy the story, however, setting out to find the truth, and it seems that all the fingers point toward Strike & Rodney.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c79uqLJleho2a7OQayfrW5Ypphf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20649'),
  ('260595336458517042', 'Clockface Cafe', 1947, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Henri Decoin, Jean Gehret, Hervé Bromberger', 'Henri Decoin, Pierre Bénard', 'Bernard Blier, Blanchette Brunoy, Aimé Clariond, Nane Germon, Charles Vissières, Robert Le Fort, Félix Oudart, Pierre Sergeol', null, 'Julien Couturier and his wife Louise, a young couple from Auvergne who have come to Paris to try their luck for the first time in their lives, become the owners of the "Café du Cadran" ("Clockface Cafe"). On opening day, they meet the people who will become their clientele. It''s a busy place, with regular customers served by two waiters, Jules and Victor. While Julien is comfortable in his role as boss, Louise doesn''t quite get used to this urban world, where everything moves faster, especially human feelings. She often misses Marcenait, the village in Auvergne where she and her husband ran the "Café du Commerce". Mr. Luigi, a café customer and violinist who performs at the "Café de Paris", has undertaken Louise''s cultural education. He teaches her how to dress and do her hair, while recounting his musical successes and travels, skilfully playing on his undeniable seductiveness...', 'Julien Couturier and his wife Louise, a young couple from Auvergne who have come to Paris to try their luck for the first time in their lives, become the owners of the "Café du Cadran" ("Clockface Cafe"). On opening day, they meet the people who will become their clientele. It''s a busy place, with regular customers served by two waiters, Jules and Victor. While Julien is comfortable in his role as boss, Louise doesn''t quite get used to this urban world, where everything moves faster, especially human feelings. She often misses Marcenait, the village in Auvergne where she and her husband ran the "Café du Commerce". Mr. Luigi, a café customer and violinist who performs at the "Café de Paris", has undertaken Louise''s cultural education. He teaches her how to dress and do her hair, while recounting his musical successes and travels, skilfully playing on his undeniable seductiveness...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ghsniJLwUXMWnKUl24zl88576fz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66439'),
  ('70706317723320048', 'Clockmaker', 1998, 'Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Christopher Coppola, Gabriel Kosuth', 'Neal Marshall Stevens', 'Anthony Medwetz, Katie Johnston, Zachary McLemore, Pierrino Mascarino, Daisy Nystul, Tom Gulager', null, 'Fourteen-year-old Henry and his friends are about to change history. Sneaking into the apartment of an eccentric Clockmaker, the kids discover that the old man controls time for the entire world through an incredible array of magnificent timepieces and weird machines. When one of the curious kids accidentally pushes a wrong button and gets launched back in time, the space-time continuum is severely disrupted. As everything begins to change around them, the young adventurers must travel back in time to save their friend...and the future', 'Fourteen-year-old Henry and his friends are about to change history. Sneaking into the apartment of an eccentric Clockmaker, the kids discover that the old man controls time for the entire world through an incredible array of magnificent timepieces and weird machines. When one of the curious kids accidentally pushes a wrong button and gets launched back in time, the space-time continuum is severely disrupted. As everything begins to change around them, the young adventurers must travel back in time to save their friend...and the future', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2dRf49iHKveWOvzqwIeqvHG91YO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3585'),
  ('707793074921668876', 'Clockstoppers', 2002, 'Adventure, Family, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Kino Scialabba, Christopher Duddy, Eric Swenson', 'Rob Hedden, Andy Hedden, J. David Stem', 'Jesse Bradford, Paula Garcés, French Stewart, Michael Biehn, Robin Thomas, Julia Sweeney, Lindze Letherman, Jason George', 'PG', 'Until now, Zak Gibbs'' greatest challenge has been to find a way to buy a car. But when he discovers an odd wristwatch amidst his father''s various inventions and slips it on -- something very strange happens. The world around him seems to come to a stop, everything and everybody frozen in time. Zak quickly learns how to manipulate the device and he and his quick-witted and beautiful new friend, Francesca, start to have some real fun.', 'Until now, Zak Gibbs'' greatest challenge has been to find a way to buy a car. But when he discovers an odd wristwatch amidst his father''s various inventions and slips it on -- something very strange happens. The world around him seems to come to a stop, everything and everybody frozen in time. Zak quickly learns how to manipulate the device and he and his quick-witted and beautiful new friend, Francesca, start to have some real fun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6XZJ58gStdLZV8uJyTRcA5bGNyi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15028'),
  ('950129818945371389', 'Clockwatchers', 1997, 'Drama', 'Jill Sprecher, Jim Denault, Lauren Cloud', 'Karen Sprecher, Jill Sprecher', 'Toni Collette, Parker Posey, Lisa Kudrow, Alanna Ubach, Helen FitzGerald, Stanley DeSantis, Jamie Kennedy, David James Elliott', 'PG-13', 'Four female temps working for a credit company find their friendship threatened by the arrival of a new hire, who lands a permanent position one of the women was vying for.', 'Four female temps working for a credit company find their friendship threatened by the arrival of a new hire, who lands a permanent position one of the women was vying for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dUCeH8FIsDOpjXQhOFIbP5DARQD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55561'),
  ('30750214242131546', 'Clockwise', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Christopher Morahan, John Coquillon', 'Michael Frayn', 'John Cleese, Penelope Wilton, Alison Steadman, Stephen Moore, Joan Hickson, Benjamin Whitrow, Geoffrey Palmer, Michael Aldridge', 'PG', 'School headmaster Brian Stimpson is obsessed with timeliness, order, and discipline. Brian misses his train after meticulously preparing a speech for an education conference. With no one else to turn to, he asks young former student Laura Wisely for a ride. Laura, upset over a break-up, agrees to drive him in her parents'' car - which alarms her mother and father, who worry that she has run away with a married man and subsequently alert the police.', 'School headmaster Brian Stimpson is obsessed with timeliness, order, and discipline. Brian misses his train after meticulously preparing a speech for an education conference. With no one else to turn to, he asks young former student Laura Wisely for a ride. Laura, upset over a break-up, agrees to drive him in her parents'' car - which alarms her mother and father, who worry that she has run away with a married man and subsequently alert the police.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uRetBG6n8ScyIdtkJNGngTqX75c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11938'),
  ('152851804872369491', 'Clockwork Bananas', 1974, 'Comedy', 'Jean-François Davy, Cyrille Chardon, Daniel Traganz', 'Jean-François Davy', 'Philippe Gasté, Nanette Corey, Pierre Danny, Anne Libert, Malisa Longo, Corinne O''Brien, Gilda Arancio, Claudine Beccarie', null, 'Gilles, who operates a money losing garage, teams up with his friends Max, who operates a scrap yard, and lawyer Xavier to open a brothel catering to women. They get the idea from Gilles'' secretary Irma, a former prostitute. They are assisted in the implementation by Max''s wife Juliette and Sabine who is mad for Gilles. Unfortunately Gilles has fallen for Florence the daughter of the conservative Prime Minister and his wife. When the Prime Minister tries to shut down the brothel Gilles decides to stand against him in the election.', 'Gilles, who operates a money losing garage, teams up with his friends Max, who operates a scrap yard, and lawyer Xavier to open a brothel catering to women. They get the idea from Gilles'' secretary Irma, a former prostitute. They are assisted in the implementation by Max''s wife Juliette and Sabine who is mad for Gilles. Unfortunately Gilles has fallen for Florence the daughter of the conservative Prime Minister and his wife. When the Prime Minister tries to shut down the brothel Gilles decides to stand against him in the election.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yBHmH9vm5GakDTjGVicRXYAX7AR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:271746'),
  ('678832682864811221', 'Cloistered Nun: Runa''s Confession', 1976, 'Drama, Romance', 'Masaru Konuma', 'Toshio Ashizawa', 'Runa Takamura, Nobutaka Masutomi, Aoi Nakajima, Shinsho Nakamaru, Kumi Taguchi, Yōko Azusa', null, 'Sisterhood is powerful. Before leaving for a mission in Africa, Runa, a nun, visits her sister three years after entering the convent when her sister stole Runa''s boyfriend. Runa comes to forgive and to help her sister make enough money buying and selling some convent property so she can marry. The old boyfriend has new women in his life, but he and the sister tell Runa they''re a couple in order to keep the property deal. To make even more money, Runa''s sister wheedles large gifts from various men she''s stringing along. There are flashbacks to Runa''s sexual awakening at the convent. But what are her real reasons to close this deal?', 'Sisterhood is powerful. Before leaving for a mission in Africa, Runa, a nun, visits her sister three years after entering the convent when her sister stole Runa''s boyfriend. Runa comes to forgive and to help her sister make enough money buying and selling some convent property so she can marry. The old boyfriend has new women in his life, but he and the sister tell Runa they''re a couple in order to keep the property deal. To make even more money, Runa''s sister wheedles large gifts from various men she''s stringing along. There are flashbacks to Runa''s sexual awakening at the convent. But what are her real reasons to close this deal?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lyg6yFLQTFxNeuJ0MFnYaGPdjC3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49591'),
  ('780128419062375790', 'CLONED: The Recreator Chronicles', 2012, 'Horror', 'Gregory Orr', 'Gregory Orr', 'Stella Maeve, J. Mallory McCree, John de Lancie, Laura Moss, Alexander Nifong, Curzon Dobell', 'NR', 'When a group of teenagers stumble upon a secret lab, they become part of a deadly experiment - The Recreator - evil human clones. Craig, Tracy and Derek come face to face with exact copies of themselves that have only one purpose; to find and kill their originals. With time running out it''s up to the original group to destroy the lab and save themselves before they are replaced. Gregory Orr''s exciting thriller brings science fiction to life with a sexy edge.', 'When a group of teenagers stumble upon a secret lab, they become part of a deadly experiment - The Recreator - evil human clones. Craig, Tracy and Derek come face to face with exact copies of themselves that have only one purpose; to find and kill their originals. With time running out it''s up to the original group to destroy the lab and save themselves before they are replaced. Gregory Orr''s exciting thriller brings science fiction to life with a sexy edge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tDMjcYqsLtUVoBnTNozRrBI2sna.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127594'),
  ('1111429053918685401', 'Cloportes', 1965, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Pierre Granier-Deferre, Nicolas Hayer, Jean-Michel Lacor', 'Albert Simonin, Pierre Granier-Deferre, Michel Audiard', 'Lino Ventura, Charles Aznavour, Irina Demick, Maurice Biraud, Georges Géret, Pierre Brasseur, Françoise Rosay, Annie Fratellini', null, 'Three little criminals get a tip for a great coup with lots of money in it. Unfortunately they lack the starting funds to buy the required welding torch. So they persuade their successful colleague Alphonse to join their team. But the well thought-out coup fails, and Alphonse is the only one of them who ends up in jail for several years. When he''s released, he''s out for revenge.', 'Three little criminals get a tip for a great coup with lots of money in it. Unfortunately they lack the starting funds to buy the required welding torch. So they persuade their successful colleague Alphonse to join their team. But the well thought-out coup fails, and Alphonse is the only one of them who ends up in jail for several years. When he''s released, he''s out for revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ia7QtZIB9Xo45fUn1lUFWD8ngZ7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74878'),
  ('64431279872614560', 'Close', 2019, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Vicky Jewson, Malte Rosenfeld, Mark Hedges', 'Vicky Jewson, Rupert Whitaker', 'Noomi Rapace, Sophie Nélisse, Indira Varma, Eoin Macken, Akin Gazi, Sargon Yelda, Abdellatif Chaouqi, George Georgiou', 'R', 'A counter-terrorism expert takes a job protecting a young heiress. After an attempted kidnapping puts both of their lives in danger, they must flee.', 'A counter-terrorism expert takes a job protecting a young heiress. After an attempted kidnapping puts both of their lives in danger, they must flee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iYAwwdE5KvDaU4Uyll5h4XscXkc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:460321'),
  ('869516217494623603', 'Close Encounters of the Fifth Kind', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Michael Mazzola', 'Michael Mazzola', 'Jeremy Piven, Steven M. Greer, Daniel Sheehan', 'PG', 'Dr. Steven Greer’s previous works, SIRIUS and UNACKNOWLEDGED, broke crowdfunding records and ignited a grassroots movement. CLOSE ENCOUNTERS OF THE FIFTH KIND features groundbreaking video and photographic evidence and supporting interviews from prominent figures such as Adam Curry of Princeton’s PEAR Lab; legendary civil rights attorney Daniel Sheehan, and Dr. Russell Targ, who headed the CIA’s top secret remote viewing program. Their message: For thousands of people, contact has begun. This is their story.', 'Dr. Steven Greer’s previous works, SIRIUS and UNACKNOWLEDGED, broke crowdfunding records and ignited a grassroots movement. CLOSE ENCOUNTERS OF THE FIFTH KIND features groundbreaking video and photographic evidence and supporting interviews from prominent figures such as Adam Curry of Princeton’s PEAR Lab; legendary civil rights attorney Daniel Sheehan, and Dr. Russell Targ, who headed the CIA’s top secret remote viewing program. Their message: For thousands of people, contact has begun. This is their story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/R0rmE1wDbxMb2W0MyDE3HKPhOR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:688335'),
  ('351381871553081747', 'Close Encounters of the Third Kind', 1977, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Steven Spielberg, Vilmos Zsigmond, Charles Myers', 'Steven Spielberg', 'Richard Dreyfuss, François Truffaut, Teri Garr, Melinda Dillon, Bob Balaban, J. Patrick McNamara, Warren J. Kemmerling, Roberts Blossom', 'PG', 'After an encounter with UFOs, an electricity linesman feels undeniably drawn to an isolated area in the wilderness where something spectacular is about to happen.', 'After an encounter with UFOs, an electricity linesman feels undeniably drawn to an isolated area in the wilderness where something spectacular is about to happen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gCWPB8cF82tqzrS9tvzcO6q6nyz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:840'),
  ('758066556862246913', 'Close Enemies', 2018, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Guillaume Deffontaines, David Oelhoffen', 'David Oelhoffen, Jeanne Aptekman', 'Matthias Schoenaerts, Reda Kateb, Adel Bencherif, Sofiane Zermani, Sabrina Ouazani, Gwendolyn Gourvenec, Nicolas Giraud, Astrid Whettnall', 'NR', 'Driss and Manuel both grew up on the same council estate. An estate where the sense of belonging to your patch is much stronger than the sense of belonging to a country, a nation or a culture... Manuel has assimilated this belonging, and he has even benefited from it and built his life on it. Driss, meanwhile, has shunned it. They will both have to face up to the consequences of their decisions – because they will each have a price to pay…', 'Driss and Manuel both grew up on the same council estate. An estate where the sense of belonging to your patch is much stronger than the sense of belonging to a country, a nation or a culture... Manuel has assimilated this belonging, and he has even benefited from it and built his life on it. Driss, meanwhile, has shunned it. They will both have to face up to the consequences of their decisions – because they will each have a price to pay…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mo9qdzENQLzdqLnbqAlDP4Vou0T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:484901'),
  ('442801338295902954', 'Close Friends', 1992, 'Drama, Romance', 'Michele Placido', 'Angelo Pasquini, Michele Placido, Roberto Nobile', 'Asia Argento, Carlotta Natoli, Claudia Pandolfi, Michele Placido, Enrico Lo Verso, Laura Trotter, Franco Interlenghi, Simonetta Stefanelli', null, 'Fifteen-year-old Sabrina has lived with her father since he split with her mother. As the film unfolds it gradually becomes clear that Sabrina is a victim of incest.', 'Fifteen-year-old Sabrina has lived with her father since he split with her mother. As the film unfolds it gradually becomes clear that Sabrina is a victim of incest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7hKIJMslRIxgEMZxLhEbh61PgEU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145921'),
  ('907540054685867992', 'Close My Eyes', 1991, 'Drama, Romance', 'Stephen Poliakoff, Witold Stok', 'Stephen Poliakoff', 'Alan Rickman, Clive Owen, Saskia Reeves, Karl Johnson, Lesley Sharp, Kate Gartside, Karen Knight, Niall Buggy', 'R', 'After some years of tension, Richard begins a sexual relationship with his sister Natalie. Now married, the relationship proves dangerously obsessional.', 'After some years of tension, Richard begins a sexual relationship with his sister Natalie. Now married, the relationship proves dangerously obsessional.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/HVMvJ3TzjbNOqlOILZWPkfZXt0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53896'),
  ('380952005014276556', 'Close Quarters', 2019, 'Drama', 'Andrés Clariond', 'Andrés Clariond', 'Paulina Gaitán, José Pescina, Jorge A. Jimenez, Fernando Becerril, Verónica Langer, Mario Escalante, Austin Morgan, Horacio F. Lazo', null, 'Manuel and Lupe want to have a baby. When Manuel discovers he is infertile, he starts to fall apart both physically and emotionally. After exploring several options, Manuel turns to Rubén, his new friend, to act as their donor.', 'Manuel and Lupe want to have a baby. When Manuel discovers he is infertile, he starts to fall apart both physically and emotionally. After exploring several options, Manuel turns to Rubén, his new friend, to act as their donor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aRcXdOZV1coZmkelaGEgfmTgXx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:638937'),
  ('991592238918145353', 'Close Range', 2015, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Thomas E. Nicholson, Jesse Bactat, John Hall', 'Chad Law, Shane Dax Taylor', 'Scott Adkins, Nick Chinlund, Caitlin Keats, Jake La Botz, Tony Perez, Madison Lawlor, Julien Cesario, Jimmy Chhiu', 'NR', 'A rogue soldier turned outlaw is thrust into a relentless fight with a corrupt sheriff, his obedient deputies, and a dangerous drug cartel in order to protect his sister and her young daughter.', 'A rogue soldier turned outlaw is thrust into a relentless fight with a corrupt sheriff, his obedient deputies, and a dangerous drug cartel in order to protect his sister and her young daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1mB2uLg9qDzLX6BpJReAFAPyAtv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:325173'),
  ('396568901020635423', 'Close Range Love', 2014, 'Drama, Romance', 'Naoto Kumazawa, Hiro''o Yanagida', 'Yukiko Manabe', 'Tomohisa Yamashita, Nana Komatsu, Asami Mizukawa, Nozomu Kotaki, Mizuki Yamamoto, Hirofumi Arai, Kazuma Sano, Seika Furuhata', null, 'A smart high school student falls in love with her English teacher after she receives one-on-one tutoring from him.', 'A smart high school student falls in love with her English teacher after she receives one-on-one tutoring from him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/44Z0VKZvZ071NDHhy1oYb7ghGTS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:300823'),
  ('99497236448903061', 'Close to Eden', 1991, 'Drama', 'Nikita Mikhalkov, Vilen Kalyuta, Stepan Mikhalkov', 'Rustam Ibragimbekov, Nikita Mikhalkov', 'Badema, Bayaertu, Vladimir Gostyukhin, Baoyinhexige, Bao Yungyan, Wurinile, Babouchka, Biao Wang', null, 'A farmer and his wife live in a rural part of Inner Mongolia with their three children. Chinese population control policies prevent them from having any more. The farmer sets out for the nearest town to obtain birth control. He comes upon a Russian truck driver who has ended up in a lake. The farmer takes the man back to his farm, and after initially being appalled, the Russian becomes enchanted with the peaceful life of the countryside and decides to stay. But his presence presages big changes for the peasants.', 'A farmer and his wife live in a rural part of Inner Mongolia with their three children. Chinese population control policies prevent them from having any more. The farmer sets out for the nearest town to obtain birth control. He comes upon a Russian truck driver who has ended up in a lake. The farmer takes the man back to his farm, and after initially being appalled, the Russian becomes enchanted with the peaceful life of the countryside and decides to stay. But his presence presages big changes for the peasants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jeUzgLOzvIMK07Xg1sTpmyqNhxv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36346'),
  ('728550325766892564', 'Close to Leo', 2002, 'Drama, Family, TV Movie', 'Christophe Honoré', 'Diastème', 'Yaniss Lespert, Pierre Mignard, Marie Bunel, Rodolphe Pauly, Jérémie Lippmann, Dominic Gould, Joana Preiss, Louis Gonzales', null, 'When 21 year-old Leo, the oldest of four brothers, announces to his rural French family that he''s HIV positive, his family quickly rallies around him. Leo travels to Paris with his youngst brother Marcel for treatment. When Leo tries to push his brother away to protect him, the love and loyalty of the two brothers is tested.', 'When 21 year-old Leo, the oldest of four brothers, announces to his rural French family that he''s HIV positive, his family quickly rallies around him. Leo travels to Paris with his youngst brother Marcel for treatment. When Leo tries to push his brother away to protect him, the love and loyalty of the two brothers is tested.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/djxYQx1VeyYL1cpOfHRuHGWr3R2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27093'),
  ('124137192211437244', 'Close to Me', 2025, 'Romance, Thriller', 'Stefano Sardo, Francesco Di Giacomo, Elisa Becchere', 'Stefano Sardo, Giacomo Bendotti', 'Riccardo Scamarcio, Mariela Garriga, Maria Chiara Giannetta, Paolo Pierobon, Giulio Beranek, Francesco Brandi, Mariana Falace, Flavia Vittorini', null, 'Luca is a forty-year-old teacher experiencing a relationship crisis with his wife, Sara, who is much wealthier than him. During the lockdown, Luca finds himself a bystander in the life of his new neighbor, Amanda, and decides to bridge the distance between them, with disastrous consequences.', 'Luca is a forty-year-old teacher experiencing a relationship crisis with his wife, Sara, who is much wealthier than him. During the lockdown, Luca finds himself a bystander in the life of his new neighbor, Amanda, and decides to bridge the distance between them, with disastrous consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zRsQgmJRCCHXAm1Ls5Q72ziVYBh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1313003'),
