  ('16548792905701691', 'Closed Note', 2007, 'Romance, Drama', 'Kôichi Nakayama, Isao Yukisada, Shinsuke Ohno', 'Isao Yukisada, Chihiro Ito, Tomoko Yoshida', 'Erika Sawajiri, Yūsuke Iseya, Yuko Takeuchi, Yuka Itaya, Masaya Kikawada, Hiromi Nagasaku, Katsuo Nakamura, Saeko', null, 'Kae Horii moves into her new flat in an undisclosed area of Kyoto. While unpacking her belongings, she discovers a hidden compartment behind a inconspicuous mirror. In that compartment, Kae finds a notebook, that turns out to be a diary belonging to the previous tenant. Later that evening Kae starts to read the diary. The writer of the diary is Ibuki Mano, a young lady about to embark on her first year as an elementary school teacher. Ibuki is also in love with a man named Takashi, who may or may not hold similar feelings for Ibuki.', 'Kae Horii moves into her new flat in an undisclosed area of Kyoto. While unpacking her belongings, she discovers a hidden compartment behind a inconspicuous mirror. In that compartment, Kae finds a notebook, that turns out to be a diary belonging to the previous tenant. Later that evening Kae starts to read the diary. The writer of the diary is Ibuki Mano, a young lady about to embark on her first year as an elementary school teacher. Ibuki is also in love with a man named Takashi, who may or may not hold similar feelings for Ibuki.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/630u8IIpbA4Ex0BhlBpyBBUoBNj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36185'),
  ('797071768876902434', 'Closed School', 2019, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Choi Hyo-won', null, 'Chun Yi-seul, Lee Yoon-soo, Seo Do-hyun, Hwang Myung-hwan, Ahn Sang-eun', null, 'Yoo-ra suffers from nightmares every night. One day she meets her high school friends. Jin-tae is a promising artist, In-seok is a chaebol and former thug, Hye-jin likes In-seok, and Seong-ho, who used to be In-seok''s errand boy, finally meet up. Yoo-ra asks her friends if they remember the classmate that killed herself. Everyone is flustered and claims they don''t. Yoo-ra goes to the bathroom, but passes out after seeing herself in the mirror. Everyone gets in In-seok''s car to send Yoo-ra home, but they get into an accident and all become unconscious. When they wake up, they are at a familiar school that''s closed. It was the school they went to that has closed down.', 'Yoo-ra suffers from nightmares every night. One day she meets her high school friends. Jin-tae is a promising artist, In-seok is a chaebol and former thug, Hye-jin likes In-seok, and Seong-ho, who used to be In-seok''s errand boy, finally meet up. Yoo-ra asks her friends if they remember the classmate that killed herself. Everyone is flustered and claims they don''t. Yoo-ra goes to the bathroom, but passes out after seeing herself in the mirror. Everyone gets in In-seok''s car to send Yoo-ra home, but they get into an accident and all become unconscious. When they wake up, they are at a familiar school that''s closed. It was the school they went to that has closed down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vgtQJbDD141JNLvbMs9WFTa3Bpv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:627430'),
  ('225191112694140783', 'Closed Season', 2013, 'Drama', 'Franziska Schlotterer, Bernd Fischer', 'Gwendolyn Bellmann', 'Brigitte Hobmeier, Hans-Jochen Wagner, Christian Friedel, Max Mauff, Wolfgang Packhäuser, Thomas Loibl, Rami Heuberger, Mike Maas', null, '1942 - Fritz and Emma are hiding Albert, a Jewish refugee, at their remote farm. Since their marriage has remained childless, Fritz asks Albert to sleep with Emma and conceive a child on his behalf.', '1942 - Fritz and Emma are hiding Albert, a Jewish refugee, at their remote farm. Since their marriage has remained childless, Fritz asks Albert to sleep with Emma and conceive a child on his behalf.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gKMFjaC8u6WNSLYXajtOziESAEh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163719'),
  ('643291374008312549', 'Closely Watched Trains', 1966, 'Comedy, Drama, War', 'Jiří Menzel, Jaromír Šofr, Bohumil Kouba', 'Jiří Menzel, Bohumil Hrabal', 'Václav Neckář, Jitka Scoffin, Vladimír Valenta, Libuše Havelková, Josef Somr, Alois Vachek, Jitka Zelenohorská, Vlastimil Brodský', null, 'At a village railway station in occupied Czechoslovakia, a bumbling dispatcher’s apprentice longs to liberate himself from his virginity. Oblivious to the war and the resistance that surrounds him, this young man embarks on a journey of sexual awakening and self-discovery, encountering a universe of frustration, eroticism, and adventure within his sleepy backwater depot.', 'At a village railway station in occupied Czechoslovakia, a bumbling dispatcher’s apprentice longs to liberate himself from his virginity. Oblivious to the war and the resistance that surrounds him, this young man embarks on a journey of sexual awakening and self-discovery, encountering a universe of frustration, eroticism, and adventure within his sleepy backwater depot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oKiOhsSRWO6fRqxtvda8WuCiXBm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:789'),
  ('1076072189274794102', 'Closeness', 2017, 'Drama', 'Kantemir Balagov, Artem Emelyanov', 'Kantemir Balagov, Anton Yarush', 'Darya Zhovner, Olga Dragunova, Veniamin Kac, Nazir Zhukov, Timur Shidginov, Anna Levit, Evgeniy Sannikov, Artyom Tsypin', null, '1998, Nalchik. A Jewish family is in trouble: the youngest son and his bride do not come home, and in the morning, a ransom note arrives. The ransom is so high that the family is forced not only to sell its small business, but also to seek help from its fellow tribesmen.', '1998, Nalchik. A Jewish family is in trouble: the youngest son and his bride do not come home, and in the morning, a ransom note arrives. The ransom is so high that the family is forced not only to sell its small business, but also to seek help from its fellow tribesmen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2in3p9uaX6ClqkMS8Oci69LCsXP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:452008'),
  ('257835972646901081', 'Closer', 2004, 'Drama, Romance', 'Mike Nichols, Stephen Goldblatt, Michael Haley', 'Patrick Marber', 'Jude Law, Natalie Portman, Julia Roberts, Clive Owen, Colin Stinton, Nick Hobbs, Steve Benham, Elizabeth Bower', 'R', 'The relationships of two couples become complicated and deceitful when the man from one couple meets the woman of the other.', 'The relationships of two couples become complicated and deceitful when the man from one couple meets the woman of the other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fGGaokx4k00S0J603VG53Qlr9jz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2288'),
  ('565986213743895767', 'Closer to Heaven', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Park Jin-pyo, Hong Seung-chul, Kim Tae-kyeong', 'Park Jin-pyo', 'Ha Ji-won, Kim Myung-min, Nam Neung-mi, Im Ha-ryong, Shin Shin-ae, Lim Jong-yun, Lim Hyung-jun, Lim Sung-min', null, 'A funeral director meets a man who has been battling Lou Gehrig''s disease since he was young. The two fall in love and hope for a cure that can keep him alive.', 'A funeral director meets a man who has been battling Lou Gehrig''s disease since he was young. The two fall in love and hope for a cure that can keep him alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z9rwDnlIQzFNSkrjS1ydcJhzPUm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73092'),
  ('137320208208306318', 'Closer to the Moon', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Nae Caranfil, Marius Panduru', 'Nae Caranfil', 'Vera Farmiga, Mark Strong, Harry Lloyd, Anton Lesser, Joe Armstrong, Christian McKay, Tim Plester, Monica Bîrlădeanu', 'R', 'A Romanian police officer teams up with a small crew of bank robbers to pull off a heist by convincing everyone at the scene of the crime that they are only filming a movie.', 'A Romanian police officer teams up with a small crew of bank robbers to pull off a heist by convincing everyone at the scene of the crime that they are only filming a movie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pBqnSEkLMZoEFgOCQLxM7wKmmS0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137347'),
  ('642147382252445609', 'Closest Love to Heaven', 2017, 'Romance, Drama', 'Taisuke Kawamura, Takamasa Kanazawa', 'Chieko Nakagawa', 'Taishi Nakagawa, Marie Iitoyo, Shono Hayama, Yuna Taira, Kohki Okada, Rieko Miura, Ken Yasuda, Show Kasamatsu', 'PG', 'When Ninon found out that her neighbor and popular classmate Yuji only has one year to live. She decided to go out of her way and help him attain happiness on his remaining time.', 'When Ninon found out that her neighbor and popular classmate Yuji only has one year to live. She decided to go out of her way and help him attain happiness on his remaining time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rmCHrpEkjnyKq6EdEcSusLMYFWL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438640'),
  ('551837233344521657', 'Closet Land', 1991, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Radha Bharadwaj, Bill Pope', 'Radha Bharadwaj', 'Alan Rickman, Madeleine Stowe', 'R', 'A young writer is interrogated by a sadistic secret policeman. She is accused of embedding political messages in her children''s stories. The entire movie takes place in one room, with only the two actors. The movie is set in an unidentified, modern police state.', 'A young writer is interrogated by a sadistic secret policeman. She is accused of embedding political messages in her children''s stories. The entire movie takes place in one room, with only the two actors. The movie is set in an unidentified, modern police state.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6EsCDiddM1zAFehNIcYx2uRujn1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58648'),
  ('673109151988376601', 'Closet Monster', 2016, 'Drama, Fantasy, Mystery', 'Stephen Dunn, Bobby Shore, Deirdre Bowen', 'Stephen Dunn', 'Connor Jessup, Aaron Abrams, Joanne Kelly, Aliocha Schneider, Sofia Banzhaf, Jack Fulton, Mary Walsh, Isabella Rossellini', 'NR', 'A creative and driven teenager is desperate to escape his hometown and the haunting memories of his turbulent childhood.', 'A creative and driven teenager is desperate to escape his hometown and the haunting memories of his turbulent childhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mJYAloVKf20Ko5OE9F9VSfAvmXY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:353728'),
  ('606582324203552962', 'Closing the Ring', 2007, 'Drama, Romance', 'Richard Attenborough, Michael Stevenson, Roger Pratt', 'Peter Woodward', 'Shirley MacLaine, Christopher Plummer, Mischa Barton, Stephen Amell, Neve Campbell, Pete Postlethwaite, Martin McCann, Allan Hawco', 'R', 'During the 1940s, a group of young men go off to war, leaving behind Ethel Ann, who is in love with one of them, Teddy. In modern-day Belfast, a man named Jimmy endeavors to return a ring found in the wreckage of a crashed plane. He travels to Michigan, where the grown Ethel Ann, who married another man after Teddy was killed in battle, now lives. Ethel Ann must decide whether to go with Jimmy to meet the soldier who last saw Teddy alive.', 'During the 1940s, a group of young men go off to war, leaving behind Ethel Ann, who is in love with one of them, Teddy. In modern-day Belfast, a man named Jimmy endeavors to return a ring found in the wreckage of a crashed plane. He travels to Michigan, where the grown Ethel Ann, who married another man after Teddy was killed in battle, now lives. Ethel Ann must decide whether to go with Jimmy to meet the soldier who last saw Teddy alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rsQp6ZlVN9DFj6wcxDcwgpFrOaH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13957'),
  ('904066301268663335', 'Clothes Make the Man', 1940, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Helmut Käutner', 'Helmut Käutner', 'Heinz Rühmann, Hertha Feiler, Fritz Odemar, Hilde Sessak, Rudolf Schündler, Erich Ponto, Aribert Wäscher, Hans Sternberg', null, 'The daydreaming tailor Wenzel is fired from his job, because the fancy frock he was supposed to cut for the mayor, he instead made for himself. He is allowed, however, to take the frock, which he appropriated for himself and he puts it on as he leaves the shop. A puppeteer picks him up in his coach and addresses Wenzel as "Count". So is he received in Goldach, where people think he is Count Stroganoff, the ambassador to the Czar of Russia.', 'The daydreaming tailor Wenzel is fired from his job, because the fancy frock he was supposed to cut for the mayor, he instead made for himself. He is allowed, however, to take the frock, which he appropriated for himself and he puts it on as he leaves the shop. A puppeteer picks him up in his coach and addresses Wenzel as "Count". So is he received in Goldach, where people think he is Count Stroganoff, the ambassador to the Czar of Russia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hb1m6KZ03PsykfZASqiUk8NofmI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36908'),
  ('952488746013911280', 'Cloud', 2007, 'Drama, Romance', null, null, 'Diana Pang Dan, Deng Jiajia', null, 'The film mainly tells the ups and downs and lingering love story between the young female writer Liu Yin (Peng Dan) and the young female college student (Deng Jiajia).', 'The film mainly tells the ups and downs and lingering love story between the young female writer Liu Yin (Peng Dan) and the young female college student (Deng Jiajia).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/39iGoBO0w2R4iY0SrdobkJhjZWT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:838365'),
  ('574683716817310784', 'Cloud', 2024, 'Action, Drama, Crime, Thriller, Horror', 'Kiyoshi Kurosawa, Atsushi Unno, Yasuyuki Sasaki', 'Kiyoshi Kurosawa', 'Masaki Suda, Daiken Okudaira, Kotone Furukawa, Masataka Kubota, Yoshiyoshi Arakawa, Amane Okayama, Masaaki Akahori, Mutsuo Yoshioka', 'NR', 'Ryōsuke Yoshii, an ordinary reseller, carelessly earns grudges by people and becomes entangled in a life-threatening struggle.', 'Ryōsuke Yoshii, an ordinary reseller, carelessly earns grudges by people and becomes entangled in a life-threatening struggle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bmUTHMmqiLWBo19U2y5kk2uqJbA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1244244'),
  ('1100499917743108758', 'Cloud 9', 2006, 'Comedy, Romance, Thriller', 'Harry Basil', 'Brett Hudson', 'Burt Reynolds, D.L. Hughley, Paul Rodríguez, Paul Wesley, Angie Everhart, Gabrielle Reece, Katheryn Winnick, Patricia De Leon', 'R', 'Has-been sports promoter Billy Cole gets a second shot at fame and fortune when he puts together a women''s volleyball team, comprised of exotic dancers...', 'Has-been sports promoter Billy Cole gets a second shot at fame and fortune when he puts together a women''s volleyball team, comprised of exotic dancers...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wAOpdKNVnCtO0rtHEI8HvEYX8rI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18424'),
