  ('158961451717928180', 'Cloud 9', 2014, 'Drama, Romance, Family, TV Movie', 'Paul Hoen, Kathy Jarvis, Suki Medencevic', 'Justin Ware', 'Luke Benward, Dove Cameron, Mike C. Manning, Kiersey Clemons, Amy Farrington, Patrick Fabian, Carlon Jeffery, Andrew Lewis Caldwell', 'G', 'Set high atop snow-capped mountains in the adrenaline-fueled world of competitive snowboarding, the Disney Channel Original Movie “Cloud 9″ tells the inspiring story of two snowboarders who must overcome self-doubt to learn that achieving their dreams is possible.', 'Set high atop snow-capped mountains in the adrenaline-fueled world of competitive snowboarding, the Disney Channel Original Movie “Cloud 9″ tells the inspiring story of two snowboarders who must overcome self-doubt to learn that achieving their dreams is possible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Pe9r7In5HqKUtwug6T3ZdVWHiG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:245473'),
  ('509489603212848647', 'Cloud Atlas', 2012, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Frank Griebe, Sebastian Fahr-Brix, Terry Needham', 'Lana Wachowski, Tom Tykwer, Lilly Wachowski', 'Tom Hanks, Halle Berry, Jim Broadbent, Hugo Weaving, Jim Sturgess, Bae Doona, Ben Whishaw, James D''Arcy', 'R', 'A set of six nested stories spanning time between the 19th century and a distant post-apocalyptic future. Cloud Atlas explores how the actions and consequences of individual lives impact one another throughout the past, the present and the future. Action, mystery and romance weave through the story as one soul is shaped from a killer into a hero and a single act of kindness ripples across centuries to inspire a revolution in the distant future. Based on the award winning novel by David Mitchell. Directed by Tom Tykwer and the Wachowskis.', 'A set of six nested stories spanning time between the 19th century and a distant post-apocalyptic future. Cloud Atlas explores how the actions and consequences of individual lives impact one another throughout the past, the present and the future. Action, mystery and romance weave through the story as one soul is shaped from a killer into a hero and a single act of kindness ripples across centuries to inspire a revolution in the distant future. Based on the award winning novel by David Mitchell. Directed by Tom Tykwer and the Wachowskis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8naVv2Xu3rWI5JKHz0vCujx6GaJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83542'),
  ('582808973685074854', 'Cloud Heaven', 1990, 'Drama', 'Nikolay Dostal, Fyodor Popov, Olga Savenko', 'Georgi Nikolayev', 'Andrey Zhigalov, Sergey Batalov, Irina Rozanova, Alla Kliouka, Anna Ovsyannikova, Vladimir Tolokonnikov, Lev Borisov, Yuri Kolobkov', null, 'In this gentle comedy, an unpopular resident in a Russian village has his life completely changed when he announces, entirely on a whim and just to upset things a bit, that he''s moving to the Pacific coast.', 'In this gentle comedy, an unpopular resident in a Russian village has his life completely changed when he announces, entirely on a whim and just to upset things a bit, that he''s moving to the Pacific coast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g3KrNS9KtPxtc3uj9lsOnqjDwje.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49574'),
  ('253050332820151190', 'Cloud Phenomena of Maloja', 1924, 'Documentary', 'Arnold Fanck', null, null, null, 'The cloud phenomena of Maloja are so well-known that some of them have names, such as the Maloja snake, a cloud bank that winds its way through the Alpine pass like a river. Clouds pass overhead, Fanck films them, just sufficiently to get the idea, among the crags of the Engadine, and gradually he connotes the wider scene, peopling the solitude and stillness below with a person or two, boating.', 'The cloud phenomena of Maloja are so well-known that some of them have names, such as the Maloja snake, a cloud bank that winds its way through the Alpine pass like a river. Clouds pass overhead, Fanck films them, just sufficiently to get the idea, among the crags of the Engadine, and gradually he connotes the wider scene, peopling the solitude and stillness below with a person or two, boating.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4sCROBWHAIY8ZFQtJqne1VW8Z2H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186460'),
  ('389529346792618693', 'Cloudburst', 1951, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Walter J. Harvey, Francis Searle', 'Francis Searle', 'Robert Preston, Elizabeth Sellars, Colin Tapley, Sheila Burrell, Harold Lang, Mary Germaine, Stanley Baker, Edith Sharpe', 'NR', 'Canadian World War II veteran John Graham works in London as a code breaker. Tragedy strikes when his pregnant wife, Carol, is accidentally run over by two crooks who are speeding away from the scene of a murder. Haunted, grieving, and thirsting for revenge, Graham sets out to find the two fugitive murderers.', 'Canadian World War II veteran John Graham works in London as a code breaker. Tragedy strikes when his pregnant wife, Carol, is accidentally run over by two crooks who are speeding away from the scene of a murder. Haunted, grieving, and thirsting for revenge, Graham sets out to find the two fugitive murderers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pjVV2xTuT5G5Cx5p3cJJkWT72Gx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60520'),
  ('524600636605102950', 'Cloudburst', 2011, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Thom Fitzgerald, Thomas M. Harting, Mark Bennett', 'Thom Fitzgerald', 'Olympia Dukakis, Brenda Fricker, Ryan Doucette, Kristin Booth, Michael McPhee, Mary-Colin Chisholm, Stephen Arnold, Juanita Peters', null, 'When Dot''s granddaughter puts her into a nursing home, Stella stages a breakout, and takes Dot to Canada so they can get married. They pick up a hitchhiker along the way.', 'When Dot''s granddaughter puts her into a nursing home, Stella stages a breakout, and takes Dot to Canada so they can get married. They pick up a hitchhiker along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x4vlDX1xc0ZPRYnzyiGMpUOBSPv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117098'),
  ('410859499815814559', 'Clouds of May', 1999, 'Drama', 'Nuri Bilge Ceylan, Nuri Bilge Ceylan', 'Nuri Bilge Ceylan', 'Mehmet Emin Ceylan, Muzaffer Özdemir, Fatma Ceylan, Mehmet Emin Toprak, Muhammed Zımbaoğlu, Hatice Bodur, Sadık İncesu, Saime Toprak', null, 'An aspiring filmmaker visits his parents and begins to devise a movie. Amidst creating and casting for the film, he encounters with family & friends who struggle with their own problems, dreams and life.', 'An aspiring filmmaker visits his parents and begins to devise a movie. Amidst creating and casting for the film, he encounters with family & friends who struggle with their own problems, dreams and life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vWuqYkYSRzhlMc9Vfr2EIpR7OpC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52072'),
  ('556932912964381299', 'Clouds of Sils Maria', 2014, 'Drama', 'Olivier Assayas, Yorick Le Saux, Anja Dihrberg', 'Olivier Assayas', 'Juliette Binoche, Kristen Stewart, Chloë Grace Moretz, Lars Eidinger, Johnny Flynn, Brady Corbet, Hanns Zischler, Angela Winkler', 'R', 'A veteran actress comes face-to-face with an uncomfortable reflection of herself when she agrees to take part in a revival of the play that launched her career 20 years earlier.', 'A veteran actress comes face-to-face with an uncomfortable reflection of herself when she agrees to take part in a revival of the play that launched her career 20 years earlier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dtCZ31RlokpkAaKMr9jFCJjBngi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:246860'),
  ('801199198035305698', 'Cloudy Mountain', 2021, 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Li Jun, Zhao Xiaoshi', 'Sha Song, Li Jun', 'Zhu Yilong, Huang Zhizhong, Chen Shu, Jiao Junyan, Zhang Shangmingzhu, Zhou Xiaoou, Tao Hong, Qiao Xin', 'NR', 'The opening of the new tunnel, which took ten years to build, coincided with a series of serious cataclysms. The lives of 160,000 people depend on the actions of two people, a father and a son.', 'The opening of the new tunnel, which took ten years to build, coincided with a series of serious cataclysms. The lives of 160,000 people depend on the actions of two people, a father and a son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kzAKJAdknTtBfT0l60h9uBQaKRc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:862855'),
  ('726961789476455001', 'Cloudy with a Chance of Meatballs', 2009, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Christopher Miller, Phil Lord', 'Christopher Miller, Rob Greenberg, Phil Lord', 'Bill Hader, Anna Faris, James Caan, Andy Samberg, Bruce Campbell, Mr. T, Bobb''e J. Thompson, Benjamin Bratt', 'PG', 'Inventor Flint Lockwood creates a machine that makes clouds rain food, enabling the down-and-out citizens of Chewandswallow to feed themselves. But when the falling food reaches gargantuan proportions, Flint must scramble to avert disaster. Can he regain control of the machine and put an end to the wild weather before the town is destroyed?', 'Inventor Flint Lockwood creates a machine that makes clouds rain food, enabling the down-and-out citizens of Chewandswallow to feed themselves. But when the falling food reaches gargantuan proportions, Flint must scramble to avert disaster. Can he regain control of the machine and put an end to the wild weather before the town is destroyed?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qhOhIKf7QEyQ5dMrRUqs5eTX1Oq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22794'),
  ('524669806251660641', 'Cloudy with a Chance of Meatballs 2', 2013, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Kris Pearn, Cody Cameron', 'John Francis Daley, Jonathan Goldstein, Erica Rivinoja', 'Bill Hader, Anna Faris, James Caan, Will Forte, Andy Samberg, Benjamin Bratt, Neil Patrick Harris, Terry Crews', 'PG', 'After the disastrous food storm in the first film, Flint and his friends are forced to leave the town. Flint accepts the invitation from his idol Chester V to join The Live Corp Company, which has been tasked to clean the island, and where the best inventors in the world create technologies for the betterment of mankind. When Flint discovers that his machine still operates and now creates mutant food beasts like living pickles, hungry tacodiles, shrimpanzees and apple pie-thons, he and his friends must return to save the world.', 'After the disastrous food storm in the first film, Flint and his friends are forced to leave the town. Flint accepts the invitation from his idol Chester V to join The Live Corp Company, which has been tasked to clean the island, and where the best inventors in the world create technologies for the betterment of mankind. When Flint discovers that his machine still operates and now creates mutant food beasts like living pickles, hungry tacodiles, shrimpanzees and apple pie-thons, he and his friends must return to save the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ss5NcK2NWFg2YcKKYXLrk8q1myS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109451'),
  ('282938247311502124', 'Clover', 2014, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Takeshi Furusawa, Takashi Matsuo, Mitsuru Komiyama', 'Taeko Asano', 'Emi Takei, Tadayoshi Okura, Kento Nagayama, Natsuna Watanabe, Masahiko Nishimura, Yusuke Kamiji, Haruka Kinami, Erena Mizusawa', null, 'Saya Suzuki is an ordinary employee working at a hotel. She falls in love with her elite boss Susumu Tsuge. Through their romance, Saya Suzuki grows as a person.', 'Saya Suzuki is an ordinary employee working at a hotel. She falls in love with her elite boss Susumu Tsuge. Through their romance, Saya Suzuki grows as a person.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4NwK3zjZlUtNiRrULN10VySkNgJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:341041'),
  ('898337358336455536', 'Cloverfield', 2008, 'Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Kari Brown, Michael Parker, Adrian Thompson', 'Drew Goddard', 'Lizzy Caplan, Jessica Lucas, T.J. Miller, Michael Stahl-David, Mike Vogel, Odette Annable, Anjul Nigam, Margot Farley', 'PG-13', 'Five young New Yorkers throw their friend a going-away party the night that a monster the size of a skyscraper descends upon the city. Told from the point of view of their video camera, the film is a document of their attempt to survive the most surreal, horrifying event of their lives.', 'Five young New Yorkers throw their friend a going-away party the night that a monster the size of a skyscraper descends upon the city. Told from the point of view of their video camera, the film is a document of their attempt to survive the most surreal, horrifying event of their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qIegUGJqyMMCRjkKV1s7A9MqdJ8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7191'),
  ('919657912322011575', 'Clown', 2014, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Reid A. Dunlop, Alan Goluboff, Alexandre Champagne', 'Christopher Ford, Jon Watts', 'Andy Powers, Laura Allen, Peter Stormare, Christian Distefano, Chuck Shamata, Elizabeth Whitmere, Victor Cornfoot, Lucas Kelly', 'R', 'A loving father finds a clown suit for his son''s birthday party, only to realize the suit is part of an evil curse that turns its wearer into a killer.', 'A loving father finds a clown suit for his son''s birthday party, only to realize the suit is part of an evil curse that turns its wearer into a killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gp5QyaU49utfWVVL698BzlN2vMh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112454'),
  ('640086832735061875', 'Clown & Out', 2026, 'Adventure, Comedy, Drama', 'Sergio Guerrero Garzafox', 'Sergio Guerrero Garzafox, Janet Quinonez, Sergio Guerrero', 'Alejandro Edda, Katherine Bourne Taylor, Ethan Daniel Corbett, Fermín Martínez, Malili Dib', 'Not Rated', 'Paco Saavedra is a struggling comedian whose life flips overnight when a livestreamed scuffle with a gangster goes viral. Suddenly, he’s a national hero, a meme, and the internet’s newest obsession. But fame is a double-edged sword. As Paco is thrust into instant stardom, he battles to separate his true identity from the clown persona the world demands — even if it costs him the woman he loves.', 'Paco Saavedra is a struggling comedian whose life flips overnight when a livestreamed scuffle with a gangster goes viral. Suddenly, he’s a national hero, a meme, and the internet’s newest obsession. But fame is a double-edged sword. As Paco is thrust into instant stardom, he battles to separate his true identity from the clown persona the world demands — even if it costs him the woman he loves.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F15LwzfCoI8dJRrG4fojXp3EkY0B.jpg', 'plex:movie:clown-and-out'),
  ('1017353459991584412', 'Clown and His Dogs', 1892, 'Animation', 'Émile Reynaud', 'Émile Reynaud', null, null, 'Short film of 300 individually painted images. A lost film.', 'Short film of 300 individually painted images. A lost film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ACC8V9ZSZ9AlWcAqUeF8aMcZV6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16613'),
  ('731309335256662937', 'Clown in a Cornfield', 2025, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Eli Craig, Douglas Mitchell, Brian Pearson', 'Eli Craig, Carter Blanchard', 'Katie Douglas, Carson MacCormac, Kevin Durand, Dylan McEwan, Aaron Abrams, Alexandre Martin Deakin, Vincent Muller, Will Sasso', 'R', 'Quinn and her father have just moved to the quiet town of Kettle Springs hoping for a fresh start. Instead, she discovers a fractured community that has fallen on hard times after the treasured Baypen Corn Syrup Factory burned down. As the locals bicker amongst themselves and tensions boil over, a sinister, grinning figure emerges from the cornfields to cleanse the town of its burdens, one bloody victim at a time.', 'Quinn and her father have just moved to the quiet town of Kettle Springs hoping for a fresh start. Instead, she discovers a fractured community that has fallen on hard times after the treasured Baypen Corn Syrup Factory burned down. As the locals bicker amongst themselves and tensions boil over, a sinister, grinning figure emerges from the cornfields to cleanse the town of its burdens, one bloody victim at a time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cTa1gSyUrvByw2uILt8iyJHbcRb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:713364'),
  ('753497753901648714', 'Clown of the Jungle', 1947, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack Hannah', null, 'Clarence Nash, Pinto Colvig', 'NR', 'In the African jungle, the narrator introduces us to the various birds living there and to wildlife photographer Donald Duck intent on getting some pictures. Unfortunately, all his attempts to photograph birds are ruined by the "clown of the jungle", the Aracuan Bird. Example: when Donald attempts to photograph a chorus line of hummingbirds, the Aracuan Bird interrupts the picture with a Russian kick dance. Donald becomes aggravated to the point where he gives chase but the bird always manages to outsmart Donald and make short work of his sanity.', 'In the African jungle, the narrator introduces us to the various birds living there and to wildlife photographer Donald Duck intent on getting some pictures. Unfortunately, all his attempts to photograph birds are ruined by the "clown of the jungle", the Aracuan Bird. Example: when Donald attempts to photograph a chorus line of hummingbirds, the Aracuan Bird interrupts the picture with a Russian kick dance. Donald becomes aggravated to the point where he gives chase but the bird always manages to outsmart Donald and make short work of his sanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oypzB7f4nanDQ6jbMcycMnJ37SU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53494'),
  ('455459530141006628', 'Clown, Dog and Balloon', 1905, 'Comedy', 'Alice Guy-Blaché', null, null, null, 'Cute one-trick doggie show. The backdrop is beautifully detailed, yet the illusion of depth is humorously broken by the balloon bouncing off the set.', 'Cute one-trick doggie show. The backdrop is beautifully detailed, yet the illusion of depth is humorously broken by the balloon bouncing off the set.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gXy7edG0uSJAnzk952Hs16wIUdz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119995'),
  ('413916041208110904', 'Clownery', 2020, 'Horror', 'Eros D''Antona', 'Eros D''Antona, Carlo De Santis', 'Kateryna Korchynska, Serena P. Palmisano, Alex D''Antona, Mirko D''Antona, Joe Pansa, Pietro Sportelli, Roberto D''Antona, Ida Perrucci', null, 'After a terrible trauma on her birthday, Emma chooses not to celebrate it again. But when she turns 21, a friend of her breaks the ritual with a surprise party, unaware of awakening horrors, which for years have been waiting in the darkness.', 'After a terrible trauma on her birthday, Emma chooses not to celebrate it again. But when she turns 21, a friend of her breaks the ritual with a surprise party, unaware of awakening horrors, which for years have been waiting in the darkness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2CbeEC1m7J4IDJIo0sFQYOhDFuf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:713474'),
  ('121701112288188294', 'Clownhouse', 1990, 'Horror', 'Victor Salva, Tim Young, Robin Mortarotti', 'Victor Salva', 'Nathan Forrest Winters, Brian McHugh, Bobby Salem, Anne Tomin, Sam Rockwell, Michael Jerome West, Byron Weible, David C. Reinecker', 'R', 'Three teenage brothers are terrorized by a trio of escaped mental patients disguised as clowns.', 'Three teenage brothers are terrorized by a trio of escaped mental patients disguised as clowns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lRhXNf7zrOShQumPmMxHifUUUhz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25756'),
  ('1063990212306268817', 'Clowns', 2016, 'Drama', 'Daniele Ciprì, Marco Bellocchio', 'Marco Bellocchio', 'Lucia Ragni, Luca Micheletti, Federica Fracassi, Rebecca Liberati, Corrado Invernizzi, Mino Manni', null, 'In the theater of a small village, rehersals are taking place for a show based on the opera I Pagliacci. There is no orchestra, just a piano and the singers. Amongs the few people in the audience there is the mother of the singer, a rich local lady and financer of the project, the sister, and a few other people involved in the show. During a dinner party at this rich lady’s house, a hiposis session takes place, where rancor and pain emerge from the brother and sister towards their mother and their impossibility of overcoming them.', 'In the theater of a small village, rehersals are taking place for a show based on the opera I Pagliacci. There is no orchestra, just a piano and the singers. Amongs the few people in the audience there is the mother of the singer, a rich local lady and financer of the project, the sister, and a few other people involved in the show. During a dinner party at this rich lady’s house, a hiposis session takes place, where rancor and pain emerge from the brother and sister towards their mother and their impossibility of overcoming them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/krIGuBWZN6k5MAxwq8zKCxC3cgH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:415176'),
  ('1088555215597605008', 'ClownTown', 2017, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Ryan Pilz, Ken Stachnik, David Greathouse', 'Jeff Miller', 'Brian Nagel, Andrew Staton, Katie Keene, Tom Nagel, David Greathouse, Greg Violand, Maryanne Nagel, Jeff Denton', null, 'Whilst on their way to a concert four friends get sidetracked and stranded in a seemingly abandoned town and whilst looking for help find themselves stalked and terrorised by a gang of violent clown dressed psychopaths who will stop at nothing ensnaring them into their sinister blood thirsty games.', 'Whilst on their way to a concert four friends get sidetracked and stranded in a seemingly abandoned town and whilst looking for help find themselves stalked and terrorised by a gang of violent clown dressed psychopaths who will stop at nothing ensnaring them into their sinister blood thirsty games.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Uqx7NitLn4CO1syvTqN6Bb3F6A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:403964'),
  ('1150199113677811707', 'Club de femmes', 1936, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Jacques Deval, Jean Delannoy', 'Jacques Deval', 'Danielle Darrieux, Betty Stockfeld, Else Argal, Raymond Galle, Ève Francis, Valentine Tessier, Josette Day, Junie Astor', null, 'Young women search for love whilst living in a cheap Parisian boardinghouse that does not allow men.', 'Young women search for love whilst living in a cheap Parisian boardinghouse that does not allow men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/soeCVXru1XvGzNFJzLr8aQLnCcC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256979'),
  ('175250362429807002', 'Club Dread', 2004, 'Comedy, Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Jay Chandrasekhar, Lawrence Sher, Francisco Ramirez', 'Paul Soter, Jay Chandrasekhar, Kevin Heffernan', 'Kevin Heffernan, Jay Chandrasekhar, Brittany Daniel, Bill Paxton, Steve Lemme, Jordan Ladd, Elena Lyons, Paul Soter', 'R', 'When a serial killer interrupts the fun at the swanky Coconut Pete''s Coconut Beach Resort -- a hedonistic island paradise for swingers --- it''s up to the club''s staff to stop the violence ... or at least hide it!', 'When a serial killer interrupts the fun at the swanky Coconut Pete''s Coconut Beach Resort -- a hedonistic island paradise for swingers --- it''s up to the club''s staff to stop the violence ... or at least hide it!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9slWyVotwxZNthMcKoeFaK3tgNz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11217'),
  ('72553257136492535', 'Club Las Piranjas', 1995, 'Comedy', 'Ulli Baumann', 'Hape Kerkeling, Doris J. Heinze', 'Hape Kerkeling, Angelika Milster, Judy Winter, Michael Brandner, Katharina Schubert, Hildegard Krekel, Tana Schanzara, Dorothea Walda', null, 'Karl-Heinz, a filling-station attendant, and his family, Herta, a retiree, Kurt, a drugstore branch manager, and Margot, a divorced man-hunter, have only one thing in common: they have booked a holiday at Club Las Piranjas, where they want to relax from their nerve-racking occupations. But there are three people knowing a way to prevent this. Most notably the two animators Edwin and Biggy, who don''t allow any amusement outside their own plans, and of course the always drunken club chief Mrs. Wenger, whose only thought is, that there shouldn''t be any reclamation from the travel agency. Apart from the scruffy condition of the Club (no water in the pool, etc). and the obscure Club activities involving Biggy and Edwin, the vacation becomes a complete horror trip, with only one end in sight, which is to part from the club as soon as possible. Written by Stefan Fey', 'Karl-Heinz, a filling-station attendant, and his family, Herta, a retiree, Kurt, a drugstore branch manager, and Margot, a divorced man-hunter, have only one thing in common: they have booked a holiday at Club Las Piranjas, where they want to relax from their nerve-racking occupations. But there are three people knowing a way to prevent this. Most notably the two animators Edwin and Biggy, who don''t allow any amusement outside their own plans, and of course the always drunken club chief Mrs. Wenger, whose only thought is, that there shouldn''t be any reclamation from the travel agency. Apart from the scruffy condition of the Club (no water in the pool, etc). and the obscure Club activities involving Biggy and Edwin, the vacation becomes a complete horror trip, with only one end in sight, which is to part from the club as soon as possible. Written by Stefan Fey', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fOsIQxDg8xEXccWBXMzrF7yVLtU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52946'),
  ('110088841120548107', 'Club of the Discarded', 1989, 'Animation, Fantasy, Horror', 'Jiří Barta, Ivan Vít', 'Edgar Dutka, Jiří Barta', null, null, 'Laid-off old mannequins spend their cracked and broken lives in an old, abandoned warehouse. New mannequins are brought to the warehouse. They are old as well, but from a younger generation. The two groups must live together, but it''s not easy at all.', 'Laid-off old mannequins spend their cracked and broken lives in an old, abandoned warehouse. New mannequins are brought to the warehouse. They are old as well, but from a younger generation. The two groups must live together, but it''s not easy at all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Mytz8Wur3SEEIr3LOVQxQFvIVT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254268'),
  ('975926356378312335', 'Club Paradise', 1986, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Harold Ramis, Peter Hannan, Callum McDougall', 'Brian Doyle-Murray, Harold Ramis', 'Robin Williams, Peter O''Toole, Rick Moranis, Jimmy Cliff, Twiggy, Adolph Caesar, Eugene Levy, Joanna Cassidy', 'PG-13', 'When Chicago firefighter Jack Moniker retires and moves to a small Caribbean island, he is befriended by the owner of a run-down resort. Together they renovate the resort and lure tourists to Club Paradise in an effort to fight off corrupt officials and businessmen who want to claim the resort as their own.', 'When Chicago firefighter Jack Moniker retires and moves to a small Caribbean island, he is befriended by the owner of a run-down resort. Together they renovate the resort and lure tourists to Club Paradise in an effort to fight off corrupt officials and businessmen who want to claim the resort as their own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y79MRJPUH5zV8doA9uunDV0G9PU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26555'),
  ('952795819724514824', 'Club Sandwich', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Fernando Eimbcke', 'Fernando Eimbcke', 'María Renée Prudencio, Lucio Giménez Cacho, Danae Reynaud, Carolina Politi', null, 'While vacationing at a beachside resort, a single mother faces inevitable separation anxiety when her 15-year-old son — who is also her best friend — discovers magical chemistry with a girl his own age.', 'While vacationing at a beachside resort, a single mother faces inevitable separation anxiety when her 15-year-old son — who is also her best friend — discovers magical chemistry with a girl his own age.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5FznbGSE307ke7KjMJUSh9AMoti.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:213983'),
  ('550753526116131963', 'Club Zero', 2023, 'Thriller, Drama, Comedy', 'Alison Adams, Alice Caronna, Laura Carrion del Pozo', 'Géraldine Bajard, Jessica Hausner', 'Mia Wasikowska, Sidse Babett Knudsen, Amir El-Masry, Elsa Zylberstein, Mathieu Demy, Ksenia Devriendt, Luke Barker, Florence Baker', null, 'Miss Novak joins the staff of an international boarding school to teach a conscious eating class and forms a strong bond with five students that eventually takes a dangerous turn.', 'Miss Novak joins the staff of an international boarding school to teach a conscious eating class and forms a strong bond with five students that eventually takes a dangerous turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9BPVGkU51kUWk54YJl2BXDEdl9y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:938250'),
