  ('1026195217391685116', 'Cobb', 1994, 'Drama', 'Ron Shelton, Russell Boyd, K.C. Hodenfield', 'Ron Shelton', 'Tommy Lee Jones, Robert Wuhl, Lolita Davidovich, Ned Bellamy, Scott Burkholder, Allan Malamud, Bill Caplan, Jeff Fellenzer', 'R', 'Al Stump is a famous sports-writer chosen by Ty Cobb to co-write his official, authorized ''autobiography'' before his death. Cobb, widely feared and despised, feels misunderstood and wants to set the record straight about ''the greatest ball-player ever,'' in his words.', 'Al Stump is a famous sports-writer chosen by Ty Cobb to co-write his official, authorized ''autobiography'' before his death. Cobb, widely feared and despised, feels misunderstood and wants to set the record straight about ''the greatest ball-player ever,'' in his words.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/clOqh9is8vWZvX6AUjF4HtLdQMj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29973'),
  ('446052842299396999', 'Cobra', 1925, 'Drama, Romance', 'Joseph Henabery, Devereaux Jennings, Harry Fischbeck', 'Anthony Coldeway', 'Rudolph Valentino, Nita Naldi, Casson Ferguson, Gertrude Olmstead, Hector Sarno, Claire de Lorez, Eileen Percy, Lillian Langdon', 'NR', 'Rodrigo, an impoverished Italian nobleman takes a job with a New York antique dealer he met overseas. Swearing off women, Rodrigo focuses on his job. But complications arise when he falls in love with his friend''s secretary-- and his friend''s wife looks to make a date with him.', 'Rodrigo, an impoverished Italian nobleman takes a job with a New York antique dealer he met overseas. Swearing off women, Rodrigo focuses on his job. But complications arise when he falls in love with his friend''s secretary-- and his friend''s wife looks to make a date with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4udCI4SwSR7aQgtK919VwyrRlb4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38715'),
