  ('341686815143430823', 'Cobweb', 2023, 'Horror', 'Philip Lozano, Petya Evtimova, Christopher Landry', 'Chris Thomas Devlin', 'Lizzy Caplan, Antony Starr, Cleopatra Coleman, Woody Norman, Luke Busey, Aleksandra Dragova, Jay Rincon, Anton Kottas', 'R', 'Eight year old Peter is plagued by a mysterious, constant tapping from inside his bedroom wall—one that his parents insist is all in his imagination. As Peter''s fear intensifies, he believes that his parents could be hiding a terrible, dangerous secret and questions their trustworthiness.', 'Eight year old Peter is plagued by a mysterious, constant tapping from inside his bedroom wall—one that his parents insist is all in his imagination. As Peter''s fear intensifies, he believes that his parents could be hiding a terrible, dangerous secret and questions their trustworthiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cGXFosYUHYjjdKrOmA0bbjvzhKz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:709631'),
  ('502123333639694541', 'Cocaine Bear', 2023, 'Thriller, Comedy, Crime', 'Elizabeth Banks, Conor Dennison, John Guleserian', 'Jimmy Warden', 'Keri Russell, Alden Ehrenreich, O''Shea Jackson Jr., Ray Liotta, Isiah Whitlock Jr., Brooklynn Prince, Christian Convery, Margo Martindale', 'R', 'Inspired by a true story, an oddball group of cops, criminals, tourists and teens converge in a Georgia forest where a 500-pound black bear goes on a murderous rampage after unintentionally ingesting cocaine.', 'Inspired by a true story, an oddball group of cops, criminals, tourists and teens converge in a Georgia forest where a 500-pound black bear goes on a murderous rampage after unintentionally ingesting cocaine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gOnmaxHo0412UVr1QM5Nekv1xPi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:804150'),
  ('39966353413618756', 'Cocaine Cowboys', 2006, 'Documentary', 'Billy Corben, Armando Salas', null, 'Jon Roberts, Jorge Ayala, Mickey Munday, Toni Mooney, Nelson Andreu, Al Sunshine', 'R', 'In the 1980s, ruthless Colombian cocaine barons invaded Miami with a brand of violence unseen in this country since Prohibition-era Chicago - and it put the city on the map. "Cocaine Cowboys" is the true story of how Miami became the drug, murder and cash capital of the United States, told by the people who made it all happen.', 'In the 1980s, ruthless Colombian cocaine barons invaded Miami with a brand of violence unseen in this country since Prohibition-era Chicago - and it put the city on the map. "Cocaine Cowboys" is the true story of how Miami became the drug, murder and cash capital of the United States, told by the people who made it all happen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gxGis0HgcLJv2MS3l01a0wuhCAI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14761'),
  ('370416987581115272', 'Cocaine Cowboys 2', 2008, 'Action, Documentary', 'Billy Corben', null, null, 'R', 'Set in 1991 on the inner-city streets of Oakland, California, cocaine dealer Charles Cosby has his life is changed forever when he writes a fan letter to the "Cocaine Godmother" Griselda Blanco, who is serving time at a nearby federal prison. Six months later, Cosby is a multi-millionaire, Blanco''s lover, and the head of her $40 million a year cocaine business.', 'Set in 1991 on the inner-city streets of Oakland, California, cocaine dealer Charles Cosby has his life is changed forever when he writes a fan letter to the "Cocaine Godmother" Griselda Blanco, who is serving time at a nearby federal prison. Six months later, Cosby is a multi-millionaire, Blanco''s lover, and the head of her $40 million a year cocaine business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ebdMmTdoqAHEFFgKxxQfSvSGOYV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26769'),
  ('133738250309150471', 'Cocaine Godmother', 2017, 'Drama, TV Movie, Crime', 'Guillermo Navarro, Guillermo Navarro', null, 'Catherine Zeta-Jones, Raúl Méndez, Juan Pablo Espinosa, Jenny Pellicer, Matteo Stefan, Spencer Borgeson, José Julián, Carolyn Adair', null, 'At the age of 17, Griselda Blanco, made her way to the U.S. with a fake passport with her first husband Carlos. Living in Queens with her three sons, Griselda became enticed by the money the drug world offered, and quickly became embroiled with local drug runners. Griselda masterminded the use of beautiful women, the elderly and children as the mules and created false-bottom suitcases to smuggle cocaine from Colombia.', 'At the age of 17, Griselda Blanco, made her way to the U.S. with a fake passport with her first husband Carlos. Living in Queens with her three sons, Griselda became enticed by the money the drug world offered, and quickly became embroiled with local drug runners. Griselda masterminded the use of beautiful women, the elderly and children as the mules and created false-bottom suitcases to smuggle cocaine from Colombia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/BYD6DT0dwtLFXkuCk7SqfAZrqv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:492258'),
  ('1041655477293981218', 'Cocaine Prison', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Violeta Ayala', 'Violeta Ayala', 'Mario Bernal, Daisy Torres, Hernan Torres', null, 'From inside Bolivia''s craziest prison a cocaine worker, a drug mule and his little sister reveal the countries relationship with cocaine.', 'From inside Bolivia''s craziest prison a cocaine worker, a drug mule and his little sister reveal the countries relationship with cocaine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tc6R98vxuIHn90x82FlVcvwIm4q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:470829'),
  ('880063681398313515', 'Cocaine Shark', 2023, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Paul Alan Steele, Mark Polonia', 'Bando Glutz', 'Titus Himmelberger, Ken Van Sant, Natalie Himmelberger, Samantha Coolidge, Ryan Dalton, Noyes J. Lawton, Kevin Coolidge, Mark Polonia', 'NR', 'A mafia drug lord has unleashed a new, highly addictive stimulant on the streets called HT25, derived from sharks held captive in a secret lab, and which causes monstrous side effects. After an explosion and leak at the lab, an army of mutated, bloodthirsty sharks and other creatures are set loose on the world.', 'A mafia drug lord has unleashed a new, highly addictive stimulant on the streets called HT25, derived from sharks held captive in a secret lab, and which causes monstrous side effects. After an explosion and leak at the lab, an army of mutated, bloodthirsty sharks and other creatures are set loose on the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qbtJ6xn5rQFjQCtIh6BZhUXpkza.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1097322'),
  ('400907456169377203', 'Cocaine Wars', 1985, 'Action, Drama', 'Héctor Olivera', 'Héctor Olivera, David Viñas, Steven M. Krauzer', 'John Schneider, Kathryn Witt, Royal Dano, Federico Luppi, Rodolfo Ranni, Ivan Grey, Edgardo Moreira, Ricardo Hamlin', null, 'Miami DEA agent Cliff Adams is in South America working undercover for Gonzalo Reyes, the biggest cocaine exporter in South America. Cliff''s fiancée, Janet Meade, is a reporter doing a story about Reyes. Reyes orders Cliff to kill Marcelo Villalba, who is running for his countries position as president, but Cliff can''t bring himself to do it, because his assignment from the DEA is to work against Reyes. Reyes is afraid Villalba will put him out of business, and is afraid that Janet''s story will do the same thing, so Reyes sends someone else after Villalba, and then Reyes has Janet kidnapped, and Cliff is the only one who can keep Reyes'' plans from succeeding.', 'Miami DEA agent Cliff Adams is in South America working undercover for Gonzalo Reyes, the biggest cocaine exporter in South America. Cliff''s fiancée, Janet Meade, is a reporter doing a story about Reyes. Reyes orders Cliff to kill Marcelo Villalba, who is running for his countries position as president, but Cliff can''t bring himself to do it, because his assignment from the DEA is to work against Reyes. Reyes is afraid Villalba will put him out of business, and is afraid that Janet''s story will do the same thing, so Reyes sends someone else after Villalba, and then Reyes has Janet kidnapped, and Cliff is the only one who can keep Reyes'' plans from succeeding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i9P7SzxYyaTCDmWjuRIMtRDbb9K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119533'),
  ('1100025673357449649', 'Cock and Bull', 2016, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Cao Baoping, Yang Shu', 'Jianjun Yang, Tianhui Zhang, Cao Baoping', 'Liu Ye, Zhang Yi, Duan Bowen, Wang Ziwen, Tan Zhuo, Wang Yanhui, Fu Xiaohu, Yan Bei', 'NR', 'When a murder occurs in a small town in Southeast China, a local mechanic, known for his honesty, comes under suspicion. When the police target him to take the fall, he’s forced to try and exonerate himself, uncovering a number of disturbing facts, most much bigger than the initial crime.', 'When a murder occurs in a small town in Southeast China, a local mechanic, known for his honesty, comes under suspicion. When the police target him to take the fall, he’s forced to try and exonerate himself, uncovering a number of disturbing facts, most much bigger than the initial crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aFbe0uCtNRa4UdV80DzWVLcLadS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:415634'),
  ('225364312709253353', 'Cock o'' the Walk', 1935, 'Animation', 'Ben Sharpsteen, Roy Williams', null, 'Florence Gill, Clarence Nash', 'NR', 'The title character comes to town, complete with portable boxing ring. He grabs a local chicken and dances with her, inspiring several other barnyard animals to dance. But her rooster takes offense, and enters the ring to do battle.', 'The title character comes to town, complete with portable boxing ring. He grabs a local chicken and dances with her, inspiring several other barnyard animals to dance. But her rooster takes offense, and enters the ring to do battle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nyZ92nOBncs59b9YcgRcz0nr6FB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54079'),
  ('543507556098067978', 'Cock-a-Doodle Dog', 1951, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Tex Avery', null, 'Bill Thompson', 'NR', 'Collection of classic Tex Avery visual gags, set up as a battle between a sleep-deprived bulldog who just wants some shut-eye and a rooster driven by his natural instincts to crow all night long.', 'Collection of classic Tex Avery visual gags, set up as a battle between a sleep-deprived bulldog who just wants some shut-eye and a rooster driven by his natural instincts to crow all night long.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vyjG0FXF8WrwpVcu1zRgGZQJ6Un.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84676'),
  ('631730306516755150', 'Cockfighter', 1974, 'Drama', 'Monte Hellman, Don Walters, Néstor Almendros', 'Charles Willeford', 'Warren Oates, Richard B. Shull, Harry Dean Stanton, Ed Begley Jr., Laurie Bird, Troy Donahue, Warren Finnerty, Robert Earl Jones', 'R', 'A man who trains fighting cocks vows to remain silent until one of his birds wins a championship.', 'A man who trains fighting cocks vows to remain silent until one of his birds wins a championship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rfOLlxDwhnaXQ2NWOG8qYsOrEnr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27658'),
  ('93578218026030129', 'Cockles and Muscles', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Olivier Ducastel, Jacques Martineau, Matthieu Poirot-Delpech', null, 'Valeria Bruni Tedeschi, Gilbert Melki, Jean-Marc Barr, Jacques Bonnaffé, Édouard Collin, Romain Torres, Sabrina Seyvecou, Yannick Baudin', null, 'Crustacés et coquillages is a fresh French comedy film with numerous surprise turnarounds and about the tolerance of a family of four. The family spend an idealistic summer vacation together where each of the family members gets involved in a new or old relationship.', 'Crustacés et coquillages is a fresh French comedy film with numerous surprise turnarounds and about the tolerance of a family of four. The family spend an idealistic summer vacation together where each of the family members gets involved in a new or old relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eQPrrzj76pQxmprQ3LpHhriZqlJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:349'),
  ('378434056948329509', 'Cockneys vs Zombies', 2012, 'Action, Comedy, Horror, Thriller', 'Daniel Bronks, Matthias Hoene', 'Lucas Roche, James Moran', 'Rasmus Hardiker, Harry Treadaway, Michelle Ryan, Ashley Thomas, Jack Doolan, Georgia King, Tony Gardner, Alan Ford', 'NR', 'A group of Cockneys arm themselves to rescue their elderly relative and his retirement home friends who are trapped and fighting off a zombie attack during a zombie apocalypse in the East End of London.', 'A group of Cockneys arm themselves to rescue their elderly relative and his retirement home friends who are trapped and fighting off a zombie attack during a zombie apocalypse in the East End of London.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xZPIZb81NSlF1zJhWqne4dKwtxC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114606'),
  ('643498539189009260', 'Cocksucker Blues', 1972, 'Documentary, Music', 'Robert Frank', null, 'Mick Jagger, Keith Richards, Charlie Watts, Bill Wyman, Mick Taylor, Truman Capote, Dick Cavett, Bianca Jagger', null, 'This fly-on-the-wall documentary follows the Rolling Stones on their 1972 North American Tour, their first return to the States since the tragedy at Altamont.', 'This fly-on-the-wall documentary follows the Rolling Stones on their 1972 North American Tour, their first return to the States since the tragedy at Altamont.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ohkYXuOmvMRg77ucUODcxeqAwCL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35922'),
  ('324741562743106784', 'Cocktail', 1988, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Dean Semler, Roger Donaldson, Rob Cowan', 'Heywood Gould', 'Tom Cruise, Bryan Brown, Elisabeth Shue, Lisa Banes, Kelly Lynch, Gina Gershon, Ron Dean, Ellen Foley', 'R', 'After being discharged from the Army, Brian Flanagan moves back to Queens and takes a job in a bar run by Doug Coughlin, who teaches Brian the fine art of bar-tending. Brian quickly becomes a patron favorite with his flashy drink-mixing style, and Brian adopts his mentor''s cynical philosophy on life and goes for the money.', 'After being discharged from the Army, Brian Flanagan moves back to Queens and takes a job in a bar run by Doug Coughlin, who teaches Brian the fine art of bar-tending. Brian quickly becomes a patron favorite with his flashy drink-mixing style, and Brian adopts his mentor''s cynical philosophy on life and goes for the money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jFRhEPhtsln9tDwzMdZN3OlhUob.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7520'),
  ('1027291778480715844', 'Cocktail', 2012, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Homi Adajania, Freya Parekh, Henry Forsyth', 'Sajid Ali, Imtiaz Ali', 'Saif Ali Khan, Deepika Padukone, Diana Penty, Randeep Hooda, Boman Irani, Dimple Kapadia, Ray Burnet, Tina Desai', null, 'A shy simple traditional girl leaves her family in India for her new husband in London, where she meets a shameless flirt and a complicated party girl.', 'A shy simple traditional girl leaves her family in India for her new husband in London, where she meets a shameless flirt and a complicated party girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2F2hFBzYAWKVL1ok2h3ZXKaK4JW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118051'),
  ('628248096241660845', 'Cocktail Molotov', 1980, 'Drama', 'Diane Kurys, Philippe Rousselot', 'Diane Kurys, Alain Le Henry, Philippe Adrien', 'Élise Caron, François Cluzet, Philippe Lebas, Geneviève Fontanel, Henri Garcin, Michel Puterflam, Marco Perrin, Stefania Casini', null, '"Cocktail Molotov" is the story of the adventures of this threesome, who reach Venice only to learn of the outbreak of the May 1968 disturbances at home. Once again, Anne, Frederic and Bruno realize that the important things of their time are happening somewhere where they are not. Swindled out of their car and virtually broke, they hitchhike back to Paris, hoping to arrive in time for some of the excitement.', '"Cocktail Molotov" is the story of the adventures of this threesome, who reach Venice only to learn of the outbreak of the May 1968 disturbances at home. Once again, Anne, Frederic and Bruno realize that the important things of their time are happening somewhere where they are not. Swindled out of their car and virtually broke, they hitchhike back to Paris, hoping to arrive in time for some of the excitement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aYaeXGbMVSMCKF7167f8AWEaVYF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:335925'),
  ('439031406401034761', 'Cocky', 1978, 'Comedy', 'José Amaral, Oswaldo de Oliveira, Rubens Moral', 'José Miziara', 'Nuno Leal Maia, Consuelo Leandro, Maria Luíza Castelli, Guilherme Corrêa, Marlene França, Helena Ramos, Esmeralda Barros, Lola Brah', null, 'Shy countryboy from Itu (a town in Brazil where everything is unusually big) is invited to work in the house of a rich woman, who ends up discovering the boy''s hidden (and big) qualities...', 'Shy countryboy from Itu (a town in Brazil where everything is unusually big) is invited to work in the house of a rich woman, who ends up discovering the boy''s hidden (and big) qualities...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pEktrnESKM0F3rAcEg3Cfp7watI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188992'),
  ('994972109384089210', 'Coco', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Gad Elmaleh, Gilles Henry', 'Gad Elmaleh, Caroline Thivel', 'Gad Elmaleh, Pascale Arbillot, Manu Payet, Jean Benguigui, Ary Abittan, Daniel Cohen, Noémie Lvovsky, Gladys Cohen', null, 'Coco is a French comedy released in 2009 and produced by Gad Elmaleh. This is the first embodiment of the actor, adapted from a sketch in the show La Vie Normale. Coco talks about organizing a Bar Mitzvah.', 'Coco is a French comedy released in 2009 and produced by Gad Elmaleh. This is the first embodiment of the actor, adapted from a sketch in the show La Vie Normale. Coco talks about organizing a Bar Mitzvah.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xQ7gSJIlF4wG6qcaRmiVGBiTKWW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18955'),
  ('1150052551271935419', 'Coco', 2017, 'Family, Animation, Music, Adventure', 'Lee Unkrich, Matt Aspbury, Danielle Feinberg', 'Adrian Molina, Matthew Aldrich', 'Anthony Gonzalez, Gael García Bernal, Benjamin Bratt, Alanna Ubach, Renée Victor, Jaime Camil, Alfonso Arau, Herbert Siguenza', 'PG', 'Despite his family’s baffling generations-old ban on music, Miguel dreams of becoming an accomplished musician like his idol, Ernesto de la Cruz. Desperate to prove his talent, Miguel finds himself in the stunning and colorful Land of the Dead following a mysterious chain of events. Along the way, he meets charming trickster Hector, and together, they set off on an extraordinary journey to unlock the real story behind Miguel''s family history.', 'Despite his family’s baffling generations-old ban on music, Miguel dreams of becoming an accomplished musician like his idol, Ernesto de la Cruz. Desperate to prove his talent, Miguel finds himself in the stunning and colorful Land of the Dead following a mysterious chain of events. Along the way, he meets charming trickster Hector, and together, they set off on an extraordinary journey to unlock the real story behind Miguel''s family history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Ryitt95xrO8KXuqRGm1fUuNwqF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:354912'),
  ('263272076763360923', 'Coco Before Chanel', 2009, 'Drama, History', 'Christophe Beaucarne, Anne Fontaine', 'Anne Fontaine, Camille Fontaine', 'Audrey Tautou, Benoît Poelvoorde, Alessandro Nivola, Marie Gillain, Emmanuelle Devos, Régis Royer, Étienne Bartholomeus, Yan Duffas', 'PG-13', 'Several years after leaving the orphanage, to which her father never returned for her, Gabrielle Chanel finds herself working in a provincial bar. She''s both a seamstress for the performers and a singer, earning the nickname Coco from the song she sings nightly with her sister. A liaison with Baron Balsan gives her an entree into French society and a chance to develop her gift for designing.', 'Several years after leaving the orphanage, to which her father never returned for her, Gabrielle Chanel finds herself working in a provincial bar. She''s both a seamstress for the performers and a singer, earning the nickname Coco from the song she sings nightly with her sister. A liaison with Baron Balsan gives her an entree into French society and a chance to develop her gift for designing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nNpP1P2EufA6TN7fQOBeHUIVmeH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11156'),
  ('438528101455571679', 'Coco Chanel', 2008, 'Drama, Romance', 'Christian Duguay, Fabrizio Lucci', 'Jeffrey Hatcher, Carla Giulia Casalini, Enrico Medioli', 'Shirley MacLaine, Malcolm McDowell, Jean-Claude Dreyfus, Barbora Bobuľová, Brigitte Boucher, Cécile Cassel, Robert Dawson, Daniele Savoca', 'PG', 'Fashion icon Coco Chanel, steeped in wealth and fame, still issues game-changing designs and collections. The audience is taken backwards in time to the woman''s upbringing in an orphanage, and traces her path to ubiquity as it winds through poverty, wars, doomed romances, and rather glamorous betrayals.', 'Fashion icon Coco Chanel, steeped in wealth and fame, still issues game-changing designs and collections. The audience is taken backwards in time to the woman''s upbringing in an orphanage, and traces her path to ubiquity as it winds through poverty, wars, doomed romances, and rather glamorous betrayals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bhEJi25lP4HPntBpO48ZO93D4dT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24475'),
  ('74911869121598872', 'Coco Chanel & Igor Stravinsky', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jan Kounen, David Ungaro, Dominique Delany', 'Chris Greenhalgh', 'Anna Mouglalis, Mads Mikkelsen, Natacha Lindinger, Elena Morozova, Grigori Manoukov, Radivoje Bukvić, Nicolas Vaude, Anatole Taubman', 'R', 'Paris 1913. Coco Chanel is infatuated with the rich and handsome Boy Capel, but she is also compelled by her work. Igor Stravinsky''s The Rite of Spring is about to be performed. The revolutionary dissonances of Igor''s work parallel Coco''s radical ideas. She wants to democratize women''s fashion; he wants to redefine musical taste. Coco attends the scandalous first performance of The Rite in a chic white dress. The music and ballet are criticized as too modern, too foreign. Coco is moved but Igor is inconsolable.', 'Paris 1913. Coco Chanel is infatuated with the rich and handsome Boy Capel, but she is also compelled by her work. Igor Stravinsky''s The Rite of Spring is about to be performed. The revolutionary dissonances of Igor''s work parallel Coco''s radical ideas. She wants to democratize women''s fashion; he wants to redefine musical taste. Coco attends the scandalous first performance of The Rite in a chic white dress. The music and ballet are criticized as too modern, too foreign. Coco is moved but Igor is inconsolable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gfnBY4gMErWej5afiID9ksTcJPf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38984'),
  ('248815519602962306', 'Coco Farm', 2023, 'Comedy, Family', 'Sébastien Gagné', 'Dominic James', 'Oscar Desgagnés, Joey Bélanger, Emma Bao Linh Tourné, Benoît Brière, Louis-Philippe Dandenault, Simon Lacroix, Mia Garnier, Joëlle Paré-Beaulieu', null, 'After his father faces financial struggles, 12-year-old Max is forced to shut down the pawn shop he operates from his garage and move to a small country town. When Max discovers the world of small-scale farming, the young entrepreneur rallies the help of his cousin Charles, along with local youtuber Alice, to start an egg farming business in Charles''s old decaying barn.', 'After his father faces financial struggles, 12-year-old Max is forced to shut down the pawn shop he operates from his garage and move to a small country town. When Max discovers the world of small-scale farming, the young entrepreneur rallies the help of his cousin Charles, along with local youtuber Alice, to start an egg farming business in Charles''s old decaying barn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7kj0cZPXZt2MVPtDEJVNTYcn24n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1080951'),
  ('559791210205667869', 'Cocolors', 2017, 'Animation, Science Fiction', 'Yoshihiko Ishiguro, Manabu Kadono, Ryuudai Abe', 'Toshihisa Yokoshima', 'Yuuki Takada, Sawako Hata, Mutsuki Iwanaka, Masaki Terasoma, Yoshiko Kamei, Yayoi Nakazawa', null, 'Aki isn’t a brave little boy, but he’s dedicated nonetheless to safeguarding his sickly, mute friend Fuyu. They and their little gang live deep underground, in the concrete warrens to which survivors have fled following the eruption of Mt. Fuji. The community is in decline, however, as illness and despair take their toll. Fuyu dreams of the outside world, which he is too frail to ever reach. But what colour is the sky out there?', 'Aki isn’t a brave little boy, but he’s dedicated nonetheless to safeguarding his sickly, mute friend Fuyu. They and their little gang live deep underground, in the concrete warrens to which survivors have fled following the eruption of Mt. Fuji. The community is in decline, however, as illness and despair take their toll. Fuyu dreams of the outside world, which he is too frail to ever reach. But what colour is the sky out there?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/llOx0D5K2G0sB1UcTilcbKTGBJW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:469211'),
  ('282292624479267641', 'Coconut the Dragon', 2014, 'Family, Animation', 'Hubert Weiland, Nina Wels', 'Gabriele M. Walther, Mark Slater', 'Claudia Michelsen, Max von der Groeben, Dustin Semmelrogge, Carolin Kebekus, Sarah Alles, Sabine Falkenberg, Fred Maire', null, 'Coconut and his friend Oscar are outsiders on Dragon Island. Coconut is supposed to be a flying dragon but he can''t fly and Oscar, a carnivore by nature, is a vegetarian bychoice. Together with the porcupine Matilda they go on fabulous adventures and meet dragons in all shapes and sizes.', 'Coconut and his friend Oscar are outsiders on Dragon Island. Coconut is supposed to be a flying dragon but he can''t fly and Oscar, a carnivore by nature, is a vegetarian bychoice. Together with the porcupine Matilda they go on fabulous adventures and meet dragons in all shapes and sizes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3PXBIRY9gXe3tG5W5Vg3Qh5cUqM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:308167'),
  ('753139058343194764', 'Coconut The Little Dragon: Into The Jungle', 2018, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Anthony Power', 'Mark Slater, Gabriele M. Walther', 'Max von der Groeben, Carolin Kebekus, Dustin Semmelrogge', null, 'This is going to be the best holiday ever. Coconut The Little Dragon is thrilled about going to summer camp with his best friends Oscar and Matilda. But due to wild Water Dragons and carnivorous plants, the adventure he wished for turns out tougher than expected.', 'This is going to be the best holiday ever. Coconut The Little Dragon is thrilled about going to summer camp with his best friends Oscar and Matilda. But due to wild Water Dragons and carnivorous plants, the adventure he wished for turns out tougher than expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nLRvXZFakO8LYgFIipk1ykScXxQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:544052'),
  ('990066778104047625', 'Cocoon', 1985, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Mystery, Drama', 'Donald Peterman, Ron Howard, Phillip Norwood', 'Tom Benedek', 'Steve Guttenberg, Tahnee Welch, Brian Dennehy, Don Ameche, Wilford Brimley, Hume Cronyn, Maureen Stapleton, Jack Gilford', 'PG-13', 'When a group of trespassing seniors swim in a pool containing alien cocoons, they find themselves energized with youthful vigor.', 'When a group of trespassing seniors swim in a pool containing alien cocoons, they find themselves energized with youthful vigor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wqNNm36j3nkucAucHEGAW5pNZcd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10328'),
  ('126926253564088055', 'Cocoon', 1995, 'Drama', 'Nuri Bilge Ceylan, Nuri Bilge Ceylan', 'Nuri Bilge Ceylan', 'Mehmet Emin Ceylan, Fatma Ceylan, Turgut Toprak', null, 'The three human characters are an old man, an old woman, and a young boy, who wander among the natural wonders and give the camera soulful looks.', 'The three human characters are an old man, an old woman, and a young boy, who wander among the natural wonders and give the camera soulful looks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nUiIxHgRtr5DMoUHYO9DqD9Yg0f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49473'),
  ('524412887362380894', 'Cocoon', 2020, 'Drama, Romance', 'Kathrin Adam, Hat Koob, Leonie Krippendorff', 'Leonie Krippendorff', 'Lena Urzendowsky, Lena Klenke, Jella Haase, Elina Vildanova, Anja Schneider, Ogulcan Sert, Mohamed Issa, Hussein Eliraqui', null, 'In the heat of a shimmering Berlin summer, Nora spends her days as a third wheel to her older sister Jule and her best friend Aylin. When Romy comes onto the scene, a friendship blossoms. Nora instantly falls for her, opening up a whole new world and unexpected summer of love.', 'In the heat of a shimmering Berlin summer, Nora spends her days as a third wheel to her older sister Jule and her best friend Aylin. When Romy comes onto the scene, a friendship blossoms. Nora instantly falls for her, opening up a whole new world and unexpected summer of love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ik5hG3HJWIjmS2HChi9DLvpQrHB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:656483'),
  ('198660151358735980', 'Cocoon: From the Girls of Summer', 2025, 'Animation, Drama, War, TV Movie', 'Yukimitsu Ina, Hitomi Tateno, Jiro Tazawa', 'Yukimitsu Ina, Taku Kishimoto', 'Marika Ito, Hikari Mitsushima, Yoko Hikasa, Rena Motomura, Chinatsu Akasaki, Aoi Koga, Yume Miyamoto, Izumi Aoyagi', null, 'San and Mayu are two schoolgirls living in Okinawa during the closing months of the Pacific War. Together with their classmates, the two friends are drafted into the war effort as nurses for wounded soldiers. When ordered to die for their country, the remaining members of the group escape only to face the harsh environment of a tropical paradise that has become a hellish battlefield.', 'San and Mayu are two schoolgirls living in Okinawa during the closing months of the Pacific War. Together with their classmates, the two friends are drafted into the war effort as nurses for wounded soldiers. When ordered to die for their country, the remaining members of the group escape only to face the harsh environment of a tropical paradise that has become a hellish battlefield.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xBWJVkyH3ZbKusKJQSOnixfw5BK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1452267'),
  ('948817551054847103', 'Cocoon: The Return', 1988, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Tak Fujimoto, Daniel Petrie', 'Stephen McPherson, David Saperstein', 'Don Ameche, Wilford Brimley, Courteney Cox, Hume Cronyn, Jack Gilford, Steve Guttenberg, Barret Oliver, Maureen Stapleton', 'PG', 'The reinvigorated elderly group that left Earth comes back to visit their relatives. Will they all decide to go back to the planet where no one grows old, or will they be tempted to remain on Earth?', 'The reinvigorated elderly group that left Earth comes back to visit their relatives. Will they all decide to go back to the planet where no one grows old, or will they be tempted to remain on Earth?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xBsXdBl8qCXoQsWX6vfsVjWOMGk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11285'),
  ('747896482050491961', 'Cocorico', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Julien Hervé, Jérôme Alméras, Adélaïde Canonge', 'Julien Hervé', 'Christian Clavier, Didier Bourdon, Sylvie Testud, Marianne Denicourt, Julien Pestel, Chloé Coulloud, Patrick Préjean, Sophie Froissard', null, 'The Bouvier-Sauvages, a large aristocratic family, meet the much more modest Martin family when their children''s wedding is announced. For the occasion, the future bride and groom offer their parents DNA tests, which will reveal their true origins. The results are totally unexpected and will make the effect of a bomb.', 'The Bouvier-Sauvages, a large aristocratic family, meet the much more modest Martin family when their children''s wedding is announced. For the occasion, the future bride and groom offer their parents DNA tests, which will reveal their true origins. The results are totally unexpected and will make the effect of a bomb.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bH8FlHmk3fYmCsmPvWQ2QbhtSsI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:973912'),
  ('48586981303959438', 'Cocote', 2017, 'Drama', 'Nelson Carlos de los Santos Arias, Roman Kasseroller, Andrés Farías', 'Nelson Carlos de los Santos Arias', 'Vicente Santos, Yuberbi de la Rosa, José Miguel Fernández, Kalyane Linares, Enerolisa Núñez, Judith Rodriguez Perez, Pepe Sierra, Isabel Spencer', null, 'A rapturous crime fable set in the Dominican Republic, Nelson Carlo De Los Santos Arias’ COCOTE follows Alberto, a kind-hearted gardener returning home to attend his father’s funeral. When he discovers that a powerful local figure is responsible for his father’s death, Alberto realizes that he’s been summoned by his family to avenge the murder. It’s an unthinkable act — especially for him, an Evangelical Christian. But as pressure mounts, he sees few ways out. Questions of faith, tradition and honor course through this electrifying film, which, seemingly at the speed of thought itself, jumps between film formats, colors, and aspect ratios, radically envisioning a community torn asunder by senseless violence.', 'A rapturous crime fable set in the Dominican Republic, Nelson Carlo De Los Santos Arias’ COCOTE follows Alberto, a kind-hearted gardener returning home to attend his father’s funeral. When he discovers that a powerful local figure is responsible for his father’s death, Alberto realizes that he’s been summoned by his family to avenge the murder. It’s an unthinkable act — especially for him, an Evangelical Christian. But as pressure mounts, he sees few ways out. Questions of faith, tradition and honor course through this electrifying film, which, seemingly at the speed of thought itself, jumps between film formats, colors, and aspect ratios, radically envisioning a community torn asunder by senseless violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sB0WEvzYmwKPurAti4mFo9OSUkZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:467398'),
  ('619481722685950652', 'Coda', 2013, 'Drama, Animation', 'Alan Holly', 'Rory Byrne, Alan Holly', 'Joseph Dermody, Orla Fitzgerald, Brian Gleeson, Donie Ryan', 'NR', 'A lost soul stumbles drunken through the city. In a park, Death finds him and shows him many things.', 'A lost soul stumbles drunken through the city. In a park, Death finds him and shows him many things.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g4sTN0q7ndnjccIhdpGHZ7q2p8c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:307696'),
  ('531764047643140209', 'Coda', 2020, 'Music, Drama', 'Claude Lalonde, Guy Dufaux', 'Louis Godbout', 'Patrick Stewart, Katie Holmes, Giancarlo Esposito, Don Anderson, Abdul Ayoola, Letitia Brookes, Drew Davis, Nicholas Haze', 'PG-13', 'A famous pianist at the twilight of his career meets a free-spirited music critic who soon becomes his rock as his mental state deteriorates.', 'A famous pianist at the twilight of his career meets a free-spirited music critic who soon becomes his rock as his mental state deteriorates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v8w80VLACr7wz97dlGK8GvNIGbP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:528761'),
  ('429326367111593585', 'CODA', 2021, 'Drama, Music, Romance', 'Chantal Birdsong, Pete Waterman, Cameron K. Morton', 'Stanislas Carré de Malberg, Thomas Bidegain, Victoria Bedos', 'Emilia Jones, Marlee Matlin, Troy Kotsur, Eugenio Derbez, Ferdia Walsh-Peelo, Daniel Durant, Amy Forsyth, Kevin Chapman', 'PG-13', 'As a CODA (Child of Deaf Adults), Ruby is the only hearing person in her deaf family. When the family''s fishing business is threatened, Ruby finds herself torn between pursuing her love of music and her fear of abandoning her parents.', 'As a CODA (Child of Deaf Adults), Ruby is the only hearing person in her deaf family. When the family''s fishing business is threatened, Ruby finds herself torn between pursuing her love of music and her fear of abandoning her parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/BzVjmm8l23rPsijLiNLUzuQtyd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:776503'),
  ('889427406100947217', 'Code 3', 2025, 'Comedy, Action, Drama', 'Christopher Leone, Mark Williams', 'Patrick Pianezza, Christopher Leone', 'Rainn Wilson, Lil Rel Howery, Aimee Carrero, Yvette Nicole Brown, Rob Riggle, Page Kennedy, Xolo Maridueña, Eric Jungmann', 'R', 'A burned-out paramedic tries to survive his last 24 hours on the job while training a new recruit.', 'A burned-out paramedic tries to survive his last 24 hours on the job while training a new recruit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gIAYMDb5mIAeCAj76q1sRsKjkzo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1161617'),
  ('712211328298262751', 'Code 46', 2003, 'Drama, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Michael Winterbottom, Alwin H. Küchler, Marcel Zyskind', 'Frank Cottrell Boyce', 'Tim Robbins, Samantha Morton, Nabil Elouahabi, Om Puri, Emil Marwa, Nina Fog, Bruno Lastra, Togo Igawa', 'R', 'In a dystopian future, insurance fraud investigator William Gold arrives in Shanghai to investigate a forgery ring for "papelles", futuristic passports that record people''s identities and genetics. Gold falls for Maria Gonzalez, the woman in charge of the forgeries. After a passionate affair, Gold returns home, having named a coworker as the culprit. But when one of Gonzalez''s customers is found dead, Gold is sent back to Shanghai to complete the investigation.', 'In a dystopian future, insurance fraud investigator William Gold arrives in Shanghai to investigate a forgery ring for "papelles", futuristic passports that record people''s identities and genetics. Gold falls for Maria Gonzalez, the woman in charge of the forgeries. After a passionate affair, Gold returns home, having named a coworker as the culprit. But when one of Gonzalez''s customers is found dead, Gold is sent back to Shanghai to complete the investigation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ijayvLrCAwOVizi9OY8LZWq5SRW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2577'),
  ('501762804179775829', 'Code 7, Victim 5', 1964, 'Action, Adventure, Crime', 'Robert Lynn, Nicolas Roeg, Roy Baird', 'Peter Yeldham', 'Lex Barker, Ann Smyrner, Ronald Fraser, Véronique Vendell, Walter Rilla, Dietmar Schönherr, Gert Van den Bergh, Howard Davis', null, 'The first victim is the butler of South African millionaire Wexler, who hires hard-hitting private eye Steve Martin for protection. Once at Wexler’s palatial Cape Town estate, Martin meets the patriarch’s family, close associates – and possible suspects. When it’s discovered that the key to the killing may lie in an old war photograph, Martin sets out on a mission to unravel the identities of the men in the picture before they become target two through VICTIM 5.', 'The first victim is the butler of South African millionaire Wexler, who hires hard-hitting private eye Steve Martin for protection. Once at Wexler’s palatial Cape Town estate, Martin meets the patriarch’s family, close associates – and possible suspects. When it’s discovered that the key to the killing may lie in an old war photograph, Martin sets out on a mission to unravel the identities of the men in the picture before they become target two through VICTIM 5.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xM8iao7FiRZC41AGBg9jj7BgJg2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109168'),
  ('566991215760880416', 'Code 8', 2016, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Jeff Chan, Alex Disenhof, Alon Isocianu', 'Chris Paré, Jeff Chan', 'Robbie Amell, Sung Kang, Aaron Abrams, Stephen Amell, Chad Donella, Alfred Rubin Thompson, Christine Pagulayan, Jack Horan', null, 'In Lincoln City, 4% of people have extraordinary abilities. Most live below the poverty line, under the close surveillance of a heavily militarized police force. Taylor, a construction worker with powers, is forced to fight after committing a misdemeanor…', 'In Lincoln City, 4% of people have extraordinary abilities. Most live below the poverty line, under the close surveillance of a heavily militarized police force. Taylor, a construction worker with powers, is forced to fight after committing a misdemeanor…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z1fXSh5rIrzBCOJt72MvxmSvrAn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:389165'),
  ('876797966918088252', 'Code 8', 2019, 'Science Fiction, Action, Crime', 'Lize van der Bijl, Ace McCallum, Grant Boyle', 'Chris Paré', 'Robbie Amell, Stephen Amell, Kari Matchett, Penny Eizenga, Lawrence Bayne, Jai Jai Jones, Alex Mallari Jr., Shaun Benson', 'NR', 'In Lincoln City, some inhabitants have extraordinary abilities. Most live below the poverty line, under the close surveillance of a heavily militarized police force. Connor, a construction worker with powers, involves with a criminal gang to help his ailing mother. (Based on the short film “Code 8,” 2016.)', 'In Lincoln City, some inhabitants have extraordinary abilities. Most live below the poverty line, under the close surveillance of a heavily militarized police force. Connor, a construction worker with powers, involves with a criminal gang to help his ailing mother. (Based on the short film “Code 8,” 2016.)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/izGX7npHEopDQvngYcxMJEfcFbj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:461130'),
  ('569699975313179793', 'Code 8 Part II', 2024, 'Science Fiction, Action, Crime', 'Jeff Chan, Marie Davignon, David MacDonald', 'Chris Paré, Jeff Chan, Sherren Lee', 'Robbie Amell, Stephen Amell, Alex Mallari Jr., Sirena Gulamgaus, Aaron Abrams, Moe Jeudy-Lamour, Akiel Julien, Natalie Liconti', 'R', 'In a world where superpowered people are heavily policed by robots, an ex-con teams up with a drug lord he despises to protect a teen from a corrupt cop.', 'In a world where superpowered people are heavily policed by robots, an ex-con teams up with a drug lord he despises to protect a teen from a corrupt cop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h89INyaoH16CdlT7q7BtKikIFRy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:932420'),
  ('306574215680266687', 'Code Blue: The Movie', 2018, 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Etsushi Sugawara, Masaki Nishiura', 'Naoko Adachi', 'Tomohisa Yamashita, Yui Aragaki, Erika Toda, Manami Higa, Yōsuke Asari, Kippei Shiina, Tetta Sugimoto, Daiki Arioka', null, 'A medical team is dispatched to the patients on a helicopter to provide medical care in the field as soon as possible. One day, four young physicians are assigned to this latest medical system. The doctors experience traumatic medical situations, deal with personal ambitions, witness the fragility of life, and they grow personally and professionally.', 'A medical team is dispatched to the patients on a helicopter to provide medical care in the field as soon as possible. One day, four young physicians are assigned to this latest medical system. The doctors experience traumatic medical situations, deal with personal ambitions, witness the fragility of life, and they grow personally and professionally.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5SqrJEFW5UJigAR3GRaryA3Zk66.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:497333'),
  ('357814351114196986', 'Code Geass: Akito the Exiled 1: The Wyvern Arrives', 2012, 'Action, Science Fiction, Animation, War', 'Kazuki Akane, Hiroyuki Chiba, Sota Oya', 'Ichiro Okouchi, Goro Taniguchi', 'Miyu Irino, Maaya Sakamoto, Takehito Koyasu, Nao Toyama, Asami Seto, Saori Hayami, Mariya Ise, Unsho Ishizuka', null, 'The side story takes place in 2017 a.t.b., between the rise of the “Black Knights” organization and the return of the supposedly "dead" Zero. The setting is in Europe, where the European Union (E.U.) allied nations are being invaded by the overwhelming forces of the Holy Britannian Empire. On the verge of defeat, the E.U. army forms a special unit known as “W-0″, of which a young pilot named Akito Hyuga is a member. Leila Malkal , a former Britannian Aristocrat comes to the E.U.''s aid, commanding the “Wyvern” Knightmare corps comprised of Japanese teenagers. They recklessly plunge into a battlefield, where the survival rate is extremely low, at about 5% only. They fight for their freedom and for a "home" to which they can return.', 'The side story takes place in 2017 a.t.b., between the rise of the “Black Knights” organization and the return of the supposedly "dead" Zero. The setting is in Europe, where the European Union (E.U.) allied nations are being invaded by the overwhelming forces of the Holy Britannian Empire. On the verge of defeat, the E.U. army forms a special unit known as “W-0″, of which a young pilot named Akito Hyuga is a member. Leila Malkal , a former Britannian Aristocrat comes to the E.U.''s aid, commanding the “Wyvern” Knightmare corps comprised of Japanese teenagers. They recklessly plunge into a battlefield, where the survival rate is extremely low, at about 5% only. They fight for their freedom and for a "home" to which they can return.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6fytnsNxIF4kBdRbzHQzMNLaAnT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185526'),
  ('308814050428904105', 'Code Geass: Akito the Exiled 2: The Wyvern Divided', 2013, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Kazuki Akane, Hidekazu Shimamura, Jin Aketagawa', 'Goro Taniguchi, Ichiro Okouchi', 'Miyu Irino, Maaya Sakamoto, Satoshi Hino, Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Yoko Hikasa, Keiji Fujiwara, Yuhko Kaida, Shinji Kawada', null, 'The war between Euro Britannia and the European Union continues. New orders are given to the W-0 Unit. To land in the middle of the enemy territory as a diversion. The pilots of the W-0 Unit consist only of the commanding officer, Leila, the only surviving Japanese from their last battle, Akito, and the three that escaped from the Eleven ghettos and lived in the underworld, Ryou, Yukiya, and Ayano. With everyone holding their respective expectations, the operation moves forward. On the other side in Euro Britannia, Shin, who made his benefactor commit suicide with the mysterious power of “Geass”, is appointed the leader of the Knights of St. Michael. As Shin steadily advances for the sake of his own ambition, he and his subordinates in the Ashura squad are given orders to deploy. The one that lives in order to fight, and the one that fights in order to live.', 'The war between Euro Britannia and the European Union continues. New orders are given to the W-0 Unit. To land in the middle of the enemy territory as a diversion. The pilots of the W-0 Unit consist only of the commanding officer, Leila, the only surviving Japanese from their last battle, Akito, and the three that escaped from the Eleven ghettos and lived in the underworld, Ryou, Yukiya, and Ayano. With everyone holding their respective expectations, the operation moves forward. On the other side in Euro Britannia, Shin, who made his benefactor commit suicide with the mysterious power of “Geass”, is appointed the leader of the Knights of St. Michael. As Shin steadily advances for the sake of his own ambition, he and his subordinates in the Ashura squad are given orders to deploy. The one that lives in order to fight, and the one that fights in order to live.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oyklF3LHto3jdwrVmQaze5Q3EDM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:212161'),
  ('128750133765066153', 'Code Geass: Akito the Exiled 3: The Brightness Falls', 2015, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Kazuki Akane', 'Kazuki Akane, Hiroshi Onogi, Miya Asakawa', 'Miyu Irino, Maaya Sakamoto, Satoshi Hino, Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Yoko Hikasa, Masaya Matsukaze, Keiji Fujiwara, Ai Kayano', null, 'After discovering the face of their true enemy, someone who is related to Akito and responsible for the Geass placed upon him, W-0 attempts to return to their base at Castle Weisswolf. However, stranded in Warsaw due to a complication involving their military identification, they are forced to accept the help of local gypsies, allowing the squad to take some time to deepen their bonds. Meanwhile, Britannian advisor Julius Kingsley and his guard Suzaku Kururugi begin working together with the Knights of St. Michael in order to crush the European resistance once and for all, armed with the destructive power of a giant weapon known as the Ark Fleet.', 'After discovering the face of their true enemy, someone who is related to Akito and responsible for the Geass placed upon him, W-0 attempts to return to their base at Castle Weisswolf. However, stranded in Warsaw due to a complication involving their military identification, they are forced to accept the help of local gypsies, allowing the squad to take some time to deepen their bonds. Meanwhile, Britannian advisor Julius Kingsley and his guard Suzaku Kururugi begin working together with the Knights of St. Michael in order to crush the European resistance once and for all, armed with the destructive power of a giant weapon known as the Ark Fleet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n7ajLedWF7AFMwkUVXhowNZG3cA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347200'),
  ('315618271697521865', 'Code Geass: Akito the Exiled 4: Memories of Hatred', 2015, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Kazuki Akane', 'Goro Taniguchi, Ichiro Okouchi', 'Miyu Irino, Maaya Sakamoto, Satoshi Hino, Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Yoko Hikasa, Masaya Matsukaze, Mariya Ise, Keiji Fujiwara', null, 'While W-0 is away, Leila and the remaining crew at base find themselves surrounded by Britannian Knightmares. Piloting the Vercingetorix, Shin Hyuuga leads the enemy charge, having usurped the position of Grand Master in the Knights of St. Michael. With her core members unavailable, it''s up to Leila to protect her comrades, but this may be much tougher than she realizes: a spy lurking among them is finally ready to reveal himself. Left with no choice but to surrender, Leila arranges a meeting with Shin in order to ensure the safety of her squad. But as negotiations begin to fall apart, Akito and an unexpected ally return in the nick of time to turn things around.', 'While W-0 is away, Leila and the remaining crew at base find themselves surrounded by Britannian Knightmares. Piloting the Vercingetorix, Shin Hyuuga leads the enemy charge, having usurped the position of Grand Master in the Knights of St. Michael. With her core members unavailable, it''s up to Leila to protect her comrades, but this may be much tougher than she realizes: a spy lurking among them is finally ready to reveal himself. Left with no choice but to surrender, Leila arranges a meeting with Shin in order to ensure the safety of her squad. But as negotiations begin to fall apart, Akito and an unexpected ally return in the nick of time to turn things around.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4eNsnGy5zwzn0ro4BOv5rHfwhAV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347187'),
  ('154319429454896727', 'Code Geass: Akito the Exiled 5: To Beloved Ones', 2016, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Kazuki Akane', 'Goro Taniguchi, Ichiro Okouchi, Hiroshi Onogi', 'Miyu Irino, Maaya Sakamoto, Takuma Terashima, Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Satoshi Hino, Yoko Hikasa, Unsho Ishizuka, Masaya Matsukaze', null, 'The Ark Fleet has been destroyed, and a significant number of the enemy''s troops have been wiped out due to its crash landing. As the remaining forces of the Holy Order of Michael regroup in order to launch a final assault on Weiswolf Castle, the wZERO unit, along with their new ally Ashley Ashra, stand ready to intercept them. Meanwhile, with his Geass out of control, Shin moves to erase his younger brother''s existence once and for all. But Akito, having promised Leila that he will come back alive, refuses to accept such a fate, and the two clash in their final battle.', 'The Ark Fleet has been destroyed, and a significant number of the enemy''s troops have been wiped out due to its crash landing. As the remaining forces of the Holy Order of Michael regroup in order to launch a final assault on Weiswolf Castle, the wZERO unit, along with their new ally Ashley Ashra, stand ready to intercept them. Meanwhile, with his Geass out of control, Shin moves to erase his younger brother''s existence once and for all. But Akito, having promised Leila that he will come back alive, refuses to accept such a fate, and the two clash in their final battle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4jb6fwNcvnF6tKF9L9leC6bdiS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:372751'),
  ('307551171551197959', 'Code Geass: Lelouch of the Re;surrection', 2019, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Crime, Mystery, War', 'Tatsuya Suzuki, Seiichi Nakatani, Eiji Nakada', 'Goro Taniguchi, Ichiro Okouchi', 'Jun Fukuyama, Yukana, Takahiro Sakurai, Ayumu Murase, Nobunaga Shimazaki, Wataru Takagi, Keiko Toda, Akio Otsuka', null, 'The story takes place several years after Lelouch''s "Zero Requiem" plan. He gave up his life to save the world and protect the ones he loved. The day Lelouch vi Brittannia fell was the day this war-torn world found peace. Now, as his friends work to keep the peace, a terrorist attack could risk everything. Can the brilliant tactician outwit death and save them all? Or will Lelouch’s legacy fall here?', 'The story takes place several years after Lelouch''s "Zero Requiem" plan. He gave up his life to save the world and protect the ones he loved. The day Lelouch vi Brittannia fell was the day this war-torn world found peace. Now, as his friends work to keep the peace, a terrorist attack could risk everything. Can the brilliant tactician outwit death and save them all? Or will Lelouch’s legacy fall here?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ghD2HJyAk6EYVHrzBhddNDJ73Go.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:553837'),
  ('55792972555531520', 'Code Geass: Lelouch of the Rebellion I - Initiation', 2017, 'Science Fiction, Animation, Drama, Action', 'Goro Taniguchi, Hiroyuki Chiba, Motoi Izawa', 'Goro Taniguchi, Ichiro Okouchi', 'Jun Fukuyama, Sayaka Ohara, Yukana, Norio Wakamoto, Kaori Nazuka, Noriaki Sugiyama, Ami Koshimizu, Nobuo Tobita', null, 'The world is at war. Lelouch Lamperouge, an exiled prince, encounters a strange girl known as C.C., who gifts him with a great power. With this ability, Lelouch can get anyone to do as he wills. But the power of Geass: is it a blessing…or a curse?', 'The world is at war. Lelouch Lamperouge, an exiled prince, encounters a strange girl known as C.C., who gifts him with a great power. With this ability, Lelouch can get anyone to do as he wills. But the power of Geass: is it a blessing…or a curse?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lRfTNdwfcXnECZXeZswMOSV3q36.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:477776'),
  ('959706046567000710', 'Code Geass: Lelouch of the Rebellion II - Transgression', 2018, 'Science Fiction, Animation, Drama, Action', 'Goro Taniguchi, Motoi Izawa, Hiroyuki Chiba', 'Ichiro Okouchi, Goro Taniguchi', 'Jun Fukuyama, Yukana, Takahiro Sakurai, Ami Koshimizu, Takahiro Mizushima, Fumiko Orikasa, Omi Minami, Kaori Nazuka', null, 'Having achieved miraculous victories in a series of battles against the Britannian Army, Lelouch Lamperouge has brought the Black Knights, his paramilitary organization, to a more powerful state than ever before. Nothing seems impossible for him when he utilizes his military strength, intellect, and Geass power of absolute obedience. However, obstacles in the face of the uprising never cease, putting Lelouch in a difficult predicament. Most worryingly, Kururugi Suzaku''s combat prowess and the appearance of a mysterious child named V.V. threaten to put an end Lelouch''s great rebellion.', 'Having achieved miraculous victories in a series of battles against the Britannian Army, Lelouch Lamperouge has brought the Black Knights, his paramilitary organization, to a more powerful state than ever before. Nothing seems impossible for him when he utilizes his military strength, intellect, and Geass power of absolute obedience. However, obstacles in the face of the uprising never cease, putting Lelouch in a difficult predicament. Most worryingly, Kururugi Suzaku''s combat prowess and the appearance of a mysterious child named V.V. threaten to put an end Lelouch''s great rebellion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wENcjUrDmCj6gyhSSdA39U8RbIQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:477777'),
  ('1064057904264661166', 'Code Geass: Lelouch of the Rebellion III - Glorification', 2018, 'Science Fiction, Animation, Drama, Action', 'Goro Taniguchi, Hiroyuki Chiba, Motoi Izawa', 'Ichiro Okouchi, Goro Taniguchi', 'Jun Fukuyama, Yukana, Takahiro Sakurai, Ami Koshimizu, Kaori Nazuka', null, 'With his spell of impressive successes seemingly behind him, Lelouch Lamperouge''s hopes of destroying the Brittanian Empire presided over by his father are crumbling at an alarming rate. With his sister kidnapped, his former friend Suzaku ignoring his pleas for help, and his organisation The Black Knights losing their faith in him, the man behind Zero''s mask is left with nowhere to turn.', 'With his spell of impressive successes seemingly behind him, Lelouch Lamperouge''s hopes of destroying the Brittanian Empire presided over by his father are crumbling at an alarming rate. With his sister kidnapped, his former friend Suzaku ignoring his pleas for help, and his organisation The Black Knights losing their faith in him, the man behind Zero''s mask is left with nowhere to turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qGoOP4VWAMQifbCRJkDPVSAkSi2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:477779'),
  ('1129527339060941407', 'Code Name Banshee', 2022, 'Action, Thriller', 'Jon Keeyes, Austin Schmidt', 'Matthew Rogers', 'Jaime King, Antonio Banderas, Tommy Flanagan, Catherine Davis, Kim DeLonghi, Levon Panek, Wayne Pyle, Keil Oakley Zepernick', 'NR', 'Caleb, a former government assassin in hiding, who resurfaces when his protégé, the equally deadly killer known as Banshee, discovers a bounty has been placed on Caleb''s head.', 'Caleb, a former government assassin in hiding, who resurfaces when his protégé, the equally deadly killer known as Banshee, discovers a bounty has been placed on Caleb''s head.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/YLv9S84WyPZ5uxty989Duhzi5u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:916719'),
  ('279527288378625388', 'Code Name Coq Rouge', 1989, 'Thriller, Action', 'Per Berglund, Göran Nilsson, Harald Hamrell', 'Per Berglund', 'Stellan Skarsgård, Lennart Hjulström, Krister Henriksson, Philip Zandén, Bengt Eklund, Lars Green, Roland Hedlund, Anette Kischinowsky', null, 'His name is Carl Hamilton from a Swedish noble family - trained by the CIA and a army SEAL. When a group of terrorists based in Sweden threatens to initiate their diabolic plans - the Coq Rouge Carl Hamilton is activated.', 'His name is Carl Hamilton from a Swedish noble family - trained by the CIA and a army SEAL. When a group of terrorists based in Sweden threatens to initiate their diabolic plans - the Coq Rouge Carl Hamilton is activated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fe82di5xK7GODNhnhkugdNNXIP9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31292'),
  ('228440231296656002', 'Code Name K.O.Z.', 2015, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Celal Çimen', 'Parantez Yazı Grubu', 'Cem Kurtoğlu, Hakan Ural, Hazım Körmükçü, Tolga Karel, Günay Musayeva, İskender Bağcılar, Turgay Tanülkü, Mehmet Çepiç', null, 'Political and social processes in recent and current Turkish political history.', 'Political and social processes in recent and current Turkish political history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jeqLUvdsZBLvzx5SxYQXafGZm4h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:328345'),
  ('1084327061914035580', 'Code Name: Diamond Head', 1977, 'Crime, Drama, TV Movie', 'Jeannot Szwarc, Jack Whitman', 'Paul King', 'Roy Thinnes, France Nuyen, Zulu, Ward Costello, Don Knight, Ian McShane, Eric Braeden, Dennis Patrick', null, 'A failed Quinn Martin pilot for a series starring a Hawaii-based government counter intelligence agency run by the indomitable Aunt Mary. In this, his only adventure, Diamond Head has to prevent the evil Tree from stealing a deadly nerve toxin gas and selling it to foreign powers. To help Diamond Head is the Dragon Lady and Zulu.', 'A failed Quinn Martin pilot for a series starring a Hawaii-based government counter intelligence agency run by the indomitable Aunt Mary. In this, his only adventure, Diamond Head has to prevent the evil Tree from stealing a deadly nerve toxin gas and selling it to foreign powers. To help Diamond Head is the Dragon Lady and Zulu.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ldzw49n70z7ONaSv1b8dj5gtQWg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186584'),
  ('247208534147710685', 'Code Name: Emerald', 1985, 'Action, Drama, War', 'Jonathan Sanger, Freddie Francis', 'Ronald Bass', 'Ed Harris, Max von Sydow, Horst Buchholz, Helmut Berger, Cyrielle Clair, Eric Stoltz, Patrick Stewart, Graham Crowden', 'NR', 'In preparation for Operation Overlord, the Allied invasion of Nazi occupied territory, the ''overlords'' were the few Allied agents who knew the details of the operation. When one them is captured by the Germans, a double agent must infiltrate occupied Paris, with the help of a high level German officer and the French Resistance.', 'In preparation for Operation Overlord, the Allied invasion of Nazi occupied territory, the ''overlords'' were the few Allied agents who knew the details of the operation. When one them is captured by the Germans, a double agent must infiltrate occupied Paris, with the help of a high level German officer and the French Resistance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hJzZBuwHn0VBK3jnxlVdgTjhjdF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74974'),
  ('591058773476028884', 'Code Name: Emperor', 2022, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Pablo Rosso, María Liaño, Antton Zabala', 'Jorge Guerricaechevarría', 'Luis Tosar, Alexandra Masangkay, Georgina Amorós, Denís Gómez, Laura Domínguez, María Botto, Miguel Rellán, Santi Prego', null, 'Juan, a secret service agent, approaches Wendy, a young Filipina who works as a maid for a suspicious couple.', 'Juan, a secret service agent, approaches Wendy, a young Filipina who works as a maid for a suspicious couple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8VjVLMiPm598Kg6XmKk5m1fz0p7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:769636'),
  ('916892797552442267', 'Code Name: Jackal', 2012, 'Action, Comedy', 'Bae Hyeong-jun, Jang Tae-hyeon', 'Oh Sang-ho', 'Song Ji-hyo, HERO Jaejoong, Han Sang-jin, Oh Dal-su, Seo Dong-won, Ra Mi-ran, Seo Yi-an, Kim Sung-ryung', null, 'A legendary assassin takes on an elimination task targeting the famous pop singer. She succeeds in kidnapping the singer but is hesitant to kill him, while he is hesitant to run away.', 'A legendary assassin takes on an elimination task targeting the famous pop singer. She succeeds in kidnapping the singer but is hesitant to kill him, while he is hesitant to run away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/709lwicZ3hgqKPLjzJ8hbM3jmkm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159230'),
  ('333565820587187161', 'Code Name: Rose', 2012, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Arnauld Mercadier, Stéphane Cami', 'Marie Lefevre, Arnaud Mercadier, Frédérique Moreau', 'Claire Keim, Lannick Gautry, Serge Hazanavicius, Florence Pernel, Yvan Le Bolloc''h, Amanda Lear, Nadège Beausson-Diagne, Lucien Belvès', null, 'Margot, a mother-of-three who works as a secretary at an Import''s company is summoned to work as a secret agent with the codename "Rose" forming a funny duo with the handsome spy FX.', 'Margot, a mother-of-three who works as a secretary at an Import''s company is summoned to work as a secret agent with the codename "Rose" forming a funny duo with the handsome spy FX.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jp15oJhYvbtYeylX9WdwGexRIUZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157787'),
  ('825062907680554159', 'Code Name: The Cleaner', 2007, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Les Mayfield, David Franco', 'Robert Adetuyi, George Gallo', 'Cedric the Entertainer, Nicollette Sheridan, Niecy Nash, Mark Dacascos, Lucy Liu, Callum Keith Rennie, DeRay Davis, Will Patton', 'PG-13', 'Cedric the Entertainer plays Jake, a seemingly regular guy who has no idea who he is after being hit over the head by mysterious assailants. When he finds himself entangled in a government conspiracy, Jake and his pursuers become convinced that he is an undercover agent.', 'Cedric the Entertainer plays Jake, a seemingly regular guy who has no idea who he is after being hit over the head by mysterious assailants. When he finds himself entangled in a government conspiracy, Jake and his pursuers become convinced that he is an undercover agent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wSQkv51ygnds56lylNavYJzLmNZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14396'),
  ('279830546294038334', 'Code Name: Wild Geese', 1984, 'Action', 'Antonio Margheriti, Peter Baumgartner, Edoardo Margheriti', 'Tito Carpi, Gianfranco Couyoumdjian', 'Lewis Collins, Klaus Kinski, Lee Van Cleef, Ernest Borgnine, Manfred Lehmann, Thomas Danneberg, Frank Glaubrecht, Hartmut Neugebauer', 'R', 'Commander Robin Wesley, leader of a group of mercenaries, go to the Golden Triangle in Southeast Asia to overthrow the dictator, who is a major manufacturer and dealer of the world''s opium.', 'Commander Robin Wesley, leader of a group of mercenaries, go to the Golden Triangle in Southeast Asia to overthrow the dictator, who is a major manufacturer and dealer of the world''s opium.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7zWv91cybCaQ7wz4zHTllqNXPp3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138595'),
  ('486576742068848462', 'Code Name: Wolverine', 1996, 'Action, TV Movie', 'David Jackson', null, 'Antonio Sabàto, Jr., Traci Lind, Danny Quinn, Richard Brooks, Matthew Cox, Urbano Barberini, Sam Douglas, Brian Protheroe', 'R', 'Harry Gordini is on his way to Italy for a holiday with his family. On his way he accidentally picks up the wrong suitcase which holds in it hundreds of millions worth of new superdrug. Now the drugdealers want the drugs back and kidnap Harry''s wife and son. But unfortunately Harry isn''t just anyone, he''s an ex-Navy SEAL and veteran of the Gulf war, code named "Wolverine". He successfully rescues his wife and kid from the drugdealers, but unfortunately their problems aren''t yet over. Adolfo Jones, the head of the crime organisation, is still at large, and he''s being helped by couple of dirty DEA-agents. Once again the drugdealer Jones is able to kidnap his son. So everything must come down to a final showdown between the "Wolverine" and Jones...', 'Harry Gordini is on his way to Italy for a holiday with his family. On his way he accidentally picks up the wrong suitcase which holds in it hundreds of millions worth of new superdrug. Now the drugdealers want the drugs back and kidnap Harry''s wife and son. But unfortunately Harry isn''t just anyone, he''s an ex-Navy SEAL and veteran of the Gulf war, code named "Wolverine". He successfully rescues his wife and kid from the drugdealers, but unfortunately their problems aren''t yet over. Adolfo Jones, the head of the crime organisation, is still at large, and he''s being helped by couple of dirty DEA-agents. Once again the drugdealer Jones is able to kidnap his son. So everything must come down to a final showdown between the "Wolverine" and Jones...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pcYkod8E4SRzpdSKMsbB7l6Dqld.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:267778'),
  ('219869495814475494', 'Code of Honor', 2016, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Sazzy Lee Calhoun, Mercedes Williamson, Michael Winnick', 'Michael Winnick', 'Steven Seagal, Craig Sheffer, James Russo, Louis Mandylor, Griff Furst, Helena Mattsson, Rafael Petardi, R. D. Call', 'R', 'Colonel Robert Sikes is on a mission to rid his city of crime. As a stealthy, one-man assault team, he will take on street gangs, mobsters, and politicians with extreme prejudice until his mission is complete. His former protégé, William Porter, teams up with the local police department to bring his former commander to justice and prevent him from further vigilantism.', 'Colonel Robert Sikes is on a mission to rid his city of crime. As a stealthy, one-man assault team, he will take on street gangs, mobsters, and politicians with extreme prejudice until his mission is complete. His former protégé, William Porter, teams up with the local police department to bring his former commander to justice and prevent him from further vigilantism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zoNvd5DNrQwGjc9lVit7rJMYFQY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:389425'),
  ('13265089778763390', 'Code of Silence', 1985, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Andrew Davis, James A. Dennett, Richard Feld', 'Mike Gray, Michael Butler, Dennis Shryack', 'Chuck Norris, Mike Genovese, Henry Silva, Bert Remsen, Ralph Foody, Nathan Davis, Allen Hamilton, Ron Henriquez', 'R', 'A Chicago cop is caught in the middle of a gang war while his own comrades shun him because he wants to take an irresponsible cop down.', 'A Chicago cop is caught in the middle of a gang war while his own comrades shun him because he wants to take an irresponsible cop down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yE1Xh7Q7M6uDrm28ib0MMcuhO4L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20721'),
  ('404900923459106636', 'Code Unknown', 2000, 'Drama', 'Michael Haneke, Jürgen Jürges', 'Michael Haneke', 'Juliette Binoche, Thierry Neuvic, Josef Bierbichler, Alexandre Hamidi, Maimouna Hélène Diarra, Ona Lu Yenke, Djibril Kouyaté, Luminița Gheorghiu', null, 'A series of events unfold like a chain reaction, all stemming from a minor event that brings the film''s five characters together. Set in Paris, France, Anne is an actress whose boyfriend Georges photographs the war in Kosovo. Georges'' brother, Jean, is looking for the entry code to Georges'' apartment. These characters'' lives interconnect with a Romanian immigrant and a deaf teacher.', 'A series of events unfold like a chain reaction, all stemming from a minor event that brings the film''s five characters together. Set in Paris, France, Anne is an actress whose boyfriend Georges photographs the war in Kosovo. Georges'' brother, Jean, is looking for the entry code to Georges'' apartment. These characters'' lives interconnect with a Romanian immigrant and a deaf teacher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kJJx2FNmiaep8WT21uMPY9qPzxL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30970'),
  ('877236200411136994', 'Code: Karim', 2021, 'Thriller, Action', 'Claudio Zamarion, Federico Alotto', 'Federico Alotto, Massimo Galimberti', 'Mohamed Zouaoui, Stella Egitto, Aleksandros Memetaj, Gianluca Merolli, Roberto Pappalardo, Fabio Fulco, Valentina Cervi', null, 'The protagonist, after years spent in war-torn Syria, decides to return to Italy, to finally put behind his terrible experiences, and regain his life. But in order to do so, he will have to pay a very high price.', 'The protagonist, after years spent in war-torn Syria, decides to return to Italy, to finally put behind his terrible experiences, and regain his life. But in order to do so, he will have to pay a very high price.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d0ZsPFyXThqDYE0jw2OUeIMVqAK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:762687'),
  ('368411237563737411', 'Coded Bias', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Shalini Kantayya', 'Shalini Kantayya', 'Joy Buolamwini, Cathy O''Neil, Meredith Broussard, Silkie Carlo, Virginia Eubanks, Ravi Naik, Safiya Umoja Noble, Zeynep Tufekci', null, 'Exploring the fallout of MIT Media Lab researcher Joy Buolamwini''s startling discovery that facial recognition does not see dark-skinned faces accurately, and her journey to push for the first-ever legislation in the U.S. to govern against bias in the algorithms that impact us all.', 'Exploring the fallout of MIT Media Lab researcher Joy Buolamwini''s startling discovery that facial recognition does not see dark-skinned faces accurately, and her journey to push for the first-ever legislation in the U.S. to govern against bias in the algorithms that impact us all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2PknXfJbjxIkrC5RqiNEmywSPOY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:653734'),
  ('1066165814286568721', 'Codename Cougar', 1989, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Zhang Yimou, Yang Fengliang, Gu Changwei', 'Cheng Shiqing', 'Ge You, Gong Li, Liu Xiaoning, Yu Rongguang, Wang Xueqi, Xu Yao, Jia Zhaoji, Tian Min', null, 'A commercial airliner on a routine flight between Taipei and Seoul is hijacked and taken to mainland China by the Taiwan Revolutionary Army Front. Chinese authorities cannot seize the plane because of the presence of an important business figure on board, but agree to cooperate with Taiwanese authorities to defuse the tense situation.', 'A commercial airliner on a routine flight between Taipei and Seoul is hijacked and taken to mainland China by the Taiwan Revolutionary Army Front. Chinese authorities cannot seize the plane because of the presence of an important business figure on board, but agree to cooperate with Taiwanese authorities to defuse the tense situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bGWncJbmmiQQnKh5mg2alC8cyFE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:230236'),
  ('722195280819684953', 'Codename: Kids Next Door: Operation I.N.T.E.R.V.I.E.W.S.', 2008, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Comedy, Family, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Robert Alvarez, Maurice Joyce, Karen Villarreal', 'Andy Rheingold, Tom Warburton', 'Ben Diskin, Lauren Tom, Dee Bradley Baker, Cree Summer, Maurice LaMarche, Ric Stoneback, Sonnie Brown, Jeff Bennett', null, 'In a series of interviews with the KND after they''re all grown up, the former operatives are temporarily brought out of their decommissioned haze to discuss what happened during their very last mission with Numbuh one - where he disappeared and was never heard from again! It all started with a routine mission to get the Delightful Children''s birthday cake, but when a mysterious boy steals it instead, he makes it available to whoever wants it, IF they can solve his ''simple'' scavenger hunt first. Soon it''s a mad, mad, mad, mad chase around the world as the KND, their friends, and virtually all of their enemies compete to win the yummiest cake ever', 'In a series of interviews with the KND after they''re all grown up, the former operatives are temporarily brought out of their decommissioned haze to discuss what happened during their very last mission with Numbuh one - where he disappeared and was never heard from again! It all started with a routine mission to get the Delightful Children''s birthday cake, but when a mysterious boy steals it instead, he makes it available to whoever wants it, IF they can solve his ''simple'' scavenger hunt first. Soon it''s a mad, mad, mad, mad chase around the world as the KND, their friends, and virtually all of their enemies compete to win the yummiest cake ever', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ZgHTAm2Qpb5GscqxlJwWY0qyIO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:543744'),
  ('457070819934997260', 'Codename: Kids Next Door: Operation Z.E.R.O.', 2006, 'Animation, Science Fiction, TV Movie, Adventure, Family, Comedy, Fantasy, Mystery, Action', 'Guy Moore, Tom Warburton', 'Mo Willems', 'Ben Diskin, Lauren Tom, Dee Bradley Baker, Cree Summer, Jason Harris, Grey DeLisle, Jeff Bennett, Jennifer Hale', null, 'The villains of the Kids Next Door, lead by Father, join forces to resurrect the Ultimate Evil, Grandfather, a tyrant who once ruled the world many years ago when most of the villains were themselves kids. However, Father disgraced him that he can''t even try to destroy the KND and the Villains were quickly betrayed when they are turned into Senior Citizombies, creatures that are immortal and can transform any living creature into one of them and slaves who are forced to make Tapioca to refuel Grandfather so he can find and destroy the Book of K.N.D.', 'The villains of the Kids Next Door, lead by Father, join forces to resurrect the Ultimate Evil, Grandfather, a tyrant who once ruled the world many years ago when most of the villains were themselves kids. However, Father disgraced him that he can''t even try to destroy the KND and the Villains were quickly betrayed when they are turned into Senior Citizombies, creatures that are immortal and can transform any living creature into one of them and slaves who are forced to make Tapioca to refuel Grandfather so he can find and destroy the Book of K.N.D.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fwgLVVHcDT2XtR3I9ozHN2CwC0v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205081'),
  ('416157167670487485', 'Coeds', 1976, 'Comedy', 'Mariano Laurenti, Alessandro Metz, Federico Zanni', 'Franco Mercuri, Francesco Milizia', 'Dagmar Lassander, Alfredo Pea, Gianfranco D''Angelo, Femi Benussi, Gabriele Di Giulio, Alvaro Vitali, Giusi Raspani Dandolo, Fiammetta Baralla', null, 'Dagmar Lassander is the stunning new teacher that every male student yearns for. Her sultry looks virtually guarantee that every boy makes it to class. School attendance is way up and no longer is staying after school considered a punishment!', 'Dagmar Lassander is the stunning new teacher that every male student yearns for. Her sultry looks virtually guarantee that every boy makes it to class. School attendance is way up and no longer is staying after school considered a punishment!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rrn1Z73oNqr8lPmJOKnU3xFyUc7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124713'),
  ('101405726892905696', 'Cœur fidèle', 1923, 'Drama, Romance', 'Henri Stuckert, Léon Donnot, Paul Guichard', 'Jean Epstein, Marie Epstein', 'Gina Manès, Léon Mathot, Edmond van Daële, Claude Benedict, Madame Maufroy, Marie Epstein, Madeleine Erickson', null, 'The good guys win out in this sweet tale about a young orphan who is abused for much of her life but who eventually finds happiness when she marries an honest man who extricates her from her situation.', 'The good guys win out in this sweet tale about a young orphan who is abused for much of her life but who eventually finds happiness when she marries an honest man who extricates her from her situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hcjZqVlQN5nYcvcbICqzYHK581G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67440'),
  ('251807006045112848', 'Coexist', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Fabrice Eboué, Philippe Guilbert', 'Fabrice Eboué', 'Ramzy Bedia, Fabrice Eboué, Guillaume de Tonquédec, Audrey Lamy, Jonathan Cohen, Mathilde Seigner, Amelle Chahbi, Mylene Bude', null, 'An opportunistic music producer brings together a rabbi, a priest, and an imam to preach about peaceful coexistence through song. But he''s in for a surprise when he realizes the religious leaders are far from saints.', 'An opportunistic music producer brings together a rabbi, a priest, and an imam to preach about peaceful coexistence through song. But he''s in for a surprise when he realizes the religious leaders are far from saints.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lTXjPswcvDIqI72m4nuwEg12oPI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:432618'),
  ('911746921406031503', 'Coffee & Kareem', 2020, 'Comedy, Action, Crime', 'Dan Miller, Michael Dowse, Brian Burgoyne', 'Shane Mack', 'Ed Helms, Taraji P. Henson, Terrence Little Gardenhigh, Betty Gilpin, RonReaco Lee, David Alan Grier, Andrew Bachelor, William ''Big Sleeps'' Stewart', 'R', 'A Detroit cop reluctantly teams with his girlfriend''s 11-year-old son to clear his name and take down the city''s most ruthless criminal.', 'A Detroit cop reluctantly teams with his girlfriend''s 11-year-old son to clear his name and take down the city''s most ruthless criminal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fsIIv6QKDlqrVyGGkouMah4D4ir.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:615177'),
  ('259674110174094674', 'Coffee and Cigarettes', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Jim Jarmusch', 'Steven Wright, Jim Jarmusch, Roberto Benigni', 'Roberto Benigni, Steven Wright', null, 'In a vignette called "Strange to meet you," Roberto sits at a small table in a coffee bar. Five cups of coffee and two ashtrays are in front of him; he drinks and smokes. Steven joins him. They start a conversation about cigarettes and coffee. Steven likes to drink coffee before he sleeps, so he can dream faster. The conversation jumps around. "You know my mother?" asks Roberto. Steven describes coffee Popsicles. They switch seats; then switch back. Steven has to leave for a dental appointment he''s not looking forward to. Roberto makes a startling offer, inspired no doubt by the coffee and cigarettes.', 'In a vignette called "Strange to meet you," Roberto sits at a small table in a coffee bar. Five cups of coffee and two ashtrays are in front of him; he drinks and smokes. Steven joins him. They start a conversation about cigarettes and coffee. Steven likes to drink coffee before he sleeps, so he can dream faster. The conversation jumps around. "You know my mother?" asks Roberto. Steven describes coffee Popsicles. They switch seats; then switch back. Steven has to leave for a dental appointment he''s not looking forward to. Roberto makes a startling offer, inspired no doubt by the coffee and cigarettes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ndGeSVCT1yLl1Mbcvx0yxJPcx6p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68540'),
  ('5825101704133311', 'Coffee and Cigarettes', 2004, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jim Jarmusch, Frederick Elmes, Ellen Kuras', 'Jim Jarmusch', 'Roberto Benigni, Steven Wright, Joie Lee, Cinqué Lee, Steve Buscemi, Iggy Pop, Tom Waits, Joseph Rigano', 'R', 'An anthology of eleven vignettes featuring star-studded casts of extremely unique individuals who all share the common activities of conversing while drinking coffee and smoking cigarettes.', 'An anthology of eleven vignettes featuring star-studded casts of extremely unique individuals who all share the common activities of conversing while drinking coffee and smoking cigarettes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pfG02QCsutx3PIxFS8UY4iM9AsS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:883'),
  ('1141627476621119318', 'Coffee and Cigarettes II', 1989, 'Comedy', 'Jim Jarmusch, Robby Müller', 'Jim Jarmusch', 'Joie Lee, Cinqué Lee, Steve Buscemi', null, 'A brother and sister, sitting in a coffee bar, bicker mildly about whose idea it was to come to Memphis and which kind of cigarette is fresher. Danny, their waiter, comes by offering refills; after determining they are twins, he guesses which is the evil one. Without a pause, he sits down and offers his theory about Elvis''s twin. He drones on. The good twin finally speaks up, giving her own opinion. The waiter is unfazed. After his boss finally calls him back to work, the twins are free to resume their bickering amidst the coffee and cigarettes.', 'A brother and sister, sitting in a coffee bar, bicker mildly about whose idea it was to come to Memphis and which kind of cigarette is fresher. Danny, their waiter, comes by offering refills; after determining they are twins, he guesses which is the evil one. Without a pause, he sits down and offers his theory about Elvis''s twin. He drones on. The good twin finally speaks up, giving her own opinion. The waiter is unfazed. After his boss finally calls him back to work, the twins are free to resume their bickering amidst the coffee and cigarettes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yHBVwbMkeHLZoeBH13vcoSm11D0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:263912'),
  ('753011459477769385', 'Coffee and Cigarettes III', 1997, 'Comedy', 'Frederick Elmes, Jim Jarmusch', 'Jim Jarmusch', 'Iggy Pop, Tom Waits', null, 'This shortcut repeats the structure of Coffee and Cigarettes. This time, Iggy Pop and Tom Waits meet in a bar. But, again, we don''t know why they agreed to do that in the first place, because they don''t seem to know each other very well and they don''t have much to talk about, so the conversation wanders idly and hilariously as they sip their coffee and smoke cigarettes.', 'This shortcut repeats the structure of Coffee and Cigarettes. This time, Iggy Pop and Tom Waits meet in a bar. But, again, we don''t know why they agreed to do that in the first place, because they don''t seem to know each other very well and they don''t have much to talk about, so the conversation wanders idly and hilariously as they sip their coffee and smoke cigarettes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1qbgQfFIG1YA5TzwdbZsWymHDbh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:472693'),
  ('275790834877030416', 'Coffee Date', 2006, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Stewart Wade', 'Stewart Wade', 'Jonathan Bray, Wilson Cruz, Elaine Hendrix, Joanne Baron, Debbie Gibson, Jason Stuart, Judy Dixon, Lisa Ann Walter', null, 'Todd''s life takes a turn when his friendship with a homosexual causes everyone in his life to start questioning his sexuality.', 'Todd''s life takes a turn when his friendship with a homosexual causes everyone in his life to start questioning his sexuality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1UANBKExOnOGgutmvZO3lBNa5NG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40922'),
  ('1058426263369095035', 'Coffee for All', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Fulvio Iannucci, Roly Santos', null, 'Glodier Biedma, Martín Malharro, Elisabeth Cardiello', null, 'Just as "the fluttering of the wings of a butterfly can be felt on the other side of the world" (according to the Chinese proverb) a coffee offered in Naples can be felt in Buenos Aires and replicated in New York. In the bars of threedifferent cities ofthe world, the camera will record the "first flutter" of a coffee cup offered to a customer.', 'Just as "the fluttering of the wings of a butterfly can be felt on the other side of the world" (according to the Chinese proverb) a coffee offered in Naples can be felt in Buenos Aires and replicated in New York. In the bars of threedifferent cities ofthe world, the camera will record the "first flutter" of a coffee cup offered to a customer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/imD6bG2a0d1VVJRLB1Iw7eTH7uM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:521753'),
  ('984918976431435231', 'Coffee or Tea?', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Derek Hui Wang-Yu, Zhao Xiaoshi', 'Zhou Yunhai, Zhang Ji', 'Liu Haoran, Peng Yuchang, Yin Fang, Tan Zhuo, Fu Xiaohu, Zhang Qi, 李佳琦', null, 'Three young men with very different personalities. When they leave the big city to return to the thousand-year-old village of Yunnan, they each begin a crazy and dream journey.', 'Three young men with very different personalities. When they leave the big city to return to the thousand-year-old village of Yunnan, they each begin a crazy and dream journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gDzNg9oNJoX7P4i5GjgLIOrrwzw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:743408'),
  ('1125666552680952435', 'Coffee Shop', 2014, 'Romance, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Dave Alan Johnson, Kristopher S. Kimlin', 'Jon Erwin, Theresa Preston', 'Laura Vandervoort, Cory M. Grant, Rachel Hendrix, Montrel Miller, Jason Burkey, Gabriela Lopez, Josh Ventura, Dave Alan Johnson', null, 'When a young coffee shop owner is threatened with repossession she must take a chance with life and love as she fights to save her business.', 'When a young coffee shop owner is threatened with repossession she must take a chance with life and love as she fights to save her business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Xf1JWAbnLacGoBRN0rrWunJEaO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:308143'),
  ('738062533645146439', 'Coffee Stains', 2014, 'Romance, Drama', 'Leonardo Lacca, Pedro Sotero', 'Leonardo Lacca', 'Irandhir Santos, Rita Carelli, Genézio de Barros, Sílvio Restiffe, Laila Pas, Vera Valdez, Sabrina Greve', null, 'A photographer travels to São Paulo for his first solo exhibition and decides to stay in his now married, ex-girlfriend’s house.', 'A photographer travels to São Paulo for his first solo exhibition and decides to stay in his now married, ex-girlfriend’s house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ftsxlgrPlnS05vRFRX9mVVkkSeM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:299071'),
  ('627632388733674600', 'Coffee Town', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Brad Copeland, Anthony B. Richmond', 'Brad Copeland', 'Glenn Howerton, Steve Little, Ben Schwartz, Adrianne Palicki, Josh Groban, Matt Walsh, Jake Johnson, Derek Waters', 'NR', 'Will is a 30-something website manager who uses local café, Coffee Town, as his office. When the owners of the shop discuss plans to convert Coffee Town into a bar, Will enlists the help of his two best friends Chad and Gino to save his freeloading existence. In order to thwart the plans of Coffee Town''s owners, the trio stages a robbery to create the illusion of an unsafe neighborhood not suitable for the proposed venue. Also standing in their way is Sam, a disgruntled barista with delusions of grandeur and Will''s heartache over unrequited love for Becca.', 'Will is a 30-something website manager who uses local café, Coffee Town, as his office. When the owners of the shop discuss plans to convert Coffee Town into a bar, Will enlists the help of his two best friends Chad and Gino to save his freeloading existence. In order to thwart the plans of Coffee Town''s owners, the trio stages a robbery to create the illusion of an unsafe neighborhood not suitable for the proposed venue. Also standing in their way is Sam, a disgruntled barista with delusions of grandeur and Will''s heartache over unrequited love for Becca.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/475PTJRhikorye5BnTan5BPm85j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198062'),
  ('221437980625841169', 'Coffee With Cinnamon', 2018, 'Drama', 'Thamires Vieira, Ary Rosa, Glenda Nicácio', 'Ary Rosa', 'Valdineia Soriano, Aline Brune, Michelle Mattiuzzi, Aldri Anunciação, Guilherme Silva, Antônio Fábio, Babu Santana, Arlete Dias', null, 'Five friends drink beer and chat at Violeta''s house. Bit by bit, their stories of love, loss and suffering are told, revealing the acts of love and friendship that helped them through the hardest times of their lives.', 'Five friends drink beer and chat at Violeta''s house. Bit by bit, their stories of love, loss and suffering are told, revealing the acts of love and friendship that helped them through the hardest times of their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1TMIJKVNRA57RgMq8jmFOMNdYre.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:469915'),
