  ('727280212304579507', 'Cold Case', 2021, 'Thriller, Mystery, Horror', 'Girish Gangadharan, Jomon T. John, Tanu Balak', 'Sreenath V Nath', 'Prithviraj Sukumaran, Aditi Balan, Anil Nedumangad, Pooja Mohanraj, Suchitra Pillai, Athmeeya Rajan, Lakshmi Priyaa, Rajesh Hebbar', null, 'Sathyajith, Assistant Commissioner of Police, along with his team is assigned to handle controversial and complicated cases. One day, while fishing on a lake side, a man finds a garbage bag trapped inside his net.', 'Sathyajith, Assistant Commissioner of Police, along with his team is assigned to handle controversial and complicated cases. One day, while fishing on a lake side, a man finds a garbage bag trapped inside his net.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6lodKsWEcNNlEPbE461pD2c2SuG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:838609'),
  ('657234417144139999', 'Cold Comes the Night', 2013, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Tze Chun, Noah Rosenthal, Eric Berkal', 'Tze Chun, Osgood Perkins, Nick Simon', 'Alice Eve, Bryan Cranston, Logan Marshall-Green, Ursula Parker, Leo Fitzpatrick, Erin Cummings, Robin Lord Taylor, Sarah Sokolovic', 'R', 'A struggling motel owner and her daughter are taken hostage by a nearly blind career criminal to be his eyes as he attempts to retrieve his cash package from a crooked cop.', 'A struggling motel owner and her daughter are taken hostage by a nearly blind career criminal to be his eyes as he attempts to retrieve his cash package from a crooked cop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1b4O7zqjLVEvdbJcIeLUP77gOSF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210047'),
  ('908473813200724342', 'Cold Comfort Farm', 1995, 'Comedy, Romance', 'John Schlesinger, Chris Seager', 'Malcolm Bradbury', 'Eileen Atkins, Kate Beckinsale, Sheila Burrell, Stephen Fry, Freddie Jones, Joanna Lumley, Ian McKellen, Miriam Margolyes', null, 'In this adaptation of the satirical British novel, Flora Poste, a plucky London society girl orphaned at age 19, finds a new home with some rough relatives, the Starkadders of Cold Comfort Farm. With a take-charge attitude and some encouragement from her mischievous friend, Mary, Flora changes the Starkadders'' lives forever when she settles into their rustic estate, bringing the backward clan up to date and finding inspiration for her novel in the process.', 'In this adaptation of the satirical British novel, Flora Poste, a plucky London society girl orphaned at age 19, finds a new home with some rough relatives, the Starkadders of Cold Comfort Farm. With a take-charge attitude and some encouragement from her mischievous friend, Mary, Flora changes the Starkadders'' lives forever when she settles into their rustic estate, bringing the backward clan up to date and finding inspiration for her novel in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fkPm7MQhn3YqcRDM9qFDKNHiw7D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32513'),
  ('165716284439089144', 'Cold Copy', 2024, 'Mystery, Thriller, Drama', 'Roxine Helberg, Matteo Cocco', 'Roxine Helberg', 'Bel Powley, Tracee Ellis Ross, Jacob Tremblay, Nesta Cooper, James Tupper, Ekaterina Baker, Helena Marie, Yoshie Bancroft', 'R', 'A young broadcast journalism student is trying to win the approval of her influential mentor who pushes her to reconsider the meaning of truth if it means success.', 'A young broadcast journalism student is trying to win the approval of her influential mentor who pushes her to reconsider the meaning of truth if it means success.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6uvjR7tiSycXeDiOu5uXYvXML4X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1029654'),
  ('155037897335687466', 'Cold Creek Manor', 2003, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Mike Figgis, Declan Quinn, Peter Grundy', 'Richard Jefferies', 'Dennis Quaid, Sharon Stone, Stephen Dorff, Juliette Lewis, Kristen Stewart, Christopher Plummer, Kathleen Duborg, Peter Outerbridge', 'R', 'A family moves from New York into an old mansion in the countryside, still filled with the previous owner''s things. As they begin to make it their own, a series of events begin to occur that makes them believe that the former inhabitants are not yet gone.', 'A family moves from New York into an old mansion in the countryside, still filled with the previous owner''s things. As they begin to make it their own, a series of events begin to occur that makes them believe that the former inhabitants are not yet gone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2AKitfwCoCmHU4PTtC5oF6LImlG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12767'),
  ('1054029227390586089', 'Cold Dog Soup', 1990, 'Comedy', 'Alan Metter, Frederick Elmes', 'Thomas Pope', 'Randy Quaid, Frank Whaley, Christine Harnos, Sheree North, Nancy Kwan, Dante Basco, Peter Pan, Pierre Epstein', null, 'A taxi driver (Quaid) pounds Zen parables (if time money, is time the root of all evil?) into his passenger in a high-speed, idiosyncratic tour of their city''s ethnic coteries. All the boy wants is to dispose of his date''s dead dog and get back to the babe who''s so hot she mutters darkly about being a pressure cooker.', 'A taxi driver (Quaid) pounds Zen parables (if time money, is time the root of all evil?) into his passenger in a high-speed, idiosyncratic tour of their city''s ethnic coteries. All the boy wants is to dispose of his date''s dead dog and get back to the babe who''s so hot she mutters darkly about being a pressure cooker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y7C9UGYkmrRgaM43ekK9q1iPNFu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94870'),
  ('1146004621313521166', 'Cold Eyes', 2013, 'Crime, Action, Thriller', 'Kim Byung-seo, Cho Ui-seok, Lee Beom-seok', 'Yau Nai-Hoi', 'Sul Kyung-gu, Jung Woo-sung, Han Hyo-joo, Kim Byeong-ok, Jin Kyung, Lee Jun-ho, Simon Yam, Son Min-seok', null, 'Ha Yoon-ju becomes the newest member of a unit within the Korean Police Forces Special Crime Department that specializes in surveillance activities on high-profile criminals. She teams up with Hwang Sang-jun, the veteran leader of the unit, and tries to track down James who is the cold-hearted leader of an armed criminal organization.', 'Ha Yoon-ju becomes the newest member of a unit within the Korean Police Forces Special Crime Department that specializes in surveillance activities on high-profile criminals. She teams up with Hwang Sang-jun, the veteran leader of the unit, and tries to track down James who is the cold-hearted leader of an armed criminal organization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i1a1rk2qPrxIF5pYyBB2oSTa6OR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204553'),
  ('198651245641138702', 'Cold Eyes of Fear', 1971, 'Crime, Thriller, Horror', 'Enzo G. Castellari, Bruno Nicolai, Antonio L. Ballesteros', 'Enzo G. Castellari, Tito Carpi, Leo Anchóriz', 'Gianni Garko, Giovanna Ralli, Frank Wolff, Fernando Rey, Julián Mateos, Leonardo Scavino, Karin Schubert, Franco Marletta', null, 'Against a backdrop of Swingin'' 60s London a young playboy type "steals" a beautiful Italian girl from her elderly date and suggests she comes back to his place for some good times. "His place" being owned by his father, a rich and respected solicitor. Unfortunately a couple of criminals have plans of their own, one for money, the other for revenge, and the lovers end up prisoners in a tense siege situation', 'Against a backdrop of Swingin'' 60s London a young playboy type "steals" a beautiful Italian girl from her elderly date and suggests she comes back to his place for some good times. "His place" being owned by his father, a rich and respected solicitor. Unfortunately a couple of criminals have plans of their own, one for money, the other for revenge, and the lovers end up prisoners in a tense siege situation', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i14mciipGBf8vcztgH7DufC0te3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105085'),
  ('66548736111840043', 'Cold Feet', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Wolfgang Groos, Andreas Berger', 'Christof Ritter', 'Heiner Lauterbach, Emilio Sakraya, Sonja Gerhardt, Roman Schomburg, Jeanne Goursaud, Adam Hajajczyk, Michael Ostrowski, Aleksandar Jovanović', null, 'Although he actually just wanted to steal money, the crook Denis finds himself in the position of caretaking for the stroke patient Raimund. When Raimund''s granddaughter Charlotte turns up, Denis has enough of it and wants to skip. But because of an huge blizzard, escape is unimaginable.', 'Although he actually just wanted to steal money, the crook Denis finds himself in the position of caretaking for the stroke patient Raimund. When Raimund''s granddaughter Charlotte turns up, Denis has enough of it and wants to skip. But because of an huge blizzard, escape is unimaginable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9v8dhdYwTeXzzw2fDb05TrvhWH1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:564140'),
  ('238886275764767665', 'Cold Fever', 1995, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Fridrik Thor Fridriksson, Ari Kristinsson', 'Jim Stark, Fridrik Thor Fridriksson', 'Masatoshi Nagase, Lili Taylor, Fisher Stevens, Gísli Halldórsson, Seijun Suzuki, Hiromasa Shimada, Masayuki Sasaki, Laura Hughes', null, 'A Japanese businessman travels to Iceland and has a series of misadventures while venturing to a remote area to perform a traditional burial ritual where his parents died several years back.', 'A Japanese businessman travels to Iceland and has a series of misadventures while venturing to a remote area to perform a traditional burial ritual where his parents died several years back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hFqI4uEViGZWPzebAm0gFs63Ewp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68445'),
  ('1007832087925034994', 'Cold Fish', 2011, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime, Horror', 'Shinya Kimura, Sion Sono, Satoshi Yoshida', 'Yoshiki Takahashi, Sion Sono', 'Mitsuru Fukikoshi, Denden, Asuka Kurosawa, Megumi Kagurazaka, Hikari Kajiwara, Tetsu Watanabe, Tarō Suwa, Jyonmyon Pe', 'NR', 'When fish shop owner Shamoto''s teenage daughter Mitsuko is caught stealing, a generous middle-aged man named Murata helps resolve the situation. The man and his wife offer to have Mitsuko work at their opposing fish store. Shamoto soon discovers that something far more sinister lives behind Murata''s friendly demeanor.', 'When fish shop owner Shamoto''s teenage daughter Mitsuko is caught stealing, a generous middle-aged man named Murata helps resolve the situation. The man and his wife offer to have Mitsuko work at their opposing fish store. Shamoto soon discovers that something far more sinister lives behind Murata''s friendly demeanor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/669GmEZsyMlPliURX5myHTStslv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68341'),
  ('197270609909757717', 'Cold Ground', 2017, 'Horror, Mystery, Science Fiction', 'Fabien Delage', 'Fabien Delage', 'Doug Rand, Philip Schurer, Gala Besson, Fabrice Pierre, Maura Tillay', 'R', '1976: Two young journalists leave for the French-Swiss border to investigate a strange case of cattle mutilations and record testimonies for a TV channel. Yet, once they get there, the scientific team they were supposed to meet has gone missing. Escorted by a first-aider, a British biologist and an American forensic investigator, Melissa and David will go looking for the missing team deep into the mountains.', '1976: Two young journalists leave for the French-Swiss border to investigate a strange case of cattle mutilations and record testimonies for a TV channel. Yet, once they get there, the scientific team they were supposed to meet has gone missing. Escorted by a first-aider, a British biologist and an American forensic investigator, Melissa and David will go looking for the missing team deep into the mountains.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yBVtWhp6EEuPK7AyIaITrPAzZeJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:472591'),
  ('791952690874893065', 'Cold Harvest', 1999, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Isaac Florentine, Yossi Wein', 'Frank Dietz', 'Gary Daniels, Bryan Genesse, Barbara Crampton, David Sherwood, Isaac Mavimbela, Chris Buchanan, Greg Melvill-Smith, David Dukas', 'R', 'A bounty hunter protects his dead brother''s wife in a lawless world after a comet has devastated much of earth.', 'A bounty hunter protects his dead brother''s wife in a lawless world after a comet has devastated much of earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tpOF9fyFMfYOIBSoeqmXqQCS68u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59268'),
  ('194120425004408943', 'Cold Heart', 2001, 'Thriller, Romance', 'Dennis Dimster, Philip Holahan, Bud Robertson', 'Zvia Dimbort, Dennis Dimster', 'Nastassja Kinski, Jeff Fahey, Josh Holloway, Hudson Leick, Janne Olivia Campbell, Lincoln Myerson, Bob Sattler, Chris Innis', 'R', 'A married woman has a fling with her husband’s charming, but sociopathic young patient, but when she returns to her husband she finds herself being stalked by her former lover.', 'A married woman has a fling with her husband’s charming, but sociopathic young patient, but when she returns to her husband she finds herself being stalked by her former lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lXHPkjlXFlclX4KMq0wVGQ2KkQN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59996'),
  ('365021079929415626', 'Cold Heaven', 1992, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Nicolas Roeg, Francis Kenny', 'Allan Scott', 'Theresa Russell, James Russo, Julie Carmen, Will Patton, Richard Bradford, Talia Shire, Mark Harmon, Diana Douglas', 'R', 'An adulterous woman''s faith in God is tested when her husband dies and miraculously comes back to life.', 'An adulterous woman''s faith in God is tested when her husband dies and miraculously comes back to life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dnlNgqPlNNWuskm0AO5MnRNhwrn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107254'),
  ('1108828659021979203', 'Cold Hell', 2017, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Stefan Ruzowitzky, Benedict Neuenfels', 'Martin Ambrosch', 'Violetta Schurawlow, Tobias Moretti, Robert Palfrader, Sammy Sheik, Friedrich von Thun, Murathan Muslu, Elif Nisa Uyar, Nursel Köse', null, 'A young Vienna-based taxi driver of Turkish origin witnesses an extremely brutal murder. The perpetrator, a serial killer, makes eye contact with her; a deadly game of cat-and-mouse ensues.', 'A young Vienna-based taxi driver of Turkish origin witnesses an extremely brutal murder. The perpetrator, a serial killer, makes eye contact with her; a deadly game of cat-and-mouse ensues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5WlAA62MaLzdjCzMzIbZpc1pAN2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:410212'),
  ('489623830692063101', 'Cold in July', 2014, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Anne Marie Dentici, Bobby Boothe, Randall Ehrmann', 'Nick Damici, Jim Mickle', 'Michael C. Hall, Don Johnson, Sam Shepard, Vinessa Shaw, Nick Damici, Wyatt Russell, Lanny Flaherty, Brianda Agramonte', 'R', 'While investigating noises in his house one balmy Texas night in 1989, Richard Dane puts a bullet in the brain of a low-life burglar. Although he’s hailed as a small-town hero, Dane soon finds himself fearing for his family’s safety when Freddy’s ex-con father rolls into town, hell-bent on revenge.', 'While investigating noises in his house one balmy Texas night in 1989, Richard Dane puts a bullet in the brain of a low-life burglar. Although he’s hailed as a small-town hero, Dane soon finds himself fearing for his family’s safety when Freddy’s ex-con father rolls into town, hell-bent on revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1rXkxhubAtKVTZl29Xbnwpfen3H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:244509'),
  ('97365410742158875', 'Cold Light of Day', 1989, 'Horror, Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Fhiona-Louise', 'Fhiona-Louise', 'Bob Flag, Geoffrey Greenhill, Claire King, Martin Byrne-Quinn, Keith Hamilton Cobb, Jackie Cox', null, 'February, 1983. Detectives are called to a residential address in the London suburbs following reports that the drains have been clogged by human remains. One of the property’s residents, Dennis Nilsen – a mild-mannered and unassuming civil servant – is brought in for questioning, leading to the discovery of one of the most shocking and disturbing cases of serial murder ever to rock Britain.', 'February, 1983. Detectives are called to a residential address in the London suburbs following reports that the drains have been clogged by human remains. One of the property’s residents, Dennis Nilsen – a mild-mannered and unassuming civil servant – is brought in for questioning, leading to the discovery of one of the most shocking and disturbing cases of serial murder ever to rock Britain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dOETh70mL8QWfFKNSybl52fMf8p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109086'),
  ('118174590321597112', 'Cold Meat', 2024, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Sébastien Drouin, Ryan Petey', 'James Kermack, Andrew Desmond, Sébastien Drouin', 'Allen Leech, Nina Bergman, Yan Tual, James Barton-Steel, Riley Banzer, Sydney Hendricks, William Kuklis, Gil Botelho', null, 'David Petersen is passing through the Colorado Rockies. After saving a young diner waitress from her violent ex-husband during a break from driving, he hits the road again alone through a dangerous snow blizzard. One false move behind the wheel has him waking up inside a ravine, in the eye of the storm. But the cold is the least of his worries when a beast starts prowling outside. How will he survive?', 'David Petersen is passing through the Colorado Rockies. After saving a young diner waitress from her violent ex-husband during a break from driving, he hits the road again alone through a dangerous snow blizzard. One false move behind the wheel has him waking up inside a ravine, in the eye of the storm. But the cold is the least of his worries when a beast starts prowling outside. How will he survive?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gcACvRRy9nE9de5gTetoXiheIZ5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1032372'),
  ('659270118512079739', 'Cold Meridian', 2020, 'Drama', 'Peter Strickland, Márk Győri', 'Peter Strickland', 'Dalma Wéninger, Máté Váth, Juli Jakab, Márton Kristóf', null, 'In this short exploration of sensual audio-visual stimulation, the repeated rituals of an online performer have a transfixing effect on her viewers. What starts as an exploration of tactility, addiction and control soon descends into a nightmarish dance performance where no rules apply.', 'In this short exploration of sensual audio-visual stimulation, the repeated rituals of an online performer have a transfixing effect on her viewers. What starts as an exploration of tactility, addiction and control soon descends into a nightmarish dance performance where no rules apply.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uyHgDkeq0X3itadbsrYzVkMSADL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:687262'),
  ('1068488490275870469', 'Cold Moon', 1991, 'Drama', 'Patrick Bouchitey, Jean-Jacques Bouhon', 'Jackie Berroyer, Charles Bukowski, Patrick Bouchitey', 'Jean-François Stévenin, Patrick Bouchitey, Jean-Pierre Bisson, Laura Favali, Silvana de Faria, Karine Nuris, Roland Blanche, Jean-Pierre Castaldi', null, 'Simon and Dede are best friends: two aimless drunks who spend their days getting sloshed and any other available time getting laid. Simon is living on unemployment benefits in a trailer parked near his sister''s apartment. Dede works at a fish-packing plant on the night shift. Neither man is sensitive, young, or good looking. However, their sang-froid (literally, "cold blood," referring to a quality of imperturbability) stands them in good stead as they go about their seedy lives, picking up one woman and having sex with her on the beach, or when Simon calmly has sex with a prostitute in front of the woman''s brother. In the past, a bizarre necrophiliac situation led to Simon experiencing his only sense of what it might be to truly love someone.', 'Simon and Dede are best friends: two aimless drunks who spend their days getting sloshed and any other available time getting laid. Simon is living on unemployment benefits in a trailer parked near his sister''s apartment. Dede works at a fish-packing plant on the night shift. Neither man is sensitive, young, or good looking. However, their sang-froid (literally, "cold blood," referring to a quality of imperturbability) stands them in good stead as they go about their seedy lives, picking up one woman and having sex with her on the beach, or when Simon calmly has sex with a prostitute in front of the woman''s brother. In the past, a bizarre necrophiliac situation led to Simon experiencing his only sense of what it might be to truly love someone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/UaV8mDNy0DQtCq6wzI9mk9qoln.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60824'),
  ('1143053996748694959', 'Cold Moon', 2016, 'Crime, Drama, Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Thomas L. Callaway, Griff Furst, Brian O''Sullivan', 'Jack Snyder, Griff Furst', 'Candy Clark, Josh Stewart, Robbie Kay, Frank Whaley, Christopher Lloyd, Jaiden Kaine, Tommy Wiseau, Madison Wolfe', null, 'Cold Moon takes place in tiny Babylon, Fla., where the granddaughter of Clark’s character is murdered by a mysterious assailant, her body sunk into the black waters of the Styx River — the river where her parents disappeared from their boat a decade earlier. Suspicion falls on a duplicitous banker and his wealthy father, played by Stewart and Lloyd.', 'Cold Moon takes place in tiny Babylon, Fla., where the granddaughter of Clark’s character is murdered by a mysterious assailant, her body sunk into the black waters of the Styx River — the river where her parents disappeared from their boat a decade earlier. Suspicion falls on a duplicitous banker and his wealthy father, played by Stewart and Lloyd.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2qbgaZothXrCMohpY7CzsMcZeMo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:354125'),
  ('795353093910239388', 'Cold Mountain', 2003, 'War, History, Adventure, Romance', 'John Seale, Anthony Minghella, Jennifer Leacey', 'Anthony Minghella', 'Jude Law, Nicole Kidman, Renée Zellweger, Eileen Atkins, Brendan Gleeson, Philip Seymour Hoffman, Natalie Portman, Giovanni Ribisi', 'R', 'In this classic story of love and devotion set against the backdrop of the American Civil War, a wounded Confederate soldier named W.P. Inman deserts his unit and travels across the South, aiming to return to his young wife, Ada, who he left behind to tend their farm. As Inman makes his perilous journey home, Ada struggles to keep their home intact with the assistance of Ruby, a mysterious drifter sent to help her by a kindly neighbor.', 'In this classic story of love and devotion set against the backdrop of the American Civil War, a wounded Confederate soldier named W.P. Inman deserts his unit and travels across the South, aiming to return to his young wife, Ada, who he left behind to tend their farm. As Inman makes his perilous journey home, Ada struggles to keep their home intact with the assistance of Ruby, a mysterious drifter sent to help her by a kindly neighbor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j0AJeeR5CQPDFh0otyWyCWREHO8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2289'),
  ('545740229306102862', 'Cold of Kalandar', 2016, 'Family, Drama', 'Mustafa Kara, Cevahir Şahin, Kürşat Üresin', 'Bilal Sert, Mustafa Kara', 'Haydar Şişman, Nuray Yeşilaraz, Hanife Kara, İbrahim Kuvvet, Temel Kara, Muzaffer Şen, Hasan Fehmi Hızal, Tuncer Salman', null, 'Mehmet is a man living with his family in a mountain village in the Black Sea region. He earns his living by breeding a few animals, while passionately looking for a mineral reserve on the mountains, but his pursuit is seen useless by his family. Devastated by vain efforts, his hope is renewed with a competition. Mehmet will attend the bull fight held in Artvin, but he returns from Artvin completely lost, once again. This simple story pictures the naive portrait of a touching life, a life struggle in hardship and the relationship between nature, animals and human beings.', 'Mehmet is a man living with his family in a mountain village in the Black Sea region. He earns his living by breeding a few animals, while passionately looking for a mineral reserve on the mountains, but his pursuit is seen useless by his family. Devastated by vain efforts, his hope is renewed with a competition. Mehmet will attend the bull fight held in Artvin, but he returns from Artvin completely lost, once again. This simple story pictures the naive portrait of a touching life, a life struggle in hardship and the relationship between nature, animals and human beings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/94eZ1ox44Y6MY3Ku9XEcriI3l22.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:400812'),
  ('659515674898746474', 'Cold Prey', 2006, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Roar Uthaug, Nico Poulsson, Daniel Voldheim', 'Thomas Moldestad, Roar Uthaug, Marit Haug', 'Ingrid Bolsø Berdal, Rolf Kristian Larsen, Tomas Alf Larsen, Endre Martin Midtstigen, Viktoria Winge, Rune Melby, Erik Skjeggedal, Tonie Lunde', null, 'When one of them breaks a leg, five friends snowboarding in the Norwegian mountains take shelter in an abandoned ski lodge and soon realize they’re not alone.', 'When one of them breaks a leg, five friends snowboarding in the Norwegian mountains take shelter in an abandoned ski lodge and soon realize they’re not alone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sxYjsslcs5FSsAkEfjr50gAQWNo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21786'),
  ('377383259431489783', 'Cold Prey II', 2008, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Anders Flatland, Nico Poulsson, Hannah Hunter', 'Thomas Moldestad', 'Ingrid Bolsø Berdal, Marthe Snorresdotter Rovik, Kim Arne Hagen, Johanna Mørck, Per Schaanning, Fridtjov Såheim, Andreas Cappelen, Vetle Qvenild Werring', null, 'After surviving the events in the Jotunheimen mountains in which four of her friends were murdered, the badly injured Jannicke is brought to the local hospital. But when she wakes up, the building is dark and deserted... and she soon realizes that her nightmare isn’t over yet.', 'After surviving the events in the Jotunheimen mountains in which four of her friends were murdered, the badly injured Jannicke is brought to the local hospital. But when she wakes up, the building is dark and deserted... and she soon realizes that her nightmare isn’t over yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bDLIGTF9gGbnyJOezqJJ7VO9dv9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15440'),
  ('1059580410838279495', 'Cold Prey III', 2010, 'Horror', 'Mikkel Brænne Sandemose, Ari Willey', 'Peder Fuglerud, Lars Gudmestad', 'Ida Marie Bakkerud, Julie Rusti, Kim S. Falck-Jørgensen, Pål Stokka, Arthur Berning, Sturla Rui, Terje Ranes, Nils Johnson', null, 'In 1988, a group of teenagers go to visit an abandoned hotel, only to find themselves hunted by a psychotic killer through the Norwegian woods.', 'In 1988, a group of teenagers go to visit an abandoned hotel, only to find themselves hunted by a psychotic killer through the Norwegian woods.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ugGa77nQvRT1REmz3L9mEVVZRUO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56937'),
  ('919379086957771854', 'Cold Pursuit', 2019, 'Crime, Action', 'Jason Furukawa, Annie Feldsott, Kit Marlatt', 'Kim Fupz Aakeson', 'Liam Neeson, Tom Bateman, Tom Jackson, Laura Dern, Nicholas Holmes, Emmy Rossum, Domenick Lombardozzi, Julia Jones', 'R', 'The quiet family life of Nels Coxman, a snowplow driver, is upended after his son''s murder. Nels begins a vengeful hunt for Viking, the drug lord he holds responsible for the killing, eliminating Viking''s associates one by one. As Nels draws closer to Viking, his actions bring even more unexpected and violent consequences, as he proves that revenge is all in the execution.', 'The quiet family life of Nels Coxman, a snowplow driver, is upended after his son''s murder. Nels begins a vengeful hunt for Viking, the drug lord he holds responsible for the killing, eliminating Viking''s associates one by one. As Nels draws closer to Viking, his actions bring even more unexpected and violent consequences, as he proves that revenge is all in the execution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5RILVnOchQyL1LbcVzmabipdJfc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438650'),
  ('408603850422554675', 'Cold Showers', 2005, 'Drama', 'Antony Cordier, Nicolas Gaurin', 'Antony Cordier, Julie Peyr', 'Johan Libéreau, Salomé Stévenin, Pierre Perrier, Florence Thomassin, Claire Nebout, Aurélien Recoing, Jean-Philippe Écoffey, Sarah Pratt', null, 'Mickael''s family is struggling (they don''t have enough money to pay for hot water) however his life is full with Judo and his girlfriend Venessa. Then Mickael makes a decision to open up his relationship to include Clement his rich-kid Judo partner, starting a chain of events.', 'Mickael''s family is struggling (they don''t have enough money to pay for hot water) however his life is full with Judo and his girlfriend Venessa. Then Mickael makes a decision to open up his relationship to include Clement his rich-kid Judo partner, starting a chain of events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qn8azEgsSyYuSqdP7LyQsx1Py1v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27095'),
  ('419219015461751104', 'Cold Skin', 2017, 'Horror, Fantasy, Drama', 'Juan Moreno, Sergio González Kuhn, Rubén Sanz', 'Jesús Olmo, Eron Sheean', 'David Oakes, Ray Stevenson, Aura Garrido, Winslow Iwaki, John Benfield, Ben Temple, Iván González, Alejandro Rod', null, 'A young man who arrives at a remote island finds himself trapped in a battle for his life.', 'A young man who arrives at a remote island finds himself trapped in a battle for his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yYDNVAckvOHH9v6EGVB73cMyZgZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:428399'),
  ('1124402890752680273', 'Cold Souls', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Sophie Barthes, Andrij Parekh', 'Sophie Barthes', 'Paul Giamatti, Emily Watson, Dina Korzun, David Strathairn, Katheryn Winnick, Lauren Ambrose, Michael Stuhlbarg, Michael Tucker', null, 'Paul is agonising over his interpretation of ''Uncle Vanya'' and, paralysed by anxiety, stumbles upon a solution via a New Yorker article about a high-tech company promising to alleviate suffering by extracting souls. He enlists their services—only to discover that his soul is the shape and size of a chickpea.', 'Paul is agonising over his interpretation of ''Uncle Vanya'' and, paralysed by anxiety, stumbles upon a solution via a New Yorker article about a high-tech company promising to alleviate suffering by extracting souls. He enlists their services—only to discover that his soul is the shape and size of a chickpea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ejJjTwoEqIKiZJOyPaHlTJh2jL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30250'),
  ('1003939183003893109', 'Cold Steel', 1987, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Dorothy Ann Puzo, Thomas F. Denove, John Stewart', 'Moe Quigley', 'Brad Davis, Sharon Stone, Jonathan Banks, Jay Acovone, Adam Ant, Eddie Egan, Sy Richardson, Anne Haney', 'R', 'On Christmas Eve, Johnny Modine''s father is murdered by a psycho cutthroat. The cop swears bloody revenge, though he''s taken off the case. He doesn''t suspect yet that he''s also the target in a diabolic plan of revenge.', 'On Christmas Eve, Johnny Modine''s father is murdered by a psycho cutthroat. The cop swears bloody revenge, though he''s taken off the case. He doesn''t suspect yet that he''s also the target in a diabolic plan of revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ud9QcFpRgc02lUkcKmBquQBg7os.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31700'),
  ('396763664004741686', 'Cold Storage', 1951, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Jack Kinney', 'Dick Kinney, Milt Schaffer', 'Pinto Colvig', 'NR', 'An egret, frozen by the winter weather, moves into Pluto''s doghouse. Pluto, cold and tired, takes a while to realize his doghouse is moving around without him. Even when he does realize, though, he has a hard time dislodging the interloper.', 'An egret, frozen by the winter weather, moves into Pluto''s doghouse. Pluto, cold and tired, takes a while to realize his doghouse is moving around without him. Even when he does realize, though, he has a hard time dislodging the interloper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xBKsmexLzsxN2oo4f6Kk6Kyij0R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80040'),
  ('626868704490571739', 'Cold Storage', 2026, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Luca Iacona, Alessandra Fortuna, Ali Cherkaoui', 'David Koepp', 'Joe Keery, Georgina Campbell, Liam Neeson, Lesley Manville, Sosie Bacon, Aaron Heffernan, Andrew Brooke, Rob Collins', 'R', 'When a mutating, highly contagious fungus escapes a sealed facility, two employees – joined by a grizzled bioterror operative – must survive the wildest night shift ever to save humanity from extinction.', 'When a mutating, highly contagious fungus escapes a sealed facility, two employees – joined by a grizzled bioterror operative – must survive the wildest night shift ever to save humanity from extinction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pfqkETJ2A3zXZJuNcufZbAJNnKA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:696393'),
  ('160520915000890443', 'Cold Sweat', 1970, 'Thriller, Action, Crime', 'Terence Young, Jean Rabier', 'Dorothea Bennett, Jo Eisinger', 'Charles Bronson, Liv Ullmann, Jean Topart, James Mason, Jill Ireland, Michel Constantin, Luigi Pistilli, Yannick Delulle', null, 'During the Korean War, Joe Moran, is convicted for striking a colonel. Imprisoned in Germany he encounters his former company commander Captain Ross, jailed for black marketeering. Together with Ross'' cohorts Joe agrees to escape with them, but things go wrong and a policeman is killed. An appalled Joe escapes by himself, abandoning the others, who are recaptured. Years later Joe has a boat rental business where he is found by Ross. Now a wanted drug smuggler he wants the use of Joe''s boats and to ensure his cooperation, they kidnap his wife and daughter.', 'During the Korean War, Joe Moran, is convicted for striking a colonel. Imprisoned in Germany he encounters his former company commander Captain Ross, jailed for black marketeering. Together with Ross'' cohorts Joe agrees to escape with them, but things go wrong and a policeman is killed. An appalled Joe escapes by himself, abandoning the others, who are recaptured. Years later Joe has a boat rental business where he is found by Ross. Now a wanted drug smuggler he wants the use of Joe''s boats and to ensure his cooperation, they kidnap his wife and daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9rbTkc6FWhJS0IrNRPQ2Fcn1x6v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42358'),
  ('727439468907970675', 'Cold Sweat', 1993, 'Thriller', 'Gail Harvey, Vic Sarin, Charles Braive', 'Richard Beattie', 'Shannon Tweed, Ben Cross, Adam Baldwin, Dave Thomas, Henry Czerny, Maria del Mar, Lenore Zann, Ellen Dubin', null, 'Mark Cahill is a good family man with a loving wife and two wonderful children. Mark also happens to be a hit man who is haunted by his last victim, a blonde, who keeps appearing in his bedroom at the worst of times. His life becomes even more complicated when he becomes caught up in the schemes of two business partners, one of the partner''s spouse and her boyfriend(s).', 'Mark Cahill is a good family man with a loving wife and two wonderful children. Mark also happens to be a hit man who is haunted by his last victim, a blonde, who keeps appearing in his bedroom at the worst of times. His life becomes even more complicated when he becomes caught up in the schemes of two business partners, one of the partner''s spouse and her boyfriend(s).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iWimRHUxgLy3sLiu75CXr36moo9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168079'),
  ('828439916112395736', 'Cold Sweat', 2010, 'Horror, Action, Thriller', 'Adrián García Bogliano, Ernesto Herrera, Andrea Quiroz Hérnandez', 'Adrián García Bogliano, Hernán Moyano, Ramiro García Bogliano', 'Pancho Mochi, Victoria Witemburg, Nicolás Marotta, Facundo Espinosa, Marina Glezer, Gabriel Bosisio, Camila Velasco, Omar Gioiosa', 'NR', 'A young man searching for his missing girlfriend. An unconditional friend willing to do anything to uncover the truth. An investigation that culminates in an old house. Inside await two brutal murderers, armed with twenty-five boxes of explosives that were lost since the last military dictatorship.', 'A young man searching for his missing girlfriend. An unconditional friend willing to do anything to uncover the truth. An investigation that culminates in an old house. Inside await two brutal murderers, armed with twenty-five boxes of explosives that were lost since the last military dictatorship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l3NfHyDb6JUD2wWS8EML3hZ9SI5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65989'),
  ('612011746380367182', 'Cold Tropics', 2009, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Kleber Mendonça Filho, Kleber Mendonça Filho', 'Kleber Mendonça Filho', 'Andrés Schaffer, Luiz Otávio Pereira, Emilie Lesclaux, Juliano Dornelles, Simone Jubert, Tião, Gilvan Soares, Cristiane Santos', null, 'In tropical Recife, in northeastern Brazil, temperatures drop to impossible lows and the inhabitants have to adapt. This ''mockumentary'' gradually turns critical, looking at the climate, urban development and social interaction from every angle. Does a ray of sun pierce the clouds, after all?', 'In tropical Recife, in northeastern Brazil, temperatures drop to impossible lows and the inhabitants have to adapt. This ''mockumentary'' gradually turns critical, looking at the climate, urban development and social interaction from every angle. Does a ray of sun pierce the clouds, after all?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iOAqVwYG4lN2jp4E6iac9s02MZl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:181539'),
  ('57092035702870313', 'Cold Turkey', 1951, 'Animation', 'Charles August Nichols', null, 'Pinto Colvig', null, 'Pluto and the cat, goaded by a TV commercial for turkey, raid the fridge and find a turkey inside. The cat gets there first and re-heats the turkey, first on the furnace duct, and then, trying to hide from Pluto, inside the tube-type TV - but he over-does it a bit.', 'Pluto and the cat, goaded by a TV commercial for turkey, raid the fridge and find a turkey inside. The cat gets there first and re-heats the turkey, first on the furnace duct, and then, trying to hide from Pluto, inside the tube-type TV - but he over-does it a bit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qCzxfY92RmfJTCgGOLz4yHjxFBF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164978'),
  ('282447130824421111', 'Cold Turkey', 1971, 'Comedy', 'Norman Lear, Charles F. Wheeler', 'Norman Lear', 'Dick Van Dyke, Pippa Scott, Tom Poston, Edward Everett Horton, Bob Elliott, Vincent Gardenia, Barnard Hughes, Graham Jarvis', 'PG-13', 'Reverend Brooks leads his small Iowa town in a contest to stop smoking for a month. But some tobacco executives don''t want them to win, and try everything they can to make them smoke. If townspeople don''t go nuts from wanting a cigarette, or kill each other from irritation and frustration, they will win a huge prize.', 'Reverend Brooks leads his small Iowa town in a contest to stop smoking for a month. But some tobacco executives don''t want them to win, and try everything they can to make them smoke. If townspeople don''t go nuts from wanting a cigarette, or kill each other from irritation and frustration, they will win a huge prize.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k1NBOkxBS3v6y7bdNAS2KcymPpl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42493'),
  ('23572502011081231', 'Cold Wallet', 2025, 'Thriller', 'Cutter Hodierne, Oliver Millar, Grier Minos', 'John Hibey', 'Raúl Castillo, Melonie Díaz, Tony Cavalero, Josh Brener, Zoë Winters, Ian Unterman, Genevieve Adams, Joanna Sylvie Weinig', 'R', 'After losing everything in a cryptocurrency scam, a ragtag team of Redditors attempt to kidnap the kingpin who screwed them over.', 'After losing everything in a cryptocurrency scam, a ragtag team of Redditors attempt to kidnap the kingpin who screwed them over.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m6ZGxUu0JyV7Cyj9xDR8capgrzb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1150370'),
  ('952407890366482363', 'Cold War', 1951, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack Kinney', null, 'Pinto Colvig, Rhoda Williams', 'G', 'George Geef gets sent home from work to tend to his cold.', 'George Geef gets sent home from work to tend to his cold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3H70eANgYPGQsi1CggY4gfcHI8J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66836'),
  ('3141426289276349', 'Cold War', 2012, 'Action, Thriller', 'Leung Lok-Man, Sunny Luk Kim-Ching, Jason Kwan', 'Leung Lok-Man, Sunny Luk Kim-Ching', 'Aaron Kwok, Tony Leung Ka-fai, Charlie Yeung Choi-Nei, Gordon Lam Ka-Tung, Chin Ka-Lok, Andy On Chi-Kit, Terence Yin Chi-Wai, Andy Lau', null, 'Five police officers in Hong Kong are kidnapped. The police commissioner is on a business trip overseas. Two vice commissioners, Sean Rau and M.B. Lee, then take over the case. The two vice commissioners are rivals who both vie for the police commissioner seat. At first, M.B. Lee takes the lead in the case, but comes to a dead end. Sean Lau then takes the lead, but he falls into a trap. Both men are then investigated by the ICAC (Independent Commission Against Corruption).', 'Five police officers in Hong Kong are kidnapped. The police commissioner is on a business trip overseas. Two vice commissioners, Sean Rau and M.B. Lee, then take over the case. The two vice commissioners are rivals who both vie for the police commissioner seat. At first, M.B. Lee takes the lead in the case, but comes to a dead end. Sean Lau then takes the lead, but he falls into a trap. Both men are then investigated by the ICAC (Independent Commission Against Corruption).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zFiHdFJHppW43xmsnS8whzYnVQ8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137409'),
  ('218193447115975432', 'Cold War', 2018, 'Romance, Music, Drama', 'Ivana Patricia Đilas Čeranić, Jakub Wielecki, Paweł Pawlikowski', 'Piotr Borkowski', 'Joanna Kulig, Tomasz Kot, Borys Szyc, Agata Kulesza, Cédric Kahn, Jeanne Balibar, Adam Woronowicz, Adam Ferency', 'R', 'A man and a woman meet in the ruins of post-war Poland. With vastly different backgrounds and temperaments, they are fatally mismatched and yet drawn to each other.', 'A man and a woman meet in the ruins of post-war Poland. With vastly different backgrounds and temperaments, they are fatally mismatched and yet drawn to each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6rbS8oPIgUMhQgIX8oGVTtlNgLR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:440298'),
  ('729154051353833575', 'Cold War II', 2016, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Jack Ng Wai-Lun, Chin Ka-Lok, Danny Wong Hing-Fun', 'Jack Ng Wai-Lun, Sunny Luk Kim-Ching, Leung Lok-Man', 'Aaron Kwok, Tony Leung Ka-fai, Chow Yun-Fat, Charlie Yeung Choi-Nei, Janice Man Wing-San, Eddie Peng Yu-Yan, Aarif Rahman, Tony Yang', null, 'A suspected criminal mastermind escapes from police custody, throwing the city into turmoil. With the police department now divided, rival police chiefs are forced to take their fight to the streets of Hong Kong with deadly consequences.', 'A suspected criminal mastermind escapes from police custody, throwing the city into turmoil. With the police department now divided, rival police chiefs are forced to take their fight to the streets of Hong Kong with deadly consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qG3e432sNeesyPG86Ybg9amyTlL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:416249'),
  ('961522179138608529', 'Cold Water', 1994, 'Drama', 'Olivier Assayas, Denis Lenoir', 'Olivier Assayas', 'Virginie Ledoyen, Cyprien Fouquet, László Szabó, Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Dominique Faysse, Jackie Berroyer, Smaïl Mekki, Jean-Christophe Bouvet', 'NR', 'An outer suburb of Paris, 1972. Gilles and Christine, both sixteen, are classmates and lovers who have become frustrated with the aloofness of their families and the general monotony of their lives. When the pair are caught shoplifting, Christine''s father ships her off to a home for emotionally disturbed children, temporarily putting space between her and Gilles. Luckily for them, though, she escapes and the couple contemplate running away together.', 'An outer suburb of Paris, 1972. Gilles and Christine, both sixteen, are classmates and lovers who have become frustrated with the aloofness of their families and the general monotony of their lives. When the pair are caught shoplifting, Christine''s father ships her off to a home for emotionally disturbed children, temporarily putting space between her and Gilles. Luckily for them, though, she escapes and the couple contemplate running away together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7UmbO8A7EVWmv1kpssBzzz9iPrY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64901'),
  ('817591593399518419', 'Cold Zone', 2017, 'Science Fiction, Adventure', 'John MacCarthy, Christopher Charles Kempinski', 'Hannah Davies, Ivan Hayden', 'Lauren K. Robek, Steve Bacic, Nick Purcha, Daniel Boileau, Sarah Desjardins, Darcy Laurie, Melanie McLaren, Sarah-Jane Redmond', 'PG-13', 'A storm is coming. No one could predict it. No one can measure it. Now one family must survive it. You can''t come in from the cold.', 'A storm is coming. No one could predict it. No one can measure it. Now one family must survive it. You can''t come in from the cold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c47vzme1QvFdSYaVJuyy8rtJdBB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:437463'),
  ('773067534546511329', 'Coldblooded', 1995, 'Action, Comedy', 'Phil Robinson, Wallace Wolodarsky, Robert D. Yeoman', 'Wallace Wolodarsky', 'Jason Priestley, Kimberly Williams-Paisley, Janeane Garofalo, Robert Loggia, Peter Riegert, Josh Charles, David Anthony Higgins, Doris Grau', null, 'Cosmo, an affectless mob bookie who lives in the basement of a retirement home, is promoted to hitman. He learns his new trade from Steve, a seasoned killer. He falls in love with a yoga teacher, Jasmine, and must figure out a way to leave the mob so they can be together.', 'Cosmo, an affectless mob bookie who lives in the basement of a retirement home, is promoted to hitman. He learns his new trade from Steve, a seasoned killer. He falls in love with a yoga teacher, Jasmine, and must figure out a way to leave the mob so they can be together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zfU3QJVqnY3wW1La9ptrOYGFdbP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32502'),
  ('118773429349498920', 'Coldplay: A Head Full of Dreams', 2018, 'Music, Documentary', 'Mat Whitecross', null, 'Guy Berryman, Jon Buckland, Will Champion, Chris Martin, Phil Harvey, Mat Whitecross, Gwyneth Paltrow, Beyoncé', null, 'An in-depth and intimate portrait of Coldplay''s spectacular rise from the backrooms of Camden pubs to selling out stadiums across the planet. At the heart of the story is the band''s unshakeable brotherhood which has endured through many highs and lows.', 'An in-depth and intimate portrait of Coldplay''s spectacular rise from the backrooms of Camden pubs to selling out stadiums across the planet. At the heart of the story is the band''s unshakeable brotherhood which has endured through many highs and lows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fx7A8TRYL8JJ9fg0eJLk80RZOkf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:554152'),
  ('236059148142158137', 'Coldwater', 2013, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Jayson Crothers, Vincent Grashaw', 'Mark Penney, Vincent Grashaw', 'P.J. Boudousqué, James C. Burns, Chris Petrovski, Octavius J. Johnson, Stephanie Simbari, Mackenzie Sidwell Graff, Clayton LaDue, Scott MacArthur', 'R', 'A teenage boy is sent to a juvenile reform facility in the wilderness. As we learn about the tragic events that sent him there, his struggle becomes one for survival with the inmates, counselors, and the retired war colonel in charge.', 'A teenage boy is sent to a juvenile reform facility in the wilderness. As we learn about the tragic events that sent him there, his struggle becomes one for survival with the inmates, counselors, and the retired war colonel in charge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/txjUPHSFoTwO4IYtRkt997c9ABc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172520'),
  ('882113318215409334', 'Colette', 2018, 'Drama, History', 'Wash Westmoreland, Giles Nuttgens, Joe Geary', 'Rebecca Lenkiewicz, Wash Westmoreland, Richard Glatzer', 'Keira Knightley, Dominic West, Denise Gough, Fiona Shaw, Robert Pugh, Eleanor Tomlinson, Ray Panthaki, Dickie Beau', 'R', 'After marrying a successful Parisian writer known commonly as Willy, Sidonie-Gabrielle Colette is transplanted from her childhood home in rural France to the intellectual and artistic splendor of Paris. Soon after, Willy convinces Colette to ghostwrite for him. She pens a semi-autobiographical novel about a witty and brazen country girl named Claudine, sparking a bestseller and a cultural sensation. After its success, Colette and Willy become the talk of Paris and their adventures inspire additional Claudine novels.', 'After marrying a successful Parisian writer known commonly as Willy, Sidonie-Gabrielle Colette is transplanted from her childhood home in rural France to the intellectual and artistic splendor of Paris. Soon after, Willy convinces Colette to ghostwrite for him. She pens a semi-autobiographical novel about a witty and brazen country girl named Claudine, sparking a bestseller and a cultural sensation. After its success, Colette and Willy become the talk of Paris and their adventures inspire additional Claudine novels.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5fvcs8x7k16wGdet16qkx1cKBPM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:454652'),
  ('1075570454392126087', 'Colette', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Rose Bush, Anthony Giacchino', 'Anthony Giacchino', 'Colette Marin-Catherine, Lucie Fouble', null, 'World War II. Not all warriors wore uniforms. Not all warriors were men. Meet ninety-year-old Colette Catherine who, as a young girl, fought the Nazis as a member of the French Resistance. Now she’s about to re-open old wounds, re-visting the terrors of that time. Some nightmares are too terrible to remember. But also, too dangerous to forget.', 'World War II. Not all warriors wore uniforms. Not all warriors were men. Meet ninety-year-old Colette Catherine who, as a young girl, fought the Nazis as a member of the French Resistance. Now she’s about to re-open old wounds, re-visting the terrors of that time. Some nightmares are too terrible to remember. But also, too dangerous to forget.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lkMwjLzKBkhivbjH1af1ZRlNydX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:741845'),
  ('259183297754141820', 'Colic', 2006, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Patchanon Thammajira, Teerawat Rujintham, Tossapol Khumraksa', 'Piyaros Suntornwipak', 'Witaya Wasukraipaisarn, Pympan Chalayanacupt, Kulthida Sattabongkoch, Sonthannee Suttabongoch, Kitsana Sathathmrong, Pontip Prasertyingsook, Nathchanon Wasutinuch, Nitipong Piyasakmathakum', null, 'Colic is a syndrome found in infants, which causes infants to cry continuously for hours. The reason behind this illness is usually credited by medical expects to a number of factors. However, some people believe that it''s linked to something supernatural.', 'Colic is a syndrome found in infants, which causes infants to cry continuously for hours. The reason behind this illness is usually credited by medical expects to a number of factors. However, some people believe that it''s linked to something supernatural.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Xbm5Mo2GKVS3ilgoJM6hZ8kvqd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27528'),
  ('1001265228813522029', 'Colin', 2008, 'Horror, Action', 'Marc Price, Marc Price', 'Marc Price', 'Alastair Kirton, Daisy Aitkens, Kate Alderman, Leanne Pammen, Tat Whalley, Kerry Owen, Nick Stoppani, Leigh Crocombe', null, 'Our hero Colin is bitten by a zombie; he dies and returns from the dead. We follow him as he wanders through suburbia during the throes of a cadaverous apocalypse.', 'Our hero Colin is bitten by a zombie; he dies and returns from the dead. We follow him as he wanders through suburbia during the throes of a cadaverous apocalypse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o2n6IfxHoBSFmvKd7R04qFTF5eG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27231'),
  ('137987102750888421', 'Collage of Our Lives', 2003, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Yukihiko Tsutsumi', 'Kaoru Ogawa', 'Ryuhei Matsuda, Hirosue Ryoko, Eiko Koike, Adeyto, Kansai Eto, Atsushi Harada, Dominic Marcus, Shigenori Yamazaki', null, 'A young cameraman receives a letter from an old girlfriend, announcing that she is to hold a photo exhibition in the United States. Having heard rumors that she has died, he follows his curiosity to New York City.', 'A young cameraman receives a letter from an old girlfriend, announcing that she is to hold a photo exhibition in the United States. Having heard rumors that she has died, he follows his curiosity to New York City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aimvcr39kzgyDUBS66urHQXQoC5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110855'),
  ('56791949461777297', 'Collapse', 1990, 'Drama', 'Mykhailo Belikov, Vasyl Trushkovskyi, Aleksandr Shigayev', 'Oleg Prihodko, Mykhailo Belikov', 'Sergey Shakurov, Aleksey Serebryakov, Georgiy Drozd, Marina Mogilevskaya, Oleksiy Horbunov, Tatyana Kochemasova, Stanislav Stankevych, Anatoli Groshevoy', null, '1986, Chornobyl disaster. Couples, friends, and a risk-taking journalist are woven into the larger framework of the disaster. Panic follows.', '1986, Chornobyl disaster. Couples, friends, and a risk-taking journalist are woven into the larger framework of the disaster. Panic follows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2tL9fBpDtZWf7w2XjcFAPs1wii7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82851'),
  ('613046863871142847', 'Collapse', 2009, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Chris Smith, Max Malkin, Edward Lachman', 'Michael Ruppert', 'Michael Ruppert', 'NR', 'From the acclaimed director of American Movie, the documentary follows former Los Angeles police officer turned independent reporter Michael Ruppert. He recounts his career as a radical thinker and spells out his apocalyptic vision of the future, spanning the crises in economics, energy, environment and more.', 'From the acclaimed director of American Movie, the documentary follows former Los Angeles police officer turned independent reporter Michael Ruppert. He recounts his career as a radical thinker and spells out his apocalyptic vision of the future, spanning the crises in economics, energy, environment and more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gM3uukXhkDkfK5qNqg4IM8UWlvp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28227'),
  ('1034683905167457576', 'Collateral', 2004, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Michael Mann, Dion Beebe, Paul Cameron', 'Stuart Beattie', 'Tom Cruise, Jamie Foxx, Jada Pinkett Smith, Mark Ruffalo, Peter Berg, Javier Bardem, Bruce McGill, Klea Scott', 'R', 'Cab driver Max picks up a man who offers him $600 to drive him around. But the promise of easy money sours when Max realizes his fare is an assassin.', 'Cab driver Max picks up a man who offers him $600 to drive him around. But the promise of easy money sours when Max realizes his fare is an assassin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nV5316WUsVij8sVXLCF1g7TFitg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1538'),
  ('273225217677721771', 'Collateral Beauty', 2016, 'Drama, Romance', 'Stephen Lee Davis, Deanna Leslie Kelly, David Frankel', 'Allan Loeb', 'Will Smith, Edward Norton, Kate Winslet, Michael Peña, Helen Mirren, Jacob Latimore, Keira Knightley, Naomie Harris', 'PG-13', 'Retreating from life after a tragedy, a man questions the universe by writing to Love, Time and Death. Receiving unexpected answers, he begins to see how these things interlock and how even loss can reveal moments of meaning and beauty.', 'Retreating from life after a tragedy, a man questions the universe by writing to Love, Time and Death. Receiving unexpected answers, he begins to see how these things interlock and how even loss can reveal moments of meaning and beauty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4vfqosgik5pLb32RpskYifp8PWJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:345920'),
  ('121999657956441756', 'Collateral Damage', 2002, 'Action, Thriller, Drama', 'Craig Haagensen, Andrew Davis, Adam Greenberg', 'Ronald Roose, David Griffiths, Peter Griffiths', 'Arnold Schwarzenegger, Francesca Neri, Elias Koteas, Cliff Curtis, John Leguizamo, John Turturro, Jsu Garcia, Tyler Posey', 'R', 'Firefighter Gordon Brewer is plunged into the complex and dangerous world of international terrorism after he loses his wife and child in a bombing credited to Claudio ''The Wolf'' Perrini.', 'Firefighter Gordon Brewer is plunged into the complex and dangerous world of international terrorism after he loses his wife and child in a bombing credited to Claudio ''The Wolf'' Perrini.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rALb2pU8QQGIlYdHezB2F5kwecI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9884'),
