  ('331997876990649516', 'Collective', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Alexander Nanau, Alexander Nanau, Maria Cirstea', 'Alexander Nanau, Antoaneta Opris', 'Cătălin Tolontan, Mirela Neag, Razvan Lutac, Tedy Ursuleanu, Vlad Voiculescu, Camelia Roiu, Narcis Hogea', null, 'In the aftermath of a tragic fire in a Romanian club, burn victims begin dying in hospitals from wounds that were not life threatening. A team of investigative journalists move into action uncovering the mass corruption of the health system and of the state institutions. Collective follows journalists, whistle blowers, and authorities alike. An immersive and uncompromising look into a dysfunctional system, exposing corruption, propaganda, and manipulation that nowadays affect not only Romania, but societies around the world.', 'In the aftermath of a tragic fire in a Romanian club, burn victims begin dying in hospitals from wounds that were not life threatening. A team of investigative journalists move into action uncovering the mass corruption of the health system and of the state institutions. Collective follows journalists, whistle blowers, and authorities alike. An immersive and uncompromising look into a dysfunctional system, exposing corruption, propaganda, and manipulation that nowadays affect not only Romania, but societies around the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oR93n0CAn2GznyHDFSRTp0J1t8c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:618363'),
  ('851580361737967245', 'Collective Invention', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kwon O-kwang, Lee Eun-jung, Kim Tae-soo', 'Kwon O-kwang', 'Lee Kwang-soo, Park Bo-young, Lee Chun-hee, Jang Kwang, Lee Byung-joon, Kim Hie-won, Jeong In-gi, Dong Bang-woo', null, 'Park Goo mutates into a man-fish due to side effects from an experimental drug. He receives heavy publicity and becomes a star. A conspiracy by a pharmaceutical company leads Park Goo to being possibly expelled from the world.', 'Park Goo mutates into a man-fish due to side effects from an experimental drug. He receives heavy publicity and becomes a star. A conspiracy by a pharmaceutical company leads Park Goo to being possibly expelled from the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bEblVnOYqBhzGlUerPmOcaKTOAC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:356201'),
