  ('73541744402029096', 'College Road Trip', 2008, 'Comedy, Family, Action, Adventure', 'Roger Kumble, Francisco Ortiz, Theo van de Sande', 'Emi Mochizuki, Carrie Evans, Cinco Paul', 'Martin Lawrence, Raven-Symoné, Kym Whitley, Brenda Song, Margo Harshman, Donny Osmond, Molly Ephraim, Will Sasso', 'G', 'When an overachieving high school student decides to travel around the country to choose the perfect college, her overprotective cop father also decides to accompany her in order to keep her on the straight and narrow.', 'When an overachieving high school student decides to travel around the country to choose the perfect college, her overprotective cop father also decides to accompany her in order to keep her on the straight and narrow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8kcBMzhqW2eo058SmIKvbTbakYr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13493'),
