  ('458605693092317601', 'Collide', 2022, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Mukunda Michael Dewil, Rasa Partin, Anthony Arrigo', 'Mukunda Michael Dewil, Moira Dewil', 'Ryan Phillippe, Kat Graham, Jim Gaffigan, Drea De Matteo, Aisha Dee, Dylan Flashner, David Cade, Wilson Bethel', 'R', 'A gripping chronicle of three couples over the course of one fateful night in an LA restaurant named Collide. Hunter finds himself on an awkward blind date with the captivating Tamira, while a busboy and his waitress girlfriend hope to score a big payday, and outside, Peter sits in his car observing his wife Angie meet with the restaurant’s manager. Though all strangers, their stories are weaved together as they hurl towards an explosive end.', 'A gripping chronicle of three couples over the course of one fateful night in an LA restaurant named Collide. Hunter finds himself on an awkward blind date with the captivating Tamira, while a busboy and his waitress girlfriend hope to score a big payday, and outside, Peter sits in his car observing his wife Angie meet with the restaurant’s manager. Though all strangers, their stories are weaved together as they hurl towards an explosive end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xdoOkjtC6BLZGdVBfLCKVXrKOcO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1001925'),
