  ('845115087631539903', 'Colombiana', 2011, 'Action, Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Stephanie ''Tuty'' Correa, Mike De La Vina, Matt Corrado', 'Robert Mark Kamen, Luc Besson', 'Zoe Saldaña, Cliff Curtis, Callum Blue, Michael Vartan, Lennie James, Amandla Stenberg, Graham McTavish, Jesse Borrego', 'PG-13', 'After witnessing her parents’ murder as a child in Bogota, Cataleya Restrepo grows up to be a stone-cold assassin. She works for her uncle as a hitman by day, but her personal time is spent engaging in vigilante murders that she hopes will lead her to her ultimate target: the mobster responsible for her parents'' death.', 'After witnessing her parents’ murder as a child in Bogota, Cataleya Restrepo grows up to be a stone-cold assassin. She works for her uncle as a hitman by day, but her personal time is spent engaging in vigilante murders that she hopes will lead her to her ultimate target: the mobster responsible for her parents'' death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rEdGDgRB3gducezNSIyx2lbKQy4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62835'),
