  ('69637256468185756', 'Colonel Kwiatkowski', 1996, 'Comedy, History', 'Kazimierz Kutz, Grzegorz Kędzierski', 'Jerzy Stefan Stawiński', 'Marek Kondrat, Zbigniew Zamachowski, Renata Dancewicz, Adam Ferency, Artur Barciś, Andrzej Blumenfeld, Krzysztof Globisz, Tomasz Schimscheiner', null, 'Military doctor Kwiatkowski, serving in a barracks hospital on the Western Territories, is rewarded with a week’s leave after successfully operating on Colonel Kiziora of the UB. He and his friend steal a truck bound for Warsaw, where among the ruins of his former home he meets his prewar neighbor Krysia, instantly falls in love, and, after a brawl with a Russian officer at a dance in the surviving “Polonia” hotel, pretends to be a high-ranking UB colonel to save face.', 'Military doctor Kwiatkowski, serving in a barracks hospital on the Western Territories, is rewarded with a week’s leave after successfully operating on Colonel Kiziora of the UB. He and his friend steal a truck bound for Warsaw, where among the ruins of his former home he meets his prewar neighbor Krysia, instantly falls in love, and, after a brawl with a Russian officer at a dance in the surviving “Polonia” hotel, pretends to be a high-ranking UB colonel to save face.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q6Jb1IdOJ8k7QO9vk3tJkaMGyIF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145341'),
  ('711937247182300921', 'Colonel Panics', 2017, 'Thriller', 'Cho Jinseok', null, 'Sasa Handa, Satomi Hiraguri, Suguru Minami, Tia, Masaya Mimura, Yusuke Miyawaki', null, 'The destinies of two men, one from the future and one from the past, become entwined as a malevolent virus spreads throughout Level 4, a digital gaming experience that blurs dreams and reality.', 'The destinies of two men, one from the future and one from the past, become entwined as a malevolent virus spreads throughout Level 4, a digital gaming experience that blurs dreams and reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/27jt8N9iu6aaDWoz0pYgja6lz6L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:412757'),
  ('712094090141716762', 'Colonel Redl', 1985, 'Drama, History', 'István Szabó, Lajos Koltai, Mara Luttor', 'Péter Dobai', 'Klaus Maria Brandauer, Hans Christian Blech, Armin Mueller-Stahl, Gudrun Landgrebe, Jan Niklas, László Mensáros, András Bálint, László Gálffi', null, 'Set during the fading glory of the Austro-Hungarian empire, the film tells of the rise and fall of Alfred Redl, an ambitious young officer who proceeds up the ladder to become head of the Secret Police only to become ensnared in political deception.', 'Set during the fading glory of the Austro-Hungarian empire, the film tells of the rise and fall of Alfred Redl, an ambitious young officer who proceeds up the ladder to become head of the Secret Police only to become ensnared in political deception.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oSOwBgEfMzJa3KqkqNUjBuV2DnT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29471'),
  ('1103319676241142496', 'Colonel Wolodyjowski', 1969, 'History, Adventure, War', 'Jerzy Lipman, Jerzy Trojan, Jerzy Lipman', 'Jerzy Hoffman, Jerzy Lutowski', 'Tadeusz Łomnicki, Magdalena Zawadzka, Mieczysław Pawlikowski, Hanka Bielicka, Barbara Brylska, Irena Karel, Jan Nowicki, Daniel Olbrychski', null, 'In 1668 Polish colonel Michał Wołodyjowski, who recently retired to a monastery, is recalled to active duty and takes charge of Poland''s eastern frontier defenses against invading Tatar hordes and Ottoman armies.', 'In 1668 Polish colonel Michał Wołodyjowski, who recently retired to a monastery, is recalled to active duty and takes charge of Poland''s eastern frontier defenses against invading Tatar hordes and Ottoman armies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n0BmWm8XpbgplHQlNGhqUWc5XQw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126434'),
  ('575891505827671385', 'Colonia', 2016, 'Drama, History', 'Florian Gallenberger, Aixa Torres, Kolja Brandt', 'Torsten Wenzel, Florian Gallenberger, Tom Kinninmont', 'Emma Watson, Daniel Brühl, Michael Nyqvist, Richenda Carey, Vicky Krieps, Jeanne Werner, Julian Ovenden, August Zirner', 'R', 'A young woman''s desperate search for her abducted boyfriend draws her into the infamous Colonia Dignidad, a sect nobody ever escaped from.', 'A young woman''s desperate search for her abducted boyfriend draws her into the infamous Colonia Dignidad, a sect nobody ever escaped from.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p7oGFkMGaQR27R1olN9RoMzg4vS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:318781'),
  ('697907627699285717', 'Colony', 2026, 'Action, Thriller, Horror', 'Yeon Sang-ho', 'Yeon Sang-ho, Choi Gyu-seok', 'Gianna Jun, Koo Kyo-hwan, Ji Chang-wook, Shin Hyun-been, Kim Shin-rock, Go Soo, Kim Hyeong-mook', null, 'Se-jeong, a biotechnology professor, attends a biotech conference—only to witness it spiral into catastrophe when a rapidly mutating virus is unleashed. As the outbreak spreads and the infected begin to transform, authorities seal off the entire facility, trapping the survivors with an ever-growing threat.', 'Se-jeong, a biotechnology professor, attends a biotech conference—only to witness it spiral into catastrophe when a rapidly mutating virus is unleashed. As the outbreak spreads and the infected begin to transform, authorities seal off the entire facility, trapping the survivors with an ever-growing threat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3pKJMW5xehwaxpQdF7oIZnyhIfo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1375646'),
  ('1148768962730773441', 'Color Adjustment', 1992, 'Documentary, History', 'Marlon Riggs, Rick Butler', 'Marlon Riggs', 'Ruby Dee, Norman Lear, Tim Reid, Daphne Maxwell Reid, Steven Bochco, Diahann Carroll, Henry Louis Gates, Jr., Hal Kanter', null, 'From Amos ''n'' Andy to Nat King Cole, from Roots to The Cosby Show, black people have played many roles on primetime television. Brilliantly weaving clips from classic TV shows with commentary from TV producers, black actors and scholars, Marlon Riggs blends humor, insight, and thoughtful analysis to explore the evolution of black/white relations as reflected by America''s favorite addiction.', 'From Amos ''n'' Andy to Nat King Cole, from Roots to The Cosby Show, black people have played many roles on primetime television. Brilliantly weaving clips from classic TV shows with commentary from TV producers, black actors and scholars, Marlon Riggs blends humor, insight, and thoughtful analysis to explore the evolution of black/white relations as reflected by America''s favorite addiction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kXPCFD0dkEdR16JGFDGXvlWfLR8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:207558'),
  ('399042735488762805', 'Color Film', 1971, null, 'Standish Lawder', null, null, null, 'Further examining the medium of film itself, Colorfilm is a work Lawder made while trying to make a minimalist, "pure color" film. Using spliced-together strips of colored film leader in white, yellow, blue, red, green, etc., Lawder ran the film through a projector and found the results to be quite boring. While he was running the film, though, he noticed how beautiful the colored strips of film looked as they ran through the projector. So, he turned a camera on the projector and filmed the colored film gorgeously winding its way through the projector''s machinery." - Noel Black, Colorado Springs Independent', 'Further examining the medium of film itself, Colorfilm is a work Lawder made while trying to make a minimalist, "pure color" film. Using spliced-together strips of colored film leader in white, yellow, blue, red, green, etc., Lawder ran the film through a projector and found the results to be quite boring. While he was running the film, though, he noticed how beautiful the colored strips of film looked as they ran through the projector. So, he turned a camera on the projector and filmed the colored film gorgeously winding its way through the projector''s machinery." - Noel Black, Colorado Springs Independent', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fGTQTbwMEqIbmT42QDSTqghqWlj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147419'),
  ('219215480028249391', 'Color Me Blood Red', 1965, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Herschell Gordon Lewis, Herschell Gordon Lewis', 'Herschell Gordon Lewis', 'Gordon Oas-Heim, Candi Conder, Elyn Warner, Pat Finn-Lee, Jerome Eden, Scott H. Hall, Jim Jaekel, Iris Marshall', null, 'A crackpot painter kills people to use their blood as his new crimson red color for his art.', 'A crackpot painter kills people to use their blood as his new crimson red color for his art.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wQR9ZhhZ7LZwZVnm0dcTs8LdG20.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28180'),
  ('687875363915180449', 'Color Me True', 2018, 'Drama, Romance, Fantasy', 'Hideki Takeuchi, Hideo Yamamoto', 'Keisuke Uyama', 'Haruka Ayase, Kentaro Sakaguchi, Tsubasa Honda, Kazuki Kitamura, Akiyoshi Nakao, Anna Ishibashi, Akira Emoto, Gō Katō', null, 'Kenji is a young aspiring movie director. He falls in love with Princess Miyuki, who came from a black‐and‐white movie.', 'Kenji is a young aspiring movie director. He falls in love with Princess Miyuki, who came from a black‐and‐white movie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rd3h0zCECIzdmeX27SrmrSo74CY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:486266'),
  ('594947087757109807', 'Color of Night', 1994, 'Romance, Mystery, Thriller', 'Dietrich Lohmann, Richard Rush, Vicki Jackson-Lemay', 'Matthew Chapman, Billy Ray', 'Bruce Willis, Jane March, Rubén Blades, Lesley Ann Warren, Scott Bakula, Brad Dourif, Lance Henriksen, Kevin J. O''Connor', 'R', 'A color-blind psychiatrist is stalked by an unknown killer after taking over his murdered friend''s therapy group and becomes embroiled in an intense affair with a mysterious woman who may be connected to the crime.', 'A color-blind psychiatrist is stalked by an unknown killer after taking over his murdered friend''s therapy group and becomes embroiled in an intense affair with a mysterious woman who may be connected to the crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w1OBPkf3BxeC7543YzFwiKIwBFJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2124'),
  ('387045688427629894', 'Color of Victory', 2024, 'History, Drama', 'Abdullah Oğuz', 'Abdullah Oğuz, Safran Banu Erdoğan, Evren Oğuz', 'Kubilay Aka, Timuçin Esen, Nejat İşler, Gülper Özdemir, Yilmaz Bayraktar, Gonca Vuslateri, Birce Akalay, Yiğit Özşener', null, 'The days when Istanbul was occupied as a result of the Armistice of Mudros after the First World War and the Fenerbahce football team won the "Harington Cup".', 'The days when Istanbul was occupied as a result of the Armistice of Mudros after the First World War and the Fenerbahce football team won the "Harington Cup".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nBkUpDWUBwcA3KPPr1cSzTKtzU8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1232895'),
  ('345522649286421532', 'Color Out of Space', 2020, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Mystery, Thriller', 'Hugo Pedro, Pedro Patrocínio, Richard Stanley', 'Richard Stanley, Scarlett Amaris', 'Nicolas Cage, Joely Richardson, Madeleine Arthur, Elliot Knight, Tommy Chong, Brendan Meyer, Julian Hilliard, Josh C. Waller', 'R', 'The Gardner family moves to a remote farmstead in rural New England to escape the hustle of the 21st century. They are busy adapting to their new life when a meteorite crashes into their front yard, melts into the earth, and infects both the land and the properties of space-time with a strange, otherworldly colour. To their horror, the family discovers this alien force is gradually mutating every life form that it touches—including them.', 'The Gardner family moves to a remote farmstead in rural New England to escape the hustle of the 21st century. They are busy adapting to their new life when a meteorite crashes into their front yard, melts into the earth, and infects both the land and the properties of space-time with a strange, otherworldly colour. To their horror, the family discovers this alien force is gradually mutating every life form that it touches—including them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k7rD7LzlsPS4jmE6Siah0QO4tAc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:548473'),
  ('823858588386657005', 'Color Sequence', 1943, 'Animation', 'Dwinell Grant', null, null, null, 'One of Grant''s most interesting and important films is Color Sequence (1943) which consists only of pure solid-colour frames that fade, mutate and flicker. He made the film as a research into colour rhythms and perceptual phenomena, and although it now appears not only visually exciting but also as a precedent for the work of younger film-makers like Paul Sharits, Grant himself found the film to be too disquieting when it was first screened (cf. the Film Exercises), and it received little further play until the 70s.', 'One of Grant''s most interesting and important films is Color Sequence (1943) which consists only of pure solid-colour frames that fade, mutate and flicker. He made the film as a research into colour rhythms and perceptual phenomena, and although it now appears not only visually exciting but also as a precedent for the work of younger film-makers like Paul Sharits, Grant himself found the film to be too disquieting when it was first screened (cf. the Film Exercises), and it received little further play until the 70s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xv7EqgaUph7k8qQ1IwUre5Dho0L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:247295'),
  ('1004504237735287092', 'Color Theories by Julio Torres', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Julio Torres, Sam Levy, Josh Muzaffer', 'Julio Torres', 'Drew Rollins, Joe Rumrill, Ian Edlund, Max Collura, Sean Bennett', 'R', 'Torres blends stand-up, design and dream logic into a whimsical exploration of color, emotion and identity that is equal parts comedy, theater and art piece, using color as a way of explaining observed experiences.', 'Torres blends stand-up, design and dream logic into a whimsical exploration of color, emotion and identity that is equal parts comedy, theater and art piece, using color as a way of explaining observed experiences.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FcnJeI6TqrIzMKt9r5VXxaj1YJqR.jpg', 'plex:movie:color-theories-by-julio-torres-2026'),
  ('1052923288871175278', 'Colorado Territory', 1949, 'Western, Crime, Romance', 'Raoul Walsh, Sidney Hickox, Russell Saunders', 'Edmund H. North, John Twist', 'Joel McCrea, Virginia Mayo, Dorothy Malone, Henry Hull, John Archer, James Mitchell, Morris Ankrum, Basil Ruysdael', null, 'After escaping from jail, outlaw Wes McQueen is convinced by his old partner in crime to do one last heist.', 'After escaping from jail, outlaw Wes McQueen is convinced by his old partner in crime to do one last heist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sliBPULxtTEit14lFJYLSeHO679.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28484'),
  ('680584029454165069', 'Colorful', 2010, 'Animation, Drama, Family', 'Minoru Yamaoka, Keiichi Hara, Masahiro Sato', 'Miho Maruo', 'Kazato Tomizawa, Akina Minami, Aoi Miyazaki, Jingi Irie, Akiyoshi Nakao, Kumiko Aso, Katsumi Takahashi, Michael', 'PG-13', 'Upon reaching the train station to death, a dejected soul is informed that he is lucky and will have another chance at life. He is placed in the body of a 14-year-old boy named Kobayashi Makoto, who has just committed suicide. Watched over by a neutral spirit named Purapura, the soul must figure out what his greatest sin and mistake in his former life was, before his time limit in Makoto''s body runs out. He also has a number of other lesser duties he must complete, such as understanding what led Makoto to commit suicide in the first place and learning how to enjoy his second chance at life.', 'Upon reaching the train station to death, a dejected soul is informed that he is lucky and will have another chance at life. He is placed in the body of a 14-year-old boy named Kobayashi Makoto, who has just committed suicide. Watched over by a neutral spirit named Purapura, the soul must figure out what his greatest sin and mistake in his former life was, before his time limit in Makoto''s body runs out. He also has a number of other lesser duties he must complete, such as understanding what led Makoto to commit suicide in the first place and learning how to enjoy his second chance at life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aSM1ki4WSEgvPYMZ9K28aylImFF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64246'),
  ('639161946046188856', 'COLORFUL STAGE! The Movie: A Miku Who Can''t Sing', 2025, 'Animation, Music, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Hiroyuki Hata, Jin Aketagawa, Yuki Akiyama', 'Yoko Yonaiyama', 'Saki Fujita, Asami Shimoda, Yuu Asakawa, Meiko Haigou, Naoto Fuuga, Ruriko Noguchi, Karin Isobe, Reina Ueda', 'PG', 'Ichika is a high school musician who can enter a mysterious place called “SEKAI,” where she and her friends express their innermost emotions through music alongside Hatsune Miku. One day after giving a live performance, Ichika meets a new Miku that she has never seen before. No matter how hard this new Miku tries to sing, she struggles connecting with the hearts of her listeners. Miku must rely on the help of others to find a way to sing again.', 'Ichika is a high school musician who can enter a mysterious place called “SEKAI,” where she and her friends express their innermost emotions through music alongside Hatsune Miku. One day after giving a live performance, Ichika meets a new Miku that she has never seen before. No matter how hard this new Miku tries to sing, she struggles connecting with the hearts of her listeners. Miku must rely on the help of others to find a way to sing again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uiQ6wj8TPYHueuIJRsNlPruzogT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1322752'),
  ('288719485194771797', 'Colors', 1988, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Dennis Hopper, Haskell Wexler', 'Michael Schiffer', 'Sean Penn, Robert Duvall, María Conchita Alonso, Randy Brooks, Grand L. Bush, Don Cheadle, Gerardo Mejía, Glenn Plummer', 'R', 'A confident young cop is shown the ropes by a veteran partner in the dangerous gang-controlled barrios of Los Angeles, where the gang culture is enforced by the colors the members wear.', 'A confident young cop is shown the ropes by a veteran partner in the dangerous gang-controlled barrios of Los Angeles, where the gang culture is enforced by the colors the members wear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5KueYME8A449pxaKTJZp3cWKKSX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10126'),
  ('961580923708992176', 'Colors in the Dark', 2011, 'Drama, Family', 'Sophie Heldman, Christine A. Maier', 'Sophie Heldman, Felix zu Knyphausen', 'Bruno Ganz, Senta Berger, Barnaby Metschurat, Carina Wiese, Leonie Benesch, Sylvana Krappatsch, Thomas Limpinsel, Traute Hoess', null, 'Anita and Fred have been a couple for 50 years, and happily married for nearly as long. They have two grown children, and their grandchildren are finishing school. Both can look back at a fulfilling past, but their lives are still rich and vibrant. The fact that Fred is terribly ill has been hidden from the family. For the first time in all these years, Fred takes some liberties, which his wife interprets as an affront. Never before has she felt so abandoned. Although she starts to question her relationship, a love like theirs cannot end so easily. Indeed it should never end.', 'Anita and Fred have been a couple for 50 years, and happily married for nearly as long. They have two grown children, and their grandchildren are finishing school. Both can look back at a fulfilling past, but their lives are still rich and vibrant. The fact that Fred is terribly ill has been hidden from the family. For the first time in all these years, Fred takes some liberties, which his wife interprets as an affront. Never before has she felt so abandoned. Although she starts to question her relationship, a love like theirs cannot end so easily. Indeed it should never end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dVmY43RDdJxntHEBaXcw3U7deRg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77513'),
  ('986412989379157996', 'Colors of Evil: Red', 2024, 'Crime, Thriller, Mystery', 'Adrian Panek, Tomasz Augustynek, Radosław Chrześciański', 'Adrian Panek, Łukasz M. Maciejewski', 'Jakub Gierszał, Maja Ostaszewska, Zofia Jastrzębska, Andrzej Konopka, Przemysław Bluszcz, Wojciech Zieliński, Andrzej Zieliński, Jan Wieteska', null, 'When a girl''s body is found on a beach in Poland''s Tricity, a prosecutor teams up with the victim''s mother on an impassioned quest for the truth.', 'When a girl''s body is found on a beach in Poland''s Tricity, a prosecutor teams up with the victim''s mother on an impassioned quest for the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5NAdIXaF2AhewMFMqFvbxZmDC3M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1115395'),
  ('351047856648900883', 'Colors of Wind', 2018, 'Romance, Drama', 'Kwak Jae-yong, Park Cheon-bok, Lee Seong-je', 'Kwak Jae-yong', 'Yuki Furukawa, Takemi Fujii, Tomoya Ishii, Yoshihiko Hakamada, Mantaro Koichi, Yoshiko Nakada, Naoto Takenaka, Choi Hyeon-woo', null, 'Yuri leaves Ryo with mysterious words. Ryo goes to Hokkaido knowing that his doppelganger magician is missing. Ryo realizes Yuri was also the magician’s lover and he learns magic. The story that crosses over two identities, illusion and magic.', 'Yuri leaves Ryo with mysterious words. Ryo goes to Hokkaido knowing that his doppelganger magician is missing. Ryo realizes Yuri was also the magician’s lover and he learns magic. The story that crosses over two identities, illusion and magic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/glNsZnAgNiHOsZnfXqnTMQrGMw1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:464911'),
  ('175502669195407262', 'Colosio', 2012, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Carlos Bolado, Andrés León Becker, Erik Baeza', 'Carlos Bolado, Hugo Rodríguez, Miguel Necoechea', 'José María Yázpik, Daniel Giménez Cacho, Kate del Castillo, Odiseo Bichir, Tenoch Huerta Mejía, Harold Torres, Dagoberto Gama, Emilio Echevarría', null, 'It''s 1994 in Mexico, the nation was witnessing a turbulent year since its beginnings. An indigenous rebellion shakes the country. Three months later, the ruling party''s presidential candidate is brutally murdered during a rally in Tijuana. The country is concerned. Nobody knows who''s behind this event, it all points to a conspiracy. Andrés Vázquez, an intelligence expert, is commissioned to lead a secret investigation parallel to the official government issued one. But another expert agent, el Seco, has received orders to wipe out all witnesses and get rid of the evidence surrounding the candidate''s murder. As Andrés begins putting the pieces of this intricate puzzle together and comes closer to the truth, he realizes he''s also putting his life and that of his loved ones in peril.', 'It''s 1994 in Mexico, the nation was witnessing a turbulent year since its beginnings. An indigenous rebellion shakes the country. Three months later, the ruling party''s presidential candidate is brutally murdered during a rally in Tijuana. The country is concerned. Nobody knows who''s behind this event, it all points to a conspiracy. Andrés Vázquez, an intelligence expert, is commissioned to lead a secret investigation parallel to the official government issued one. But another expert agent, el Seco, has received orders to wipe out all witnesses and get rid of the evidence surrounding the candidate''s murder. As Andrés begins putting the pieces of this intricate puzzle together and comes closer to the truth, he realizes he''s also putting his life and that of his loved ones in peril.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uE22BFnDeEDV9JApDD41u7MP0wb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151708'),
  ('1110374644583744941', 'Colossal', 2017, 'Drama, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Nacho Vigalondo, Eric Kress, Tim Sereda', 'Nacho Vigalondo', 'Anne Hathaway, Jason Sudeikis, Austin Stowell, Tim Blake Nelson, Dan Stevens, Hannah Cheramy, Nathan Ellison, Sarah Surh', 'R', 'A woman discovers that severe catastrophic events are somehow connected to the mental breakdown from which she''s suffering.', 'A woman discovers that severe catastrophic events are somehow connected to the mental breakdown from which she''s suffering.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4VOyofBd1pexblxtDZYtYIk7NI4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:339967'),
  ('935593229305747285', 'Colossal Youth', 2006, 'Drama', 'Pedro Costa', 'Pedro Costa', 'Ventura, Vanda Duarte, Beatriz Duarte, Gustavo Sumpta, Cila Cardoso, Isabel Cardoso, Alberto ''Lento'' Barros, António Semedo Moreno', null, 'After the Portuguese government demolishes his slum and relocates him to a housing project on the outskirts of Lisbon, 75-year-old Cape Verde immigrant Ventura wanders between his new and old homes, reconnecting with people from his past.', 'After the Portuguese government demolishes his slum and relocates him to a housing project on the outskirts of Lisbon, 75-year-old Cape Verde immigrant Ventura wanders between his new and old homes, reconnecting with people from his past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7gXzGezgUDaYsauYGPhM3Dmbt2g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82404'),
  ('111247695842122326', 'Colossus and the Amazon Queen', 1960, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Vittorio Sala, Bitto Albertini, Daniele G. Luisi', 'Vittorio Sala, Augusto Frassinetti, Ennio De Concini', 'Dorian Gray, Rod Taylor, Gianna Maria Canale, Ed Fury, Alberto Farnese, Ignazio Leone, Daniela Rocca, Adriana Facchetti', null, 'Two muscle-men come up against a tribe of Amazon women.', 'Two muscle-men come up against a tribe of Amazon women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u5d2YT9mSd6O7nqMRoeA0KgEp95.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91587'),
  ('138811964961805074', 'Colossus and the Headhunters', 1963, 'Action, Adventure, Romance', 'Domenico Scala, Guido Malatesta', 'Guido Malatesta', 'Kirk Morris, Laura Brown, Demeter Bitenc, Frank Leroy, Alfredo Zammi, Corinne Capri, Luigi Esposito, Nello Pazzafini', null, 'Maciste and his people flee their volcano-ravaged island. They end up caught in between two warring tribes.', 'Maciste and his people flee their volcano-ravaged island. They end up caught in between two warring tribes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dS0UbT5NrP8KrLRMB92OP7crcgg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198558'),
  ('663326439538948245', 'Colossus of the Stone Age', 1963, 'Romance, Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Guido Malatesta, Giuseppe La Torre', 'Arpad De Riso, Guido Malatesta', 'Reg Lewis, Margaret Lee, Birgit Bergen, Luciano Marin, Andrea Aureli, Nello Pazzafini, Maria Kent, Fulvia Gasser', null, 'Wandering strongman Maxxus comes upon two warring tribes, the Sun worshipers and the Moon worshipers...and fights monsters !', 'Wandering strongman Maxxus comes upon two warring tribes, the Sun worshipers and the Moon worshipers...and fights monsters !', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1dYng7wcIPJotcEwW8Tue0FJzY7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197259'),
  ('871719619608308963', 'Colossus: The Forbin Project', 1970, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Joseph Sargent, Robin S. Clark, Gene Polito', 'James Bridges', 'Eric Braeden, Susan Clark, Gordon Pinsent, William Schallert, Georg Stanford Brown, Willard Sage, Alex Rodine, Martin E. Brooks', 'PG', 'The U.S. has handed over control of its nuclear defense system to the Colossus supercomputer designed by scientist Dr. Charles Forbin. It soon becomes clear, that the now-sentient Colossus is far more intelligent than its creator realized—with the fate of the world hanging in the balance.', 'The U.S. has handed over control of its nuclear defense system to the Colossus supercomputer designed by scientist Dr. Charles Forbin. It soon becomes clear, that the now-sentient Colossus is far more intelligent than its creator realized—with the fate of the world hanging in the balance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kmVDlTzERxSvBrqtQurjKf1zEy1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14801'),
  ('850252703190338056', 'Colour Flight', 1937, 'Animation', 'Len Lye', null, null, null, 'This riot of color was a showcase for Lye’s hand-painted and stenciled imagery. Sponsored by Imperial Airways, it incorporates the airline’s “speedbird” symbol, and the music consists of “Honolulu Blues” by Red Nichols and a rumba by the Lecuona Cuban Boys. Time Magazine raved about the film, describing Lye as England’s alternative to Walt Disney (a David-and-Goliath comparison!). Like Lye’s other films, Colour Flight was not eligible for distribution in the US due to its status as an overseas advertising film. - Harvard Film Archive', 'This riot of color was a showcase for Lye’s hand-painted and stenciled imagery. Sponsored by Imperial Airways, it incorporates the airline’s “speedbird” symbol, and the music consists of “Honolulu Blues” by Red Nichols and a rumba by the Lecuona Cuban Boys. Time Magazine raved about the film, describing Lye as England’s alternative to Walt Disney (a David-and-Goliath comparison!). Like Lye’s other films, Colour Flight was not eligible for distribution in the US due to its status as an overseas advertising film. - Harvard Film Archive', null, 'tmdb:movie:203090'),
  ('38020242405947176', 'Colour Me Kubrick', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Brian W. Cook, Howard Atherton', 'Anthony Frewin', 'John Malkovich, Sam Redford, Tom Allen, Lynda Baron, Linda Bassett, Nick Barber, Angus Barnett, Marisa Berenson', null, 'The true story of a man who posed as director Stanley Kubrick during the production of Kubrick''s last film, Eyes Wide Shut, despite knowing very little about his work and looking nothing like him.', 'The true story of a man who posed as director Stanley Kubrick during the production of Kubrick''s last film, Eyes Wide Shut, despite knowing very little about his work and looking nothing like him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gqunu6IHCm6qxGZMDC8pMyRtDfk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13802'),
  ('231225927575902964', 'Colour Photo', 2020, 'Drama, Romance', 'Sandeep Raj', 'Sandeep Raj, Sai Rajesh Neelam', 'Suhas, Chandini Chowdary, Sunil Varma, Harsha Chemudu, Divya Sripada, Kancharapalem Raju, Sai Krishna Enreddy', null, 'Jayakrishna is a dark-skinned guy who falls head over heels on Deepu but keeps his feelings to himself. As time passes by, a gang in his college beats him up and this issue brings Deepu closer to him. Slowly the friendship turns into love and this does not go well with Deepu’s brother Rama Raju. The rest of the story is as to how the couple reunites after facing several problems.', 'Jayakrishna is a dark-skinned guy who falls head over heels on Deepu but keeps his feelings to himself. As time passes by, a gang in his college beats him up and this issue brings Deepu closer to him. Slowly the friendship turns into love and this does not go well with Deepu’s brother Rama Raju. The rest of the story is as to how the couple reunites after facing several problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c6P4zWRUbyoknRSBr1LUR3rzJX9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:690565'),
  ('1007654857706837498', 'Colours of Time', 2025, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Cédric Klapisch, Elise Lahouassa, Constance Demontoy', 'Cédric Klapisch, Santiago Amigorena', 'Suzanne Lindon, Abraham Wapler, Vincent Macaigne, Julia Piaton, Zinedine Soualem, Paul Kircher, Vassili Schneider, Sara Giraudeau', null, 'United by the unexpected inheritance of a house in Normandy, four estranged cousins discover their family history by retracing their ancestor''s steps.', 'United by the unexpected inheritance of a house in Normandy, four estranged cousins discover their family history by retracing their ancestor''s steps.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vaZBgB1Z3dkdu0LuvId0VoEHCBA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1235304'),
  ('512058438646084012', 'ColOZio', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Artemio Narro, Mariel Baqueiro', 'María González de León, Artemio Narro', 'Diego Calva, Orlando Moguel, Hector Kotsifakis, Flor Eduarda Gurrola, Ignacio Perales, José María de Tavira, Ariane Pellicer, Janet Ruiz', null, 'In 1994, Mexican presidential candidate Colosio garnered attention for his democratic ideology and anti-corruption stance until he was shot through the head in Tijuana. The wondrous ColOZio, which is partly based on true events, starts three days prior with a prophecy to tripping friends Diego and Gael: save Colosio from death. The duo''s dancing in a kaleidoscopic animated, almost 10-minute-long title sequence subsequently sets the tone for a playful, delightfully over-the-top road movie. Expect mythical apparitions, cartoony chases and plenty of drink and drugs.', 'In 1994, Mexican presidential candidate Colosio garnered attention for his democratic ideology and anti-corruption stance until he was shot through the head in Tijuana. The wondrous ColOZio, which is partly based on true events, starts three days prior with a prophecy to tripping friends Diego and Gael: save Colosio from death. The duo''s dancing in a kaleidoscopic animated, almost 10-minute-long title sequence subsequently sets the tone for a playful, delightfully over-the-top road movie. Expect mythical apparitions, cartoony chases and plenty of drink and drugs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/isBAyTF8ttnxPa2d4eULlsn1VB5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:664347'),
  ('1056872584175430624', 'Colpi di fortuna', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Neri Parenti, Tani Canevari', 'Alessandro Bencivenni, Domenico Saverni, Neri Parenti', 'Luca Bizzarri, Paolo Kessisoglu, Fatima Trotta, Antonio D''Ursi, Giuseppe Laurato, Salvatore Gisonna, Ivan Fedele, Cristiano Di Maio', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rWumuliOwR6yAcP6ZVo0D0kjaGR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:244514'),
  ('559309334035138013', 'Colpo di fulmine', 1985, 'Comedy', 'Marco Risi, Giuseppe Maccari', 'Marco Risi', 'Jerry Calà, Ricky Tognazzi, Elisabetta Giovannini, Isabella Amadeo, Raimondo Penne, Luca Di Fulvio, Valeria D''Obici, Vanessa Gravina', null, 'Carlo, a thirty-something man-child, platonically falls in love with eleven-year-old Giulia.', 'Carlo, a thirty-something man-child, platonically falls in love with eleven-year-old Giulia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eD1rN1DcOVqNjuSwtOLQaTUQ5Pb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:238367'),
  ('938587734469354014', 'Colt .45', 1950, 'Action, Western', 'Edwin L. Marin, Wilfrid M. Cline, Oren Haglund', 'Thomas W. Blackburn', 'Randolph Scott, Ruth Roman, Zachary Scott, Lloyd Bridges, Alan Hale, Ian MacDonald, Chief Thundercloud, Walter Coy', null, 'Gun salesman Steve Farrell gets two of his new Colt .45 pistols stolen from him by ruthless killer Jason Brett but vows to recover them.', 'Gun salesman Steve Farrell gets two of his new Colt .45 pistols stolen from him by ruthless killer Jason Brett but vows to recover them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fOpZdojtGjyz0zbedKKZCb5elHw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55472'),
  ('278761998630824416', 'Colt 38 Special Squad', 1976, 'Action, Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Massimo Dallamano, Gábor Pogány, Bruno Cortini', 'Franco Bottari, Massimo Dallamano, Marco Guglielmi', 'Marcel Bozzuffi, Carole André, Ivan Rassimov, Riccardo Salvino, Giancarlo Bonuglia, Fabrizio Capucci, Francesco Ferracini, Daniele Gabbai', null, 'The city of Turin is in the grip of a brutal crime boss known as "Il Marsigliese" and plenty of cops have good cause to want him dead — none more than Inspector Vanni, whose wife was murdered by the ruthless gangster. Having exhausted every other avenue, Vanni forms a crack squad of motorcycle-riding, Colt .38-toting elite officers, tasked with meting out justice on the margins of the law. But when "Il Marsigliese" launches a bombing campaign designed to extort a vast ransom from the city''s authorities, Vanni finds himself in a race against time to exact his revenge and avert disaster.', 'The city of Turin is in the grip of a brutal crime boss known as "Il Marsigliese" and plenty of cops have good cause to want him dead — none more than Inspector Vanni, whose wife was murdered by the ruthless gangster. Having exhausted every other avenue, Vanni forms a crack squad of motorcycle-riding, Colt .38-toting elite officers, tasked with meting out justice on the margins of the law. But when "Il Marsigliese" launches a bombing campaign designed to extort a vast ransom from the city''s authorities, Vanni finds himself in a race against time to exact his revenge and avert disaster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lbWogWBxlyem3O4g0Htjvpq7bNB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89652'),
  ('91935248427380554', 'Colt 45', 2014, 'Drama, Thriller, Action, Crime', 'Fabrice Du Welz, Benoît Debie', 'Fathi Beddiar', 'Gérard Lanvin, JoeyStarr, Alice Taglioni, Ymanol Perset, Simon Abkarian, Antoine Basler, Jo Prestia, Salem Kali', null, 'Vincent Miles, a gunsmith and shooting instructor at the National Police, is an expert in combat shooting who stubbornly refuses to join a field brigade, a choice which his colleagues do not understand. When he meets Milo Cardena, a mysterious and skilled cop, his life changes in such way that he cannot ignore his true nature anymore.', 'Vincent Miles, a gunsmith and shooting instructor at the National Police, is an expert in combat shooting who stubbornly refuses to join a field brigade, a choice which his colleagues do not understand. When he meets Milo Cardena, a mysterious and skilled cop, his life changes in such way that he cannot ignore his true nature anymore.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5DXgJMsTETLNNO5xSQeMGa8tQCx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:285387'),
  ('155022241738340348', 'Coluche', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Antoine de Caunes, Thomas Hardmeier', 'Antoine de Caunes, Diastème', 'François-Xavier Demaison, Léa Drucker, Olivier Gourmet, Laurent Bateau, Jean-Pierre Martins, Alexandre Astier, Denis Podalydès, Valérie Crouzet', null, 'French comedian Michel Colucci, better known as Coluche, announces - for laughs - his candidacy for the 1981 French presidential elections.', 'French comedian Michel Colucci, better known as Coluche, announces - for laughs - his candidacy for the 1981 French presidential elections.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dDSLLId9xbc7utCpum7trP7QutQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14419'),
  ('836340139687791960', 'Columbus', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Kogonada, Elisha Christian, Eric Williams', 'Kogonada', 'John Cho, Haley Lu Richardson, Michelle Forbes, Rory Culkin, Parker Posey, Erin Allegretti, Shani Salyers Stiles, Reen Vogel', 'PG-13', 'When a renowned architecture scholar falls suddenly ill during a speaking tour, his son Jin finds himself stranded in Columbus, Indiana - a small Midwestern city celebrated for its many significant modernist buildings. Jin strikes up a friendship with Casey, a young architecture enthusiast who works at the local library.', 'When a renowned architecture scholar falls suddenly ill during a speaking tour, his son Jin finds himself stranded in Columbus, Indiana - a small Midwestern city celebrated for its many significant modernist buildings. Jin strikes up a friendship with Casey, a young architecture enthusiast who works at the local library.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6tk0xmn9k5HjUeXsnhxIa94sFXP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:414453'),
  ('294214515564918307', 'Columbus Circle', 2012, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'George Gallo, Anastas N. Michos, Mark Taylor', 'George Gallo, Kevin Pollak, Kevin Pollak', 'Selma Blair, Jason Lee, Amy Smart, Giovanni Ribisi, Kevin Pollak, Beau Bridges, Lauren Gallagher, Samm Levine', 'PG-13', 'An heiress who''s been shut inside her apartment building for nearly two decades is forced to confront her fears after one of her neighbors is killed and a detective arrives to begin the investigation.', 'An heiress who''s been shut inside her apartment building for nearly two decades is forced to confront her fears after one of her neighbors is killed and a detective arrives to begin the investigation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/78vEPvktr8AvRfovH9yWzWD7aje.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92000'),
