  ('464017915617577008', 'Column South', 1953, 'Western', 'Frederick de Cordova, Charles P. Boyle, Fred Frank', 'William Sackheim', 'Audie Murphy, Joan Evans, Robert Sterling, Ray Collins, Dennis Weaver, Gregg Palmer, Russell Johnson, Jack Kelly', 'NR', 'In the weeks prior to the start of the Civil War, Confederate sympathizers hope to help their cause by inciting a Navajo war in the New Mexico Territory. Director Frederick de Cordova''s 1953 western stars Audie Murphy, Robert Sterling, Joan Evans, Ray Collins, Dennis Weaver, Palmer Lee, Jack Kelly, James Best, Bob Steele and Ralph Moody.', 'In the weeks prior to the start of the Civil War, Confederate sympathizers hope to help their cause by inciting a Navajo war in the New Mexico Territory. Director Frederick de Cordova''s 1953 western stars Audie Murphy, Robert Sterling, Joan Evans, Ray Collins, Dennis Weaver, Palmer Lee, Jack Kelly, James Best, Bob Steele and Ralph Moody.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8hHOlzwJehzprQ8DfRn3eCu0jSK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164561'),
  ('681064060909101128', 'Com’è umano lui!', 2024, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Luca Manfredi, Giandomenico Trillo, Fabio Olmi', 'Dido Castelli, Luca Manfredi', 'Enzo Paci, Camilla Semino Favro, Andrea Filippi, Andrea Benfante, Augusto Zucchi, Emanuela Grimalda, Vincenzo Zampa, Valentina Ruggeri', null, 'The film retraces the early years of Paolo Villaggio''s career, from when he was an employee to the success of the Fantozzi film series.', 'The film retraces the early years of Paolo Villaggio''s career, from when he was an employee to the success of the Fantozzi film series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9uRGR9ETYyCFBPX6lXIJt9QXuIF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1187786'),
  ('1020676399832993152', 'Coma', 1978, 'Thriller, Mystery, Horror', 'Victor J. Kemper, Michael Crichton', 'Michael Crichton', 'Geneviève Bujold, Michael Douglas, Elizabeth Ashley, Rip Torn, Richard Widmark, Lois Chiles, Hari Rhodes, Richard Doyle', 'PG', 'When relatively healthy patients begin having ''complications'' during simple operations and ending up in comas, a concerned doctor defies her male superiors when she suspects a secret plot.', 'When relatively healthy patients begin having ''complications'' during simple operations and ending up in comas, a concerned doctor defies her male superiors when she suspects a secret plot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kNMfXPm1f8OgVYFU4aEhmP9TJzO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11223'),
  ('233681573128043693', 'Coma', 2020, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Action', 'Nikita Argunov, Yuliya Zharkova, Sergey Dyshuk', 'Nikita Argunov, Timofey Dekin, Aleksey Gravitskiy', 'Rinal Mukhametov, Anton Pampushnyy, Lyubov Aksyonova, Miloš Biković, Konstantin Lavronenko, Polina Kuzminskaya, Rostislav Gulbis, Vilen Babichev', null, 'A young and talented architect comes to his senses after a horrific accident only to find himself in the odd dystopian world. A world that is filled with the memories of all current coma patients. Just like a human memory this world is fragmental, chaotic and unstable. This is COMA: icecaps, rivers and cities can all exist in a space of a single room and laws of physics are no longer laws as they can be bent.', 'A young and talented architect comes to his senses after a horrific accident only to find himself in the odd dystopian world. A world that is filled with the memories of all current coma patients. Just like a human memory this world is fragmental, chaotic and unstable. This is COMA: icecaps, rivers and cities can all exist in a space of a single room and laws of physics are no longer laws as they can be bent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1hVEsBS4vnozB1yAsMiqW0IMxyp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:430155'),
  ('559658268549512456', 'Coma', 2022, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Bertrand Bonello, Antoine Parouty, Alexis Diop', 'Bertrand Bonello', 'Julia Faure, Louise Labèque, Ninon François, Bonnie Banane, Adilé David, Mathilde Riu, Violette Guillon, Léa Jousset', 'NR', 'Amidst a period of unprecedented world events, an eighteen-year-old girl’s life is placed on hold. Isolated in her bedroom, she falls under the spell of the mysterious vlogger Patricia Coma. As time carries on, the lines between her dreams, fears, hopes, and reality begin to blur into one another.', 'Amidst a period of unprecedented world events, an eighteen-year-old girl’s life is placed on hold. Isolated in her bedroom, she falls under the spell of the mysterious vlogger Patricia Coma. As time carries on, the lines between her dreams, fears, hopes, and reality begin to blur into one another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xpxquNuhQQWjYLMzP2Fx4Ii2eFB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:920772'),
  ('711826050605838975', 'Coma-Brutal Duel', 1999, 'Horror, Action', 'Heiko Fipper', 'Heiko Fipper', 'Heiko Fipper, Mike Hoffman, Stefan Hoft, Stephan Fipper, Andreio Fiore, Diana Golinski, Stefanie Hass, Dennis O. Heinrich', null, 'When a man is killed by a drunk driving, his son wants revenge, which starts a big battle that will continue for years.', 'When a man is killed by a drunk driving, his son wants revenge, which starts a big battle that will continue for years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xECthYv21l3KnqvrsNjcEvbMsD7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36903'),
  ('1036400008766187238', 'Comali', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Pradeep Ranganathan, Richard M. Nathan', 'Pradeep Ranganathan', 'Ravi Mohan, Kajal Aggarwal, Samyuktha Hegde, K. S. Ravikumar, Yogi Babu, Shah Ra, Vinodhini Vaidyanathan, RJ Ananthi', null, 'A youngster in his mid-30s goes through a series of struggles after coming to terms with the fact that he was in coma for 16 years.', 'A youngster in his mid-30s goes through a series of struggles after coming to terms with the fact that he was in coma for 16 years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a6ruupinOM7HwjcR3Uafx9YfwM8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:591102'),
  ('43496446416187558', 'Comanche', 1956, 'Western', 'George Sherman, Henry Spitz', 'Carl Krueger', 'Dana Andrews, Kent Smith, Nestor Paiva, Henry Brandon, Stacy Harris, John Litel, Lowell Gilmore, Mike Mazurki', 'NR', 'Common efforts of the U.S. government and the Comanche nation to negotiate a peace treaty are sabotaged by renegade Indians and by the short-sighted Indian Commissioner.', 'Common efforts of the U.S. government and the Comanche nation to negotiate a peace treaty are sabotaged by renegade Indians and by the short-sighted Indian Commissioner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AcQZRgqSUaceltSMiT7OUt3coyq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89450'),
  ('304875545705527351', 'Comanche Station', 1960, 'Western', 'Charles Lawton Jr., Budd Boetticher, Sam Nelson', 'Burt Kennedy', 'Randolph Scott, Nancy Gates, Claude Akins, Skip Homeier, Richard Rust, Rand Brooks, Dyke Johnson, Foster Hood', null, 'A white man trades with the Comanche for the release of a female stranger and the pair cross paths with three outlaws who have their eyes on the handsome reward for bringing her home and Comanche on the warpath.', 'A white man trades with the Comanche for the release of a female stranger and the pair cross paths with three outlaws who have their eyes on the handsome reward for bringing her home and Comanche on the warpath.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1PHMKqoyZ4JS1iXBDSgKrbirox.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1673'),
  ('965163228044155622', 'Comanche Territory', 1950, 'Western', 'George Sherman, Maury Gertsman', 'Oscar Brodney, Lewis Meltzer', 'Maureen O''Hara, Macdonald Carey, Will Geer, Charles Drake, Pedro de Cordoba, Ian MacDonald, Rick Vallin, Parley Baer', 'NR', 'White settlers plan to defy the agreement between the government and the Comanche to mine for silver on Comanche lands, while scout Jim Bowie tries to keep the peace in the territory.', 'White settlers plan to defy the agreement between the government and the Comanche to mine for silver on Comanche lands, while scout Jim Bowie tries to keep the peace in the territory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1M1OKZ5vAsg4m7dHzQtJB8hrYGM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79101'),
  ('662591322167025118', 'Comandante', 2003, 'Documentary', 'Oliver Stone, Carlos Marcovich, Rodrigo Prieto', null, 'Oliver Stone, Juanita Vera, Fidel Castro, Che Guevara, John F. Kennedy, Richard Nixon, Janet Reno, Jaume Roures', null, 'Oliver Stone spends three days filming with Fidel Castro in Cuba, discussing an array of subjects with the president such as his rise to power, fellow revolutionary Che Guevara, the Cuban Missile crisis, and the present state of the country.', 'Oliver Stone spends three days filming with Fidel Castro in Cuba, discussing an array of subjects with the president such as his rise to power, fellow revolutionary Che Guevara, the Cuban Missile crisis, and the present state of the country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gJjwog4k9ricwM9oi0rc0CsOrXr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25783'),
  ('533488213290947235', 'Combat 16', 2005, 'Drama', 'Mirko Borscht', 'Mirko Borscht, Jana Erdmann', 'Florian Bartholomäi, Falk Rockstroh, Ludwig Trepte, Max Mauff, Maximilian Oelze, Sven Lubeck, Isabelle Mbarga, Christine Diensberg', null, '16 year-old Georg is forced to leave his home in the West, which means saying goodbye to his two loves; his girlfriend, and his Taekwondo team, something that is all-important to him. Now living in Cottbus, an economically depressed place where the people are not too fond of things like American culture and foreigners living in their country, Georg soon falls in with a group of angry mates. Together the group delves further into a nationalist way of thinking, and soon they are shaving their heads, and becoming a skinhead gang. "Kombat Sechzehn" features some impressive, proffessional looking fight sequences, as well as a memorable soundtrack.', '16 year-old Georg is forced to leave his home in the West, which means saying goodbye to his two loves; his girlfriend, and his Taekwondo team, something that is all-important to him. Now living in Cottbus, an economically depressed place where the people are not too fond of things like American culture and foreigners living in their country, Georg soon falls in with a group of angry mates. Together the group delves further into a nationalist way of thinking, and soon they are shaving their heads, and becoming a skinhead gang. "Kombat Sechzehn" features some impressive, proffessional looking fight sequences, as well as a memorable soundtrack.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b7HOa0XMxkyRJuABxXV2tx5eMWI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36989'),
  ('334244705730959663', 'Combat Academy', 1986, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Neal Israel, Steve Yaconelli, Harvey Waldman', 'Paul W. Shapiro', 'Keith Gordon, Wallace Langham, Dana Hill, Tina Caspary, George Clooney, Elya Baskin, Danny Nucci, Kevin Haley', null, '"Police Academy"-style comedy set in a military school. Two errant high-school students are ordered by a judge to spend a year at a prestigious military academy, where one of the cadets finds out who is responsible for a spate of midnight thefts. Written by Mark Lennon', '"Police Academy"-style comedy set in a military school. Two errant high-school students are ordered by a judge to spend a year at a prestigious military academy, where one of the cadets finds out who is responsible for a spate of midnight thefts. Written by Mark Lennon', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lKa3OuZrYGPNpEsfYDFavlAqaWI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50524'),
  ('898748634877601783', 'Combat Girls', 2011, 'Drama', 'David Wnendt, Jonas Schmager', 'David Wnendt', 'Alina Levshin, Jella Haase, Sayed Ahmad, Gerdy Zint, Lukas Steltner, Uwe Preuss, Winnie Böwe, Rosa Enskat', 'PG-13', 'Marisa, a 20-year-old German girl, hates foreigners, Jews, cops, and everyone she finds guilty for the decline of her country. She provokes, drinks, fights and her next tattoo will be a portrait of Adolf Hitler. But Marisa''s convictions begin to crumble when she meets a young Afghan refugee, and she learns that the black and white principles of her gang are not the only way.', 'Marisa, a 20-year-old German girl, hates foreigners, Jews, cops, and everyone she finds guilty for the decline of her country. She provokes, drinks, fights and her next tattoo will be a portrait of Adolf Hitler. But Marisa''s convictions begin to crumble when she meets a young Afghan refugee, and she learns that the black and white principles of her gang are not the only way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nsMjsaBMkZgXaUzW3YmvIAHE2oC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82529'),
  ('40946529476862326', 'Combat Shock', 1986, 'War, Drama, Horror', 'Buddy Giovinazzo, Stella Varveris', 'Buddy Giovinazzo', 'Rick Giovinazzo, Veronica Stork, Mitch Maglio, Asaph Livni, Nick Nasta, Michael Tierno, Arthur Saunders, Lori Labar', 'R', 'A dangerously disturbed Vietnam veteran struggles with life 15 years after his return home, and slowly falls into insanity from his gritty urban lifestyle.', 'A dangerously disturbed Vietnam veteran struggles with life 15 years after his return home, and slowly falls into insanity from his gritty urban lifestyle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oCGUSrJVVjFPwkxcdVnOa7880S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26558'),
  ('77001944455173722', 'Combat Wombat', 2020, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Ricard Cussó', 'Matthew James Kinmonth', 'Deborah Mailman, Ed Oxenbould, Frank Woodley, Judith Lucy, George Pullar, Kate Murphy, Thomas Larkin, Adam Lochowicz', 'G', 'Maggie Diggins, a wombat turned Wonder Woman, unintentionally becomes the city''s superhero after she begrudgingly saves a rookie superhero sugar glider from certain doom.', 'Maggie Diggins, a wombat turned Wonder Woman, unintentionally becomes the city''s superhero after she begrudgingly saves a rookie superhero sugar glider from certain doom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/383b9E3Uv1fOyPiSxMZr8lsjFMa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:732721'),
  ('752513255054880632', 'Combustible', 2012, 'Animation, History', 'Katsuhiro Otomo', 'Katsuhiro Otomo', 'Saori Hayami, Masakazu Morita, Hajime Iijima, Kokoa Amano, Masaaki Emori, Nobutoshi Canna, Ruiki Sato, Ryuji Aigase', null, 'The city of Edo, the 18th century. Owaka, the daughter of a merchant family, and her childhood friend Matsukichi. The two were drawn to each other, but Matsukichi has been disowned by his family, and is working for the city fire brigade. Meanwhile, negotiations begin for the arrangement of Owaka''s marriage. Unable to let go of her thoughts of Matsukichi, her mad emotions make her bring about a massive inferno which razes Edo. By chance encounter, the two meet again amidst the fires.It is an epic spectacle set against the stage of the massive metropolis of Edo.', 'The city of Edo, the 18th century. Owaka, the daughter of a merchant family, and her childhood friend Matsukichi. The two were drawn to each other, but Matsukichi has been disowned by his family, and is working for the city fire brigade. Meanwhile, negotiations begin for the arrangement of Owaka''s marriage. Unable to let go of her thoughts of Matsukichi, her mad emotions make her bring about a massive inferno which razes Edo. By chance encounter, the two meet again amidst the fires.It is an epic spectacle set against the stage of the massive metropolis of Edo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/om9vdERsjJ46O5KX0OeoBr9BzSU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118932'),
