  ('1026926114958324348', 'Come Undone', 2000, 'Romance, Drama', 'Sébastien Lifshitz, Pascal Poucet', 'Stéphane Bouquet, Sébastien Lifshitz', 'Jérémie Elkaïm, Stéphane Rideau, Dominique Reymond, Marie Matheron, Laetitia Legrix, Nils Ohlund, Réjane Kerdaffrec, Guy Houssier', 'NR', 'Story of two gorgeous, young French boys who begin a passionate relationship that boils over and threatens to destroy both their lives. Shy 18-year-old Mathieu is on summer vacation in the south of France. He spends his days lazily sunning himself at the beach, until he spies the handsome Cédric and falls in love.', 'Story of two gorgeous, young French boys who begin a passionate relationship that boils over and threatens to destroy both their lives. Shy 18-year-old Mathieu is on summer vacation in the south of France. He spends his days lazily sunning himself at the beach, until he spies the handsome Cédric and falls in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x04Oo0CKJNA0TlilWR0o5gY9sr1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27099'),
  ('109104977315522172', 'Come Undone', 2010, 'Drama, Romance', 'Silvio Soldini, Ramiro Civita, Cinzia Castania', 'Doriana Leondeff, Silvio Soldini, Angelo Carbone', 'Alba Rohrwacher, Pierfrancesco Favino, Giuseppe Battiston, Teresa Saponangelo, Monica Nappo, Tatiana Lepore, Sergio Solli, Gisella Burinato', null, 'Anna is an accountant for an important insurance firm and lives with her longterm lover Alessio - a man who longs for a stable longterm relationship with children, home, etc. Anna, feeling as though the fire has fizzled in that relationship takes up with co-worker Domenico and the two begin a passionate affair.', 'Anna is an accountant for an important insurance firm and lives with her longterm lover Alessio - a man who longs for a stable longterm relationship with children, home, etc. Anna, feeling as though the fire has fizzled in that relationship takes up with co-worker Domenico and the two begin a passionate affair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7yxCUZBxIVOG8CEZ8O9zW4u9Fju.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36956'),
  ('766580145719445649', 'Come What May', 2015, 'War, Drama', 'Pierre Cottereau, Christian Carion', 'Andrew Bampfield, Christian Carion, Laure Irrmann', 'August Diehl, Olivier Gourmet, Mathilde Seigner, Alice Isaaz, Matthew Rhys, Joshio Marlon, Thomas Schmauser, Laurent Gerra', null, 'In may 1940, the German troops enter France. Frightened by the progress of the enemy, the people of a small village of Pas-de-Calais decide on the recommendations of the prefecture, to give up everything to go on the road, fleeing to the coast.', 'In may 1940, the German troops enter France. Frightened by the progress of the enemy, the people of a small village of Pas-de-Calais decide on the recommendations of the prefecture, to give up everything to go on the road, fleeing to the coast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m6JB1I384GtMcD04z6Rpzt3fF9M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:351192'),
  ('400300588235537950', 'Come, Come, Come Upward', 1989, 'Drama', 'Im Kwon-taek, Oh Byung-chul, Koo Joong-mo', null, 'Kang Soo-youn, Jin Yeong-mi, Yu In-chon, Han Ji-il, Jeon Moo-song, Yoon In-ja, Yoon Yang-ha, Kim Se-jun', null, 'In 1980s South Korea, two young nuns-in-training at the same monastery embark on very different journeys towards enlightenment.', 'In 1980s South Korea, two young nuns-in-training at the same monastery embark on very different journeys towards enlightenment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qXLmp63UpGzdIv70uMUuFT95lZK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:223478'),
  ('127543218670085014', 'Come, Sweet Death', 2000, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Wolfgang Murnberger, Peter von Haller', 'Wolfgang Murnberger, Josef Hader, Wolf Haas', 'Josef Hader, Simon Schwarz, Barbara Rudnik, Michael Schönborn, Bernd Michael Lade, Nina Proll, Karl Markovics, Reinhard Nowak', null, 'Former detective Brenner has become an ambulance driver and finds himself, much to his dismay, caught up in a war between two rival first aid organizations.', 'Former detective Brenner has become an ambulance driver and finds himself, much to his dismay, caught up in a war between two rival first aid organizations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fsuUPQK5j4J2Jr6OweWPYdyrCad.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10469'),
  ('880526704405611082', 'Comeback', 2017, 'Drama, Western', 'Erico Rassi, André Carvalheira, Igor Penna', 'Erico Rassi', 'Nelson Xavier, Marcos de Andrade, Everaldo Pontes, Gê Martú, João Antonio, Henrique Taubaté, Eucir de Souza, Sérgio Sartório', null, 'Amador is a retired and ostracized gunman. Alone and bitter, he collects newspaper clippings of his old crimes in an album. After several humiliations, he will react with violence to the world’s hostility that surrounds him while also trying to get back to action.', 'Amador is a retired and ostracized gunman. Alone and bitter, he collects newspaper clippings of his old crimes in an album. After several humiliations, he will react with violence to the world’s hostility that surrounds him while also trying to get back to action.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qTMWYZuBZKqAEkUdBC4sSBkX7wC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:417499'),
  ('531751725890364648', 'Comeback Season', 2006, 'Comedy, Family, Romance', 'Bruce McCulloch, Jamie Anderson', 'Bruce McCulloch', 'Ray Liotta, Shaun Sipos, Glenne Headly, Rachel Blanchard, Brooke Nevin, Brendan Fehr, Brenda Campbell, David Parker', null, 'First Down. Second Chance. Skylar is a star quarterback of his football team. He''s got the skills, the looks, and the girls. His next-door neighbor, Walter is a loving husband, good father and all-round decent family man. When their worlds start to crumble they find themselves in jail together and suddenly these former enemies must rely on each other to rebuild their lives...', 'First Down. Second Chance. Skylar is a star quarterback of his football team. He''s got the skills, the looks, and the girls. His next-door neighbor, Walter is a loving husband, good father and all-round decent family man. When their worlds start to crumble they find themselves in jail together and suddenly these former enemies must rely on each other to rebuild their lives...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zSNW11igwXcCyX52RevUZMNGpv9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14561'),
  ('991862082696291469', 'Comedian', 2002, 'Comedy, Documentary', 'Christian Charles', null, 'Jerry Seinfeld, Orny Adams, Greg Giraldo, Jim Norton, Sherrod Small, Allan Havey, Colin Quinn, Cynthia Koury', null, 'A look at the work of two stand-up comics, Jerry Seinfeld and a lesser-known newcomer, detailing the effort and frustration behind putting together a successful act and career while living a life on the road.', 'A look at the work of two stand-up comics, Jerry Seinfeld and a lesser-known newcomer, detailing the effort and frustration behind putting together a successful act and career while living a life on the road.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tktajWQ91P09zTV7HdefzeVw1UV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19973'),
  ('406921698814782548', 'Comedians', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Gabriele Salvatores, Italo Petriccione', 'Gabriele Salvatores', 'Natalino Balasso, Christian De Sica, Vincenzo Zampa, Marco Bonadei, Ale, Franz, Walter Leonardi, Giulio Pranno', null, 'Six aspiring comedians tired of the mediocrity of their lives, at the end of an evening stand-up course they prepare to face their first performance in a club. In the audience there is also an examiner, who will choose one of them for a TV show. For everyone this is the great opportunity to change their life, for some it could be the last one. The performances begin and each comedian takes the stage with a great dilemma: to respect the teachings of their master, devoted to intelligent and uncompromising comedy, or to twist their numbers to satisfy the much less refined taste of the examiner? Or maybe look for a third way, one of absolute originality? Through the stories of six comedians, Comedians is a reflection on the very meaning of comedy in our time, facing absolutely topical issues.', 'Six aspiring comedians tired of the mediocrity of their lives, at the end of an evening stand-up course they prepare to face their first performance in a club. In the audience there is also an examiner, who will choose one of them for a TV show. For everyone this is the great opportunity to change their life, for some it could be the last one. The performances begin and each comedian takes the stage with a great dilemma: to respect the teachings of their master, devoted to intelligent and uncompromising comedy, or to twist their numbers to satisfy the much less refined taste of the examiner? Or maybe look for a third way, one of absolute originality? Through the stories of six comedians, Comedians is a reflection on the very meaning of comedy in our time, facing absolutely topical issues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hps25NkX5Kh4zDLkUM4Dx1ZavO8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:738627'),
  ('593808259508140081', 'Comedy', 2002, 'Drama, Fantasy, History, War, Animation', 'Kazuto Nakazawa, Hiroshi Murakami', null, 'Ai Maeda, Hikaru Midorikawa', null, 'During Ireland''s War of Independence, a five-year-old girl sets out to save her village from the English army by trying to enlist the help of the rumored Black Swordsman, who only takes books of a certain genre as payment.', 'During Ireland''s War of Independence, a five-year-old girl sets out to save her village from the English army by trying to enlist the help of the rumored Black Swordsman, who only takes books of a certain genre as payment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/paF9j0ft3woVDl9D3R0fsNd6n8q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:507022'),
