  ('162059154087140242', 'Comedy of Innocence', 2000, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Raúl Ruiz, Jacques Bouquin', 'Francoise Dumas, Raúl Ruiz', 'Isabelle Huppert, Jeanne Balibar, Charles Berling, Denis Podalydès, Nils Hugon, Laure de Clermont-Tonnerre, Chantal Bronner, Bruno Marengo', null, 'Today, Camille turns nine. He had sworn that on his 9th birthday he would show his parents the videos he was shooting on the side - the tail of a cat scampering away, a window, and a veiled woman''s face - an intriguing picture... Later that day, Camille''s mother, Ariane, meets up with her son in the park. The boy appears perturbed. He is leaning against a tree, eyes cast down. He says that now he wants to return to his "real home" and his "real mother."', 'Today, Camille turns nine. He had sworn that on his 9th birthday he would show his parents the videos he was shooting on the side - the tail of a cat scampering away, a window, and a veiled woman''s face - an intriguing picture... Later that day, Camille''s mother, Ariane, meets up with her son in the park. The boy appears perturbed. He is leaning against a tree, eyes cast down. He says that now he wants to return to his "real home" and his "real mother."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vvC0C4mFszF06EwnGqRyEFWaMNC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52049'),
  ('262288402710669375', 'Comedy of Power', 2006, 'Drama', 'Eduardo Serra, Claude Chabrol, Dominique Frizat', 'Claude Chabrol, Odile Barski', 'Isabelle Huppert, François Berléand, Patrick Bruel, Marilyne Canto, Robin Renucci, Thomas Chabrol, Jean-François Balmer, Dominique Daguier', 'NR', 'Magistrate Jeanne Charmant-Killman doggedly investigates CEO Michel Humeau, who is accused of participating in massive corporate malfeasance. As her investigation leads her into the upper echelons of government, Jeanne becomes intoxicated by the power she is amassing.', 'Magistrate Jeanne Charmant-Killman doggedly investigates CEO Michel Humeau, who is accused of participating in massive corporate malfeasance. As her investigation leads her into the upper echelons of government, Jeanne becomes intoxicated by the power she is amassing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8GqEwYLdnDjoMWXv8FARBhnC1VR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12713'),
  ('250578903733834959', 'Comedy of the Strict Regime', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Leonid Gavrichenko, Anatoly Lapshov, Valentin Sidorin', 'Vladimir Studennikov, Mikhail Grigoriev', 'Viktor Sukhorukov, Ivan Krivoruchko, Lev Kubarev, Nadezhda Zharikova, Vladimir Ermilov, Viktor Solovyov, Sergei Selin, Stanislav Kontsevich', null, 'The action is set in 1970 as the Soviet Union (and the entire progressive world) are preparing to celebrate Lenin''s centenary. Not to be outdone, the camp commander decides to have the prisoners put on a play about Lenin''s life. However, the ensuing preparations turn everything upside down and seem to offer a God-given chance to plot an escape.', 'The action is set in 1970 as the Soviet Union (and the entire progressive world) are preparing to celebrate Lenin''s centenary. Not to be outdone, the camp commander decides to have the prisoners put on a play about Lenin''s life. However, the ensuing preparations turn everything upside down and seem to offer a God-given chance to plot an escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/psJJKzF7WX2lSvNzw1LgidTArvw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83501'),
  ('515964010869962961', 'Comes a Horseman', 1978, 'Western, Drama, Romance', 'Alan J. Pakula, Gordon Willis', 'Dennis Lynton Clark', 'James Caan, Jane Fonda, Jason Robards, George Grizzard, Richard Farnsworth, Mark Harmon, Macon McCalman, Basil Hoffman', 'PG', 'Ella Connors is a single woman who gets pressured to sell her failing cattle farm to her corrupt ex-suitor, Jacob Ewing. She asks for help from her neighbor, Frank Athearn. As Ella and Frank fight back through stampedes, jealousy, betrayal, and sabotage... they eventually find love.', 'Ella Connors is a single woman who gets pressured to sell her failing cattle farm to her corrupt ex-suitor, Jacob Ewing. She asks for help from her neighbor, Frank Athearn. As Ella and Frank fight back through stampedes, jealousy, betrayal, and sabotage... they eventually find love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iSX6HqUJM0Caxm4hK5N2EAPbLaV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42201'),
  ('320676952828443786', 'Comet', 2014, 'Science Fiction, Comedy, Romance', 'Stephanie Cluff, David Gross, Sam Esmail', 'Sam Esmail', 'Justin Long, Emmy Rossum, Kayla Servi, Eric Winter, Lou Beatty Jr., Ben Pace, Nicole Lucas, Connie Jackson', 'R', 'When a chance encounter brings together the cynical Dell and the quick-witted Kimberly, the stage is set for a tempestuous love affair that unfolds like a puzzle. As the film zigzags back and forth in time — from a meteor shower in LA, to an encounter in a Paris hotel room, to a fateful phone call — an unforgettable portrait of a relationship emerges.', 'When a chance encounter brings together the cynical Dell and the quick-witted Kimberly, the stage is set for a tempestuous love affair that unfolds like a puzzle. As the film zigzags back and forth in time — from a meteor shower in LA, to an encounter in a Paris hotel room, to a fateful phone call — an unforgettable portrait of a relationship emerges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4zOOSa5zyJDvqDDKFwUQVMK6eDe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:276908'),
  ('1144390221363955850', 'Comet in Moominland', 1992, 'Animation, Comedy, Fantasy, Adventure, Family', 'Hiroshi Saito, Hisao Shirai', 'Akira Miyazaki', 'Minami Takayama, Ryusei Nakao, Rei Sakuma, Takehito Koyasu, Mika Kanai, Akio Otsuka, Ikuko Tani, Yasuyuki Hirata', null, 'Moomintroll, Sniff and Little My set out to stop a comet approaching the Moominvalley. Along the way they meet Snufkin, the beautiful Snorkmaiden, Snork and Hemulen, who join them in their quest.', 'Moomintroll, Sniff and Little My set out to stop a comet approaching the Moominvalley. Along the way they meet Snufkin, the beautiful Snorkmaiden, Snork and Hemulen, who join them in their quest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b4O25Joz13gZqXusA5tyqO4Y4OV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70089'),
  ('545358095008109686', 'Comfort and Joy', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Bill Forsyth, Jim Gillespie, Chris Menges', 'Bill Forsyth', 'Bill Paterson, Eleanor David, Clare Grogan, Alex Norton, Patrick Malahide, Roberto Bernardi, Rikki Fulton, George Rossi', 'R', 'Radio host Alan ''Dickie'' Bird witnesses how an icecream van is attacked and destroyed by angry competitors. This leads him into the struggle between two Italian families over the icecream market of Glasgow.', 'Radio host Alan ''Dickie'' Bird witnesses how an icecream van is attacked and destroyed by angry competitors. This leads him into the struggle between two Italian families over the icecream market of Glasgow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6hD1WpT2XK2IkPIPxkhbotZdZsN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30278'),
  ('425265300020090917', 'Comic Book Confidential', 1989, 'Documentary', 'Ron Mann, Robert Fresco, Joan Churchill', 'Charles Lippincott, Ron Mann', 'Frank Miller, Jack Kirby, Stan Lee, Will Eisner, Robert Crumb, Lynda Barry, Charles Burns, William M. Gaines', 'PG', 'A survey of the artistic history of the comic book medium and some of the major talents associated with it.', 'A survey of the artistic history of the comic book medium and some of the major talents associated with it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7XOJXO8qqf9jr5XeBizhY4UrRtn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40844'),
  ('108109159836969830', 'Comic Book Villains', 2002, 'Comedy, Crime', 'James Robinson, Blake T. Evans', 'James Robinson', 'Donal Logue, Cary Elwes, Michael Rapaport, Natasha Lyonne, Eileen Brennan, DJ Qualls, Danny Masterson, James Duval', 'R', 'When word hits the street that a nearby elderly gentleman has a cache of old, rare, and very valuable mint condition comic books, rival comic book shop owners Raymond McGillicuddy (Donal Logue) and Norman Link (Michael Rapaport) both set out to be the first to buy them. But when the old man declines to sell, the former friends turn into enemies, and a friendly rivalry becomes tainted with greed and turns to murder.', 'When word hits the street that a nearby elderly gentleman has a cache of old, rare, and very valuable mint condition comic books, rival comic book shop owners Raymond McGillicuddy (Donal Logue) and Norman Link (Michael Rapaport) both set out to be the first to buy them. But when the old man declines to sell, the former friends turn into enemies, and a friendly rivalry becomes tainted with greed and turns to murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4yK0mEONadsXSdeoZQAGn92ZrKp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36629'),
  ('812357024106340322', 'Comic Book: The Movie', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Mark Hamill, Jason Cooley', 'Mark Hamill, Billy West', 'Mark Hamill, Donna D''Errico, Billy West, Lori Alan, Daran Norris, Bruce Campbell, Kevin Smith, Tom Kenny', null, 'Hugh Hefner, Stan Lee, Mark Hamill and Kevin Smith journey into the world of comic book fandom! Documentary filmmaker Donald Swan heads to the world''s largest comic book convention where he encounters a culture of craziness that he''s totally unprepared for.', 'Hugh Hefner, Stan Lee, Mark Hamill and Kevin Smith journey into the world of comic book fandom! Documentary filmmaker Donald Swan heads to the world''s largest comic book convention where he encounters a culture of craziness that he''s totally unprepared for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v0uYgoh74LYr6QMz23vurLD7bMP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25757'),
