  ('1007942726968385576', 'Comical Conjuring', 1903, 'Comedy', 'Georges Méliès', null, null, null, 'In a room filled with jugglers'' properties of enormous size a prestidigitateur dressed in eccentric costume enters with his assistant. The servant, believing that he would be comfortable in an armchair, sits down in it, but finds that it conceals a bucket of water, in which he falls. The juggler brings a large empty cask and puts it upon a table and fills it up with several pails of water.', 'In a room filled with jugglers'' properties of enormous size a prestidigitateur dressed in eccentric costume enters with his assistant. The servant, believing that he would be comfortable in an armchair, sits down in it, but finds that it conceals a bucket of water, in which he falls. The juggler brings a large empty cask and puts it upon a table and fills it up with several pails of water.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hwTrGcyH7xa1ROAkQVxXY87z8IA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195952'),
  ('240655460557948575', 'Comicalamities', 1928, 'Animation', 'Otto Messmer', null, null, null, 'Comicalamities'' starts with a hand drawing an incomplete Felix the cat. Felix is not satisfied with the result so he goes to a man who can fix him (finish his body and give him his black color).', 'Comicalamities'' starts with a hand drawing an incomplete Felix the cat. Felix is not satisfied with the result so he goes to a man who can fix him (finish his body and give him his black color).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2pqS3dQLoSEx2FfO93qyavLHG0a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190012'),
