  ('880531122739736453', 'Comidark Films 2: The Pawn', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Cem Yılmaz, Ahmet Sesigürgil', 'Cem Yılmaz', 'Cem Yılmaz, Çağlar Çorumlu, Özge Özpirinçci, Tansu Biçer, Tülin Özen, Celil Nalçakan, Saba Tümer, Onur Yar', null, 'Birol has given up his true passion, dancing, after getting injured in an accident. Birol leaves his job as a quilt maker at his father’s shop when his father passes away and travels to İstanbul to dance his way to the top at a talent show. But his dreams soon run up against uncanny realities.', 'Birol has given up his true passion, dancing, after getting injured in an accident. Birol leaves his job as a quilt maker at his father’s shop when his father passes away and travels to İstanbul to dance his way to the top at a talent show. But his dreams soon run up against uncanny realities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uPPN4UWDOP932SwaPYQ8tJrkgxO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:665089'),
  ('750953443626753183', 'Comidark Films: In Between', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Cem Yılmaz, Ahmet Sesigürgil', 'Cem Yılmaz', 'Cem Yılmaz, Zafer Algöz, Cem Davran, Ozan Güven, Uraz Kaygılaroğlu, Cemre Ebüzziya, Umut Kurt, Bala Atabek', null, 'Working in a ferry as a waiter, Ayzek, having a defect with his front teeth, dreams to get his front teeth fixed and to marry his girlfriend, Songül. The news gets out that the ferry company is turning over the management to a new one and the whole crew is to be interviewed. When the interviewer arrives on board, Ayzek’s world is turned upside down.', 'Working in a ferry as a waiter, Ayzek, having a defect with his front teeth, dreams to get his front teeth fixed and to marry his girlfriend, Songül. The news gets out that the ferry company is turning over the management to a new one and the whole crew is to be interviewed. When the interviewer arrives on board, Ayzek’s world is turned upside down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6eOFH9Ib9ZMDf5W7gczM9rUNk0v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:640154'),
  ('91269059883864743', 'Comidark Films: The Getaway', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Cem Yılmaz, Ahmet Sesigürgil', 'Cem Yılmaz', 'Cem Yılmaz, Zafer Algöz, Özkan Uğur, Necip Memili, Can Yılmaz, Nilperi Şahinkaya, Alişan Uğur, Sami Hamidi', null, '4 pals find themselves in the middle of an adventure involving the US Army and aliens when one of them is gone missing during their secret weekend getaway without their wives in a spa center in Kömlük.', '4 pals find themselves in the middle of an adventure involving the US Army and aliens when one of them is gone missing during their secret weekend getaway without their wives in a spa center in Kömlük.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ggxSIl6cdMtn1JJw2QGbNQOuUt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:640155'),
  ('1063908732522020313', 'Comin'' at Ya!', 1981, 'Western', 'Ferdinando Baldi, Fernando Arribas', 'Lloyd Battista, Wolf Lowenthal, Esteban Cuenca Sevilla', 'Tony Anthony, Gene Quintano, Victoria Abril, Ricardo Palacios, Lewis Gordon, Luis Barboo, Charly Bravo, Joaquín Gómez', null, 'A young couple''s wedding ceremony is brutally interrupted when a pair of outlaw brothers arrive and massacre almost everyone in sight. They kidnap the beautiful young bride and leave her husband for dead. Luckily, he only sustains a flesh wound and quickly saddles up to track down the brothers before they sell his wife and a group of other women at an auction to a group of Mexican brothel owners.', 'A young couple''s wedding ceremony is brutally interrupted when a pair of outlaw brothers arrive and massacre almost everyone in sight. They kidnap the beautiful young bride and leave her husband for dead. Luckily, he only sustains a flesh wound and quickly saddles up to track down the brothers before they sell his wife and a group of other women at an auction to a group of Mexican brothel owners.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/orTVQwOUnRwPWyoOGJZIL0hFVhi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83007'),
