  ('1143563231448848464', 'Coming 2 America', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Christophe Le Chanu, Jeffrey Hunt, Jason Suhrke', 'Kenya Barris, David Sheffield, Barry W. Blaustein', 'Eddie Murphy, Arsenio Hall, Jermaine Fowler, Leslie Jones, Tracy Morgan, KiKi Layne, Shari Headley, Wesley Snipes', 'PG-13', 'Prince Akeem Joffer is set to become King of Zamunda when he discovers he has a son he never knew about in America – a street savvy Queens native named Lavelle. Honoring his royal father''s dying wish to groom this son as the crown prince, Akeem and Semmi set off to America once again.', 'Prince Akeem Joffer is set to become King of Zamunda when he discovers he has a son he never knew about in America – a street savvy Queens native named Lavelle. Honoring his royal father''s dying wish to groom this son as the crown prince, Akeem and Semmi set off to America once again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nWBPLkqNApY5pgrJFMiI9joSI30.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:484718'),
