  ('533650997188483031', 'Communists', 2014, 'Drama', 'Jean-Marie Straub, Christophe Clavert', 'Jean-Marie Straub', 'Aldo Fruttuosi, Rosalba Curatola, Franco Fortini, Andreas von Rauch, Vladimir Baratta, Danièle Huillet, Jean-Marie Straub, Barbara Ulrich', null, 'Jean-Marie Straub pushes this musicality of blocks to a paroxysmal extreme, mixing blocks of time (40 years separate the various extracts that are going to be used, and what is to be filmed), blocks of text (Malraux, Fortini, Vittorini, Hölderlin) and blocks of language (French, Italian, German), and from this ruckus emerges the history of the world, yes, History with a capital H, and from the same movement, the political hope of its being overtaken. So this is an adventure film, about the Human adventure, still one that is always, in the end, overtaken by Nature.', 'Jean-Marie Straub pushes this musicality of blocks to a paroxysmal extreme, mixing blocks of time (40 years separate the various extracts that are going to be used, and what is to be filmed), blocks of text (Malraux, Fortini, Vittorini, Hölderlin) and blocks of language (French, Italian, German), and from this ruckus emerges the history of the world, yes, History with a capital H, and from the same movement, the political hope of its being overtaken. So this is an adventure film, about the Human adventure, still one that is always, in the end, overtaken by Nature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pdfwcViYbZGHcGltgN85ll0IicI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:300832'),
  ('409811194299705823', 'Cómo Filmar Una XXX', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Manuel Escalante, José Casillas', 'María del Pozo, Miguel Islas, Manuel Escalante', 'Alejandra Adame, Alex Ibarra, Miguel Islas, Carlos Macías, Carmen Aub, Ernesto Gómez Cruz, Gabriel Retes, Héctor Jiménez', null, 'Ulises Alpuyeca, a film initiate, wants to make his debut feature and he accepts the first opportunity offered to him to direct a film, without knowing that it is foing to be a porn movie. Gudelio Medina, photographer and Ulysses''s old mate, convinces him to do it. All participants in the film, start, unaware of the main porn star gender, making room for hilarious entanglements, but once committed to the project they must discover how to shoot a porn movie and in the process, just maybe, discover love.', 'Ulises Alpuyeca, a film initiate, wants to make his debut feature and he accepts the first opportunity offered to him to direct a film, without knowing that it is foing to be a porn movie. Gudelio Medina, photographer and Ulysses''s old mate, convinces him to do it. All participants in the film, start, unaware of the main porn star gender, making room for hilarious entanglements, but once committed to the project they must discover how to shoot a porn movie and in the process, just maybe, discover love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1pLqySm67TjYBRIruwqLByLDfl4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:273831'),
