  ('403023240828130274', 'Comrades, Almost a Love Story', 1996, 'Drama, Romance', 'Peter Chan Ho-Sun, Matthew Tang Hon-Keung, Jingle Ma Choh-Sing', 'Ivy Ho', 'Maggie Cheung, Leon Lai Ming, Eric Tsang Chi-Wai, Kristy Yang Rongru, Christopher Doyle, Joe Cheung Tung-Cho, Irene Tsu, Ding Yue', null, 'Jun arrives in Hong Kong from mainland China, hoping to be able to earn enough money to marry his girlfriend back home. He meets the streetwise Qiao and they become friends. As friendship turns into love, problems develop, and although they seem meant for each other they somehow keep missing out.', 'Jun arrives in Hong Kong from mainland China, hoping to be able to earn enough money to marry his girlfriend back home. He meets the streetwise Qiao and they become friends. As friendship turns into love, problems develop, and although they seem meant for each other they somehow keep missing out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hjlRaJEa8zuN72LmMATQ3FcCTb0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37185'),
  ('796624953168066435', 'Comradeship', 1931, 'Drama', 'G.W. Pabst, Robert Baberske, Fritz Arno Wagner', 'Peter Martin Lampel, Karl Otten, Herbert Rappaport', 'Alexander Granach, Fritz Kampers, Ernst Busch, Elisabeth Wendt, Gustav Püttjer, Oskar Höcker, Daniel Mendaille, Georges Charlia', null, 'At a mine on the shared edge of France and Germany, an underground explosion leads to the entrapment of a group of French miners. In an effort to save the trapped Frenchmen, German miners Wittkopp and Kasper take it upon themselves to traverse a crumbling war tunnel leading down into the mines. Yet, though the workers harbor no political biases against one another, their callous, less tolerant bosses hope to halt this cross-cultural rescue mission.', 'At a mine on the shared edge of France and Germany, an underground explosion leads to the entrapment of a group of French miners. In an effort to save the trapped Frenchmen, German miners Wittkopp and Kasper take it upon themselves to traverse a crumbling war tunnel leading down into the mines. Yet, though the workers harbor no political biases against one another, their callous, less tolerant bosses hope to halt this cross-cultural rescue mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dSGMzPqWQz2IvjvVx0WDD3z7zBF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42836'),
