  ('783257912770154129', 'Con chi viaggi', 2022, 'Comedy, Mystery', 'Andrea Martino De Carles, Emanuele Pasquet, Anna Guerra', 'Hugo Martín Cuervo', 'Lillo Petrolo, Alessandra Mastronardi, Michela De Rossi, Fabio Rovazzi', null, 'Four strangers meet through an app to share a car ride that turns into an adventure destined to change the lives of those involved.', 'Four strangers meet through an app to share a car ride that turns into an adventure destined to change the lives of those involved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wvKckOMqyeZlEXx0su4pQsc98As.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:893672'),
  ('676018653773251552', 'Con Mum', 2025, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Nick Green', null, 'Graham Hornigold', 'R', 'A chef''s life is upended when a jet-setting, champagne-sipping, hotel-hopping woman claims to be his long-lost mother. This documentary reveals the untold story.', 'A chef''s life is upended when a jet-setting, champagne-sipping, hotel-hopping woman claims to be his long-lost mother. This documentary reveals the untold story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iA5ZHflyzsxmR09Ce53w9Ng0tIx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1442440'),
  ('271546566420633799', 'Con tutto il Cuore', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Marco Limberti, Stefano Salemme, Ludovico Alfinito', 'Gianluca Bomprezzi, Gianluca Ansanelli, Antonio Guerriero', 'Vincenzo Salemme, Serena Autieri, Cristina Donadio, Maurizio Casagrande, Antonio Guerriero, Sergio D''Auria, Andrea Di Maria, Vincenzo Borrino', null, 'Ottavio Camaldoli is a professor of Latin and Greek. An honest and gentleman, he is considered a "fool" by everyone around him. But what would happen if this defenseless man, a victim of petty daily abuses in his social life, at work, and even at home, were to receive another man''s heart transplant? Especially if this other man, the donor, were a brutal criminal with the sinister nickname of "O Barbiere" (The Barber)? Would Ottavio Camaldoli, after inheriting the heart, automatically become a criminal? Science tells us that these are just silly, ancient beliefs. But what if Donna Carmela, the Barber''s ruthless mother, were convinced that her son is still alive thanks to the heart now beating in the professor''s chest?', 'Ottavio Camaldoli is a professor of Latin and Greek. An honest and gentleman, he is considered a "fool" by everyone around him. But what would happen if this defenseless man, a victim of petty daily abuses in his social life, at work, and even at home, were to receive another man''s heart transplant? Especially if this other man, the donor, were a brutal criminal with the sinister nickname of "O Barbiere" (The Barber)? Would Ottavio Camaldoli, after inheriting the heart, automatically become a criminal? Science tells us that these are just silly, ancient beliefs. But what if Donna Carmela, the Barber''s ruthless mother, were convinced that her son is still alive thanks to the heart now beating in the professor''s chest?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uURf3YoA8W3yTyD3DwduWdPcZkZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:776325'),
  ('293728881421364287', 'Conagher', 1991, 'TV Movie, Western', 'Reynaldo Villalobos, James R. Bagdonas', null, 'Sam Elliott, Katharine Ross, Barry Corbin, Billy Green Bush, Ken Curtis, Paul Koslo, Gavan O''Herlihy, James Parks', null, 'Mrs. Evie Teale is struggling to stay alive while raising her two children alone on a remote homestead. Conn Conagher is an honest, hardworking cowboy. Their lives are intertwined as they fight the elements, indians, outlaws, and loneliness.', 'Mrs. Evie Teale is struggling to stay alive while raising her two children alone on a remote homestead. Conn Conagher is an honest, hardworking cowboy. Their lives are intertwined as they fight the elements, indians, outlaws, and loneliness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Ur2JSDhldj5hnbNrNkIAD9Jcyk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37307'),
  ('641504401314313936', 'Conan', 1997, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Gérard Hameline', 'Charles Henry Fabian, Steve Hayes', 'Ralf Moeller, Danny Woodburn, Robert McRay, Andrew Craig', null, 'In this adaptation of the work of Robert E. Howard, Conan goes in search of the ancient Sword of Atlantis, a powerful weapon you need to deal with an evil sorcerer. Together with a group of brave warriors live an incredible adventure in which you face terrible creatures from hell.', 'In this adaptation of the work of Robert E. Howard, Conan goes in search of the ancient Sword of Atlantis, a powerful weapon you need to deal with an evil sorcerer. Together with a group of brave warriors live an incredible adventure in which you face terrible creatures from hell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5IEVeD65WcIWCYNgT9Mabe0eMk1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119423'),
  ('911993178983893700', 'Conan O''Brien Can''t Stop', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Rodman Flender, Rodman Flender, Vanessa Holtgrewe', null, 'Conan O''Brien, Andy Richter, Jimmy Vivino, Scott Healy, Stephen Colbert, Jim Carrey, Jon Hamm, Jennifer Westfeldt', 'R', 'A documentary that follows the former Tonight Show host. Filmed during Conan’s ”Legally Prohibited From Being Funny on Television” comedy tour, after his departure from the Tonight Show, taking viewers on an intimate journey of O’Brien’s life.', 'A documentary that follows the former Tonight Show host. Filmed during Conan’s ”Legally Prohibited From Being Funny on Television” comedy tour, after his departure from the Tonight Show, taking viewers on an intimate journey of O’Brien’s life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nRxb5WsKnOIdkjecBRSKksRL4ia.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65058'),
  ('613409400979593686', 'Conan the Barbarian', 1982, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Action', 'Terry Leonard, John Milius, Duke Callaghan', 'John Milius, Oliver Stone', 'Arnold Schwarzenegger, James Earl Jones, Max von Sydow, Sandahl Bergman, Ben Davidson, Cassandra Gava, Gerry Lopez, Mako', 'R', 'A horde of rampaging warriors massacre the parents of young Conan and enslave the young child for years on The Wheel of Pain. As the sole survivor of the childhood massacre, Conan is released from slavery and taught the ancient arts of fighting. Transforming himself into a killing machine, Conan travels into the wilderness to seek vengeance on Thulsa Doom, the man responsible for killing his family. In the wilderness, Conan takes up with the thieves Valeria and Subotai. The group comes upon King Osric, who wants the trio of warriors to help rescue his daughter who has joined Doom in the hills.', 'A horde of rampaging warriors massacre the parents of young Conan and enslave the young child for years on The Wheel of Pain. As the sole survivor of the childhood massacre, Conan is released from slavery and taught the ancient arts of fighting. Transforming himself into a killing machine, Conan travels into the wilderness to seek vengeance on Thulsa Doom, the man responsible for killing his family. In the wilderness, Conan takes up with the thieves Valeria and Subotai. The group comes upon King Osric, who wants the trio of warriors to help rescue his daughter who has joined Doom in the hills.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qw2A587Ee61IwcSOLNFRhuOACZZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9387'),
  ('713171943442654841', 'Conan the Barbarian', 2011, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Action', 'Petya Evtimova, Mark Roper, Rosen Marinkov', 'Joshua Oppenheimer, Sean Hood, Thomas Dean Donnelly', 'Jason Momoa, Stephen Lang, Rachel Nichols, Ron Perlman, Rose McGowan, Bob Sapp, Leo Howard, Steven O''Donnell', 'R', 'A quest that begins as a personal vendetta for the fierce Cimmerian warrior soon turns into an epic battle against hulking rivals, horrific monsters, and impossible odds, as Conan realizes he is the only hope of saving the great nations of Hyboria from an encroaching reign of supernatural evil.', 'A quest that begins as a personal vendetta for the fierce Cimmerian warrior soon turns into an epic battle against hulking rivals, horrific monsters, and impossible odds, as Conan realizes he is the only hope of saving the great nations of Hyboria from an encroaching reign of supernatural evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sSMjZmOtqzlRTYSUFPmIXTV4rhh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37430'),
  ('1027632202581915396', 'Conan the Destroyer', 1984, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Action', 'Richard Fleischer, Jack Cardiff', 'Stanley Mann', 'Arnold Schwarzenegger, Grace Jones, Wilt Chamberlain, Mako, Tracey Walter, Sarah Douglas, Olivia D''Abo, Pat Roach', 'PG', 'Conan is commissioned by the evil queen Taramis to safely escort a teen princess and her powerful bodyguard to a far away castle to retrieve the magic Horn of Dagoth. Unknown to Conan, the queen plans to sacrifice the princess when she returns and inherit her kingdom after the bodyguard kills Conan. The queen''s plans fail to take into consideration Conan''s strength and cunning and the abilities of his sidekicks: the eccentric wizard Akiro, the warrior woman Zula, and the inept Malak. Together the hero and his allies must defeat both mortal and supernatural foes in this voyage to sword-and-sorcery land.', 'Conan is commissioned by the evil queen Taramis to safely escort a teen princess and her powerful bodyguard to a far away castle to retrieve the magic Horn of Dagoth. Unknown to Conan, the queen plans to sacrifice the princess when she returns and inherit her kingdom after the bodyguard kills Conan. The queen''s plans fail to take into consideration Conan''s strength and cunning and the abilities of his sidekicks: the eccentric wizard Akiro, the warrior woman Zula, and the inept Malak. Together the hero and his allies must defeat both mortal and supernatural foes in this voyage to sword-and-sorcery land.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m5i7S46DT1ESy7URkh2l92awGRr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9610'),
  ('35480117644539698', 'Conceiving Ada', 1999, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Fantasy', 'Lynn Hershman-Leeson, Bill Zarchy, Hiro Narita', 'Lynn Hershman-Leeson, Eileen Jones', 'Tilda Swinton, Francesca Faridany, Timothy Leary, Karen Black, John Perry Barlow, John O''Keefe, J.D. Wolfe, Owen Murphy', 'NR', 'Emmy Coer, a computer genius, devises a method of communicating with the past by tapping into undying information waves. She manages to reach the world of Ada Lovelace, founder of the idea of a computer language and proponent of the possibilities of the "difference engine." Ada''s ideas were stifled and unfulfilled because of the reality of life as a woman in the nineteenth century. Emmy has a plan to defeat death and the past using her own DNA as a communicative agent to the past, bringing Ada to the present. But what are the possible ramifications?', 'Emmy Coer, a computer genius, devises a method of communicating with the past by tapping into undying information waves. She manages to reach the world of Ada Lovelace, founder of the idea of a computer language and proponent of the possibilities of the "difference engine." Ada''s ideas were stifled and unfulfilled because of the reality of life as a woman in the nineteenth century. Emmy has a plan to defeat death and the past using her own DNA as a communicative agent to the past, bringing Ada to the present. But what are the possible ramifications?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vDvLDFvqbmm9M1LeuHSMTbEtPK5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96484'),
  ('1119314737211816510', 'Conception', 2005, 'Drama', 'José Eduardo Belmonte', 'Luis Carlos Pacca, Breno Alex', 'Matheus Nachtergaele, Milhem Cortaz, Juliano Cazarré, Rosanne Mulholland, Gabrielle Lopes, Murilo Grossi, Zepedro Gollo, Rinaldo Costa', null, 'A group of bored well-off young adults come up with anarchic concept of Conceptionism, that promotes absolute looseness when it comes to sex and drugs, but total rejection of money and ego. However, their movement won''t last long.', 'A group of bored well-off young adults come up with anarchic concept of Conceptionism, that promotes absolute looseness when it comes to sex and drugs, but total rejection of money and ego. However, their movement won''t last long.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jCtK6jIQgNSo8NueYuN9THZxREV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87217'),
  ('677890835968581061', 'Concert for George', 2003, 'Music, Documentary', 'Eric Clapton, Jeff Lynne, David Leland', null, 'Joe Brown, Eric Clapton, Jools Holland, Sam Brown, Jeff Lynne, Paul McCartney, Tom Petty, Billy Preston', 'PG-13', 'As a memorial to George Harrison on the first anniversary of his passing, The Concert for George was held at the Royal Albert Hall in London on 29 November 2002 . Organized by Harrison''s widow, Olivia, and son, Dhani, and arranged under the musical direction of Eric Clapton and Jeff Lynne. A benefit for Harrison''s Material World Charitable Foundation, the all-star concert took place on the day of the first anniversary of his death. Proceeds from the film also went to the Material World Charitable Foundation. The film was shot using discreet cameras from over twelve locations.', 'As a memorial to George Harrison on the first anniversary of his passing, The Concert for George was held at the Royal Albert Hall in London on 29 November 2002 . Organized by Harrison''s widow, Olivia, and son, Dhani, and arranged under the musical direction of Eric Clapton and Jeff Lynne. A benefit for Harrison''s Material World Charitable Foundation, the all-star concert took place on the day of the first anniversary of his death. Proceeds from the film also went to the Material World Charitable Foundation. The film was shot using discreet cameras from over twelve locations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mpz7cVFuwC9QnNMb2SjZOqzCJUx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28236'),
  ('1112222413349939496', 'Concert of Requests', 1967, 'Drama', 'Krzysztof Kieślowski, Lechosław Trzęsowski', 'Krzysztof Kieślowski', 'Ryszard Dembiński, Jerzy Fedorowicz, Ewa Konarska, Waldemar Korzeniowsky, Roman Talarczyk, Andrzej Titkow', null, 'A young couple leave a lake campsite on motorbike at the same time as a bus full of youths. The boy accidently loses a tent along the road which is picked up by those in the bus who offer a trade of the tent for his girl.', 'A young couple leave a lake campsite on motorbike at the same time as a bus full of youths. The boy accidently loses a tent along the road which is picked up by those in the bus who offer a trade of the tent for his girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b4OWH32ahb8ZKOApv7Fl4ZAvuvq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49101'),
  ('880879044793652447', 'Conclave', 2024, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Edward Berger, Elena Real-Davies, Roberta Federico', 'Peter Straughan', 'Ralph Fiennes, Stanley Tucci, John Lithgow, Isabella Rossellini, Lucian Msamati, Carlos Diehz, Sergio Castellitto, Brían F. O''Byrne', 'PG', 'After the unexpected death of the Pope, Cardinal Lawrence is tasked with managing the covert and ancient ritual of electing a new one. Sequestered in the Vatican with the Catholic Church’s most powerful leaders until the process is complete, Lawrence finds himself at the center of a conspiracy that could lead to its downfall.', 'After the unexpected death of the Pope, Cardinal Lawrence is tasked with managing the covert and ancient ritual of electing a new one. Sequestered in the Vatican with the Catholic Church’s most powerful leaders until the process is complete, Lawrence finds himself at the center of a conspiracy that could lead to its downfall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vYEyxF1UT779RiEalpMjUT6kfdf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:974576'),
  ('64190145077125021', 'Concorde Affair', 1979, 'Action, Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Ruggero Deodato, Goffredo Unger', 'Renzo Genta, Alberto Fioretti', 'James Franciscus, Mimsy Farmer, Venantino Venantini, Joseph Cotten, Van Johnson, Fiamma Maglione, Edmund Purdom, Francisco Charles', null, 'A reporter tries to stop the crash of an aircraft after uncovering an airline''s plot to save their business by sabotaging Concorde flights and have them decommissioned.', 'A reporter tries to stop the crash of an aircraft after uncovering an airline''s plot to save their business by sabotaging Concorde flights and have them decommissioned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7hmwQuLfKzl1b9iPBJJLLiL82gU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81772'),
  ('443947370565321861', 'Concrete', 2004, 'Horror, Crime', 'Hiromu Nakumura', 'Hiroshi Kanno', 'Miki Komori, Katsuya Kobayashi, Masanori Machida, Kensuke Mano, Mika Mifune, Yôichirô Momose, Toshiya Nagasawa, Akihiro Nakatani', null, 'On the 25th of November 1988, four youths abducted and held Furuta Junko in the house of one of the captors. Subjected to rape, torture, and humiliation, Junko had no hope of escape as the manhunt was stalled by the captors forcing her to tell her parents that she was ok. For 41 harrowing days, Junko had to endure unimaginable suffering at the hands of these four individuals. Finally, after losing in a game of mahjong solitaire, they beat her with an iron dumbbell and set on fire with lighter fluid. She died later that day from shock. In an attempt to hide their crime they buried her in cement and thus the name ''Concrete Encased High School Murder Case'' was born as Japan had to confront the horrors of this crime. The perpetrators disposed the drum in a tract of reclaimed land in Koto, Tokyo.', 'On the 25th of November 1988, four youths abducted and held Furuta Junko in the house of one of the captors. Subjected to rape, torture, and humiliation, Junko had no hope of escape as the manhunt was stalled by the captors forcing her to tell her parents that she was ok. For 41 harrowing days, Junko had to endure unimaginable suffering at the hands of these four individuals. Finally, after losing in a game of mahjong solitaire, they beat her with an iron dumbbell and set on fire with lighter fluid. She died later that day from shock. In an attempt to hide their crime they buried her in cement and thus the name ''Concrete Encased High School Murder Case'' was born as Japan had to confront the horrors of this crime. The perpetrators disposed the drum in a tract of reclaimed land in Koto, Tokyo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lSJKjUfVCeTlJ1TSKAh2FgYkoDG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111934'),
  ('270054111215575617', 'Concrete Cowboy', 2020, 'Drama, Western', 'Ricky Staub, Minka Farthing-Kohl', 'Ricky Staub, Dan Walser', 'Caleb McLaughlin, Idris Elba, Jharrel Jerome, Byron Bowers, Lorraine Toussaint, Method Man, Jamil Prattis, Ivannah Mercedes', 'R', 'Sent to live with his estranged father for the summer, a rebellious teen finds kinship in a tight-knit Philadelphia community of Black cowboys.', 'Sent to live with his estranged father for the summer, a rebellious teen finds kinship in a tight-knit Philadelphia community of Black cowboys.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qRW2poVt06WCVlIhrolWS5af4YV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:621954'),
  ('627234565967812674', 'Concrete Cowboys', 1979, 'Crime, Action, TV Movie', 'Alan Stensvold, Burt Kennedy, Earle Hagen', 'Jimmy Sangster', 'Jerry Reed, Tom Selleck, Morgan Fairchild, Claude Akins, Lucille Benson, Gene Evans, Randy Powell, Roy Acuff', null, 'Two Montana saddletramps head to Nashville to open up a detective agency. At first, the agency begins on a lark but, soon, they get involved in a case involving a kidnapped singer and an intricate blackmail scheme.', 'Two Montana saddletramps head to Nashville to open up a detective agency. At first, the agency begins on a lark but, soon, they get involved in a case involving a kidnapped singer and an intricate blackmail scheme.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yOSpOHiFlYNEm6Kmtz9xjvCfVZo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:237802'),
  ('195908388266999850', 'Concrete Football', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Jesse Adang, Syrine Boulanouar, Raphaël Vandenbussche', null, 'Riyad Mahrez, Serge Aurier, Medhi Benatia, Ousmane Dembélé, MHD, Niska, Gradur, Adrien Gasmi', null, 'The development of professional soccer worldwide owes a great debt to the soccer – or "football" – that is played on the streets of France.', 'The development of professional soccer worldwide owes a great debt to the soccer – or "football" – that is played on the streets of France.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/syfJ5jhgj4fed74KesS8WSvQvlW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:474070'),
  ('522758249718655409', 'Concrete Romance', 2007, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Marco Martani, Federica Russo, Stefano Maria Mioni', 'Marco Martani, Fausto Brizzi, Luca Poldelmengo', 'Nicolas Vaporidis, Giorgio Faletti, Carolina Crescentini, Dario Cassini, Alfredo Pea, Ninetto Davoli, Thamisanqa Molepo, Fabio Camilli', null, 'A climax of brutality and violence after a young man hits some cars in a rush.', 'A climax of brutality and violence after a young man hits some cars in a rush.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pdxu2zIcyOqkZMVesOPcbHnpGti.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53805'),
  ('257250021037847734', 'Concrete Utopia', 2023, 'Thriller, Action', 'Kim Jung-woo, Cho Hyoung-rae, Lee Gil-gyu', 'Lee Sin-ji, Um Tae-hwa', 'Lee Byung-hun, Park Seo-jun, Park Bo-young, Kim Sun-young, Kim Do-yoon, Park Ji-hu, Kim Hak-seon, Gong Min-jeung', 'NR', 'The world has been reduced to rubble by a massive earthquake. While no one knows for sure how far the ruins stretch, or what the cause of the earthquake may be, in the heart of Seoul there is only one apartment building left standing. It is called Hwang Gung Apartments. As time passes, outsiders start coming in to Hwang Gung Apartments trying to escape the extreme cold. Before long, the apartment residents are unable to cope with the increasing numbers. Feeling a threat to their very survival, the residents enact a special measure.', 'The world has been reduced to rubble by a massive earthquake. While no one knows for sure how far the ruins stretch, or what the cause of the earthquake may be, in the heart of Seoul there is only one apartment building left standing. It is called Hwang Gung Apartments. As time passes, outsiders start coming in to Hwang Gung Apartments trying to escape the extreme cold. Before long, the apartment residents are unable to cope with the increasing numbers. Feeling a threat to their very survival, the residents enact a special measure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4l68KHxnPSow8MvnGUpjqLzJtLJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:729854'),
  ('379205097185274154', 'Concussion', 2013, 'Drama', 'Stacie Passon, David Kruta', 'Stacie Passon', 'Robin Weigert, Maggie Siff, Johnathan Tchaikovsky, Julie Fain Lawrence, Laila Robins, Ben Shenkman, Janel Moloney, Daniel London', 'R', 'After a blow to the head, Abby decides she can''t do it anymore. Her life just can''t be only about the house, the kids and the wife. She needs more: she needs to be Eleanor.', 'After a blow to the head, Abby decides she can''t do it anymore. Her life just can''t be only about the house, the kids and the wife. She needs more: she needs to be Eleanor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uib2Khi2wynz9BEAoUBIvEE64vB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156965'),
  ('876454896943814450', 'Concussion', 2015, 'Drama', 'Peter Landesman, Salvatore Totino, Christina Myal', 'Peter Landesman, Jeanne Marie Laskas', 'Will Smith, Alec Baldwin, Albert Brooks, Gugu Mbatha-Raw, David Morse, Arliss Howard, Mike O''Malley, Eddie Marsan', 'PG-13', 'A dramatic thriller based on the incredible true David vs. Goliath story of American immigrant Dr. Bennet Omalu, the brilliant forensic neuropathologist who made the first discovery of CTE, a football-related brain trauma, in a pro player and fought for the truth to be known. Omalu''s emotional quest puts him at dangerous odds with one of the most powerful institutions in the world.', 'A dramatic thriller based on the incredible true David vs. Goliath story of American immigrant Dr. Bennet Omalu, the brilliant forensic neuropathologist who made the first discovery of CTE, a football-related brain trauma, in a pro player and fought for the truth to be known. Omalu''s emotional quest puts him at dangerous odds with one of the most powerful institutions in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gseayWAIFt3GQrEUNuUcYxT77Ud.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:321741'),
  ('1005142886502032879', 'Condemned', 2015, 'Horror', 'Eli Morgan Gesner, Richard Henkels', 'Eli Morgan Gesner', 'Johnny Messner, Michael DeMello, Lydia Hearst, Jordan Gelber, Tuffy Questell, Kevin Smith Kirkwood, Anthony Chisholm, Genevieve Hudson-Price', null, 'Fed up with her parents'' bickering, poor-little-rich-girl Maya (Dylan Penn) moves in with her boyfriend who is squatting in an old, condemned building on Manhattan''s Lower East Side. With neighbors that are meth heads, junkies and degenerates, this depraved hell hole is even more toxic than it appears: After a virus born from their combined noxious waste and garbage infects the building''s residents, one by one, they succumb to a terrifying pathogen that turns them into bloodthirsty, rampaging killers and transforms their building into a savage slaughterhouse.', 'Fed up with her parents'' bickering, poor-little-rich-girl Maya (Dylan Penn) moves in with her boyfriend who is squatting in an old, condemned building on Manhattan''s Lower East Side. With neighbors that are meth heads, junkies and degenerates, this depraved hell hole is even more toxic than it appears: After a virus born from their combined noxious waste and garbage infects the building''s residents, one by one, they succumb to a terrifying pathogen that turns them into bloodthirsty, rampaging killers and transforms their building into a savage slaughterhouse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9kGzfY3nuMfOp3GxLjOlh7MUCOr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:368256'),
  ('565228439991771677', 'Condemned to Live', 1935, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Frank R. Strayer, Melville Shyer, M.A. Andersen', 'Karen DeWolf', 'Ralph Morgan, Pedro de Cordoba, Maxine Doyle, Russell Gleason, Mischa Auer, Lucy Beaumont, Carl Stockdale, Barbara Bedford', null, 'After a series of murders, a man finds out that his mother was bitten by a vampire bat during her pregnancy, and he believes that he may be the vampire committing the murders.', 'After a series of murders, a man finds out that his mother was bitten by a vampire bat during her pregnancy, and he believes that he may be the vampire committing the murders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2StercLz8j8YG7frZS1fNkB8xyV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41024'),
  ('310699522218733452', 'Condemned!', 1929, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Wesley Ruggles, Gregg Toland, George Barnes', 'Sidney Howard', 'Ronald Colman, Ann Harding, Louis Wolheim, Dudley Digges, William Elmer, Wilhelm von Brincken, Albert Kingsley, Constantine Romanoff', null, 'Suave thief Colman is sent to Devil''s Island, where he becomes romantically involved with the wife of sadistic warden Digges.', 'Suave thief Colman is sent to Devil''s Island, where he becomes romantically involved with the wife of sadistic warden Digges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nbOOViVVKb2A3Bw7P2Dto8P6N9r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104208'),
  ('723384508424801828', 'Condones.com', 2009, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Abraham Mancilla', 'Rosa María Chávez, Abraham Mancilla', 'ramon marquez, Sandra Echeverría, Martha Acuña, Mark Tacher, Wendy Álvarez, Gerardo Albarrán, Irene Arcila, Michel Brown', null, 'Timo has a girlfriend but he cheated on her and his lover is now pregnant.', 'Timo has a girlfriend but he cheated on her and his lover is now pregnant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lNhbu5yMQ0NVlSjWlBXfYbGrtOB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88280'),
  ('284562014617473549', 'Condor''s Nest', 2023, 'Action, War', 'Phil Blattenberger', 'Phil Blattenberger', 'Michael Ironside, Arnold Vosloo, Jackson Rathbone, Jorge Garcia, Bruce Davison, James Urbaniak, Brandon Tyler Moore, Michael Tourek', 'R', 'American war veteran Will Spalding has tracked the sadistic Nazi Colonel who executed his bomber crew during WWII to a remote location in South America. But he is in for more than he bargained for when he uncovers a secret Nazi headquarters known as the Condor''s Nest.', 'American war veteran Will Spalding has tracked the sadistic Nazi Colonel who executed his bomber crew during WWII to a remote location in South America. But he is in for more than he bargained for when he uncovers a secret Nazi headquarters known as the Condor''s Nest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aBAsCMzsbGlFtQFqeWsKWM6hvOE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1062482'),
