  ('133693053986777823', 'Condorman', 1981, 'Comedy, Action, Adventure', 'Charles F. Wheeler, Charles Jarrott', 'Marc Stirdivant', 'Michael Crawford, Oliver Reed, Barbara Carrera, James Hampton, Jean-Pierre Kalfon, Dana Elcar, Vernon Dobtcheff, Robert Arden', 'PG', 'Comic artist and writer Woody performs a simple courier operation for his friend Harry who works for the CIA. But when he successfully fends off hostile agents, he earns the respect of the beautiful Natalia, who requests his assistance for her defection. Woody uses this request as leverage to use the CIA''s resources to bring his comic book creation, Condorman, to life to battle the evil Krokov.', 'Comic artist and writer Woody performs a simple courier operation for his friend Harry who works for the CIA. But when he successfully fends off hostile agents, he earns the respect of the beautiful Natalia, who requests his assistance for her defection. Woody uses this request as leverage to use the CIA''s resources to bring his comic book creation, Condorman, to life to battle the evil Krokov.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wRe9kAvjN5IGAjPd0oCKhjyQDt0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19379'),
  ('927545229217945323', 'Conduct Unbecoming', 1975, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Michael Anderson', 'Barry England, Robert Enders', 'Michael York, Richard Attenborough, Trevor Howard, Stacy Keach, Christopher Plummer, Susannah York, James Faulkner, Persis Khambatta', 'PG', 'A company of British soldiers in colonial India is shaken when the widow of their most honored hero is assaulted. A young officer must defend a fellow lieutenant from the charges in an unusual court-martial, while investigating the deepening mystery behind the attack.', 'A company of British soldiers in colonial India is shaken when the widow of their most honored hero is assaulted. A young officer must defend a fellow lieutenant from the charges in an unusual court-martial, while investigating the deepening mystery behind the attack.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2TgZDGYojNRhdSFGjaJS5XNliUw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59144'),
  ('575319379382590492', 'Conduct Zero', 2002, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Joh Keun-shik, Cho Yong-kyu, Jeon In-hwan', 'Joh Keun-shik, Lee Hae-jun, Lee Hae-young', 'Ryoo Seung-bum, Gong Hyo-jin, Lim Eun-kyung, Kim Kwang-il, Kim Hee-jung, Park Hyo-ju, Geum Bo-ra, Seo Myung-soo', null, 'When Joong-pil, the biggest bully in his high-school by far finds himself harboring feelings for a classmate, his entire identity is thrown off balance. Suddenly his smoking, his drinking, his constant swearing and his habit of pushing underclassmen into walls don''t seem like good habits anymore. Without his nastiness, who is he? He might just like this girl enough to find out, if he can figure out how.', 'When Joong-pil, the biggest bully in his high-school by far finds himself harboring feelings for a classmate, his entire identity is thrown off balance. Suddenly his smoking, his drinking, his constant swearing and his habit of pushing underclassmen into walls don''t seem like good habits anymore. Without his nastiness, who is he? He might just like this girl enough to find out, if he can figure out how.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qSWc6XPqhyijn3MIsftiGl3FfYS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83830'),
  ('418407143613257883', 'Cone of Silence', 1960, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Charles Frend, Arthur Grant, Basil Rayburn', 'Robert Westerby', 'Michael Craig, Peter Cushing, Bernard Lee, Elizabeth Seal, George Sanders, André Morell, Gordon Jackson, Charles Tingwell', 'NR', 'A seasoned pilot is condemned for an error which causes a crash. The pilot later dies in a crash with similar circumstances and an examiner looks for scientific reasons for the crashes.', 'A seasoned pilot is condemned for an error which causes a crash. The pilot later dies in a crash with similar circumstances and an examiner looks for scientific reasons for the crashes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fWR6OfTEnjstNdpGBlMXllewHvu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164578'),
  ('1024362189248991468', 'Coneheads', 1993, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Steve Barron, Francis Kenny', 'Tom Davis, Dan Aykroyd, Bonnie Turner', 'Dan Aykroyd, Jane Curtin, Michael McKean, Laraine Newman, Jason Alexander, Lisa Jane Persky, Chris Farley, David Spade', 'PG', 'A pair of aliens arrive on Earth to prepare for invasion, but crash instead. With enormous cone-shaped heads, robotlike walks and an appetite for toilet paper, aliens Beldar and Prymatt don''t exactly blend in with the population of Paramus, N.J. But for some reason, everyone believes them when they say they''re from France.', 'A pair of aliens arrive on Earth to prepare for invasion, but crash instead. With enormous cone-shaped heads, robotlike walks and an appetite for toilet paper, aliens Beldar and Prymatt don''t exactly blend in with the population of Paramus, N.J. But for some reason, everyone believes them when they say they''re from France.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vlpQnf0rl0FpMjWLS0TNd8Bog2F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9612'),
  ('46225460495730302', 'Confess, Fletch', 2022, 'Comedy, Mystery, Crime', 'Sam Levy, Tim LaDue, Giorgio Melidoni', 'Greg Mottola, Zev Borow', 'Jon Hamm, Lorenza Izzo, Kyle MacLachlan, Roy Wood Jr., Ayden Mayeri, Marcia Gay Harden, John Slattery, Annie Mumolo', 'R', 'The roguishly charming and endlessly troublesome Fletch becomes the prime suspect in a murder case while searching for a stolen art collection. The only way to prove his innocence? Find out which of the long list of suspects is the culprit - from the eccentric art dealer and a missing playboy to a crazy neighbor and Fletch’s Italian girlfriend. Crime, in fact, has never been this disorganized.', 'The roguishly charming and endlessly troublesome Fletch becomes the prime suspect in a murder case while searching for a stolen art collection. The only way to prove his innocence? Find out which of the long list of suspects is the culprit - from the eccentric art dealer and a missing playboy to a crazy neighbor and Fletch’s Italian girlfriend. Crime, in fact, has never been this disorganized.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h2oyiPu7aql1s1mLDoKBNAH7p3B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:724665'),
