  ('608403102634802064', 'Confession Note - That SEX I Got Wet!', 1997, null, 'Ryōji Shinmura', 'Chiaki Hashiba', 'Hitoe Ootake, Hitomi Shiraishi, Ijirî Okada, Kyoko Tachibana', null, 'An Eros drama about the shocking sexual experiences of ordinary women, based on a live-action version of the popular section of “Weekly Asahi Geino”. Starring Hitoe Otake, who created an era in the 1990s. The bonus footage includes “Kokuhaku-noteki, a resume that can’t be told to anyone” starring Kaori Asada.', 'An Eros drama about the shocking sexual experiences of ordinary women, based on a live-action version of the popular section of “Weekly Asahi Geino”. Starring Hitoe Otake, who created an era in the 1990s. The bonus footage includes “Kokuhaku-noteki, a resume that can’t be told to anyone” starring Kaori Asada.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f3cDeWtL9jfkqyyzeU99BKXIWUW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1077347'),
  ('837085951688544386', 'Confession of a Child of the Century', 2012, 'Drama', 'Sylvie Verheyde, Nicolas Gaurin', 'Sylvie Verheyde', 'Charlotte Gainsbourg, Pete Doherty, August Diehl, Lily Cole, Volker Bruch, Guillaume Gallienne, Karole Rocher, Rhian Rees', null, 'Paris, 1830: Octave, betrayed by his mistress, sinks into despair and debauchery. His father''s death leads him to the country where he meets Brigitte, a widow who is ten years his elder. Octave falls in love passionately, but will he have the courage to believe in it?', 'Paris, 1830: Octave, betrayed by his mistress, sinks into despair and debauchery. His father''s death leads him to the country where he meets Brigitte, a widow who is ten years his elder. Octave falls in love passionately, but will he have the courage to believe in it?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zTgStzsPDMYPhElRs5awwH80U3X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58559'),
