  ('119305612178782215', 'Confession of Murder', 2012, 'Action, Thriller', 'Kim Gyeong-seok, Kim Gi-tae, Jung Byung-gil', 'Jung Byung-gil', 'Jung Jae-young, Park Si-hoo, Jung Hae-kyun, Kim Young-ae, Choi Won-young, Kim Jong-goo, Jang Kwang, Cho Eun-ji', null, 'A serial killer reappears 15 years after his murder spree with a book detailing his crimes. The resentful cop who failed to catch him before is assigned to protect him. The families of the victims plan revenge. And as the media circus spirals out of control, a masked man called "J" appears claiming to be the real killer.', 'A serial killer reappears 15 years after his murder spree with a book detailing his crimes. The resentful cop who failed to catch him before is assigned to protect him. The families of the victims plan revenge. And as the media circus spirals out of control, a masked man called "J" appears claiming to be the real killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aA2WdIhq7e3grXFg6FZemRvbAIM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140212'),
  ('84852867980822398', 'Confession of Pain', 2006, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Andrew Lau Wai-Keung, Alan Mak Siu-Fai, Lee Tat-Chiu', 'Felix Chong Man-Keung, Alan Mak Siu-Fai', 'Tony Leung Chiu-wai, Takeshi Kaneshiro, Shu Qi, Xu Jinglei, Chapman To Man-Chat, Vincent Wan Yeung-Ming, Elliot Ngok Wah, Emme Wong Yi-Man', null, 'In a city of love and prosperity, a city of lost hope and premature death, veteran detective Hei feels it all: the hurt, the helplessness, the horror. When his father-in-law, the billionaire benefactor Kim, is gruesomely murdered in his palatial mansion, he enlists the assistance of his former partner turned private detective.', 'In a city of love and prosperity, a city of lost hope and premature death, veteran detective Hei feels it all: the hurt, the helplessness, the horror. When his father-in-law, the billionaire benefactor Kim, is gruesomely murdered in his palatial mansion, he enlists the assistance of his former partner turned private detective.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xzj1XnM3TIF3OQ95DC94Nsa5zdh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18877'),
  ('378335977043041295', 'Confessions', 2010, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Tetsuya Nakashima, Takayuki Masuo, Atsushi Ozawa', 'Tetsuya Nakashima', 'Takako Matsu, Masaki Okada, Yoshino Kimura, Yukito Nishii, Kaoru Fujiwara, Ai Hashimoto, Naoki Ichii, Kai Inowaki', null, 'Devastated at the death of her four-year-old daughter, a grieving middle school teacher is horrified to discover that her students aren''t as innocent as she thinks.', 'Devastated at the death of her four-year-old daughter, a grieving middle school teacher is horrified to discover that her students aren''t as innocent as she thinks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xQcnx6jMuPRCeidotgVy6YIls6p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54186'),
  ('823701964048608964', 'Confessions', 2023, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Carlos Carrera, Marya Saab', 'Josué Ramos, Alberto Chimal', 'Claudia Ramírez, Luis Gnecco, Emilio Treviño, Juan Manuel Bernal, Ana Claudia Talancón, Victoria Olivares, María del Carmen Farias, Miguel Ángel Barrera', null, 'When a young girl from a wealthy Mexico City family disappears, a man arrives to discuss the girl''s return, asking for the confession of a family member that has committed a terrible act. One by one, confession by confession, the intruder exposes each member of the family, revealing their deepest and most shocking secrets.', 'When a young girl from a wealthy Mexico City family disappears, a man arrives to discuss the girl''s return, asking for the confession of a family member that has committed a terrible act. One by one, confession by confession, the intruder exposes each member of the family, revealing their deepest and most shocking secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/MKXpmn7a59NKHSiYQR6OOl9TSq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1103501'),
  ('340211539579698585', 'Confessions Among Actresses', 1971, 'Drama', 'Yoshishige Yoshida, Motokichi Hasegawa', 'Yoshishige Yoshida, Masahiro Yamada', 'Mariko Okada, Ruriko Asaoka, Ineko Arima, Rentaro Mikuni, Isao Kimura, Miyoko Akaza, Kiwako Taichi, Kazuko Inano', null, 'In this intricately layered Japanese film, the nature of actresses and what they gain from acting is explored. The lives of three actresses are laid bare, and scenes from their lives are woven in and out of interviews with each of them. Each of them has experienced a traumatic event which contributes to their particular enjoyment of becoming someone else in dramatic roles.', 'In this intricately layered Japanese film, the nature of actresses and what they gain from acting is explored. The lives of three actresses are laid bare, and scenes from their lives are woven in and out of interviews with each of them. Each of them has experienced a traumatic event which contributes to their particular enjoyment of becoming someone else in dramatic roles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wsvPG4cCu5DEkvCM03moH10ZVIl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:169905'),
  ('1044118302531489703', 'Confessions from a Holiday Camp', 1977, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Norman Cohen, Bill Westley, Weston Drury Jr.', 'Christopher Wood', 'Robin Askwith, Anthony Booth, Doris Hare, Bill Maynard, Sheila White, Colin Crompton, Liz Fraser, Linda Hayden', null, 'Timmy Lea and his brother-in-law Sidney Noggett are working as entertainment officers at Funfrall, a typical British holiday camp. The staff are lazy and inefficient, preferring to laze by the pool rather than organise activities for the holiday campers. A new owner, Mr. Whitemonk, an ex-prison officer, takes over the camp and is determined to install discipline into the staff. He is on the verge of dismissing Timmy and Sidney; however, Sidney''s suggestion of organising a beauty contest changes his mind.', 'Timmy Lea and his brother-in-law Sidney Noggett are working as entertainment officers at Funfrall, a typical British holiday camp. The staff are lazy and inefficient, preferring to laze by the pool rather than organise activities for the holiday campers. A new owner, Mr. Whitemonk, an ex-prison officer, takes over the camp and is determined to install discipline into the staff. He is on the verge of dismissing Timmy and Sidney; however, Sidney''s suggestion of organising a beauty contest changes his mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nv8ecPVoCxSf1zy5baudqKlTxzZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50076'),
  ('524545516252509200', 'Confessions from the David Galaxy Affair', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Willy Roe', null, 'Alan Lake, Glynn Edwards, Bernie Winters, Mary Millington, Anthony Booth, Kenny Lynch, Rosemary England, Queenie Watts', null, 'Professional astrologer and lothario David Galaxy (Alan Lake, aka Mr Diana Dors), finds himself entangled with the Law and must be able to provide an alibi to clear himself from an incident that involved robbery and murder five years previously.', 'Professional astrologer and lothario David Galaxy (Alan Lake, aka Mr Diana Dors), finds himself entangled with the Law and must be able to provide an alibi to clear himself from an incident that involved robbery and murder five years previously.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5DXQR7gqvpXh7PK1ZaZb0bUQ3zm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117930'),
  ('163903614923791030', 'Confessions of a Brazilian Call Girl', 2011, 'Drama', 'Marcus Baldini, Luciana Baptista, Gabriela Ribeiro', 'José de Carvalho, Homero Olivetto, Antônia Pellegrino', 'Deborah Secco, Cássio Gabus Mendes, Drica Moraes, Fabiula Nascimento, Cristina Lago, Guta Ruiz, Clarisse Abujamra, Luciano Chirolli', null, 'Rachel is a girl, adopted by an upper middle class family, who rebelled at 17 and left her family and studies at a traditional college in Sao Paulo to become a sexy call girl. Shortly after starting work, she decided to write a blog about her experiences. Since some clients thought she looked like a surfer she adopted the name "Surfistinha" which means little surfer girl.', 'Rachel is a girl, adopted by an upper middle class family, who rebelled at 17 and left her family and studies at a traditional college in Sao Paulo to become a sexy call girl. Shortly after starting work, she decided to write a blog about her experiences. Since some clients thought she looked like a surfer she adopted the name "Surfistinha" which means little surfer girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9htMnu5Zg3WEpz6SccgzfxWfDPw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58235'),
