  ('512937515941527092', 'Confessions of a Nazi Spy', 1939, 'Drama, War', 'Ernest Haller, Anatole Litvak, Sol Polito', 'Leon G. Turrou', 'Edward G. Robinson, Francis Lederer, George Sanders, Paul Lukas, Henry O''Neill, Dorothy Tree, Lya Lys, Grace Stafford', 'NR', 'FBI agent Ed Renard investigates the pre-War espionage activities of the German-American Bund.', 'FBI agent Ed Renard investigates the pre-War espionage activities of the German-American Bund.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/344MutCY2Xd6nxztXa1tkTR9Nml.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99920'),
  ('673055201283212447', 'Confessions of a Police Captain', 1971, 'Crime, Drama', 'Damiano Damiani, Claudio Ragona', 'Salvatore Laurani, Damiano Damiani', 'Franco Nero, Martin Balsam, Claudio Gora, Marilù Tolo, Luciano Catenacci, Giancarlo Prete, Arturo Dominici, Michele Gammino', 'PG', 'A police captain arranges the release of a criminally insane prisoner, who soon winds up dead. When the District Attorney takes on the case, he uncovers corruption in the department and vows to take down the man who''s responsible.', 'A police captain arranges the release of a criminally insane prisoner, who soon winds up dead. When the District Attorney takes on the case, he uncovers corruption in the department and vows to take down the man who''s responsible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s7761FscQjnbEQTWYzvficLGunD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117890'),
  ('628145145008269023', 'Confessions of a Pop Performer', 1975, 'Comedy', 'Norman Cohen, Alan Hume, Bill Westley', 'Christopher Wood', 'Robin Askwith, Anthony Booth, Doris Hare, Bill Maynard, Sheila White, Peter Cleall, Carol Hawkins, Peter Jones', null, 'Either you''ve got it or you haven''t - some like randy young Timothy Lea (Robin Askwith), manage to get it all the time! Signing up with a pop group, our boisterous hero progresses rapidly from local gigs to scoring a titillating hit with The Climax Sisters, with plenty of ribald adventures along the way!', 'Either you''ve got it or you haven''t - some like randy young Timothy Lea (Robin Askwith), manage to get it all the time! Signing up with a pop group, our boisterous hero progresses rapidly from local gigs to scoring a titillating hit with The Climax Sisters, with plenty of ribald adventures along the way!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mrbn4oeYxQWu8DytLn61Pqzyuf3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34905'),
  ('346682319828197915', 'Confessions of a Serial Killer', 1985, 'Crime, Horror', 'Layton Blaylock, John Gibson, Randy Ostrow', 'John Dwyer', 'Robert A. Burns, Dennis Hill, Berkley Garrett, Sidney Brammer, DeeDee Norton, Ollie Handley, Demp Toney, Eleese Lester', 'R', 'After being arrested, a Texas man begins confessing to the brutal murder of over 200 women. He recounts his random selection of victims and his traveling companions, his friend and friend''s sister. But the police can''t be sure whether to believe him or not until he locates a body and shows them some polaroids. Based on the true story of Henry Lee Lucas.', 'After being arrested, a Texas man begins confessing to the brutal murder of over 200 women. He recounts his random selection of victims and his traveling companions, his friend and friend''s sister. But the police can''t be sure whether to believe him or not until he locates a body and shows them some polaroids. Based on the true story of Henry Lee Lucas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cApeRORijFCkAfHsoLpLfx5NVzQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43686'),
  ('1117790522756574733', 'Confessions of a Shopaholic', 2009, 'Comedy, Romance', 'P.J. Hogan, Jo Willems, H.H. Cooper', 'Tracey Jackson, Tim Firth, Kayla Alpert', 'Isla Fisher, Hugh Dancy, Krysten Ritter, Joan Cusack, John Goodman, John Lithgow, Kristin Scott Thomas, Fred Armisen', 'PG', 'In the glamorous world of New York City, Rebecca Bloomwood is a fun-loving girl who is really good at shopping – a little too good, perhaps. She dreams of working for her favorite fashion magazine, but can''t quite get her foot in the door – until ironically, she snags a job as an advice columnist for a financial magazine published by the same company.', 'In the glamorous world of New York City, Rebecca Bloomwood is a fun-loving girl who is really good at shopping – a little too good, perhaps. She dreams of working for her favorite fashion magazine, but can''t quite get her foot in the door – until ironically, she snags a job as an advice columnist for a financial magazine published by the same company.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r17R9OIC0pKDqqsNore6atYLCVZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20048'),
  ('134565169914321894', 'Confessions of a Sociopathic Social Climber', 2005, 'Comedy, Romance, TV Movie', 'Dana Lustig, Luc Montpellier, Eddy Hardy', null, 'Jennifer Love Hewitt, Colin Ferguson, Natassia Malthe, Daniel Roebuck, Stefanie von Pfetten, James Kirk, Sonja Bennett, Jennifer Clement', 'R', 'Katya Livingston, a self-centered, obnoxious and conceited 28-year-old ad sales exec, won''t let anything or anyone stand in her way in getting to the top of the San Francisco social ladder. When tax inspectors question her claims Katya is forced to keep a financial diary and finds time to add details about her friends, enemies and lovers all from her unique point of view.', 'Katya Livingston, a self-centered, obnoxious and conceited 28-year-old ad sales exec, won''t let anything or anyone stand in her way in getting to the top of the San Francisco social ladder. When tax inspectors question her claims Katya is forced to keep a financial diary and finds time to add details about her friends, enemies and lovers all from her unique point of view.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/inZZVamQxP9NFHVWSAMh83RiPC4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21891'),
  ('700122183946786580', 'Confessions of a Sorority Girl', 1995, 'Comedy, Drama, TV Movie', 'Uli Edel, Jean de Segonzac, James M. Freitag', 'Gigi Vorgan, Debra Hill', 'Brian Bloom, Jamie Luner, Alyssa Milano, Natalija Nogulich, David Brisbin, Judson Mills, Sadie Stratton', null, 'Evicted from home and forced to live in a sorority house, Sabrina Masterson becomes attracted to Mort, who owns the hip bar on the beach, but he''s involved with pretty overachiever Rita Summers. Sabrina befriends Rita, planning to break up the romance, but Mort still doesn''t respond to Sabrina''s advances. As she becomes progressively desperate, Sabrina resorts to increasingly dangerous and violent measures to win him over.', 'Evicted from home and forced to live in a sorority house, Sabrina Masterson becomes attracted to Mort, who owns the hip bar on the beach, but he''s involved with pretty overachiever Rita Summers. Sabrina befriends Rita, planning to break up the romance, but Mort still doesn''t respond to Sabrina''s advances. As she becomes progressively desperate, Sabrina resorts to increasingly dangerous and violent measures to win him over.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pUrFYZWkts6nba6esfu1biZxpvV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63341'),
  ('1150156558740004686', 'Confessions of a Superhero', 2007, 'Documentary', 'Matthew Ogens, Charlie Gruet', null, null, 'R', 'CONFESSIONS OF A SUPERHERO is a feature length documentary chronicling the lives of three mortal men and one woman who make their living working as superhero characters on the sidewalks of Hollywood Boulevard. This deeply personal view into their daily routines reveals their hardships, and triumphs, as they pursue and achieve their own kind of fame. The Hulk sold his Super Nintendo for a bus ticket to LA; Wonder Woman was a mid-western homecoming queen; Batman struggles with his anger, while Superman’s psyche is consumed by the Man of Steel. Although the Walk of Fame is right beneath their feet, their own paths to stardom prove to be a long, hard climbs.', 'CONFESSIONS OF A SUPERHERO is a feature length documentary chronicling the lives of three mortal men and one woman who make their living working as superhero characters on the sidewalks of Hollywood Boulevard. This deeply personal view into their daily routines reveals their hardships, and triumphs, as they pursue and achieve their own kind of fame. The Hulk sold his Super Nintendo for a bus ticket to LA; Wonder Woman was a mid-western homecoming queen; Batman struggles with his anger, while Superman’s psyche is consumed by the Man of Steel. Although the Walk of Fame is right beneath their feet, their own paths to stardom prove to be a long, hard climbs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bNLMLncZAYqGGWHiE7Iew2IsREq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16509'),
  ('397518639886313387', 'Confessions of a Teenage Drama Queen', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Stephen H. Burum, Sara Sugarman, Rick Kush', 'Gail Parent', 'Lindsay Lohan, Adam Garcia, Glenne Headly, Alison Pill, Eli Marienthal, Carol Kane, Megan Fox, Sheila McCarthy', 'PG', 'After moving to New Jersey, Lola bags a coveted role in a school play, which earns her the wrath of Carla, the most popular girl in school, who will do anything to ruin Lola''s life.', 'After moving to New Jersey, Lola bags a coveted role in a school play, which earns her the wrath of Carla, the most popular girl in school, who will do anything to ruin Lola''s life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nQA9Ozh9ftLQyJvuKy6sl5zSlH2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11132'),
  ('26001317553487694', 'Confessions of a Window Cleaner', 1974, 'Comedy', 'Val Guest, Norman Warwick, Bert Batt', 'Christopher Wood, Val Guest', 'Robin Askwith, Anthony Booth, Linda Hayden, Bill Maynard, Dandy Nichols, Sheila White, John Le Mesurier, Richard Wattis', 'R', 'Young Timmy starts as a window cleaner in the little company of his brother. Soon he learns that some female customers expect additional service. Young and curious as he is, he reluctantly accepts the juicy duty. However his heart belongs to Liz, who demands the highest commitment until she lets him go all the way.', 'Young Timmy starts as a window cleaner in the little company of his brother. Soon he learns that some female customers expect additional service. Young and curious as he is, he reluctantly accepts the juicy duty. However his heart belongs to Liz, who demands the highest commitment until she lets him go all the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7AZjQkQ3gDWpi0p8xjlYkdoufk5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33303'),
  ('972855174213869184', 'Confessions of a Young American Housewife', 1974, 'Drama', 'Stephen Colwell, Joseph W. Sarno, Tom Brumberger', 'Joseph W. Sarno', 'Rebecca Brooke, Kathie Fitch, Jennifer Welles, Eric Edwards, David Hausman, Juliet Lay, Erica Eaton, Arlana Blue', 'NR', 'An attractive but conservative mid-30''s housewife stays at the house of her sexually open daughter and soon becomes involved in her daughter''s swinger lifestyle.', 'An attractive but conservative mid-30''s housewife stays at the house of her sexually open daughter and soon becomes involved in her daughter''s swinger lifestyle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kgZELjdy8FkRZOUTYw5uH1AIE1P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81476'),
  ('310024327068350949', 'Confessions of an Invisible Girl', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Bruno Garotti, Julio Constantini, Plínio Profeta', 'Bruno Garotti, Flávia Lins e Silva, Thalita Rebouças', 'Klara Castanho, Gabriel Lima, Júlia Gomes, Marcus Bessa, Lucca Picon, Caio Cabral, Kiria Malheiros, Fernanda Concon', null, 'When the clever but socially-awkward Tetê joins a new school, she''ll do anything to fit in. But the queen bee among her classmates has other ideas.', 'When the clever but socially-awkward Tetê joins a new school, she''ll do anything to fit in. But the queen bee among her classmates has other ideas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fRxz9cKaCOF5noUBvoA6cebOdUE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:786705'),
  ('693604190615641265', 'Confessions of an Opium Eater', 1962, 'Drama, Crime', 'Albert Zugsmith, Joseph F. Biroc', 'Thomas De Quincey, Robert Hill', 'Vincent Price, Linda Ho, Richard Loo, June Kyoto Lu, Philip Ahn, Yvonne Moray, Terence de Marney, John Fujioka', 'NR', 'Vincent Price stars in this early ''60s adaptation of Thomas De Quincey''s thriller about an opium addict trying to solve a mystery in San Francisco''s Chinatown.', 'Vincent Price stars in this early ''60s adaptation of Thomas De Quincey''s thriller about an opium addict trying to solve a mystery in San Francisco''s Chinatown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2PJ4AHqd2TjoDYxCBUZj8Kghvga.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59101'),
  ('688232508785260836', 'Confessions of Felix Krull', 2021, 'Crime, Drama', 'Marc Achenbach, Detlev Buck, Valerie Adamer', 'Daniel Kehlmann, Detlev Buck', 'Jannis Niewöhner, David Kross, Liv Lisa Fries, Nicholas Ofczarek, Maria Furtwängler, Joachim Król, Désirée Nosbusch, Dominique Horwitz', null, 'Literary adaptation: a handsome youth of humble origins rises in society through his connections made as an elevator attendant in a luxury hotel.', 'Literary adaptation: a handsome youth of humble origins rises in society through his connections made as an elevator attendant in a luxury hotel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7AzY6wiiRZiKiVHY78WQu2xGAi3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:835433'),
