  ('881664006864625468', 'Conflict', 1945, 'Thriller', 'Curtis Bernhardt, Leo F. Forbstein, Merritt B. Gerstad', 'Arthur T. Horman, Dwight Taylor', 'Humphrey Bogart, Alexis Smith, Sydney Greenstreet, Rose Hobart, Charles Drake, Grant Mitchell, Patrick O''Moore, Ann Shoemaker', 'NR', 'Unhappily married Richard Mason concocts a meticulous scheme to kill his shrewish wife so that he''ll be free to marry her sister.', 'Unhappily married Richard Mason concocts a meticulous scheme to kill his shrewish wife so that he''ll be free to marry her sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kzVULA1agXKgi5cc2fbyWiDKiuF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26654'),
  ('558813235135625165', 'Conflict', 1983, 'Animation', 'Garri Bardin', 'Garri Bardin', null, null, 'The heroes of the film: ordinary matches. A quarrel that breaks out over nothing turns into a real battle in which both warring sides are burned.', 'The heroes of the film: ordinary matches. A quarrel that breaks out over nothing turns into a real battle in which both warring sides are burned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7MilJfFf7dUP65yiYw9sOTQaskZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48605'),
  ('47640062144988111', 'Confucius', 2010, 'Drama, History', 'Hu Mei', 'Hu Mei, Jiang Qitao, Chan Hon', 'Chow Yun-Fat, Zhou Xun, Wang Ban, Chen Jianbin, Ren Quan, Yao Lu, Liu Fengchao, Chen Ran', 'PG-13', 'In 500 B.C., during Chinas famed ''Spring and Autumn Period'', Kong Ze (Confucius), a commoner reverred for his outstanding wisdom, is made Minister of Law in the ancient Kingdom of Lu. Under his inspired leadership, Lu ascends to new heights but becomes a target of conquest for the warlike nation of Qi. Threatened with annihilation by their powerful neighbour, a desperate people turn to their greatest teacher to lead their most powerful army. When Confucius delivers a stunning victory against all odds, a jealous aristocracy sets out to destroy him, but they should never under-estimate a remarkable man whose wisdom is more powerful than the sword.', 'In 500 B.C., during Chinas famed ''Spring and Autumn Period'', Kong Ze (Confucius), a commoner reverred for his outstanding wisdom, is made Minister of Law in the ancient Kingdom of Lu. Under his inspired leadership, Lu ascends to new heights but becomes a target of conquest for the warlike nation of Qi. Threatened with annihilation by their powerful neighbour, a desperate people turn to their greatest teacher to lead their most powerful army. When Confucius delivers a stunning victory against all odds, a jealous aristocracy sets out to destroy him, but they should never under-estimate a remarkable man whose wisdom is more powerful than the sword.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rCRMOp9LvgSdpvJm1xvjFGKGfNY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34182'),
  ('1121455332382443087', 'Confusion of Genders', 2000, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Ilan Duran Cohen, Jeanne Lapoirie', 'Ilan Duran Cohen, Philippe Lasry', 'Pascal Greggory, Nathalie Richard, Julie Gayet, Alain Bashung, Bulle Ogier, Dominique Bernardi, Samuel Perche, Chloé Mons', null, 'Bisexual attorney Alain is bedding his female boss, his murderer client, the client''s hairdresser girlfriend, and a precocious boy who knows what he wants and tries to convince Alain that he can ''have it all''.', 'Bisexual attorney Alain is bedding his female boss, his murderer client, the client''s hairdresser girlfriend, and a precocious boy who knows what he wants and tries to convince Alain that he can ''have it all''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fHSDAJApYXIucAL9AolYCQmXH64.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41877'),
  ('477211555795991854', 'Confusions of a Nutzy Spy', 1943, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Norm McCabe', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Constable Porky Pig and his lazy bloodhound are on the trail of a Nazi spy, Missing Lynx, in this World War II propaganda piece (a spoof on the 1939 "Confessions of a Nazi Spy").', 'Constable Porky Pig and his lazy bloodhound are on the trail of a Nazi spy, Missing Lynx, in this World War II propaganda piece (a spoof on the 1939 "Confessions of a Nazi Spy").', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/heL09wkbV5BEMc3F9y5VFvSjpKI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175666'),
  ('27998219955754171', 'Congo', 1995, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Allen Daviau, Frank Marshall, Richard Holland', 'John Patrick Shanley', 'Laura Linney, Dylan Walsh, Ernie Hudson, Tim Curry, Grant Heslov, Joe Don Baker, Misty Rosas, Mary Ellen Trainor', 'PG-13', 'Eight people embark on an expedition into the Congo, a mysterious expanse of unexplored Africa, where human greed and the laws of nature have gone berserk.', 'Eight people embark on an expedition into the Congo, a mysterious expanse of unexplored Africa, where human greed and the laws of nature have gone berserk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hPNSToNIIpRO6y5Rh973leqQqNr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10329'),
  ('263226821182761563', 'Congo Crossing', 1956, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Thriller', 'Joseph Pevney, Russell Metty, Frank Shaw', 'Richard Alan Simmons', 'Virginia Mayo, George Nader, Peter Lorre, Michael Pate, Rex Ingram, Tonio Selwart, Kathryn Givney, Tudor Owen', 'NR', 'Congotanga, West Africa, has no extradition laws; the government is controlled by foreign gangsters, headed by Carl Rittner. The latest plane from Europe carries lovely Louise Whitman, fleeing a French murder charge, and Mannering, who pays resident hit man O''Connell to kill her. Through a chain of circumstances Louise, O''Connell, and heroic surveyor David Carr end up alone in the jungle on Carr''s mission to determine the true border of Congotanga... in which Rittner is keenly interested.', 'Congotanga, West Africa, has no extradition laws; the government is controlled by foreign gangsters, headed by Carl Rittner. The latest plane from Europe carries lovely Louise Whitman, fleeing a French murder charge, and Mannering, who pays resident hit man O''Connell to kill her. Through a chain of circumstances Louise, O''Connell, and heroic surveyor David Carr end up alone in the jungle on Carr''s mission to determine the true border of Congotanga... in which Rittner is keenly interested.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oSRJ6HQl2rXd40ztDwJwVzLRLyR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163775'),
  ('229253672788983252', 'Congo Jazz', 1930, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Rudolf Ising, Hugh Harman', null, 'Johnny Murray, Carman Maxwell', null, 'Bosko hunts in the jungle, but ends up playing music with the animals.', 'Bosko hunts in the jungle, but ends up playing music with the animals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1zXAoa9X2EUI128Ptnl2yBQfVW1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166635'),
  ('966571608672311302', 'Congorama', 2006, 'Drama', 'Philippe Falardeau, André Turpin', 'Philippe Falardeau', 'Paul Ahmarani, Olivier Gourmet, Jean-Pierre Cassel, Claudia Tagbo, Arnaud Mouithys, Lorraine Pintal, Gabriel Arcand, Guy Pion', null, 'Michel is a Belgian inventor. He cares for his father, a paralysed writer, is married to a Congolese woman and is the father of an interracial child whom he reassures as to his parentage. He discovers at the age of 41 that he was adopted, actually having been born in Sainte-Cécile, Quebec. In the summer of 2000, he travels to Quebec, supposedly to sell some of his inventions. While on a near-impossible quest to find his birth family in the town where he was born, he crosses paths with Louis Legros, son of another inventor, in a meeting which will change their lives.', 'Michel is a Belgian inventor. He cares for his father, a paralysed writer, is married to a Congolese woman and is the father of an interracial child whom he reassures as to his parentage. He discovers at the age of 41 that he was adopted, actually having been born in Sainte-Cécile, Quebec. In the summer of 2000, he travels to Quebec, supposedly to sell some of his inventions. While on a near-impossible quest to find his birth family in the town where he was born, he crosses paths with Louis Legros, son of another inventor, in a meeting which will change their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vR92CiqJG5dj6m7389B1M6fPCPc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61783'),
  ('930530120437032979', 'Congratulations It''s Pink', 1967, 'Animation', 'Hawley Pratt', 'Jim Ryan', 'June Foray', null, 'The Pink Panther steals a family''s baby basket instead of a picnic basket at the park and ends up having to raise the baby until the parents return.', 'The Pink Panther steals a family''s baby basket instead of a picnic basket at the park and ends up having to raise the baby until the parents return.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/janTozaP9pdi9YXO6Kne7jgwd6l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:379139'),
  ('943796815466134255', 'Congress Dances', 1931, 'History, Comedy', 'Erik Charell, Paul Martin, Carl Hoffmann', 'Robert Liebmann, Norbert Falk', 'Lilian Harvey, Willy Fritsch, Otto Wallburg, Conrad Veidt, Carl-Heinz Schroth, Lil Dagover, Alfred Abel, Adele Sandrock', null, 'An Austrian prince hatches a plan to keep his rival, the Russian czar, busy by keeping him surrounded by beautiful women and away from the negotiating table. The Czar, however, has his own plan—he hires a man who is his exact double to impersonate him and confuse the Austrians by appearing to be everywhere at once. In addition, both the Czar and his double fall for the same woman.', 'An Austrian prince hatches a plan to keep his rival, the Russian czar, busy by keeping him surrounded by beautiful women and away from the negotiating table. The Czar, however, has his own plan—he hires a man who is his exact double to impersonate him and confuse the Austrians by appearing to be everywhere at once. In addition, both the Czar and his double fall for the same woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hEEWHARz0Xq2BiEDQd9aDVdRccr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95759'),
  ('637251353651420657', 'Conjugal Warfare', 1975, 'Comedy', 'Joaquim Pedro de Andrade, Carlos Alberto Prates Correia, Pedro de Moraes', 'Joaquim Pedro de Andrade', 'Lima Duarte, Jofre Soares, Carmem Silva, Carlos Gregório, Ítala Nandi, Analú Prestes, Carlos Kroeber, Cristina Aché', null, 'Many stories revolving around a poor couple who, in spite of hating each other, still live together under the same roof.', 'Many stories revolving around a poor couple who, in spite of hating each other, still live together under the same roof.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/exBKV61DQ3mEOtNq0I1UA2jhEsC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74451'),
  ('1055521533494572609', 'Conjurer', 2008, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Clint Hutchison, Ken Blakey, Evans Griffin', 'Clint Hutchison, David Yarbrough', 'Andrew Bowen, Maxine Bahns, John Schneider, Tom Nowicki, Brett Rice, Edith Ivey', 'PG-13', 'After moving to the country to start life anew after their child''s death, photographer Shawn Burnett and his wife, Helen, begin to suspect that a ramshackle cabin on their property is haunted by the malevolent spirit of a long-dead witch who once lived there.', 'After moving to the country to start life anew after their child''s death, photographer Shawn Burnett and his wife, Helen, begin to suspect that a ramshackle cabin on their property is haunted by the malevolent spirit of a long-dead witch who once lived there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3LLzs60zYGpcupLMWCpjU4RvevU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25573'),
  ('291191482522993975', 'Conjuring', 1896, null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'The film reproduces a magic act Méliès performed at his Paris theater-of-illusions, the Théâtre Robert-Houdin. Conjuring is notable as Méliès''s second film, and as his first to move beyond the actuality film genre pioneered by the Lumière brothers and experiment with using the camera to capture a theatrical magic act. (Later in 1896, with his discovery of the substitution splice technique, Méliès was able to begin augmenting his theatrical illusions with new special effects unique to film.) Conjuring can thus be seen as Méliès''s first foray into the world of fiction film. The film was released by Méliès''s Star Film Company and numbered 2 in its catalogues.', 'The film reproduces a magic act Méliès performed at his Paris theater-of-illusions, the Théâtre Robert-Houdin. Conjuring is notable as Méliès''s second film, and as his first to move beyond the actuality film genre pioneered by the Lumière brothers and experiment with using the camera to capture a theatrical magic act. (Later in 1896, with his discovery of the substitution splice technique, Méliès was able to begin augmenting his theatrical illusions with new special effects unique to film.) Conjuring can thus be seen as Méliès''s first foray into the world of fiction film. The film was released by Méliès''s Star Film Company and numbered 2 in its catalogues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pfb2kGvcW7d4SaLsEEgUVr9wnEt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:694185'),
  ('589647215567042008', 'Conjuring Tapes', 2025, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Randy Nundlall Jr., Robert Livings', 'Randy Nundlall Jr., Robert Livings', 'Samantha Laurenti, Brenda Yanez, Daniel Outlaw, Robert Felsted Jr., Greg Sestero, Whitney Clack, Norah DeMello, Imin Love', null, 'While sorting through their late friend''s belongings, two women discover VHS tapes showing them in haunting, unfamiliar scenes, each one drawing them into the grasp of a mysterious, malevolent entity.', 'While sorting through their late friend''s belongings, two women discover VHS tapes showing them in haunting, unfamiliar scenes, each one drawing them into the grasp of a mysterious, malevolent entity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/puPN6uC5NpbAQW8dDovGkJ79arn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1206083'),
  ('842595702439134576', 'Conjuring the Cult', 2024, 'Horror, Drama', 'Calvin Morie McCarthy', 'Calvin Morie McCarthy', 'Neil Green, Elissa Dowling, Chynna Rae Shurts, BJ Mezek, Jason Brooks, Brad Littlefield, Naomi Mechem-Miller, Michelle Colman Padron', null, 'After discovering his blood-soaked daughter dead in the bathtub, David Bryson attends a self-help group to help save him from his ghostly nightmares. But when a group of mysterious cult-like women offer to help him resurrect his daughter. David''s choices will not just decide his fate... but the fate of his dead daughter''s SOUL.', 'After discovering his blood-soaked daughter dead in the bathtub, David Bryson attends a self-help group to help save him from his ghostly nightmares. But when a group of mysterious cult-like women offer to help him resurrect his daughter. David''s choices will not just decide his fate... but the fate of his dead daughter''s SOUL.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t4MiAeYpjL7saYvqvcn9xtOfA4K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1359977'),
  ('661499830683805939', 'Conjuring: The Beyond', 2022, 'Horror', 'Calvin Morie McCarthy', 'Calvin Morie McCarthy', 'Victoria Grace Borrello, Steve Larkin, Jon Meggison, Erik Skybak, Stephanie Leet, Daniel Donlon, Tim Coyle, Neil Green', null, 'A sleep study goes awry when participants start to go missing.', 'A sleep study goes awry when participants start to go missing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dNr0mqVSLfIaPlhcmJNRJVzCQBs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1022103'),
  ('429893932573815818', 'Conman in Tokyo', 2000, 'Action, Comedy', 'Tony Ching Siu-Tung', 'Law Yiu-Fai', 'Louis Koo, Nick Cheung Ka-Fai, Athena Chu Yan, Christy Chung Lai-Tai, Ben Lam Kwok-Bun, Bryan Leung Kar-Yan, Yasuaki Kurata, Joe Cheng Cho', null, 'Jersey is a popular gambler in Mongkok. One day, he takes a trip to Japan with her girlfriend, Nancy, they come to Chinese resaurant. Suddenly, a gang of Japanese triads comes in and starts a fight. Just at the moment when he is in danger, the restaurant owner uses a special card - casting skill to save him. Jersey recognize it is the skill of Cool, the Gambling King, but the owner refuses to admit that Cool is still alive. Cool finally admit his true identity and tells Jersey that Ho Yan was orginally his girlfriend but now she is the wife of Yeung. Cool treated Yeung like his brother, but he is jealous of Cool''s beautiful grilfriend and wealth. Yeung conspired to take away Cool''s everthing. With Jersey''s help, Cool decides to get Ho Yan back, but he does not realizes that Yeung is setting another trap for him.', 'Jersey is a popular gambler in Mongkok. One day, he takes a trip to Japan with her girlfriend, Nancy, they come to Chinese resaurant. Suddenly, a gang of Japanese triads comes in and starts a fight. Just at the moment when he is in danger, the restaurant owner uses a special card - casting skill to save him. Jersey recognize it is the skill of Cool, the Gambling King, but the owner refuses to admit that Cool is still alive. Cool finally admit his true identity and tells Jersey that Ho Yan was orginally his girlfriend but now she is the wife of Yeung. Cool treated Yeung like his brother, but he is jealous of Cool''s beautiful grilfriend and wealth. Yeung conspired to take away Cool''s everthing. With Jersey''s help, Cool decides to get Ho Yan back, but he does not realizes that Yeung is setting another trap for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x1vcPJtgQtSweGCXRIsVHvDtBhz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75697')