  ('978473935350533148', 'Connectés', 2020, 'Comedy, Thriller', 'Marine Durand, Romuald Boulanger', 'Romuald Boulanger', 'Stéphane De Groodt, Nadia Farès, François-Xavier Demaison, Michaël Youn, Claudia Tagbo, Pascal Demolon, Vanessa Guide, Audrey Fleurot', null, 'On a Saturday night during lock down, a group of very good friends go online to share a virtual aperitif. Suddenly, one of them is attacked and kidnapped live by an unknown man in front of his friends who watch helplessly from behind their screens. They soon discover that this mysterious stranger knows all their worst secrets, which he intends to bring to light one after the other.', 'On a Saturday night during lock down, a group of very good friends go online to share a virtual aperitif. Suddenly, one of them is attacked and kidnapped live by an unknown man in front of his friends who watch helplessly from behind their screens. They soon discover that this mysterious stranger knows all their worst secrets, which he intends to bring to light one after the other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bUKQe1YQAnq1WIYi4CAkntj1Jr4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:753756'),
  ('1147199269298584104', 'Connecting Rooms', 1970, 'Drama', 'Franklin Gollings, Gerry Arbeid, John Wilcox', 'Franklin Gollings, Marion Hart', 'Bette Davis, Michael Redgrave, Alexis Kanner, Kay Walsh, Leo Genn, Olga Georges-Picot, Richard Wyler, Gabrielle Drake', 'NR', 'Explores the relationships shared by the residents of a seedy boarding house in London. Based on the play The Cellist, by Marion Hart.', 'Explores the relationships shared by the residents of a seedy boarding house in London. Based on the play The Cellist, by Marion Hart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m6N6QSaNWSOkaq3IBFCYVatrLDy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:223568'),
  ('727504599431547649', 'Connemara', 2025, 'Drama', 'Alex Lutz, Éponine Momenceau, Guillaume Huin', 'Hadrien Bichet', 'Mélanie Thierry, Bastien Bouillon, Jacques Gamblin, Bruno Sanches, Eliot Giraud, Grégory Montel, Clémentine Célarié, Anne Charrier', null, 'Born into a modest family, Hélène left the Vosges a long time ago. Today, a sudden burn-out forces her to leave Paris and return to the place where she grew up. One evening, in the parking lot of a franchised restaurant, she spots Christophe Marchal, the charismatic field hockey prodigy from her high school days. An unexpected love affair begins between these two people, who are now at odds with each other.', 'Born into a modest family, Hélène left the Vosges a long time ago. Today, a sudden burn-out forces her to leave Paris and return to the place where she grew up. One evening, in the parking lot of a franchised restaurant, she spots Christophe Marchal, the charismatic field hockey prodigy from her high school days. An unexpected love affair begins between these two people, who are now at odds with each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ylrxN4IxcrqMWbohgHJso6ORTg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:979976'),
