  ('320604079915848374', 'Connie and Carla', 2004, 'Comedy, Crime, Music', 'Michael Lembeck, Richard Greatrex', 'Nia Vardalos', 'Nia Vardalos, Toni Collette, David Duchovny, Stephen Spinella, Alec Mapa, Ian Gomez, Nick Sandow, Dash Mihok', 'PG-13', 'After accidentally witnessing a mafia hit in the Windy City, gal pals Connie and Carla skip town for L.A., where they go way undercover as singers working the city''s dinner theater circuit ... disguised as drag queens. Now, it''s not enough that they become big hits on the scene; things get extra-weird when Connie meets Jeff -- a guy she''d like to be a woman with.', 'After accidentally witnessing a mafia hit in the Windy City, gal pals Connie and Carla skip town for L.A., where they go way undercover as singers working the city''s dinner theater circuit ... disguised as drag queens. Now, it''s not enough that they become big hits on the scene; things get extra-weird when Connie meets Jeff -- a guy she''d like to be a woman with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mR0K8S5s2c5uxpcevnVam17HFrh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15673'),
