  ('511405809955262218', 'Conquest', 1983, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Action, Horror', 'Alejandro Ulloa, Lucio Fulci, José Antonio de la Loma Jr.', 'Carlos Vasallo, José Antonio de la Loma, Gino Capone', 'Jorge Rivero, Andrea Occhipinti, Sabrina Siani, Conrado San Martín, Gioia Scola, Violeta Cela, José Gras', 'R', 'To mark his passage into manhood, young Ilias is gifted a magical bow by his father and embarks upon a journey into the wilderness to rid the land of evil, all the while battling the witch Ocron, who wishes to steal the bow for her own nefarious ends.', 'To mark his passage into manhood, young Ilias is gifted a magical bow by his father and embarks upon a journey into the wilderness to rid the land of evil, all the while battling the witch Ocron, who wishes to steal the bow for her own nefarious ends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fwEZHv3nksttbsSkRYAdb5dfaBn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27232'),
  ('293607134854106651', 'Conquest 1453', 2012, 'Adventure, Drama, Action, War', 'Faruk Aksoy', 'Irfan Saruhan, Melih Esat Acil', 'Devrim Evin, İbrahim Çelikkol, Dilek Serbest, Cengiz Coşkun, Recep Aktuğ, Şahika Koldemir, Erden Alkan, Naci Adıgüzel', null, 'After the death of his father Murat II, young Mehmet II ascends to the Ottoman throne. After braving internal and external enemies, he decides to complete what he was destined to do: Conquer Constantinople.', 'After the death of his father Murat II, young Mehmet II ascends to the Ottoman throne. After braving internal and external enemies, he decides to complete what he was destined to do: Conquer Constantinople.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xzTAM0yaOKkdD4C2tVbdHilcNAc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89584'),
  ('1116400488787981661', 'Conquest of Space', 1955, 'Science Fiction', 'Byron Haskin, Lionel Lindon', null, 'Walter Brooke, Eric Fleming, Mickey Shaughnessy, Phil Foster, William Redfield, William Hopper, Benson Fong, Ross Martin', null, 'A team of American astronauts leave their space station on the first mission to Mars, but the captain''s religious beliefs may get in the way.', 'A team of American astronauts leave their space station on the first mission to Mars, but the captain''s religious beliefs may get in the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9RxLfVIJ3nCZQZUMgbF7ThGlrFi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25952'),
  ('1125738023315584902', 'Conquest of the Earth', 1980, 'TV Movie, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Sigmund Neufeld Jr., Sidney Hayers, Ben Colman', 'Glen A. Larson', 'Kent McCord, Barry Van Dyke, Robyn Douglass, Lorne Greene, James Patrick Stuart, Richard Lynch, Robbie Rist, John Colicos', null, 'A compilation of Battlestar Galactica episodes 1–3 and 7–9, with alternate footage. The Galactica and its ragtag fleet of ships finally arrive on Earth, only to discover that the planet is not prepared for the inevitable Cylon invasion.', 'A compilation of Battlestar Galactica episodes 1–3 and 7–9, with alternate footage. The Galactica and its ragtag fleet of ships finally arrive on Earth, only to discover that the planet is not prepared for the inevitable Cylon invasion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r2Bzv38oAFyTf2yaBLdaASDMMP1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65288'),
  ('129673748346254419', 'Conquest of the Planet of the Apes', 1972, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Bruce Surtees, J. Lee Thompson, David ''Buck'' Hall', 'Paul Dehn', 'Roddy McDowall, Don Murray, Ricardo Montalban, Hari Rhodes, Severn Darden, Lou Wagner, Natalie Trundy, John Randolph', 'PG', 'In a futuristic world that has embraced ape slavery, a chimpanzee named Caesar resurfaces after almost twenty years of hiding from the authorities, and prepares for a revolt against humanity.', 'In a futuristic world that has embraced ape slavery, a chimpanzee named Caesar resurfaces after almost twenty years of hiding from the authorities, and prepares for a revolt against humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lZ1pUxJCO14ObrhDuxTBuYm0tjN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1688'),
  ('124910217481068112', 'Conrack', 1974, 'Drama', 'Martin Ritt, Anthony Brand, Irby Smith', 'Harriet Frank Jr., Irving Ravetch', 'Jon Voight, Paul Winfield, Madge Sinclair, Tina Andrews, Antonio Fargas, Ruth Attaway, James O''Rear, Gracia Lee', 'PG', 'A young, white school teacher is assigned to Yamacraw Island, an isolated fishing community off the coast of South Carolina, populated mostly by poor black families. He finds that the basically illiterate, neglected children there know so little of the world outside their island.', 'A young, white school teacher is assigned to Yamacraw Island, an isolated fishing community off the coast of South Carolina, populated mostly by poor black families. He finds that the basically illiterate, neglected children there know so little of the world outside their island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wiP6lRKlF4jngcH4yQZINWqqaUh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30702'),
  ('953225634562525424', 'Conrad the Sailor', 1942, 'Animation', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc, Pinto Colvig', null, 'Conrad, a sailor aboard a Navy battleship, is swabbing the deck when he is interrupted and tormented by Daffy Duck.', 'Conrad, a sailor aboard a Navy battleship, is swabbing the deck when he is interrupted and tormented by Daffy Duck.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ZRwHngx2AeBjlqlfl4AKJHwyK2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175668'),
  ('481637474396838464', 'Conscience', 2008, 'Drama', 'Erden Kıral', 'Raşit Çelikezer', 'Nurgül Yeşilçay, Murat Han, Tülin Özen, Nazan Kesal, Rıza Sönmez, Nihan Okutucu, Murat Gürvardar, Şener Kökkaya', null, 'Centers on a passionate and complicated love story that connects three small-town people trying to survive solely on their labor. Aydanur is a young woman living in Anatolia who wants to break away from whatever life has--or doesn''t have--to offer her. Meanwhile, Mahmut is stuck between Aydanur and his wife, Songul. However, Aydanur starts covering a much bigger space in his heart. The roads of the two intersect at a tavern.', 'Centers on a passionate and complicated love story that connects three small-town people trying to survive solely on their labor. Aydanur is a young woman living in Anatolia who wants to break away from whatever life has--or doesn''t have--to offer her. Meanwhile, Mahmut is stuck between Aydanur and his wife, Songul. However, Aydanur starts covering a much bigger space in his heart. The roads of the two intersect at a tavern.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xS2seq2KjrzUim8mz3J7te2ixKw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52148'),
  ('474428719637263488', 'Consecration', 2023, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Rob Hart, Shaun Mone, Christopher Smith', 'Christopher Smith, Laurie Cook', 'Jena Malone, Danny Huston, Thoren Ferguson, Will Keen, Ian Pirie, Janet Suzman, Alexandra Lewis, Steffan Cennydd', 'R', 'After the alleged suicide of her priest brother, Grace travels to the remote Scottish convent where he fell to his death. Distrusting the Church''s account, she uncovers murder, sacrilege and a disturbing truth about herself.', 'After the alleged suicide of her priest brother, Grace travels to the remote Scottish convent where he fell to his death. Distrusting the Church''s account, she uncovers murder, sacrilege and a disturbing truth about herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yQTRmPzKAdLodknnPVtImm6FWPZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:884184'),
  ('507045339804493274', 'Consent', 2023, 'History, Drama', 'Vanessa Filho, Guillaume Schiffman, Nicolas Trabaud', 'Vanessa Filho, François Pirot', 'Kim Higelin, Jean-Paul Rouve, Laetitia Casta, Élodie Bouchez, Jean Chevalier, Lolita Chammah, David Clavel, Agathe Dronne', null, 'In 2013, Vanessa Springora recounts how she found herself under the influence of a famous writer. In 1986, she was 13; him, almost 50. The victim of a triple predation: sexual, literary, and psychic, there''s more beyond her individual story. She questions the excesses of an era, and the complacency of an environment blinded by talent and celebrity.', 'In 2013, Vanessa Springora recounts how she found herself under the influence of a famous writer. In 1986, she was 13; him, almost 50. The victim of a triple predation: sexual, literary, and psychic, there''s more beyond her individual story. She questions the excesses of an era, and the complacency of an environment blinded by talent and celebrity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8QTo3OgSqS09jFYPwQWXyx0fi2W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:956964'),
  ('838235184063959475', 'Consenting Adult', 1985, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Frank Stanley, Gilbert Cates', null, 'Marlo Thomas, Martin Sheen, Barry Tubb, Talia Balsam, Ben Piazza, John Terlesky, Corinne Camacho, Matthew Laurance', null, 'Young and shy Jeff discovers his attraction to men. After struggling with himself he comes out to his parents. Mum eventually listens to his son and tries to understand his feelings, but his Dad would rather die — which, in the end, he really does, leaving behind a mother, her son and his friend to work those things out Jeff and his Dad had never the courage to talk about.', 'Young and shy Jeff discovers his attraction to men. After struggling with himself he comes out to his parents. Mum eventually listens to his son and tries to understand his feelings, but his Dad would rather die — which, in the end, he really does, leaving behind a mother, her son and his friend to work those things out Jeff and his Dad had never the courage to talk about.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ag8VjwB3eNykf6YCM591RQNuLRx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129526'),
  ('298993591551648655', 'Consenting Adults', 1992, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Alan J. Pakula, Stephen Goldblatt, Alan B. Curtiss', 'Matthew Chapman', 'Kevin Kline, Mary Elizabeth Mastrantonio, Kevin Spacey, Rebecca Miller, Forest Whitaker, E.G. Marshall, Kimberly McCullough, Billie Neal', 'R', 'Richard and Priscilla Parker are an ordinary suburban couple whose lives are invaded and rocked by their hedonistic, secretive new neighbors, Eddy and Kay Otis.', 'Richard and Priscilla Parker are an ordinary suburban couple whose lives are invaded and rocked by their hedonistic, secretive new neighbors, Eddy and Kay Otis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/16H9mMevZFFZfnCgsE2fVe2HH51.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37753'),
  ('510235640836669542', 'Consequences', 2014, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Onur Bilgetay, Burçin Çakir, Merve Uzuner', 'Cem Akaş, Ozan Açıktan, Faruk Özerten', 'Nehir Erdoğan, Tardu Flordun, İlker Kaleli, Esra Bezen Bilgin, Serkan Keskin, Aytaç Uşun, Cem Özeren, Caner Arıkan', null, 'Cenk has just arrived back to Istanbul from the United States. Suppressed love slowly begins to resurface after he encounters Ece, a woman whom he had a romantic relationship with in the past. Suddenly, there is a robbery attempt in a quiet and gloomy house, which results in a crime being committed.', 'Cenk has just arrived back to Istanbul from the United States. Suppressed love slowly begins to resurface after he encounters Ece, a woman whom he had a romantic relationship with in the past. Suddenly, there is a robbery attempt in a quiet and gloomy house, which results in a crime being committed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jHmWm7S2pjL0j70p4dB5GOH1BKR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:314462'),
  ('936995207323503769', 'Consequences', 2018, 'Drama, Crime', 'Darko Štante, Rok Kajzer Nagode', 'Darko Štante', 'Matej Zemljič, Timon Šturbej, Gašper Markun, Rosana Hribar, Dejan Spasič, Blaž Setnikar, Lovro Zafred, Lea Čok Rajčič', null, 'After being sent to a youth detention centre, 18-year-old Andrej has to fight for his place within the group of inmates while getting closer to Željko, their informal leader, and struggling to keep his repressed secret in the dark.', 'After being sent to a youth detention centre, 18-year-old Andrej has to fight for his place within the group of inmates while getting closer to Željko, their informal leader, and struggling to keep his repressed secret in the dark.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v2VE7f5addFwBcUhHSciJSVr22E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:539504'),
  ('609657187846695268', 'Conserje en Condominio', 1974, 'Comedy', 'Miguel M. Delgado, Jorge Stahl Jr.', 'Isaac Díaz Araiza', 'Cantinflas, Claudia Islas, Raquel Olmedo, Jesús Salinas, Carlos Riquelme, Bertha Moss, Eugenia Avendaño, Ricardo Carrión', null, 'After reading in the newspaper, Úrsulo runs to seek employment. It is the position of caretaker of a luxury apartment building habited by people more heterogeneous: the professional model, the spiritualist, hippies and all turn to him to solve their problems. But someone in the building, kidnapped an important person and Úrsulo becomes a private investigator.', 'After reading in the newspaper, Úrsulo runs to seek employment. It is the position of caretaker of a luxury apartment building habited by people more heterogeneous: the professional model, the spiritualist, hippies and all turn to him to solve their problems. But someone in the building, kidnapped an important person and Úrsulo becomes a private investigator.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aOPZ9E8iDK3FWmOtipt6jr9ph9j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69045'),
  ('755075709066352398', 'Consolation Marriage', 1931, 'Drama, Romance', 'Paul Sloane, J. Roy Hunt, Charles Kerr', 'Bill Cunningham', 'Irene Dunne, Pat O''Brien, John Halliday, Myrna Loy, Lester Vail, Matt Moore, Elmer Ballard, Wilson Benge', 'NR', 'A sportswriter jilted by his globe-trotting girlfriend marries a woman jilted by her boyfriend.', 'A sportswriter jilted by his globe-trotting girlfriend marries a woman jilted by her boyfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oiIeAefuWZUx4bXC32togtw4kUQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136109'),
  ('1133493579698216585', 'Console Wars', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Blake J. Harris, Jonah Tulis, Seamus Tierney', null, 'Howard Phillips, Shinobu Toyoda, Paul Rioux, Tom Kalinske, Gail Tilden, Peter Main, Howard Lincoln, Al Nilsen', 'PG-13', 'In 1990, SEGA, a fledgling arcade company assembled a team of misfits to take on the greatest video game company in the world, Nintendo. It was a once-in-a-lifetime, no-holds-barred conflict that pit brother against brother, kids against grownups, Sonic against Mario, and uniquely American capitalism against centuries-old Japanese tradition. For the first time ever, the men and women who fought on the front lines for Sega and Nintendo discuss this battle that defined a generation.', 'In 1990, SEGA, a fledgling arcade company assembled a team of misfits to take on the greatest video game company in the world, Nintendo. It was a once-in-a-lifetime, no-holds-barred conflict that pit brother against brother, kids against grownups, Sonic against Mario, and uniquely American capitalism against centuries-old Japanese tradition. For the first time ever, the men and women who fought on the front lines for Sega and Nintendo discuss this battle that defined a generation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1y9uIazgq9gKawFqXuO71Xjs44Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:344031'),
  ('125720912615208745', 'Conspiracy', 1930, 'Mystery', 'Christy Cabanne, Nicholas Musuraca, Dewey Starkey', 'Beulah Marie Dix', 'Bessie Love, Ned Sparks, Hugh Trevor, Ivan Lebedeff, Rita La Roy, Gertrude Howard, Otto Matieson, Walter Long', null, 'Margaret Holt and her brother Victor set out to smash a narcotics ring responsible for their father''s death. Young reporter John Howell and eccentric mystery writer Winthrop Clavering help unravel the truth about the murder.', 'Margaret Holt and her brother Victor set out to smash a narcotics ring responsible for their father''s death. Young reporter John Howell and eccentric mystery writer Winthrop Clavering help unravel the truth about the murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x1MOIhApWOmtvPFFSfjUklGng22.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:165009'),
  ('56577915050627066', 'Conspiracy', 2001, 'History, Drama, War, TV Movie', 'Frank Pierson, Stephen Goldblatt', 'Loring Mandel', 'Kenneth Branagh, Stanley Tucci, Colin Firth, Jonathan Coy, Brendan Coyle, Ben Daniels, Barnaby Kay, Kevin McNally', 'R', 'At the Wannsee Conference on January 20, 1942, senior Nazi officials meet to determine the manner in which the so-called "Final Solution to the Jewish Question" can be best implemented.', 'At the Wannsee Conference on January 20, 1942, senior Nazi officials meet to determine the manner in which the so-called "Final Solution to the Jewish Question" can be best implemented.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/77uU3sPxufJEgK5SmqeJIdHeNSU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12900'),
  ('1086934946991219267', 'Conspiracy', 2008, 'Drama, Action, Thriller, Mystery', 'Adam Marcus, Ben Weinstein, Joseph Suarez', 'Debra Sullivan, Adam Marcus', 'Val Kilmer, Jennifer Esposito, Gary Cole, Alesia Riabenkova, Jay Jablonski, David Frye, Jeannine Cota, Stacy Marie Warden', 'R', 'A Gulf War veteran with PTSD heads to a small town to find his friend. When he arrives his friend and his family have vanished and the townsfolk afraid to answer questions about their disappearance. He soon discovers that the town is owned and controlled by one man, and he doesn''t like people asking questions.', 'A Gulf War veteran with PTSD heads to a small town to find his friend. When he arrives his friend and his family have vanished and the townsfolk afraid to answer questions about their disappearance. He soon discovers that the town is owned and controlled by one man, and he doesn''t like people asking questions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/isJpvxaaZd8mHH3E4FFpdExSYEt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13255'),
  ('585389643633013902', 'Conspiracy of Hearts', 1960, 'Drama, War', 'Ralph Thomas', 'Robert Presnell Jr.', 'Lilli Palmer, Sylvia Syms, Yvonne Mitchell, Albert Lieven, Peter Arne, Nora Swinburne, Michael Goodliffe, Ronald Lewis', null, 'In wartime Italy nuns in a convent regularly smuggle Jewish children out of a nearby internment camp. The Italian army officer in charge suspects what may be going on but deliberately turns a blind eye. When the Germans take over the camp security the nuns'' activities become far more dangerous.', 'In wartime Italy nuns in a convent regularly smuggle Jewish children out of a nearby internment camp. The Italian army officer in charge suspects what may be going on but deliberately turns a blind eye. When the Germans take over the camp security the nuns'' activities become far more dangerous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c5ykMEdhiSX6CeVYPUZ23PBkhci.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73898'),
  ('1151943540410504773', 'Conspiracy Theory', 1997, 'Action, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'John Schwartzman, Richard Donner, Jim Van Wyck', 'Brian Helgeland', 'Mel Gibson, Julia Roberts, Patrick Stewart, Cylk Cozart, Steve Kahan, Terry Alexander, Alex McArthur, Rod McLachlan', 'R', 'A man obsessed with conspiracy theories becomes a target after one of his theories turns out to be true. Unfortunately, in order to save himself, he has to figure out which theory it is.', 'A man obsessed with conspiracy theories becomes a target after one of his theories turns out to be true. Unfortunately, in order to save himself, he has to figure out which theory it is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sTyTKZVikQU6g50HE8HR1tBSRxj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8834'),
  ('349129183225851187', 'Conspirator', 1949, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Victor Saville, Freddie Young', 'Sally Benson', 'Robert Taylor, Elizabeth Taylor, Robert Flemyng, Harold Warrender, Honor Blackman, Marjorie Fielding, Thora Hird, Wilfrid Hyde-White', 'NR', 'A newlywed suspects her husband of being a Communist spy.', 'A newlywed suspects her husband of being a Communist spy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uqK0Nxp88M6G2wuQWWTyLejfIHN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83932'),
  ('288569284746499489', 'Conspirators of Pleasure', 1996, 'Drama, Animation, Comedy', 'Miloslav Špála, Jan Švankmajer', 'Jan Švankmajer', 'Petr Meissel, Gabriela Wilhelmová, Barbora Hrzánová, Anna Wetlinská, Jiří Lábus, Pavel Nový, Frantisek Polata, Eva Vidimská', null, 'Six Prague residents pursue bizarre rituals. Mr. Peony builds a chicken costume to wear while enacting homicidal fantasies toward neighbor Mrs. Loubalova, who does the same dressed as a dominatrix. Their mail carrier, Mrs. Malkova, inhales tiny balls of bread. Newsstand operator Mr. Kula obsessively watches the broadcasts of news anchor Mrs. Beltinska, whose husband regularly scrubs his body.', 'Six Prague residents pursue bizarre rituals. Mr. Peony builds a chicken costume to wear while enacting homicidal fantasies toward neighbor Mrs. Loubalova, who does the same dressed as a dominatrix. Their mail carrier, Mrs. Malkova, inhales tiny balls of bread. Newsstand operator Mr. Kula obsessively watches the broadcasts of news anchor Mrs. Beltinska, whose husband regularly scrubs his body.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rqZLPEVEcF703OeAkJNT624f7Zw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59892'),
  ('429295334889962683', 'Constance aux enfers', 2023, 'TV Movie, Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Gaël Morel, Grégoire de Calignon', 'Gilles Taurand, Gaël Morel', 'Miou-Miou, Salim Kéchiouche, Marilyn Lima, Aurore Clément, Leonid Glushchenko, Jérôme Deschamps, Catherine Schwartz, Jean-Pascal Hattu', null, 'Except for Amine and Kimmy, the young couple of neighbors she meets regularly, visitors are rare in Constance Brunel''s antique store. Loneliness is also her life. One night, Amine, in a panic, seeks help at her house: Kimmy has fallen badly when she slipped and she has killed herself. Thinking that the police will not believe this version because of his judicial past, Amine borrows Constance''s car to take the corpse and make it disappear. In the days that follow, this shared secret brings Constance and Amine closer. But one morning, an anonymous letter accompanied by photos demands a ransom: someone in the building has seen everything, the blackmail begins.', 'Except for Amine and Kimmy, the young couple of neighbors she meets regularly, visitors are rare in Constance Brunel''s antique store. Loneliness is also her life. One night, Amine, in a panic, seeks help at her house: Kimmy has fallen badly when she slipped and she has killed herself. Thinking that the police will not believe this version because of his judicial past, Amine borrows Constance''s car to take the corpse and make it disappear. In the days that follow, this shared secret brings Constance and Amine closer. But one morning, an anonymous letter accompanied by photos demands a ransom: someone in the building has seen everything, the blackmail begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zLywsZpT1jk2ZcNpY5IIpyOaSzT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:892498'),
  ('244990481392480778', 'Constantine', 2005, 'Fantasy, Action, Horror', 'Philippe Rousselot, Francis Lawrence, Darin Rivetti', 'Kevin Brodbin, Frank A. Cappello', 'Keanu Reeves, Rachel Weisz, Shia LaBeouf, Djimon Hounsou, Max Baker, Pruitt Taylor Vince, Gavin Rossdale, Tilda Swinton', 'R', 'John Constantine has literally been to Hell and back. When he teams up with a policewoman to solve the mysterious suicide of her twin sister, their investigation takes them through the world of demons and angels that exists beneath the landscape of contemporary Los Angeles.', 'John Constantine has literally been to Hell and back. When he teams up with a policewoman to solve the mysterious suicide of her twin sister, their investigation takes them through the world of demons and angels that exists beneath the landscape of contemporary Los Angeles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vPYgvd2MwHlxTamAOjwVQp4qs1W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:561'),
  ('833408283867027505', 'Constantine and the Cross', 1961, 'Adventure, Drama, History', 'Lionello De Felice, Massimo Dallamano, Paolo Bianchini', 'Ennio De Concini, Lionello De Felice, Ernesto Guida', 'Cornel Wilde, Belinda Lee, Massimo Serato, Christine Kaufmann, Fausto Tozzi, Tino Carraro, Carlo Ninchi, Vittorio Sanipoli', 'NR', 'Constantine is fighting against Barbarians with his father when he is called to Rome. In his way to Rome, he falls in an ambush planned by Maxence, who wants to become emperor.', 'Constantine is fighting against Barbarians with his father when he is called to Rome. In his way to Rome, he falls in an ambush planned by Maxence, who wants to become emperor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m1KG0Z2O1cgwW9ZccF1OtFJ1jXV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101853'),
  ('866994672578179844', 'Consumed', 2024, 'Horror', 'Mitchell Altieri, M.I. Littin-Menz', 'David Calbert', 'Courtney Halverson, Mark Famiglietti, Devon Sawa, Amber Mari, Golden Flores', null, 'Married couple Jay and Beth take a celebratory camping trip a year after Beth''s cancer remission but find themselves trapped between a wild madman and a skin-stealing monster.', 'Married couple Jay and Beth take a celebratory camping trip a year after Beth''s cancer remission but find themselves trapped between a wild madman and a skin-stealing monster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jMKc8AOyb7KWSzlKblstqjCXhvn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1280990'),
  ('195618005846976635', 'Contact', 1978, 'Animation, Science Fiction', 'Vladimir Tarasov, Kabul Rasulov, Vladimir Kutuzov', 'Alexander Kostinsky', 'Leonid Chizhik', null, 'A man walking on the fields encounters an alien visitor from outer space.', 'A man walking on the fields encounters an alien visitor from outer space.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lVcuvpMy4HnYZEUdjH0eelM3iy3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90008'),
