  ('375115646250388873', 'Contact High', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Michael Glawogger, Wolfgang Thaler, Marta Komorowska', 'Michael Glawogger, Michael Ostrowski', 'Michael Ostrowski, Raimund Wallisch, Detlev Buck, Georg Friedrich, Alexis Santiago Hernandez, Victor Varnado, Jeremy Strong, Michael-Joachim Heiss', null, 'Gangster boss Carlos orders the dodgy Viennese junkyard owner Harry to bring him a bag from Poland. Harry passes the order on to his "best man" Schorsch. Schorsch, not exactly the brightest, is currently without a driver''s license and completely fixated on the 24-hour car race of Le Mans. So he gives the order to Mao and sends in their place the takeaway lessees Hans and Max to Poland. Their journey leads to a seemingly endless drug trip full of extraordinary phenomena.', 'Gangster boss Carlos orders the dodgy Viennese junkyard owner Harry to bring him a bag from Poland. Harry passes the order on to his "best man" Schorsch. Schorsch, not exactly the brightest, is currently without a driver''s license and completely fixated on the 24-hour car race of Le Mans. So he gives the order to Mao and sends in their place the takeaway lessees Hans and Max to Poland. Their journey leads to a seemingly endless drug trip full of extraordinary phenomena.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uDV8vKdnYb6XJtzZqu4Lqt6m7Yh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31337'),
  ('145445545109575560', 'Contagion', 1988, 'Horror, Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Karl Zwicky', null, 'John Doyle, Nicola Bartlett, Ray Barrett, Nathy Gaffney, Pamela Hawkesford, Jacqueline Brennan, Chris Betts, Michael Simpson', null, 'A real estate agent is lured to a run-down mansion only to be trapped and tortured by ghosts.', 'A real estate agent is lured to a run-down mansion only to be trapped and tortured by ghosts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3gSV7PxduvfIav5aISN3p3yJqRD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85153'),
  ('586254066058863540', 'Contagion', 2011, 'Drama, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Gregory Jacobs, Ahmed Hatimi, Lemon Liu Yi-Man', 'Scott Z. Burns', 'Marion Cotillard, Matt Damon, Laurence Fishburne, Jude Law, Kate Winslet, Jennifer Ehle, Gwyneth Paltrow, Bryan Cranston', 'PG-13', 'As an epidemic of a lethal airborne virus - that kills within days - rapidly grows, the worldwide medical community races to find a cure and control the panic that spreads faster than the virus itself.', 'As an epidemic of a lethal airborne virus - that kills within days - rapidly grows, the worldwide medical community races to find a cure and control the panic that spreads faster than the virus itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qL0IooP0bjXy0KXl9KEyPo22ll0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39538'),
  ('217934670172535999', 'Contagion of Fear', 2023, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Enzo Tedeschi', 'Greta Harrison, Matthew C. Vaughan', 'Paul Michael Ayre, Melissa Brattoni, Zoe Carides, Raelee Hill, Nicholas Hope, Jessica Fallico, Anna Houston, Ash Ricardo', null, 'A catastrophic train derailment sends the city spiraling into chaos. But the derailment is just the beginning. A biological gas attack sees crash survivors collapsing and dying within minutes. And the sickness is rapidly spreading.', 'A catastrophic train derailment sends the city spiraling into chaos. But the derailment is just the beginning. A biological gas attack sees crash survivors collapsing and dying within minutes. And the sickness is rapidly spreading.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A5muc6PtApC9ubfmJW3ADRnIIfi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1223272'),
  ('327759425588467014', 'Contagious', 1997, 'Thriller, Drama, TV Movie', 'Andreas Poulsson, Joe Napolitano', 'Sandy Kroopf', 'Lindsay Wagner, Elizabeth Peña, Ken Pogue, Brendan Fletcher, Tom Wopat, Alexandra Purvis, Matt Hill, Gerard Plunkett', 'NR', 'When cholera-tainted shrimp from Mexico is served to people on a Los Angeles-bound plane, an outbreak ensues and a doctor sets out to find and contain the source before it turns into an epidemic.', 'When cholera-tainted shrimp from Mexico is served to people on a Los Angeles-bound plane, an outbreak ensues and a doctor sets out to find and contain the source before it turns into an epidemic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ygcDBeWisaOT4dTUZFgPHtE6jQm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:207644'),
  ('321667854561398775', 'Containment', 2015, 'Thriller, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Neil Mcenery-West, Arthur Mulhern', 'David Lemon', 'Louise Brealey, Lee Ross, Sheila Reid, Pippa Nixon, Claire Greasley, Andrew Leung, Billy Postlethwaite, Hannah Chalmers', 'R', 'Neighbors in a block wake one morning to find they have been sealed inside their apartments. Can they work together to find out why? Or will they destroy each other in their fight to escape?', 'Neighbors in a block wake one morning to find they have been sealed inside their apartments. Can they work together to find out why? Or will they destroy each other in their fight to escape?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lz6G41YdOK1CO2qOkoBe6cudofb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347548'),
  ('611998745681067552', 'Contamination', 1980, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Luigi Cozzi, Giuseppe Pinori', 'Luigi Cozzi, Erich Tomek', 'Ian McCulloch, Louise Marleau, Marino Masé, Siegfried Rauch, Gisela Hahn, Carlo De Mejo, Carlo Monni, Mike Morris', 'R', 'A former astronaut helps a government agent and a police detective track the source of mysterious alien pod spores, filled with lethal flesh-dissolving acid, to a South American coffee plantation controlled by alien pod clones.', 'A former astronaut helps a government agent and a police detective track the source of mysterious alien pod spores, filled with lethal flesh-dissolving acid, to a South American coffee plantation controlled by alien pod clones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eCUSieEikP6vt0dBbIKnEGpyEK2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39916'),
  ('11372886966106948', 'Contempt', 1963, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jean-Luc Godard, Raoul Coutard, Alain Levent', 'Jean-Luc Godard', 'Brigitte Bardot, Michel Piccoli, Jack Palance, Giorgia Moll, Fritz Lang, Raoul Coutard, Jean-Luc Godard, Linda Veras', 'NR', 'A philistine in the art film business, Jeremy Prokosch is a producer unhappy with the work of his director. Prokosch has hired Fritz Lang to direct an adaptation of "The Odyssey," but when it seems that the legendary filmmaker is making a picture destined to bomb at the box office, he brings in a screenwriter to energize the script. The professional intersects with the personal when a rift develops between the writer and his wife.', 'A philistine in the art film business, Jeremy Prokosch is a producer unhappy with the work of his director. Prokosch has hired Fritz Lang to direct an adaptation of "The Odyssey," but when it seems that the legendary filmmaker is making a picture destined to bomb at the box office, he brings in a screenwriter to energize the script. The professional intersects with the personal when a rift develops between the writer and his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kNElbRcp4Qz6wmJ9kH5vdY004Hq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:266'),
  ('757563336839441947', 'Contigo no, bicho', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Álvaro Alonso, Miguel Ángel Jiménez', 'Álvaro Alonso, Miguel Ángel Jiménez', 'Manuel Pérez, Carlos Suárez, Fredy López, Alicia Ciero, Noe Fernández, Cristina Bállega, Alfonso Sánchez, Amarna Miller', 'R', 'Víctor, Rubio, Charly, and Berny are four high school buddies who only think about girls and video games. When one of them, Víctor, manages to lose his virginity, the other three decide to change their luck. They''ll go out for a weekend, with only one goal: lose it or die trying.', 'Víctor, Rubio, Charly, and Berny are four high school buddies who only think about girls and video games. When one of them, Víctor, manages to lose his virginity, the other three decide to change their luck. They''ll go out for a weekend, with only one goal: lose it or die trying.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aH9wSQqhRI1B8SM09UBcJhVbmtD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:542437'),
  ('1101006570575215030', 'Continental Divide', 1981, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Michael Apted, John Bailey', 'Lawrence Kasdan', 'John Belushi, Blair Brown, Allen Garfield, Carlin Glynn, Tony Ganios, Val Avery, Liam Russell, Everett Smith', 'PG', 'A hard-nosed Chicago journalist has an unlikely love affair with an eagle researcher.', 'A hard-nosed Chicago journalist has an unlikely love affair with an eagle researcher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jwLFNA10RJBcQ4Fe0SoySkSFr0V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26560'),
  ('310262451797208337', 'Continental Drift (South)', 2022, 'Drama', 'Lionel Baier, Josée Deshaies', 'Marina de Van, Lionel Baier, Laurent Larivière', 'Isabelle Carré, Théodore Pellerin, Ursina Lardi, Ivan Georgiev, Tom Villa, Daphne Scoccia, Mario Opinato, Indri Qyteza Shiroka', null, 'Nathalie Adler is on a mission for the EU in Sicily. She organizes the next visit of Macron and Merkel to a migrant camp. Their presence has a high symbolic value to show that everything is under control. But who still wants to believe in this European family on the verge of a nervous breakdown? Probably not Albert, Nathalie''s son, an NGO activist who arrives without warning. He, moreover, no longer believes in his mother.', 'Nathalie Adler is on a mission for the EU in Sicily. She organizes the next visit of Macron and Merkel to a migrant camp. Their presence has a high symbolic value to show that everything is under control. But who still wants to believe in this European family on the verge of a nervous breakdown? Probably not Albert, Nathalie''s son, an NGO activist who arrives without warning. He, moreover, no longer believes in his mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7T70V8hKjMWWdKEVsF8uD9skKil.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:958978'),
  ('256236766439154668', 'Continental Split', 2024, 'Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Nick Lyon, Pedja Radenkovic', 'Gil Luna, Joe Roche', 'Jessica Morris, Chris Bruno, Allison Gold, Crew Morrow, Canyon Prince, Joe Kurak, Quintin Mims, Iman Mireille Kamel', null, 'As the New Madrid Fault threatens to tear the U.S. in half, a desperate team of seismologists and government agents race to prevent disaster while the clock ticks down.', 'As the New Madrid Fault threatens to tear the U.S. in half, a desperate team of seismologists and government agents race to prevent disaster while the clock ticks down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1LbJYo2l0Gfx6hs3CDdWZQSW2ZP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1181701'),
