  ('254662696212146607', 'Controlled Conversations', 1991, 'Comedy', 'Sylwester Chęciński, Jerzy Stawicki, Stanisław Tym', 'Stanisław Tym', 'Stanisław Tym, Irena Kwiatkowska, Alina Janowska, Krzysztof Kowalewski, Jerzy Bończak, Marian Opania, Jerzy Turek, Bożena Dykiel', null, 'Ryszard Ochódzki receives a special assignment for UB - infiltrating the "Solidarity" party branch in Suwałki. His arriving there coincides with the imposition of martial law on Poland.', 'Ryszard Ochódzki receives a special assignment for UB - infiltrating the "Solidarity" party branch in Suwałki. His arriving there coincides with the imposition of martial law on Poland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vsdp6mpUHd6jYaqqurFY9Rm5Sem.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57721'),
