  ('858962336944286023', 'Controsesso', 1964, 'Comedy', 'Renato Castellani, Marco Ferreri, Leonida Barboni', 'Piero De Bernardi, Giorgio Salvioni, Leonardo Benvenuti', 'Nino Manfredi, Ugo Tognazzi, Anna Maria Ferrero, Dolores Wettach, Umberto D''Orsi, Antonio Ciani, Renzo Marignano, Marzia Ubaldi', null, 'A vivid assortment consisted of three acts taken from the lives of modern 1960s Italians, always in orbit around the restless theme of sexual inhibition and the pursuit of pleasure in sex.', 'A vivid assortment consisted of three acts taken from the lives of modern 1960s Italians, always in orbit around the restless theme of sexual inhibition and the pursuit of pleasure in sex.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mumtBLhq7Vk73a8rmNmdaywjHFp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54141'),
  ('833806269446217049', 'Convent of Sinners', 1986, 'Drama, Horror', 'Joe D''Amato, Joe D''Amato', 'Antonio Bonifacio, Daniele Stroppa', 'Eva Grimaldi, Karin Well, Gabriele Gori, Jessica Moore, Martin Philips, Gabriele Tinti, Aldina Martano, Katalin Murany', null, 'Convent of Sinners is the story of Susanna, a young girl who is raped by her own father and sent to a convent for her sins, where she falls in love with a priest. The other nuns, however, are jealous and angry, they want Susanna for themselves, and accuse her of being possessed by the Devil.', 'Convent of Sinners is the story of Susanna, a young girl who is raped by her own father and sent to a convent for her sins, where she falls in love with a priest. The other nuns, however, are jealous and angry, they want Susanna for themselves, and accuse her of being possessed by the Devil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1L0BEF5ymuJeAW05fSGMB849Fnq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29187'),
  ('256769846385971205', 'Conversation Piece', 1974, 'Drama, Romance', 'Luchino Visconti, Albino Cocco, Louise Vincent', 'Suso Cecchi d''Amico, Enrico Medioli, Luchino Visconti', 'Burt Lancaster, Silvana Mangano, Helmut Berger, Claudia Marsani, Stefano Patrizi, Elvira Cortese, Philippe Hersent, Guy Tréjan', 'R', 'A retired professor of American origin lives a solitary life in a luxurious palazzo in Rome. He is confronted by a vulgar Italian marchesa and her lover, her daughter and her daughter''s boyfriend, and forced to rent to them an apartment on the upper floor of his palazzo. From this point on his quiet routine is turned into chaos by his tenants'' machinations, and everybody''s life takes an unexpected but inevitable turn.', 'A retired professor of American origin lives a solitary life in a luxurious palazzo in Rome. He is confronted by a vulgar Italian marchesa and her lover, her daughter and her daughter''s boyfriend, and forced to rent to them an apartment on the upper floor of his palazzo. From this point on his quiet routine is turned into chaos by his tenants'' machinations, and everybody''s life takes an unexpected but inevitable turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vLFdB2MsgAH7UCVb60EzLTjIoqN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56142'),
  ('11810248222036810', 'Conversation with Fritz Lang', 1975, 'Documentary', 'William Friedkin, William A. Fraker', null, 'William Friedkin, Fritz Lang', null, 'American director William Friedkin interviewed Austrian director Fritz Lang on February 21st and 24th, 1975. Lang died August 2nd, 1976.', 'American director William Friedkin interviewed Austrian director Fritz Lang on February 21st and 24th, 1975. Lang died August 2nd, 1976.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bTNtlGRK5rci7dzQewFvPv0NyZB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154267'),
  ('527182274915195246', 'Conversation with Romy Schneider', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Patrick Jeudy', 'Charlie Buffet, Patrick Jeudy', 'Alice Schwarzer, Romy Schneider, Denis Podalydès', null, 'During a night in Cologne in 1976, Romy Schneider opens up like she’d never done before. An intimate portrait based on audio recordings of her interview with journalist Alice Schwarzer.', 'During a night in Cologne in 1976, Romy Schneider opens up like she’d never done before. An intimate portrait based on audio recordings of her interview with journalist Alice Schwarzer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fwPNd7GNGO06KKPgdKR2tivckil.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:548967'),
  ('124036007381885793', 'Conversations with God', 2006, 'Drama', 'Stephen Deutsch', 'Eric DelaBarre', 'Henry Czerny, Michelle Merring, Ingrid Boulting, Vilma Silva, U. Jonathan Toppo, Zoe McLellan, Abdul Salaam El Razzac, Douglas Rowe', 'PG', '"Conversations with God" is the true story of Neale Donald Walsch that inspired and changed the lives of millions. The journey begins after he unexpectedly breaks his neck in a car accident and loses his job.', '"Conversations with God" is the true story of Neale Donald Walsch that inspired and changed the lives of millions. The journey begins after he unexpectedly breaks his neck in a car accident and loses his job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1JYNHj83ELXg38427fnAc02auBV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24590'),
  ('1125223019488696568', 'Conversations with Mother', 2004, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Santiago Carlos Oves, Aníbal Bosco', 'Santiago Carlos Oves', 'China Zorrilla, Eduardo Blanco, Ulises Dumont, Silvina Bosco, Floria Bloise, Tito Mendoza, Nicolás Condito', null, 'Jaime has lost his job and has to provide for his wife, son and daughter. Pressured by this circumstances, he visits his mom, who lives in an apartment he owns, to ask her to move with him so he can sell the apartment. But she is not going to cooperate. And, to Jaime''s surprise, she also has a boyfriend!', 'Jaime has lost his job and has to provide for his wife, son and daughter. Pressured by this circumstances, he visits his mom, who lives in an apartment he owns, to ask her to move with him so he can sell the apartment. But she is not going to cooperate. And, to Jaime''s surprise, she also has a boyfriend!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zIRCirg18lhRQoBCSZ9Dl6DVY7W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35005'),
  ('1098735547972462753', 'Conversations with My Gardener', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jean Becker, Jean-Marie Dreujou', 'Jean Cosmos, Jean Becker, Jacques Monnet', 'Daniel Auteuil, Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Fanny Cottençon, Alexia Barlier, Hiam Abbass, Élodie Navarre, Roger Van Hool, Michel Lagueyrie', null, 'A successful artist, weary of Parisian life and on the verge of divorce, returns to the country to live in his childhood house. He needs someone to make a real vegetable garden again out of the wilderness it has become. The gardener happens to be a former schoolfriend. A warm, fruitful conversation starts between the two men.', 'A successful artist, weary of Parisian life and on the verge of divorce, returns to the country to live in his childhood house. He needs someone to make a real vegetable garden again out of the wilderness it has become. The gardener happens to be a former schoolfriend. A warm, fruitful conversation starts between the two men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q3xyafrkgnAv0ErKJacHE5MA6ef.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4519'),
  ('1069190565053492988', 'Conversations with Other Women', 2006, 'Drama, Romance', 'Hans Canosa, Steve Yedlin, Chad Rosen', 'Gabrielle Zevin', 'Helena Bonham Carter, Aaron Eckhart, Yury Tsykun, Brian Geraghty, Brianna Brown, Nora Zehetner, Olivia Wilde, Thomas Lennon', 'R', 'Reunited at a wedding after many years, former lovers again feel the pull of a mutual attraction neither is willing to admit. Escaping the reception for the privacy of a hotel room, the unnamed pair explore the choices of the past that led them to the present.', 'Reunited at a wedding after many years, former lovers again feel the pull of a mutual attraction neither is willing to admit. Escaping the reception for the privacy of a hotel room, the unnamed pair explore the choices of the past that led them to the present.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5iA72q3avmveCiOtx1Uaj22pgXI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15624'),
  ('674462637761354110', 'Conversazioni con altre donne', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Filippo Conz', 'Gabrielle Zevin', 'Francesco Scianna, Valentina Lodovini', null, 'Two former partners reignite their spark at a wedding reception, but as the night wears on, fond memories fade into mutual regrets and their brief affair turns into a desperate attempt to recapture lost time.', 'Two former partners reignite their spark at a wedding reception, but as the night wears on, fond memories fade into mutual regrets and their brief affair turns into a desperate attempt to recapture lost time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/la8jBQSOnKumOpU8RgUOk3Ikf5b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1145538'),
  ('857815406860341623', 'Convict', 2014, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'David Field, George Basha', 'George Basha', 'George Basha, David Field, Richard Green, Franc Violi, Brian Ellison, Johnny Nasser, Tony Ryan, Stephen Anderton', null, 'Set in the dark and old Parramatta prison built by the original convicts our lead character Ray a war veteran finds himself serving 18 months for manslaughter after defending his fiance. He soon realizes that the prison boss has it in for him and does everything possible to break Ray even going after his fiance.', 'Set in the dark and old Parramatta prison built by the original convicts our lead character Ray a war veteran finds himself serving 18 months for manslaughter after defending his fiance. He soon realizes that the prison boss has it in for him and does everything possible to break Ray even going after his fiance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mnvkok7eVau9Fg8BMDuwmk8JCZw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:245527'),
  ('320728691419806082', 'Convict 13', 1920, 'Comedy', 'Buster Keaton, Edward F. Cline', 'Edward F. Cline, Buster Keaton', 'Buster Keaton, Sybil Seely, Joe Roberts, Edward F. Cline, Joe Keaton, Harry Keaton, Louise Keaton', null, 'A young golfer is mugged by an escaped convict and finds himself in a prison where he foils a jailbreak.', 'A young golfer is mugged by an escaped convict and finds himself in a prison where he foils a jailbreak.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1KHIWkD1jHMICyWsV00lghJXbn9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38705'),
  ('543213906834197084', 'Convict 99', 1938, 'Comedy', 'Marcel Varnel', 'Val Guest, Ralph Smart, Jack Davis Jr.', 'Will Hay, Moore Marriott, Graham Moffatt, Googie Withers, Peter Gawthorne, Basil Radford, Wilfred Walter, Dennis Wyndham', null, 'A disgraced school master, Benjamin Twist, is mistaken for a tough prison governor and assigned the charge of a prison for particularly hardened criminals. Believing he is being sent to a school rather than a prison, he celebrates accordingly only to find that his drunkenness accidently lands him on the wrong side of the prison bars. The Governorship is eventually restored to him, and he sets about popularising himself amongst the convicts by turning a blind eye to their shady dealings.', 'A disgraced school master, Benjamin Twist, is mistaken for a tough prison governor and assigned the charge of a prison for particularly hardened criminals. Believing he is being sent to a school rather than a prison, he celebrates accordingly only to find that his drunkenness accidently lands him on the wrong side of the prison bars. The Governorship is eventually restored to him, and he sets about popularising himself amongst the convicts by turning a blind eye to their shady dealings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nWdp2hW6LLfsLaHkOP6W4lkrSHI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78456'),
  ('87114113208531305', 'Convicted', 1950, 'Crime, Drama', 'Burnett Guffey, Henry Levin, Frederick Briskin', 'Fred Niblo Jr., William Bowers, Seton I. Miller', 'Glenn Ford, Broderick Crawford, Millard Mitchell, Dorothy Malone, Carl Benton Reid, Frank Faylen, Will Geer, Martha Stewart', null, 'A prison warden fights to prove one of his inmates was wrongly convicted.', 'A prison warden fights to prove one of his inmates was wrongly convicted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lKSB2IJDifvE9AC2OOmxY7gJqWI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35920'),
  ('1148987007004911040', 'Conviction', 2010, 'Drama', 'Tony Goldwyn, Adriano Goldman', 'Pamela Gray', 'Hilary Swank, Sam Rockwell, Minnie Driver, Melissa Leo, Peter Gallagher, Ari Graynor, Loren Dean, Conor Donovan', 'R', 'When Betty Anne Waters'' older brother Kenny is arrested for murder and sentenced to life in 1983, Betty Anne, a Massachusetts wife and mother of two, dedicates her life to overturning the murder conviction. Convinced that her brother is innocent, Betty Anne puts herself through high school, college and, finally, law school in an 18 year quest to free Kenny. With the help of best friend Abra Rice, Betty Anne pores through suspicious evidence mounted by small town cop Nancy Taylor, meticulously retracing the steps that led to Kenny''s arrest. Belief in her brother - and her quest for the truth - pushes Betty Anne and her team to uncover the facts and utilize DNA evidence with the hope of exonerating Kenny.', 'When Betty Anne Waters'' older brother Kenny is arrested for murder and sentenced to life in 1983, Betty Anne, a Massachusetts wife and mother of two, dedicates her life to overturning the murder conviction. Convinced that her brother is innocent, Betty Anne puts herself through high school, college and, finally, law school in an 18 year quest to free Kenny. With the help of best friend Abra Rice, Betty Anne pores through suspicious evidence mounted by small town cop Nancy Taylor, meticulously retracing the steps that led to Kenny''s arrest. Belief in her brother - and her quest for the truth - pushes Betty Anne and her team to uncover the facts and utilize DNA evidence with the hope of exonerating Kenny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rUxznyFz7D0HgC5zcYigzP1XUi4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45094'),
  ('321692952893994953', 'Conviction', 2019, 'Drama', 'Pierre Cottereau, Pierrick Vautier, Antoine Raimbault', 'Antoine Raimbault, Isabelle Lazard', 'Marina Foïs, Olivier Gourmet, Laurent Lucas, Philippe Uchan, Jean Benguigui, François Fehner, François Caron, Philippe Dormoy', null, 'Ever since she served on the jury during his trial, Nora has been convinced that Jacques Viguier is innocent, despite him being accused of murdering his wife. Following an appeal by the public prosecutor’s office, and fearing a miscarriage of justice, she convinces a leading lawyer to defend him during his second trial, on appeal. Together, they will put up a tenacious fight against injustice.', 'Ever since she served on the jury during his trial, Nora has been convinced that Jacques Viguier is innocent, despite him being accused of murdering his wife. Following an appeal by the public prosecutor’s office, and fearing a miscarriage of justice, she convinces a leading lawyer to defend him during his second trial, on appeal. Together, they will put up a tenacious fight against injustice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aSiDOaB12twIXNN4tJWnCspwyys.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:487611'),
  ('1034898370767094561', 'Convicts', 1991, 'Drama', 'Peter Masterson, Toyomichi Kurita', 'Horton Foote', 'Robert Duvall, Lukas Haas, James Earl Jones, Starletta DuPois, Carlin Glynn, Calvin Levels, Gary Swanson', null, 'In 1902, 13-year-old Horace toils on a run-down plantation in rural Texas to buy a tombstone for the father he lost a year earlier. Soll, the crusty old Confederate who owns the plantation and depends on convict labor to keep his farm running, takes a liking to Horace. However, Soll is aging and sinking into senility, making the possibility of Horace ever getting his pay increasingly unlikely. On Christmas Eve, as Soll becomes obsessed with his own mortality, he makes a grand promise... forcing Horace to confront his fear of death and the harsh truths of a decadent society.', 'In 1902, 13-year-old Horace toils on a run-down plantation in rural Texas to buy a tombstone for the father he lost a year earlier. Soll, the crusty old Confederate who owns the plantation and depends on convict labor to keep his farm running, takes a liking to Horace. However, Soll is aging and sinking into senility, making the possibility of Horace ever getting his pay increasingly unlikely. On Christmas Eve, as Soll becomes obsessed with his own mortality, he makes a grand promise... forcing Horace to confront his fear of death and the harsh truths of a decadent society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qg9gzYqONDAj79VwQ0VxhkhoTke.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71034'),
  ('634186765304086542', 'Convoy', 1940, 'Drama, War', 'Pen Tennyson', 'Pen Tennyson, Patrick Kirwan', 'Clive Brook, John Clements, Edward Chapman, Judy Campbell, Penelope Dudley-Ward, Edward Rigby, Allan Jeayes, Michael Wilding', null, 'A tale of life on board a Royal Navy cruiser assigned to protect the vital convoys between America and England during WWII.', 'A tale of life on board a Royal Navy cruiser assigned to protect the vital convoys between America and England during WWII.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sqHWS5hPZWnKEoQ7UDT8OvdK7O0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130989'),
  ('145282034441120899', 'Convoy', 1978, 'Action, Comedy, Drama', 'Sam Peckinpah, Harry Stradling Jr., James Coburn', 'Bill L. Norton', 'Kris Kristofferson, Ali MacGraw, Burt Young, Madge Sinclair, Franklyn Ajaye, Brian Davies, Seymour Cassel, Cassie Yates', 'PG', 'Trucker Rubber Duck and his buddies Pig Pen, Widow Woman and Spider Mike use their CB radios to warn one another of the presence of cops. But conniving Sheriff Wallace is hip to the truckers'' tactics, and begins tricking the drivers through his own CB broadcasts. Facing constant harassment from the law, Rubber Duck and his pals use their radios to coordinate a vast convoy and rule the road.', 'Trucker Rubber Duck and his buddies Pig Pen, Widow Woman and Spider Mike use their CB radios to warn one another of the presence of cops. But conniving Sheriff Wallace is hip to the truckers'' tactics, and begins tricking the drivers through his own CB broadcasts. Facing constant harassment from the law, Rubber Duck and his pals use their radios to coordinate a vast convoy and rule the road.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xjowoBInlikSlvfAYDRN9ubaODB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9584'),
  ('849529964582057610', 'Convoy Busters', 1978, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Stelvio Massi, Sergio Rubini, Danilo Massi', 'Gino Capone', 'Maurizio Merli, Massimo Serato, Mario Feliciani, Mimmo Palmara, Marco Gelardini, Attilio Duse, Olga Karlatos, Piero Gerlini', null, 'In Rome, a vagrant finds the body of a teen girl, her throat professional slashed. Police inspector Olmi uses his brutal and violent methods to follow a trail that leads him toward high government officials. When his methods leave an innocent bystander dead, the corrupt officials have an excuse to get Olmi transferred to a coastal town where the pace is slow and he has time for a romantic dalliance. Soon, Olmi discovers that fishing isn''t the only local occupation, and out comes his gun and his ruthless tactics of investigation.', 'In Rome, a vagrant finds the body of a teen girl, her throat professional slashed. Police inspector Olmi uses his brutal and violent methods to follow a trail that leads him toward high government officials. When his methods leave an innocent bystander dead, the corrupt officials have an excuse to get Olmi transferred to a coastal town where the pace is slow and he has time for a romantic dalliance. Soon, Olmi discovers that fishing isn''t the only local occupation, and out comes his gun and his ruthless tactics of investigation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9x13fru9AH1OQrrv8IdTDjrydvR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106139'),
  ('673815447458015516', 'Convoy of Girls', 1979, 'War, Drama', 'Pierre Chevalier, Jesús Franco, Raymond Heil', 'Jesús Franco, Marius Lesoeur', 'Brigitte Parmentier, Jean-Marie Lemaire, Henri Lambert, Monica Swinn, Michel Charrel, Pamela Stanford, Michel Danjou, Carine François', null, 'Eric, a brilliant young German officer, is transfered back to Berlin.His superior officer tells him about his new assignment on the Russian front and then invites him to a luxurious villa. Gathered in the mansion are the most beautiful women: the army''s special services could enroll for the pleasure of its returning heroes.Eric is stupefied to recognize Renata among the women, who are all ready and willing to make love with any officer present. Not many years ago, while still students, Renata and Eric had been very much in love. After making love in a room put at their disposal, Renata tells him that she had no choice but to accept joining the army as an official camp follower: her father''s survival depended on it. The following morning, Renata leaves in a special women''s convoy for Eastern frontwhere they are scheduled to entertain hard-pressed officers and men. Will Eric and Renata''s love survive those adventures?', 'Eric, a brilliant young German officer, is transfered back to Berlin.His superior officer tells him about his new assignment on the Russian front and then invites him to a luxurious villa. Gathered in the mansion are the most beautiful women: the army''s special services could enroll for the pleasure of its returning heroes.Eric is stupefied to recognize Renata among the women, who are all ready and willing to make love with any officer present. Not many years ago, while still students, Renata and Eric had been very much in love. After making love in a room put at their disposal, Renata tells him that she had no choice but to accept joining the army as an official camp follower: her father''s survival depended on it. The following morning, Renata leaves in a special women''s convoy for Eastern frontwhere they are scheduled to entertain hard-pressed officers and men. Will Eric and Renata''s love survive those adventures?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pqBdb48Uj0H9DN0zox4rZpaL499.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81736'),
  ('914327273969798712', 'Coo of the Far Seas', 1993, 'Animation, Adventure', 'Tetsuo Imazawa, Masahiko Watanabe, Hideki Hiroshima', 'Kihachi Okamoto', 'Yuta Yamazaki, Masatô Ibu, Tomoko Yamaguchi, Akira Kamiya, Iemasa Kayumi, Takeshi Aono, Taro Ishida, Ryuji Saikachi', null, 'After a storm hits their island, Yusuke (driving his jet-ski) finds a baby dinosaur. He show it to his dad, they keep it and call it Coo. But there are other parties interested in a 65 million year old creature...', 'After a storm hits their island, Yusuke (driving his jet-ski) finds a baby dinosaur. He show it to his dad, they keep it and call it Coo. But there are other parties interested in a 65 million year old creature...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7uUxVv8sHIO8LIcPeGjZx8LC02V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174712'),
  ('404575638972012452', 'Coogan''s Bluff', 1968, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Don Siegel, Bud Thackery, Robert Surtees', 'Herman Miller, Howard A. Rodman, Dean Riesner', 'Clint Eastwood, Lee J. Cobb, Susan Clark, Tisha Sterling, Don Stroud, Betty Field, Tom Tully, Melodie Johnson', 'R', 'Coogan, an Arizona deputy sheriff goes to New York to pick up a prisoner. While escorting the prisoner to the airport, he escapes and Coogan heads into the city to recapture him.', 'Coogan, an Arizona deputy sheriff goes to New York to pick up a prisoner. While escorting the prisoner to the airport, he escapes and Coogan heads into the city to recapture him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A0dObkaXai6q46sIMSRI1MCcN7E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26170'),
  ('998198235791670548', 'Cook Up a Storm', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Raymond Yip Wai-Man, Yip Shiu-Kei', 'Liu Yi, Manfred Wong Man-Chun, Li Jing Ling', 'Nicholas Tse Ting-Fung, Jung Yong-hwa, Tang Yan, Michelle Bai, Ge You, Anthony Wong Chau-Sang, Du Haitao, Jim Chim Sui-Man', 'NR', 'An international culinary competition becomes a battleground between rival cooks, one famous for his Cantonese street food and the other a Michelin-starred chef trained in France. But their rivalry takes an unexpected turn when they discover a common foe and combine their skills in a fusion of East and West.', 'An international culinary competition becomes a battleground between rival cooks, one famous for his Cantonese street food and the other a Michelin-starred chef trained in France. But their rivalry takes an unexpected turn when they discover a common foe and combine their skills in a fusion of East and West.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jHMVa4VWLxggvbDo2Ol1ln4obJs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438857'),
  ('1035635243092821787', 'Cooked', 2025, 'Drama', 'Emre Şahin, Clint Lealos', 'Can Cengiz', 'Burak Deniz, Öykü Karayel, Osman Sonant, Onur Ünsal, Ulvi Kahyaoğlu, Tuğba Çom, Murat Kılıç, Nergis Öztürk', 'NR', 'Chef and owner Sina Bora faces personal and professional challenges on one of his restaurant''s busiest nights. His father''s emergency surgery, staff tensions and his former mentor Renzo''s plans to take over push Sina to make tough decisions.', 'Chef and owner Sina Bora faces personal and professional challenges on one of his restaurant''s busiest nights. His father''s emergency surgery, staff tensions and his former mentor Renzo''s plans to take over push Sina to make tough decisions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bjHGT2f65Tim3YFJJci766FOgzH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1392117'),
  ('350981597248945296', 'Cookie', 1989, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Susan Seidelman, Oliver Stapleton, David Dreyfuss', 'Alice Arlen, Nora Ephron', 'Peter Falk, Dianne Wiest, Emily Lloyd, Michael V. Gazzo, Brenda Vaccaro, Adrian Pasdar, Lionel Stander, Jerry Lewis', 'R', 'Cookie Voltecki is the illegitimate daughter of mobster Dino Capisco, who has just finished thirteen years in prison. Since being released from jail, all that Dino wants is to settle some old scores, and make up for lost time with his daughter.', 'Cookie Voltecki is the illegitimate daughter of mobster Dino Capisco, who has just finished thirteen years in prison. Since being released from jail, all that Dino wants is to settle some old scores, and make up for lost time with his daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z37uyPcHdQoXFXSywqsUJTeFAPc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86093'),
  ('356935318339294636', 'Cookie', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Léa Fazer, Christophe Offenstein', 'Ayelet Menahemi, Shemi Zarhin', 'Alice Taglioni, Virginie Efira, Mehdi Nebbou, Scali Delpeyrat, Meriem Serbah, Max Ding, Philippe Lefebvre, Lolita Offenstein', null, 'Adeline''s Chinese housekeeper suddenly disappears, leaving behind a little boy who doesn''t speak a word of French. Helped by her sister, she takes care of the child and proceeds to locate the mother.', 'Adeline''s Chinese housekeeper suddenly disappears, leaving behind a little boy who doesn''t speak a word of French. Helped by her sister, she takes care of the child and proceeds to locate the mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zDUVhaVlSQiSmfjnwdpbTtmjNDn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160652'),
  ('948330115507189879', 'Cookie''s Fortune', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Robert Altman, Toyomichi Kurita', 'Anne Rapp', 'Glenn Close, Julianne Moore, Liv Tyler, Chris O''Donnell, Charles S. Dutton, Patricia Neal, Ned Beatty, Courtney B. Vance', 'PG-13', 'Conflict arises in the small town of Holly Springs when an old woman''s death causes a variety of reactions among family and friends.', 'Conflict arises in the small town of Holly Springs when an old woman''s death causes a variety of reactions among family and friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tskbsm57aWqU4wsf8sX4ClM77Kf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9465'),
  ('228869665829569658', 'Cookies', 1975, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Joël Séria, Hubert Rostaing, Marcel Combes', 'Joël Séria', 'Jean-Pierre Marielle, Claude Piéplu, Jeanne Goupil, Dolores McDonough, Romain Bouteille, Andréa Ferréol, Bernard Fresson, Martine Ferrière', null, 'Henri Serin (Jean-Pierre Marielle), an umbrella salesman, leads a quiet life between his work, his family and his passion for painting. During his many business trips, Henri indulges in a few amorous escapades, which provide a welcome change from the tiresome daily routine his bigoted wife locks him into. One fine day, Henri decides to drop everything and live on love and fresh water. He ends up in Pont-Aven, where he meets Émile, a local painter imitating Gauguin, with whom he shares his drinking and other feminine attractions.', 'Henri Serin (Jean-Pierre Marielle), an umbrella salesman, leads a quiet life between his work, his family and his passion for painting. During his many business trips, Henri indulges in a few amorous escapades, which provide a welcome change from the tiresome daily routine his bigoted wife locks him into. One fine day, Henri decides to drop everything and live on love and fresh water. He ends up in Pont-Aven, where he meets Émile, a local painter imitating Gauguin, with whom he shares his drinking and other feminine attractions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ZYbGdFa9wVqctQ6uSdFWK3apJ2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35549'),
  ('275360134609116369', 'Cooking Up Love', 2021, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Family, Romance', 'Jonathan Yapp, Rocco Gismondi, Rick Kush', 'Simone J. Chapman, Farhad Mann', 'Rachel Bles, Stephen Huszar, Ron Lea, Mykee Selkin, Kathryn Davis, Paulino Nunes, Benjamin Beauchemin, Kyana Teresa', 'PG', 'On a lark, Zoey rents a food truck and enters a reality TV competition. Heat rises between her and the handsome founder of a fast food chain, but when Zoey finds out he’s a judge in the contest, things quickly fizzle. Zoey’s determined to win fair and square and she suspects ‘Mr-Too-Good-To-Be-True’ is really after her sauce recipe, not her heart.', 'On a lark, Zoey rents a food truck and enters a reality TV competition. Heat rises between her and the handsome founder of a fast food chain, but when Zoey finds out he’s a judge in the contest, things quickly fizzle. Zoey’s determined to win fair and square and she suspects ‘Mr-Too-Good-To-Be-True’ is really after her sauce recipe, not her heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o24F18im8npdLfmVPDz2xu0doqw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:779006'),
  ('533582401219142029', 'Cooking with Love', 2018, 'Comedy, TV Movie, Romance', 'Christopher Charles Kempinski, Dave T. Nall, Vince Coates', 'Justine Cogan Gunn, Marcy Holland', 'Ali Liebert, Brett Dalton, Janet Kidder, Kimberley Sustad, Aria Birch, Preston Vanderslice, Julius Fair, Gabrielle Rose', null, 'Optimistic and cheerful TV producer, Kelly, doesn’t have time for love. Bad boy celebrity chef, Stephen, doesn’t have time for anything besides cooking. Fun with a side of love ensues as Kelly and Stephen are paired on a children''s cooking show.', 'Optimistic and cheerful TV producer, Kelly, doesn’t have time for love. Bad boy celebrity chef, Stephen, doesn’t have time for anything besides cooking. Fun with a side of love ensues as Kelly and Stephen are paired on a children''s cooking show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fxV4yA8bQjp6dgjjEpaWtgyGbgA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:497515'),
  ('667957073802551263', 'Cookoo Cavaliers', 1940, 'Comedy', 'Jules White', 'Ewart Adamson', 'Curly Howard, Moe Howard, Larry Fine, Dorothy Appleby, Lynton Brent', 'NR', 'The stooges are three fish peddlers who, looking for a new business opportunity, open a beauty salon south of the border. Their first customers are some chorus girls from a local night club. After the stooges completely ruin the girls'' hair, and their manager finds out, the boys must leave on the run.', 'The stooges are three fish peddlers who, looking for a new business opportunity, open a beauty salon south of the border. Their first customers are some chorus girls from a local night club. After the stooges completely ruin the girls'' hair, and their manager finds out, the boys must leave on the run.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fRqxzL4gNGT0IXN4OPJubyXmT9K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115987'),
  ('120674541673878394', 'Cool Air', 1999, 'Drama, Horror', 'Bryan Moore', null, 'Jack Donner, Ron Ford, Vera Lockwood, Bryan Moore, Michael Sonye', null, 'Randolph Carter moves into a squalid boarding house in the summer of 1925 where he becomes friends with a mysterious doctor who revives him after a near-fatal heart attack. Soon after Carter discovers the awful truth about the doctor, and the fragile line that separates life and death. Featuring a stellar performance by Jack Donner as Dr. Muñoz, Cool Air remains a haunting reminder of the power of the human will.', 'Randolph Carter moves into a squalid boarding house in the summer of 1925 where he becomes friends with a mysterious doctor who revives him after a near-fatal heart attack. Soon after Carter discovers the awful truth about the doctor, and the fragile line that separates life and death. Featuring a stellar performance by Jack Donner as Dr. Muñoz, Cool Air remains a haunting reminder of the power of the human will.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fhyZSWfsgoij9uvkANC9DHM40vB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47286'),
  ('989834455795846920', 'Cool and the Crazy', 1994, 'Drama, Romance, Action, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Ralph Bakshi, Roberto Schaefer, Chris Howell', 'Ralph Bakshi', 'Alicia Silverstone, Jared Leto, Jennifer Blanc, Tuesday Knight, John Hawkes, John Kapelos, Christine Harnos, Matthew Flint', null, 'High school sweethearts Roslyn and Michael, now in their twenties, co-exist in a deeply unfulfilling marriage with kids. Both embark on extramarital affairs, unaware of the violent repercussions that await.', 'High school sweethearts Roslyn and Michael, now in their twenties, co-exist in a deeply unfulfilling marriage with kids. Both embark on extramarital affairs, unaware of the violent repercussions that await.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zfiHXAsQiEGfXgVsWgLLOdFzpLn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109551'),
  ('444630730748186419', 'Cool as Ice', 1991, 'Romance, Music, Comedy', 'David Kellogg, Janusz Kamiński', 'David Stenn', 'Vanilla Ice, Kristin Minter, Naomi Campbell, Deezer D, Kevin Hicks, Allison Dean, Sydney Lassick, Dody Goodman', 'PG', 'Freewheeling, motorcycle-riding musician Johnny rolls into a small town with his band, and meets Kathy, an honor student who catches his eye. Meanwhile, Kathy''s father, after being in the Witness Protection Program, is finally tracked down by two corrupt cops he escaped from years ago, who want the money he owes them.', 'Freewheeling, motorcycle-riding musician Johnny rolls into a small town with his band, and meets Kathy, an honor student who catches his eye. Meanwhile, Kathy''s father, after being in the Witness Protection Program, is finally tracked down by two corrupt cops he escaped from years ago, who want the money he owes them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fO0YbAJiMPFMquixdZgbC98I3MP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1496'),
  ('426977634653227383', 'Cool Blue', 1990, 'Comedy, Romance, Thriller', 'Mark Mullin, Richard Shepard, Jordan Stone', 'Mark Mullin, Richard Shepard', 'Woody Harrelson, Hank Azaria, Ely Pouget, Christopher McDonald, Paul Lussier, Phillip Brock, Judie Aronson, Gloria LeRoy', 'R', 'Dustin, an aspiring painter meets this woman named Christiane. Dustin is on a search for love, sex, and inspiration. When Christiane dumps him and disapears as quickly as she dropped in, Dustin embarks on an obsessive search in Southern California to search for her.', 'Dustin, an aspiring painter meets this woman named Christiane. Dustin is on a search for love, sex, and inspiration. When Christiane dumps him and disapears as quickly as she dropped in, Dustin embarks on an obsessive search in Southern California to search for her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8OogHparPXyKFiHZOD5hEerTc4T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91580'),
  ('833140753931322408', 'Cool Breeze', 1972, 'Action, Crime', 'Barry Pollack, Andrew Davis', 'Barry Pollack', 'Thalmus Rasulala, Judy Pace, Lincoln Kilpatrick, Sam Laws, Margaret Avery, Pam Grier, Paula Kelly, Wally Taylor', 'R', 'A paroled crook masterminds a $3 million jewelry theft to fund a bank for businessmen.', 'A paroled crook masterminds a $3 million jewelry theft to fund a bank for businessmen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wxS6IIneJD2I6uXuKqx3nJTQKKZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89656'),
  ('272912001198453042', 'Cool Cat Saves the Kids', 2015, 'Comedy, Crime, Family', 'Stephen Treadway, Blaine Spence, Derek Savage', 'Derek Savage', 'Vivica A. Fox, Erik Estrada, Derek Savage, Connor Dean, Cynthia Rothrock, Jason Johnson, Jessica R. Salazar, Mikee Loria', null, 'Cool Cat is the coolest cat in town. All the kids love him. Except for the bully Butch, who hates Cool Cat for his coolness. He terrorizes Cool Cat, his friends and family with threats, taunting, and the internet. Can Cool Cat face his fears and defeat the bully Derrick?', 'Cool Cat is the coolest cat in town. All the kids love him. Except for the bully Butch, who hates Cool Cat for his coolness. He terrorizes Cool Cat, his friends and family with threats, taunting, and the internet. Can Cool Cat face his fears and defeat the bully Derrick?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vxFlGc3zGnFS4sgXoECAJeLzjvx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:325712'),
  ('1072536183774773033', 'Cool Gel Attacks', 2010, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Panya Nimchareonpong, Jaturong Mokjok', 'Sompope Vejchapipat', 'Jaturong Mokjok, Noppadon Songsang, Pattarasaya Kreursuwansiri, Nattapong Chatpong, Sarinrat Thomas, Monthon Suravitthamma, Thidawan Hongchukiat, Darunee Sutiphitak', null, 'When gelatinous blue aliens fall from the sky and threaten their lives, neighbors at odds with each other must put aside their ongoing feud.', 'When gelatinous blue aliens fall from the sky and threaten their lives, neighbors at odds with each other must put aside their ongoing feud.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8lr5Sczbyui8DRWRYzBJfXVg49b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73095'),
  ('296182240671681297', 'Cool It, Carol!', 1970, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Pete Walker, Peter Jessop', 'Murray Smith', 'Robin Askwith, Janet Lynn, Jess Conrad, Derek Aylward, Kenneth Hendel, Harry Baird, Peter Elliott, Stephen Bradley', null, 'A naive couple leave their small town for success in London''s adult entertainment culture.', 'A naive couple leave their small town for success in London''s adult entertainment culture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AtA3Fwck26BpX28YYOZyJlolkAU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110703'),
  ('362585253653773784', 'Cool Kids Don''t Cry', 2012, 'Family, Romance, Drama', 'Dennis Bots, Gerd Schelfhout', 'Jacques Vriens, Karen van Holst Pellekaan', 'Hanna Obbeek, Nils Verkooijen, Fiona Livingston, Bram Flick, Amin Belyandouz, Eva van der Gucht, Loek Peters, Johanna ter Steege', null, 'Adaptation of one of Benelux most famous children''s novels. Tough prime school girl Akkie loves soccer and can be a real bully. Love is the only thing she''s scared of. When Akkie is diagnosed with Leukemia, she has to fight for her life. On the verge of going to high school, Akkie has to allow love to enter her life, and thus gain courage to accept the inevitable.', 'Adaptation of one of Benelux most famous children''s novels. Tough prime school girl Akkie loves soccer and can be a real bully. Love is the only thing she''s scared of. When Akkie is diagnosed with Leukemia, she has to fight for her life. On the verge of going to high school, Akkie has to allow love to enter her life, and thus gain courage to accept the inevitable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oKcS00H2ItgXmSvmY6e4O0PZaQP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115929'),
  ('336223730271512496', 'Cool Runnings', 1993, 'Comedy, Adventure, Drama', 'Jon Turteltaub, Phedon Papamichael, Kim H. Winther', 'Tommy Swerdlow, Lynn Siefert, Michael Goldberg', 'Leon, Doug E. Doug, Rawle D. Lewis, Malik Yoba, John Candy, Raymond J. Barry, Peter Outerbridge, Paul Cœur', 'PG', 'When a Jamaican sprinter is disqualified from the Olympic Games, he enlists the help of a dishonored coach to start the first Jamaican bobsled team.', 'When a Jamaican sprinter is disqualified from the Olympic Games, he enlists the help of a dishonored coach to start the first Jamaican bobsled team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6fXuGEb7EqGmAeUodxm7l5ELPZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:864'),
  ('87825359075475361', 'Cool World', 1992, 'Animation, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Ralph Bakshi, John A. Alonzo, Bruce Woodside', 'Michael Grais, Mark Victor', 'Kim Basinger, Gabriel Byrne, Brad Pitt, Michele Abrams, Deirdre O''Connell, Janni Brenn, William Frankfather, Greg Collins', 'PG-13', 'While incarcerated for murder, cartoonist Jack Deebs found escape by creating Cool World, a series featuring a voluptuous femme fatale named Holli Would. But the artist becomes a prisoner of his own fantasies when Holli transports Jack into Cool World with a scheme to seduce him and bring herself to life. Hard-boiled detective Frank Harris – the only other human in Cool World – cautions Jack with the law: Noids (humans) don''t have sex with doodles (cartoons). However, flesh proves weaker than ink as Holli takes human form in Las Vegas, staring in a trans-universal chase that threatens the destruction of both worlds.', 'While incarcerated for murder, cartoonist Jack Deebs found escape by creating Cool World, a series featuring a voluptuous femme fatale named Holli Would. But the artist becomes a prisoner of his own fantasies when Holli transports Jack into Cool World with a scheme to seduce him and bring herself to life. Hard-boiled detective Frank Harris – the only other human in Cool World – cautions Jack with the law: Noids (humans) don''t have sex with doodles (cartoons). However, flesh proves weaker than ink as Holli takes human form in Las Vegas, staring in a trans-universal chase that threatens the destruction of both worlds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mqzRUHNtFwmgJCmSnvq3JnX0xgZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14239'),
  ('917461375563881322', 'Cooley High', 1975, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Michael Schultz', 'Eric Monte', 'Glynn Turman, Lawrence Hilton-Jacobs, Garrett Morris, Cynthia Davis, Corin Rogers, Maurice Leon Havis, Joseph Carter Wilson, Sherman Smith', 'PG', 'In the mid-1960s, a group of high school friends who live on the Near North Side of Chicago enjoy life to the fullest...parties, hanging out, meeting new friends. Then life changes for two of the guys when they are falsely arrested in connection with stealing a Cadillac. We follow their lives through to the dramatic end of high school.', 'In the mid-1960s, a group of high school friends who live on the Near North Side of Chicago enjoy life to the fullest...parties, hanging out, meeting new friends. Then life changes for two of the guys when they are falsely arrested in connection with stealing a Cadillac. We follow their lives through to the dramatic end of high school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xidj4vgIFvG2nCnLt1XHR2YncVW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35711'),
  ('736234474211536828', 'Coolie', 1983, 'Action, Comedy, Drama', 'Manmohan Desai, Prayag Raj', 'K.K. Shukla', 'Amitabh Bachchan, Waheeda Rehman, Rishi Kapoor, Amrish Puri, Rati Agnihotri, Kader Khan, Shoma Anand, Suresh Oberoi', null, 'When Iqbal gets separated from his mother and brother by a flood, he becomes a coolie at Mumbai railway station. He then fights for the coolies rights and faces challenges from a businessman.', 'When Iqbal gets separated from his mother and brother by a flood, he becomes a coolie at Mumbai railway station. He then fights for the coolies rights and faces challenges from a businessman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rT2GUcSQYIopRw23mx09yWHKbZH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25505'),
  ('223012406440214558', 'Coolie', 2025, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Girish Gangadharan, Lokesh Kanagaraj, Immanuel Prakash', 'Lokesh Kanagaraj, Chandhru Anbazhagan', 'Rajinikanth, Nagarjuna Akkineni, Soubin Shahir, Upendra, Shruti Haasan, Sathyaraj, Aamir Khan, Rachita Ram', 'NR', 'Deva, once living a quiet life, is shaken when his close friend dies under suspicious circumstances. Determined to uncover the truth, he infiltrates a powerful gang operating in the shadows. As he investigates, Deva becomes entangled in a dangerous web of crime, betrayal, and secrets from his own past, forcing him to confront powerful enemies while protecting the ones he loves.', 'Deva, once living a quiet life, is shaken when his close friend dies under suspicious circumstances. Determined to uncover the truth, he infiltrates a powerful gang operating in the shadows. As he investigates, Deva becomes entangled in a dangerous web of crime, betrayal, and secrets from his own past, forcing him to confront powerful enemies while protecting the ones he loves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kr36awqmziEI5mfUElsHB0pj9zP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1153399'),
  ('301176294783653135', 'Coolie No. 1', 1995, 'Comedy, Romance', 'David Dhawan, Rajan Kinagi', 'Rumi Jaffery, Kader Khan', 'Govinda, Karisma Kapoor, Kader Khan, Harish Kumar, Shakti Kapoor, Sadashiv Amrapurkar, Javed Khan, Mahesh Anand', null, 'Raju is a poor coolie who falls in love with a rich girl. He pretends to be rich and tells one big lie after another to marry her.', 'Raju is a poor coolie who falls in love with a rich girl. He pretends to be rich and tells one big lie after another to marry her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pxdbdWA6EQb15YIEhRVt5iIdStA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63345'),
  ('975352118174263075', 'Coolie No. 1', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'David Dhawan, Jaykumar Verma, Mukesh Chauhan', 'Rumi Jaffery', 'Varun Dhawan, Sara Ali Khan, Paresh Rawal, Rajpal Yadav, Johny Lever, Javed Jaffrey, Shikha Talsania, Sahil Vaid', null, 'Insulted by Rosario, a rich businessman, Jai Kishen a Matchmaker teaches him a lesson by getting his daughter married to Raju, a Coolie, who poses to be a millionaire. They sense something fishy and Raju''s deceptions are discovered. In an attempt to cover it up, he cooks up a story of having a filthy rich twin. One lie leads to another and things start to go awry culminating in a comedy of errors.', 'Insulted by Rosario, a rich businessman, Jai Kishen a Matchmaker teaches him a lesson by getting his daughter married to Raju, a Coolie, who poses to be a millionaire. They sense something fishy and Raju''s deceptions are discovered. In an attempt to cover it up, he cooks up a story of having a filthy rich twin. One lie leads to another and things start to go awry culminating in a comedy of errors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ahkaPWW2SU9AaDhpD31phQKhTtT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:614179'),
  ('174979149706632049', 'Coonskin', 1975, 'Drama, Animation, Comedy, Crime', 'Ralph Bakshi, William A. Fraker, James roden', 'Ralph Bakshi', 'Philip Michael Thomas, Barry White, Charles Gordone, Scatman Crothers, Danny Rees, Buddy Douglas, Jim Moore, Al Lewis', 'R', 'A multi-layered satire of race relations in America. Live-action sequences of a prison break bracket the animated tale of Brother Rabbit, Brother Bear, and Preacher Fox, who rise to the top of the crime ranks in Harlem by going up against a con-man, a racist cop, and the Mafia.', 'A multi-layered satire of race relations in America. Live-action sequences of a prison break bracket the animated tale of Brother Rabbit, Brother Bear, and Preacher Fox, who rise to the top of the crime ranks in Harlem by going up against a con-man, a racist cop, and the Mafia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3zrxUkbeLl2KmSIRywNTwiGOZ2y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27716'),
  ('1149758813585117975', 'Cooties', 2014, 'Comedy, Horror, Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Lori Ashfield, JoAnne Lowrie, Joe McDougall', 'Leigh Whannell, Ian Brennan', 'Elijah Wood, Alison Pill, Rainn Wilson, Jack McBrayer, Nasim Pedrad, Leigh Whannell, Morgan Lily, Rebecca Marshall', 'R', 'A mysterious virus hits an isolated elementary school, transforming the kids into a feral swarm of mass savages. An unlikely hero must lead a motley band of teachers in the fight of their lives.', 'A mysterious virus hits an isolated elementary school, transforming the kids into a feral swarm of mass savages. An unlikely hero must lead a motley band of teachers in the fight of their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oFBQsngRdgxnbO4H1FIbQ0Zuq43.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:241843'),
