  ('474962712294172604', 'Cop & ½', 1993, 'Action, Comedy, Family', 'Henry Winkler, Bill Butler, Meg Liberman', 'Arne Olsen', 'Burt Reynolds, Norman D. Golden II, Ruby Dee, Holland Taylor, Ray Sharkey, Sammy Hernandez, Frank Sivero, Rocky Giordani', 'PG', 'When a pint-sized 8-year-old kid witnesses a murder he offers to help the police, if they make him a cop, too. Saddled with this streetwise sidekick, a hardboiled cop is forced to take his new partner seriously as they race the clock to bring the bad guys to justice.', 'When a pint-sized 8-year-old kid witnesses a murder he offers to help the police, if they make him a cop, too. Saddled with this streetwise sidekick, a hardboiled cop is forced to take his new partner seriously as they race the clock to bring the bad guys to justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2z2AcI1VyPnRtHrvfpk1YDItdmB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12574'),
  ('107904262166706377', 'Cop au Vin', 1985, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Claude Chabrol, Jean Rabier, Pierre-François Dumeniaud', 'Dominique Roulet, Claude Chabrol', 'Jean Poiret, Stéphane Audran, Michel Bouquet, Lucas Belvaux, Jean Topart, Pauline Lafont, Caroline Cellier, Josephine Chaplin', null, 'Unorthodox detective Jean Lavardin is called to a provincial French town after a prank turns deadly.', 'Unorthodox detective Jean Lavardin is called to a provincial French town after a prank turns deadly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zsCkiQYaTvkhQj1vytiTejQyK3A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4898'),
