  ('1019786391647074190', 'Cop Game', 1988, 'Action, Crime, War', 'Bruno Mattei, Riccardo Grassetti, Luigi Ciccarese', 'Rossella Drudi', 'Brent Huff, Max Laurel, Romano Puppo, Candice Daly, Werner Pochath, Robert Marius, Claudio Fragasso, Donald Wilson', null, 'In the final days of the Vietnam War, someone is killing the officers of the elite Cobra Force. Two undercover M.P.''s are assigned to the case. The trail leads from the streets of Saigon to the war zone.', 'In the final days of the Vietnam War, someone is killing the officers of the elite Cobra Force. Two undercover M.P.''s are assigned to the case. The trail leads from the streets of Saigon to the war zone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vVKgjCGYvDeD4sHfwmSVnmgULPF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86095'),
  ('38657665468099583', 'Cop Goes Missing', 2022, 'Drama', 'Frédéric Videau', 'Frédéric Videau', 'Patrick d''Assumçao, Sofia Lesaffre, Laetitia Casta, Simon Abkarian, Alban Lenoir, Émile Berling, Jean-François Stévenin, Corentin Fila', null, 'One morning, a worn-out field cop, nicknamed Ping-Pong by everyone, burns his police ID and disappears. During one night and one day, his colleagues look for him, meet him and lose him in Toulouse and its suburbs. But every hour that passes brings Ping-Pong a little bit closer to his own destiny.', 'One morning, a worn-out field cop, nicknamed Ping-Pong by everyone, burns his police ID and disappears. During one night and one day, his colleagues look for him, meet him and lose him in Toulouse and its suburbs. But every hour that passes brings Ping-Pong a little bit closer to his own destiny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aGHJrTrZv6YoYaNGZQfWeoyNWY2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:862856'),
  ('951792454149243074', 'Cop Hater', 1958, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'J. Burgi Contner, William Berke, John Zane', 'Henry Kane', 'Robert Loggia, Gerald S. O''Loughlin, Shirley Ballard, Russell Hardie, Hal Riddle, Bill Neff, Gene Miller, Vincent Gardenia', null, 'Members of the 87th Precinct search for a cop killer who has already murdered two of their own.', 'Members of the 87th Precinct search for a cop killer who has already murdered two of their own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qUMJizjkTvkXrP4U90fn3MNInxZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62658'),
  ('549206079030481363', 'Cop in Drag', 1984, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Bruno Corbucci, Roberto Tatti, Marcello Masciocchi', 'Bruno Corbucci, Mario Amendola', 'Tomas Milian, Bombolo, Olimpia Di Nardo, Paco Fabrini, Anita Kupsch, Monica Gruber, Nazzareno Cardinali, Marcello Martana', null, 'Rome, Italy, early 1980s. A guy who worked at the Blue Gay, a transvestite cabaret, is found murdered, strangled. Marshal Nico Giraldi is responsible for investigating, infiltrating the Roman Gay community.', 'Rome, Italy, early 1980s. A guy who worked at the Blue Gay, a transvestite cabaret, is found murdered, strangled. Marshal Nico Giraldi is responsible for investigating, infiltrating the Roman Gay community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t6xSSGWed4uUmeZYl7G71ah5b9L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53342'),
  ('766594526082633567', 'Cop Killer', 1994, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Peter Keglevic, Wolfgang Dickmann', 'Beate Langmaack', 'Gösta Ekman, Kjell Bergqvist, Rolf Lassgård, Johan Widerberg, Marie-Thérèse Sarrazin, Tomas Norström, Anica Dobra, Heinz Hoenig', null, 'A woman is found murdered in a closed amusement park. A young couple who happen to be there at the same time become, without their knowledge, suspects for the murder. They are chased by a large number of police but only Martin Beck believes them to be innocent.', 'A woman is found murdered in a closed amusement park. A young couple who happen to be there at the same time become, without their knowledge, suspects for the murder. They are chased by a large number of police but only Martin Beck believes them to be innocent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7JlWisT0yRvrMKT0RTnIFGb54wI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34644'),
  ('48336052115759021', 'Cop Killers', 1977, 'Action, Thriller', 'Walter R. Cichy, Howard Ziehm', 'Walter R. Cichy', 'Jason Williams, Bill Osco, Diane Keller, Michael D. White, Donna Stubbert, Judy Ross, Thomas Burnes, Ted Ellison', 'R', 'Two hippies on their way to a cocaine deal get stopped by the police at a roadblock, resulting in a shootout where they kill the cops. They then go on a crime spree of robbery and murder.', 'Two hippies on their way to a cocaine deal get stopped by the police at a roadblock, resulting in a shootout where they kill the cops. They then go on a crime spree of robbery and murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pVxRMb7ecro4yNqWjg7KwmMSq3A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77091'),
  ('21605693887044491', 'Cop Land', 1997, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'James Mangold, Eric Alan Edwards, Nicholas Lundy', 'James Mangold', 'Sylvester Stallone, Harvey Keitel, Ray Liotta, Robert De Niro, Peter Berg, Janeane Garofalo, Robert Patrick, Michael Rapaport', 'R', 'Freddy Heflin is the sheriff of a place everyone calls “Cop Land” — a small and seemingly peaceful town populated by the big city police officers he’s long admired. Yet something ugly is taking place behind the town’s peaceful facade. And when Freddy uncovers a massive, deadly conspiracy among these local residents, he is forced to take action and make a dangerous choice between protecting his idols and upholding the law.', 'Freddy Heflin is the sheriff of a place everyone calls “Cop Land” — a small and seemingly peaceful town populated by the big city police officers he’s long admired. Yet something ugly is taking place behind the town’s peaceful facade. And when Freddy uncovers a massive, deadly conspiracy among these local residents, he is forced to take action and make a dangerous choice between protecting his idols and upholding the law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dyOqXyPCQh8VF0KA5aelBCCQond.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2142'),
  ('1101429152893187983', 'Cop or Hood', 1979, 'Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Georges Lautner, Henri Decaë', 'Michel Audiard', 'Jean-Paul Belmondo, Georges Géret, Claude Brosset, Jean-François Balmer, Tony Kendall, Michel Beaune, Catherine Lachens, Julie Jézéquel', null, 'When the local police inspector was found dead in a prostitute''s house, police division commissioner Stan Borowitz is sent to investigate the situation. Posing as the prostitute''s long-lost brother "Antonio Cerruti," he discovers a mare''s nest of police corruption. In fact, in this comedy thriller the whole town is corrupt. If they were closely examined, Stan''s methods for pursuing this investigation might embarrass the police. For instance, he drives into a criminal''s house in a fancy, expensive race car. In another incident, he callously blows up a casino owned by Musard , one of the town''s crime bosses. On that occasion, he first forces Musard to remove his clothes, and the poor criminal watches his casino explode from across the square while standing naked in a phone booth. Meanwhile, Stan seduces the lovely Edmonde.', 'When the local police inspector was found dead in a prostitute''s house, police division commissioner Stan Borowitz is sent to investigate the situation. Posing as the prostitute''s long-lost brother "Antonio Cerruti," he discovers a mare''s nest of police corruption. In fact, in this comedy thriller the whole town is corrupt. If they were closely examined, Stan''s methods for pursuing this investigation might embarrass the police. For instance, he drives into a criminal''s house in a fancy, expensive race car. In another incident, he callously blows up a casino owned by Musard , one of the town''s crime bosses. On that occasion, he first forces Musard to remove his clothes, and the poor criminal watches his casino explode from across the square while standing naked in a phone booth. Meanwhile, Stan seduces the lovely Edmonde.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2D76XBu7Vl4oMzGUsq9H6dfXjQN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40420'),
  ('390404559007690957', 'Cop Out', 2010, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Kevin Smith, David Klein, David R. Ellis', 'Robb Cullen, Mark Cullen', 'Bruce Willis, Tracy Morgan, Adam Brody, Kevin Pollak, Ana de la Reguera, Guillermo Díaz, Seann William Scott, Rashida Jones', 'R', 'Detectives Jimmy and Paul, despite nine years as partners, can still sometimes seem like polar opposites—especially when Paul''s unpredictable antics get them suspended without pay. Already strapped for cash and trying to pay for his daughter''s wedding, Jimmy decides to sell a rare baseball card that''s worth tens of thousands. Unfortunately, when the collector''s shop is robbed and the card vanishes with the crook, Paul and Jimmy end up going rogue, tracking down the card and the drug ring behind its theft, all on their own time and without any backup—except for each other.', 'Detectives Jimmy and Paul, despite nine years as partners, can still sometimes seem like polar opposites—especially when Paul''s unpredictable antics get them suspended without pay. Already strapped for cash and trying to pay for his daughter''s wedding, Jimmy decides to sell a rare baseball card that''s worth tens of thousands. Unfortunately, when the collector''s shop is robbed and the card vanishes with the crook, Paul and Jimmy end up going rogue, tracking down the card and the drug ring behind its theft, all on their own time and without any backup—except for each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qA31i7FPVDHezuoevx3497CvZd4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23742'),
  ('435081248067286182', 'Cop Secret', 2022, 'Comedy, Action, Thriller', 'Elli Cassata, Haraldur Ari Karlsson, Hannes Þór Halldórsson', 'Sverrir Þór Sverrisson, Nína Pedersen, Hannes Þór Halldórsson', 'Auðunn Blöndal, Egill Einarsson, Steinunn Ólína Þorsteinsdóttir, Sverrir Þór Sverrisson, Björn Hlynur Haraldsson, Vivian Ólafsdóttir, Rúrik Gíslason, Júlíana Sara Gunnarsdóttir', 'NR', 'When Bússi, Iceland''s toughest cop, is forced to work with a new partner to solve a series of bank robberies, the pressure to close the case as soon as possible proves too much for him.', 'When Bússi, Iceland''s toughest cop, is forced to work with a new partner to solve a series of bank robberies, the pressure to close the case as soon as possible proves too much for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jnWyZsaCl3Ke6u6ReSmBRO8S1rX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:792775'),
  ('768775654754662333', 'Cop''s Honor', 1985, 'Action', 'José Pinheiro, Jean-Jacques Tarbès', 'Frédéric Fajardie', 'Alain Delon, Jacques Perrin, Fiona Gélin, Éva Darlan, Jean-François Stévenin, Vincent Lindon, Stéphane Ferrara, Jean-Yves Chatelais', null, 'Cop''s Honor (Parole de Flic) is a 1985 French crime movie directed by José Pinheiro and starring Alain Delon as retired police officer Daniel Pratt. His teenager daughter was killed by a gang of mysterious hooded killers so Pratt began his own investigation to avenge the killers and their backroom leader.', 'Cop''s Honor (Parole de Flic) is a 1985 French crime movie directed by José Pinheiro and starring Alain Delon as retired police officer Daniel Pratt. His teenager daughter was killed by a gang of mysterious hooded killers so Pratt began his own investigation to avenge the killers and their backroom leader.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fbe8BK4EsLelG5bsdqV7VHUsZjQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:170033'),
  ('1086497213773255776', 'Copacabana', 1947, 'Comedy, Music', 'Alfred E. Green, Harold Godsoe, Bert Glennon', 'Allen Boretz, László Vadnay, Howard Harris', 'Groucho Marx, Carmen Miranda, Steve Cochran, Andy Russell, Gloria Jean, Earl Wilson, Abel Green, Louis Sobol', 'NR', 'A talent agent sells his girlfriend to a nightclub – as two separate acts. The deception and constant costume changes are too much for his girl, and the men who have fallen for the different performers.', 'A talent agent sells his girlfriend to a nightclub – as two separate acts. The deception and constant costume changes are too much for his girl, and the men who have fallen for the different performers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mZeA7LCVSrvKdgpcP7ylwvlQtFF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46955'),
  ('1087976691726892266', 'Copacabana', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Marc Fitoussi, Hélène Louvart', 'Marc Fitoussi', 'Isabelle Huppert, Aure Atika, Lolita Chammah, Jurgen Delnaet, Chantal Banlier, Magali Woch, Nelly Antignac, Guillaume Gouix', null, 'Babou seems to be able to shrug off anything. Real jobs, husbands, responsibilities, who needs them? But when she finds out that her own daughter is too ashamed of her to invite her to her wedding, she decides to make some changes.', 'Babou seems to be able to shrug off anything. Real jobs, husbands, responsibilities, who needs them? But when she finds out that her own daughter is too ashamed of her to invite her to her wedding, she decides to make some changes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wFg5csZorNWupAAUiov35BvnvBv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41271'),
  ('1029405758783427218', 'Copacabana Mon Amour', 1970, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Rogério Sganzerla, Renato Laclette, Guará Rodrigues', 'Rogério Sganzerla', 'Helena Ignez, Paulo Villaça, Laura Galano, Guará Rodrigues, Otoniel Serra, Joãozinho da Goméia, Lilian Lemmertz', null, 'Sônia and her homosexual brother are both believed by their mother to be possessed by the devil. She works as a prostitute in the streets of Copacabana and he’s a servant who falls madly in love with his employer.', 'Sônia and her homosexual brother are both believed by their mother to be possessed by the devil. She works as a prostitute in the streets of Copacabana and he’s a servant who falls madly in love with his employer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/62Dr6APKyVcauk21PwuEzJSTEn4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:192568'),
  ('1036416009375732971', 'Copacabana Palace', 1962, 'Crime, Comedy, Adventure, Drama', 'Steno, Massimo Dallamano', null, 'Sylva Koscina, Walter Chiari, Mylène Demongeot, Claude Rich, Francis de Wolff, Gloria Paul, Franco Fabrizi, Cyll Farney', null, 'For three days at the Copacabana Palace in Rio de Janeiro, amorous cross-fertilizations are intertwined with petty tricks against the backdrop of the famous carnival festivities. Three (sympathetic) accomplices are beaten to a punch in the hotel vault; three charming stewardesses are looking for entertainment, but their three Carioca host, musicians Tom Jobim, Luiz Bonfá, and João Gilberto, are married; a man, separated from his wife, wants to catch her in the act of adultery.', 'For three days at the Copacabana Palace in Rio de Janeiro, amorous cross-fertilizations are intertwined with petty tricks against the backdrop of the famous carnival festivities. Three (sympathetic) accomplices are beaten to a punch in the hotel vault; three charming stewardesses are looking for entertainment, but their three Carioca host, musicians Tom Jobim, Luiz Bonfá, and João Gilberto, are married; a man, separated from his wife, wants to catch her in the act of adultery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dGu9TxfL79o1uJwAMozh20VSCC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:340961'),
  ('314450958916232768', 'Copenhagen', 2014, 'Adventure, Romance, Drama', 'Mark Raso, Alan Poon', 'Mark Raso', 'Gethin Anthony, Frederikke Dahl Hansen, Sebastian Armesto, Olivia Grant, Baard Owe, Tamzin Merchant, Mille Dinesen, Martin Hestbæk', null, 'After weeks of traveling through Europe, the immature William finds himself in Copenhagen, the place of his father’s birth. He befriends the youthful Effy, who works in William’s hotel as part of an internship program, and they set off to find William’s last living relative. Effy’s mix of youthful exuberance and wisdom challenges William unlike any woman ever has. As the attraction builds, he must come to grips with destabilizing elements of his family’s sordid past.', 'After weeks of traveling through Europe, the immature William finds himself in Copenhagen, the place of his father’s birth. He befriends the youthful Effy, who works in William’s hotel as part of an internship program, and they set off to find William’s last living relative. Effy’s mix of youthful exuberance and wisdom challenges William unlike any woman ever has. As the attraction builds, he must come to grips with destabilizing elements of his family’s sordid past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1MSFfjvgf9auNANWcaGTvzf1TcW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:251232'),
  ('708024063418991828', 'Copilot', 2021, 'Drama', 'Anne Zohra Berrached, Christopher Aoun', 'Stefanie Schmitz, Anne Zohra Berrached', 'Canan Kir, Roger Azar, Hans-Jürgen Alf, Ceci Chuh, Aziz Dyab, Michael Kamp, Christian Müller, Kevin Patzke', null, 'Asli and Saeed fall in love in the mid-1990s. Although Asli’s mother is against their relationship, they secretly get married. Then he disappears. A sensitive love story that recounts how Saeed changes Asli’s life – before the entire world is shaken.', 'Asli and Saeed fall in love in the mid-1990s. Although Asli’s mother is against their relationship, they secretly get married. Then he disappears. A sensitive love story that recounts how Saeed changes Asli’s life – before the entire world is shaken.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AoPZxSUcKCMuqTe5K5rxuUflatB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:655379'),
  ('712131379020517031', 'Copkiller', 1983, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Roberto Faenza, Gil Rossellini, Giuseppe Pinori', 'Ennio De Concini, Roberto Faenza, Hugh Fleetwood', 'Harvey Keitel, John Lydon, Nicole Garcia, Leonard Mann, Sylvia Sidney, Carla Romanelli, Nicola Cancellaro, Ettore Venturini', 'R', 'A NYPD officer imprisons and tortures an admitted cop-killer, but finds the tables turned when his victim refuses to break and in fact urges more punishment.', 'A NYPD officer imprisons and tortures an admitted cop-killer, but finds the tables turned when his victim refuses to break and in fact urges more punishment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lEdauUmLl9tJqCsbroHHWPpEtZX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68050'),
  ('107023896402579780', 'Coplan Saves His Skin', 1968, 'Crime, Action', 'Yves Boisset, Alain Derobe, Pierre Lhomme', 'Claude Veillot, Yves Boisset', 'Claudio Brook, Margaret Lee, Klaus Kinski, Jean Servais, Jean Topart, Bernard Blier, Hans Meyer, Nanna Michael', null, 'Free-lance undercover agent Coplan receives a phone call from an old girlfriend in Turkey. The panic-stricken woman gives sketchy details of a plot that threatens world security. When Coplan arrives, he is told the woman has been killed, and the trail of the murderer leads to her mad-scientist brother.', 'Free-lance undercover agent Coplan receives a phone call from an old girlfriend in Turkey. The panic-stricken woman gives sketchy details of a plot that threatens world security. When Coplan arrives, he is told the woman has been killed, and the trail of the murderer leads to her mad-scientist brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5UFGOGY9smJ1dDVpT91IFvd694P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66798'),
  ('792647437168749930', 'Copper Bill', 2020, 'Crime, Action, Thriller', 'Brett Bentman', 'Brett Bentman', 'Dustin Runnels, Thom Hallum, Kitty Harris, Arthur Redcloud, Billy Blair, Tom Zembrod', 'PG', 'Two thieves attempt to steal 80 million dollars of hidden Texas drug money from the famed ranch belonging to a dead member of the Cowboy Mafia.', 'Two thieves attempt to steal 80 million dollars of hidden Texas drug money from the famed ranch belonging to a dead member of the Cowboy Mafia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mSZnvJ0olvAss77b01Vf68or8xr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:685571'),
  ('598174669443706042', 'Copper Canyon', 1950, 'Western', 'John Farrow, Charles Lang, Herbert Coleman', 'Jonathan Latimer', 'Ray Milland, Hedy Lamarr, Macdonald Carey, Mona Freeman, Harry Carey, Jr., Frank Faylen, Hope Emerson, Taylor Holmes', 'NR', 'A group of copper miners, Southern veterans, are terrorized by local rebel-haters, led by deputy Lane Travis. The miners ask stage sharpshooter Johnny Carter to help them, under the impression that he is the legendary Colonel Desmond. It seems they''re wrong; but Johnny''s show comes to Coppertown and Johnny romances lovely gambler Lisa Roselle, whom the miners believe is at the center of their troubles.', 'A group of copper miners, Southern veterans, are terrorized by local rebel-haters, led by deputy Lane Travis. The miners ask stage sharpshooter Johnny Carter to help them, under the impression that he is the legendary Colonel Desmond. It seems they''re wrong; but Johnny''s show comes to Coppertown and Johnny romances lovely gambler Lisa Roselle, whom the miners believe is at the center of their troubles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wx7ZKQmtPk9MCDbLLtwPj2D8Hpg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103164'),
  ('216455749082142997', 'Copper Mountain', 1983, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'David Mitchell', 'Damian Lee', 'Jim Carrey, Alan Thicke, Richard Gautier, Ziggy Lorenc, Rod Hebron, Jean Laplac, Bruce Carr, Randi Brooks', null, 'Two friends travel to a ski resort, with one looking to hit the slopes, while the other spends time trying to pick up women.', 'Two friends travel to a ski resort, with one looking to hit the slopes, while the other spends time trying to pick up women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y4EUqnad8cGfucthSkmYe2OLiNL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19809'),
  ('560750389136505971', 'Copperman', 2019, 'Family, Drama', 'Giuseppe Bonito, Eros Puglielli, Alfredo Betrò', 'Riccardo Irrera, Mauro Graiani, Paolo Logli', 'Luca Argentero, Antonia Truppo, Tommaso Ragno, Galatea Ranzi, Gianluca Gobbi, Sebastian Dimulescu, Angelica Bellucci, Massimo Poggio', null, 'Despite his adult age, Anselmo behaves like a child and takes up the role of a superhero called "Copperman."', 'Despite his adult age, Anselmo behaves like a child and takes up the role of a superhero called "Copperman."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wePd9IIh44W0qKHhwjRll9zcrbu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:568165'),
  ('458677000272640964', 'Cops', 1922, 'Comedy, Family, Adventure', 'Buster Keaton, Edward F. Cline, Elgin Lessley', 'Buster Keaton, Edward F. Cline', 'Buster Keaton, Edward F. Cline, Virginia Fox, Steve Murphy, Joe Roberts', null, 'Buster Keaton gets involved in a series of misunderstandings involving a horse and cart. Eventually he infuriates every cop in the city when he accidentally interrupts a police parade.', 'Buster Keaton gets involved in a series of misunderstandings involving a horse and cart. Eventually he infuriates every cop in the city when he accidentally interrupts a police parade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uN8b6oQlmsb81G7GepgjPyRDLaO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38742'),
  ('32896851746926504', 'Cops', 1997, 'Action', 'Jorge Nisco, Omar Jadur, Juan Pablo Galli', 'Mario Segade, Gustavo Belatti, Ricardo Piglia', 'Carlos Calvo, Adrián Suar, Rodolfo Ranni, Nancy Dupláa, Patricia Viggiano, Raúl Rizzo, Tony Vilas, Isabel Quinteros', null, 'Two men from completely different backgrounds confront a gang of swindlers. Norberto Lorenzi and Guillermo Parodi are the two "jokers" who meet and relate with the usual initial distrust. Lorenzo is impelled by the necessity to clear the name of Pérez, his best friend. Parodi, on the other hand, has been called to disperse a ring of "narcos"...', 'Two men from completely different backgrounds confront a gang of swindlers. Norberto Lorenzi and Guillermo Parodi are the two "jokers" who meet and relate with the usual initial distrust. Lorenzo is impelled by the necessity to clear the name of Pérez, his best friend. Parodi, on the other hand, has been called to disperse a ring of "narcos"...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xy7r1aQMNiwt9TX8SPM7jsa0mK4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127299'),
  ('153142520414832368', 'Cops', 2018, 'Drama', 'Stefan Lukacs', null, 'Laurence Rupp, Anton Noori, Maria Hofstätter, Roland Düringer, Anna Suk', null, 'Young and eager police recruit Chris shoots a mentally ill man on duty. He is celebrated a hero, but soon after, traumatic symptoms begin to surface. In a desperate attempt not to be exposed by his tough superior Konstantin, he resorts to excessive violence, in order to hide his trauma and fulfill his dream of becoming an elite cop.', 'Young and eager police recruit Chris shoots a mentally ill man on duty. He is celebrated a hero, but soon after, traumatic symptoms begin to surface. In a desperate attempt not to be exposed by his tough superior Konstantin, he resorts to excessive violence, in order to hide his trauma and fulfill his dream of becoming an elite cop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/18zsFrHwMKFfvIaIp2FWR16i13W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:497901'),
  ('700270986316294277', 'Cops & Robbersons', 1994, 'Comedy, Thriller, Crime', 'Michael Ritchie, Gerry Fisher', 'Bernie Somers', 'Chevy Chase, Jack Palance, Dianne Wiest, Robert Davi, David Barry Gray, Jason James Richter, Fay Masterson, Miko Hughes', 'PG', 'When the police discover that a mob hitman has moved in next door to the Robbersons, they set up a stakeout in the Robbersons'' home. Hard-nosed, tough-as-nails Jake Stone and his young partner Tony Moore are assigned to the stakeout, but now it is a question of whether Jake can last long enough to capture the bad guys. The Robbersons want to help, and by doing so, drive Jake crazy.', 'When the police discover that a mob hitman has moved in next door to the Robbersons, they set up a stakeout in the Robbersons'' home. Hard-nosed, tough-as-nails Jake Stone and his young partner Tony Moore are assigned to the stakeout, but now it is a question of whether Jake can last long enough to capture the bad guys. The Robbersons want to help, and by doing so, drive Jake crazy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wnkWgFU5UcLwbExCp1YtCg5Ox4E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26261'),
  ('910995257335475251', 'Cops and Robbers', 1951, 'Comedy', 'Mario Monicelli, Steno, Rudy Bauer', 'Vitaliano Brancati, Aldo Fabrizi, Ennio Flaiano', 'Totò, Aldo Fabrizi, Ave Ninchi, William Tubbs, Pina Piovani, Rossana Podestà, Ernesto Almirante, Pietro Carloni', null, 'Esposito is a thief who cons tourists in Rome. Officer Bottoni manages to catch him and starts persecuting him. When Esposito manages to flee, Bottoni''s superiors inform him that he''ll lose his job if he can''t catch Esposito.', 'Esposito is a thief who cons tourists in Rome. Officer Bottoni manages to catch him and starts persecuting him. When Esposito manages to flee, Bottoni''s superiors inform him that he''ll lose his job if he can''t catch Esposito.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pUKGjrHk3zwPGu6gwaXqlf8x4Oe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45099'),
  ('715098014236774835', 'Cops and Robbers', 1973, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Aram Avakian, David L. Quaid', 'Donald E. Westlake', 'Cliff Gorman, Joseph Bologna, Charlene Dallas, Walt Gorney, Randy Jurgensen, Martin Kove, John P. Ryan, Joe Spinell', 'PG', 'Two disillusioned New York policemen plan a $10 million robbery to fuel their low pensions, only to run into one debacle after another in the process.', 'Two disillusioned New York policemen plan a $10 million robbery to fuel their low pensions, only to run into one debacle after another in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pVJX834235KTdPSHePoS6vQIoUj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88359'),
  ('1052416494549202700', 'Cops and Robbers', 2020, 'Animation', 'Bert Poole, Timothy Ware-Hill, Arnon Manor', 'Timothy Ware-Hill', 'Timothy Ware-Hill', 'PG-13', 'Animation and activism unite in this multimedia spoken-word response to police brutality and racial injustice.', 'Animation and activism unite in this multimedia spoken-word response to police brutality and racial injustice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wzvLbFgo4dv9KxkE9FLoMxygWDd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:776979'),
  ('910516674289352348', 'Cops vs. Thugs', 1975, 'Drama, Action, Crime', 'Kinji Fukasaku', 'Kazuo Kasahara', 'Bunta Sugawara, Tatsuo Umemiya, Reiko Ike, Shingo Yamashiro, Sanae Nakahara, Yōko Koizumi, Maki Tachibana, Keiko Yumi', null, 'When a lucrative waterfront development becomes available, the Kawade gang quickly use their political connections to secure the land. However, the acting boss of the Ohara gang also has his eyes on the property and recruits crooked detective Tokumatsu Kuno to help him hijack the deal. With relations between the rival gangs at breaking point, it''s not long before all-out war breaks out as the gangsters, police and local politicians battle for control of the city.', 'When a lucrative waterfront development becomes available, the Kawade gang quickly use their political connections to secure the land. However, the acting boss of the Ohara gang also has his eyes on the property and recruits crooked detective Tokumatsu Kuno to help him hijack the deal. With relations between the rival gangs at breaking point, it''s not long before all-out war breaks out as the gangsters, police and local politicians battle for control of the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j7AEopxMOHt3Fbiv5KzDWA79zcK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91872'),
  ('491242055153578955', 'Copshop', 2021, 'Thriller, Crime, Action', 'Nathan Kimball, Jayson Merrill, Megan Schmidt', 'Kurt McLeod, Joe Carnahan', 'Gerard Butler, Frank Grillo, Alexis Louder, Toby Huss, Chad L. Coleman, Ryan O''Nan, Jose Pablo Cantillo, Kaiwi Lyman', 'R', 'On the run from a lethal assassin, a wily con artist devises a scheme to hide out inside a small-town police station. However, when the hit man turns up at the precinct, an unsuspecting rookie cop finds herself caught in the crosshairs.', 'On the run from a lethal assassin, a wily con artist devises a scheme to hide out inside a small-town police station. However, when the hit man turns up at the precinct, an unsuspecting rookie cop finds herself caught in the crosshairs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9LEWWWEhS7SZXFDuH1YYhs0VFct.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:738652'),
  ('1150047471488343764', 'Copy Cat', 2020, 'TV Movie, Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Akim Isker, Karine Fleury', 'Frédéric J. Lozet, Isabelle Polin', 'Thierry Godard, Noémie Schmidt, Francis Renaud, Marc Ruchmann, Laurent Bateau, Steve Tientcheu, Thor Schenker, Thomas Drelon', null, 'Newly promoted Lieutenant Valentine Ventura finds herself working with famous Captain Antoine Thomas who just came back from his medical leave after the tragedy he lived a few months ago : victim of a car crash that killed both his wife and the child she was bearing, Antoine Thomas spent several months in the hospital, and is now back in a wheelchair after losing function of his legs. Working on the case of a murdered young journalist, the two detectives succeed in arresting her colleague, whose guilt is undeniable. Multiple elements even indicate that they just caught a serial killer; although he admits he killed the young journalist, their suspect didn''t commit these other murders, and seems to be the victim of a manipulation.', 'Newly promoted Lieutenant Valentine Ventura finds herself working with famous Captain Antoine Thomas who just came back from his medical leave after the tragedy he lived a few months ago : victim of a car crash that killed both his wife and the child she was bearing, Antoine Thomas spent several months in the hospital, and is now back in a wheelchair after losing function of his legs. Working on the case of a murdered young journalist, the two detectives succeed in arresting her colleague, whose guilt is undeniable. Multiple elements even indicate that they just caught a serial killer; although he admits he killed the young journalist, their suspect didn''t commit these other murders, and seems to be the victim of a manipulation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kYVAkFknQaplulhvzXtN5XcxIEd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:743549'),
  ('426330695012053116', 'Copy Shop', 2001, 'Drama, Comedy, Animation', 'Virgil Widrich, Volkmar Geiblinger', 'Virgil Widrich', 'Johannes Silberschneider, Elisabeth Ebner-Haid', null, 'Wordless story about a man who awakes in his bed wearing his clothes (including a check vest). He rises, washes his face, combs his hair, and heads for work across the street at a copy shop. He inadvertently makes a photocopy of his hand, and then the machine beings turning out copies of photographs of himself, the street outside, and his apartment. He unplugs the copier and heads home. He repeats the scene we saw earlier. Copies of himself emerge from bed; baffled, he watches them go to work. Soon, it seems, he''s part of a society in which everyone looks like him and wears check vest. Can he get things back to normal?', 'Wordless story about a man who awakes in his bed wearing his clothes (including a check vest). He rises, washes his face, combs his hair, and heads for work across the street at a copy shop. He inadvertently makes a photocopy of his hand, and then the machine beings turning out copies of photographs of himself, the street outside, and his apartment. He unplugs the copier and heads home. He repeats the scene we saw earlier. Copies of himself emerge from bed; baffled, he watches them go to work. Soon, it seems, he''s part of a society in which everyone looks like him and wears check vest. Can he get things back to normal?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4jsofyCCHcEEdQ7iYK98v4n5ZOP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53981'),
  ('671221688949567731', 'Copycat', 1995, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Jon Amiel, László Kovács, Richard Oswald', 'Ann Biderman, David Madsen', 'Sigourney Weaver, Holly Hunter, Dermot Mulroney, William McNamara, Harry Connick Jr., J.E. Freeman, Will Patton, John Rothman', 'R', 'An agoraphobic psychologist and a female detective must work together to take down a serial killer who copies serial killers from the past.', 'An agoraphobic psychologist and a female detective must work together to take down a serial killer who copies serial killers from the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oMgwJb016znNZcpDR20eXxZoW8A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1710'),
  ('838580168144318725', 'Copycat Killer', 2002, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Yoshimitsu Morita, Nobuyasu Kita', 'Yoshimitsu Morita', 'Masahiro Nakai, Junnosuke Taguchi, Tsutomu Yamazaki, Misaki Itō, Kanji Tsuda, Yuki Saori, Takashi Fujii, Yoko Fujita', null, 'The story of a criminal who abducts and kills women, and those who try to catch him. Nakai is cast as a cold-blooded, intelligent and evil guy who uses the media to announce and show his murders live to the public.', 'The story of a criminal who abducts and kills women, and those who try to catch him. Nakai is cast as a cold-blooded, intelligent and evil guy who uses the media to announce and show his murders live to the public.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xWeoT4VIOw62L8dsH2fzVo3Q6WD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118775'),
  ('576002168298005173', 'Copying Beethoven', 2006, 'Drama', 'Agnieszka Holland, Ashley Rowe, Kasia Adamik', 'Stephen J. Rivele, Christopher Wilkinson', 'Ed Harris, Diane Kruger, Matthew Goode, Phyllida Law, Ralph Riach, Bill Stewart, Angus Barnett, Viktoria Dihen', 'PG-13', 'A fictionalised exploration of Beethoven''s life in his final days working on his Ninth Symphony. It is 1824. Beethoven is racing to finish his new symphony. However, it has been years since his last success and he is plagued by deafness, loneliness and personal trauma. A copyist is urgently needed to help the composer. A fictional character is introduced in the form of a young conservatory student and aspiring composer named Anna Holtz. The mercurial Beethoven is skeptical that a woman might become involved in his masterpiece but slowly comes to trust in Anna''s assistance and in the end becomes quite fond of her. By the time the piece is performed, her presence in his life is an absolute necessity. Her deep understanding of his work is such that she even corrects mistakes he has made, while her passionate personality opens a door into his private world.', 'A fictionalised exploration of Beethoven''s life in his final days working on his Ninth Symphony. It is 1824. Beethoven is racing to finish his new symphony. However, it has been years since his last success and he is plagued by deafness, loneliness and personal trauma. A copyist is urgently needed to help the composer. A fictional character is introduced in the form of a young conservatory student and aspiring composer named Anna Holtz. The mercurial Beethoven is skeptical that a woman might become involved in his masterpiece but slowly comes to trust in Anna''s assistance and in the end becomes quite fond of her. By the time the piece is performed, her presence in his life is an absolute necessity. Her deep understanding of his work is such that she even corrects mistakes he has made, while her passionate personality opens a door into his private world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xplAbPXhZF9B3H4OnhjQsEKUESe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1590'),
  ('721796679374618592', 'Coqueta', 1983, 'Drama, Music, Romance', 'Sergio Véjar', 'Kiki Galindo', 'Lucero, Pedro Fernández, Rodolfo Gómez, Sergio Gómez, Antonio de Hud, Lucero León, Isabel Margarita Gándara, Ana María Martínez', null, 'Two teenagers fall in love with each other for the first time.', 'Two teenagers fall in love with each other for the first time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s3QVsh42SxqGRjBd081XhG14522.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:404172'),
