  ('638890513696149980', 'Cora', 2024, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Horror', 'Tommy Wiklund, Sonny Laguna, Tommy Wiklund', 'David Liljeblad, Sonny Laguna, Tommy Wiklund', 'Thomas Lennon, Andreas Rylander, Felicia Rylander, Patrick Saxe, Alec Toselli, Alex Fatehnia, Caroline Mathiasen, Sanne Broström', 'NR', 'Cora is set decades into the future, after a deadly mist has covered earth, effectively wiping out most of humanity. Now, we follow Cora, a woman working for an organization trying to reverse the effects of the apocalypse.', 'Cora is set decades into the future, after a deadly mist has covered earth, effectively wiping out most of humanity. Now, we follow Cora, a woman working for an organization trying to reverse the effects of the apocalypse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jBi5ZHxoRwjlPzPlBTMKRopC76i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1086867'),
  ('1091790223972800328', 'Coral Reefs', 1939, 'Adventure', 'Maurice Gleize, Jules Kruger', 'Charles Spaak', 'Jean Gabin, Michèle Morgan, Pierre Renoir, Saturnin Fabre, Gina Manès, Jenny Burnay, René Bergeron, Louis Florencie', null, 'The adventures of a sailor from Mexico to a lagoon in the Pacific ocean, and the meeting with a lonely girl.', 'The adventures of a sailor from Mexico to a lagoon in the Pacific ocean, and the meeting with a lonely girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r2oaLhq0fvrY3OeTCyGCWBVnxlF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79220'),
  ('937926919041464114', 'Coraline', 2009, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Henry Selick, Pete Kozachik, Dielle Alexandre', 'Henry Selick', 'Dakota Fanning, Teri Hatcher, Jennifer Saunders, Dawn French, Keith David, John Hodgman, Robert Bailey Jr., Ian McShane', 'PG', 'Wandering her rambling old house in her boring new town, 11-year-old Coraline discovers a hidden door to a strangely idealized version of her life. In order to stay in the fantasy, she must make a frighteningly real sacrifice.', 'Wandering her rambling old house in her boring new town, 11-year-old Coraline discovers a hidden door to a strangely idealized version of her life. In order to stay in the fantasy, she must make a frighteningly real sacrifice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4jeFXQYytChdZYE9JYO7Un87IlW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14836'),
  ('816629923393569582', 'Corazón del tiempo', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Alberto Cortés, Julián de Tavira, Marc Bellver', 'Hernann Bellinghaussen, Alberto Cortés', 'Rocío Barrios, Francisco Jiménez, Marisela Rodríguez, Doña Aurelia, Leonardo Rodríguez, Doña Ofelia, Verónica Trejo, Compa Moisés', null, 'A young woman in the southern Mexican region of Chiapas falls for a revolutionary fighting in the Zapatista conflict.', 'A young woman in the southern Mexican region of Chiapas falls for a revolutionary fighting in the Zapatista conflict.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jv8Cf90PTmJwj4dMasQlfOMjC7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47298'),
  ('99255521187028836', 'Corazón salvaje', 1968, 'Drama, Romance, Adventure', 'Tito Davison, Gabriel Figueroa, Alex Phillips', 'Edmundo Báez, Tito Davison', 'Julio Alemán, Angélica María, Manuel Gil, Teresa Velázquez, Beatriz Baz, Miguel Macía, José Baviera, Sara Guasch', null, 'Calculating Aime sends her sister Monica to distract a love-struck smuggler, Juan del Diablo, when he threatens to reveal their affair to Aime''s new rich husband. They are discovered alone together and to save Monica''s virtue, Juan del Diablo promises to marry Monica.', 'Calculating Aime sends her sister Monica to distract a love-struck smuggler, Juan del Diablo, when he threatens to reveal their affair to Aime''s new rich husband. They are discovered alone together and to save Monica''s virtue, Juan del Diablo promises to marry Monica.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bFuTsmLmDhNpfz7T3DNDpSSVKVP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52168'),
