  ('509248335763062166', 'Corbo', 2015, 'Crime, Drama, History', 'Mathieu Denis, Steve Asselin', 'Mathieu Denis', 'Anthony Therrien, Antoine L''Écuyer, Karelle Tremblay, Tony Nardi, Marie Brassard, Jean-François Pronovost, Dino Tavarone, Francis Ducharme', null, 'Montreal, spring 1966. Jean Corbo, 16 years old, born to a Quebec mother and an Italian father, is torn between his two affiliations. After befriending two young far-left activists, he joined the Front de Libération du Québec, an underground radical group. Jean, from then on, marches inexorably towards his destiny.', 'Montreal, spring 1966. Jean Corbo, 16 years old, born to a Quebec mother and an Italian father, is torn between his two affiliations. After befriending two young far-left activists, he joined the Front de Libération du Québec, an underground radical group. Jean, from then on, marches inexorably towards his destiny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hy4hjQ1fYjte3LCo2Gt5WKb8QaI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:285858'),
