  ('760418413962411404', 'Corina', 2025, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Urzula Barba Hopfner, Michelle Betancourt', 'Samuel Sosa Derat, Urzula Barba Hopfner', 'Naian González Norvind, Cristo Fernández, Laura de Ita, Carolina Politi, Mariana Giménez, Gerardo Trejoluna, Ariana Candela Michel, Elena Gore', null, 'Corina is 20 years old and does not leave her house except to work in a publishing house located in the neighborhood where she lives. After making a serious mistake with the end of the company''s most famous book saga, Corina must overcome her fears with the help of Carlos and embark on a journey in search of a mysterious writer to save her job and that of her colleagues.', 'Corina is 20 years old and does not leave her house except to work in a publishing house located in the neighborhood where she lives. After making a serious mistake with the end of the company''s most famous book saga, Corina must overcome her fears with the help of Carlos and embark on a journey in search of a mysterious writer to save her job and that of her colleagues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pXS4A7VmWT3p1Bc4KyTapOviUmw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1280684'),
  ('258546135204614019', 'Coriolanus', 2011, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Howard Watkins, Ralph Fiennes, Barry Ackroyd', 'John Logan', 'Ralph Fiennes, Gerard Butler, Lubna Azabal, Ashraf Barhom, Jessica Chastain, Vanessa Redgrave, James Nesbitt, Brian Cox', 'R', 'Caius Martius, aka Coriolanus, is an arrogant and fearsome general who has built a career on protecting Rome from its enemies. Pushed by his ambitious mother to seek the position of consul, Coriolanus is at odds with the masses and unpopular with certain colleagues. When a riot results in his expulsion from Rome, Coriolanus seeks out his sworn enemy, Tullus Aufidius. Together, the pair vow to destroy the great city.', 'Caius Martius, aka Coriolanus, is an arrogant and fearsome general who has built a career on protecting Rome from its enemies. Pushed by his ambitious mother to seek the position of consul, Coriolanus is at odds with the masses and unpopular with certain colleagues. When a riot results in his expulsion from Rome, Coriolanus seeks out his sworn enemy, Tullus Aufidius. Together, the pair vow to destroy the great city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6W6In8IUJMkxB8aBipulho6QLDd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101173'),
  ('717652144736541478', 'Corky Romano', 2001, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Rob Pritts, Steven Bernstein', 'Jason Ward, David Garrett', 'Chris Kattan, Vinessa Shaw, Peter Falk, Peter Berg, Chris Penn, Fred Ward, Richard Roundtree, Matthew Glave', 'PG-13', 'Corky Romano is a bumbling, simpleton, veterinarian and the youngest, outcast son of an aging gangster, named Pops Romano, who calls upon Corky to infiltrate the local FBI and retrieve and destroy evidence being used to incriminate Pops for racketeering charges.', 'Corky Romano is a bumbling, simpleton, veterinarian and the youngest, outcast son of an aging gangster, named Pops Romano, who calls upon Corky to infiltrate the local FBI and retrieve and destroy evidence being used to incriminate Pops for racketeering charges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aLgzSIgHTyWggrP7ieDVYE3PB8g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17708'),
  ('759289513908978415', 'Corleone', 1978, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Pasquale Squitieri, Roberto Pariante, Eugenio Bentivoglio', 'Dino Maiuri, Pasquale Squitieri, Orazio Barrese', 'Giuliano Gemma, Claudia Cardinale, Francisco Rabal, Michele Placido, Stefano Satta Flores, Salvatore Billa, Tony Kendall, Fulvio Mingozzi', null, 'Two friends grow up together in the Sicily of the ''50s. Two different destiny, two different way of life. Could their friendship survive to the mafia shadow?', 'Two friends grow up together in the Sicily of the ''50s. Two different destiny, two different way of life. Could their friendship survive to the mafia shadow?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aSVE7SkgFFpGtHw0u4mHniVp4K2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167583'),
  ('35955763767423050', 'Corman''s World', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Alex Stapleton, Patrick Simpson', 'Alex Stapleton', 'Roger Corman, Gary J. Tunnicliffe, Frances Doel, Julie Corman, David Carradine, John Sayles, Eric Balfour, Robert De Niro', 'R', 'A chronicle of the long career of American filmmaker Roger Corman, the most tenacious and ingenious low-budget producer and director in the US film industry, a pioneer of independent filmmaking and discoverer of new talent.', 'A chronicle of the long career of American filmmaker Roger Corman, the most tenacious and ingenious low-budget producer and director in the US film industry, a pioneer of independent filmmaking and discoverer of new talent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wnHm6TWNLjwHjfqpocxgPCMEQvS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56591'),
  ('147713057519738702', 'Corn Chips', 1951, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack Hannah', null, 'Clarence Nash, Dessie Flynn, James MacDonald', 'NR', 'Donald is shoveling the snow off his walk; Chip ''n'' Dale are shoveling their branch. Donald tricks them into shoveling his walk. Angered, they sneak into his house, where he''s getting ready to make popcorn. They''ve never seen this before, but they love it. They stow away in the box, then make off with the bowl of popped corn.', 'Donald is shoveling the snow off his walk; Chip ''n'' Dale are shoveling their branch. Donald tricks them into shoveling his walk. Angered, they sneak into his house, where he''s getting ready to make popcorn. They''ve never seen this before, but they love it. They stow away in the box, then make off with the bowl of popped corn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wcReSGA6CIrStd0YAqL3KFC0Y3I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53751'),
  ('573186964849951258', 'Corn Island', 2014, 'Drama, War', 'Giorgi Ovashvili, Elemér Ragályi', 'Roelof Jan Minneboo, Giorgi Ovashvili, Nugzar Shataidze', 'Mariam Buturishvili, İlyas Salman, Tamer Levent, Irakli Samushia, Tedo Bekhauri', null, 'The Inguri River forms a natural border dividing Georgia from Abkhazia. One of the spring floods has created a little island in the middle of the river, as if made for the cultivation of corn. At least, this is the belief of an old peasant, whose sunburned face resembles the landscape he has trodden for dozens of years.', 'The Inguri River forms a natural border dividing Georgia from Abkhazia. One of the spring floods has created a little island in the middle of the river, as if made for the cultivation of corn. At least, this is the belief of an old peasant, whose sunburned face resembles the landscape he has trodden for dozens of years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aXfqkcug2GewkSmpIVdmzMSzu3Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:282376'),
  ('967737313305640771', 'Corn on the Cop', 1965, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Irv Spector', null, 'Mel Blanc, Joan Gerber', null, 'Corn on the Cop is a 1965 Merrie Melodies short directed by Irv Spector and starring Daffy Duck and Porky Pig. On Halloween night, a robber disguises himself as a little old lady and goes on a crime spree. The police, including Daffy Duck and Porky Pig, search for the robber but end up tangling with the real Granny instead.', 'Corn on the Cop is a 1965 Merrie Melodies short directed by Irv Spector and starring Daffy Duck and Porky Pig. On Halloween night, a robber disguises himself as a little old lady and goes on a crime spree. The police, including Daffy Duck and Porky Pig, search for the robber but end up tangling with the real Granny instead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wYtfXpN73e0yvKqr9MQuSaFpT2S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234377'),
  ('691962415804434629', 'Corn Plastered', 1951, 'Animation', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc, Pat Patrick', null, 'A beany-capped, wise-cracking crow invades a corn field owned by an elderly farmer. The farmer unsuccessfully attempts to kill the crow by using a gun, an axe, and a cannon.', 'A beany-capped, wise-cracking crow invades a corn field owned by an elderly farmer. The farmer unsuccessfully attempts to kill the crow by using a gun, an axe, and a cannon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jc3empOfdx5VKBUdl8UIB1558E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236004'),
  ('197894807813078779', 'Cornbread, Earl and Me', 1975, 'Drama', 'Joseph Manduke, Lynn Stalmaster, Jules Brenner', 'Leonard Lamensdorf', 'Moses Gunn, Rosalind Cash, Bernie Casey, Madge Sinclair, Laurence Fishburne, Thalmus Rasulala, Antonio Fargas, Logan Ramsey', 'PG', 'The unintentional shooting by police of a star basketball player has profound personal, political and community repercussions in this acclaimed adaptation of the novel Hog Butcher by Ronald Fair. This was one of the more thoughtful urban dramas produced at the height of the "blaxploitation" craze. Also released under the title Hit the Open Man, it features the screen debut of Laurence Fishburne, who was barely a teenager at the time.', 'The unintentional shooting by police of a star basketball player has profound personal, political and community repercussions in this acclaimed adaptation of the novel Hog Butcher by Ronald Fair. This was one of the more thoughtful urban dramas produced at the height of the "blaxploitation" craze. Also released under the title Hit the Open Man, it features the screen debut of Laurence Fishburne, who was barely a teenager at the time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/manvBUSZ6PWBOv76dcMI2QKP6M1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37754'),
  ('332993916310491129', 'Cornelius, the Howling Miller', 2018, 'Drama', 'Yann Le Quellec', 'David Elkaïm, Jean-Luc Gaget, Yann Le Quellec', 'Bonaventure Gacon, Anaïs Demoustier, Gustave Kervern, Denis Lavant, Christophe Paou, Solange Milhaud, Jocelyne Desverchère, Guillaume Delaunay', null, 'An isolated village welcomes a new miller with open arms. Problem is, the man howls at the moon every night. His integration is starting well… French comedy at its best.', 'An isolated village welcomes a new miller with open arms. Problem is, the man howls at the moon every night. His integration is starting well… French comedy at its best.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wCRk3NcQgZgsND8ZL5zBzzwTkzy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:499724'),
  ('703746993745987536', 'Corner Office', 2023, 'Comedy, Mystery', 'Paweł Edelman, Joachim Back', 'Ted Kupper', 'Jon Hamm, Danny Pudi, Sarah Gadon, Christopher Heyerdahl, Allison Riley, Bill Marchant, Kimberley Shoniker, Shawn Macdonald', 'PG-13', 'In this office satire, Orson, a straight-laced employee, retreats to a blissfully empty corner office to get away from his lackluster colleagues. But why does this seem to upset them so much?', 'In this office satire, Orson, a straight-laced employee, retreats to a blissfully empty corner office to get away from his lackluster colleagues. But why does this seem to upset them so much?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2JOPMnpaaTBvhy0HCby9uSBkt11.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:800279'),
  ('767502015470215675', 'Cornered', 1945, 'Thriller', 'Edward Dmytryk, Harry J. Wild, Ruby Rosenberg', 'Ben Hecht', 'Dick Powell, Walter Slezak, Micheline Cheirel, Nina Vale, Morris Carnovsky, Edgar Barrier, Steven Geray, Jack La Rue', 'NR', 'A World War II veteran hunts down the Nazi collaborators who killed his wife.', 'A World War II veteran hunts down the Nazi collaborators who killed his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Tnliph0BmvpSIkEshWI2Ms6IpB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35954');
